  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_1_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}天哪...我吃了一个月过期的卷饼吗？一切都感觉很奇怪...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_1_INTRO_2": "{SAY:crazydave}我的头好痛！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_1_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，肯定发生了什么事。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_1_INTRO_4": "{EXCITED:winnie}扫描仪读数只发出白噪声！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_1_INTRO_5": "{EXCITED:crazydave}扫描仪不可能说谎！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_1_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}一秒，一些有用的数据出现了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_1_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}还记得你的邻居如何在他们自己身上留下不同现实的痕迹吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_1_INTRO_8": "{EXCITED:crazydave}耶！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_1_INTRO_9": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我们就这一切进行了一次完整的讨论！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_1_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，这里有来自不同现实的实体。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_1_INTRO_11": "{EXCITED:winnie}有人打开了宇宙之间的桥梁。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_1_INTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}原点通向213宇宙。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_1_INTRO_13": "{EXCITED:crazydave}神圣梭鱼！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_1_INTRO_14": "{SAY:winnie}现在过桥的都是丧尸。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_1_INTRO_15": "{TIRED:winnie}我当然可以猜测谁对此负责。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_1_INTRO_16": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我还是惊呆了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_1_INTRO_17": "{EXCITED:crazydave}另一个平行宇宙！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_1_INTRO_18": "{EXCITED:crazydave}季节开放！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_1_INTRO_19": "{SAY:crazydave}但是僵尸是唯一能通过的？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_1_INTRO_20": "{EXCITED:crazydave}不在我的手表上！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_1_INTRO_21": "{EXCITED:crazydave}让我们抓住他们'朋朋！让我们来对抗平行宇宙的僵尸吧！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_2_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，就在我们说话的时候，两个宇宙似乎正在融合。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_2_INTRO_2": "{EXCITED:winnie}联系只会越来越强！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_2_INTRO_3": "{SAY:crazydave}我正想说，这些丧尸……",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_2_INTRO_4": "{EXCITED:crazydave}就像他们来自相似的记忆，只是不同！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_2_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}事件的因果关系，它们的差异允许多种发展的可能性......",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_2_INTRO_6": "{TIRED:winnie}...这是一个有趣的概念。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_2_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}然而，我们现在还不能奉献自己。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_2_INTRO_8": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}你认为还有另一个戴夫和朋朋吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_2_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}最有可能。我想知道他们对时事有何反应。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_2_INTRO_10": "{EXCITED:crazydave}如果替补我也有类似的情况，他可能会吓坏了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_2_INTRO_11": "{EXCITED:crazydave}却没有得到一半！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_3_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}我们现在在霓虹旋音游？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_3_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}确实，宇宙的融合正在影响所有时代。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_3_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}僵王还没有回复他平时的联系方式。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_3_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}计算表明，这整个困境是“阴暗的”。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_3_INTRO_5": "{EXCITED:crazydave}哦，很阴暗，好吧！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_3_INTRO_6": "{EXCITED:crazydave}不仅仅是因为灯光！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_4_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，我做了一些隐喻性的挖掘。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_4_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}数据表明我们发现自己处于物质交叉的情况之一。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_4_INTRO_3": "{EXCITED:winnie}从两边！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_4_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}僵尸从邻近宇宙流入我们自己的宇宙并不是单向的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_4_INTRO_5": "{EXCITED:winnie}我们自己的宇宙里有僵尸被消灭了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_4_INTRO_6": "{EXCITED:winnie}就在我们说话的时候，他们正在被传送到另一个宇宙！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_4_INTRO_7": "{SAY:crazydave}跨界吧？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_4_INTRO_8": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}我从来不喜欢跨界专辑。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_4_INTRO_9": "{EXCITED:crazydave}看起来更像是一个廉价的噱头而不是什么！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_4_INTRO_10": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我真正需要穿越的是华夫饼和墨西哥菜！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_4_INTRO_11": "{SAY:winnie}说到……",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_4_INTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}在我们当前的音乐形势下，跨界有着明显的亲和力。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_4_INTRO_13": "{SAY:winnie}读数表明：许多僵尸会在堵塞开关时互相交换位置。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_4_INTRO_14": "{SAY:crazydave}啊，对了，果酱。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_4_INTRO_15": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}也不能忘记华夫饼上的果酱。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_5_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，重要信息已送达！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_5_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}它的来源与我长期以来扫描过的任何内容都不同。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_5_INTRO_3": "{EXCITED:crazydave}注意！多么古老的学校啊！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_5_INTRO_4": "{SAY:crazydave}它说什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_5_INTRO_5": "{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}亲爱的跨维度对手们：",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_5_INTRO_6": "{SAY:zombossicon}It is I, the great Dr. Edgar G. 僵王!",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_5_INTRO_7": "{SAY:zombossicon}However, not the 僵王 that you would probably expect!",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_5_INTRO_8": "{SAY:zombossicon}I am the only 僵王 which matters.",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_5_INTRO_9": "{SAY:zombossicon}One from the parallel universe currently making its way into yours.",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_5_INTRO_10": "{SAY:zombossicon}我的才华可能引起了你的注意，因为是我精心策划了这一努力。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_5_INTRO_11": "{SAY:zombossicon}我最深的愿望是你们不辜负你们的声誉。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_5_INTRO_12": "{SAY:zombossicon}来自你的家乡宇宙的我自己已经抱怨了（感觉长达几个小时）你的努力！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_5_INTRO_13": "{SAY:zombossicon}坦白说，我看不出停止休假会对你造成丝毫威胁。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_5_INTRO_14": "{SAY:zombossicon}但是，尽管我的逻辑能力超强，但我的另一个自我却坚持认为我无法打败你。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_5_INTRO_15": "{SAY:zombossicon}他坚持认为我的你的变种也很容易被打败......",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_5_INTRO_16": "{SAY:zombossicon}坦白说，这根本没有让我心情愉快。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_5_INTRO_17": "{SAY:zombossicon}我们必须达成协议。我们与对手进行交易！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_5_INTRO_18": "{SAY:zombossicon}我们互换位置，真正的斗智斗勇！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_5_INTRO_19": "{SAY:zombossicon}我们还达成了互相交换部分力量的条件！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_5_INTRO_20": "{SAY:zombossicon}只是为了让游戏更有趣。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_5_INTRO_21": "{SAY:zombossicon}All with the bottom line: May the better 僵王 win!",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_5_INTRO_22": "{SAY:zombossicon}我打算这么做！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_5_INTRO_23": "{SAY:zombossicon}带你出去...那些我另一个自己无法...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_5_INTRO_24": "{SAY:zombossicon}...I shall forever prove that I am, in fact, the superior 僵王!",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_5_INTRO_25": "{SAY:zombossicon}此致，Edgar G. 僵王博士。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_5_INTRO_26": "{NPC_EXIT:zombossicon}{SAY:crazydave}哇，真是个混蛋。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_6_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}接下来，海滩……",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_6_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}看来这个替代版本的僵王正在把我们拖到不同的时间点。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_6_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}Perhaps to further his \"game\" with our own 僵王.",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_6_INTRO_4": "{SAY:crazydave}这两个人是怎么认识的？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_6_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}One of them probably invented a way to cross universes.",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_6_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}At that point, their meeting must have been inevitable.",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_6_INTRO_7": "{SAY:crazydave}是啊，我觉得他们处不来。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_6_INTRO_8": "{EXCITED:crazydave}不像我！我会和自己相处！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_6_INTRO_9": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我已经在自言自语了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_6_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}Either way, another alternate universe zombie is here.",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_6_INTRO_11": "{SAY:winnie}Sea Spill Zombie can spill toxic waste in a 3x3 area.",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_6_INTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}The poison spills can damage our plants.",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_6_INTRO_13": "{TIRED:crazydave}So much for other universes being clean.",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_7_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，我们遇到了维度异常。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_7_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}有人可能会说，节庆串烧的连锁反应。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_7_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}虽然僵王的剧情已经结束，但其效果却在时间线的缝隙中回响。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_7_INTRO_4": "{TIRED:crazydave}呜呜呜……对了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_7_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}我们也可能在未来的冒险中遇到他们。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_7_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}现在，我们必须警惕地观察来自平行宇宙的物体。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_7_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}有伤害植物和僵尸的烟花，但不能被植物摧毁。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_7_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}但是，它们可以被僵尸吃掉。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_7_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}我们还有气球魔术师僵尸要担心。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_7_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}他的气球会覆盖我们的植物，阻挡攻击。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_7_INTRO_11": "{EXCITED:crazydave}听起来三叶草可能会有用！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_7_INTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}还有一件事：",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_7_INTRO_13": "{EXCITED:winnie}我的阅读表明僵尸并不是唯一穿越宇宙的生物！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_7_INTRO_14": "{SAY:winnie}在大量的不死者中，有一株植物找到了这里。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_7_INTRO_15": "{SAY:winnie}虚空兰花会帮助我们保卫自己。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_7_INTRO_16": "{EXCITED:winnie}她可以把僵尸变成重力球！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_7_INTRO_17": "{SAY:winnie}他们的引力会吸引其他人到它所在的车道。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_7_INTRO_18": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}她在的时候能吸引一些热狗摊吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_11_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}我们即将经历来自平行宇宙的众多负面影响之一。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_11_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}刺骨寒冷是已转移到我们版本的冰河世界的活动。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_11_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}刺骨寒冷将带来可以冻结我们的植物并赋予僵尸力量的射弹。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_12_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，我检测到高度鹦鹉学舌。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_12_INTRO_2": "{EXCITED:crazydave}这些平行宇宙鹦鹉有自己的想法！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_12_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}他们甚至不再需要海盗船长僵尸来攻击。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_12_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}我们必须谨慎对待这个难题。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_14_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:winnie}警报！警报！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_14_INTRO_2": "{EXCITED:crazydave}朋朋你怎么了！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_14_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}我正在检测维度门左右打开。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_14_INTRO_4": "{EXCITED:winnie}越来越多的僵尸正在跨过门槛。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_14_INTRO_5": "{EXCITED:winnie}两个宇宙合并，扭曲维度。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_14_INTRO_6": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}听起来就像我做了一个梦。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_14_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}计算结果显而易见。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_14_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}两个僵王都准备牺牲他们的大牌球员。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_14_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}我们必须做好准备，他们的棋局即将进入残局。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_15_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，我又收到一封恐吓信。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_15_INTRO_2": "{SAY:crazydave}如果是来自那个替代老板，我不想听！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_15_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}我们将看看它说了什么，无论如何都会给我们带来战术优势。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_15_INTRO_4": "{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}亲爱的维度对手：",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_15_INTRO_5": "{SAY:zombossicon}事实证明，你确实是一个棘手的问题。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_15_INTRO_6": "{SAY:zombossicon}不过我不会让你赢的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_15_INTRO_7": "{SAY:zombossicon}真正的僵王不玩肮脏游戏就不会退缩。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_15_INTRO_8": "{SAY:zombossicon}你的变种已经忘记了如何处理你的同类。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_15_INTRO_9": "{SAY:zombossicon}这个世界与我和他所展现的智慧相差甚远。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_15_INTRO_10": "{SAY:zombossicon}以最精确的方式向你的房子发起战术攻击......",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_15_INTRO_11": "{SAY:zombossicon}...它已成为这里被遗忘的艺术。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_15_INTRO_12": "{SAY:zombossicon}所以，让我告诉你-",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_15_INTRO_13": "{SAY:zombossicon}-是如何完成的-",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_15_INTRO_14": "{SAY:zombossicon}-回到过去！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_15_INTRO_15": "{NPC_EXIT:zombossicon}{SAY:winnie}就是这样，最后一击。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_15_INTRO_16": "{SAY:winnie}平行宇宙僵王已经适应，学到了新的技巧。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_15_INTRO_17": "{SAY:winnie}可能是通过接触我们相对不稳定的时间线。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_15_INTRO_18": "{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，邻居，祝你好运。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_15_OUTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，我刚刚收到了电子票据。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_15_OUTRO_2": "{SAY:crazydave}Ooooooh，有人在学习。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_15_OUTRO_3": "{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}可恶！就连我新发现的时间物质位移的能力也没有发挥作用！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_15_OUTRO_4": "{SAY:zombossicon}诅咒你，交替异常！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_15_OUTRO_5": "{SAY:zombossicon}这几乎注定了我在“游戏”中的失败。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_15_OUTRO_6": "{SAY:zombossicon}请务必注意，我会把我的愤怒发泄到我世界里的你们的同行身上！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_15_OUTRO_7": "{SAY:zombossicon}美好的一天！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_15_OUTRO_8": "{NPC_EXIT:zombossicon}{PLAYFUL:crazydave}和我们的老板一样烦人......",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_15_OUTRO_9": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}……他对那家伙一无所知！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_15_OUTRO_10": "{EXCITED:winnie}我的计算表明我们再也不用遇到他了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_15_OUTRO_11": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}还是吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_15_OUTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}嗯，这是合一的-",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_15_OUTRO_13": "{SHOUT:crazydave}还是DOOOOO THEEEEEEY？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_04_ALTVERZ_15_OUTRO_14": "{SHOUT:crazydave}OOooooOOoOo....",
  "NARRATIVE_SPONGEBOB_1_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}警报，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_SPONGEBOB_1_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}我们似乎已经到达Bikini Bottom了。",
  "NARRATIVE_SPONGEBOB_1_INTRO_3": "{EXCITED:crazydave}终于！这是一段漫长的旅程！",
  "NARRATIVE_SPONGEBOB_1_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}当然，僵王博士一直对黄色海绵怀有深仇大恨。",
  "NARRATIVE_SPONGEBOB_1_INTRO_5": "{EXCITED:crazydave}这就是为什么他必须被阻止！",
  "NARRATIVE_SPONGEBOB_1_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}确实如此。我们必须在僵王之前与海绵宝宝取得联系。",
  "NARRATIVE_SPONGEBOB_1_INTRO_7": "{SAY:crazydave}草坪上这些粘糊糊的瓷砖是什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_SPONGEBOB_1_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}一定是从标志性的古泻湖溢出的。",
  "NARRATIVE_SPONGEBOB_1_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}扫描显示它们具有冻结能力。",
  "NARRATIVE_SPONGEBOB_1_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}我们必须小心，粘液会冻结僵尸和植物。",
  "NARRATIVE_SPONGEBOB_2_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{TIRED:winnie}大卫。我有一些令人不安的消息。",
  "NARRATIVE_SPONGEBOB_2_INTRO_2": "{TIRED:crazydave}天哪。",
  "NARRATIVE_SPONGEBOB_2_INTRO_3": "{TIRED:winnie}令我心烦意乱的消息...",
  "NARRATIVE_SPONGEBOB_2_INTRO_4": "{EXCITED:winnie}叹息……",
  "NARRATIVE_SPONGEBOB_2_INTRO_5": "{EXCITED:winnie}...他们是悲剧。",
  "NARRATIVE_SPONGEBOB_2_INTRO_6": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}海绵宝宝还活着吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_SPONGEBOB_2_INTRO_7": "{PLAYFUL:winnie}海绵宝宝已落入邪恶的僵王博士的魔爪。",
  "NARRATIVE_SPONGEBOB_2_INTRO_8": "{EXCITED:crazydave}老大？不……",
  "NARRATIVE_SPONGEBOB_2_INTRO_9": "{TIRED:winnie}这是真的，我必须强调这一点......",
  "NARRATIVE_SPONGEBOB_2_INTRO_10": "{EXCITED:winnie}我们正处于海绵宝宝时代。",
  "NARRATIVE_SPONGEBOB_2_INTRO_11": "{SAY:crazydave}不哦哦哦哦哦哦哦哦哦哦哦哦",
  "NARRATIVE_SPONGEBOB_2_INTRO_12": "{NPC_ENTER:spongebob}{SAY:spongebob}大家好！",
  "NARRATIVE_SPONGEBOB_2_INTRO_13": "{EXCITED:crazydave}海绵宝宝！！！",
  "NARRATIVE_SPONGEBOB_2_INTRO_14": "{EXCITED:winnie}哦，感谢主你还活着！",
  "NARRATIVE_SPONGEBOB_2_INTRO_15": "{EXCITED:spongebob}来吧伙计们，是时候度过最美好的一天了！",
  "NARRATIVE_SPONGEBOB_3_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:spongebob}{SAY:crazydave}海绵宝宝，穿比基尼怎么样？",
  "NARRATIVE_SPONGEBOB_3_INTRO_2": "{SAY:spongebob}哦，真的没什么！但谢谢你的询问...",
  "NARRATIVE_SPONGEBOB_3_INTRO_3": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我喜欢这个。我非常喜欢这个。",
  "NARRATIVE_SPONGEBOB_3_INTRO_4": "{SAY:spongebob}请小心！浮游生物潜伏着...",
  "NARRATIVE_SPONGEBOB_4_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:spongebob}{SAY:spongebob}这就是海绵的梦想",
  "NARRATIVE_SPONGEBOB_4_INTRO_2": "{NPC_EXIT:spongebob}{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫。我必须提醒你。僵王近了。",
  "NARRATIVE_SPONGEBOB_4_INTRO_3": "{NPC_EXIT:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:zomboss}{SAY:zomboss}欢迎来到...",
  "NARRATIVE_SPONGEBOB_4_INTRO_4": "{SAY:zomboss}海绵鲍勃时代！",
  "NARRATIVE_SPONGEBOB_4_INTRO_5": "{SAY:zomboss}植物进入...",
  "NARRATIVE_SPONGEBOB_4_INTRO_6": "{SAY:zomboss}但他们没有...离开！",
  "NARRATIVE_SPONGEBOB_4_INTRO_7": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫。我们现在已经来到了远古海绵宝宝时代。",
  "NARRATIVE_SPONGEBOB_4_INTRO_8": "{SAY:crazydave}是的！",
  "NARRATIVE_SPONGEBOB_5_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SAY:crazydave}朋朋！朋朋！朋朋！",
  "NARRATIVE_SPONGEBOB_5_INTRO_2": "{NPC_ENTER:pennycoin}{SAY:pennycoin}用户戴夫，我检测到微量海藻",
  "NARRATIVE_SPONGEBOB_5_INTRO_3": "{NPC_EXIT:pennycoin}{NPC_ENTER:spongebob}{SAY:spongebob}大家好！",
  "NARRATIVE_SPONGEBOB_5_INTRO_4": "{SAY:spongebob}准备好，是时候为我庆祝了！欢呼！",
  "NARRATIVE_SPONGEBOB_5_INTRO_5": "{NPC_EXIT:spongebob}{NPC_ENTER:pennycoin}{SAY:pennycoin}确实如此，同胞“海绵宝宝”",
  "NARRATIVE_SPONGEBOB_5_INTRO_6": "{NPC_EXIT:pennycoin}{NPC_ENTER:douglas}{SAY:douglas}大家！听我说完！",
  "NARRATIVE_SPONGEBOB_5_INTRO_7": "{NPC_EXIT:douglas}{NPC_ENTER:spongebob}{SAY:spongebob}omggg嗨道格拉斯！",
  "NARRATIVE_SPONGEBOB_5_INTRO_8": "{NPC_EXIT:spongebob}{NPC_ENTER:douglas}{SAY:douglas}我收到这个令人讨厌的谣言说一些僵尸就在附近！",
  "NARRATIVE_SPONGEBOB_5_INTRO_9": "{NPC_EXIT:douglas}{NPC_ENTER:spongebob}{SAY:spongebob}今天没有！我们现在就要让他们变得更好，好朋友！",
  "NARRATIVE_SPONGEBOB_6_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SAY:crazydave}呃哦，他来了。",
  "NARRATIVE_SPONGEBOB_6_INTRO_2": "{SAY:crazydave}最好做好准备。",
  "NARRATIVE_SPONGEBOB_6_INTRO_3": "{EXCITED:crazydave}这将是一场激烈的战斗！",
  "NARRATIVE_SPONGEBOB_6_INTRO_4": "{SAY:crazydave}听着。",
  "NARRATIVE_SPONGEBOB_6_INTRO_5": "{SAY:crazydave}我知道他的弱点是什么：",
  "NARRATIVE_SPONGEBOB_6_INTRO_6": "{SAY:crazydave}你必须击中他的胰腺！",
  "NARRATIVE_SPONGEBOB_6_INTRO_7": "{TIRED:crazydave}不，那是另一个人……",
  "NARRATIVE_SPONGEBOB_6_INTRO_8": "{TIRED:crazydave}你必须...嗯...",
  "NARRATIVE_SPONGEBOB_6_INTRO_9": "{TIRED:crazydave}踢他的…嗯…",
