  "NARRATIVE_N3XTUNIVERSE_18_INTRO_13": "{NPC_EXIT:matpat}{NPC_EXIT:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:markipliergun}{SHOUT:markipliergun}不用担心？？？我们都快要死了！",
