  "NARRATIVE_CONTAINMINT_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}Contain-mint 系列包括停滞和减缓植物。",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_CHALLENGE_LASTSTAND_A_1": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY}正午时分，僵尸一波又一波地袭来。",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_CHALLENGE_LASTSTAND_A_2": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{EXCITED:crazydave}是时候向他们展示谁及时获得了最快的植物！",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_CHALLENGE_LASTSTAND_B_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SAY}我现在真的可以去吃一桶炸鸡了。",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_CHALLENGE_LASTSTAND_B_2": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{PLAYFUL:winnie}好吧，他们放出了战鸟，所以你很幸运。",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_CHALLENGE_LASTSTAND_C_1": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{PLAYFUL}{START_DIALOG_MUSIC}干得好，警长用户时间旅行者。",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_CHALLENGE_LASTSTAND_C_2": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SAY:crazydave}你已经从很多牛市中幸存下来了。",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_CHALLENGE_MINIGAME_A_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SAY}穿上你的灯笼裤并为你的簧片充电。",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_CHALLENGE_MINIGAME_A_2": "{EXCITED:crazydave}这是对决！",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_CHALLENGE_MINIGAME_B_1": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED}那是很多矿车。",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_CHALLENGE_MINIGAME_B_2": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{EXCITED:crazydave}它们正在繁殖！",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_CHALLENGE_MINIGAME_B_3": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}我不知道矿车可以做数学！",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_CHALLENGE_MINIGAME_C_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SAY}{START_DIALOG_MUSIC}我的曾祖父是这些地区的执法者。",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_CHALLENGE_MINIGAME_C_2": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:winnie}那边是他吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_CHALLENGE_MINIGAME_C_3": "{EXCITED:crazydave}哪里？",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_CHALLENGE_MINIGAME_C_4": "{PLAYFUL:winnie}让你看起来。",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_CHALLENGE_PRESET_A_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{EXCITED}这些植物是我的。",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_CHALLENGE_PRESET_A_2": "{TIRED:crazydave}好吧不是我的......你的。",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_CHALLENGE_PRESET_A_3": "{SAY:crazydave}他们是为了矿井...",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_CHALLENGE_PRESET_A_4": "{PLAYFUL}推车。",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_CHALLENGE_PRESET_B_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SPECIAL17}他们翻山越岭来抢你的大脑！",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_CHALLENGE_PRESET_B_2": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{TIRED:winnie}哦不，他又唱歌了。",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_CHALLENGE_PRESET_C_1": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY}{START_DIALOG_MUSIC}我不敢相信有这么多鸡。",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_CHALLENGE_PRESET_C_2": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{EXCITED:crazydave}我哭了！",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_CHALLENGE_PRESET_C_3": "{SAY:winnie}这将被称为 1850 年的大鸡鸡事件。",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_CHALLENGE_PROTECTPLANTS_A_1": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY}这些关卡可能很难破解。",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_CHALLENGE_PROTECTPLANTS_A_2": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{PLAYFUL:crazydave}我想看看美味的奶油中心。",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_CHALLENGE_PROTECTPLANTS_A_3": "{TIRED:winnie}重点是不要破解它们。",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_CHALLENGE_PROTECTPLANTS_B_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{EXCITED}远处的声音是什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_CHALLENGE_PROTECTPLANTS_B_2": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{PLAYFUL:winnie}那是必然的声音。",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_CHALLENGE_PROTECTPLANTS_B_3": "{SAY:crazydave}听起来就像钢琴踩踏一样！",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_CHALLENGE_PROTECTPLANTS_C_1": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED}{START_DIALOG_MUSIC}干得好。",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_CHALLENGE_PROTECTPLANTS_C_2": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SAY:crazydave}你拥有西方最快的手指。",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_CHALLENGE_PROTECTPLANTS_C_3": "{EXCITED:crazydave}现在让我们制作曲目！",
