  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_INTRO_FIRSTLEVEL_2": "{SAY}老式钢琴音乐：下载的",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_INTRO_FIRSTLEVEL_3": "{SAY}炸玉米饼的机会：\r\n 0.015%",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_INTRO_FIRSTLEVEL_4": "{TIRED}误差范围：\n 0.016%",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_INTRO_GARGANTUAR_1": "{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY}问候植物盗贼，",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_INTRO_GARGANTUAR_2": "{SAY:zombossicon}特工们即将到来，将你的大脑标记为我的财产。",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_INTRO_GARGANTUAR_3": "{SAY:zombossicon}致敬，埃德加博士僵王。",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_INTRO_GARGANTUAR_4": "{NPC_EXIT:zombossicon}{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}我不想让我的大脑都被标记。",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_INTRO_GARGANTUAR_5": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}花了很长时间才把它们清理干净。",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_INTRO_LEVEL7_1": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY}就像牛倾倒一样，僵尸倾倒最好从侧面进行。",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_INTRO_LEVEL7_2": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{PLAYFUL:crazydave}相信我，不要试图从后面打倒一头牛！",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_INTRO_ZOMBOSS_1": "{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}你有没有想过你正在分享疯狂大卫的疯狂？",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_INTRO_ZOMBOSS_2": "{SAY:zombossicon}没有僵尸爆发威胁你。",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_INTRO_ZOMBOSS_3": "{SAY:zombossicon}你没有用植物来保卫你的家。",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_INTRO_ZOMBOSS_4": "{SAY:zombossicon}我和僵尸都是普通人，只是想帮助你。",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_INTRO_ZOMBOSS_5": "{NPC_EXIT:zombossicon}{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SAY:crazydave}我打赌你也会告诉我们没有勺子！",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_NEW_OUTRO_LASTTLEVEL_1": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}{START_DIALOG_MUSIC}用户戴夫，是时候上马出发了。",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_NEW_OUTRO_LASTTLEVEL_2": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SPECIAL14}有日落。我们骑吧！",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_NEW_OUTRO_LASTTLEVEL_3": "{EXCITED:winnie}您认为未来将带我们走向何方？",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_NEW_OUTRO_LASTTLEVEL_4": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}你说的未来？",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_NEW_OUTRO_LASTTLEVEL_5": "{SAY:crazydave}我们应该再看看我的时空塔可地图。",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_OUTRO_DANGER_ROOM_KEY_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}我叔叔Milo曾经有过其中一个，他称之为音箱。",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_OUTRO_DANGER_ROOM_KEY_2": "{SAY:winnie}其实已经足够接近了。我会允许的。",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_OUTRO_GARGANTUAR_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}也许我们可以用它来解锁我们的思想。",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_OUTRO_GARGANTUAR_2": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}我还有一些清洁工作要做。",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_OUTRO_GARGANTUAR_3": "{SAY:winnie}事实上，用户戴夫，我的传感器表明你可能没有那么错。",
