  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_OUTRO_GARGANTUAR_5": "{EXCITED:winnie}当然，未来有一些关于你丢失的炸玉米饼的信息。",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_OUTRO_GARGANTUAR_6": "{EXCITED:crazydave}你说得对，朋朋！我想知道技术进步了多少。",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_OUTRO_LASTTLEVEL_1": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}{START_DIALOG_MUSIC}用户戴夫，该上马出发了。",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_OUTRO_LASTTLEVEL_2": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SPECIAL14}有日落。我们骑吧！",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_OUTRO_LASTTLEVEL_3": "{EXCITED:winnie}您认为未来将带我们走向何方？",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_OUTRO_LASTTLEVEL_4": "{SAY:winnie}炸玉米饼怎么了？",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_OUTRO_LASTTLEVEL_5": "{TIRED:winnie}猫为什么有毛？",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_OUTRO_LASTTLEVEL_6": "{SAY:crazydave}{SPECIAL15}记住即可。明天总是炸玉米饼...",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_OUTRO_LASTTLEVEL_7": "{SPECIAL16:crazydave}炸玉米饼是我们每个人内心深处的东西。",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_OUTRO_ZOMBOSS_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{EXCITED:crazydave}没错！这些植物对抗你和你的僵尸。",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_OUTRO_ZOMBOSS_2": "{SAY:crazydave}而且我们连勺子都没用...",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_OUTRO_ZOMBOSS_3": "{SAY:crazydave}虽然那些东西完全存在！",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_OUTRO_ZOMBOSS_4": "{NPC_EXIT:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}我承认你在这方面是正确的。",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_OUTRO_ZOMBOSS_5": "{SAY:zombossicon}我们对于勺子的本质没有存在冲突。",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_OUTRO_ZOMBOSS_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydaveicon}{START_DIALOG_MUSIC}看起来这一切都可能是未来的。",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_OUTRO_ZOMBOSS_INTRO_10": "{SAY:zombossicon}此致，埃德加博士僵王。",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_OUTRO_ZOMBOSS_INTRO_11": "{NPC_EXIT:zombossicon}",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_OUTRO_ZOMBOSS_INTRO_12": "{EXCITED:crazydaveicon}那个老板先生看起来真是个好人啊！",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_OUTRO_ZOMBOSS_INTRO_13": "{TIRED:winnieicon}我们应该警惕那个用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_OUTRO_ZOMBOSS_INTRO_14": "{SAY:winnieicon}同时...",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_OUTRO_ZOMBOSS_INTRO_15": "{EXCITED:winnieicon}赚取星星将为您为我们稍后找到的星门做好准备！",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_OUTRO_ZOMBOSS_INTRO_16": "{SAY:winnieicon}此外，无尽地带会让你在未来的考验中保持敏锐。",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_OUTRO_ZOMBOSS_INTRO_17": "{SAY:crazydaveicon}{SPECIAL15}记住就好。明天总是炸玉米饼...",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_OUTRO_ZOMBOSS_INTRO_18": "{SPECIAL16:crazydave}炸玉米饼是我们每个人内心深处的东西。",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_OUTRO_ZOMBOSS_INTRO_2": "{PLAYFUL:crazydaveicon}我打赌未来戴夫已经解决了我们的玉米卷悖论。",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_OUTRO_ZOMBOSS_INTRO_3": "{NPC_ENTER:winnieicon}我正在检测到一股快子粒子。",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_OUTRO_ZOMBOSS_INTRO_4": "{EXCITED:winnieicon}也许未来朋朋正在尝试联系。",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_OUTRO_ZOMBOSS_INTRO_5": "{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}问候临时通勤者。",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_OUTRO_ZOMBOSS_INTRO_6": "{SAY:zombossicon}未来将请求你的存在。",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_OUTRO_ZOMBOSS_INTRO_7": "{PLAYFUL:zombossicon}但是要注意...",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_OUTRO_ZOMBOSS_INTRO_8": "{SAY:zombossicon}进入后，合法拥有你的大脑......",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_OUTRO_ZOMBOSS_INTRO_9": "{SAY:zombossicon}将被转移到一位Edgar博士僵王。",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_WORLDMAP_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydaveicon}{SAY}这是赶牛...",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_WORLDMAP_INTRO_2": "{SAY}有植物...",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_WORLDMAP_INTRO_3": "{EXCITED}还有僵尸！",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_WORLDMAP_INTRO_4": "{PLAYFUL}让我们把这些植物带到水坑里。",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_ZOMBIENOTE_1": "{NPC_ENTER:winnieicon}看来这里的大脑是非法的。",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_ZOMBIENOTE_2": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydaveicon}快点，邻居。装傻。",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_ZOMBIENOTE_3": "{PLAYFUL:winnieicon}我们会听从你的领导，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_DANGER_ROOM_FAILURE_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SAY}哦不，僵尸吃了你的大脑！",
