  "NARRATIVE_DANGER_ROOM_FAILURE_3": "{SAY}还好你还有两个！",
  "NARRATIVE_DANGER_ROOM_INTRO_BEACH_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{EXCITED:crazydave}嗨邻居！欢迎来到提基火炬手！",
  "NARRATIVE_DANGER_ROOM_INTRO_BEACH_2": "{SAY:crazydave}但是要小心！僵尸在这海边卖贝壳！",
  "NARRATIVE_DANGER_ROOM_INTRO_BEACH_3": "{SHOUT:crazydave}而且他们坚持要你用脑付费！",
  "NARRATIVE_DANGER_ROOM_INTRO_COWBOY_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SAY}嗨邻居！欢迎来到大坏山！",
  "NARRATIVE_DANGER_ROOM_INTRO_COWBOY_2": "{SAY}我的意思是爬满僵尸......",
  "NARRATIVE_DANGER_ROOM_INTRO_DARK_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SAY}嗨邻居！欢迎来到亚瑟的挑战！",
  "NARRATIVE_DANGER_ROOM_INTRO_DARK_2": "{PLAYFUL}在这里你会发现白天是黑夜，骑士是僵尸！",
  "NARRATIVE_DANGER_ROOM_INTRO_DINO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{EXCITED:crazydave}你好，邻居！欢迎来到拉布雷萨塔皮茨！",
  "NARRATIVE_DANGER_ROOM_INTRO_DINO_2": "{PLAYFUL}我希望你已经准备好迎接爬行动物的隆隆声！",
  "NARRATIVE_DANGER_ROOM_INTRO_EGYPT_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SAY}嗨邻居！欢迎来到末日金字塔！",
  "NARRATIVE_DANGER_ROOM_INTRO_EGYPT_2": "{SAY}它就像一个普通的金字塔，但是......你知道......更加厄运。",
  "NARRATIVE_DANGER_ROOM_INTRO_EIGHTIES_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{EXCITED:crazydave}你好，邻居！欢迎来到最伟大的热门歌曲！",
  "NARRATIVE_DANGER_ROOM_INTRO_EIGHTIES_2": "{PLAYFUL}我希望您已准备好享受快节奏的体验！",
  "NARRATIVE_DANGER_ROOM_INTRO_FUTURE_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SAY}嗨邻居！欢迎来到明天的恐怖！",
  "NARRATIVE_DANGER_ROOM_INTRO_FUTURE_2": "{PLAYFUL}让明天的恐怖变成今天的可怕！",
  "NARRATIVE_DANGER_ROOM_INTRO_ICEAGE_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SAY}嗨邻居！欢迎来到冰封战场！",
  "NARRATIVE_DANGER_ROOM_INTRO_ICEAGE_2": "{SAY:crazydave}这个地方很冷，呃，冰……更不用说充满了僵尸。",
  "NARRATIVE_DANGER_ROOM_INTRO_ICEAGE_3": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}最好带一些热门的僵尸格斗动作。也许还有一件漂亮保暖的外套。",
  "NARRATIVE_DANGER_ROOM_INTRO_LOSTCITY_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SAY}嗨邻居！欢迎来到绽放神殿！",
  "NARRATIVE_DANGER_ROOM_INTRO_LOSTCITY_2": "{PLAYFUL}在这里你会发现金子虽好，但会带来更多僵尸！",
  "NARRATIVE_DANGER_ROOM_INTRO_MODERN_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{EXCITED:crazydave}你好，邻居！欢迎来到危险公路！",
  "NARRATIVE_DANGER_ROOM_INTRO_MODERN_2": "{EXCITED:crazydave}在这里你会发现所有的时间都是一次......",
  "NARRATIVE_DANGER_ROOM_INTRO_MODERN_3": "{SHOUT:crazydave}...现在就是时候了！",
  "NARRATIVE_DANGER_ROOM_INTRO_PIRATE_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SAY}嗨邻居！欢迎来到死人的战利品！",
  "NARRATIVE_DANGER_ROOM_INTRO_PIRATE_2": "{PLAYFUL}我会掠夺它。",
  "NARRATIVE_DANGER_ROOM_INTROWRAPUP_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{PLAYFUL}不错的选择，让我们看看你能走多远！",
  "NARRATIVE_DANGER_ROOM_LAWNMOWER_SUCCESS_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{EXCITED}很棒的工作邻居！",
  "NARRATIVE_DANGER_ROOM_LAWNMOWER_SUCCESS_2": "{tutorial}",
  "NARRATIVE_DANGER_ROOM_LAWNMOWER_SUCCESS_3": "{SAY}您的植物性食物将提升到一个新的水平！",
