  "NARRATIVE_DANGER_ROOM_POWER_2": "{SAY:winnie}每个级别只能购买一次能量道具和植物食物。",
  "NARRATIVE_DANGER_ROOM_POWER_3": "{EXCITED:winnie}祝你好运！",
  "NARRATIVE_DANGER_ROOM_SUCCESS_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{EXCITED}很棒的工作邻居！",
  "NARRATIVE_DANGER_ROOM_SUCCESS_2": "{tutorial}",
  "NARRATIVE_DANGER_ROOM_SUCCESS_3": "{SAY}在无尽地带，您的割草机将提升到一个新的水平！\r\n",
  "NARRATIVE_DANGER_ROOM_SUCCESS_4": "{tutorial}",
  "NARRATIVE_DANGER_ROOM_SUCCESS_5": "{SAY}您的植物性食物也将进入新的水平！",
  "NARRATIVE_DANGER_ROOM_SUCCESS_6": "{tutorial}",
  "NARRATIVE_DANGER_ROOM_SUCCESS_7": "{PLAYFUL}现在是时候采摘另一种植物了！",
  "NARRATIVE_DANGER_ROOM_TUTORIAL_1": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{tutorial}",
  "NARRATIVE_DANGER_ROOM_TUTORIAL_2": "{EXCITED}这些是你的起始植物！",
  "NARRATIVE_DANGER_ROOM_TUTORIAL_3": "{SAY}现在你可以再选一个了。",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_INTRO_EVILPOTIONS_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:winnie}警告！我检测到装有恶意化妆品的玻璃水瓶！",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_INTRO_EVILPOTIONS_2": "{TIRED:crazydave}你能帮我把它翻译成《Crazy Dave Talk》吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_INTRO_EVILPOTIONS_3": "{TIRED:winnie}草坪上有邪恶药水！",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_INTRO_EVILPOTIONS_4": "{EXCITED:crazydave}邪恶的中世纪药水！他们是最危险的一类...",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_INTRO_EVILPOTIONS_5": "{EXCITED:crazydave}因为有双倍的邪恶！",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_INTRO_FIRSTLEVEL_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:crazydave}哇哦！谁把灯调暗了？",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_INTRO_FIRSTLEVEL_2": "{TIRED:winnie}没有人，用户戴夫。我们刚刚抵达黑暗时代。",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_INTRO_FIRSTLEVEL_3": "{SAY:crazydave}对我来说听起来很悲观。",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_INTRO_FIRSTLEVEL_4": "{PLAYFUL:winnie}确实如此。根据我的研究，一场瘟疫席卷了这个时代。",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_INTRO_FIRSTLEVEL_5": "{SAY:winnie}而且，太阳不再从天而降。",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_INTRO_FIRSTLEVEL_6": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}我们需要的是有人来照亮这个地方！",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_INTRO_FIRSTLEVEL_7": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我明白了！我们需要阳光菇！",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_INTRO_FIRSTLEVEL_8": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}这些家伙不只懂得皱眉……",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_INTRO_FIRSTLEVEL_9": "{EXCITED:crazydave}它们在成长过程中会吸收更多的阳光！很棒的小伙子，非常有才华。",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_INTRO_FUMESHROOM_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{TIRED:crazydave}恐怕黑暗时代给我带来了糟糕的蒸汽情况。",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_INTRO_FUMESHROOM_2": "{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，蒸汽不再被视为真正的疾病。",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_INTRO_FUMESHROOM_3": "{SAY:winnie}但我相信大喷菇在这里会有用。",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_INTRO_FUMESHROOM_4": "{EXCITED:winnie}他的蒸汽非常真实，并且在对抗正确的僵尸对手时提供了明显的优势。",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_INTRO_FUMESHROOM_5": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}烟雾缭绕！让我们给僵尸一箱蒸汽吧！",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_INTRO_GARGANTUAR_1": "{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY}幸会，不是什么贵族大人！",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_INTRO_GARGANTUAR_2": "{SAY:zombossicon}我热切的医学意见是你的体液失衡了！",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_INTRO_GARGANTUAR_3": "{SAY:zombossicon}我认为虹吸你的大脑是纠正这种疾病的唯一方法！",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_INTRO_GARGANTUAR_4": "{SAY:zombossicon}再见，埃德加博士僵王",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_INTRO_GARGANTUAR_5": "{NPC_EXIT:zombossicon}{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{PLAYFUL:crazydave}嘿！我更喜欢我的幽默感和不平衡的大脑！",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_INTRO_GARGANTUAR_6": "{EXCITED:crazydave}因为我很疯狂！",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_INTRO_HYPNOSHROOM_1": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SAY:winnie}数据表明黑暗时代是一个智力衰退和道德混乱的时期。",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_INTRO_HYPNOSHROOM_2": "{PLAYFUL:winnie}也许现在是发挥魅惑菇说服力的好时机？",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_INTRO_HYPNOSHROOM_3": "{EXCITED:crazydave}好主意，朋朋！我们将改变邪恶——黑暗时代风格！",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_INTRO_HYPNOSHROOM_4": "{SAY:crazydave}部署这个蘑菇，僵尸将不知道是什么咬了他们......",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_INTRO_HYPNOSHROOM_5": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}直到他们发现那是他们的僵尸同胞！然后，心碎了！",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_INTRO_MAGNETSHROOM_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}根据我的数据，铁和其他金属在黑暗时代期间被常规使用。",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_INTRO_MAGNETSHROOM_2": "{EXCITED:winnie}因此，磁力蘑菇在这里应该是一个出色的盟友。",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_INTRO_MAGNETSHROOM_3": "{EXCITED:crazydave}他可以从僵尸身上拉下水桶、头盔和其他金属物体！",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_INTRO_MAGNETSHROOM_4": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}有些人认为这很神奇。但实际上，这只是物理学。",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_INTRO_PEANUT_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}Boy、豌豆射手和坚果墙确实很擅长他们所做的事情。",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_INTRO_PEANUT_2": "{EXCITED:crazydave}谈论两种伟大的植物一起战斗！",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_INTRO_PEANUT_3": "{EXCITED:winnie}用户戴夫！也许你的大脑并不像你时不时强调的那样不健全！",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_INTRO_PEANUT_4": "{PLAYFUL:winnie}如果有一种植物的行为既像豌豆射手又像坚果墙呢？",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_INTRO_PEANUT_5": "{SAY:winnie}我们称之为……花生！",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_INTRO_PEANUT_6": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}一颗豆类体内有两种植物力量？",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_INTRO_PEANUT_7": "{EXCITED:crazydave}继续这样说话，人们会叫你疯子朋朋！",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_INTRO_PEANUT_8": "{SAY:crazydave}这对我们俩来说都很奇怪。",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_INTRO_ZOMBOSS_1": "{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY}问你一个问题，我可耻的敌人！",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_INTRO_ZOMBOSS_2": "{SAY:zombossicon}你有没有注意到你的植物在食用植物性食物后变得多么暴力？",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_INTRO_ZOMBOSS_3": "{SAY:zombossicon}也许，您是否想知道植物性食物的真正成分是什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_INTRO_ZOMBOSS_4": "{SAY:zombossicon}我真的告诉​​你。这是僵尸！植物性食物是由僵尸制成的！",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_INTRO_ZOMBOSS_5": "{NPC_EXIT:zombossicon}{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}不可能！我们只为我们的植物提供最优质的有机呃...",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_INTRO_ZOMBOSS_6": "{TIRED:crazydave}嘿朋朋，植物性食物是由什么制成的？",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_INTRO_ZOMBOSS_7": "{SAY:winnie}恐怕植物性食物的真实性质需要进一步分析，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_INTRO_ZOMBOSS_8": "{TIRED:winnie}对不起，我正在运行一些测试。",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_OUTRO_DANGER_ROOM_KEY_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}为什么有人会把一把漂亮的剑插进肮脏的岩石里？",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_OUTRO_DANGER_ROOM_KEY_2": "{TIRED:winnie}我理解这是一个测试，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_OUTRO_DANGER_ROOM_KEY_3": "{EXCITED:winnie}只有体力和性格坚强的人才能将其移除。",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_OUTRO_DANGER_ROOM_KEY_4": "{SAY:crazydave}我打赌有人用手提钻可以把它拆下来。",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_OUTRO_DANGER_ROOM_KEY_5": "{EXCITED:crazydave}一个疯狂的人！",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_OUTRO_DANGER_ROOM_KEY_6": "{TIRED:winnie}一个不优雅但无疑有效的测试解决方案，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_OUTRO_ZOMBOSS_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}我没有发现任何证据表明植物性食物含有僵尸或僵尸副产品。",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_OUTRO_ZOMBOSS_2": "{TIRED:crazydave}唷！植物不应该吃吃植物的僵尸。",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_OUTRO_ZOMBOSS_3": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}除了大嘴花。他必须这样做。老兄需要纤维。",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_OUTRO_ZOMBOSS_4": "{NPC_EXIT:crazydave}{NPC_EXIT:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}你的穿越老爷车为何对你撒谎？",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_OUTRO_ZOMBOSS_5": "{SAY:zombossicon}也许，这个问题最好留到另一天再回答？",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_OUTRO_ZOMBOSS_6": "{SAY:zombossicon}现在，我祈祷，想象一下我离开时疯狂的笑声。",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_ZOMBIENOTE_1": "{NPC_ENTER:winnieicon}{SAY:winnieicon}用户戴夫，我们遇到了卷轴。",
