  "NARRATIVE_DINO_1_INTRO_4": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我知道我闻到了更多的氧气味！",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_15_OUTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:crazydave}看，朋朋！新鲜出炉的明星帅哥！",
