  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_GEMJAM_10_OUTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}{START_DIALOG_MUSIC}嘘！流氓！盗取宝石的恶棍！",
