  "NARRATIVE_FUTURE_OUTRO_DANGER_ROOM_KEY_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:crazydave}我用我疯狂的眼睛发现了一个U.F.B.！不明飞行大脑！",
  "NARRATIVE_FUTURE_OUTRO_DANGER_ROOM_KEY_2": "{SAY:winnie}里面有比大脑更强大的东西。",
  "NARRATIVE_FUTURE_OUTRO_ZOMBOSS_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SPECIAL2}哦！那真是……令人惊叹的催眠！",
