  "NARRATIVE_HEROES_EVENT_009_INTRO_3": "{NPC_ENTER:wallknight}{SAY:wallknight}骑士！那是墙！",
  "NARRATIVE_HEROES_EVENT_009_INTRO_4": "{SAY:wallknight}墙骑士！",
  "NARRATIVE_HEROES_EVENT_009_INTRO_5": "{SAY:wallknight}我喜欢这个游戏！",
  "NARRATIVE_HEROES_EVENT_010_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:greenshadow}{NPC_ENTER:superbrainz}{SAY:greenshadow}我就知道我们会再见面，超级脑子！",
  "NARRATIVE_HEROES_EVENT_010_INTRO_2": "{SAY:superbrainz}我的名字是超级脑子！",
  "NARRATIVE_HEROES_EVENT_010_INTRO_3": "{SAY:greenshadow}是的，我已经……你知道吗？算了。",
  "NARRATIVE_HEROES_EVENT_011_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:greenshadow}{NPC_ENTER:impfinity}{SAY:greenshadow}缺失的英雄特隆5000零件在哪儿，小鬼僵尸finity？",
  "NARRATIVE_HEROES_EVENT_011_INTRO_2": "{SAY:impfinity}噢—嘿—嘿——！",
  "NARRATIVE_HEROES_EVENT_011_INTRO_3": "{SAY:greenshadow}那不是答案！",
  "NARRATIVE_HEROES_EVENT_012_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:wallknight}{NPC_ENTER:electricboogaloo}{SAY:elecricboogaloo}电波！布加鲁！",
  "NARRATIVE_HEROES_EVENT_012_INTRO_2": "{SAY:wallknight}嗨！你喜欢蜡笔吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_HEROES_EVENT_012_INTRO_3": "{SAY:electricboogaloo}我喜欢很多东西！",
  "NARRATIVE_HEROES_EVENT_012_INTRO_4": "{SAY:wallknight}但是你喜欢……蓝色的蜡笔吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_HEROES_EVENT_013_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:impfinity}{SAY:impfinity}嘘！",
  "NARRATIVE_HEROES_EVENT_013_INTRO_2": "{SAY:impfinity}我们偷了英雄创位！是的！把它们卡在我的帽子里了！",
  "NARRATIVE_HEROES_EVENT_013_INTRO_3": "{NPC_EXIT:impfinity}{NPC_ENTER:wallknight}{SAY:wallknight}嗨嗨嗨！",
  "NARRATIVE_HEROES_EVENT_013_INTRO_4": "{SAY:wallknight}我错过了什么吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_HEROES_EVENT_014_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:solarflare}{SAY:solarflare}唷！这些僵尸是难缠的顾客！",
  "NARRATIVE_HEROES_EVENT_014_INTRO_2": "{SAY:solarflare}他们一直来！他们永远不会停止！",
  "NARRATIVE_HEROES_EVENT_014_INTRO_3": "{NPC_ENTER:superbrainz}{SAY:superbrainz}我的名字是超级大脑！",
  "NARRATIVE_HEROES_EVENT_014_INTRO_4": "{SAY:solarflare}让我们面对现实吧......他们的谈话并不具有启发性！",
  "NARRATIVE_HEROES_EVENT_015_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:greenshadow}{SAY:greenshadow}太阳耀斑！你找到 Hero-Tron 组件了吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_HEROES_EVENT_015_INTRO_10": "{NPC_EXIT:solarflare}{NPC_EXIT:electricboogaloo}{NPC_ENTER:impfinity}{SAY:impfinity}嘻嘻嘻嘻嘻！",
  "NARRATIVE_HEROES_EVENT_015_INTRO_11": "{SAY:impfinity}收听更多精彩...",
  "NARRATIVE_HEROES_EVENT_015_INTRO_12": "{SAY:impfinity}...并查看植物大战僵尸英雄！",
  "NARRATIVE_HEROES_EVENT_015_INTRO_2": "{NPC_EXIT:greenshadow}{NPC_ENTER:solarflare}{SAY:solarflare}不！就是一堆垃圾！你呢，墙骑士？",
  "NARRATIVE_HEROES_EVENT_015_INTRO_3": "{NPC_EXIT:solarflare}{NPC_ENTER:wallknight}{SAY:wallknight}嗨！我是墙骑士！",
  "NARRATIVE_HEROES_EVENT_015_INTRO_4": "{NPC_ENTER:superbrainz}{SAY:superbrainz}我的名字是超级大脑！",
  "NARRATIVE_HEROES_EVENT_015_INTRO_5": "{NPC_EXIT:wallknight}{NPC_ENTER:greenshadow}{SAY:greenshadow}我们知道！！！",
  "NARRATIVE_HEROES_EVENT_015_INTRO_6": "{NPC_EXIT:greenshadow}{NPC_EXIT:superbrainz}{NPC_ENTER:electricboogaloo}{SAY:electricboogaloo}呼呼准备好2...",
  "NARRATIVE_HEROES_EVENT_015_INTRO_7": "{SAY:electricboogaloo}用电动布加卢打倒！",
  "NARRATIVE_HEROES_EVENT_015_INTRO_8": "{NPC_ENTER:solarflare}{SAY:solarflare}我！",
  "NARRATIVE_HEROES_EVENT_015_INTRO_9": "{SAY:solarflare}我的意思是……永远不会！",
  "NARRATIVE_HOCUS_EQ_1": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}种植魔术番红花，用魔法将僵尸靠近草坪后面。",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLLY_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}点击冬青屏障，然后点击目标来发射屏障叶。",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLLY_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}发起的攻击会击退僵尸并在空的方块中留下带刺的障碍物。",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLLY_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}冬青屏障可以发射3个屏障，还可以对攻击的僵尸造成刺痛伤害！",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_INTRO_CHARDGUARD_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}这些洞穴僵尸的头脑确实很顽固。",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_INTRO_CHARDGUARD_2": "{TIRED:crazydave}他们只是不会接受“无脑”的答案。",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_INTRO_CHARDGUARD_3": "{PLAYFUL:winnie}根据我的数据，尼安德特人的僵尸头骨比其他僵尸头骨坚硬33.2%。",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_INTRO_CHARDGUARD_4": "{SAY:winnie}我建议我们部署甜菜护卫。他的叶子里藏着一个秘密。",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_INTRO_CHARDGUARD_5": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}你是说他的“Knock 'Em Dead”策略？",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_INTRO_CHARDGUARD_6": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}它将把那些僵尸击回原来的地方！",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_INTRO_CHARDGUARD_7": "{TIRED:winnie}我想这已经不是什么秘密了，现在是用户戴夫吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_INTRO_FIREPEASHOOTER_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:winnie}警告，用户戴夫！我的防冻液用量低-低-低！",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_INTRO_FIREPEASHOOTER_2": "{TIRED:winnie}如果我的系统死机了，我们可能会永远被困在这里！",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_INTRO_FIREPEASHOOTER_3": "{EXCITED:crazydave}在我让这种情况发生之前，这将是一个寒冷的日子，朋朋！",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_INTRO_FIREPEASHOOTER_4": "{SAY:crazydave}释放火焰豌豆的时间到了！",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_INTRO_FIREPEASHOOTER_5": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}她可以给那些僵尸加热，也可以温暖附近的朋友！",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_INTRO_FIRSTLEVEL_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{PLAYFUL:crazydave}Brrrrr。比北极熊吃冰棒还冷！",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_INTRO_FIRSTLEVEL_2": "{SAY:winnie}Indeed. 看来我们已经到达冰河世界了。",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_INTRO_FIRSTLEVEL_3": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}我们已经回到了历史那么久……我们已经到达了史前时代！",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_INTRO_FIRSTLEVEL_4": "{SAY:winnie}确实是一个历史性时刻，用户戴夫。 But more importantly...",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_INTRO_FIRSTLEVEL_5": "{EXCITED:winnie}我的传感器显示草坪上有浮冰。",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_INTRO_FIRSTLEVEL_6": "{SAY:winnie}数据表明它会阻挡植物和僵尸。",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_INTRO_FIRSTLEVEL_7": "{EXCITED:winnie}虽然我预测饥饿的僵尸会找到解决办法。",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_INTRO_FIRSTLEVEL_8": "{SAY:crazydave}别担心。我们会明智地种植并阻止那些僵尸！",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_INTRO_FLAMETHROWER_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{TIRED:crazydave}全局冷却就是坑。我们需要的是热浪！",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_INTRO_FLAMETHROWER_2": "{SAY:winnie}Agreed. 请注意，我现在已将雪球替换为火球。",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_INTRO_FLAMETHROWER_3": "{SAY:winnie}火焰喷射器能量提升会融化冰霜并伤害僵尸。",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_INTRO_FLAMETHROWER_4": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}Neat-o! 你知道，他们说复仇是一道冷盘最好吃的菜。",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_INTRO_FLAMETHROWER_5": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}但我说最好趁热吃。 Fiery hot! 加上额外的辣酱。",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_INTRO_FLAMETHROWER_6": "{EXCITED:crazydave}还有一份炸玉米饼！",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_INTRO_GARGANTUAR_1": "{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}我僵王。我再给你写一封威胁信。",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_INTRO_GARGANTUAR_2": "{SAY:zombossicon}你有麻烦了。 Biiiiig trouble. 事实上，这是一个巨大的麻烦！",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_INTRO_GARGANTUAR_3": "{SAY:zombossicon}树懒巨人粉碎！粉碎那些瑟瑟发抖的小植物！",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_INTRO_GARGANTUAR_4": "{SAY:zombossicon}树懒巨人带来小鬼僵尸的史前瘟疫！",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_INTRO_GARGANTUAR_5": "{SAY:zombossicon}度过了糟糕的一天。此致，僵王博士",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_INTRO_GARGANTUAR_6": "{NPC_EXIT:zombossicon}{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}我假设进化永远不会降临到那个僵尸身上。",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_INTRO_GARGANTUAR_7": "{SAY:crazydave}一百万、十亿、亿万年都不会。",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_INTRO_HURRIKALE_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}我的数据表明飓风甘蓝在这里很有用。",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_INTRO_HURRIKALE_2": "{EXCITED:crazydave}从他身上吹出一股气流，僵尸就会冷静下来并减速！",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_INTRO_HURRIKALE_3": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}这家伙真是一个重击。我的意思是，以尽可能最好的方式。",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_INTRO_ICEBLOCKS_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}现在别看，朋朋，但那些植物有严重的冻伤情况！",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_INTRO_ICEBLOCKS_2": "{TIRED:winnie}是这个时期的寒风。他们已经把植物固定住了。",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_INTRO_ICEBLOCKS_3": "{EXCITED:winnie}我建议我们去热土豆。她可以融化那些冰块。",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_INTRO_ICEBLOCKS_4": "{SAY:crazydave}我已经开始准备这个想法了！",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_INTRO_MINIGAME_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}{SAY:crazydave}太安静了。大家都在哪里？我对此有一种不好的预感。",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_INTRO_MINIGAME_2": "{SAY:winnie}我的传感器显示冰下藏着僵尸。",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_INTRO_MINIGAME_3": "{SAY:crazydave}我知道这个游戏！他们称之为隐藏和吃大脑。",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_INTRO_MINIGAME_4": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}是时候玩我们自己的游戏了：我称之为Whack-A-Zombie。",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_INTRO_MINIGAME_5": "{SAY:winnie}好好敲击他们，他们一定会掉落更好的锤子。",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_INTRO_MINIGAME_6": "{SAY:crazydave}对不起。没办法。不得不说。现在是……锤子时间。",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_INTRO_PEPPERPULT_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{TIRED:crazydave}我开始对这个地方感到畏惧了。",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_INTRO_PEPPERPULT_2": "{SAY:crazydave}还有，我的脚真的很冷。",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_INTRO_PEPPERPULT_3": "{PLAYFUL:winnie}是时候打开暖气了。我推荐辣椒投手来完成这项工作。",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_INTRO_PEPPERPULT_4": "{SAY:winnie}他向僵尸扔辣椒，还为附近的植物保暖。",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_INTRO_PEPPERPULT_5": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}让我们挑选一个辣椒投手！它是解决我们困境的完美植物！",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_INTRO_PEPPERPULT_6": "{TIRED:winnie}你必须头韵吗用户戴夫？一定要吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_INTRO_STUNION_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{TIRED:crazydave}我希望这些史前僵尸赶紧回到他们的洞穴里去。",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_INTRO_STUNION_2": "{EXCITED:winnie}用户戴夫，或许是时候尝试一下新的战术了。",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_INTRO_STUNION_3": "{SAY:winnie}数据表明郁金香将成为这里的……强大的……盟友。",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_INTRO_STUNION_4": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}好主意，朋朋！那家伙的气息，太惊人了！",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_INTRO_STUNION_5": "{SAY:crazydave}一点也不夸张。他用他的口臭让僵尸晕眩。",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_INTRO_STUNION_6": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}毛。而且，非常漂亮！",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_INTRO_XSHOT_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}朋朋，我们现在需要的是一杯热腾腾的可可！",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_INTRO_XSHOT_2": "{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，这是一种未经证实的僵尸战斗武器。",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_INTRO_XSHOT_3": "{SAY:winnie}我建议我们改为致电萝卜仪。",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_INTRO_XSHOT_4": "{EXCITED:winnie}她可以悬停在地面上并向四个方向射击僵尸！",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_INTRO_XSHOT_5": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}孩子很有天赋！也许她也知道如何制作热可可？",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_INTRO_ZOMBOSS_1": "{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}咕噜咕噜！僵王博士有一个史前问题给可怜的植物朋友们。",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_INTRO_ZOMBOSS_2": "{SAY:zombossicon}你为什么要寻找炸玉米饼？塔可真如人们所吹捧的那样吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_INTRO_ZOMBOSS_3": "{SAY:zombossicon}难道是……陷阱？难道是……诡计？",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_INTRO_ZOMBOSS_4": "{SAY:zombossicon}咀嚼那个！哇哈哈哈哈乌嘎乌嘎！",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_INTRO_ZOMBOSS_5": "{NPC_EXIT:zombossicon}{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:crazydave}朋朋 ...我的炸玉米饼！？！",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_INTRO_ZOMBOSS_6": "{TIRED:winnie}用户戴夫，忽略炸玉米饼。忽略嘲笑。",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_INTRO_ZOMBOSS_7": "{EXCITED:winnie}是时候与博士战斗了。僵尸老大！",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_OUTRO_DANGER_ROOM_KEY_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED: winnie}用户戴夫，我检测到有一块冰块传入。",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_OUTRO_DANGER_ROOM_KEY_2": "{EXCITED:crazydave}对我来说看起来像僵尸片。",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_OUTRO_DANGER_ROOM_KEY_3": "{SAY:winnie}分析表明这个令人毛骨悚然的立方体解锁了一个寒冷的挑战。",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_OUTRO_DANGER_ROOM_KEY_4": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}你知道我说什么吗？继续吧！",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_OUTRO_ZOMBOSS_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:winnie}干得好。我们打败了僵王博士。",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_OUTRO_ZOMBOSS_2": "{EXCITED:crazydave}他试图让我质疑我的炸玉米饼！",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_OUTRO_ZOMBOSS_3": "{TIRED:winnie}用户戴夫，我们的时空之旅……",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_OUTRO_ZOMBOSS_4": "{SAY:winnie}你知道它不仅仅是一个炸玉米饼。",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_OUTRO_ZOMBOSS_5": "{TIRED:crazydave}我想你是对的，朋朋。这也是关于——",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_OUTRO_ZOMBOSS_6": "{NPC_EXIT:crazydave}{NPC_EXIT:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}哈！僵王博士没有被打败！",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_OUTRO_ZOMBOSS_7": "{SAY:zombossicon}僵王博士从毁灭边缘爬回来！",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_OUTRO_ZOMBOSS_8": "{SAY:zombossicon}僵王博士在你不等他的时候就回来了。带来大惊喜！",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_OUTRO_ZOMBOSS_9": "{SAY:zombossicon}僵王博士现在停止用第三人称谈论自己！再见！",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_ZOMBIENOTE_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydaveicon}{TIRED:crazydaveicon}朋朋，你有没有尝试过用舌头去舔厚厚的冰块？",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_ZOMBIENOTE_2": "{NPC_ENTER:winnieicon}{TIRED:winnieicon}不，用户戴夫。我没有。",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_ZOMBIENOTE_3": "{SAY:crazydaveicon}呃……我也不是。那真是太疯狂了。",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_ZOMBIENOTE_4": "{SAY:winnieicon}叹息。当你的舌头痊愈时，请注意那块奇怪的石碑。",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_ZOMBIENOTE_5": "{SAY:winnieicon}这似乎是一个警告标志，用洞穴僵尸写的。",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_ZOMBIENOTE_6": "{PLAYFUL:crazydaveicon}它是在警告人们不要舔冰厚吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_JACKOLANTERN_LOD_1": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}点击南瓜灯爆发火焰。",
  "NARRATIVE_JACKOLANTERN_LOD_2": "{SAY:winnie}点击并按住可延长爆发，造成更大的伤害！",
  "NARRATIVE_JOUST_UNLOCK_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydaveicon}{NPC_ENTER:winnieicon}{SAY:winnieicon}用户戴夫。我发现一个新的裂痕已经打开。我们现在可以访问“竞技场”。",
  "NARRATIVE_JOUST_UNLOCK_2": "{EXCITED:crazydaveicon}竞技场？！这听起来像是园艺战争的树木园！",
  "NARRATIVE_JOUST_UNLOCK_3": "{SAY:winnieicon}竞技场将让我们展示我们的种植实力，以获得声望和奖品。",
  "NARRATIVE_JOUST_UNLOCK_4": "{SAY:crazydaveicon}很多豌豆！这就是我知道它很好的原因。",
  "NARRATIVE_KIWIBEAST_EQ_1": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}猕猴桃兽对僵尸造成重击伤害。 ",
  "NARRATIVE_KIWIBEAST_EQ_2": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}当它们受到僵尸伤害时，它们会变得更加强大。 ",
  "NARRATIVE_LAWN_MOWERS_FILL_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{EXCITED:winnie}哇，割草机可以追赶僵尸，继续前进！",
  "NARRATIVE_LAWN_MOWERS_FILL_2": "{SAY:crazydave}留意僵尸掉落的割草机，但与此同时......",
  "NARRATIVE_LAWN_MOWERS_FILL_3": "{SAY:crazydave}让我让你们的割草机恢复战斗状态。",
  "NARRATIVE_LAWN_MOWERS_FILL_4": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}别担心，这个就在房子上，或者房子旁边。",
  "NARRATIVE_LOD_BIG_REWARD_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}你真的太棒了！最名副其实的……皮纳塔先生！",
  "NARRATIVE_LOD_BIG_REWARD_INTRO_2": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}你看到我的 Taco Señor Piñata 了吗？原来是关于这个大...",
  "NARRATIVE_LOD_BIG_REWARD_INTRO_3": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{TIRED}就是这样。请在用户戴夫变得过于执着之前扰乱这个异常。",
  "NARRATIVE_LOD_LEVEL_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{TIRED}用户戴夫，这看起来不像是聚会。",
  "NARRATIVE_LOD_LEVEL_INTRO_2": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{PLAYFUL}它仍然可以是一个惊喜派对，有礼物什么的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LOD_LEVEL_INTRO_3": "{EXCITED:crazydave}你会看到朋朋，我认为这些僵尸是不同的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LOD_MAP_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:winnieicon}{EXCITED}现代你的房子即将遭受袭击！",
  "NARRATIVE_LOD_MAP_INTRO_2": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydaveicon}{EXCITED}我打赌这不是攻击...我打赌这是一场派对！哦，我希望这是一个皮纳塔派对！",
  "NARRATIVE_LOD_MAP_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnieicon}这不是派对，有来自各个时期的僵尸准备出击！",
  "NARRATIVE_LOD_MAP_INTRO_4": "{EXCITED:winnieicon}谁知道他们还可以带什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LOD_MAP_INTRO_5": "{PLAYFUL:crazydaveicon}对我来说听起来像是一场派对！最好快点，我们不想错过！",
  "NARRATIVE_LOD_MAP_OUTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:winnieicon}聚会暂时结束了，但那些僵尸总有一天会回来的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LOD_MAP_OUTRO_2": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydaveicon}{PLAYFUL}还有他们......更多皮纳塔！",
  "NARRATIVE_LOD_MAP_OUTRO_3": "{SAY:winnieicon}连续防御多方可能会导致大规模的“皮纳塔”异常。",
  "NARRATIVE_LOD_MAP_OUTRO_4": "{EXCITED:crazydaveicon}我已经等不及下一场皮纳塔派对了，还有下一场！",
  "NARRATIVE_LOD_MAP_OUTRO_5": "{TIRED:crazydaveicon}但是那些皮纳塔只是让我想起了我悲伤丢失的玉米卷。我们走吧！",
  "NARRATIVE_LOD_RESET_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:winnieicon}错过“皮纳塔”派对将会重置大规模“皮纳塔”异常的构建。",
  "NARRATIVE_LOD_RESET_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnieicon}我不会假装明白为什么，但数据不会说谎。",
  "NARRATIVE_LOD_RESET_INTRO_3": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydaveicon}{EXCITED}请告诉我们您发现的更多皮纳塔派对！",
  "NARRATIVE_LOD_RESET_INTRO_4": "{PLAYFUL:crazydaveicon}对于聚会来说，它们可能非常鬼祟。",
  "NARRATIVE_LOD_REWARD_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}我告诉你了什么朋朋？惊喜皮纳塔派对！",
  "NARRATIVE_LOD_REWARD_INTRO_2": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{TIRED}不计算。看来需要进行 3 级诊断检查。",
  "NARRATIVE_LOD_REWARD_INTRO_3": "{EXCITED:crazydave}皮纳塔！让我们打开一些看看我们会得到什么！",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_1_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:crazydave}哇哦！欢迎来到丛林！",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_1_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，这不是普通的丛林。翻看我的记录，这就是传说中的失落之城。",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_1_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}历史文献记载，这里崇拜太阳。资源应该很丰富。\r\n",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_1_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}我建议我们尝试在我们在这里找到的金块上种植。",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_1_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}只要上面有植物，它们就应该不断产生阳光。",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_1_INTRO_6": "{EXCITED:crazydave}失落之城？就是这个朋朋！我们找到了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_1_INTRO_7": "{SAY:crazydave}除了失落之城之外，我还能在哪里找到丢失的炸玉米饼？\r\n",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_1_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}你的持续固着违背了所有逻辑或理由，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_16_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}来这里寻求冒险吧？",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_16_INTRO_2": "{SAY:zombossicon}不幸的是，波特巨人僵尸即将毁了你的一天！\r\n",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_16_INTRO_3": "{SAY:zombossicon}他们携带小鬼。小鬼僵尸s！准备好成为古老的历史吧！",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_16_INTRO_4": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:crazydave}我希望有人能带着我在小房子里到处走走！",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_16_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}我想要很多东西，用户戴夫。那不是其中之一。",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_17_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}警报，用户戴夫！我的传感器感应到传入的搬运小鬼。",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_17_INTRO_2": "{EXCITED:crazydave}小鬼僵尸orters？精美商品和玻璃器皿？",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_17_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}负。他们在金砖上搭帐篷，帐篷里就会产生僵尸。",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_17_INTRO_4": "{EXCITED:crazydave}小鬼僵尸有不良意图！",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_2_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}我的传感器指示来自上方的运动。",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_2_INTRO_2": "{EXCITED:crazydave}也许是礼物。从天而降的礼物！",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_2_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}该陈述成立的可能性在统计上是无关的。\r\n",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_2_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}我相信这是一种新形式的僵尸威胁。我们应该警惕不速之客。",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_22_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}小心，用户戴夫！我检测到陷阱瓷砖。",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_22_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}它们是由僵尸触发的，或者当你踩在它们身上时触发的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_22_INTRO_3": "{EXCITED:crazydave}然后他们给你炸玉米饼？",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_22_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}如果您将炸玉米饼等同于火焰喷射和巨大的巨石，那么是的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_3_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}我们面临着相当大的威胁，用户戴夫。我建议我们以强大的力量进行报复。",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_3_INTRO_2": "{SAY:crazydave}更给力！就是这样！我们会对他们所有人进行严厉的谈话。",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_3_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}我指的是熔岩番石榴。它的爆炸会留下危险的岩浆。\r\n",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_3_INTRO_4": "{EXCITED:crazydave}听起来更好了！首先是严厉的谈话，然后是一些熔岩！",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_4_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}小心，用户戴夫。我用铲子检测到僵尸。",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_4_INTRO_2": "{SAY:crazydave}他能挖到吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_4_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}它似乎可以阻挡传入的镜头。我们需要一种方法让弹丸越过铲子。",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_4_INTRO_4": "{SAY:crazydave}我知道！心灵传动！",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_4_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}再试一次，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_INTRO_ZOMBOSS_1": "{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon} 不要想篡夺我们对传说中的失落之城的发现！",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_INTRO_ZOMBOSS_2": "{SAY:zombossicon}我和我的僵尸们已经将我们的发现提交给了《失踪者与遗失者杰出杂志》！",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_INTRO_ZOMBOSS_3": "{SAY:zombossicon}我们将发布，你就会灭亡！",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_OUTRO_DANGER_ROOM_KEY_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:crazydave}看，朋朋！一个闪闪发光的玩意儿！",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_OUTRO_DANGER_ROOM_KEY_2": "{SAY:winnie}我的传感器表明这个护身符指向了久违的挑战。",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_OUTRO_DANGER_ROOM_KEY_3": "{EXCITED:crazydave}让我们灵巧地发现吧！",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_OUTRO_ZOMBOSS_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:crazydave}所有的发现，但仍然没有炸玉米饼！",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_OUTRO_ZOMBOSS_2": "{SAY:winnie}搜索无疑将继续，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_OUTRO_ZOMBOSS_3": "{NPC_EXIT:crazydave}{NPC_EXIT:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}我的发现仍然完好无损。炸玉米饼仍然没有找到。有一天，你的大脑肯定会成为我的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_ZOMBIENOTE_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydaveicon}{NPC_ENTER:winnieicon}{EXCITED:crazydaveicon}好吧，看这里，朋朋！这是一张藏宝图！",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_ZOMBIENOTE_2": "{SAY:winnieicon}我的分析表明该地图的起源非常可疑。",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_ZOMBIENOTE_3": "{SAY:crazydaveicon}上面有一个红色的大X，朋朋。大红X什么时候坏过？",
  "NARRATIVE_MINIGAME_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydaveicon}{SAY}现在我们要打破传统了。",
  "NARRATIVE_MINIGAME_INTRO_2": "{EXCITED:crazydaveicon}Facebreaker 是来自过去的爆炸，就在你的脸上！",
  "NARRATIVE_MINIGAME_INTRO_3": "{NPC_ENTER:winnieicon}{TIRED}它的名字叫《花瓶破坏者》，用户戴夫。打破花瓶的人。",
  "NARRATIVE_MINIGAME_INTRO_4": "{PLAYFUL:crazydaveicon}那么，它一定适合你的花瓶！",
  "NARRATIVE_MISSILETOE_LOD_1": "{NPC_ENTER:Winnie}{SAY:Winnie}点击导弹槲寄生武装她，然后点击目标进行射击。",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_1_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}啊哈！悖论项目开始……现在！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_1_INTRO_2": "{NPC_EXIT:zombossicon}{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}时间线提醒，用户戴夫！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_1_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}我们在出发前不久就到达了！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_1_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}如果我的猜测是正确的，僵王博士将尝试阻止你最初的炸玉米饼消费！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_1_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}我们的旅程将不复存在！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_1_INTRO_6": "{EXCITED:crazydave}NOOOOOOOOOOO！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_1_INTRO_7": "{EXCITED:crazydave}...噢噢噢噢！抱歉，我正忙着尖叫“不”。你说的是“塔可”吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_1_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}我们必须小心，用户戴夫。僵王博士一定会调动他所有的时变僵尸来对付我们！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_1_INTRO_9": "{EXCITED:crazydave}TACOOOOOOO！！！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_11_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}我们领取了暗影菇种子包，用户戴夫。 ",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_11_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie} 暗影菇是影子植物，因此请务必将它们种植在月光花旁边以获得额外效果。",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_11_INTRO_3": "{EXCITED:crazydave} 邻接再次获胜！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_15_OUTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:crazydave}看，朋朋！我的炸玉米饼！ ",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_15_OUTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}不，用户戴夫！你一定不能！我发现了高度的陷阱！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_15_OUTRO_3": "{EXCITED:crazydave}但是...饥饿...周...炸玉米饼！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_16_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}傻瓜！你已经落入我设下的极其明显的陷阱了！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_16_INTRO_2": "{SAY:zombossicon} 我庞大而多样的巨人僵尸阵列会将你彻底遗忘！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_16_INTRO_3": "{NPC_EXIT:zombossicon}{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{EXCITED:crazydave}然后我得到我的炸玉米饼？",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_17_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}黄昏投手是另一种影子植物用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_17_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}它本身会发射爆炸射弹。",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_17_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}然而，在通电状态下，它可以向下投出三道！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_17_INTRO_4": "{EXCITED:crazydave}那是我每个拇指和鼻子的通道！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_19_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}遁地根是一种棘手的植物，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_19_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}如果你点击它，然后点击另一株植物，它们会交换位置！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_19_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}当受到某些僵尸威胁时，他会爆炸，造成严重伤害！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_19_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}您可以使用遁地根来拯救濒临危险的昂贵植物！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_19_INTRO_5": "{EXCITED:crazydave}哇啊啊啊-？植物可能面临危险吗？打电话叫警察！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_2_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}月光花发射阳光，用户戴夫。但这还不是全部。",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_2_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}我的扫描显示它会产生特殊的光芒，增强同类植物的效果。",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_2_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}将月光花相邻种植应该会增加它们的威力。",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_2_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}我怀疑它们会对我们可能发现的任何其他影子植物产生相同的效果。 ",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_2_INTRO_5": "{EXCITED:crazydave}TACOOOOOOOOO！！！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_21_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}全明星僵尸正在侵占，用户戴夫！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_21_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}他们处理并摧毁他们遇到的第一株植物！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_21_INTRO_3": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我责怪裁判！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_22_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:crazydave}哎呀你好！我认为这又是那些令人沮丧的网格之一，朋朋！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_23_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}墓碑玫瑰是影子植物，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_23_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}它拖拽进入其车道的僵尸。",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_23_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}通电后，它可以在失效前处理掉三个僵尸。",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_23_INTRO_4": "{EXCITED:crazydave}这似乎太努力了！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_24_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:crazydave}我听到细小的脚步声！他们叽叽喳喳的！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_24_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}谨慎行事，用户戴夫。我发现超级粉丝小鬼僵尸就在前面！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_24_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}他们的团队精神爆炸！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_3_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}缩小紫罗兰名字很好，用户戴夫。 ",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_3_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}它缩小僵尸并使它们变弱。",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_3_INTRO_3": "{EXCITED:crazydave}小僵尸！离我的小腿远一点！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_32_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}现在是你的末日时刻！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_32_INTRO_2": "{SAY:zombossicon}你对已经吃完的炸玉米饼的鲁莽追求已经粉碎了！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_32_INTRO_3": "{SAY:zombossicon}恢复未来、现在、过去就落在我身上了！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_32_INTRO_4": "{NPC_EXIT:zombossicon}{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}这是真的吗用户戴夫？",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_32_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}我们的任务是否打破了时间流本身？",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_32_INTRO_6": "{SAY:crazydave}请允许我这样解决您的问题：",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_32_INTRO_7": "{SAY:crazydave}*咳咳*",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_32_INTRO_8": "{EXCITED:crazydave}TACOOOOOOO!!!!!",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_32_OUTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}傻瓜！你不重视时间的有效性吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_32_OUTRO_2": "{SAY:zombossicon}你不在意一个时刻接着另一个时刻吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_32_OUTRO_3": "{SAY:zombossicon}白痴！无知！穿锅的！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_32_OUTRO_4": "{NPC_EXIT:zombossicon}{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:crazydave}这不是锅，是带柄盆！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_32_OUTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}我担心，用户戴夫。如果他说的是真话怎么办？",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_32_OUTRO_6": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我太吃玉米卷了，根本不在乎，朋朋！向前！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_33_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}求求你们，时间拉链，一定要听道理！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_33_INTRO_2": "{SAY:zombossicon}连贯性崩溃！我们的时代变得毫无意义！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_33_INTRO_3": "{SAY:zombossicon}东西都是摇摆不定的，超级古怪，就像！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_33_INTRO_4": "{NPC_EXIT:zombossicon}{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{EXCITED:crazydave}释放松鼠！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_33_OUTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}我说的是实话，疯狂的戴夫人！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_33_OUTRO_2": "{SAY:zombossicon}我的话绝对不是想欺骗你！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_33_OUTRO_3": "{SAY:zombossicon}你不能再吃炸玉米饼！这是不可能的！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_33_OUTRO_4": "{NPC_EXIT:zombossicon}{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{EXCITED:crazydave}小鬼僵尸-可能吗？我讨厌小鬼！充满激情！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_34_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}如果你不听，那么你就会被毁灭！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_34_INTRO_2": "{NPC_EXIT:zombossicon}{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{EXCITED:crazydave}你没有信誉！塔库奥！！！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_34_OUTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}大卫，我求你了！你必须放弃很久以前吃玉米卷的无望梦想！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_34_OUTRO_10": "{EXCITED:crazydave}这是我或其他人一生中最伟大的一天！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_34_OUTRO_11": "{SAY:winnie}确实，或许我们一直都误判了僵王博士...",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_34_OUTRO_12": "{NPC_EXIT:crazydave}{NPC_EXIT:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}哈哈哈！也许你误判了我。或者……也许不是！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_34_OUTRO_13": "{SAY:zombossicon}我对未来绝对没有什么不正当的计划！或者……我可以吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_34_OUTRO_14": "{SAY:zombossicon}哇哈哈哈哈哈哈！我们还会再见面的！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_34_OUTRO_2": "{SAY:zombossicon}消失了，永远消失了！但请拿走这个！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_34_OUTRO_3": "{NPC_EXIT:zombossicon}{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_34_OUTRO_4": "{SAY:crazydave}！！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_34_OUTRO_5": "{EXCITED:crazydave}!!!!!!!!!!!!",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_34_OUTRO_6": "{SAY:crazydave}那是……",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_34_OUTRO_7": "{SAY:crazydave}这不可能……",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_34_OUTRO_8": "{SPECIAL2}{EXCITED:crazydave}里面有华夫饼的炸玉米饼！！！！！！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_34_OUTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}我发现美味程度很高，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_5_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}夜幕菇是另一种影子植物用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_5_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}它本身会对僵尸造成拍打伤害。",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_5_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}但是如果接下来种一个月光花，两者都会变得更加强大。",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_5_INTRO_4": "{EXCITED:crazydave}植物朋友？那是 CRAAA-ZY！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_8_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}我正在拿起一格植物，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_8_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}我的扫描表明它们可以交换以创建三个匹配。",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_8_INTRO_3": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我曾经在手机上看过这样的游戏！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_9_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}我的传感器检测到氦气含量增加，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_9_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}我怀疑我们可能面临一个或多个气球僵尸。",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_9_INTRO_3": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我讨厌一个或多个气球僵尸！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_OUTRO_DANGER_ROOM_KEY_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:crazydave}朋朋！下水道长度随机！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_OUTRO_DANGER_ROOM_KEY_2": "{SAY:winnie}小心，用户戴夫。那根管子是市政覆盖物的一部分，有无尽的参与！",
  "NARRATIVE_MORE_LEVELS_1": "{NPC_ENTER:winnieicon}{SAY}开放世界还有更多关卡。",
  "NARRATIVE_MORE_LEVELS_2": "{EXCITED:winnieicon}还有植物和奖励可以赚取。",
  "NARRATIVE_MORE_LEVELS_3": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydaveicon}{EXCITED}还有，记得炸玉米饼！",
  "NARRATIVE_MORE_LEVELS_4": "{TIRED:crazydaveicon}我们没有忘记你，我亲爱的丢失的炸玉米饼。",
  "NARRATIVE_MURKADAMIA_EQ_1": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}种植雾气澳洲坚果来阻挡和伤害僵尸。",
  "NARRATIVE_OLIVEPIT_EQ_1": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}种植橄榄坑并观看它们吞噬僵尸。",
  "NARRATIVE_OUT_OF_CONTENT_FUTURE_NEXT_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydaveicon}{START_DIALOG_MUSIC}您认为未来将带我们走向何方？",
  "NARRATIVE_OUT_OF_CONTENT_FUTURE_NEXT_2": "{NPC_ENTER:winnieicon}在无尽地带练习先进的种植技术……",
  "NARRATIVE_OUT_OF_CONTENT_FUTURE_NEXT_3": "{SAY:winnieicon}让您在未来的试验中保持敏锐。",
  "NARRATIVE_OUT_OF_CONTENT_FUTURE_NEXT_4": "{SAY:crazydaveicon}{SPECIAL15}记住就好。明天总是炸玉米饼...",
  "NARRATIVE_OUT_OF_CONTENT_FUTURE_NEXT_5": "{SPECIAL16:crazydaveicon}炸玉米饼是我们每个人内心深处的东西。",
  "NARRATIVE_OUT_OF_CONTENT_SOON_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydaveicon}看起来可能是路的尽头......",
  "NARRATIVE_OUT_OF_CONTENT_SOON_10": "{PLAYFUL:crazydaveicon}可以放进冰箱吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_OUT_OF_CONTENT_SOON_2": "{SAY:crazydaveicon}但是在时空连续体上寻找炸玉米饼时，路还要继续。",
  "NARRATIVE_OUT_OF_CONTENT_SOON_3": "{NPC_ENTER:winnieicon}{SAY:winnieicon}同时，一定要在无尽地带练习先进的种植技术。",
  "NARRATIVE_OUT_OF_CONTENT_SOON_4": "{PLAYFUL:crazydaveicon}朋朋是对的。保持敏锐很重要。",
  "NARRATIVE_OUT_OF_CONTENT_SOON_5": "{EXCITED:crazydaveicon}你永远不知道什么时候你的草坪上会发现僵尸。",
  "NARRATIVE_OUT_OF_CONTENT_SOON_6": "{SAY:crazydaveicon}或者我在你的草坪上。",
  "NARRATIVE_OUT_OF_CONTENT_SOON_7": "{PLAYFUL:crazydaveicon}或者我在你草坪上的炸玉米饼。",
  "NARRATIVE_OUT_OF_CONTENT_SOON_8": "{TIRED:crazydaveicon}真的，你只是不知道。",
  "NARRATIVE_OUT_OF_CONTENT_SOON_9": "{SAY:crazydaveicon}但是如果你在你的草坪上发现了我的炸玉米饼......",
  "NARRATIVE_PEAVINE_EQ_1": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}在安抚薄荷家族植物上种植豌豆藤以增强其伤害。",
  "NARRATIVE_PEPPERMINT_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}能量薄荷是强大的植物，你可以用宝石获得。",
  "NARRATIVE_PEPPERMINT_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}它们为家族中的植物提供了巨大的促进作用。",
  "NARRATIVE_PEPPERMINT_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}辣椒薄荷系列包括火植物。",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_CHALLENGE_LASTSTAND_A_1": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY}退潮了，海浪正在涌来。",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_CHALLENGE_LASTSTAND_A_2": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{EXCITED:crazydave}抓住你的水翼！我们会被淋湿。",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_CHALLENGE_LASTSTAND_B_1": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY}这些波浪越来越严重。",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_CHALLENGE_LASTSTAND_B_2": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{TIRED:crazydave}我还没湿。",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_CHALLENGE_LASTSTAND_B_3": "{TIRED:winnie}我的意思是僵尸波。",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_CHALLENGE_LASTSTAND_C_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{PLAYFUL}你有一船阳光。不要太过分。",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_CHALLENGE_LASTSTAND_C_2": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{PLAYFUL:winnie}我明白你在那里做了什么。",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_CHALLENGE_LASTSTAND_C_3": "{SPECIAL13:crazydave}什么-？",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_CHALLENGE_MINIGAME_A_1": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY}目标分数已激活。让我们看看你是否能打破我的最高分。",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_CHALLENGE_MINIGAME_A_2": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{PLAYFUL:crazydave}并输入KRZYDV作为您的姓名缩写。",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_CHALLENGE_MINIGAME_B_1": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{TIRED}为什么鸟儿突然出现？",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_CHALLENGE_MINIGAME_B_2": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{EXCITED:crazydave}谁在乎呢？我们有大炮和要击败的分数。",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_CHALLENGE_MINIGAME_C_1": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}恭喜你打破了我的分数。我并不苦涩。 ",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_CHALLENGE_MINIGAME_C_2": "{TIRED:winnie}我不是说你作弊...骗子。",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_CHALLENGE_MINIGAME_C_3": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{EXCITED:crazydave}是啊！大家都很开心！",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_CHALLENGE_PRESET_A_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SAY}黄油和尖峰以及一切都很好。",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_CHALLENGE_PRESET_A_2": "{PLAYFUL}这就是黄油和穗状花序的成分。",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_CHALLENGE_PRESET_A_3": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}这很难争论或同意。",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_CHALLENGE_PRESET_B_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SPECIAL12}炮战！！！",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_CHALLENGE_PRESET_C_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{TIRED}感觉少了点什么。",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_CHALLENGE_PRESET_C_2": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}向日葵s？",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_CHALLENGE_PRESET_C_3": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}没有。我的炸玉米饼。",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_CHALLENGE_PROTECTPLANTS_A_1": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY}记住，保护那些植物。",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_CHALLENGE_PROTECTPLANTS_A_2": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{PLAYFUL:crazydave}不要让那些豆子走上木板。",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_CHALLENGE_PROTECTPLANTS_B_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{PLAYFUL}那些Spring Beans生活在边缘。",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_CHALLENGE_PROTECTPLANTS_B_2": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}危险是他们的中间名。",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_CHALLENGE_PROTECTPLANTS_B_3": "{PLAYFUL:winnie}应该有人更新年历。",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_CHALLENGE_PROTECTPLANTS_C_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SAY}现在很明显这些豆子正在被跟踪。",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_CHALLENGE_PROTECTPLANTS_C_2": "{EXCITED:crazydave}不要留下任何豆子！",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_INTRO_FIRSTLEVEL_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{TIRED:winnie}我以为我们是想回家拿你的炸玉米饼。",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_INTRO_FIRSTLEVEL_2": "{SHOUT:crazydave}但是海盗！抓住你的鹦鹉和假腿！",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_INTRO_GARGANTUAR_1": "{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY}各位队长万岁，",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_INTRO_GARGANTUAR_2": "{SAY:zombossicon}请注意，您的帆船尺寸不足。",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_INTRO_GARGANTUAR_3": "{SAY:zombossicon}此致，埃德加博士僵王。",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_INTRO_GARGANTUAR_4": "{NPC_EXIT:zombossicon}{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{PLAYFUL:crazydave}嗯？那现在是什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_INTRO_GARGANTUAR_5": "{TIRED:winnie}我们需要一艘更大的船。",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_INTRO_ZOMBOSS_1": "{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}我在你的响尾蛇时间机器中发现了一个神秘的特征。",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_INTRO_ZOMBOSS_2": "{SAY:zombossicon}它的时间签名与我自己的创作几乎相同。",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_INTRO_ZOMBOSS_3": "{SAY:zombossicon}给我解释一下，这个“朋朋”最初是如何创建的？",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_INTRO_ZOMBOSS_4": "{NPC_EXIT:zombossicon}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:winnie}我真的可以成为僵博机器人的某种形式吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_INTRO_ZOMBOSS_5": "{TIRED:winnie}用户戴夫，我是僵王博士的女儿吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_INTRO_ZOMBOSS_6": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{PLAYFUL:crazydave}那是一个很好的三明治！那么，我错过了什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_OUTRO_DANGER_ROOM_KEY_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:crazydave}最后，其中一个海盗掉落了一些战利品！ ",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_OUTRO_DANGER_ROOM_KEY_2": "{PLAYFUL:winnie}我发现里面有比宝藏更具挑战性的东西。 ",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_OUTRO_GARGANTUAR_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{PLAYFUL:winnie}这将是最有用的！",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_OUTRO_GARGANTUAR_2": "{SAY:winnie}有了它我们就可以访问西部荒野。",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_OUTRO_GARGANTUAR_3": "{TIRED:crazydave}坚果。我希望它能让我们的船变得更大。",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_OUTRO_LASTTLEVEL_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SAY}{START_DIALOG_MUSIC}我准备好了。海盗很棒，但我想我想家了。",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_OUTRO_LASTTLEVEL_2": "{TIRED}不，等等，我是说晕船。",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_OUTRO_LASTTLEVEL_3": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}请摇下车窗。",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_OUTRO_LASTTLEVEL_4": "{EXCITED:crazydave}没时间。有一个炸玉米饼可以找到！",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_OUTRO_ZOMBOSS_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{TIRED:winnie}请告诉我你的创作过程。",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_OUTRO_ZOMBOSS_2": "{EXCITED:crazydave}这非常简单！我发现了一些时兴的 wabby wabbo 东西。",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_OUTRO_ZOMBOSS_3": "{SAY:crazydave}然后我把它放在两片面包中间...",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_OUTRO_ZOMBOSS_4": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}轰隆隆！很棒的三明治！",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_OUTRO_ZOMBOSS_5": "{NPC_EXIT:winnie}{NPC_EXIT:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}如此丰富的铺​​位。我应该也有同样的期望。",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_OUTRO_ZOMBOSS_6": "{SAY:zombossicon}有一天，当大卫的大脑在我的盘子里时，我会得到答案。",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_WORLDMAP_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydaveicon}{SPECIAL11}让我颤抖。我一直想做点霸气的事！",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_WORLDMAP_INTRO_2": "{PLAYFUL}我一直想要一套属于自己的便便甲板。",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_WORLDMAP_INTRO_3": "{NPC_ENTER:winnieicon}{TIRED}是的，我们走吧。我讨厌他在这里临时搭建一个船​​尾甲板。",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_ZOMBIENOTE_1": "{NPC_ENTER:winnieicon}{SAY}小心。这是一张地图。",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_ZOMBIENOTE_2": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydaveicon}{EXCITED}珍藏！上面说没有僵尸。地图不会说谎！",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_ZOMBIENOTE_3": "{PLAYFUL:winnieicon}嗯，我们有铲子。",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_ZOMBIENOTE_4": "{SHOUT:crazydaveicon}我们走吧！没有时间采取预防措施！",
  "NARRATIVE_POWERUPS_TUTORIAL_INITIAL_1": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED}你有一些能量提升！我将向您展示如何使用它们。",
  "NARRATIVE_POWERUPS_TUTORIAL_INITIAL_2": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SPECIAL6:crazydave}是的，现在我们可以打破封印了。让我们疯狂吧！",
  "NARRATIVE_POWERUPS_TUTORIAL_REPEAT_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}您可以在这里免费试用您的 Power Ups！",
  "NARRATIVE_PUFFBALL_EQ_1": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}种植马勃来击晕和毒害僵尸。",
  "NARRATIVE_PUMPKIN_EQ_1": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie} 将南瓜头种植在其他植物上，以获得坚固的保护壳！",
  "NARRATIVE_PYREVINE_EQ_1": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}藤蔓是特殊植物，可以种植在其他植物之上。",
  "NARRATIVE_PYREVINE_EQ_2": "{SAY:winnie}将火焰藤种植在其他植物上，可以御寒并增强进攻火力！",
  "NARRATIVE_QUEST_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydaveicon}{NPC_ENTER:winnieicon}{EXCITED:crazydaveicon}朋朋，看！在我头顶上！",
  "NARRATIVE_QUEST_INTRO_2": "{EXCITED:crazydaveicon}这是旅行日志！",
  "NARRATIVE_QUEST_INTRO_3": "{PLAYFUL:crazydaveicon}那是什么，旅行日志？你提供指导、进步和奖励吗？事实上，",
  "NARRATIVE_QUEST_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnieicon}日志并不是用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_QUEST_INTRO_5": "{SAY:crazydaveicon}谢谢，旅行日志！随你怎么说！",
  "NARRATIVE_QUEST_LOG_AWARD_SCREEN_1": "{NPC_ENTER:winnieicon}{SAY}访问旅行日志以领取任务奖励。",
  "NARRATIVE_REINFORCEMINT_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}能量薄荷是强大的植物，你可以用宝石获得。",
