  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_CHALLENGE_MINIGAME_C_GEMJAM_1": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}恭喜你打破了我的分数。我并不苦涩。 ",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_CHALLENGE_MINIGAME_C_GEMJAM_2": "{TIRED:winnie}我不是说你作弊...骗子。",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_CHALLENGE_MINIGAME_C_GEMJAM_3": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{EXCITED:crazydave}嘿！吵够了！我们有宝石要保存！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_GIRA_WEATHER_1_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}朋朋，救命！我眼睛里进沙子了！我们在哪里？！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_GIRA_WEATHER_1_INTRO_2": "{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}请允许我插话，大卫！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_GIRA_WEATHER_1_INTRO_3": "{SAY:zombossicon}凭借我的新风暴机器的力量，我可以完全控制环境！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_GIRA_WEATHER_1_INTRO_4": "{SAY:zombossicon}在埃及，你的愚蠢植物将无法对抗沙尘暴！呜呜哈哈哈！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_GIRA_WEATHER_1_INTRO_5": "{NPC_EXIT:zombossicon}{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，我怀疑我们将不得不穿越以前的世界来关闭风暴机器。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_GIRA_WEATHER_1_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}我的计算表明它们可以影响植物或僵尸。我们必须保持警惕。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_GIRA_WEATHER_1_INTRO_7": "{SAY:crazydave}你能打开你的清洗液吗？我的眼睛需要清理一下！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_GIRA_WEATHER_4_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}草坪上那个奇怪的大东西是怎么回事？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_GIRA_WEATHER_4_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}那是巨人僵尸讲台，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_GIRA_WEATHER_4_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}我的研究告诉我陷阱瓷砖可能会从讲台上产生一个巨人僵尸。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_GIRA_WEATHER_4_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}与我们之前遇到的陷阱方块不同，植物无法触发这些陷阱方块。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_GIRA_WEATHER_4_INTRO_5": "{SAY:crazydave}等等，朋朋，植物有多重？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_GIRA_WEATHER_4_INTRO_6": "{TIRED:winnie}好吧，用户戴夫，如果你坚持的话……豌豆射手重约 6.45382 盎司。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_GIRA_WEATHER_4_INTRO_7": "{TIRED:winnie}A 向日葵为 3.34677 盎司，坚果墙s 为 10.22186 盎司，大嘴花s 为 9.44376...",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_GIRA_WEATHER_4_INTRO_8": "{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}我没有时间！我们的预算很紧张 - 行动起来吧！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_GIRA_WEATHER_8_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:crazydave}这里雾气蒙蒙，湿润又美味！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_GIRA_WEATHER_8_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}我的读数显示，由于地形迷雾，这里的僵尸不会被看见。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_GIRA_WEATHER_8_INTRO_3": "{SAY:crazydave}这个地方给了我食尸鬼和这些隐形的家伙！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_GIRA_WEATHER_8_INTRO_4": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}隐形食尸鬼！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_GIRA_WEATHER_8_INTRO_5": "{TIRED:winnie}Invisi-ghoul 不是一个词，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_GIRA_WEATHER_8_INTRO_6": "{EXCITED:crazydave}什么啊啊啊啊啊？！接下来你要告诉我“munchalicious”也不是一个词！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_GIRA_WEATHER_8_INTRO_7": "{TIRED:winnie}关于那个……",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_HERPLE_IMPPEAR_01_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:crazydave}我闻到了魔法的味道！还有一些相当不愉快的事情！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_HERPLE_IMPPEAR_01_2": "{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，这就是我们必须拯救的植物：小鬼僵尸梨。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_HERPLE_IMPPEAR_01_3": "{SAY:winnie}小鬼僵尸梨将僵尸变成小鬼僵尸。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_HERPLE_IMPPEAR_01_4": "{SAY:winnie}小鬼僵尸吃了小鬼僵尸梨会因消化不良而放出气体。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_HERPLE_IMPPEAR_01_5": "{TIRED:crazydave}我认为不新鲜的牛奶不好。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_HERPLE_IMPPEAR_01_6": "{SAY:winnie}无论如何，我们必须拯救小鬼僵尸梨作为我们的收藏品。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_HERPLE_IMPPEAR_01_7": "{TIRED:crazydave}我不会让他靠近我的冰箱。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_HERPLE_IMPPEAR_03_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{TIRED:crazydave}朋朋，梨子很多。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_HERPLE_IMPPEAR_03_2": "{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，小鬼僵尸梨子有危险。我们必须保护他们。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_HERPLE_IMPPEAR_03_3": "{SAY:winnie}我的处理器检测到这些小鬼僵尸 Pears 都位于同一类型的 Power Tile 上。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_HERPLE_IMPPEAR_03_4": "{SAY:winnie}喂食小鬼僵尸梨类植物食物会将成群的僵尸变成小鬼僵尸。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_HERPLE_IMPPEAR_03_5": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}这只会让草坪散发出奇特的气味！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_HERPLE_IMPPEAR_04_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{TIRED:crazydave}梨子就更丰富了。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_HERPLE_IMPPEAR_04_2": "{SAY:crazydave}至少他们不能让这个地方变得更臭了！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_HERPLE_IMPPEAR_04_3": "{EXCITED:winnie}我们现在有办法对抗邪恶药水了。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_HERPLE_IMPPEAR_04_4": "{EXCITED:winnie}消耗小鬼僵尸梨的强化僵尸会失去强化效果。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_HERPLE_IMPPEAR_04_5": "{EXCITED:crazydave}呵呵。也许这些小臭东西毕竟没那么坏！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_HERPLE_IMPPEAR_05_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{EXCITED:crazydave}我发现了一个全新的物种！小鬼僵尸梨子！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_HERPLE_IMPPEAR_05_2": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{TIRED:winnie}用户戴夫，这次冒险你有没有认真留意过呢？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_HERPLE_IMPPEAR_05_3": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}这些小家伙可以消灭成群的小动物！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_HERPLE_IMPPEAR_05_4": "{EXCITED:crazydave}他们非常适合对抗那些该死的squirbos。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_HERPLE_IMPPEAR_05_5": "{TIRED:winnie}用户戴夫，我不相信黑暗时代里有squirbos……",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_HERPLE_IMPPEAR_05_6": "{EXCITED:crazydave}说到那些该死的松鼠，僵尸来了！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_HERPLE_IMPPEAR_07_1": "{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}好了好了好了，看看谁又来乱动我的植物了！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_HERPLE_IMPPEAR_07_2": "{SAY:zombossicon}你真的认为小鬼僵尸梨站在你这边吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_HERPLE_IMPPEAR_07_3": "{SAY:zombossicon}看他的脸就知道了！你真的能相信小鬼僵尸的脸吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_HERPLE_IMPPEAR_07_4": "{SAY:zombossicon}弹指间就会与你为敌的特工！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_HERPLE_IMPPEAR_07_6": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{PLAYFUL:crazydave}嘿，盖老板先生，您对小鬼僵尸梨子有什么看法？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_HERPLE_IMPPEAR_07_7": "{SAY:zombossicon}我没有得到足够的报酬......",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_HERPLE_IMPPEAR_07_8": "{TIRED:crazydave}我只是问问而已！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_HERPLE_IMPPEAR_07_9": "{SAY:winnie}你的话不可信，僵王！你以前撒谎的次数太多了！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_HERPLE_IMPPEAR_07_10": "{SAY:zombossicon}哦，是这样吗？告诉我，你看到你那珍贵的僵尸梨了吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_HERPLE_IMPPEAR_07_11": "{EXCITED:crazydave}嘿，等一下。他们在哪里？他们都走了！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_HERPLE_IMPPEAR_07_12": "{SAY:zombossicon}正是如此！在此期间，您可以和这些“小鬼僵尸梨”一起玩耍！啊哈哈哈哈！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_HERPLE_IMPPEAR_07_13": "{NPC_EXIT:zombossicon}{TIRED:winnie}计算表明这些都没有意义。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_HERPLE_IMPPEAR_07_14": "{TIRED:crazydave}我才开始喜欢这个小家伙……",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_HERPLE_IMPPEAR_08_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:winnie}用户戴夫，我想我知道我们的小鬼僵尸梨出了什么事了！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_HERPLE_IMPPEAR_08_INTRO_2": "{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}啊，太好了！运营的脑子已经想通了！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_HERPLE_IMPPEAR_08_INTRO_3": "{SAY:zombossicon}我用你们的毛梨做了实验，性能有了很大的突破！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_HERPLE_IMPPEAR_08_INTRO_4": "{SAY:zombossicon}然而，在这个过程中，我创造了……一些非常糟糕的东西。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_HERPLE_IMPPEAR_08_INTRO_5": "{SAY:zombossicon}...我不想让他们出现在我的实验室里，所以我派他们来阻止你！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_HERPLE_IMPPEAR_08_INTRO_6": "{SAY:zombossicon}如果我有一个镍币用于我创建的与小鬼僵尸相关的合并......我目前有两个镍币。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_HERPLE_IMPPEAR_08_INTRO_7": "{NPC_EXIT:zombossicon}{SHOUT:crazydave}IMP梨，我的最爱！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_HERPLE_IMPPEAR_08_OUTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{TIRED:winnie}用户戴夫，你怎么这么喜欢小鬼僵尸梨呢？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_HERPLE_IMPPEAR_08_OUTRO_2": "{EXCITED:crazydave}和那些怪异的小鬼相比，什么都好！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_HERPLE_IMPPEAR_08_OUTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}我确实想避免再次面临这样的合并，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_HERPLE_IMPPEAR_08_OUTRO_4": "{SAY:crazydave}现在小鬼僵尸梨子被救了，我们可以去狩猎松鼠了！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_HERPLE_IMPPEAR_08_OUTRO_5": "{NPC_EXIT:crazydave}{NPC_EXIT:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}哦，你等着吧！我把最重要的突破留到以后再做……",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_CLASSROOM_STEP_01_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}欢迎回来，邻居！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_CLASSROOM_STEP_01_INTRO_2": "{EXCITED:crazydave}你睡了好久！",
