  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_CLASSROOM_STEP_01_INTRO_4": "{EXCITED:winnie}环球旅行者您好，别客气。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_CLASSROOM_STEP_01_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}你身上遍布着其他平行宇宙的粒子。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_CLASSROOM_STEP_01_INTRO_6": "{EXCITED:winnie}欢迎来到215宇宙，这里僵尸凶恶，植物茂盛！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_CLASSROOM_STEP_01_INTRO_7": "{EXCITED:crazydave}是的，在这个宇宙里我得到了我的炸玉米饼！",
