  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_CLASSROOM_STEP_07_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}夜幕菇：+75 阳光消耗。 (75->150)",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_CLASSROOM_STEP_07_INTRO_11": "{SAY:winnie}夜幕菇：+400 近战伤害。 (200->600)",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_CLASSROOM_STEP_07_INTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}夜幕菇：+50 射弹伤害。 (100->150)",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_CLASSROOM_STEP_07_INTRO_13": "{SAY:winnie}黄昏投手：+125 阳光消耗。 (150->275)",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_CLASSROOM_STEP_07_INTRO_14": "{SAY:winnie}黄昏投手：+10秒充电。 (10->20)",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_CLASSROOM_STEP_07_INTRO_15": "{SAY:winnie}霰弹：+100 太阳消耗。 (150->250)",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_CLASSROOM_STEP_07_INTRO_16": "{SAY:winnie}Grapeshot：+25秒充能。 (35->60)",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_CLASSROOM_STEP_07_INTRO_17": "{SAY:winnie}霰弹：-1000 点爆炸伤害。 (1800->800)",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_CLASSROOM_STEP_07_INTRO_18": "{SAY:winnie}金色绽放：不再立即充电。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_CLASSROOM_STEP_07_INTRO_19": "{SAY:winnie}金色绽放：-150 太阳输出。 (375->225)",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_CLASSROOM_STEP_07_INTRO_20": "{SAY:winnie}金色绽放：-15秒充电。 (75->60)",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_CLASSROOM_STEP_07_INTRO_21": "{EXCITED:winnie}尝试一下玩得开心！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_CLASSROOM_STEP_07_OUTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:winnie}本课程就到此结束！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_CLASSROOM_STEP_07_OUTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}你们都被吸引住了，准备好走出教室进入现实世界了！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_CLASSROOM_STEP_07_OUTRO_3": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{EXCITED:crazydave}哇！我设法逃课并逃脱了惩罚！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_CLASSROOM_STEP_07_OUTRO_4": "{EXCITED:crazydave}但至少我们这里的朋友有专业知识！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_CLASSROOM_STEP_07_OUTRO_5": "{EXCITED:winnie}我们希望您在这个宇宙中过得愉快！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_CLASSROOM_STEP_07_OUTRO_6": "{EXCITED:crazydave}再见！稍后再与您联系！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_HEROES_1_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}哇哦！看看这些僵尸，他们穿着华丽的服装！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_HEROES_1_INTRO_2": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}起床怎么了？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_HEROES_1_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}一年一度的英雄大会开始了，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_HEROES_1_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}僵尸和植物都准备装扮成他们最喜欢的英雄。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_HEROES_1_INTRO_5": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}哦！让我想起了我在丹德兰的冒险经历。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_HEROES_1_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}我能察觉到草坪另一边正在酝酿着恐怖的气息。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_HEROES_1_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}做好准备：这些角色扮演者能够抵抗寒冷效果。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_HEROES_1_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}他们太兴奋了，无法看到他们的英雄保持“冷静”，所以要保持警惕。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_HEROES_1_INTRO_9": "{EXCITED:crazydave}那些僵尸英雄！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_HEROES_1_INTRO_10": "{EXCITED:crazydave}他们是一群骗子！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_HEROES_1_INTRO_11": "{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，您可能需要保持较低的音量。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_HEROES_1_INTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}其中一些英雄可能会在大会上客串。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_HEROES_2_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}嗯？你们两个在这个可怕的事件中做什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_HEROES_2_INTRO_2": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{EXCITED:crazydave}哦，老板！你也是来索英雄签名的吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_HEROES_2_INTRO_3": "{SAY:zombossicon}呃……想想你的话，大卫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_HEROES_2_INTRO_4": "{SAY:zombossicon}我就是他们存在的理由！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_HEROES_2_INTRO_5": "{SAY:zombossicon}所有的赞美都应该归给我！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_HEROES_2_INTRO_6": "{SAY:zombossicon}为什么大家这么关心这些劣质英雄！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_HEROES_2_INTRO_7": "{SAY:zombossicon}我没有看到任何僵王服装！！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_HEROES_2_INTRO_8": "{SAY:zombossicon}我的才华确实值得如此崇拜。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_HEROES_2_INTRO_9": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{PLAYFUL:winnie}我不认为这会是一件特别令人兴奋的服装。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_HEROES_2_INTRO_10": "{SAY:zombossicon}什么！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_HEROES_2_INTRO_11": "{SAY:zombossicon}J-只要穿一件实验室外套什么的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_HEROES_2_INTRO_12": "{SAY:zombossicon}呸！我应该破坏这个活动！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_HEROES_2_INTRO_13": "{SAY:zombossicon}至于你们两个，在我制定解决方案的同时，愉快地处理这些单调的崇拜者吧！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_HEROES_2_INTRO_14": "{NPC_EXIT:zombossicon}{SAY:winnie}肯定没有什么深层次的问题。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_HEROES_5_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，我想告诉你，僵尸今天正在密谋一些特殊的事情。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_HEROES_5_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}想要模仿他们最喜欢的英雄的人正准备通过复制他们的攻击方式来模仿他们。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_HEROES_5_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}尽管如此，他们为了自己的利益而过于严格地遵守规则。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_HEROES_5_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}他们提前让我们知道他们的下一步行动。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_HEROES_5_INTRO_5": "{EXCITED:winnie}所以我们在轮到他们之前就看到了预感。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_HEROES_5_INTRO_6": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}嗯，这很好。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_HEROES_5_INTRO_7": "{EXCITED:winnie}最好利用我们的时间来计划事情！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_HEROES_6_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}这个大会要让我得动脉瘤了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_HEROES_6_INTRO_2": "{SAY:zombossicon}我复杂的计划被不公正地暂停了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_HEROES_6_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}僵尸英雄是不是不尊重你僵王？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_HEROES_6_INTRO_4": "{SAY:zombossicon}更糟糕！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_HEROES_6_INTRO_5": "{SAY:zombossicon}一直被人缠着要签名！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_HEROES_6_INTRO_6": "{SAY:zombossicon}在我恼怒的困境中，我犯了一个关键的战术失误。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_HEROES_6_INTRO_7": "{SAY:zombossicon}我...意外签署了大会“传奇草坪”锦标赛的赞助协议。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_HEROES_6_INTRO_8": "{SAY:zombossicon}现在我必须和其他怪人一起加入阴沟了......\n 看来，",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_HEROES_6_INTRO_9": "{PLAYFUL:winnie}名声确实是有代价的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_HEROES_10_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}我已经厌倦了和体臭的游戏选手交往了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_HEROES_10_INTRO_2": "{SAY:zombossicon}现在，是时候摧毁这个事件了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_HEROES_10_INTRO_3": "{SAY:zombossicon}我曾经喜欢这个想法，但它太令人厌恶了，无法继续存在！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_HEROES_10_INTRO_4": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{EXCITED:crazydave}等等，老板！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_HEROES_10_INTRO_5": "{EXCITED:crazydave}想想这里所有的植物英雄！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_HEROES_10_INTRO_6": "{EXCITED:crazydave}他们没有对你做什么！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_HEROES_10_INTRO_7": "{SAY:zombossicon}哈哈哈哈！我讨厌植物！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_HEROES_10_INTRO_8": "{EXCITED:crazydave}但是我想再次见到他们并得到一些签名！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_HEROES_10_INTRO_9": "{SAY:zombossicon}太糟糕了，大卫。恐怕你们的见面会从今天开始并结束。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_HEROES_10_INTRO_10": "{SAY:zombossicon}一个熟悉的面孔来了，他一直在寻找复仇。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_HEROES_10_INTRO_11": "{SAY:zombossicon}这一次，他又有新招了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_HEROES_10_INTRO_12": "{SAY:zombossicon}准备好让你最可怕的漫画噩梦变成现实！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_HEROES_10_INTRO_13": "{SAY:zombossicon}现在麻烦你了，我去检查一下特殊武器！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_HEROES_10_INTRO_14": "{SAY:zombossicon}我很想看看你的对手会如何利用它！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_HEROES_10_INTRO_15": "{SAY:zombossicon}特别是在他对战你们自己的平行版本失败之后！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_HEROES_10_INTRO_16": "{SAY:zombossicon}...说来话长。阅读最后一期以了解最新情况！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_HEROES_10_INTRO_17": "{SAY:zombossicon}总之，如果不是真人，你还以为他是coser呢……",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_HEROES_10_INTRO_18": "{SAY:zombossicon}但他的英雄事迹即将让你和这个可怕的事件被取消！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_HEROES_10_INTRO_19": "{SAY:zombossicon}哈哈哈哈哈哈！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_HEROES_10_INTRO_20": "{NPC_EXIT:zombossicon}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，我想提醒你Z-Mech已经回来了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_HEROES_10_INTRO_21": "{SAY:crazydave}哦，那个带着机器人的家伙？我们会没事的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_HEROES_10_INTRO_22": "{SAY:winnie}这一次，他拥有了前所未有的能力。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_HEROES_10_INTRO_23": "{SAY:winnie}而且这似乎和我之前察觉到的可怕气息有关。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_HEROES_10_INTRO_24": "{SAY:winnie}我暂时无法完全扫描它是什么，但要小心僵尸突然变化。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_FOODFIGHT_1_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SAY:crazydave}吉普车，朋朋。僵尸看起来很乱！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_FOODFIGHT_1_INTRO_2": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}但至少他们玩得很开心！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_FOODFIGHT_1_INTRO_3": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}我的扫描显示他们正在进行“食物大战”，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_FOODFIGHT_1_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}又到了一年中的这个时候，僵尸和植物都在庆祝丰盛的盛宴。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_FOODFIGHT_1_INTRO_5": "{TIRED:winnie}...通过参与互相扔食物的混乱活动。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_FOODFIGHT_1_INTRO_6": "{EXCITED:crazydave}听起来像是我的庆祝活动！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_FOODFIGHT_1_INTRO_7": "{EXCITED:crazydave}迫不及待地想加入其中，向他们扔各种东西！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_FOODFIGHT_1_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}不要让兴奋冲昏头脑，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_FOODFIGHT_1_INTRO_9": "{TIRED:winnie}我们知道发生这种情况时您的反应。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_FOODFIGHT_1_INTRO_10": "{SAY:crazydave}来吧，朋朋！如果他们甚至扔给我一个炸玉米饼怎么办？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_FOODFIGHT_1_INTRO_11": "{SAY:winnie}这里唯一能找到的墨西哥卷饼形状的物体是邪恶的墨西哥卷饼小鬼僵尸。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_FOODFIGHT_1_INTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}除了他们之外，这里所有的丧尸都已经习惯了向他们扔食物……",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_FOODFIGHT_1_INTRO_13": "{SAY:winnie}...他们对玉米投手的黄油产生了免疫力。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_FOODFIGHT_1_INTRO_14": "{EXCITED:crazydave}什么！我不会容忍对黄油的冷漠！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_FOODFIGHT_1_INTRO_15": "{EXCITED:crazydave}让我们展示给他们看，邻居！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_FOODFIGHT_2_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}哦，当然。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_FOODFIGHT_2_INTRO_2": "{SAY:zombossicon}你们三个是我在目前的困境中最不想见到的人！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_FOODFIGHT_2_INTRO_3": "{SAY:crazydave}怎么了，老板？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_FOODFIGHT_2_INTRO_4": "{SAY:crazydave}你看起来和上次一样心烦意乱，但现在眼睛酸痛。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_FOODFIGHT_2_INTRO_5": "{SAY:zombossicon}我只是遇到了困难好吗！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_FOODFIGHT_2_INTRO_6": "{PLAYFUL:winnie}我检测到高度的痛苦和嫉妒，用户戴夫。 ",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_FOODFIGHT_2_INTRO_7": "{SAY:zombossicon}你能找到摆脱这次对话的方法吗！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_FOODFIGHT_2_INTRO_8": "{SAY:zombossicon}随便吧。我要告辞了。不要跟着我！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_FOODFIGHT_2_INTRO_9": "{NPC_EXIT:zombossicon}{SAY:winnie}...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_FOODFIGHT_2_INTRO_10": "{SAY:crazydave}他今天一定过得很糟糕吧？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_FOODFIGHT_2_INTRO_11": "{SAY:winnie}我建议我们暂时别管他。我们不想像上次那样激怒他。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_FOODFIGHT_2_INTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}与此同时，更多热心的、以食物为食的僵尸即将到来。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_FOODFIGHT_4_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}朋朋，你觉得老板还好吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_FOODFIGHT_4_INTRO_2": "{SAY:crazydave}我有点担心这家伙。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_FOODFIGHT_4_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}僵王？我确信他做得很好。毕竟还有丧尸逼近。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_FOODFIGHT_4_INTRO_4": "{TIRED:winnie}但如果你是指精神上的，那么我不太确定。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_FOODFIGHT_4_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}据我观察，被逐出家族聚会的惩罚对他的精神造成了打击。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_FOODFIGHT_4_INTRO_6": "{TIRED:crazydave}可怜的家伙，首先他的假期被毁了，现在他的感恩节也被毁了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_FOODFIGHT_4_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}如果你不那么关心僵王，用户戴夫，我会更喜欢。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_FOODFIGHT_4_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}我们不要忘记他是我们的敌人。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_FOODFIGHT_4_INTRO_9": "{SAY:crazydave}呃。你只是不懂情绪，朋朋。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_FOODFIGHT_4_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}你说得有道理。尽管如此，永远不要忘记他多年来一直在危及你的生命。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_FOODFIGHT_4_INTRO_11": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}尽管外表粗糙，但老板可能只是一块酸饼干。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_FOODFIGHT_6_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}今天的食物大战涉及到了僵尸的击晕。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_FOODFIGHT_6_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}幸运的是，我们还有小鬼僵尸梨可供使用。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_FOODFIGHT_6_INTRO_3": "{TIRED:winnie}但不幸的是，这里只有释放美食气体的小鬼僵尸才能将他们击晕。所以明智地使用它们。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_FOODFIGHT_6_INTRO_4": "{TIRED:crazydave}我已经闻到一股臭味了……",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_FOODFIGHT_9_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，我收到来自未知来源的传输消息。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_FOODFIGHT_9_INTRO_2": "{EXCITED:crazydave}那就来听听吧！可能是我之前订的火鸡送货服务！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_FOODFIGHT_9_INTRO_3": "{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}我不敢相信你这个女巫竟然想在晚餐时讨论这个！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_FOODFIGHT_9_INTRO_4": "{SAY:zombossicon}千辛万苦才得到我们家的全息肉丸这就是我的感谢！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_FOODFIGHT_9_INTRO_5": "{SAY:zombossicon}“邪恶天才不是真正的工作乔治！”",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_FOODFIGHT_9_INTRO_6": "{SAY:zombossicon}“你为什么不像Zombillion呢？”",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_FOODFIGHT_9_INTRO_7": "{SAY:zombossicon}我受够了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_FOODFIGHT_9_INTRO_8": "{SAY:zombossicon}别指望我再参加晚宴了，听到了吗！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_FOODFIGHT_9_INTRO_9": "{SAY:zombossicon}别再将我与 Zombillion 进行比较！与我相比，他根本算不了什么！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_FOODFIGHT_9_INTRO_10": "{SAY:zombossicon}听到了吗！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_FOODFIGHT_9_INTRO_11": "{SAY:zombossicon}我就像披着人衣的神！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_FOODFIGHT_9_INTRO_12": "{SAY:zombossicon}闪电从指尖射出！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_FOODFIGHT_9_INTRO_13": "{SAY:zombossicon}*叹息*",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_FOODFIGHT_9_INTRO_14": "{SAY:zombossicon}我简直不敢相信他们！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_FOODFIGHT_9_INTRO_15": "{SAY:zombossicon}一切都得自己做，一如既往！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_FOODFIGHT_9_INTRO_16": "{SAY:zombossicon}呃，这个东西开着吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_FOODFIGHT_9_INTRO_17": "{NPC_EXIT:zombossicon}{SAY:crazydave}朋朋，我想老板可能需要...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_FOODFIGHT_9_INTRO_18": "{SAY:crazydave}我忘了叫什么了。他们曾经把我放在那里！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_FOODFIGHT_9_INTRO_19": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}我和一个喜欢在我说话的时候乱写乱画的人说话了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_FOODFIGHT_9_INTRO_20": "{TIRED:winnie}我不确定僵尸是否能够理解治疗的概念。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_FOODFIGHT_10_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}啊，大卫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_FOODFIGHT_10_INTRO_2": "{SAY:zombossicon}我在找沙袋！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_FOODFIGHT_10_INTRO_3": "{SAY:crazydave}是因为你缺乏“治疗”吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_FOODFIGHT_10_INTRO_4": "{SAY:crazydave}与你的家庭争论等等。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_FOODFIGHT_10_INTRO_5": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，我特意告诉你这件事要保持安静。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_FOODFIGHT_10_INTRO_6": "{SAY:crazydave}哎呀，我的错。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_FOODFIGHT_10_INTRO_7": "{SAY:zombossicon}...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_FOODFIGHT_10_INTRO_8": "{SAY:zombossicon}你什么也没听到！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_FOODFIGHT_10_INTRO_9": "{SAY:zombossicon}我们换个话题吧……",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_FOODFIGHT_10_INTRO_10": "{SAY:zombossicon}所以...足球，是吧？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_FOODFIGHT_10_INTRO_11": "{SAY:zombossicon}我不擅长这个，让我们跳到有趣的东西吧。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_FOODFIGHT_10_INTRO_12": "{SAY:zombossicon}我为你们这些白痴准备了新的人造恐怖来应对！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_FOODFIGHT_10_INTRO_13": "{SAY:zombossicon}如果我不能吃一顿快乐的感恩节大餐，我就只能做我最擅长的事了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_FOODFIGHT_10_INTRO_14": "{SAY:zombossicon}这样的打击，心情一定会好起来的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_FOODFIGHT_10_INTRO_15": "{SAY:zombossicon}发球！祝你感恩节过得不那么美好，白痴们！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_FOODFIGHT_10_INTRO_16": "{SAY:zombossicon}姆哇哈哈哈！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_FOODFIGHT_10_INTRO_17": "{NPC_EXIT:zombossicon}{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，我发现有巨大的不死生命体正在逼近。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_FOODFIGHT_10_INTRO_18": "{SAY:winnie}幸运的是，我有一个流行的短语非常适合我们即将到来的情况。 ",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_11_FOODFIGHT_10_INTRO_19": "{SAY:winnie}“尽量不要咬得太多。”",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_SPORTZBALL_1_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}朋朋，比赛日到了！ ",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_SPORTZBALL_1_INTRO_2": "{EXCITED:crazydave}这一天我等了好久了！ ",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_SPORTZBALL_1_INTRO_3": "{EXCITED:crazydave}那些朋克僵尸将再次输给 TEAM PLANTS！去植物吧！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_SPORTZBALL_1_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}希望如此，用户戴夫。看来丧尸们也为这个时刻做好了准备。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_SPORTZBALL_1_INTRO_5": "{EXCITED:crazydave}嘘！！！那些家伙糟透了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_SPORTZBALL_1_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，我相信你的不满会影响他们的团队精神。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_SPORTZBALL_1_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}这些僵尸具有强大的团队精神，无法被催眠。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_SPORTZBALL_1_INTRO_8": "{EXCITED:crazydave}公平竞争，失败者！裁判在哪里？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_SPORTZBALL_2_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}诅咒！你们三个就像一群鬼一样缠着我！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_SPORTZBALL_2_INTRO_2": "{SAY:zombossicon}你什么时候对足球感兴趣了？！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_SPORTZBALL_2_INTRO_3": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SAY:crazydave}叫做“足球”，老板。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_SPORTZBALL_2_INTRO_4": "{SAY:zombossicon}不，你这个穴居人！这就是“足球”！简单明了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_SPORTZBALL_2_INTRO_5": "{SAY:zombossicon}不管你那微薄的智力怎么想，今天僵尸队一定会夺取战利品！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_SPORTZBALL_2_INTRO_6": "{EXCITED:crazydave}不在我的手表上，老板！团队合作，共赢！！！哇哦！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_SPORTZBALL_2_INTRO_7": "{SAY:zombossicon}无知就是福，大卫。无知是福。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_SPORTZBALL_2_INTRO_8": "{SAY:zombossicon}你很快就会收回你的话。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_SPORTZBALL_2_INTRO_9": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{TIRED:winnie}你们两个之间的冲突实在是太小了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_SPORTZBALL_2_INTRO_10": "{SAY:zombossicon}可以吗，无能的机器！你无法理解巅峰体育精神！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_SPORTZBALL_2_INTRO_11": "{SAY:zombossicon}记住我的话：僵尸队将取得胜利！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_SPORTZBALL_4_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}最后一次，大卫！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_SPORTZBALL_4_INTRO_2": "{SAY:zombossicon}这叫“足球”！足球！足球只是一个幻想的概念！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_SPORTZBALL_4_INTRO_3": "{SAY:zombossicon}我不需要你在深更半夜发超过5条信息说明不然！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_SPORTZBALL_4_INTRO_4": "{TIRED:crazydave}但我总是看到它被称为足球...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_SPORTZBALL_4_INTRO_5": "{SAY:zombossicon}无论你从哪里得到那些错误的信息，那都是假的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_SPORTZBALL_4_INTRO_6": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}够了，你们两个。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_SPORTZBALL_4_INTRO_7": "{SAY:crazydave}是的，因为我们都知道它实际上叫做足球！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_SPORTZBALL_4_INTRO_8": "{SAY:zombossicon}没头脑、可怜、没文化的肉食者！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_SPORTZBALL_4_INTRO_9": "{SAY:zombossicon}不管你怎么想，僵尸队都会取得胜利！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_SPORTZBALL_4_INTRO_10": "{TIRED:winnie}你们队已经三连败了，僵王。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_SPORTZBALL_4_INTRO_11": "{SAY:zombossicon}都是误算！尽管如此，今天我们还是能取得胜利！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_SPORTZBALL_4_INTRO_12": "{SAY:crazydave}再想想，老板！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_SPORTZBALL_4_INTRO_13": "{EXCITED:crazydave}这些魅惑菇我都准备好了，彻底消磨你们队伍的士气！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_SPORTZBALL_4_INTRO_14": "{SHOUT:crazydave}呜呜！团队植物！！！团队植物！！！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_SPORTZBALL_4_INTRO_15": "{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，你没听我三天前说的话吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_SPORTZBALL_4_INTRO_16": "{SAY:winnie}这些热爱足球、热爱足球、热爱任何事情的僵尸对催眠免疫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_SPORTZBALL_4_INTRO_17": "{TIRED:crazydave}哦。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_SPORTZBALL_4_INTRO_18": "{SAY:zombossicon}你真是个白痴！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_SPORTZBALL_4_INTRO_19": "{SAY:zombossicon}考虑这些植物濒临灭绝！我们会把这些无用的蘑菇当作我们的战利品！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_SPORTZBALL_4_INTRO_20": "{SAY:zombossicon}前进，僵尸队！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_SPORTZBALL_7_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}哇哦！这可是很多全明星啊！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_SPORTZBALL_7_INTRO_2": "{SHOUT:crazydave}嘘！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_SPORTZBALL_7_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}确实如此。我的扫描显示大量熟练的全明星僵尸正在接近。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_SPORTZBALL_7_INTRO_4": "{EXCITED:crazydave}好吧，反正无所谓了。去团队植物吧！呜呜！！！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_SPORTZBALL_7_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}不幸的是，我们的种子包储备一夜之间突然耗尽。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_SPORTZBALL_7_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}部分工厂目前库存为零。一定是有人在背后搞事的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_SPORTZBALL_7_INTRO_7": "{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}正是如此！那道隐形射线给我带来了奇迹！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_SPORTZBALL_7_INTRO_8": "{SAY:zombossicon}让我们看看你可悲的植物队如何对抗这些高手！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_SPORTZBALL_7_INTRO_9": "{EXCITED:crazydave}这是犯规，老板！嘘！给这个家伙一张红牌！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_SPORTZBALL_7_INTRO_10": "{SAY:zombossicon}哦，去哭吧，大卫！僵尸队必胜！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_SPORTZBALL_10_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}都到这里了，朋朋！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_SPORTZBALL_10_INTRO_2": "{EXCITED:crazydave}9 场胜利，再赢一场，植物队将横扫一切！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_SPORTZBALL_10_INTRO_3": "{SHOUT:crazydave}团队植物！！！去，去团队植物！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_SPORTZBALL_10_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}很佩服你对这项运动的热情，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_SPORTZBALL_10_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}但我们今天必须坚守阵地。僵王正在为剩下的选手做最后一轮的准备。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_SPORTZBALL_10_INTRO_6": "{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}你是正确的，暂时的对手。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_SPORTZBALL_10_INTRO_7": "{SAY:zombossicon}这整个来回让我厌倦了整个运动！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_SPORTZBALL_10_INTRO_8": "{SAY:zombossicon}我对它的喜爱度减少了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_SPORTZBALL_10_INTRO_9": "{SAY:zombossicon}下次你想破坏我的游戏时，至少要有礼貌！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_SPORTZBALL_10_INTRO_10": "{SAY:zombossicon}呸，这个没用！无论如何，我应该更明智地利用我的空闲时间。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_SPORTZBALL_10_INTRO_11": "{SAY:zombossicon}我必须为下次准备一些特别的东西。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_SPORTZBALL_10_INTRO_12": "{SAY:zombossicon}与此同时，对剩下的足球运动员做任何你想做的事。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_SPORTZBALL_10_INTRO_13": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}你是说足球运动员吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_SPORTZBALL_10_INTRO_14": "{SAY:zombossicon}安静，大卫！尽可能多地投入到这项毫无意义的运动中。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_SPORTZBALL_10_INTRO_15": "{SAY:zombossicon}同时，我会忠于我的热情！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_SPORTZBALL_10_INTRO_16": "{SAY:zombossicon}很快，我就会用黑暗笼罩你们的庆祝活动！趁还可以的时候享受游戏吧！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_1_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}朋朋，时间到了！这是一年中最美好的时光！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_1_INTRO_2": "{EXCITED:winnie}而且这次不是僵王做的。节日快乐，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_1_INTRO_3": "{EXCITED:crazydave}谢谢，朋朋！你认为今年圣诞老人会来拜访我们吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_1_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}我没有具体的资料证明这个“圣诞老人”的存在。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_1_INTRO_5": "{TIRED:crazydave}你为什么要这么冷朋朋？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_1_INTRO_6": "{SAY:crazydave}此外，我知道他是真实的。他拥有一大批追随者。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_1_INTRO_7": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}提示：他们不喜欢你试图将它们暴露在购物中心周围。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_1_INTRO_8": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}我想知道僵尸会对此做什么。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_1_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}从统计上看，他们只会像往常一样争夺我们的大脑。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_1_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}不过，每年的这个时候僵尸都足够快乐来抵抗寒冷的影响。保持警惕。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_3_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}喂，等一下。其他僵尸在这里做什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_3_INTRO_2": "{SAY:crazydave}别告诉我他们会给我熔炉和喷气背包作为礼物！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_3_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}看来来自其他时代的僵尸也来参加庆祝活动了。 ",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_3_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}还有一群钢琴家为这个场合盛装打扮并改变曲调。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_3_INTRO_5": "{SAY:crazydave}哦！他们可能想救赎自己并尝试进入圣诞老人的美好名单！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_3_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}这是假期真正开始的时候，用户戴夫。准备好迎接更多的突然袭击。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_4_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SAY:crazydave}Brrr... 邻居，这么晚了我们在做什么呢？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_4_INTRO_2": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我的锅不够冷！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_4_INTRO_3": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}僵尸，用户戴夫。即使在夜间，他们也渴望你的大脑。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_4_INTRO_4": "{TIRED:crazydave}哦，真糟糕。一整天都在努力追赶商场里的圣诞老人，我以为我可以睡一会儿了……",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_8_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}节日快乐，你们这些白痴！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_8_INTRO_2": "{SAY:zombossicon}希望你们今天都过得愉快盛宴节。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_8_INTRO_3": "{SAY:zombossicon}因为我是来破坏你心情的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_8_INTRO_4": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SAY:crazydave}你在说什么，老板？你终于得到了你一直想要的假期！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_8_INTRO_5": "{SAY:crazydave}你不想和你的僵尸伙伴一起出去玩吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_8_INTRO_6": "{SAY:zombossicon}闭嘴，大卫！你只是不明白！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_8_INTRO_7": "{SAY:zombossicon}我想要一个我赢得的假期，而不是一个我等待的假期！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_8_INTRO_8": "{SAY:zombossicon}而且你们三个一年到头都缠着我……",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_8_INTRO_9": "{SAY:zombossicon}我很乐意为你毁掉这个所谓的“一年中最美好的时光”。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_8_INTRO_10": "{SAY:zombossicon}这是我的盛宴节礼物！姆瓦哈哈哈！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_8_INTRO_11": "{NPC_EXIT:zombossicon}{TIRED:crazydave}猜猜老板还在圣诞老人的顽皮名单上......",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_9_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:winnie}正好赶上假期，冬青屏障已经到了。他们将浆果运送到您选择的地方。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_9_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}落地后，浆果会轻微击退，并继续充当墙壁，对附近的僵尸造成伤害。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_9_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}但是要明智地开火，因为他们的弹药有限。弹药只能通过使用植物性食物或强化胡萝卜来补充。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_9_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}强化胡萝卜仅对冬青屏障本身有效。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_9_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}用在它的叶子上不会有任何结果，浪费了强化胡萝卜。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_9_INTRO_6": "{NPC_EXIT:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SAY:crazydave}僵尸怎么能吃这些呢……",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_9_INTRO_7": "{EXCITED:crazydave}但是当我这么做的时候我就“有危险”并且“需要去医院！”",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_12_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}毁了我的乐趣之后你还敢享受节日气氛吗！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_12_INTRO_2": "{SAY:zombossicon}你享受所有的节日欢乐，但过去却不允许我！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_12_INTRO_3": "{SAY:zombossicon}别骗我，我知道！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_12_INTRO_4": "{SAY:zombossicon}我一直在看着你对抗我的僵尸，看起来你确实玩得很开心！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_12_INTRO_5": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SAY:crazydave}你一直在看着我们吗老板？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_12_INTRO_6": "{SAY:zombossicon}是的！嗯...不喜欢，一直...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_12_INTRO_7": "{SAY:zombossicon}假期我也有爱好！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_12_INTRO_8": "{SAY:zombossicon}我当然有一个聚会要参加！还有无数的客人！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_12_INTRO_9": "{SAY:zombossicon}包括我亲爱的家人，他们非常喜欢我的存在！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_12_INTRO_10": "{SAY:crazydave}哦...好吧，我没有听到任何背景音乐或任何东西。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_12_INTRO_11": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}僵王，你不是派了你的家人去打架吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_12_INTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}我的扫描仪没有显示信号上有任何派对或欢乐气氛的迹象。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_12_INTRO_13": "{SAY:zombossicon}...（静电声听起来可疑，就像对着麦克风吹气）...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_12_INTRO_14": "{SAY:zombossicon}噢不！信号断了，我听不到哟！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_15_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}朋朋，你觉得今年我们上好名单了吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_15_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}无视这个所谓“圣诞老人”的合法性，我们阻止了许多僵尸的入侵。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_15_INTRO_3": "{EXCITED:winnie}我相信我们完全有资格胜任这些职位。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_15_INTRO_4": "{SAY:crazydave}我想这意味着老板先生完全在淘气名单上吧？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_15_INTRO_5": "{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}完全正确，我无知的快乐对手！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_15_INTRO_6": "{SAY:crazydave}你不想出现在好名单上吗？想想所有很酷的礼物！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_15_INTRO_7": "{SAY:zombossicon}呸！多么陈词滥调。正如您对我的期望，我有一个更加出色的行动方针。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_15_INTRO_8": "{SAY:zombossicon}那个快乐的胖子每年除了煤炭什么也不给我！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_15_INTRO_9": "{SAY:zombossicon}我有一卡车的这些东西，所以我已经安排将它们全部运送到您的场所。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_15_INTRO_10": "{SAY:zombossicon}享受铃儿响叮当！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_15_INTRO_11": "{NPC_EXIT:zombossicon}{EXCITED:crazydave}天上下煤雨的噩梦要成真了！！！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_15_INTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}让您放心，这些煤炭运输来自即将到来的暴风雪。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_15_INTRO_13": "{SAY:winnie}密集胡萝卜将协助我们应对这突如其来的煤炭袭击。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_18_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，我想分享一些坏消息。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_18_INTRO_2": "{SAY:crazydave}朋朋是什么？针对圣诞老人头像的反抗开始了吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_18_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}我们的攻击性植物种子包供应量已经非常低。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_18_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}我们也需要一段时间才能稳定供应。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_18_INTRO_5": "{SAY:crazydave}哦，那你就可以通过特快专递来送那些家伙了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_18_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}不幸的是，这不再可能了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_18_INTRO_7": "{TIRED:winnie}具体是因为有人打雪仗过度堵塞了传送带。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_18_INTRO_8": "{EXCITED:crazydave}嘿！我必须把那些假圣诞老人打倒！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_18_INTRO_9": "{EXCITED:crazydave}他们的假胡子飞走了！太光荣了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_18_INTRO_10": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}任务结束后，我将成为新的圣诞老人团长！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_23_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}你们这些白痴真是难灭啊。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_23_INTRO_2": "{SAY:zombossicon}日日夜夜，你和你那些劣质的、有毒的灌木仍然是最上面的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_23_INTRO_3": "{SAY:zombossicon}我厌倦了输给这些微不足道的有机杂草！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_23_INTRO_4": "{SAY:zombossicon}我会确保我应该出现在顽皮名单上，你听到我了吗大卫？！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_23_INTRO_5": "{SAY:zombossicon}今晚，我将开始策划一份精彩的盛宴节礼物，只为你准备！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_23_INTRO_6": "{SAY:zombossicon}我相信你们都会惊掉下巴......害怕！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_23_INTRO_7": "{NPC_EXIT:zombossicon}{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SAY:crazydave}呃，什么？我刚刚喝完热巧克力。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_24_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}果然，你们都还在踢。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_24_INTRO_2": "{SAY:zombossicon}你们三个人太吵闹，太烦人了，对你们的节日欢呼声非常恼火！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_24_INTRO_3": "{SAY:zombossicon}如果你们三个选的话，我选晕船的鳄鱼！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_24_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}僵王，你对用户戴夫和他的邻居的仇恨已经到了无法估量的卑鄙程度。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_24_INTRO_5": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SAY:crazydave}哦，你太值得进入调皮名单了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_24_INTRO_6": "{SAY:crazydave}你太卑鄙了老板先生！你真的不知道什么感觉！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_24_INTRO_7": "{SAY:crazydave}你对仙人掌太刻薄了，老板先生你就像香蕉皮一样滑！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_24_INTRO_8": "{SAY:zombossicon}押韵与推理没有关联！虽然我受宠若惊。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_24_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}该信息事实上是正确的。你表现得很糟糕。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_24_INTRO_10": "{SAY:zombossicon}哦，我不想听，穿越居！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_24_INTRO_11": "{SAY:zombossicon}节庆串烧倡议的残余今晚可能会有一些用处......",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_24_INTRO_12": "{SAY:zombossicon}这是我在彻底编造明天你的领地将会发生什么之前的最后一个警告。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_24_INTRO_13": "{SAY:zombossicon}你的节日快乐将会减弱和消亡，因为我不是罪孽深重的酒鬼之王！ ",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_24_INTRO_14": "{SAY:zombossicon}还有最后的盛宴节愿望吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_24_INTRO_15": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}再来一份里面有华夫饼的炸玉米饼怎么样？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_24_INTRO_16": "{EXCITED:crazydave}嗯……我还能感觉到余味。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_24_INTRO_17": "{SAY:zombossicon}恶心！那是很久以前的事了，大卫！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_24_INTRO_18": "{SAY:zombossicon}呸！我先告辞了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_24_INTRO_19": "{SAY:zombossicon}观看各种假期的到来，并提醒您自己袭击了多少人！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_24_INTRO_20": "{NPC_EXIT:zombossicon}{SAY:winnie}警告，用户戴夫。我发现今晚有大量僵尸逼近。这并不容易。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_25_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}就是这样！我和你们三个已经受够了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_25_INTRO_2": "{SAY:zombossicon}今年真是充满了一堆麻烦！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_25_INTRO_3": "{SAY:zombossicon}在屋顶上的那场战斗之后我开始重新考虑是否要再次去砍你的大脑了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_25_INTRO_4": "{SAY:zombossicon}但是现在，我不再退缩了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_25_INTRO_5": "{SAY:zombossicon}你想吃一些美味的东西，对吧，大卫？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_25_INTRO_6": "{SAY:zombossicon}现在就去把这个吃掉吧！因为你们都在享受美食！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_25_INTRO_7": "{SAY:zombossicon}快乐。假期。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_25_INTRO_8": "{NPC_EXIT:zombossicon}{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}朋朋，您是否发现附近有一个巨大的炸玉米饼或什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_25_INTRO_9": "{EXCITED:crazydave}主要圣诞老人的机器人版本怎么样？那真是太酷了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_25_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}负。相反，它是……另一个蛋糕？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_25_INTRO_11": "{SAY:crazydave}蛋糕？我已经吃了那么多糖了，我想我要吐了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_25_INTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}即便如此，我还是发现上述蛋糕的不可信度很高。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_25_INTRO_13": "{SAY:winnie}放心，这美味可能是僵王又一个烂主意。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2023_12_FEASTIVUS_25_INTRO_14": "{SAY:winnie}一个特别美妙但糟糕的主意。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_1_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:crazydave}朋朋，我们回来做什么？！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_1_INTRO_2": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}我不久前已经拿到了我的炸玉米饼，现在我能做的就是把脚浸入附近的流沙中！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_1_INTRO_3": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}你应该找个时间尝试一下，朋朋！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_1_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}我无法进行与脚相关的活动，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_1_INTRO_5": "{PLAYFUL:winnie}快速提醒：我缺脚。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_1_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}由于最近颞震的峰值，我们重新访问了这个位置。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_1_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}从我的扫描仪收集到的信息来看，它们不仅发生在这里，而且也发生在我们访问过的其他时间段。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_1_INTRO_8": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}也许是侏儒......",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_1_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}被称为“侏儒”的神话生物实际上并不存在。他们来自民间传说。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_1_INTRO_10": "{SAY:crazydave}也许你是对的。那会是什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_1_INTRO_11": "{SAY:winnie}我将扫描周围。与此同时，请抵御即将到来的僵尸大军。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_2_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SAY:crazydave}现在我们回到这里了吗？哎呀，我想念海水和海盗汗水的味道......",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_2_INTRO_2": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，我的传感器已经查明正在发生的事情。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_2_INTRO_3": "{SAY:crazydave}等等，朋朋，等等……",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_2_INTRO_4": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我手机刚刚收到一条消息说我中了抽奖大奖！！！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_2_INTRO_5": "{EXCITED:crazydave}他们指示我发送您的加密密钥来兑换它！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_2_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，你从来没有参加过抽奖吧？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_2_INTRO_7": "{SAY:crazydave}我不记得了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_2_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}那么请不要考虑回复该消息。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_2_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}即使有，听起来也非常可疑。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_2_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}无论如何，我的扫描还得到了一些其他有趣的结果。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_2_INTRO_11": "{SAY:winnie}僵企股份有限公司，僵王过去合作过的僵尸企业……",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_2_INTRO_12": "{TIRED:winnie}……回来了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_2_INTRO_13": "{SAY:winnie}而且他们最近似乎开始“入侵”各个时间点来为新产品做广告。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_2_INTRO_14": "{SAY:winnie}现在，他们把目光投向了海盗港湾。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_2_INTRO_15": "{SAY:winnie}他们可能会瞄准我们之前访问过的其余时代。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_2_INTRO_16": "{SAY:winnie}如果再这样下去，可能会导致时空再次不稳定。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_2_INTRO_17": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}所以...又是一个普通的星期二？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_2_INTRO_18": "{SAY:winnie}大约。我们必须不断追踪他们并确保他们不会做出任何危险的事情。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_5_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:crazydave}朋朋！我的电脑最近变得“咕咕”疯了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_5_INTRO_2": "{EXCITED:crazydave}但我也疯了！！！ ",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_5_INTRO_3": "{EXCITED:crazydave}这里只能容纳一个疯子！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_5_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，你能详细说明一下在这件事发生之前你到底点击了什么吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_5_INTRO_5": "{TIRED:crazydave}呃呃呃呃……",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_5_INTRO_6": "{TIRED:crazydave}一些奇怪的弹出窗口出现......",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_5_INTRO_7": "{EXCITED:crazydave}其中一个甚至展示了它可以让我的葫芦在短短几天内生长得有多快！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_5_INTRO_8": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我无法抗拒！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_5_INTRO_9": "{TIRED:winnie}我的失望值达到了5位整数。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_5_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，我们这里面对的是企业代理人，他们很可能也擅长诈骗。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_5_INTRO_11": "{SAY:winnie}您的桌面设备可能非常不安全。我建议暂时不要使用它。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_5_INTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}此外，我的加密密钥是否存储在那里？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_5_INTRO_13": "{TIRED:crazydave}是的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_5_INTRO_14": "{TIRED:winnie}... *bzzt*",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_5_INTRO_15": "{SAY:crazydave}呃，不用担心。我只会请这个“广告拦截器”家伙帮我解决这个问题。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_5_INTRO_16": "{EXCITED:crazydave}互联网告诉我他们做这种事真的很可靠，所以让我给他们打电话吧！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_5_INTRO_17": "{EXCITED:winnie}所有产品90％折扣！立即购买！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_7_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}您是否想过如何处理拥挤的草坪？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_7_INTRO_2": "{PLAYFUL:winnie}曾经希望您有更好的解决方案吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_7_INTRO_3": "{EXCITED:winnie}好吧，别再犹豫了，帮助台工作组来拯救世界！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_7_INTRO_4": "{EXCITED:winnie}需要一些杂草被烧得面目全非吗？服务台将立即完成它！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_7_INTRO_5": "{EXCITED:winnie}服务台工作组！以 5600 Zombucks 的低低实惠价格出租！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_7_INTRO_6": "{EXCITED:winnie}立即致电即可获得最新聘用特遣队的 80% 折扣！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_7_INTRO_7": "{EXCITED:winnie}只需发送您信用卡后面的号码，我们就会开始做生意！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_7_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}僵企 Incorporated 对任何旁观者、财产或其他个人造成的任何损害概不负责。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_7_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}建议观众酌情决定。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_7_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}如果症状持续，请咨询我们的顾问。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_7_INTRO_11": "{EXCITED:crazydave}这是个好主意，朋朋！我现在就给他们打电话！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_7_INTRO_12": "{EXCITED:crazydave}广告拦截者必须等待！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_12_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{TIRED:crazydave}邻居，看来又只有我们两个了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_12_INTRO_2": "{EXCITED:crazydave}朋朋被僵企伙计们接管了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_12_INTRO_3": "{EXCITED:crazydave}那些该死的服务台给了我一个快速的帮助！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_12_INTRO_4": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}告诉你，我们可以带走他们。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_12_INTRO_5": "{SAY:crazydave}你击退僵尸，我会尽力拯救朋朋！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_12_INTRO_6": "{EXCITED:crazydave}你已经得到了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_13_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:crazydave}嘿朋朋！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_13_INTRO_2": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我们一直在做的时间跳跃让我头晕了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_13_INTRO_3": "{EXCITED:winnie}因为不断的时间旅行而感到恶心？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_13_INTRO_4": "{EXCITED:winnie}需要一些东西来缓解疼痛吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_13_INTRO_5": "{EXCITED:winnie}不用担心，ZCure 来拯救世界！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_13_INTRO_6": "{EXCITED:winnie}它不仅可以治疗恶心，还可以治疗几乎任何疾病！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_13_INTRO_7": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}有什么病吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_13_INTRO_8": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}僵尸主义呢？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_13_INTRO_9": "{EXCITED:winnie}“僵尸主义”在僵企目录中不被视为合法疾病！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_13_INTRO_10": "{EXCITED:crazydave}为什么不呢？它疯狂地传播！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_13_INTRO_11": "{TIRED:winnie}因为呜呜呜……",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_13_INTRO_12": "{EXCITED:winnie}因为我们不是僵尸！因此我们不需要它！你也没有！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_13_INTRO_13": "{EXCITED:crazydave}但是我和我的邻居都是人类！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_13_INTRO_14": "{TIRED:winnie}呜呜呜……",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_13_INTRO_15": "{EXCITED:winnie}可恶！马克，他们来找我们了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_13_INTRO_16": "{TIRED:winnie}... *bzzt*",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_13_INTRO_17": "{TIRED:winnie}发生了什么事，用户戴夫？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_13_INTRO_18": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我们开始了！问题解决了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_13_INTRO_19": "{TIRED:winnie}... *bzzt*",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_13_INTRO_20": "{EXCITED:winnie}你没那么容易摆脱我们，bucko！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_13_INTRO_21": "{EXCITED:winnie}你知道的太多了！你的朋友也一样！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_13_INTRO_22": "{EXCITED:winnie}对于这种情况我们有特殊的程序！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_13_INTRO_23": "{EXCITED:winnie}预计明天会收到不愉快的包裹！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_13_INTRO_24": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我们激怒了他们，邻居！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_13_INTRO_25": "{EXCITED:crazydave}快到了，我们马上就能拯救朋朋！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_15_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SAY:crazydave}邻居，我们准备好了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_15_INTRO_2": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我们已经激怒了僵企发动全面攻击！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_15_INTRO_3": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:crazydave}来吧僵企，向我们展示你最糟糕的一面！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_15_INTRO_4": "{EXCITED:winnie}你不会带我们出去的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_15_INTRO_5": "{EXCITED:winnie}我们的律师对你来说太残酷了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_15_INTRO_6": "{EXCITED:winnie}我们已经向您发送了实际的停止令。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_15_INTRO_7": "{EXCITED:winnie}准备好在战斗中面对我们最新改进的产品！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_15_INTRO_8": "{EXCITED:winnie}经过多次战斗，战区多次失败……",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_15_INTRO_9": "{EXCITED:winnie}我们敬爱的英雄在歪植物手中经历了各种磨难！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_15_INTRO_10": "{EXCITED:winnie}但是现在，他回来了，比以往任何时候都更强大！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_15_INTRO_11": "{EXCITED:winnie}介绍，Z-Mech 2.0！！！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_15_INTRO_12": "{EXCITED:winnie}凭借先进的科技进步，他已经准备好再次踏上战场！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_15_INTRO_13": "{TIRED:winnie}由僵企公司的天才头脑增强 - *bzzt* - 和伟大的埃德加博士僵王！ *嗡嗡声*",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_15_INTRO_14": "{EXCITED:winnie}首次购买仅需 12000 Zombucks 即可获得一台破坏性机器！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_15_INTRO_15": "{TIRED:winnie}*bzzt* 原型变体为 400！ *嗡嗡声*",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_15_INTRO_16": "{TIRED:winnie}该课程被评为 T 级，适合所有年龄段。观众方向-",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_15_INTRO_17": "{NPC_EXIT:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}Z-Mech又来了一轮复仇。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_15_INTRO_18": "{EXCITED:crazydave}打败这个小丑后我们就能拯救朋朋了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_15_INTRO_19": "{EXCITED:crazydave}一旦我们搞砸了，他们的广告就没有利润了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_15_INTRO_20": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我会趁机重启朋朋，摆脱她的影响！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_01_ZCORP_15_INTRO_21": "{EXCITED:crazydave}来吧邻居，我们有这个！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_1_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}哇男孩，看那些烟花都放了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_1_INTRO_2": "{SAY:crazydave}让我想起了我的硝酸甘油收藏。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_1_INTRO_3": "{SAY:crazydave}但是等等...我很困惑，新年不是已经一个月前了吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_1_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}正确，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_1_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}然而，中国文化采用与西方世界不同的历法系统。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_1_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}因此他们庆祝新年的到来比大多数人晚一点。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_1_INTRO_7": "{TIRED:crazydave}哦。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_1_INTRO_8": "{SAY:crazydave}等等，这是否意味着僵尸是中国人？他们为什么要庆祝这个？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_1_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}数据不足，无法制定响应。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_1_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}基于数据的假设：他们根本不关心传统属于哪种文化。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_1_INTRO_11": "{SAY:winnie}反正这也不重要，他们只对我们的大脑皮层感兴趣。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_1_INTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}而且我的传感器检测到这些僵尸具有独特的属性，就像其他节日僵尸一样。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_1_INTRO_13": "{SAY:winnie}在这种情况下，他们对火焰攻击免疫50%。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_1_INTRO_14": "{TIRED:winnie}所以很遗憾，你种下的南瓜灯不会有什么结果，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_1_INTRO_15": "{SAY:crazydave}等等，是吗？我可以发誓我早些时候把椅子放在那里了......",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_2_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}新年快乐，笨蛋！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_2_INTRO_2": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{EXCITED:crazydave}老板，你在说什么？！已经一个多月了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_2_INTRO_3": "{SAY:zombossicon}安静！这次活动意义重大！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_2_INTRO_4": "{SAY:zombossicon}你没听说过吗！？这是中国新年！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_2_INTRO_5": "{SAY:zombossicon}我会找任何借口来庆祝我能做到！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_2_INTRO_6": "{SAY:zombossicon}然而，我的庆祝活动因不幸的消息而停止。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_2_INTRO_7": "{SAY:zombossicon}我想你很熟悉“幸运饼干”的概念。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_2_INTRO_8": "{SAY:zombossicon}一个有趣的活动和有营养的零食，对吧？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_2_INTRO_9": "{SAY:zombossicon}错！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_2_INTRO_10": "{SAY:zombossicon}其中一件该死的事情向我揭示了一些可怕的事情。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_2_INTRO_11": "{SAY:zombossicon}我的命运决定我不久的将来会被咬！不是别人，正是随机的生物！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_2_INTRO_12": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{TIRED:winnie}你相信这个吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_2_INTRO_13": "{SAY:zombossicon}我为什么不应该？！自从我瞄准你的大脑以来，我的运气就很糟糕！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_2_INTRO_14": "{SAY:zombossicon}如果这不是一个标志我会感到惊讶！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_2_INTRO_15": "{SAY:zombossicon}不管怎样，我把我所有的动物性赖账都转发给你了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_2_INTRO_16": "{SAY:zombossicon}你要么帮我照顾它们，要么你就是被咬的人！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_2_INTRO_17": "{SAY:zombossicon}噗哈哈哈哈哈！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_2_INTRO_18": "{SAY:zombossicon}有时候我的天才甚至让我自己都印象深刻。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_5_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}那些是一些看起来很奇怪的烟花。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_5_INTRO_2": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}让我想起小时候我存放在地下室的炸弹。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_5_INTRO_3": "{TIRED:winnie}用户戴夫，你完全忘记太阳炸弹的存在了吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_5_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}还记得阳光偶尔会变得高度不稳定和放射性并导致爆炸吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_5_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}这是其中之一。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_5_INTRO_6": "{SAY:crazydave}哦，对不起！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_5_INTRO_7": "{EXCITED:crazydave}只是我已经看了好几天那些华丽的烟花了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_5_INTRO_8": "{EXCITED:crazydave}邻居，一看到他们就一定要让他们打卡POW！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_5_INTRO_9": "{EXCITED:crazydave}不辜负新年的真意！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_6_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}你看一下吗！晚上的烟花比白天好看多了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_6_INTRO_2": "{TIRED:crazydave}等等，我们不应该这么晚才出来。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_6_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，很遗憾地通知您，从现在开始，僵尸将在夜间向我们逼近。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_6_INTRO_4": "{EXCITED:crazydave}哦，听起来不错！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_6_INTRO_5": "{EXCITED:crazydave}现在我多了一个看烟花的理由了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_6_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}然而，那些花距离草坪的僵尸一侧非常近。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_6_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}尝试坚持使用这些植物，因为这次僵尸群似乎特别不那么聪明。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_9_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}该死！我的部队里还有多少以动物为原型的僵尸？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_9_INTRO_2": "{SAY:zombossicon}我一直像暴风雨一样把它们送到你的草坪上，但它们就是没有跑完！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_9_INTRO_3": "{SAY:zombossicon}这工作量太大，无法避免被咬，但我现在已经无法停下来了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_9_INTRO_4": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}你为什么不穿越到没有动物僵尸的时代呢？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_9_INTRO_5": "{SAY:zombossicon}如果这么简单的话我早就这么做了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_9_INTRO_6": "{SAY:zombossicon}小动物会以某种方式跟随我......",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_9_INTRO_7": "{SAY:zombossicon}我必须彻底执行我的计划！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_9_INTRO_8": "{SAY:zombossicon}这包括扰乱你的植物储备！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_9_INTRO_9": "{NPC_EXIT:zombossicon}{SAY:winnie}扫描中...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_9_INTRO_10": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，我的扫描仪检测到我们的植物储备有异常变化。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_9_INTRO_11": "{SAY:winnie}看来今晚只能使用带有火力的攻击性植物了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_9_INTRO_12": "{EXCITED:crazydave}还有烟花？！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_9_INTRO_13": "{SAY:winnie}如果你一定要这样看，用户戴夫，那么确实如此。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_9_INTRO_14": "{SAY:winnie}我们必须找到一种方法来妥善处理不利植物的传入威胁。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_10_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}我已经5天没有睡觉了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_10_INTRO_2": "{SAY:zombossicon}但我做到了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_10_INTRO_3": "{SAY:zombossicon}我想我的部队里已经没有能够咬人的生物了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_10_INTRO_4": "{SAY:zombossicon}现在只剩下不同时间段的了……",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_10_INTRO_5": "{SAY:zombossicon}为了照顾他们，我今天在你的草坪上打开传送门！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_10_INTRO_6": "{SAY:zombossicon}帮我和我处理最后一批-",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_10_INTRO_7": "{SAY:zombossicon}哎呀！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_10_INTRO_8": "{SAY:zombossicon}天哪%!?$ #*!& #%$%!!#??",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_10_INTRO_9": "{SAY:zombossicon}你%!$#!$害虫#$#!$%!?$# 和$%!%$?%$?!!!",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_10_INTRO_10": "{SAY:zombossicon}*砰*",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_10_INTRO_11": "{SAY:zombossicon}我的实验室里有一只黄鼠狼，我重复一遍，有-",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_10_INTRO_12": "{SAY:zombossicon}*砰*",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_10_INTRO_13": "{SAY:zombossicon}*难以理解*",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_10_INTRO_14": "{SAY:zombossicon}我的脚-",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_10_INTRO_15": "{SAY:zombossicon}*白噪声*",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_10_INTRO_16": "{NPC_EXIT:zombossicon}{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，我检测到大量的传送门涌入。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_10_INTRO_17": "{SAY:winnie}挤满了各种动物僵尸。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_10_INTRO_18": "{SAY:winnie}小心前进，因为今晚会有各种动物进来。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_10_INTRO_19": "{EXCITED:crazydave}黄鼠狼、恐龙、鸡、渡渡鸟，天哪！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_10_INTRO_20": "{EXCITED:crazydave}他们已经做好了击败对手的准备，正好赶上新年！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_10_INTRO_21": "{SAY:crazydave}好吧，邻居。让我们向这些僵尸展示一下新年的精神吧！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_10_INTRO_22": "{SAY:crazydave}至少是农历新年。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_1_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}朋朋，今天我的鞋柜里有一些巧克力。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_1_INTRO_2": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}你猜猜这是谁的？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_1_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}扫描中......",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_1_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}扫描显示这些巧克力有 100.1% 的可能性具有僵尸相邻来源，误差范围为 0.1%。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_1_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}消费此类产品是不明智的。即使它证明是季节性的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_1_INTRO_6": "{SAY:crazydave}坚果。又一批有毒的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_1_INTRO_7": "{SAY:crazydave}在这里我想我已经引起了一些秘密崇拜者的注意。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_1_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}该说法在某种程度上可能仍然正确，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_1_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}你看，你最近确实引起了一些关注。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_1_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}来自僵尸，就是这样。这就是为什么我怀疑你家前草坪上目前有一支军队。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_1_INTRO_11": "{EXCITED:crazydave}他们就是听不懂暗示，不是吗？他们不断向我示好！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_1_INTRO_12": "{TIRED:winnie}是的，他们确实如此。但我需要提醒你，他们是在字面意义上这样做的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_1_INTRO_13": "{SAY:winnie}他们正在慢慢靠近你的家门口。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_1_INTRO_14": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}对不起，邻居！但你能帮我拒绝这些丧尸吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_1_INTRO_15": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}我只是还没有准备好接受这种承诺。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_3_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}嘎啊！这个假期真是一场噩梦！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_3_INTRO_2": "{SAY:crazydave}但这是一个庆祝爱情的节日，老板！这不是一件好事吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_3_INTRO_3": "{SAY:zombossicon}爱只是一种迫使哺乳动物繁殖的化学反应！沉迷其中就是浪费时间！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_3_INTRO_4": "{SAY:zombossicon}如果有什么不同的话，那就是它会影响生产力！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_3_INTRO_5": "{SAY:zombossicon}我的僵尸没有工作，而是在徒劳的追求这种“爱”中迷失了自己！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_3_INTRO_6": "{SAY:zombossicon}他们在一起度过时光，分享礼物，唱着令人作呕的愚蠢歌曲！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_3_INTRO_7": "{SAY:zombossicon}他们应该做的就是为了我的利益而盲目地陷入危险！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_3_INTRO_8": "{SAY:zombossicon}这些行为简直不合逻辑且愚蠢！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_3_INTRO_9": "{SAY:zombossicon}看看他们参与了这场大规模的偏执。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_3_INTRO_10": "{SAY:zombossicon}像羊一样！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_3_INTRO_11": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}好吧，爱情会让你做蠢事。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_3_INTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}您来这里只是为了抱怨你们的员工效率低下吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_3_INTRO_13": "{SAY:zombossicon}不完全是！这么说吧，如果我处理得当的话，我可以从这个假期中有所收获。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_3_INTRO_14": "{SAY:zombossicon}我正在进行实地调查！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_3_INTRO_15": "{SAY:zombossicon}现在，你何不当个好主人，迎接我送到你家门口的僵尸呢？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_3_INTRO_16": "{SAY:zombossicon}谁知道呢？您甚至可能会发现有趣的对决。哈哈哈！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_5_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}朋朋，最近有没有发现老板有什么不对劲的地方？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_5_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}我的传感器没有检测到僵王博士的行为有任何异常。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_5_INTRO_3": "{PLAYFUL:winnie}你为什么问用户戴夫？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_5_INTRO_4": "{TIRED:crazydave}嗯。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_5_INTRO_5": "{SAY:crazydave}昨天我好像看到有僵尸替他买巧克力了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_5_INTRO_6": "{SAY:crazydave}我想我看到一些小恶魔试图从我们的花园里摘花。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_5_INTRO_7": "{EXCITED:crazydave}当然是被那些花打了！但你没看到我所看到的吗，朋朋？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_5_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}我没有拾取视线范围内的任何东西。这是什么，用户戴夫？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_5_INTRO_9": "{TIRED:crazydave}啊，算了。也许只是我想多了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_5_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}如果你这么说，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_5_INTRO_11": "{SAY:winnie}我们集中精力对付僵尸吧僵王博士还在向你的草坪发送。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_7_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:crazydave}朋朋，我想我明白了！现在已经没有误会了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_7_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}这是什么，用户戴夫？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_7_INTRO_3": "{EXCITED:crazydave}是老板！他分明是恋爱了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_7_INTRO_4": "{TIRED:winnie}....",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_7_INTRO_5": "{EXCITED:crazydave}想想看！他去买巧克力了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_7_INTRO_6": "{EXCITED:crazydave}他从我们的花园里采集了花。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_7_INTRO_7": "{EXCITED:crazydave}四天前所有谈论爱情的事情，一定都是私人的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_7_INTRO_8": "{SAY:crazydave}难道老板伤透了心，发誓不再爱了？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_7_INTRO_9": "{EXCITED:crazydave}但是我们当然不能没有爱，所以他再次尝试！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_7_INTRO_10": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}你觉得他爱上的是谁朋朋？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_7_INTRO_11": "{SAY:winnie}我无法掌握爱情等人类情感的概念，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_7_INTRO_12": "{TIRED:crazydave}该死，有一天我们真的应该解决这个问题。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_7_INTRO_13": "{EXCITED:winnie}不用担心，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_7_INTRO_14": "{EXCITED:winnie}我有能力通过自学来填补我对“爱”现象的认知空白。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_7_INTRO_15": "{SAY:winnie}现在随机播放：每周播放量最高的 40 首情歌。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_7_INTRO_16": "{SAY:winnie}通过消耗足够的浪漫媒体，我将能够最终制定出你的问题的答案，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_7_INTRO_17": "{EXCITED:crazydave}嘿，我们为什么不去问这些僵尸呢？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_7_INTRO_18": "{EXCITED:crazydave}也许他们会知道老板最受追捧！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_8_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}我的研究已经完成了。对爱情概念的理解率：75%。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_8_INTRO_2": "{EXCITED:crazydave}那么，你终于知道老板看中的是谁了吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_8_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}负。然而，我从情歌、浪漫喜剧电影和业余同人小说中收集到的信息是——",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_8_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}僵王博士之前的说法是正确的。爱情可能会让人分心。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_8_INTRO_5": "{TIRED:crazydave}什么意思？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_8_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}如果僵王一直为追求爱情而分心，他就没有足够的时间来暗算我们了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_8_INTRO_7": "{EXCITED:winnie}支持他寻找爱情的努力可能对我们有益。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_8_INTRO_8": "{EXCITED:crazydave}哦！你是在告诉我你正在考虑成为他的僚机，朋朋？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_8_INTRO_9": "{EXCITED:crazydave}如果能帮助老板最终找到爱情就好了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_8_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}是的，会的。为了他和我们的利益。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_8_INTRO_11": "{SAY:winnie}如果你之前的说法可信的话，他目前正在追求一个。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_8_INTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}所以我们应该优先考虑僵王的好感对象，帮助提高他的成功率。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_8_INTRO_13": "{SAY:winnie}从我所使用的各种媒体来看，第一步应该是向各个亲密伙伴询问此事。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_8_INTRO_14": "{SAY:winnie}也许这些僵尸知道一些事情。我们应该收集一些以供进一步询问。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_9_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}什么？我没时间闲聊，机器。我很忙！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_9_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}我们出于特定目的与您联系，僵王。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_9_INTRO_3": "{SAY:zombossicon}那么，吐出来吧！我一整天都没有时间！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_9_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}制定处理主题的最不尴尬的方式。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_9_INTRO_5": "{TIRED:winnie}程序失败。用户戴夫，你可以问问他吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_9_INTRO_6": "{EXCITED:crazydave}老板，你现在有喜欢的人吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_9_INTRO_7": "{SAY:zombossicon}什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_9_INTRO_8": "{SAY:crazydave}我们注意到你有很多巧克力、鲜花和其他 Valenbrainz 纪念品。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_9_INTRO_9": "{SAY:crazydave}如果不向某人表白你的爱，你还会用它们做什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_9_INTRO_10": "{EXCITED:crazydave}特别是这个季节！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_9_INTRO_11": "{SAY:zombossicon}P-荒谬！我永远不会做这样的事！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_9_INTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，这是人类认为的“否认”行为吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_9_INTRO_13": "{SAY:zombossicon}安静，你这个几乎没有知觉的垃圾桶！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_9_INTRO_14": "{SAY:zombossicon}我不敢相信你们三个会打电话给我问这么白痴的问题！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_9_INTRO_15": "{SAY:zombossicon}别打电话给我！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_9_INTRO_16": "{NPC_EXIT:zombossicon}{TIRED:crazydave}他在回避问题。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_9_INTRO_17": "{SAY:winnie}不幸。但他的反应在某种程度上证实了我们的怀疑。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_9_INTRO_18": "{SAY:winnie}我们明天再联系他。减少对抗可能对我们有利。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_9_INTRO_19": "{EXCITED:crazydave}喂，是你把手机交给我的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_10_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}终于！事实证明我的努力是成功的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_10_INTRO_2": "{SAY:crazydave}哦？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_10_INTRO_3": "{EXCITED:crazydave}朋朋，你听到了吗？老板和心爱的人在一起了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_10_INTRO_4": "{EXCITED:winnie}多么壮观的结果啊。恭喜你，僵王博士。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_10_INTRO_5": "{SAY:zombossicon}什么？你们两个在胡言乱语什么？！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_10_INTRO_6": "{EXCITED:crazydave}不用害羞，老板！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_10_INTRO_7": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我们都知道，坠入爱河有时会有点尴尬。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_10_INTRO_8": "{EXCITED:winnie}放心，没有什么可羞耻的感觉。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_10_INTRO_9": "{SAY:zombossicon}我没有恋爱！你从哪里得到如此荒谬的前提？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_10_INTRO_10": "{TIRED:crazydave}嗯，但是那些巧克力和鲜花呢？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_10_INTRO_11": "{PLAYFUL:winnie}或许他还处于否认的状态，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_10_INTRO_12": "{SAY:zombossicon}安静点，你们这些白痴！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_10_INTRO_13": "{SAY:zombossicon}看来你们两个对我最近的举动产生了错误的印象！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_10_INTRO_14": "{SAY:zombossicon}民意调查显示，僵企目前在女性群体中的声誉正在直线下降。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_10_INTRO_15": "{SAY:zombossicon}在寻找一种方法为公司创造更好的印象时，这个假期来了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_10_INTRO_16": "{SAY:zombossicon}我心想，女人最喜欢什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_10_INTRO_17": "{SAY:zombossicon}爱，当然！以及与之相关的所有其他各种项目和概念！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_10_INTRO_18": "{SAY:zombossicon}巧克力、鲜花、毛绒玩具、1980年代的情歌。所有这些愚蠢的俗气的东西。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_10_INTRO_19": "{SAY:zombossicon}所以我才收集了这么多的东西，最终提升公司在女性心目中的形象！ MWA-哈哈！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_10_INTRO_20": "{TIRED:winnie}....",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_10_INTRO_21": "{TIRED:winnie}您对女性的看法似乎是基于之前不太可接受的一段时间的刻板印象。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_10_INTRO_22": "{SAY:zombossicon}随心所欲地指责你厌女症，机器！结果不言而喻！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_10_INTRO_23": "{SAY:zombossicon}今天，你将受到全女性劳动力的攻击！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_10_INTRO_24": "{SAY:zombossicon}接受，公司多元化调查！接受这个，贝克德尔测试！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_10_INTRO_25": "{TIRED:crazydave}所以你没有恋爱？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_10_INTRO_26": "{SAY:zombossicon}不！现在你能别再到处说这种话了吗？！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_10_INTRO_27": "{SAY:zombossicon}我的僵尸给了我很多奇怪的眼神，都是因为你不停的胡言乱语！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_10_INTRO_28": "{TIRED:winnie}这段经历让我非常难过。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_02_VALENBRAINZ_10_INTRO_29": "{TIRED:winnie}我白白地看了几个小时的糟糕电影。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_1_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}朋朋，你相信运气吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_1_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}处理问题。制定答案...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_1_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}制定答案。负数，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_1_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}进行的各种科学研究尚未找到任何具体证据来进一步证明这一观点。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_1_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}没有任何证据证明“运气”这个概念的存在。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_1_INTRO_6": "{PLAYFUL:winnie}你为什么问用户戴夫？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_1_INTRO_7": "{SAY:crazydave}嗯，我只是在想。在这段旅程中我们经历了很多，不是吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_1_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}确实如此。我们所经历的诸多漏洞可以用“很多”来形容。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_1_INTRO_9": "{EXCITED:crazydave}最后我们总是取得胜利！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_1_INTRO_10": "{SAY:crazydave}所以我只是在想，我们一定运气很好，才会一直发生这种事。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_1_INTRO_11": "{SAY:winnie}计算...您的结果不是基于可量化数据的结果。我不能同意这样的提议。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_1_INTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}仅凭毅力、智慧和技巧，我们就在许多冲突中取得了胜利。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_1_INTRO_13": "{SAY:winnie}根据数据，“运气”与其中任何一个都没有什么关系。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_1_INTRO_14": "{SAY:winnie}不太可能发生的情况，但我们的结果太一致了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_1_INTRO_15": "{SAY:winnie}另一个保持一致的事实是僵尸的到来。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_1_INTRO_16": "{SAY:winnie}看来还有一批人准备好迎接另一场节日主题的袭击。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_1_INTRO_17": "{SAY:crazydave}他们只是不知道什么时候停止整个假期的事情，是吧？ ",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_1_INTRO_18": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}好了，邻居，这个就交给你了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_2_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{PLAYFUL:crazydave}你好，邻居。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_2_INTRO_2": "{SAY:crazydave}说，你是那个把梯子到处乱放的人吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_2_INTRO_3": "{SAY:crazydave}你们有施工吗？我只是给你一个建议！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_2_INTRO_4": "{SAY:crazydave}在梯子下行走会带来厄运。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_2_INTRO_5": "{SAY:crazydave}所以如果你没有那么多散布在这个地方可能是最好的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_2_INTRO_6": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}你刚才的说法是基于迷信的，用户戴夫。 ",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_2_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}没有证据表明仅仅在梯子下行走就会造成任何不幸。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_2_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}它只是一句俗语或建议，要求在操作梯子时或周围要小心。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_2_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}不过，你家周围突然出现这么多梯子确实引起了怀疑。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_2_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}我建议谨慎。这种现象的出现一定是有原因的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_2_INTRO_11": "{SAY:crazydave}狂躁的阶梯犯罪分子逍遥法外？每个人！救救你们自己吧！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_4_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}说，朋朋，你最近有没有发现什么奇怪的地方？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_4_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}详细，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_4_INTRO_3": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我发现我花园里的很大一部分三叶草不见了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_4_INTRO_4": "{EXCITED:crazydave}不仅如此，我还收到了一封来自一只名叫马林·邦多（Marlin Bundo）的非常优秀的兔子的来信。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_4_INTRO_5": "{EXCITED:crazydave}他告诉我他的兔子朋友失踪了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_4_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}这确实是一些值得怀疑的奇怪现象。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_4_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}此外，我的扫描仪注意到该地区周围猫科动物数量的惊人增加。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_4_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}最奇特的是所有这些猫科动物似乎都有相同的特征：",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_4_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}它们都有黑色的皮毛。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_4_INTRO_10": "{EXCITED:crazydave}黑猫？哦不！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_4_INTRO_11": "{EXCITED:crazydave}让他们远离我！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_4_INTRO_12": "{EXCITED:crazydave}运气不好！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_4_INTRO_13": "{TIRED:crazydave}实际上只是一般的猫。我不喜欢他们。请让他们远离我。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_4_INTRO_14": "{SAY:winnie}我会继续关注这些越来越奇怪的事件。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_4_INTRO_15": "{SAY:winnie}同时，你应该处理目前袭击你前草坪的僵尸。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_6_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，看来我的调查有了成果。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_6_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}很可能僵王博士就是所有正在发生的奇怪事件的幕后黑手。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_6_INTRO_3": "{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}你的吸收速度有点慢，不是吗，机器？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_6_INTRO_4": "{SAY:zombossicon}那么，你是根据我留下的金币轨迹得出这个结论的吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_6_INTRO_5": "{SAY:zombossicon}也许，我的僵尸在他们身后留下的彩虹踪迹？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_6_INTRO_6": "{SAY:zombossicon}或者也许，这纯粹是出于运气？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_6_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}负。我所有的结论都来自一系列的计算和基于事实的推理。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_6_INTRO_8": "{SAY:zombossicon}好吧，不过，恐怕你来得太晚了！我的计划已经开始实施了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_6_INTRO_9": "{SAY:zombossicon}同时，我派出了更多僵尸来让你忙个不停！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_6_INTRO_10": "{SAY:zombossicon}咀嚼那个，你们这些讨厌的时间跳跃者！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_6_INTRO_11": "{NPC_EXIT:zombossicon}{TIRED:crazydave}哦，朋朋。我不喜欢那样的声音。看来运气真是太差了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_6_INTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}没有所谓的“运气不好”，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_6_INTRO_13": "{SAY:winnie}我还是无法推断出僵王博士的动机。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_6_INTRO_14": "{SAY:winnie}但是我们的重点应该是对付即将到来的僵尸群。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_6_INTRO_15": "{SAY:winnie}我的扫描仪检测到大量妖精小鬼僵尸。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_6_INTRO_16": "{SAY:winnie}为他们的肮脏伎俩和愚人金做好准备！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_6_INTRO_17": "{SAY:winnie}但是请注意，太快击败他们会给你带来麻烦。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_6_INTRO_18": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}你看到了吗？我想有一个小妖精刚刚经过。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_8_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:winnie}僵王，我还是不明白你这样做的理由。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_8_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}在草坪周围随意放置梯子，将一群黑猫送入用户戴夫的卧室。 ",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_8_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}并在人行道上造成裂缝。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_8_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}如果要证实我的怀疑，看来你正试图用用户戴夫的话来说：",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_8_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}“给我们带来不幸和厄运。”",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_8_INTRO_6": "{SAY:zombossicon}Finally! Took you long enough to notice.",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_8_INTRO_7": "{SAY:zombossicon}是的，这确实是你的阴谋！ To impose bad luck on you and your neighbor!",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_8_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}所为何事？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_8_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}作为科学僵尸，你肯定知道运气这个概念是纯粹由感知创造的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_8_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}It is in no way quantifiable.",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_8_INTRO_11": "{SAY:zombossicon}别这么确定，你一直在质疑面包车！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_8_INTRO_12": "{SAY:zombossicon}我的最新发现似乎证明运气是一个现有的元素！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_8_INTRO_13": "{SAY:zombossicon}一个元素不仅可以量化，而且在一定程度上是有形的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_8_INTRO_14": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SAY:crazydave}那么失踪的三叶草和兔子也是你干的吗老板？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_8_INTRO_15": "{SAY:zombossicon}Indeed I am. 凭借我的最新发明，我可以集聚大定的福气！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_8_INTRO_16": "{SAY:zombossicon}我一直在收集社会上所有的吉祥物和护身符。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_8_INTRO_17": "{SAY:zombossicon}我将利用它们使自己成为一股不可阻挡的纯粹、纯粹的幸运力量！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_8_INTRO_18": "{SAY:zombossicon}一旦我成为财富大师，就没有什么能够阻挡我了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_8_INTRO_19": "{SAY:zombossicon}一切都会顺我的意！ MWA-HA-HA-HA!",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_8_INTRO_20": "{SAY:zombossicon}也别想阻止我！厄运降临在那些抗拒命运和命运的人身上。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_8_INTRO_21": "{SAY:zombossicon}And also zombies. Lots of lots of zombies! MWA-HA-HA-HA!",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_8_INTRO_22": "{SAY:zombossicon}玩得开心！正如他们所说……",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_8_INTRO_23": "{SAY:zombossicon}...Don't push your luck.",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_9_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}GAH，你怎么还活着？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_9_INTRO_2": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}我想我们只是运气好而已！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_9_INTRO_3": "{SAY:zombossicon}荒谬！我一定会耗尽你所有的运气！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_9_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}放弃吧，僵王。你的继续追求是徒劳的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_9_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}运气这样抽象的东西是没有办法证明存在的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_9_INTRO_6": "{SAY:zombossicon}安静！我的理论不会被证伪！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_9_INTRO_7": "{SAY:zombossicon}我已经准备了紧急措施，毁掉你仅存的好运。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_9_INTRO_8": "{SAY:crazydave}怎么会呢？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_9_INTRO_9": "{SAY:zombossicon}检查你的日历！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_9_INTRO_10": "{EXCITED:crazydave}喘气！朋朋！这里说今天是 13 号星期五！最倒霉的一天！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_9_INTRO_11": "{SAY:zombossicon}确实如此！我的僵尸爪牙正在赶来的路上……",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_9_INTRO_12": "{SAY:zombossicon}……你运气不好了，就没有办法还手了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_9_INTRO_13": "{SAY:zombossicon}MWA-哈-哈-哈！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_9_INTRO_14": "{SAY:zombossicon}最好数一下你的日子，当然-",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_9_INTRO_15": "{SAY:zombossicon}祝你好运！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_9_INTRO_16": "{NPC_EXIT:zombossicon}{EXCITED:crazydave}朋朋，我们该怎么办？我们不可能在 13 号星期五打败老板的军队！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_9_INTRO_17": "{SAY:winnie}你的恐惧是不合理的，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_9_INTRO_18": "{PLAYFUL:winnie}而且，很明显僵王博士唯一做的就是换掉你的日历……",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_9_INTRO_19": "{TIRED:winnie}...确实显示今天的日期是“13 号星期五”。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_9_INTRO_20": "{PLAYFUL:winnie}考虑到年份，上面仍然是 1984 年。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_9_INTRO_21": "{TIRED:crazydave}哦。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_9_INTRO_22": "{SAY:winnie}然而，他并没有对他派到我们前院的僵尸撒谎。 ",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_9_INTRO_23": "{SAY:winnie}让我们利用保护区内充足的阳光和这些金砖来击退这些僵尸。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_10_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}我简直不敢相信！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_10_INTRO_2": "{PLAYFUL:winnie}什么让你恼火，僵王？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_10_INTRO_3": "{SAY:zombossicon}我用来校准和武器化运气的机器......",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_10_INTRO_4": "{SAY:zombossicon}爆炸了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_10_INTRO_5": "{SAY:crazydave}只是随机爆炸？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_10_INTRO_6": "{SAY:zombossicon}是的！运气不好，我所有的努力都白费了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_10_INTRO_7": "{SAY:zombossicon}我刚刚完成了老虎机装饰！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_10_INTRO_8": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}你听到了吗，朋朋？这是怎样的运气？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_10_INTRO_9": "{PLAYFUL:winnie}不知道僵王是否知道“诗意反讽”的概念。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_10_INTRO_10": "{SAY:zombossicon}先别庆祝！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_10_INTRO_11": "{SAY:zombossicon}那台机器可能又是一次失败，但它确实给了我一个启示。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_10_INTRO_12": "{SAY:zombossicon}运气真是无法计算的东西。这简直是​​随机的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_10_INTRO_13": "{SAY:zombossicon}所以我决定了！我只是向你扔一些随机的东西，看看它是否有效！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_10_INTRO_14": "{SAY:zombossicon}加油！让我们看看你的运气如何！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_10_INTRO_15": "{NPC_EXIT:zombossicon}{SAY:winnie}从我从那次对话中收集到的信息来看，僵王博士似乎已经耗尽了资源。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_10_INTRO_16": "{SAY:winnie}他只是将他剩下的一切扔给我们，最后一次尝试吃掉我们的大脑。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_10_INTRO_17": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}好吧，我们不能让他这样！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_10_INTRO_18": "{SAY:crazydave}如果他随机向我们扔出他所有的东西......",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_10_INTRO_19": "{EXCITED:crazydave}……那我们也把所有的东西都随机扔给他吧！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_10_INTRO_20": "{PLAYFUL:winnie}你的愿望似乎实现了，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_10_INTRO_21": "{SAY:winnie}我们的传送带似乎出现故障了。我们无法预测我们将从中得到什么植物。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_10_INTRO_22": "{SAY:winnie}这么说违背了我编程的每一部分，但是......",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_10_INTRO_23": "{SAY:winnie}我们度过这一切的唯一方法就是运气好。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_10_INTRO_24": "{EXCITED:crazydave}就是这样，朋朋！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_10_INTRO_25": "{EXCITED:crazydave}好吧，邻居，让我们向这些僵尸展示一下我们的运气吧！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_SPRINGENING_1_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SAY:crazydave}邻居！春天来了，你不兴奋吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_SPRINGENING_1_INTRO_2": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我只知道复活节兔子会给我们很多糖果！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_SPRINGENING_1_INTRO_3": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:crazydave}你呢，朋朋？你认为你会得到什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_SPRINGENING_1_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}没有足够的信息来提出假设。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_SPRINGENING_1_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}然而，有足够的信息可以断定僵尸已经回来了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_SPRINGENING_1_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}对假期剩余物的扫描显示出对基于闷棍的减速的免疫力。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_SPRINGENING_1_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}他们始终如一地进行“微跳跃”以避免树液的粘性影响。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_SPRINGENING_1_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}因此，放在那里的树汁苗效果会较差。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_SPRINGENING_1_INTRO_9": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}等等！我没有把树汁苗放在那里……你是吗，朋朋？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_SPRINGENING_1_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}负。传感器也没有检测到他身上的指纹。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_SPRINGENING_1_INTRO_11": "{EXCITED:crazydave}也许复活节兔子做到了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_SPRINGENING_1_INTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}可能需要进一步扫描。暂时阻止蜂拥而至。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_SPRINGENING_2_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}太好了，是你们话匣子……",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_SPRINGENING_2_INTRO_2": "{EXCITED:crazydave}老板！春暖花开的怎么样了？你在画鸡蛋吗？也许甚至是寻蛋？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_SPRINGENING_2_INTRO_3": "{SAY:zombossicon}我想参与假期，但有人对此有疑问！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_SPRINGENING_2_INTRO_4": "{SAY:zombossicon}我的傻家人要我做“春季大扫除”！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_SPRINGENING_2_INTRO_5": "{SAY:zombossicon}值得庆幸的是，像我这样伟大的领导者都有一支军队来完成如此繁琐的任务！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_SPRINGENING_2_INTRO_6": "{SAY:zombossicon}我敢打赌他们会以最糟糕的方式发送给你，所以祝你玩得开心！哇哈哈！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_SPRINGENING_2_INTRO_7": "{NPC_EXIT:zombossicon}{SAY:crazydave}在我们的草坪上扔垃圾？我打赌复活节兔子会给你煤炭！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_SPRINGENING_2_INTRO_8": "{TIRED:crazydave}...或者只有圣诞老人才会这么做？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_SPRINGENING_2_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，数据已经形成了树汁苗早期出现的潜在答案。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_SPRINGENING_2_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}观察1：树汁苗没有被指纹标记。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_SPRINGENING_2_INTRO_11": "{SAY:winnie}观察2：僵尸由于腐烂而缺乏适当的指纹。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_SPRINGENING_2_INTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}观察3：僵王正在利用他的军队向我们运送各种小饰品。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_SPRINGENING_2_INTRO_13": "{SAY:winnie}假设：僵王在不知不觉中用他的阴谋释放了被捕获的植物。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_SPRINGENING_2_INTRO_14": "{EXCITED:crazydave}哇！老板在送礼物吗？也许他正在扭转自己！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_SPRINGENING_2_INTRO_15": "{SAY:winnie}这个概率很低。僵王确实说过他的计划是为了阻碍我们。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_SPRINGENING_2_INTRO_16": "{SAY:winnie}另外，我的传感器没有捕捉到我们所得到的意图或模式，无论是积极的还是消极的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_SPRINGENING_2_INTRO_17": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我确信他在这样一个特殊的场合是出于好意！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_SPRINGENING_4_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:crazydave}朋朋，看！僵王给了我们更多的植物！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_SPRINGENING_4_INTRO_2": "{SAY:crazydave}我们需要为这两个人举办一个欢迎回来的派对！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_SPRINGENING_4_INTRO_3": "{SAY:crazydave}邻居，你能帮我保证他们的安全吗？我去拿派对用品！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_SPRINGENING_4_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，等等——",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_SPRINGENING_4_INTRO_5": "{NPC_EXIT:crazydave}{TIRED:winnie}...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_SPRINGENING_4_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}当用户戴夫组建他的队伍时，有重要的信息我必须转发。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_SPRINGENING_4_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}僵尸在草坪上放置了一个装置，需要一定数量的鸡蛋才能停用。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_SPRINGENING_4_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}不处理它可能会产生非常负面的结果。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_SPRINGENING_4_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}需要击败偷蛋者才能达到关闭配额。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_SPRINGENING_4_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}但是，用火或电击败偷蛋者会让他们不会掉落蛋。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_SPRINGENING_4_INTRO_11": "{SAY:winnie}给出的龙舌兰可能会产生不利影响，很可能是僵王之前“春季大扫除”的意图。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_SPRINGENING_7_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{TIRED:crazydave}Blarghh...braaaiinnnzz...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_SPRINGENING_7_INTRO_2": "{TIRED:crazydave}...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_SPRINGENING_7_INTRO_3": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:crazydave}愚人节，邻居！我敢打赌，我当时真的吓到你了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_SPRINGENING_7_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}看来僵尸们已经制定了自己的计划。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_SPRINGENING_7_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}我现在无法解读这一切......",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_SPRINGENING_7_INTRO_6": "{TIRED:winnie}...但并非所有僵尸都像看上去的那样。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_SPRINGENING_7_INTRO_7": "{TIRED:crazydave}嗯？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_SPRINGENING_10_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}你们好，浪费时间的时间旅行者！与我的部落的垃圾攻击作斗争，感觉如何……",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_SPRINGENING_10_INTRO_2": "{SAY:zombossicon}...而我却得到了我想要的所有空闲时间！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_SPRINGENING_10_INTRO_3": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我很高兴你这个假期能花时间画鸡蛋！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_SPRINGENING_10_INTRO_4": "{SAY:zombossicon}你聋了吗？我已经说过我不会那样做！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_SPRINGENING_10_INTRO_5": "{SAY:zombossicon}相反，我一直在制作各种可以为你带来厄运的装置！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_SPRINGENING_10_INTRO_6": "{SAY:zombossicon}当然，还有升级到我目前的套装！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_SPRINGENING_10_INTRO_7": "{SAY:zombossicon}其实我刚刚升级完相机！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_SPRINGENING_10_INTRO_8": "{SAY:zombossicon}这样我就能更广阔地看到你那小小的草坪了！我会知道何时何地发动攻击！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_SPRINGENING_10_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}目前这样做可能是不明智的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_SPRINGENING_10_INTRO_10": "{SAY:zombossicon}安静，废品堆！现在，我可以轻松地看到你的草坪了！我什至可以看到——",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_SPRINGENING_10_INTRO_11": "{SAY:zombossicon}...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_SPRINGENING_10_INTRO_12": "{SAY:zombossicon}为什么我的僵企牌电脑在你的草坪上。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_SPRINGENING_10_INTRO_13": "{SAY:zombossicon} 还有我的珍藏版 Pop-Smarts！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_SPRINGENING_10_INTRO_14": "{SAY:zombossicon}以及我计划使用的一些装置！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_SPRINGENING_10_INTRO_15": "{SAY:zombossicon}是谁把那些放在那里的！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_SPRINGENING_10_INTRO_16": "{TIRED:winnie}用户戴夫，我建议你不要-",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_SPRINGENING_10_INTRO_17": "{EXCITED:crazydave}你的僵尸给我们带来了一些春季大扫除！我很高兴你转身给我们送礼物，老板！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_SPRINGENING_10_INTRO_18": "{TIRED:winnie}...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_SPRINGENING_10_INTRO_19": "{SAY:zombossicon}...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_SPRINGENING_10_INTRO_20": "{SAY:zombossicon}RRRA啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！！！那些脑残白痴！！！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_SPRINGENING_10_INTRO_21": "{SAY:crazydave}怎么了，老板？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_SPRINGENING_10_INTRO_22": "{SAY:zombossicon}我想我会和我的*亲爱的*军队进行一些*交谈*。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_SPRINGENING_10_INTRO_23": "{NPC_EXIT:zombossicon}{PLAYFUL:crazydave}想知道他怎么了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_SPRINGENING_10_INTRO_24": "{SAY:winnie}我的传感器检测到僵王博士内极度愤怒......",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_SPRINGENING_10_INTRO_25": "{SAY:winnie}...我假设愤怒正在以最后攻击的形式降临到我们身上。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_SPRINGENING_10_INTRO_26": "{SAY:winnie}小心任何会挡住射弹的巧克力雨。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_03_SPRINGENING_10_INTRO_27": "{EXCITED:crazydave}巧克力？看，老板一直在给我们送礼物！他并不邪恶！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_1_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}朋朋，今天是谁的生日？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_1_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}不清楚，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_1_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}搜索结果显示，生日在五月的重要人物有很多匹配项。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_1_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}虽然似乎没有一个与我们当前的谜团相关。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_1_INTRO_5": "{SAY:crazydave}听起来不对。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_1_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}不管怎样，我们似乎有几个不速之客破坏了庆祝活动。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_1_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}僵尸们似乎穿着得体的场合。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_1_INTRO_8": "{SAY:crazydave}也许这是他们的生日？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_1_INTRO_9": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}僵尸也会庆祝生日吗？或者他们会庆祝重生吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_1_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}这些问题可以等一下，用户戴夫。一大群僵尸正朝房子逼近。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_2_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{EXCITED:crazydave}哦，我记得现在是谁的生日了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_2_INTRO_2": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}邻居，今天是你搬到邻居的周年纪念日！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_2_INTRO_3": "{EXCITED:crazydave}生日快乐！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_2_INTRO_4": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}我还记得我给你第一个坚果墙的那一天。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_2_INTRO_5": "{TIRED:crazydave}那件事好像就发生在昨天。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_2_INTRO_6": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}我想这回答了你的问题，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_2_INTRO_7": "{EXCITED:winnie}那么，祝你周年快乐。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_2_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}我很抱歉不得不缩短这些庆祝活动。更多的僵尸出现了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_2_INTRO_9": "{EXCITED:crazydave}哦，是这些家伙！我记得他们！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_2_INTRO_10": "{EXCITED:crazydave}你不记得他们了吗，邻居？这感觉就像旧时光不是吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_2_INTRO_11": "{SAY:crazydave}回到只有你、我和植物的时候。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_2_INTRO_12": "{EXCITED:crazydave}朋朋还没出生呢！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_2_INTRO_13": "{SAY:winnie}看来你是对的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_2_INTRO_14": "{SAY:winnie}我对这些精选的少数僵尸没有特别独特的记忆。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_2_INTRO_15": "{EXCITED:crazydave}也许有一天我会告诉你这个故事，朋朋！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_2_INTRO_16": "{EXCITED:crazydave}这是一个令人惊叹的故事！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_2_INTRO_17": "{EXCITED:crazydave}有一个巨型机器人参与其中！而且不仅仅是那些看起来像蜘蛛的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_2_INTRO_18": "{SAY:winnie}我期待在这些僵尸被解决后听到他们的声音。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_3_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SAY:crazydave}我和我的好友 Harvey Flaxcaster 常常在无聊时打碎花瓶。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_3_INTRO_2": "{EXCITED:crazydave}哈维出城了，所以你跟我一起去吧，哈维#2！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_3_INTRO_3": "{SHOUT:crazydave}按你的意思打破它，哈维！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_4_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{EXCITED:crazydave}你好，邻居！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_4_INTRO_2": "{SAY:crazydave}我的名字是疯狂戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_4_INTRO_3": "{SAY:crazydave}但是你可以叫我疯狂戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_4_INTRO_4": "{SAY:crazydave}听着，我给你准备了一个惊喜。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_4_INTRO_5": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我们去打保龄球！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_4_INTRO_6": "{SAY:crazydave}这里，拿这些坚果墙。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_4_INTRO_7": "{SAY:crazydave}我为什么给你这些坚果墙？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_4_INTRO_8": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}因为我疯了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_4_INTRO_9": "{SHOUT:crazydave}现在开始，给我一个胜利-",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_4_INTRO_10": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，你为什么要向邻居重新介绍自己？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_4_INTRO_11": "{TIRED:crazydave}...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_4_INTRO_12": "{EXCITED:crazydave}哇，那是一辆会说话的汽车吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_4_INTRO_13": "{SAY:winnie}？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_5_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:crazydave}我在全盛时期见过一些疯狂的东西！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_5_INTRO_2": "{EXCITED:crazydave}但是我还是第一次见到会说话的笨蛋！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_5_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫？这就是你所说的“笑话”吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_5_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}因为如果是这样的话，你就不用再假装不认识我了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_5_INTRO_5": "{TIRED:winnie}我无法感受各种情绪，但你却给了我感受刺激的能力。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_5_INTRO_6": "{TIRED:winnie}无论出于何种原因。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_5_INTRO_7": "{SAY:crazydave}你是说我给了你感到愤怒的能力？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_5_INTRO_8": "{EXCITED:crazydave}为什么，我想我会记得建造一辆恼怒的汽车！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_5_INTRO_9": "{TIRED:winnie}...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_5_INTRO_10": "{TIRED:winnie}肯定有事情正在发生。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_5_INTRO_11": "{SAY:winnie}我会进一步调查此事。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_5_INTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}同时请关注用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_5_INTRO_13": "{SAY:winnie}不要让他走进聚集在你家门前的僵尸群。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_7_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}我的调查已经有了结论。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_7_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}我想此时此刻应该不会感到惊讶。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_7_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}但是用户戴夫失忆的罪魁祸首似乎是——",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_7_INTRO_4": "{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}没错！一直都是我啊！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_7_INTRO_5": "{TIRED:winnie}是的。我正要说到这一点。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_7_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}你这样做的动机是什么，僵王？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_7_INTRO_7": "{SAY:zombossicon}哈！我很想给出一个直接的答案，但我发现让你猜更有趣！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_7_INTRO_8": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{TIRED:crazydave}呃哦。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_7_INTRO_9": "{TIRED:crazydave}他来了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_7_INTRO_10": "{TIRED:crazydave}最好做好准备。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_7_INTRO_11": "{EXCITED:crazydave}这将是一场激烈的战斗。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_7_INTRO_12": "{EXCITED:crazydave}听着。我知道他的弱点是什么：你必须——",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_7_INTRO_13": "{SAY:winnie}那没必要，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_7_INTRO_14": "{SAY:winnie}僵王博士不会亲自与我们战斗。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_7_INTRO_15": "{TIRED:crazydave}嗯？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_7_INTRO_16": "{SAY:zombossicon}MWA-哈哈！成功了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_7_INTRO_17": "{SAY:zombossicon}看看你！你根本不知道发生了什么！我可怜你。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_7_INTRO_18": "{SAY:zombossicon}为了帮你照顾老人，我就派空军来支援吧！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_7_INTRO_19": "{SAY:zombossicon}如果你的脑袋里没有美味的大脑，你就不会经历记忆丧失，不是吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_9_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}我对我们现在的情况做了进一步的调查。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_9_INTRO_2": "{TIRED:winnie}恐怕这比用户戴夫单纯的记忆丧失还要严重。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_9_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}周围时空连续体出现扰动。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_9_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}僵王博士是故意篡改的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_9_INTRO_5": "{TIRED:winnie}我建议谨慎。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_10_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}经过进一步调查，我终于推断出了到底是怎么回事。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_10_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}僵王博士似乎正在造成空间和时间的异常。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_10_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}他操纵了时间来创建一个循环。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_10_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}在对用户戴夫进行了简短测试后，我进行了更多测试。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_10_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}他们都产生了相同的结果。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_10_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}所有人，包括植物和僵尸，似乎都认为现在还是2009年的春天。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_10_INTRO_7": "{TIRED:winnie}这解释了用户戴夫对我的存在的反应。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_10_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}借用他的一句话，“我还没有出生。”",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_10_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}然而，问题仍然存在。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_10_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}为什么僵王博士要这么做？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_11_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}是的，很好，机器。你终于明白到底发生了什么了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_11_INTRO_2": "{SAY:zombossicon}只花了你10天时间就搞清楚了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_11_INTRO_3": "{TIRED:winnie}我还是看不出这样的行为背后的动机。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_11_INTRO_4": "{SAY:zombossicon}呸！我想你说这句话是很自然的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_11_INTRO_5": "{SAY:zombossicon}毕竟，我所经历的喧嚣混乱早于你的创造！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_11_INTRO_6": "{SAY:zombossicon}看看你的周围！你知道这些庆祝活动的意义吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_11_INTRO_7": "{SAY:zombossicon}这是我第一次向你家门口发送僵尸攻击的周年纪念日！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_11_INTRO_8": "{SAY:zombossicon}我个人并没有从积极的角度看待它，更不用说值得庆祝了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_11_INTRO_9": "{SAY:zombossicon}但我的僵尸不敢苟同，这就是为什么每年五月，他们和植物都会举办庆祝活动。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_11_INTRO_10": "{SAY:zombossicon}庆祝什么？连续失败？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_11_INTRO_11": "{SAY:zombossicon}我已经从事这个工作多少年了？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_11_INTRO_12": "{SAY:zombossicon}我需要休息！时间的不断流逝对我来说也不容易！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_11_INTRO_13": "{SAY:zombossicon}未来越来越黯淡。这就是为什么我决定沿着记忆之路进行一次旅行。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_11_INTRO_14": "{SAY:zombossicon}回到更简单的时光。回到一切都变坏之前！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_11_INTRO_15": "{SAY:zombossicon}现在每一天，我们都会像2009年一样聚会！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_11_INTRO_16": "{SAY:zombossicon}没有时间旅行恶作剧！没有奇怪复杂的情节！没有噱头！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_11_INTRO_17": "{SAY:zombossicon}只有我，我的僵尸......",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_11_INTRO_18": "{SAY:zombossicon}...还有你的大脑在我的盘子里。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_11_INTRO_19": "{SAY:winnie}你不会逃脱惩罚的，僵王。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_11_INTRO_20": "{SAY:zombossicon}哈哈哈哈哈哈！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_11_INTRO_21": "{SAY:zombossicon}我已经这么做了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_12_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{TIRED:crazydave}H，什么？这是怎么回事？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_12_INTRO_2": "{EXCITED:winnie}用户戴夫。我举起几根手指？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_12_INTRO_3": "{TIRED:crazydave}十二。朋朋，这是怎么回事？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_12_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}正如我所猜测的那样。时间扭曲的影响正在逐渐消失。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_12_INTRO_5": "{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}不！不，不，不！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_12_INTRO_6": "{SAY:zombossicon}回到你的时间操纵引起的幻觉！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_12_INTRO_7": "{SAY:crazydave}老板在这里做什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_12_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}他设计了一个方案，让大家以为现在还是2009年，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_12_INTRO_9": "{EXCITED:crazydave}2009？那一年我的驾照被吊销了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_12_INTRO_10": "{SAY:zombossicon}是的，大卫。也是在那一年，我们开始了漫长而无休止的战斗。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_12_INTRO_11": "{SAY:zombossicon}你还没厌倦吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_12_INTRO_12": "{SAY:zombossicon}你不希望过去的美好时光吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_12_INTRO_13": "{SAY:zombossicon}你和你的邻居所有人都会明白我在说什么。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_12_INTRO_14": "{SAY:zombossicon}2009 年是一个更简单的时期！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_12_INTRO_15": "{SAY:zombossicon}现在的社会已经堕落到不可救药的地步了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_12_INTRO_16": "{SAY:zombossicon}每个人都在不断地满足自己的贪婪。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_12_INTRO_17": "{SAY:zombossicon}这一系列的事情我不禁感到失望！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_12_INTRO_18": "{SAY:zombossicon}我当年的入侵杰作之后的事件顺序。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_12_INTRO_19": "{SAY:zombossicon}如果有一种方法可以消除我们被迫局限于这些重复、乏味的例行公事呢？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_12_INTRO_20": "{SAY:zombossicon}不再有这些公司干预和令人精疲力尽的社交交易！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_12_INTRO_21": "{SAY:zombossicon}好吧，看看你真正制作的这个方案！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_12_INTRO_22": "{SAY:zombossicon}我可以给你这一切，甚至更多。你唯一要做的就是——",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_12_INTRO_23": "{SAY:zombossicon}就是在极乐中保持无知。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_12_INTRO_24": "{SAY:winnie}你实际上是在为无知辩护，僵王。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_12_INTRO_25": "{SAY:winnie}任何理智或理性的人都不会同意这样的提议。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_12_INTRO_26": "{TIRED:winnie}...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_12_INTRO_27": "{TIRED:winnie}哦。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_13_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，你不能认真考虑僵王提供什么。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_13_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}需要我提醒你，谎言和操纵是僵王的第二天性。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_13_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}从他嘴里说出来的一切都不应被视为真理。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_13_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}我们曾经危及过时空连续体。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_13_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}我们不能因为微不足道的原因再次冒险。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_13_INTRO_6": "{TIRED:crazydave}...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_13_INTRO_7": "{TIRED:crazydave}你知道，朋朋。我可以看到他从哪里来。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_13_INTRO_8": "{EXCITED:crazydave}僵尸爆发初期？我一生中最美好的时光。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_13_INTRO_9": "{TIRED:winnie}这是一个疯狂的声明，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_13_INTRO_10": "{EXCITED:crazydave}但这是事实！种植我的第一批豌豆射手和向日葵......",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_13_INTRO_11": "{EXCITED:crazydave}将僵尸从弹簧单高跷上击落并爆裂冰车僵尸轮胎......",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_13_INTRO_12": "{EXCITED:crazydave}这是我自从担任雾人以来感受到的最有活力的感觉！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_13_INTRO_13": "{SAY:winnie}所以你要让僵王博士继续他的计划，打造永恒的2009年？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_13_INTRO_14": "{SAY:winnie}需要提醒你的是，时间继续扭曲是不可持续的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_13_INTRO_15": "{SAY:winnie}继续生活在这个被操纵的时间泡泡里……",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_13_INTRO_16": "{TIRED:winnie}...它将破坏我们所知的时间流动。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_13_INTRO_17": "{TIRED:crazydave}...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_14_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:winnie}僵王。你对时间的操纵已经达到了极限。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_14_INTRO_2": "{EXCITED:winnie}如果我们不阻止它，时空连续体将会自行崩溃。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_14_INTRO_3": "{SAY:zombossicon}为了继续存在于理想世界而付出的小小的代价！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_14_INTRO_4": "{SAY:zombossicon}而且我想你的穿锅师傅也会同意我的这一点的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_14_INTRO_5": "{SAY:zombossicon}你不喜欢我的计划吗，大卫？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_14_INTRO_6": "{TIRED:crazydave}...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_14_INTRO_7": "{SAY:crazydave}不。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_14_INTRO_8": "{SAY:crazydave}朋朋。你说得对。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_14_INTRO_9": "{SAY:crazydave}过去的那些冒险，都很精彩。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_14_INTRO_10": "{SAY:crazydave}但是如果我继续活在过去，那么我永远不会前进。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_14_INTRO_11": "{SAY:crazydave}我想我们是时候结束我们故事的这一章了，老板。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_14_INTRO_12": "{SAY:zombossicon}什么？！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_14_INTRO_13": "{SAY:zombossicon}你怎么能这么说？那时一切都更好了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_14_INTRO_14": "{SAY:zombossicon}这是什么？你对我创造的这个世界不满意吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_14_INTRO_15": "{SAY:zombossicon}我可以给你更多！更多你的老植物伙伴。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_14_INTRO_16": "{SAY:zombossicon}更多你曾经战斗过的僵尸！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_14_INTRO_17": "{SAY:zombossicon}海蘑菇！你不想念你的老朋友海蘑菇吗，大卫？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_14_INTRO_18": "{SAY:zombossicon}或者你可能怀念我的弹射器爆炸的情景？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_14_INTRO_19": "{SAY:zombossicon}如果你留在这个世界上，你可以拥有这些以及更多。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_14_INTRO_20": "{SAY:crazydave}老板，我认为你正在失去它。我喜欢那些东西！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_14_INTRO_21": "{SAY:crazydave}但这并不意味着我以后不会经历类似或更好的事情！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_14_INTRO_22": "{SAY:crazydave}我会知道。如果我继续停滞不前地生活……",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_14_INTRO_23": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我永远不会有朋朋在我身边！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_14_INTRO_24": "{EXCITED:winnie}用户戴夫，很感人。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_14_INTRO_25": "{SAY:zombossicon}荒谬！我拒绝你基于常识的说服尝试！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_14_INTRO_26": "{SAY:zombossicon}我不会轻易让你毁掉我这个理想的世界！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_14_INTRO_27": "{SAY:zombossicon}准备好反击！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_15_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}房主。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_15_INTRO_2": "{SAY:zombossicon}您未能接受我们的合法索赔。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_15_INTRO_3": "{SAY:zombossicon}请注意，除非您遵守，否则我们将被迫采取极端行动。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_15_INTRO_4": "{SAY:zombossicon}请立即将您的家和大脑汇给我们。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_15_INTRO_5": "{SAY:zombossicon}停止你继续坚持破坏我的完美世界。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_15_INTRO_6": "{SAY:zombossicon}此致，埃德加博士僵王。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_15_INTRO_7": "{NPC_EXIT:zombossicon}{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}应该是这样，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_15_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}这应该是僵王博士最后的部队了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_15_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}你准备好继续前进了吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_15_INTRO_10": "{TIRED:crazydave}...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_15_INTRO_11": "{SAY:crazydave}是的。我们开始做吧。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_15_INTRO_12": "{EXCITED:crazydave}来吧，邻居，是时候给老板一些理智了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_15_INTRO_13": "{EXCITED:crazydave}也许这一切都完成后，我们甚至可以举办一场盛大的舞会什么的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_15_INTRO_14": "{SAY:crazydave}随着歌曲，你知道那一首，有一个-",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_15_INTRO_15": "{TIRED:crazydave}草坪上有东西。我不记得歌词了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_05_BIRTHDAYZ_15_INTRO_16": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}我相信当我们完成这个之后它会回到我身边！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_1_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:crazydave}天哪！草坪怎么了！！！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_1_INTRO_2": "{SAY:crazydave}让我想起了我儿时的梦想。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_1_INTRO_3": "{TIRED:crazydave}看得我流口水了……",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_1_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}请克制一下，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_1_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}请注意，草坪不是由真正的可食用物质制成的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_1_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}我的扫描确定那些只是装饰品。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_1_INTRO_7": "{SAY:crazydave}噢！但什么场合呢？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_1_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}根据我的数据，看来儿童节快到了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_1_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}僵尸，尤其是大量的小鬼僵尸，似乎非常喜欢这个假期。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_1_INTRO_10": "{SAY:crazydave}哦，孩子们僵尸？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_1_INTRO_11": "{TIRED:winnie}用户戴夫，小鬼僵尸实际上并不是幼崽。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_1_INTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}他们只是僵尸，碰巧比平均矮得多。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_1_INTRO_13": "{EXCITED:crazydave}但是看看那些无知的面孔！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_1_INTRO_14": "{SAY:winnie}不管你相信什么，一定要警惕他们乐观的节日精神。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_1_INTRO_15": "{SAY:winnie}他们年轻的骄傲使他们对即使是最卑鄙的混合物也产生了极大的抵抗力。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_1_INTRO_16": "{SAY:winnie}所以中毒效果和有时的缩小效果对他们来说是没有用的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_1_INTRO_17": "{TIRED:crazydave}噢。我已经在准备这些一年的剩菜了......",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_1_INTRO_18": "{TIRED:winnie}你是不是打算给你认为是孩子的东西下毒，用户戴夫？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_2_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}我们回到那艘船上了？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_2_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}确实，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_2_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}不过，我必须告诉你我的检查发现的结果。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_2_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}看来这些所谓的“儿童僵尸”已经开始穿越时空了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_2_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}出于我的探测器尚未发现的原因。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_2_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}所以期待我们在其他时间段追寻他们，同时我继续寻找线索。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_2_INTRO_7": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}喜欢某种追求？由你领导，朋朋？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_2_INTRO_8": "{TIRED:crazydave}我不知道，朋朋...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_2_INTRO_9": "{EXCITED:crazydave}那些小坏蛋就像小妖精一样！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_2_INTRO_10": "{SAY:crazydave}如果可以的话，他们可能会玩大炮之类的东西。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_2_INTRO_11": "{SHOUT:crazydave}喜欢我！！！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_2_INTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}如果你这么说，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_2_INTRO_13": "{SAY:winnie}但是，请确保他们最终不会玩那些 Spring Beans。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_3_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SAY:crazydave}哇哦！现在我们已经进入了空气时代！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_3_INTRO_2": "{TIRED:crazydave}呃，烟雾比平时浓多了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_3_INTRO_3": "{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}我很抱歉，大卫。也许你应该带上更强壮的肺！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_3_INTRO_4": "{EXCITED:crazydave}嘿，老板！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_3_INTRO_5": "{SAY:crazydave}等等，你在这里做什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_3_INTRO_6": "{SAY:zombossicon}我应该是问这个的人！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_3_INTRO_7": "{SAY:zombossicon}你们三个回来做什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_3_INTRO_8": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}为什么你的一些僵尸部队要穿越时空？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_3_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}愿意解释一下吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_3_INTRO_10": "{SAY:zombossicon}我不用解释了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_3_INTRO_11": "{EXCITED:crazydave}等等，老板！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_3_INTRO_12": "{SAY:zombossicon}...是吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_3_INTRO_13": "{SAY:crazydave}你的小鬼僵尸是孩子吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_3_INTRO_14": "{TIRED:winnie}...用户戴夫我已经-",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_3_INTRO_15": "{SAY:zombossicon}你知道我真的从来没有停下来考虑过这一点。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_3_INTRO_16": "{TIRED:winnie}真的吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_3_INTRO_17": "{TIRED:crazydave}呵呵。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_3_INTRO_18": "{SAY:winnie}所以，僵王博士。在你眼里...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_3_INTRO_19": "{SAY:winnie}你一直把可能是孩子的僵尸置于危险的境地......",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_3_INTRO_20": "{SAY:winnie}以及工作场所条件。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_3_INTRO_21": "{SAY:zombossicon}嘿！不要批评我指挥军队的方式！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_3_INTRO_22": "{SAY:zombossicon}而且，小鬼劳动法再过百年也不会发明！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_3_INTRO_23": "{SAY:zombossicon}美好的一天！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_6_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}唷！那应该是他们中的最后一个。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_6_INTRO_2": "{SAY:zombossicon}*远处传来孩子般的笑声*",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_6_INTRO_3": "{SAY:zombossicon}哦，加油！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_6_INTRO_4": "{SAY:crazydave}老板？你想说什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_6_INTRO_5": "{SAY:crazydave}我听不到你的笑声。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_6_INTRO_6": "{SAY:zombossicon}嗯？我什么时候打开这个东西了？！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_6_INTRO_7": "{SAY:zombossicon}咳咳-你好，大卫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_6_INTRO_8": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}你的童工过得怎么样？ ",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_6_INTRO_9": "{SAY:zombossicon}太棒了！他们为我提供的资本增长是-",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_6_INTRO_10": "{SAY:zombossicon}哦！！！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_6_INTRO_11": "{SAY:zombossicon}回来吧你这个流氓-",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_6_INTRO_12": "{NPC_EXIT:zombossicon}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，我今天发现了一群密度要小得多的僵尸正在逼近。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_6_INTRO_13": "{SAY:winnie}我怀疑有什么东西或有人拿走了他们中的大部分。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_6_INTRO_14": "{SAY:winnie}不幸的是，我的扫描仪无法确定是谁或什么。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_6_INTRO_15": "{TIRED:crazydave}这越来越可疑了......",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_9_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}可恶！他们现在到处都是！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_9_INTRO_2": "{SAY:crazydave}怎么了，老板？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_9_INTRO_3": "{SAY:zombossicon}呃，看。这可能有点似曾相识，但是……",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_9_INTRO_4": "{SAY:zombossicon}我再次请求帮忙。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_9_INTRO_5": "{SAY:zombossicon}处理掉所有这些纠缠不休的矮子！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_9_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}你可能指的是大量的小鬼，僵王？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_9_INTRO_7": "{SAY:zombossicon}你这个废物还能怎么样？！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_9_INTRO_8": "{SAY:zombossicon}其实，我这次并没有策划什么计划。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_9_INTRO_9": "{SAY:zombossicon}这根本不是关于我的童工！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_9_INTRO_10": "{SAY:zombossicon}相反，我必须追捕一群偷了我一些技术的白痴小鬼！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_9_INTRO_11": "{SAY:zombossicon}然后决定用它来满足自己愚蠢、幼稚的欲望！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_9_INTRO_12": "{SAY:zombossicon}即时间旅行。很快，他们可能会找到如何重新创建 IT 的方法。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_9_INTRO_13": "{SAY:crazydave}什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_9_INTRO_14": "{SAY:zombossicon}呸！忘了它吧！你就替我对付他们吧！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_9_INTRO_15": "{SAY:zombossicon}呃！我真该请个保姆！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_9_INTRO_16": "{NPC_EXIT:zombossicon}{SAY:winnie}小鬼们似乎一直以来都聚集了一批其他小鬼的追随者。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_9_INTRO_17": "{SAY:winnie}请抵挡这群人，而我则试图解读僵王所说的“IT”是什么意思。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_9_INTRO_18": "{SAY:crazydave}好吧，你知道该怎么做，邻居。我去准备我的火焰喷射器。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_10_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}你们这些傻瓜来得太晚了！ ",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_10_INTRO_2": "{SAY:zombossicon}他们已经重现了我永远无法再看到的东西！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_10_INTRO_3": "{SAY:crazydave}到底是什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_10_INTRO_4": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}多重性，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_10_INTRO_5": "{SAY:crazydave}哦，穿毛衣的大孩子。我记得他们。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_10_INTRO_6": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}我的割草机花了一天的时间来处理这个问题！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_10_INTRO_7": "{SAY:zombossicon}我不在乎！只要照顾好他们就可以了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_10_INTRO_8": "{SAY:zombossicon}除非你想让这个噩梦般的白痴变得更糟！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_10_INTRO_9": "{SAY:crazydave}其实是老板。这些人不都是小孩子吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_10_INTRO_10": "{SAY:crazydave}如果是的话，那么他们的父母在哪里？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_10_INTRO_11": "{SAY:zombossicon}他们不存在，大卫！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_10_INTRO_12": "{SAY:zombossicon}没错！你和你愚蠢的邻居不仅不遵守命令......",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_10_INTRO_13": "{SAY:zombossicon}...而且还在消灭孤儿！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_10_INTRO_14": "{SAY:zombossicon}现在你的道德制高点在哪里！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_10_INTRO_15": "{SAY:crazydave}抱歉，我没在听。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_10_INTRO_16": "{SAY:zombossicon}...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_10_INTRO_17": "{NPC_EXIT:zombossicon}{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，我检测到不是一个，不是两个，而是十多个多重性的变体正在逼近。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_10_INTRO_18": "{SAY:winnie}它们都具有不同的形状和大小，因此请为即将到来的部落做好准备。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_10_INTRO_19": "{EXCITED:crazydave}哦，我准备好了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_06_CHILDRENS_10_INTRO_20": "{EXCITED:crazydave}来吧，邻居！让我们让这些麻烦制造者看看谁才是老大！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_07_SUMMERNIGHTS_1_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}嘿朋朋，今年的夏季庆祝活动我们有什么计划吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_07_SUMMERNIGHTS_1_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}目前还没有制定计划，用户戴夫。你有什么想法？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_07_SUMMERNIGHTS_1_INTRO_3": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我正在考虑举办一个盛大的聚会！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_07_SUMMERNIGHTS_1_INTRO_4": "{EXCITED:crazydave}有了所有的烟花、音乐和过期果汁，我们就可以动手了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_07_SUMMERNIGHTS_1_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}可以相应安排，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_07_SUMMERNIGHTS_1_INTRO_6": "{SAY:crazydave}嘉宾名单我来处理！你可以准备烟花和其他一切。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_07_SUMMERNIGHTS_1_INTRO_7": "{TIRED:winnie}也就是说，你想让我做所有的工作？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_07_SUMMERNIGHTS_1_INTRO_8": "{EXCITED:crazydave}你并没有做所有的工作！我正在处理宾客名单，记得吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_07_SUMMERNIGHTS_1_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}很好。然而，为了准备聚会，我们似乎需要做一些初步的房屋清洁。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_07_SUMMERNIGHTS_1_INTRO_10": "{SAY:crazydave}哦。你也能处理吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_07_SUMMERNIGHTS_1_INTRO_11": "{SAY:winnie}我已经全神贯注于其他任务了，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_07_SUMMERNIGHTS_1_INTRO_12": "{SAY:crazydave}那么，邻居你能帮我清理掉这些僵尸吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_07_SUMMERNIGHTS_1_INTRO_13": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}放心，你完成后我一定会把你加入VIP名单！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_07_SUMMERNIGHTS_2_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}请原谅我们突然的转移。我向你保证，这是有原因的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_07_SUMMERNIGHTS_2_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫已请求为我们的聚会饮品准备新鲜椰子水。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_07_SUMMERNIGHTS_2_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}这座海滩是我能想到的、最适合采集此类资源的地点。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_07_SUMMERNIGHTS_2_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}我认为这不会是一次简单的一次性努力。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_07_SUMMERNIGHTS_2_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}我们可能需要在派对准备过程中返回这个海滩。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_07_SUMMERNIGHTS_2_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}希望用户戴夫尽自己的一份力量来照顾家里的僵尸。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_07_SUMMERNIGHTS_3_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫。为什么我总是看到僵尸出现在我们家前的草坪上？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_07_SUMMERNIGHTS_3_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}需要我提醒你聚会定在一周后吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_07_SUMMERNIGHTS_3_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}我们需要在这段时间内把房子打扫干净。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_07_SUMMERNIGHTS_3_INTRO_4": "{TIRED:crazydave}呃...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_07_SUMMERNIGHTS_3_INTRO_5": "{TIRED:winnie}用户戴夫。有什么事你没有告诉我吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_07_SUMMERNIGHTS_3_INTRO_6": "{TIRED:crazydave}我可能错误地邀请了其中一些人。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_07_SUMMERNIGHTS_3_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}如何不小心邀请僵尸加入你的队伍？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_07_SUMMERNIGHTS_3_INTRO_8": "{SAY:crazydave}看，朋朋。当你和我一样经常参加聚会时...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_07_SUMMERNIGHTS_3_INTRO_9": "{SAY:crazydave}你已经经历过数千次这样的聚会了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_07_SUMMERNIGHTS_3_INTRO_10": "{SAY:crazydave}有些可能有僵尸，也可能没有。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_07_SUMMERNIGHTS_3_INTRO_11": "{SAY:crazydave}过了某个点就变得模糊了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_07_SUMMERNIGHTS_3_INTRO_12": "{SAY:crazydave}有时你想在狂欢一夜的派对后保持联系，你知道吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_07_SUMMERNIGHTS_3_INTRO_13": "{EXCITED:crazydave}它发生了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_07_SUMMERNIGHTS_3_INTRO_14": "{SAY:winnie}我什至无法想象一个正在展开的场景，但我发现争论此类事件的可行性是没有意义的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_07_SUMMERNIGHTS_3_INTRO_15": "{SAY:winnie}我正在宾客名单上制定严格的无僵尸规则，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_07_SUMMERNIGHTS_3_INTRO_16": "{SAY:winnie}你必须让这些家伙走。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_07_SUMMERNIGHTS_3_INTRO_17": "{TIRED:crazydave}当当。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_07_SUMMERNIGHTS_3_INTRO_18": "{TIRED:crazydave}对不起，拖船。下一次吧。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_07_SUMMERNIGHTS_4_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}请原谅不断的搬迁。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_07_SUMMERNIGHTS_4_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}同样，这是在用户戴夫的要求下完成的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_07_SUMMERNIGHTS_4_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}他认为酒量再多一点，聚会会更热闹。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_07_SUMMERNIGHTS_4_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}对我们来说不幸的是，他要求的饮料品牌是 20 世纪 90 年代初的品牌。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_07_SUMMERNIGHTS_4_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}这个时间段是我们能够检索它的唯一地方。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_07_SUMMERNIGHTS_4_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}看起来还活着！有些僵尸可能不会善待我们夺走这些宝贵的资源。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_07_SUMMERNIGHTS_4_INTRO_7": "{TIRED:winnie}请原谅讽刺。事实证明，这些准备工作是很累人的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_07_SUMMERNIGHTS_5_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{TIRED:winnie}用户戴夫，草坪上怎么还有僵尸？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_07_SUMMERNIGHTS_5_INTRO_2": "{TIRED:winnie}我以为我出去买那些可乐的时候就告诉你把它们扔掉了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_07_SUMMERNIGHTS_5_INTRO_3": "{EXCITED:crazydave}嗯？不是我！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_07_SUMMERNIGHTS_5_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}那为什么我会看到我们清理的僵尸身上有邀请卡呢？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_07_SUMMERNIGHTS_5_INTRO_5": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我不知道！昨天请走的我已经变成僵尸了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_07_SUMMERNIGHTS_5_INTRO_6": "{TIRED:winnie}这似乎非常可疑。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_07_SUMMERNIGHTS_5_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}等我处理完烟花运输后，会抽出一些时间去调查。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_07_SUMMERNIGHTS_5_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}同时，我委托你担任保镖的职责。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_07_SUMMERNIGHTS_5_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}希望这应该是最后一个。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_07_SUMMERNIGHTS_8_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}看，朋朋，我知道你在想什么，但我发誓，那不是我。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_07_SUMMERNIGHTS_8_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}那会是谁呢？有人邀请所有这些僵尸来参加我们的聚会。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_07_SUMMERNIGHTS_8_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}我不会这么做，你的邻居也不会。那么谁可以——",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_07_SUMMERNIGHTS_8_INTRO_4": "{TIRED:winnie}哦。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_07_SUMMERNIGHTS_8_INTRO_5": "{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{TIRED:winnie}僵王。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_07_SUMMERNIGHTS_8_INTRO_6": "{SAY:zombossicon}什么？谁打开了这个东西？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_07_SUMMERNIGHTS_8_INTRO_7": "{SAY:zombossicon}这不是看上去的样子！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_07_SUMMERNIGHTS_8_INTRO_8": "{SAY:crazydave}你是在欺骗你的僵尸以为他们被邀请参加我们的聚会吗，老板？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_07_SUMMERNIGHTS_8_INTRO_9": "{SAY:zombossicon}我向你保证对此有一个非常好的解释。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_07_SUMMERNIGHTS_8_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}那么完美的解释会是什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_07_SUMMERNIGHTS_8_INTRO_11": "{SAY:zombossicon}呃-",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_07_SUMMERNIGHTS_8_INTRO_12": "{SAY:zombossicon}看！美味的热狗小鬼！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_07_SUMMERNIGHTS_8_INTRO_13": "{EXCITED:crazydave}哪里？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_07_SUMMERNIGHTS_8_INTRO_14": "{NPC_EXIT:zombossicon}{TIRED:winnie}我无法理性地理解刚刚发生的事情。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_07_SUMMERNIGHTS_8_INTRO_15": "{SAY:winnie}不管那次令人困惑的遭遇，还有更多的僵尸需要照顾。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_07_SUMMERNIGHTS_8_INTRO_16": "{SAY:winnie}这些导弹槲寄生是我聘请的表演者......",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_07_SUMMERNIGHTS_8_INTRO_17": "{SAY:winnie}...他们有非常严格的政策，不能在有僵尸的情况下表演。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_07_SUMMERNIGHTS_8_INTRO_18": "{EXCITED:crazydave}可恶！我们不能失去重头戏！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_07_SUMMERNIGHTS_8_INTRO_19": "{EXCITED:crazydave}邻居！拯救这个派对就靠你了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_07_SUMMERNIGHTS_10_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:winnie}好了，不再有技巧了，僵王。这次你在忙什么呢？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_07_SUMMERNIGHTS_10_INTRO_2": "{SAY:crazydave}是的，如果你那么想参加我们的聚会，你可以直接提出要求。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_07_SUMMERNIGHTS_10_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫。我不打算邀请任何僵尸，无论其身份如何，参加这个聚会。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_07_SUMMERNIGHTS_10_INTRO_4": "{SAY:zombossicon}我不在乎你对我的看法！这一次，我不是为了自己才这样做！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_07_SUMMERNIGHTS_10_INTRO_5": "{TIRED:winnie}考虑到你之前自私的目标和动机，我觉得很难相信。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_07_SUMMERNIGHTS_10_INTRO_6": "{SAY:zombossicon}这是事实！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_07_SUMMERNIGHTS_10_INTRO_7": "{SAY:zombossicon}你可能记得也可能不记得我的外甥从我精彩的假期计划中懒惰的抱歉借口！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_07_SUMMERNIGHTS_10_INTRO_8": "{SAY:crazydave}你被送到开放战区间接杀死的侄子？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_07_SUMMERNIGHTS_10_INTRO_9": "{SAY:zombossicon}不要试图占据这里的道德制高点！你的植物杀死了他！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_07_SUMMERNIGHTS_10_INTRO_10": "{SAY:zombossicon}不管怎样，我一定要克隆一个新版本的他，以免我母亲唠叨的愤怒！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_07_SUMMERNIGHTS_10_INTRO_11": "{SAY:zombossicon}但我妈妈的荒谬似乎还是让我难以理解。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_07_SUMMERNIGHTS_10_INTRO_12": "{SAY:zombossicon}她让我为他在那场战斗中受伤而举办一个“道歉派对”！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_07_SUMMERNIGHTS_10_INTRO_13": "{SAY:zombossicon}我不会为那个问题孩子举办派对！即使是他的克隆体也不能！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_07_SUMMERNIGHTS_10_INTRO_14": "{SAY:zombossicon}这是原则问题！这就是为什么我一直派他的朋友来参加你的聚会！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_07_SUMMERNIGHTS_10_INTRO_15": "{TIRED:winnie}你用我们的派对作为道歉派对而不是自己举办？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_07_SUMMERNIGHTS_10_INTRO_16": "{SAY:zombossicon}是的，我知道。我多么聪明啊！这些请柬都是我亲手伪造的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_07_SUMMERNIGHTS_10_INTRO_17": "{EXCITED:crazydave}看到了吗，朋朋？我没有做！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_07_SUMMERNIGHTS_10_INTRO_18": "{SAY:zombossicon}哦，顺便说一句。僵尸克隆人正在前往他的派对的路上。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_07_SUMMERNIGHTS_10_INTRO_19": "{SAY:zombossicon}所以一定要让他玩得开心。或者不这样做。如果出现问题，我总是可以克隆另一个！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_07_SUMMERNIGHTS_10_INTRO_20": "{SAY:zombossicon}他现在是你的问题了！再见！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_07_SUMMERNIGHTS_10_INTRO_21": "{NPC_EXIT:zombossicon}{TIRED:winnie}所以现在我被两个人困住了，他们试图利用我为准备这个聚会所做的所有努力。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_07_SUMMERNIGHTS_10_INTRO_22": "{SAY:crazydave}两个人？另一个人是谁？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_07_SUMMERNIGHTS_10_INTRO_23": "{TIRED:winnie}我的编程规定我不应该回答。这是无关紧要的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_07_SUMMERNIGHTS_10_INTRO_24": "{TIRED:winnie}我们只要照顾好僵王的侄子就可以了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_08_BIGBRAINZ_1_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，请问我们现在在哪里？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_08_BIGBRAINZ_1_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}我当然不记得自己自愿回到埃及时代。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_08_BIGBRAINZ_1_INTRO_3": "{SAY:crazydave}我可以解释一下，朋朋！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_08_BIGBRAINZ_1_INTRO_4": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}我昨晚出去参加了一个聚会，你知道，和一些兄弟会的家伙 -",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_08_BIGBRAINZ_1_INTRO_5": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}那也可能是僵尸。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_08_BIGBRAINZ_1_INTRO_6": "{TIRED:winnie}无需解释，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_08_BIGBRAINZ_1_INTRO_7": "{TIRED:winnie}我认为你不知何故陷入了与这些“兄弟会僵尸”的境地。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_08_BIGBRAINZ_1_INTRO_8": "{SAY:crazydave}右-o。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_08_BIGBRAINZ_1_INTRO_9": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}我赌输了！他们要夺走我的大脑！我仍然需要那些。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_08_BIGBRAINZ_1_INTRO_10": "{SAY:crazydave}所以他们说如果我帮助完成他们的期末项目他们就会让我走！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_08_BIGBRAINZ_1_INTRO_11": "{SAY:winnie}我认为他们的大学期末项目涉及突破草坪防御？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_08_BIGBRAINZ_1_INTRO_12": "{SAY:crazydave}类似的东西。你知道那些布谷鸟研究员类型！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_08_BIGBRAINZ_1_INTRO_13": "{EXCITED:crazydave}他们说正在研究破瓶效率！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_08_BIGBRAINZ_1_INTRO_14": "{SAY:winnie}这可以解释草坪上的花瓶。明白了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_08_BIGBRAINZ_1_INTRO_15": "{EXCITED:crazydave}好吧，邻居，你是个打破花瓶的好人，不是吗？介意伸出援手吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_08_BIGBRAINZ_1_INTRO_16": "{TIRED:winnie}我想说我们现在最好还是跟着走。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_08_BIGBRAINZ_1_INTRO_17": "{SAY:winnie}像往常一样注意你打碎的花瓶。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_08_BIGBRAINZ_3_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}我想我们已经进入了研究的第二阶段。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_08_BIGBRAINZ_3_INTRO_2": "{SAY:crazydave}他们告诉我他们正在研究一些东西。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_08_BIGBRAINZ_3_INTRO_3": "{SAY:crazydave}寒冷环境对僵尸力量的增强作用。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_08_BIGBRAINZ_3_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，帮助僵尸研究更有效的方法来击败我们是否明智？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_08_BIGBRAINZ_3_INTRO_5": "{EXCITED:crazydave}废话，朋朋！我们都知道刺骨的寒冷无法增强僵尸！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_08_BIGBRAINZ_3_INTRO_6": "{SAY:crazydave}我想。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_08_BIGBRAINZ_3_INTRO_7": "{SAY:crazydave}做这项研究的可怜人可能一生都在修改！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_08_BIGBRAINZ_3_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}或许是这样，但他们无意中制造了一个不相关的现象。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_08_BIGBRAINZ_3_INTRO_9": "{EXCITED:winnie}你听说过蝴蝶效应吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_08_BIGBRAINZ_3_INTRO_10": "{EXCITED:winnie}当我们参与这个特定的实验时请记住这一点。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_08_BIGBRAINZ_6_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}这项特殊研究意味着什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_08_BIGBRAINZ_6_INTRO_2": "{SAY:crazydave}显然这是一个大脑锻炼。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_08_BIGBRAINZ_6_INTRO_3": "{EXCITED:crazydave}你需要保持大脑健康并锻炼身体来加强风味！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_08_BIGBRAINZ_6_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}....",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_08_BIGBRAINZ_6_INTRO_5": "{TIRED:crazydave}别这样看着我！僵尸们就是这么说的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_08_BIGBRAINZ_6_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}如果是这样的话，我们必须确保你的大脑不在今天的特价午餐上。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_08_BIGBRAINZ_6_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}这些金块会派上用场。利用它们来发挥你的优势。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_08_BIGBRAINZ_6_INTRO_8": "{SAY:crazydave}我想知道大脑锻炼与瓷砖有什么关系......",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_08_BIGBRAINZ_8_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SAY:crazydave}这到底是怎么回事？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_08_BIGBRAINZ_8_INTRO_2": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}这不应该是你们兄弟会僵尸的研究之一吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_08_BIGBRAINZ_8_INTRO_3": "{TIRED:crazydave}我不这么认为。他们什么也没说！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_08_BIGBRAINZ_8_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}正在扫描……",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_08_BIGBRAINZ_8_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}僵尸阵型太结构化，不太适合大学生完成。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_08_BIGBRAINZ_8_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}很有可能出现更多智力干扰。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_08_BIGBRAINZ_8_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}请密切关注这些僵尸的攻击方式。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_08_BIGBRAINZ_8_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}我敢说这会让我们知道谁是这一切的幕后黑手。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_08_BIGBRAINZ_10_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}我一直在对过去最近的“实验”的性质进行自己的研究。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_08_BIGBRAINZ_10_INTRO_2": "{SAY:crazydave}你发现了什么，朋朋？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_08_BIGBRAINZ_10_INTRO_3": "{TIRED:winnie}此时应该不足为奇。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_08_BIGBRAINZ_10_INTRO_4": "{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}我看你们这些白痴对高等教育感兴趣了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_08_BIGBRAINZ_10_INTRO_5": "{SAY:zombossicon}我的学业成绩是否成为了智力中等的人羡慕的对象？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_08_BIGBRAINZ_10_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}别沾沾自喜，僵王。我们只是作为顾问参与你们的一些僵尸研究。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_08_BIGBRAINZ_10_INTRO_7": "{SAY:zombossicon}是的，你是！但我担心你的论文有一个轻微的误判。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_08_BIGBRAINZ_10_INTRO_8": "{SAY:crazydave}什么意思？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_08_BIGBRAINZ_10_INTRO_9": "{SAY:zombossicon}那些不是我的僵尸！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_08_BIGBRAINZ_10_INTRO_10": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}不是你的僵尸吗？但你不应该是老板吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_08_BIGBRAINZ_10_INTRO_11": "{SAY:zombossicon}我是老板！但有时，一些白痴认为他们有能力推翻我。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_08_BIGBRAINZ_10_INTRO_12": "{SAY:zombossicon}太荒谬了！没有僵尸能与我超凡的智力相媲美！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_08_BIGBRAINZ_10_INTRO_13": "{SAY:zombossicon}通常情况下，我并不关心他们短暂的叛逆尝试，但这一点特别引起了我的兴趣。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_08_BIGBRAINZ_10_INTRO_14": "{SAY:zombossicon}如果我对幕后黑手的判断是正确的——而且我通常都是这样，那么这有可能是最有趣的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_08_BIGBRAINZ_10_INTRO_15": "{SAY:winnie}你愿意详细说明一下吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_08_BIGBRAINZ_10_INTRO_16": "{SAY:zombossicon}哈！你不想知道吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_08_BIGBRAINZ_10_INTRO_17": "{SAY:zombossicon}也许我会告诉你，如果你在我自己的一些研究中幸存下来！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_08_BIGBRAINZ_10_INTRO_18": "{SAY:zombossicon}未来的进步就在这里，随之而来的是Power Tiles！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_08_BIGBRAINZ_10_INTRO_19": "{SAY:zombossicon}看看这项技术，让我们看看你能用它做什么！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_08_BIGBRAINZ_12_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:winnie}用户戴夫，我的调查显示了一些有趣的东西。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_08_BIGBRAINZ_12_INTRO_2": "{SAY:crazydave}无法融化的冰淇淋？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_08_BIGBRAINZ_12_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}不完全是。但最近僵尸之间似乎发生了一场内部权力斗争。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_08_BIGBRAINZ_12_INTRO_4": "{EXCITED:winnie}一些“受过良好教育”的僵尸已经对僵王的连续失败感到不满。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_08_BIGBRAINZ_12_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}这与僵王博士之前证实的一致。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_08_BIGBRAINZ_12_INTRO_6": "{SAY:crazydave}等等。你是说这些兄弟会僵尸是……什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_08_BIGBRAINZ_12_INTRO_7": "{SAY:crazydave}想夺走老板的Boss气？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_08_BIGBRAINZ_12_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}我们不能肯定地说，但很有可能是这样。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_08_BIGBRAINZ_12_INTRO_9": "{TIRED:crazydave}这可以解释为什么他们还没有出现。我已经好几天没见到他们了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_08_BIGBRAINZ_12_INTRO_10": "{PLAYFUL:winnie}这应该是一件好事。但我们现在先不用担心这个问题。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_08_BIGBRAINZ_12_INTRO_11": "{SAY:winnie}似乎僵王深思熟虑地给我们留下了一个谜题，让我们在他们的位置上全神贯注。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_08_BIGBRAINZ_13_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}所以，我是对的！果然是那些家伙啊！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_08_BIGBRAINZ_13_INTRO_2": "{SAY:crazydave}你看起来真的很高兴，老板。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_08_BIGBRAINZ_13_INTRO_3": "{SAY:zombossicon}我是！哦，再次看到那些我在大学时塞进储物柜的失败者！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_08_BIGBRAINZ_13_INTRO_4": "{SAY:zombossicon}你知道他们为什么提前暂停研究吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_08_BIGBRAINZ_13_INTRO_5": "{SAY:zombossicon}他们试图抹黑我的荣誉并撤销我的死亡学学位！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_08_BIGBRAINZ_13_INTRO_6": "{SAY:zombossicon}他们可以尽力了！他们永远无法证明我的论文是从别人那里偷来的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_08_BIGBRAINZ_13_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}等等，什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_08_BIGBRAINZ_13_INTRO_8": "{SAY:zombossicon}而且由于这种毫无意义的努力，他们没有时间完成他们的研究！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_08_BIGBRAINZ_13_INTRO_9": "{SAY:zombossicon}现在他们必须连续第十年重复他们的最后一年！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_08_BIGBRAINZ_13_INTRO_10": "{SAY:zombossicon}哈哈哈哈！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_08_BIGBRAINZ_13_INTRO_11": "{SAY:crazydave}哇，老板。真是个恶霸！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_08_BIGBRAINZ_13_INTRO_12": "{SAY:zombossicon}真遗憾，因为我要举办最大的毕业派对 - 没有他们！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_08_BIGBRAINZ_13_INTRO_13": "{SAY:zombossicon}我会把它们都直接送到你家！ MWA-哈哈！我真聪明！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_08_BIGBRAINZ_13_INTRO_14": "{NPC_EXIT:zombossicon}{SAY:winnie}看来我们解决了你的兄弟会朋友去了哪里的小谜团，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_08_BIGBRAINZ_13_INTRO_15": "{SAY:crazydave}老板似乎很高兴摆脱它们。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_08_BIGBRAINZ_13_INTRO_16": "{TIRED:winnie}我敢说这不会是我们最后一次见到他们。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_08_BIGBRAINZ_13_INTRO_17": "{SAY:winnie}看起来他们真的很适合僵王博士。他们可能不会就此止步。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_08_BIGBRAINZ_13_INTRO_18": "{SAY:winnie}僵王博士暂时可能不会承认他们是威胁，但他的傲慢一直是他最大的弱点。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_08_BIGBRAINZ_13_INTRO_19": "{SAY:winnie}但是我们可以留到以后再说。一群狂暴的应届毕业生正向我们的所在地行进。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_08_BIGBRAINZ_13_INTRO_20": "{SAY:crazydave}真的吗？因为我看不到他们。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_08_BIGBRAINZ_13_INTRO_21": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}也许他们只是觉得我们草坪的入园资格太复杂了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_08_BIGBRAINZ_13_INTRO_22": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}我能体会到。我和Begholed从来就没有好过！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_1_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}朋朋，我有紧急的事情要告诉你。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_1_INTRO_2": "{TIRED:winnie}这是关于您尝试制造粪肥驱动的耕耘机吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_1_INTRO_3": "{SAY:crazydave}不，朋朋！这次我不玩了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_1_INTRO_4": "{SAY:crazydave}我们的种子短缺了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_1_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}种子短缺？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_1_INTRO_6": "{TIRED:crazydave}这是我的。我已经耗尽了我们的冰西瓜储备。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_1_INTRO_7": "{TIRED:crazydave}所以他们的实力就弱了一些。此时，优质种子已经出炉。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_1_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}我明白了。你不必责怪自己，用户戴夫。这部分是我的错。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_1_INTRO_9": "{TIRED:winnie}我没有跟踪我们的库存。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_1_INTRO_10": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}我觉得我们应该继续补给！还有什么比现在更好的时机呢？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_1_INTRO_11": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}这是收获的月份！植物盛开、厄运笼罩的地方。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_1_INTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}你是对的，用户戴夫。但数据储备表明这方面存在一定障碍。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_1_INTRO_13": "{SAY:crazydave}僵尸？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_1_INTRO_14": "{SAY:winnie}好吧，但主要是我们的一些植物只在某些气候下生长的事实。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_1_INTRO_15": "{SAY:winnie}我们可能需要环游世界 - 在某些情况下需要穿越时间 - 来更新我们的库存。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_1_INTRO_16": "{EXCITED:crazydave}那么是时候来一场公路旅行了！只有两个人和一辆会说话的房车经过乡村！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_1_INTRO_17": "{SAY:winnie}是的，需要一趟。但首先，我们需要将这些僵尸清除出车道。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_1_INTRO_18": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我们不带走偷渡者！让我们来处理它们吧，邻居！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_3_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:winnie}用户戴夫，我在第一次旅行时就成功收集了一些种子。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_3_INTRO_2": "{EXCITED:crazydave}哦！太棒了，朋朋。我们可以立即开始种植这些！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_3_INTRO_3": "{EXCITED:winnie}正确。您邻居的前草坪拥有植物生长所需的一切。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_3_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}但是完美的湿度和水分对于帮助我们植物的生长只能到此为止-",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_3_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}-没有充分的害虫防治。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_3_INTRO_6": "{SAY:crazydave}我不需要农药！臭蜗牛只吃巧克力！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_3_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}我不是在说腹足类，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_3_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}需要对付的害虫是僵尸。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_3_INTRO_9": "{SAY:crazydave}哦。正确的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_3_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}这些植物需要时间生长。确保僵尸不会在我们的庄稼开花时破坏它们。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_3_INTRO_11": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}是的。走进正在开花的植物是不礼貌的行为！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_4_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}我们在沼泽里做什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_4_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}日志显示我们的原始植物储备供不应求。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_4_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}这是可以预料的。如果没有我们的意外干扰，它们应该已经灭绝了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_4_INTRO_4": "{SAY:crazydave}我们不能让它们灭绝！它们太有用了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_4_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}正确。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_4_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}虽然这种情绪适用于我们的异国朋友，但这一时期的其他东西注定会过期。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_4_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}我正在检测该地区的异常僵尸活动，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_4_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}像往常一样，他们得到了这个时期独有的野生动物的帮助。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_4_INTRO_9": "{SAY:crazydave}恐龙！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_4_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}没错。我们需要保持警惕。僵尸和恐龙从来都不是一个好的组合。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_6_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，我正在检测野生动物的异常活动。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_6_INTRO_2": "{SAY:crazydave}这不是意料之中的吗？我们在西部荒野！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_6_INTRO_3": "{TIRED:winnie}在某种程度上，是的。然而，我的读数显示的数字超出了正常预期。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_6_INTRO_4": "{TIRED:winnie}我们发现牛群发生踩踏的可能性增加了 85%。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_6_INTRO_5": "{SAY:crazydave}哦，这对我来说太多了 85%。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_6_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}确实如此。最令人好奇的是，僵尸似乎参与了这些糟糕的事情。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_6_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}他们之前的行为激怒了沼泽里的恐龙，我不得不想——",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_6_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}他们在搞什么阴谋吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_7_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}现在没有错了，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_7_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}看来不是只有我们在培养军队。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_7_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}僵尸们似乎对扩大他们的动物园名单很感兴趣。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_7_INTRO_4": "{SAY:crazydave}为什么呢？他们也面临着短缺吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_7_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}可能。但目前这一切都只是猜测。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_7_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}从行为模式来看，僵王肯定会在月底出现。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_7_INTRO_7": "{EXCITED:crazydave} 那时他就会泄露秘密！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_7_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}确实如此。在此期间我们唯一能做的就是围捕他所有的牲畜。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_7_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}我想我们收集的植物选择能够完成这样的任务。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_7_INTRO_10": "{SAY:crazydave}朋朋，我们还没有补充完所有的种子供应！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_7_INTRO_11": "{TIRED:crazydave}我不能让你使用某些种子。其中一些只剩下一包了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_7_INTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}没关系，用户戴夫。事实证明，你的邻居非常足智多谋。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_7_INTRO_13": "{EXCITED:winnie}我相信他们会设法度过难关，即使有强加的限制。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_9_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}喂喂？这是该死的事情吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_9_INTRO_2": "{EXCITED:crazydave}老板！你在外面吗？我能听到你那边的哞哞声和嘶嘶声。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_9_INTRO_3": "{SAY:zombossicon}什么？！说出来！我听不到你说话！这里是一整片丛林！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_9_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}这次传输有什么原因吗僵王？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_9_INTRO_5": "{SAY:zombossicon}那是机器说话吗？是的，我——不，你这个腐烂的生物，放手！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_9_INTRO_6": "{TIRED:winnie}即使按照你的标准，这也相当粗糙。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_9_INTRO_7": "{TIRED:crazydave}是的。不酷，老板。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_9_INTRO_8": "{SAY:zombossicon}我没有-在跟你说话-啊啊！最后！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_9_INTRO_9": "{SAY:zombossicon}都是你的错！这背后肯定有你！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_9_INTRO_10": "{SAY:crazydave}背后是什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_9_INTRO_11": "{SAY:zombossicon}别装傻！还有谁会把整个动物园塞进我的实验室？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_9_INTRO_12": "{SAY:zombossicon}我的手术台闻起来像粪肥，我没洗的平角内裤里有黄鼠狼！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_9_INTRO_13": "{SAY:winnie}我们什么也没做。我们的印象是你正在建立一支军队。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_9_INTRO_14": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}是的，一支野生动物大军！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_9_INTRO_15": "{SAY:zombossicon}我为什么要这么做？我已经受够了这些令人讨厌的事情了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_9_INTRO_16": "{SAY:winnie}呵呵。多么奇特啊。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_9_INTRO_17": "{SAY:crazydave}所以你不是自己收集这些动物的？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_9_INTRO_18": "{SAY:zombossicon}不！如果你们两个不是幕后黑手，那么——",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_9_INTRO_19": "{SAY:zombossicon}呃！我刚刚意识到一件事！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_9_INTRO_20": "{NPC_EXIT:zombossicon}{SAY:crazydave}那是什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_9_INTRO_21": "{SAY:winnie}我不知道，用户戴夫。但僵王的阻碍对我们来说是有用的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_9_INTRO_22": "{SAY:winnie}他似乎在处理他毛茸茸的小问题时没有占用他偷来的太阳补给品。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_9_INTRO_23": "{SHOUT:crazydave}阳光！你永远不会拥有太多！草也！我喜欢摸草！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_9_INTRO_24": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}当你有机会时，你也应该这样做，邻居！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_10_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}我终于找到了这一切的源头——我的住处局部的荒野繁荣！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_10_INTRO_2": "{SAY:crazydave}不是我们！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_10_INTRO_3": "{SAY:zombossicon}不，当然不是——她回来了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_10_INTRO_4": "{SAY:crazydave}谁回来了？老板，你上气不接下气了！发生了什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_10_INTRO_5": "{SAY:zombossicon}清理实验室里的黄鼠狼和鸡后你也会气喘吁吁-",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_10_INTRO_6": "{SAY:zombossicon}有些还藏在我的袜子里。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_10_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}回到最初的问题——“她”是谁？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_10_INTRO_8": "{SAY:zombossicon}我的某位将军。她对动物很有感情——你可能已经注意到了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_10_INTRO_9": "{SAY:zombossicon}不久前我给她布置了一个任务，她回来了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_10_INTRO_10": "{SAY:zombossicon}时间也到了！我一直想给她委派新的任务！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_10_INTRO_11": "{SAY:winnie}那个任务将是..？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_10_INTRO_12": "{SAY:zombossicon}吓唬你们三个！你以为我有世界上所有的时间吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_10_INTRO_13": "{SAY:zombossicon}有计划要制定，巨型机器人要建造——",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_10_INTRO_14": "{SAY:zombossicon}我没有无限的闲暇时间来毁掉你的假期！大事即将来临——",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_10_INTRO_15": "{SAY:zombossicon}所以暂时得让别人占据你了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_10_INTRO_16": "{TIRED:crazydave}噢，老板，你要离开我们吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_10_INTRO_17": "{SAY:zombossicon}什么？不，从来没有！我只是把我的恶行外包给了较小的奴才。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_10_INTRO_18": "{SAY:zombossicon}今天的方案是她的作品，看你如何应对！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_10_INTRO_19": "{NPC_EXIT:zombossicon}{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，看来气温急剧上升。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_10_INTRO_20": "{SAY:crazydave}哇-哦，你是对的朋朋-天气变热了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_10_INTRO_21": "{SAY:winnie}僵王博士似乎暂时且局部地破坏了我们草坪上方的臭氧层。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_10_INTRO_22": "{SAY:winnie}我想他利用了丰富的牛粪来实现这一目标。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_10_INTRO_23": "{SAY:crazydave}他正在焚烧它并将其武器化以使天气更热？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_10_INTRO_24": "{TIRED:winnie}从气味来看，是的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_10_INTRO_25": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}这是一把双刃剑！这对我们来说意味着更多的阳光！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_10_INTRO_26": "{EXCITED:crazydave}来吧，邻居！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_09_HARVEST_10_INTRO_27": "{EXCITED:crazydave}让我们利用所有这些阳光来重新种植我们的武器库，并恢复臭氧层！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_10_HALLOWEEN_1_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}朋朋我想我刚刚目睹了一场屠杀。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_10_HALLOWEEN_1_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}能否详细说明一下，用户戴夫？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_10_HALLOWEEN_1_INTRO_3": "{SAY:crazydave}没有。你必须……看看你自己。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_10_HALLOWEEN_1_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}正在扫描……",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_10_HALLOWEEN_1_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}我们的草坪上有稻草人，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_10_HALLOWEEN_1_INTRO_6": "{TIRED:crazydave}那些可怕的东西...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_10_HALLOWEEN_1_INTRO_7": "{SHOUT:crazydave}他们用南瓜当头！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_10_HALLOWEEN_1_INTRO_8": "{TIRED:winnie}真是悲剧……",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_10_HALLOWEEN_1_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}...如果不是因为那些南瓜只是装饰品。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_10_HALLOWEEN_1_INTRO_10": "{TIRED:crazydave}哦唷...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_10_HALLOWEEN_1_INTRO_11": "{SAY:crazydave}这就是万圣节让我烦恼的原因。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_10_HALLOWEEN_1_INTRO_12": "{SAY:crazydave}所有这些怪异的装饰让我的大脑变得扭曲。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_10_HALLOWEEN_1_INTRO_13": "{SAY:crazydave}你永远不知道那些骷髅中哪一个可能是真正的……",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_10_HALLOWEEN_1_INTRO_14": "{SAY:crazydave}我的意思是，我们都有一个！甚至是僵尸！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_10_HALLOWEEN_1_INTRO_15": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}我的骷髅太酷了，不能当装饰品！他也跟我说了这么多！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_10_HALLOWEEN_1_INTRO_16": "{SAY:winnie}我的计算表明我们应该出于不同的原因关注这些稻草人。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_10_HALLOWEEN_1_INTRO_17": "{SAY:winnie}它们吓​​跑乌鸦的目的似乎与它们的实际功能相反。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_10_HALLOWEEN_1_INTRO_18": "{SAY:winnie}僵尸乌鸦使用这些稻草人作为巢穴。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_10_HALLOWEEN_1_INTRO_19": "{SAY:winnie}如果不处理，它们会不断地从它们身上生成并试图窃取我们的植物。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_10_HALLOWEEN_1_INTRO_20": "{SAY:crazydave}这些是真正的乌鸦，对吧？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_10_HALLOWEEN_2_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，我们在做什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_10_HALLOWEEN_2_INTRO_2": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我们需要回到万圣节的根源！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_10_HALLOWEEN_2_INTRO_3": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}检查幽灵和恐惧的真实本质！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_10_HALLOWEEN_2_INTRO_4": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}我想不出比这更恐怖的地方了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_10_HALLOWEEN_2_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，我的消息来源并不表明这在历史上是准确的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_10_HALLOWEEN_2_INTRO_6": "{EXCITED:crazydave}但现在是黑暗时代，朋朋！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_10_HALLOWEEN_2_INTRO_7": "{SAY:crazydave}看，那些稻草人又来了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_10_HALLOWEEN_2_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫...您可能比看起来更正确。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_10_HALLOWEEN_2_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}事实上，这些又是同样的稻草人。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_10_HALLOWEEN_2_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}一模一样。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_10_HALLOWEEN_2_INTRO_11": "{SAY:winnie}它们是万圣节装饰品。",
