  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_HEROES_4_INTRO_17": "{SAY:captaincamo}他与这件事无关！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_HEROES_4_INTRO_18": "{SAY:captaincamo}好像他能想到这样的事情。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_HEROES_4_INTRO_19": "{SAY:captaincamo}那个小丑可能会用一个劣质的机甲来冲你。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_HEROES_4_INTRO_20": "{SAY:captaincamo}不，不，你在对付我。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_HEROES_4_INTRO_21": "{SAY:crazydave}我都不认识你了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_HEROES_4_INTRO_22": "{SAY:winnie}你来这里做什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_HEROES_4_INTRO_23": "{SAY:captaincamo}就好像你要让我透露我的战术一样。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_HEROES_4_INTRO_24": "{SAY:captaincamo}我来这里是为了结束你，这就是你需要知道的一切。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_HEROES_4_INTRO_25": "{SAY:captaincamo}一旦我把你放进去，我将在各方面证明我是一个比僵王更优秀的指挥官。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_HEROES_4_INTRO_26": "{SAY:captaincamo}终于占据了我应有的位置，成为所有僵尸的指挥官。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_HEROES_4_INTRO_27": "{NPC_EXIT:captaincamo}{SAY:crazydave}那家伙很奇怪。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_HEROES_4_INTRO_28": "{SAY:winnie}现在我们知道为什么僵尸的行为不同了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_HEROES_4_INTRO_29": "{SAY:winnie}僵王似乎树敌了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_HEROES_4_INTRO_30": "{SAY:crazydave}我们会告诉他的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_HEROES_4_INTRO_31": "{SAY:crazydave}植物英雄总是拔得头筹！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_HEROES_5_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}将军那家伙疯了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_HEROES_5_INTRO_2": "{SAY:crazydave}他认为他可以利用这个约定来摆脱我们！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_HEROES_5_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}而且，他的战术也很奇怪。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_HEROES_5_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}故意标新立异，几乎像是在炫耀。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_HEROES_5_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}有了这个新敌人，我们必须保持高度警惕。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_HEROES_5_INTRO_6": "{SAY:crazydave}Y'知道朋朋，我感觉他有点嫉妒老板。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_HEROES_5_INTRO_7": "{SAY:crazydave}我一提起老板，他就疯了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_HEROES_5_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}两者可能有某种共同的历史，但这超出了我所能提供的范围。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_HEROES_5_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}看来他再次试图模仿现有僵尸英雄的游戏风格。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_HEROES_5_INTRO_10": "{SAY:crazydave}那就这样吧！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_HEROES_6_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}今天我们似乎正在对抗基于英雄的策略：粉碎。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_HEROES_6_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}我会确保你的防御措施得到适当的保障。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_HEROES_6_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}我们不会对这种威胁犯错误。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_HEROES_7_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}鉴于之前遭遇的性质，我想我可以制定一个计划。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_HEROES_7_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}这些策略似乎具有重复出现的模式，使其可预测。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_HEROES_7_INTRO_3": "{NPC_ENTER:captaincamo}{SAY:captaincamo}可以预见吗！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_HEROES_7_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}确实如此。到目前为止，你已经遵循了相当严格的模式。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_HEROES_7_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}模仿僵尸英雄及其特性的模式。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_HEROES_7_INTRO_6": "{SAY:captaincamo}这并不会让他们变得可预测，而是让他们变得更好！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_HEROES_7_INTRO_7": "{SAY:captaincamo}结构合理！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_HEROES_7_INTRO_8": "{SAY:captaincamo}如果它对他们有用，那么这是一个正确的形式！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_HEROES_7_INTRO_9": "{SAY:captaincamo}策略不是一件艺术的事情！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_HEROES_7_INTRO_10": "{SAY:captaincamo}你不能随心所欲！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_HEROES_7_INTRO_11": "{SAY:crazydave}你到底在和那些崇拜英雄的人做什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_HEROES_7_INTRO_12": "{SAY:captaincamo}我正在打造一支与僵王匹敌的军队！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_HEROES_7_INTRO_13": "{SAY:captaincamo}好吧……可以预见吧？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_HEROES_7_INTRO_14": "{SAY:captaincamo}告诉你，让我们换个方式。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_HEROES_7_INTRO_15": "{SAY:captaincamo}让我们真正把它归结为基础知识。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_HEROES_7_INTRO_16": "{SAY:captaincamo}看看你如何应对这种节奏的变化！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_HEROES_8_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:captaincamo}{SAY:captaincamo}你想要一场真正的智力比赛吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_HEROES_8_INTRO_2": "{SAY:captaincamo}我已经确保你的阳光收入有所增加。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_HEROES_8_INTRO_3": "{SAY:captaincamo}非常合我的胃口。喜欢到爆炸。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_HEROES_8_INTRO_4": "{SAY:captaincamo}你摆脱困境的唯一机会就是你那些无关紧要的强化方块。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_HEROES_8_INTRO_5": "{SAY:captaincamo}看你能否真正适应并克服。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_HEROES_8_INTRO_6": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_EXIT:captaincamo}{SAY:winnie}这不是什么新鲜事，邻居。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_HEROES_8_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}向他表明太阳炸弹是一个我们可以毫无问题地计划的障碍。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_HEROES_10_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:captaincamo}{SAY:captaincamo}为什么这些可悲的“英雄”却一事无成！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_HEROES_10_INTRO_2": "{SAY:captaincamo}我的印象是这些应该是最好的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_HEROES_10_INTRO_3": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}Uuuuh... 盖伊将军，你知道他们不是真正的英雄，对吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_HEROES_10_INTRO_4": "{SAY:captaincamo}什么！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_HEROES_10_INTRO_5": "{SAY:crazydave}他们是coser。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_HEROES_10_INTRO_6": "{SAY:crazydave}这是英雄大会。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_HEROES_10_INTRO_7": "{SAY:crazydave}就像英雄迷大会一样。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_HEROES_10_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫试图说他们是崇拜者。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_HEROES_10_INTRO_9": "{SAY:captaincamo}所以我一直在和可悲的极客一起工作！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_HEROES_10_INTRO_10": "{SAY:crazydave}我不知道该告诉你什么。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_HEROES_10_INTRO_11": "{SAY:captaincamo}整个事件都是白痴！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_HEROES_10_INTRO_12": "{SAY:captaincamo}我就是为了这个才出来的！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_HEROES_10_INTRO_13": "{SAY:captaincamo}无论如何，我都会采用默认值。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_HEROES_10_INTRO_14": "{SAY:captaincamo}吃炸弹，你们这些笨蛋！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_HEROES_10_INTRO_15": "{SAY:captaincamo}...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_HEROES_10_INTRO_16": "{SAY:captaincamo}该死！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_HEROES_10_INTRO_17": "{NPC_EXIT:captaincamo}{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，我正在检测即将发生的空袭。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_HEROES_10_INTRO_18": "{SAY:winnie}我们必须及时做出反应。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_HEROES_10_INTRO_19": "{SAY:crazydave}完美！我多么希望活动能够结束啊！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_HEROES_10_INTRO_20": "{SAY:crazydave}与假冒者的最后一战，高潮对决！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_HEROES_10_INTRO_21": "{SAY:crazydave}几乎就像漫画书本身一样！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_HEROES_10_INTRO_22": "{SAY:crazydave}去植物吧！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_1_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:crazydave}朋朋，又到了一年中的这个时候！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_1_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}你指的是家人团聚的时间吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_1_INTRO_3": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}塞满火鸡并传递果酱-",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_1_INTRO_4": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}当我们隔着桌子争论政治时！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_1_INTRO_5": "{EXCITED:crazydave}感恩节到了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_1_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}确实如此。真是一个欢乐的时刻。什么是不爱？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_1_INTRO_7": "{SAY:crazydave}你似乎对此不太高兴，朋朋。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_1_INTRO_8": "{TIRED:winnie}嗯，作为一辆有知觉的露营车，我自己没有任何家庭关系，可以这么说。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_1_INTRO_9": "{TIRED:winnie}因此，我从来没有觉得这是一个值得兴奋的假期。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_1_INTRO_10": "{SAY:crazydave}废话，朋朋！没有人应该被排除在庆祝活动之外！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_1_INTRO_11": "{EXCITED:crazydave}今年我侄女和她的朋友要过来！我给你介绍一下！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_1_INTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}这个手势值得赞赏，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_1_INTRO_13": "{SAY:crazydave}也就是说，我不记得邀请这些家伙参加家庭晚宴。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_1_INTRO_14": "{PLAYFUL:winnie}那么，是时候我们来对付这些僵尸了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_1_INTRO_15": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}是的，最好是在我开始递布丁之前！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_3_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}这么多僵尸是怎么回事？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_3_INTRO_2": "{SAY:crazydave}他们打扰了我们的盛宴！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_3_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}看来他们正在享受一场属于自己的盛宴，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_3_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}我们就是盛宴。说得清楚一点。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_3_INTRO_5": "{SAY:crazydave}当当！获得你自己的火鸡！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_3_INTRO_6": "{TIRED:winnie}...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_3_INTRO_7": "{SAY:crazydave}朋朋，怎么了？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_3_INTRO_8": "{TIRED:winnie}不用担心，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_3_INTRO_9": "{TIRED:winnie}我突然想到，即使是僵尸也有庆祝这个节日的理由。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_3_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}我无法加工食物，因此对我来说消除了这个假期的另一个方面。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_3_INTRO_11": "{SAY:crazydave}这个假期是属于大家的，朋朋！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_3_INTRO_12": "{SAY:crazydave}我们会为你找到庆祝的理由！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_3_INTRO_13": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}当然是在我们消灭这些僵尸之后！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_5_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}朋朋，你有没有注意到一些..奇怪的事情？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_5_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}正在扫描……",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_5_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}是的，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_5_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}这个月我们对抗的小鬼数量似乎激增了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_5_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}这就是你说的用户戴夫吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_5_INTRO_6": "{SAY:crazydave}嗯？哦，不！我说的是肉汁。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_5_INTRO_7": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}味道怪怪的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_5_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}注意到。然而，越来越多的小鬼数量仍然值得关注。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_5_INTRO_9": "{EXCITED:crazydave}是的，当然！但让我们暂时把它放在一边！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_5_INTRO_10": "{EXCITED:crazydave}来吧，朋朋，他们每年这个假期都会重播这部电影！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_5_INTRO_11": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}Beghouled Beyond 一直是家庭的最爱。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_6_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，我已经查明了最近小鬼攻击增加的原因。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_6_INTRO_2": "{SAY:crazydave}真的吗？这是什么，朋朋？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_6_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}嗯，简单来说..",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_6_INTRO_4": "{NPC_ENTER:nanny}{SAY:winnie}..保姆做到了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_6_INTRO_5": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}哈哈，我明白了！管家做到了——",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_6_INTRO_6": "{SAY:crazydave}等等，不。那是不对的。保姆是谁？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_6_INTRO_7": "{SAY:nanny}滚，你这个烂$@*%！侏儒。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_6_INTRO_8": "{SAY:nanny}你不会相信小鬼如此坚持咀嚼你的浴袍。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_6_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}正在扫描……",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_6_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}保姆，僵王博士的小鬼僵尸部门负责人，也是他最信任的助手之一。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_6_INTRO_11": "{SAY:nanny}是的，是的。谢谢你的介绍，机器。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_6_INTRO_12": "{SAY:crazydave}为什么僵王'保姆突然联系我们？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_6_INTRO_13": "{SAY:nanny}还有什么？我是按照他的命令做这件事的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_6_INTRO_14": "{SAY:nanny}每年的这个时候他总是很忙，花时间陪伴家人。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_6_INTRO_15": "{SAY:nanny}因此，他把假期中最有趣、最刺激、最简单的任务降级了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_6_INTRO_16": "{SAY:nanny}照顾亲戚的烂孩子。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_6_INTRO_17": "{SAY:crazydave}朋朋，为什么她的说话方式和实际所说的不一样？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_6_INTRO_18": "{SAY:nanny}我在讽刺你，你这个穿锅的白痴！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_6_INTRO_19": "{SAY:nanny}我讨厌这份工作。我受不了这些骨瘦如柴的孩子们！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_6_INTRO_20": "{SAY:nanny}所以我会让它们成为你的问题！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_6_INTRO_21": "{SAY:nanny}希望你不介意我派这些咬脚踝的人去你的院子里玩吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_6_INTRO_22": "{NPC_EXIT:nanny}{SAY:crazydave}我们确实介意，实际上——不，等等。她走了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_6_INTRO_23": "{SAY:winnie}为即将到来的攻击做好准备，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_6_INTRO_24": "{SAY:winnie}并遮住脚踝。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_7_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:nanny}{SAY:crazydave}是保姆！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_7_INTRO_2": "{SAY:nanny}是的，非常有见地。你显然已经掌握了客体持久性。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_7_INTRO_3": "{SAY:nanny}但是，对于这些小鬼来说却不能这么说。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_7_INTRO_4": "{SAY:crazydave}你在这里做什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_7_INTRO_5": "{SAY:nanny}杂货店购物。这些小鬼需要每周至少喂一次。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_7_INTRO_6": "{SAY:nanny}不幸的是。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_7_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}数据表明，成长中的孩子应该吃得更多。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_7_INTRO_8": "{SAY:nanny}你会看一下吗？黑色星期五促销！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_7_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}哦不。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_7_INTRO_10": "{SAY:nanny}快进去吧，小傻瓜们——买货架上最便宜的东西！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_7_INTRO_11": "{SAY:nanny}如果你们中有一个失败了，今年你们就没有人过生日了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_7_INTRO_12": "{NPC_EXIT:nanny}{SAY:crazydave}朋朋，我们不能让这些小鬼抢走了所有打折的火鸡！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_7_INTRO_13": "{SAY:crazydave}我还要给我侄女准备那顿晚餐！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_7_INTRO_14": "{SAY:winnie}然后这是一场竞赛，看看谁能花得最快且更负责任。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_8_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{TIRED:crazydave}这些怪人从哪里来？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_8_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}数据显示他们一直在那里，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_8_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}看来现在对僵王的反对浪潮才是他们最终出现的原因。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_8_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}僵尸正在积极寻找替代候选人作为他们的领导者。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_8_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}我们必须为未来出现更多这样的“候选人”做好准备。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_8_INTRO_6": "{TIRED:crazydave}那个保姆真是个令人讨厌的工作。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_8_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}同意，用户戴夫。她似乎以伤害她的孩子为乐。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_8_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}虽然我应该说这对于小恶魔来说似乎也是互惠的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_8_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}我刚刚看到一个人在她的座位下面偷偷放了炸药。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_8_INTRO_10": "{SAY:crazydave}说到创伤，看看这些小鬼！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_8_INTRO_11": "{SAY:crazydave}他们正在逃离我们的草坪！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_8_INTRO_12": "{NPC_ENTER:nanny}{SAY:nanny}咳嗽，咳嗽。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_8_INTRO_13": "{SAY:winnie}看起来保姆在爆炸中幸存下来，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_8_INTRO_14": "{SAY:nanny}放弃你的帖子？诅咒你们这些小流氓！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_8_INTRO_15": "{SAY:nanny}回到草坪上，你这个半品脱啤酒！这是命令！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_8_INTRO_16": "{SAY:nanny}那个——或者睡前不再讲睡前故事！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_8_INTRO_17": "{NPC_EXIT:nanny}{TIRED:crazydave}令人讨厌的作品。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_8_INTRO_18": "{TIRED:winnie}同意。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_10_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:nanny}{SAY:nanny}露营！ Delinquents! Little runts! @#$%!@#! 我讨厌这些@#$%&*!、*&!%$#、小、*&!@#$% IMPS！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_10_INTRO_2": "{SAY:nanny}都是你的错！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_10_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}这怎么是我们的错呢？你应该更好地对待你的孩子。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_10_INTRO_4": "{SAY:nanny}这些都不是我的孩子！这些是 ZOMBOSS 的小跑！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_10_INTRO_5": "{SAY:crazydave}那这不就是老板的错了吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_10_INTRO_6": "{SAY:nanny}不！这是——不，等等——",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_10_INTRO_7": "{SAY:nanny}是的..是的。这都是他的错！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_10_INTRO_8": "{SAY:nanny}他给了我这份工作，他让我照顾他那些讨厌的小鬼。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_10_INTRO_9": "{SAY:nanny}我一直看错了，我不应该想杀掉你们三个！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_10_INTRO_10": "{SAY:nanny}我应该杀掉这些小鬼，然后——我会杀了他！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_10_INTRO_11": "{SAY:crazydave}Uhh...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_10_INTRO_12": "{SAY:nanny}是的，一旦他们全部都离开了，我就会在Easy Street上过上幸福的生活！ AHAHAHAHA!",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_10_INTRO_13": "{NPC_EXIT:nanny}{SAY:winnie}这令人担忧。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_10_INTRO_14": "{SAY:crazydave}看来，艰难的生活正在等待着这些小鬼。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_10_INTRO_15": "{TIRED:crazydave}我对这一切感到抱歉，朋朋。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_10_INTRO_16": "{TIRED:crazydave}那个保姆肯定毁了你的这个假期。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_10_INTRO_17": "{PLAYFUL:winnie}相反，用户戴夫。我想我终于找到了庆祝的理由。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_10_INTRO_18": "{SAY:crazydave}呃，那是什么朋朋？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_10_INTRO_19": "{SAY:winnie}你和你的邻居，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_10_INTRO_20": "{SAY:winnie}我很幸运有你们两个作为我的看护者，看看这些小鬼有什么。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_10_INTRO_21": "{SAY:crazydave}噢，朋朋。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_10_INTRO_22": "{SAY:crazydave}你完全正确！我们是一家人！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_10_INTRO_23": "{SAY:crazydave}感恩节就是这样！所以，让我们做我们家人最擅长的事情吧！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_10_INTRO_24": "{EXCITED:crazydave}摆脱这只巨大的火鸡——等等，它一直都在那里吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_10_INTRO_25": "{PLAYFUL:winnie}看来今年我们的盛宴将会有一只巨型火鸡。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_11_FOODFIGHT_10_INTRO_26": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}我会让我侄女把银器拿过来！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_SPORTZBALL_1_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}朋朋，我听到跺脚和鼓掌的声音！这是怎么回事？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_SPORTZBALL_1_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}不用担心，用户戴夫。这是每年这个时候的预期。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_SPORTZBALL_1_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}这是一年一度的僵尸草地滚球奥运会。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_SPORTZBALL_1_INTRO_4": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}好吧，这解释了我们家门口的运动狂热分子！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_SPORTZBALL_1_INTRO_5": "{TIRED:winnie}那是另一种情况。这些僵尸需要被照顾。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_SPORTZBALL_1_INTRO_6": "{SAY:crazydave}他们甚至还找到了那个大家伙！他在乱扔什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_SPORTZBALL_1_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}大脑，用户戴夫。有氧僵尸会用大脑来增强草坪上的僵尸。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_SPORTZBALL_1_INTRO_8": "{TIRED:crazydave}该死！我希望他能分发免费 T 恤！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_SPORTZBALL_2_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，我收到了传入传输。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_SPORTZBALL_2_INTRO_2": "{SAY:crazydave}是谁？是我妈妈吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_SPORTZBALL_2_INTRO_3": "{NPC_ENTER:antibullysquad}{SAY:crazydave}哦，等等-朋朋，是上次的兄弟会！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_SPORTZBALL_2_INTRO_4": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}没错，大卫！我想我们是时候进行适当的介绍了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_SPORTZBALL_2_INTRO_5": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}我们是反-",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_SPORTZBALL_2_INTRO_6": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}恶霸-",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_SPORTZBALL_2_INTRO_7": "{TIRED:antibullysquad}是啊，他说的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_SPORTZBALL_2_INTRO_8": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}什么！？不！我们排练过这个，格里姆布里姆先生！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_SPORTZBALL_2_INTRO_9": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}当格雷格说欺负时，你说小队！我们是反欺凌小队！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_SPORTZBALL_2_INTRO_10": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}对不起，高跷老大先生。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_SPORTZBALL_2_INTRO_11": "{SAY:winnie}反欺凌小队？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_SPORTZBALL_2_INTRO_12": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}没错！我们来这里是为了阻止那个令人讨厌的恶霸，僵王！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_SPORTZBALL_2_INTRO_13": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}僵王不在！我想你接错线了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_SPORTZBALL_2_INTRO_14": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}不！我们来这里不是为了这个！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_SPORTZBALL_2_INTRO_15": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}我们是来破坏他的草地滚球奥运会的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_SPORTZBALL_2_INTRO_16": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}呵呵。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_SPORTZBALL_2_INTRO_17": "{TIRED:antibullysquad}是啊，他说的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_SPORTZBALL_2_INTRO_18": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}我们已经把下一场比赛的拼图换成我们的了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_SPORTZBALL_2_INTRO_19": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}不可能破解！那个恶霸最终会为他对我们所做的一切付出代价！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_SPORTZBALL_2_INTRO_20": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}MWA-哈哈！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_SPORTZBALL_2_INTRO_21": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}对于僵王来说是坏消息。呵呵。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_SPORTZBALL_2_INTRO_22": "{TIRED:antibullysquad}是的，他说！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_SPORTZBALL_2_INTRO_23": "{NPC_EXIT:antibullysquad}{SAY:crazydave}朋朋，那是什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_SPORTZBALL_2_INTRO_24": "{TIRED:winnie}用户戴夫，我不知道。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_SPORTZBALL_4_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:antibullysquad}{SHOUT:antibullysquad}天哪，孩子们！我们的谜题没有解开！新计划！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_SPORTZBALL_4_INTRO_2": "{SAY:crazydave}你们现在在忙什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_SPORTZBALL_4_INTRO_3": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}这次游泳比赛我们要报名自己的队伍了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_SPORTZBALL_4_INTRO_4": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}如果我们不能破坏比赛，我们就赢了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_SPORTZBALL_4_INTRO_5": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}我们从僵王手中拿走了奖杯。对他来说是个坏消息！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_SPORTZBALL_4_INTRO_6": "{TIRED:antibullysquad}是啊，他说的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_SPORTZBALL_4_INTRO_7": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}我们雇佣了我们能找到的速度最快的僵尸！比僵王’游泳者还快！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_SPORTZBALL_4_INTRO_8": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}为了确保胜利，我们会先派出我们的人！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_SPORTZBALL_4_INTRO_9": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}比赛还没开始，我们就赢了！对于僵王来说是个坏消息！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_SPORTZBALL_4_INTRO_10": "{TIRED:antibullysquad}是啊，他说的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_SPORTZBALL_4_INTRO_11": "{NPC_EXIT:antibullysquad}{TIRED:winnie}好的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_SPORTZBALL_4_INTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，看来这次游泳比赛是看谁先到达花线了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_SPORTZBALL_4_INTRO_13": "{SAY:crazydave}不！别踩他们！他们是无辜的旁观者！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_SPORTZBALL_4_INTRO_14": "{SAY:winnie}我认为我们不需要担心球队的阵容，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_SPORTZBALL_4_INTRO_15": "{SAY:winnie}但实际的竞争对手仍然令人担忧。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_SPORTZBALL_4_INTRO_16": "{SAY:crazydave}邻居！做点什么吧！救救那些花吧！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_SPORTZBALL_4_INTRO_17": "{TIRED:winnie}是的，他说的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_SPORTZBALL_5_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:antibullysquad}{SHOUT:antibullysquad}我们输了！？如何！？这个计划万无一失！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_SPORTZBALL_5_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}也许你不应该在游泳比赛中注册飞行。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_SPORTZBALL_5_INTRO_3": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}重整旗鼓！下一场比赛是什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_SPORTZBALL_5_INTRO_4": "{SAY:crazydave}看来是保龄球时间了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_SPORTZBALL_5_INTRO_5": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}保龄球？哈！这会很容易！我们是大学联赛的不败冠军！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_SPORTZBALL_5_INTRO_6": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}是的，高跷先生，老大。你打出了一个很好的保龄球。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_SPORTZBALL_5_INTRO_7": "{TIRED:antibullysquad}是啊，他说的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_SPORTZBALL_5_INTRO_8": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}那个奖杯和我们的一样好，孩子们！ MWA-哈哈！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_SPORTZBALL_5_INTRO_9": "{NPC_EXIT:antibullysquad}{SAY:crazydave}朋朋，我们把平底锅扔进擂台吧！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_SPORTZBALL_5_INTRO_10": "{SAY:crazydave}我已经好久没有打保龄球了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_SPORTZBALL_5_INTRO_11": "{TIRED:winnie}看起来无论我们愿意与否，我们都被拖入了这个，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_SPORTZBALL_6_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:antibullysquad}{SHOUT:antibullysquad}又输了！？如何！？我一定要滚进别针！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_SPORTZBALL_6_INTRO_2": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}没关系！这次我们一定能赢！跳远很容易选择！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_SPORTZBALL_6_INTRO_3": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}坏消息-我们找不到任何撑竿跳运动员。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_SPORTZBALL_6_INTRO_4": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}没关系！我们将利用我们所拥有的一切来努力！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_SPORTZBALL_6_INTRO_5": "{TIRED:antibullysquad}是啊，他说的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_SPORTZBALL_6_INTRO_6": "{NPC_EXIT:antibullysquad}{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}呃...朋朋- 你已经有一段时间没见过撑竿跳高运动员了，是吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_SPORTZBALL_6_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}不，用户戴夫。由于受伤，他们今年取消了该类别。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_SPORTZBALL_6_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}球队似乎正在使用过时的时间表。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_SPORTZBALL_6_INTRO_9": "{SAY:crazydave}这不就是——吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_SPORTZBALL_6_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}是的，用户戴夫。他们是唯一的竞争者。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_SPORTZBALL_8_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}看起来奥运会即将结束，朋朋。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_SPORTZBALL_8_INTRO_2": "{EXCITED:winnie}是的，用户戴夫。我们终于可以恢复平静了——",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_SPORTZBALL_8_INTRO_3": "{NPC_ENTER:antibullysquad}{TIRED:winnie}说得太早了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_SPORTZBALL_8_INTRO_4": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}呃哦。奥运会结束了。我们该怎么办，高跷老板？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_SPORTZBALL_8_INTRO_5": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}可恶！呃——还没结束！还剩下一场比赛！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_SPORTZBALL_8_INTRO_6": "{SAY:crazydave}呃，是什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_SPORTZBALL_8_INTRO_7": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}大脑修复器小鬼..碗！这是正确的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_SPORTZBALL_8_INTRO_8": "{SAY:crazydave}哇！我从来没有听说过这项运动！奥运会上也有这样的比赛吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_SPORTZBALL_8_INTRO_9": "{TIRED:winnie}用户戴夫...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_SPORTZBALL_8_INTRO_10": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}是的，我们会赢得这场吉他..吹炉子...碗比赛！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_SPORTZBALL_8_INTRO_11": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}这不是修复脑球碗吗..？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_SPORTZBALL_8_INTRO_12": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}我就是这么说的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_SPORTZBALL_8_INTRO_13": "{TIRED:antibullysquad}是啊，他就是这么说的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_SPORTZBALL_10_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:antibullysquad}{SHOUT:antibullysquad}哦，你现在已经完成了！看看你们这些家伙把我们带入了什么境地！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_SPORTZBALL_10_INTRO_2": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}那位教授将连续第十一年让我们不及格！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_SPORTZBALL_10_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}这次你陷入了什么困境？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_SPORTZBALL_10_INTRO_4": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}没什么！都是计划的一部分！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_SPORTZBALL_10_INTRO_5": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}我们刚刚借了-",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_SPORTZBALL_10_INTRO_6": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}偷。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_SPORTZBALL_10_INTRO_7": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}我就是这么说的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_SPORTZBALL_10_INTRO_8": "{TIRED:antibullysquad}是的，他就是这样——",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_SPORTZBALL_10_INTRO_9": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}哦，闭嘴！我们从教授的实验室偷了一些窍门，好吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_SPORTZBALL_10_INTRO_10": "{SAY:crazydave}你为什么这么做？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_SPORTZBALL_10_INTRO_11": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}还有什么？企图破坏闭幕式的最后一搏！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_SPORTZBALL_10_INTRO_12": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}但是如果那个教授现在抓住我们的话那就是——",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_SPORTZBALL_10_INTRO_13": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}...坏消息。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_SPORTZBALL_10_INTRO_14": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}完蛋了！孩子们，让我们一起奔跑吧！疾走！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_SPORTZBALL_10_INTRO_15": "{NPC_EXIT:antibullysquad}{SAY:crazydave}哇。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_SPORTZBALL_10_INTRO_16": "{SAY:crazydave}朋朋，他们所说的那个教授不可能是——",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_SPORTZBALL_10_INTRO_17": "{TIRED:winnie}恐怕是的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_SPORTZBALL_10_INTRO_18": "{SAY:winnie}再次准备迎接头脑风暴教授的另一次攻击。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_SPORTZBALL_10_INTRO_19": "{EXCITED:crazydave}除非我们能在他到来之前找到那个小玩意并归还！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_SPORTZBALL_10_INTRO_20": "{SAY:crazydave}邻居，你耽误他了！我会在我的沙发垫之间找找！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_1_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:crazydave}朋朋，看！正在下雪！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_1_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}确实，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_1_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}我们已经进入了一些人所说的“一年中最美好的时光”。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_1_INTRO_4": "{SAY:crazydave}开始看起来很像了！无论你去哪里！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_1_INTRO_5": "{SAY:crazydave}拐杖糖和发光的银色车道！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_1_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}正在扫描……",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_1_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，入侵者入站，与你所描述的景象不符。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_1_INTRO_8": "{SAY:crazydave}哦，可能只是一些颂歌，朋朋！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_1_INTRO_9": "{SAY:crazydave}让他们进来，让他们欣赏风景！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_1_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}负，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_1_INTRO_11": "{SAY:winnie}僵尸再次准备进攻。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_1_INTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}他们唯一想看到的景象——",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_1_INTRO_13": "{TIRED:winnie}是他们将钉在我们自己前门上的冬青树。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_1_INTRO_14": "{SAY:crazydave}哦，该死。难道他们根本不知道现在是盛宴节时间吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_1_INTRO_15": "{SAY:crazydave}我们不能让一些坏脾气毁了我们的节日欢乐！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_1_INTRO_16": "{EXCITED:crazydave}邻居，让我们给这些僵尸带来欢乐吧！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_3_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，我的扫描仪检测到了时空连续体的扰动。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_3_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}似乎有人在主动篡改时间。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_3_INTRO_3": "{TIRED:crazydave}但是朋朋，这里每天都会发生这种事！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_3_INTRO_4": "{SAY:crazydave}看，礼物！一定是有人把它们留在了草坪上！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_3_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}最好奇。难道这一切都有关联——？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_3_INTRO_6": "{SAY:crazydave}噢，糟糕！别再担心了，朋朋！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_3_INTRO_7": "{SAY:crazydave}今天就让我们一起来拆开这些礼物吧！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_3_INTRO_8": "{SAY:crazydave}你想要盛宴节、朋朋什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_3_INTRO_9": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}也许我们会在其中一份礼物中找到它！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_3_INTRO_10": "{TIRED:winnie}我想要的盛宴节就是你认真对待这些事情，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_4_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}朋朋，我们回到冰河时代在做什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_4_INTRO_2": "{TIRED:crazydave}盛宴节再过一千万年也不会被发明！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_4_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}你离目标太远了，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_4_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}更重要的是，我们是来调查骚乱的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_4_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}似乎有什么东西被强行从这个时间段中移除了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_4_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}如果我们不及时纠正，历史的改变将成为永久性的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_4_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}我将列出我们应该注意的可能异常情况。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_4_INTRO_8": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}你在列清单吗？一定要检查两遍！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_5_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}朋朋，花瓶发明了吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_5_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}负，用户戴夫。不是这么复杂的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_5_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}这难道就是异常吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_5_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}但是我的读数显示有些东西已被删除，而不是添加到时间段中......",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_5_INTRO_5": "{SAY:crazydave}你觉得里面是什么，朋朋？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_5_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}我们必须保持警惕，用户戴夫。不管里面有什么——我们正面临一场风暴。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_5_INTRO_7": "{SAY:crazydave}咕噜！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_5_INTRO_8": "{SAY:crazydave}邻居，你抓得那么紧——",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_5_INTRO_9": "{SAY:crazydave}今晚你能帮我们打破这个花瓶吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_7_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:winnie}照明，用户戴夫！我已经查出异常的根源了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_7_INTRO_2": "{SAY:crazydave}那我们可以回家了吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_7_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}我会尝试建立通讯线路。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_7_INTRO_4": "{NPC_ENTER:hunterria}{SAY:hunterria}狼嗅到了空气中危险的气味。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_7_INTRO_5": "{SAY:hunterria}胖子和他的铁猛犸象现身了。正如老板所说。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_7_INTRO_6": "{SAY:crazydave}朋朋，这是谁？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_7_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}扫描中......",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_7_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}亨特里亚将军，僵王博士的高级军官之一。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_7_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}她擅长管理僵尸动物园。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_7_INTRO_10": "{SAY:hunterria}铁猛犸象读心术。她是由魔法组成的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_7_INTRO_11": "{SAY:crazydave}她在空洞里做什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_7_INTRO_12": "{SAY:hunterria}老板给工作。只有 Hunterria 才能做到的事情。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_7_INTRO_13": "{SAY:hunterria}Hunterria 必须狩猎。高目标游戏。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_7_INTRO_14": "{SAY:winnie}处理中...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_7_INTRO_15": "{SAY:winnie}看来僵王博士派亨特里亚来这里是为了完成上次没能完成的事情——",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_7_INTRO_16": "{EXCITED:winnie}重新征服低温山谷！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_7_INTRO_17": "{SAY:hunterria}铁猛犸象再次读心。她是对的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_7_INTRO_18": "{SAY:hunterria}你最好小心。你最好哭一下。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_7_INTRO_19": "{SAY:hunterria}Hunterria 即将进城。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_7_INTRO_20": "{SAY:hunterria}Hunterria 现在去狩猎吧。不要跟随。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_7_INTRO_21": "{NPC_EXIT:hunterria}{SAY:crazydave}朋朋，我们不能让老板夺回部落！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_7_INTRO_22": "{SAY:winnie}同意，用户戴夫。上次释放他们花了将近一个月的时间。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_7_INTRO_23": "{SAY:winnie}我们不会让他们被僵王重新征服。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_7_INTRO_24": "{SAY:crazydave}是啊！在老板下，他们永远不会发明盛宴节！我们必须拯救未来！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_7_INTRO_25": "{SAY:winnie}未找到合适的响应。现在播放音频：facepalm.ogg。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_8_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}朋朋，这些僵尸为什么要攻击我们？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_8_INTRO_2": "{SAY:crazydave}他们不应该更..欢迎吗？我们做了什么之后？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_8_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}这一定是Hunterria在工作，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_8_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}她一定以某种方式说服了他们回到僵王'一边。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_8_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}我可以尝试与冰雹长老沟通以了解发生了什么。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_8_INTRO_6": "{SAY:crazydave}对啊，亲自跟大佬对话！而且也很快！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_8_INTRO_7": "{TIRED:crazydave}乘坐时间机器冲过雪地远没有我想象的那么有趣。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_8_INTRO_8": "{TIRED:crazydave}我想念我的躺椅。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_9_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SAY:crazydave}朋朋，冰雹长老接电话了吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_9_INTRO_2": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}我有好消息也有坏消息，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_9_INTRO_3": "{TIRED:crazydave}哎呀。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_9_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}好消息是——我终于追踪到了异常现象。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_9_INTRO_5": "{SAY:crazydave}坏消息呢？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_9_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}是长老冰雹。他失踪了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_9_INTRO_7": "{SHOUT:crazydave}但那太疯狂了！怎么可能呢？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_9_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}我脑中只想到一个嫌疑人，用户戴夫。而且她留了个信息。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_9_INTRO_9": "{NPC_ENTER:hunterria}{SAY:hunterria}Hunterria留下纸条告诉胖子和他的猛犸象狩猎结束了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_9_INTRO_10": "{SAY:hunterria}现在没什么可做的。亨特里亚获胜。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_9_INTRO_11": "{SAY:hunterria}现在Hunterria会埋葬你。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_9_INTRO_12": "{SAY:hunterria}下雪吧，下雪吧，下雪吧。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_9_INTRO_13": "{NPC_EXIT:hunterria}{SAY:crazydave}呃哦。最后那句话是什么意思？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_9_INTRO_14": "{SAY:winnie}这似乎是“模糊且不祥的威胁”的早期形式。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_9_INTRO_15": "{SAY:crazydave}听起来像一首歌！她会是音乐的发明者吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_9_INTRO_16": "{SAY:winnie}这就是Hunterria告诉我们的“狩猎”，用户戴夫。一定是",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_9_INTRO_17": "{SAY:winnie}僵王派她来追捕冰雹长老的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_9_INTRO_18": "{SAY:winnie}一旦他被排除在外，部落就会重新聚集到僵王。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_9_INTRO_19": "{SAY:crazydave}我不喜欢这个消息的味道，朋朋。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_9_INTRO_20": "{SAY:crazydave}外面的天气变得可怕了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_9_INTRO_21": "{SAY:winnie}天气预报显示暴风雨来了，僵尸出现的几率是100%。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_9_INTRO_22": "{SAY:crazydave}我们无处可去！火焰正在慢慢熄灭！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_9_INTRO_23": "{SAY:winnie}幸好我们带了一些Ultomatos用来弹开。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_9_INTRO_24": "{SAY:crazydave}我讨厌在风暴中外出！抱紧我，邻居！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_11_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:hunterria}{SAY:hunterria}狼是对的。狼鼻子追踪到了胖子。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_11_INTRO_2": "{SAY:hunterria}他怎么回来了？他应该被埋在雪下。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_11_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}猎人！你把冰雹长老带到哪里去了？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_11_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}你不知道你鲁莽行为的影响！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_11_INTRO_5": "{SAY:hunterria}Boss让Hunterria去狩猎。所以Hunterria狩猎。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_11_INTRO_6": "{SAY:hunterria}Hunterria 通过时间追踪猎物。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_11_INTRO_7": "{SAY:hunterria}老板说冰雹长老虐待动物。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_11_INTRO_8": "{SAY:hunterria}他是个卑鄙的人，冰雹长老。他是个坏香蕉。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_11_INTRO_9": "{SAY:hunterria}他不像我们。你肯定明白。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_11_INTRO_10": "{SAY:hunterria}Hunterria 照顾狼。胖子照顾他的猛犸象。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_11_INTRO_11": "{SAY:crazydave}呃，朋朋？这是真的吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_11_INTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}没有记录显示虐待动物的案例，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_11_INTRO_13": "{SAY:winnie}Hunterria，僵王在骗你，以利用你的狩猎能力。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_11_INTRO_14": "{SAY:hunterria}猛犸象对亨特里亚使用心灵魔法。老板警告了这一点。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_11_INTRO_15": "{SAY:crazydave}心灵魔法？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_11_INTRO_16": "{TIRED:winnie}我想这就是僵王所描述的“说服”。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_11_INTRO_17": "{SAY:hunterria}Hunterria 不喜欢胖子或猛犸象。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_11_INTRO_18": "{SAY:hunterria}但是没有人会妨碍狩猎。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_11_INTRO_19": "{NPC_EXIT:hunterria}{SAY:crazydave}这听起来很不祥。朋朋，这是什么意思？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_11_INTRO_20": "{TIRED:winnie}这意味着她又要去狩猎了，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_11_INTRO_21": "{SAY:winnie}这次，我们是目标。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_12_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，我成功找回冰雹长老了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_12_INTRO_2": "{EXCITED:crazydave}他冻僵了！我们需要把他解冻！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_12_INTRO_3": "{NPC_ENTER:hunterria}{SAY:hunterria}Hunterria没想到会是这样。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_12_INTRO_4": "{SAY:hunterria}胖子和他的猛犸象是一款真正的有奖游戏。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_12_INTRO_5": "{SAY:hunterria}亨特利亚现在明白了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_12_INTRO_6": "{SAY:hunterria}Hunterria 必须释放她所有的资源来追捕他们。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_12_INTRO_7": "{SAY:hunterria}Hunterria完成后，两只斑鸠，三只法国母鸡-",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_12_INTRO_8": "{SAY:hunterria}四只鸣鸟、六只鹅和七只游泳的天鹅将免费。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_12_INTRO_9": "{SAY:hunterria}他们将不再受到冰雹长老的虐待。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_12_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}Hunterria，你需要听我们的。僵王在骗你。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_12_INTRO_11": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}是的！使用颂歌，听起来像。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_12_INTRO_12": "{SAY:hunterria}心灵魔法在亨特利亚上不起作用。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_12_INTRO_13": "{SAY:hunterria}狼。吩咐兄弟们做好准备。我们必须狩猎。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_12_INTRO_14": "{NPC_EXIT:hunterria}{SAY:winnie}她的主意已定，用户戴夫。如果我们不能说服她——",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_12_INTRO_15": "{EXCITED:winnie}我们需要为她的狩猎做好准备。我们必须保卫冰雹长老。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_12_INTRO_16": "{SAY:crazydave}那么我们就将他安全送回他的部落！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_12_INTRO_17": "{EXCITED:crazydave}加油！毁掉盛宴节还需要更多的努力！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2024_12_FEASTIVUS_12_INTRO_18": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}请留意，朋朋。她可能会派十二个鼓手来打我们！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_1_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}朋朋，你取消我们的新闻订阅了吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_1_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}不，我没有，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_1_INTRO_3": "{SAY:crazydave}这很奇怪！今天早上我应该收到一份园艺季刊！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_1_INTRO_4": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}我真的需要知道如何通过一个简单的步骤来改善我的作物！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_1_INTRO_5": "{TIRED:winnie}你不应该相信你读到的一切，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_1_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}数据显示，50% 的园丁每月遭遇 3,000 起与农作物相关的诈骗。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_1_INTRO_7": "{SAY:crazydave}该死。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_1_INTRO_8": "{SAY:crazydave}您是否在某处读取了该数据，朋朋？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_1_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}来自可信出版物，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_1_INTRO_10": "{EXCITED:winnie}我的数据库经过严格的事实检查并不断更新。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_1_INTRO_11": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}好先进啊！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_1_INTRO_12": "{SAY:crazydave}你也能预测天气吗朋朋？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_1_INTRO_13": "{EXCITED:winnie}当然可以。扫描中....",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_1_INTRO_14": "{SAY:winnie}预计晚上...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_1_INTRO_15": "{PLAYFUL:winnie}..僵尸。然而，仅限小剂量。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_1_INTRO_16": "{SAY:crazydave}那么对于像我这样的小园丁来说这应该是可以管理的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_2_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{TIRED:crazydave}好吧，我没想到会这样。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_2_INTRO_2": "{SAY:crazydave}原来僵尸比你预想的还要多朋朋！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_2_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}小鬼僵尸可能。我的天气预报准确率是 98.7%。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_2_INTRO_4": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}我们都会时不时地犯错误。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_2_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}我必须彻底检查支持这些发现的先前来源。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_2_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}计算....",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_2_INTRO_7": "{SAY:crazydave}你说，你能预测今天的潮汐吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_2_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}是。这也可以作为对我预测能力的检验。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_2_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}天气预报要求...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_2_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}..整周的高潮。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_2_INTRO_11": "{SAY:crazydave}呜呜！是时候去冲浪了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_4_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}什么嘿？这两天根本没有潮汐！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_4_INTRO_2": "{EXCITED:winnie}小鬼僵尸可抢！这些预测有可验证组织提供的数据支持！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_4_INTRO_3": "{TIRED:crazydave}朋朋，你感觉还好吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_4_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}我们对“感觉良好”的定义各不相同，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_4_INTRO_5": "{TIRED:winnie}但我确实相信我需要进行健康检查。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_4_INTRO_6": "{SAY:crazydave}嘿，朋朋！别显得那么悲伤！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_4_INTRO_7": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}反正我也不太想去冲浪。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_4_INTRO_8": "{SAY:crazydave}当然，这对我们的一些水生植物朋友来说很糟糕-",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_4_INTRO_9": "{SAY:crazydave}-但没有他们我们也能生存！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_4_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}收到保证的话。谢谢你，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_4_INTRO_11": "{SAY:crazydave}别提了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_4_INTRO_12": "{SAY:crazydave}呃，哦。我想我看到地平线上有一些僵尸。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_4_INTRO_13": "{SAY:crazydave}你没有能力与他们战斗，朋朋！让我们像豌豆一样离开吧！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_6_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:winnie}用户戴夫，紧急消息。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_6_INTRO_2": "{SAY:crazydave}它是什么，朋朋？我的园艺季刊终于到了吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_6_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}负，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_6_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}我收到报告说我们的许多工厂已经放弃了我们的队伍。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_6_INTRO_5": "{SHOUT:crazydave}什么？太疯狂了！他们为什么要这么做？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_6_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}看来我们的水生部队中就有逃兵。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_6_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}以及豌豆射手。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_6_INTRO_8": "{SAY:crazydave}豌豆射手s？但我们已经追溯到很久以前了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_6_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}我对剩下的一些植物提出了质疑，看来它们是因为这个录音而离开的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_6_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}正在播放音频片段......",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_6_INTRO_11": "{SAY:winnie}这太糟糕了...我们的水生植物...没有它们我们也能生存...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_6_INTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}豌豆……应该……离开……",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_6_INTRO_13": "{SAY:crazydave}呼哈？那是我的声音！我从来没有说过这些话！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_6_INTRO_14": "{SAY:winnie}正确，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_6_INTRO_15": "{SAY:winnie}有人录制并篡改了我们前几天的对话。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_6_INTRO_16": "{SAY:crazydave}谁会这么做？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_6_INTRO_17": "{SAY:winnie}不清楚。由于我的数据库系统也遭到破坏，搜索将变得困难。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_6_INTRO_18": "{SAY:crazydave}哦，这太糟糕了。他们也在泳池派对前离开了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_7_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:winnie}用户戴夫，尽管有困难，我想我已经找到了一个发现！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_7_INTRO_2": "{TIRED:crazydave}你查出谁在散布恶作剧了吗朋朋？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_7_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}我检测到来自僵尸邻近来源的奇怪信号读数。事实上，",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_7_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}我们应该熟悉。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_7_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}看来僵企参与了扰乱我们的信息流。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_7_INTRO_6": "{SAY:crazydave}僵企？那是老板拥有的公司，不是吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_7_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}不正确，用户戴夫。僵企其实是……",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_7_INTRO_8": "{NPC_ENTER:missinfo}{SAY:missinfo}僵企实际上是一个独立于我们领袖Edgar George博士僵王的独立实体！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_7_INTRO_9": "{SAY:missinfo}虽然我们过去确实合作过，但他对我们的直接影响很小！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_7_INTRO_10": "{SAY:crazydave}哇！谢谢小姐姐的解释......",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_7_INTRO_11": "{SAY:missinfo}..信息！信息小姐就是这个名字，播报新闻就是游戏！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_7_INTRO_12": "{SAY:missinfo}早上好，邻里镇！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_7_INTRO_13": "{SPECIAL1:missinfo}*观众掌声曲目播放*",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_7_INTRO_14": "{SAY:winnie}你是如何将自己广播到我们的通讯系统中的！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_7_INTRO_15": "{SAY:missinfo}作为僵企媒体部门的负责人-我可以访问僵企的所有丰富资源！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_7_INTRO_16": "{SAY:winnie}你就是散布错误信息的人吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_7_INTRO_17": "{SAY:missinfo}我是吗？好吧，别碰那个表盘！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_7_INTRO_18": "{SAY:missinfo}休息后我们很快就会知道！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_9_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:missinfo}{SAY:missinfo}我死去的观众下午好！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_9_INTRO_2": "{SAY:missinfo}老西部荒野的天气非常炎热！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_9_INTRO_3": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{TIRED:crazydave}最后。我翻了很多频道..",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_9_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}信息小姐，我们需要答案！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_9_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}你就是篡改我数据库的人吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_9_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}还向媒体玷污用户戴夫的好名声？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_9_INTRO_7": "{SAY:missinfo}如此诽谤！你有什么证据支持吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_9_INTRO_8": "{EXCITED:winnie}我有足够的证据-",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_9_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_9_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}你是怎么做到的？抹掉我收集到的所有证据——",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_9_INTRO_11": "{SAY:missinfo}我不相信我知道你在说什么，亲爱的观众！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_9_INTRO_12": "{SAY:missinfo}现在 - 天气！天气预报称天空晴朗...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_9_INTRO_13": "{SAY:missinfo}....还有高达 0% 的踩踏伏击几率！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_9_INTRO_14": "{NPC_EXIT:missinfo}{TIRED:crazydave}朋朋，是真的吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_9_INTRO_15": "{SAY:winnie}正在扫描……",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_9_INTRO_16": "{SAY:winnie}虽然我的数据库仍然受到威胁，但我至少可以自信地说——",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_9_INTRO_17": "{SAY:winnie}信息小姐说的是没有踩踏伏击的真相。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_11_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:missinfo}{SAY:missinfo}你知道90%的僵尸体内都植入了金属芯片吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_11_INTRO_2": "{SAY:missinfo}是真的！僵王博士强制要求用一块巨大的磁铁来拉动僵尸！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_11_INTRO_3": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}是这样吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_11_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}不要相信她说的任何话，用户戴夫。她是一个被证实的骗子！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_11_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}她的做法是对新闻诚信的侮辱！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_11_INTRO_6": "{SAY:missinfo}为什么，我亲爱的观众——新闻毕竟是为了推销而写的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_11_INTRO_7": "{SAY:missinfo}我们只是让观众自己得出结论。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_11_INTRO_8": "{SAY:missinfo}我们的新闻广播到此结束。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_11_INTRO_9": "{SAY:missinfo}下一步：没有相对拇指烹饪。主演：信息小姐。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_11_INTRO_10": "{NPC_EXIT:missinfo}{SAY:crazydave}别担心，朋朋。我有一个计划！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_11_INTRO_11": "{SAY:crazydave}那个女记者暴露了僵尸的秘密弱点！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_11_INTRO_12": "{EXCITED:crazydave}这些磁铁蘑菇会很方便！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_11_INTRO_13": "{TIRED:winnie}用户戴夫...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_11_INTRO_14": "{SAY:winnie}我想我会让这件事成为一个教训，让你不要那么信任。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_13_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{TIRED:crazydave}朋朋，我受不了了！我已经不知道什么是真的，什么是假的了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_13_INTRO_2": "{TIRED:crazydave}昨天信息小姐告诉我，鸟不是真的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_13_INTRO_3": "{SAY:crazydave}是真的吗？鸟是真实的吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_13_INTRO_4": "{TIRED:winnie}我们生活在不确定的时代，用户戴夫-腐败的人物误导和欺骗你。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_13_INTRO_5": "{SAY:crazydave}朋朋，你永远不会骗我吧？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_13_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}我永远不会，用户戴夫。我也没有能力。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_13_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}我想出了一种方法来对抗她的错误信息和误导。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_13_INTRO_8": "{SAY:crazydave}这是什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_13_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}更多误导。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_13_INTRO_10": "{PLAYFUL:winnie}我们只是让她的员工尝尝她自己的药。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_14_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:missinfo}{SAY:missinfo}突发新闻！错误信息猖獗，僵企总部一片混乱！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_14_INTRO_2": "{SAY:missinfo}僵企正在积极调查此事，并找出了三个主要嫌疑人——",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_14_INTRO_3": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:winnie}没错！一直都是我们！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_14_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}我们已经向你们的工人散布谣言，说你们要把他们的养老金削减一半！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_14_INTRO_5": "{SAY:crazydave}我告诉他们勺子不是真的！你对此有何看法？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_14_INTRO_6": "{SAY:missinfo}没有人能阻止这种疯狂吗？大谎言？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_14_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}信息小姐你为什么要这么做？你的最终目标是什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_14_INTRO_8": "{SAY:crazydave}你是按照老板的命令做的吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_14_INTRO_9": "{SAY:missinfo}僵企是僵尸创新和领导力的领先品牌！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_14_INTRO_10": "{SAY:missinfo}僵王的时间结束了！我们僵企将成为未来的领导者！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_14_INTRO_11": "{SAY:missinfo}作为控制信息流的人 - 我们将统治一切！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_14_INTRO_12": "{SPECIAL2:missinfo}*雷声音效响起*",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_14_INTRO_13": "{SAY:crazydave}所以..这不是一个老板方案？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_14_INTRO_14": "{SAY:missinfo}亲爱的观众我已经告诉过你了，我们是一个独立的实体！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_14_INTRO_15": "{SAY:missinfo}请稍候，我们正在解决这些技术难题。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_14_INTRO_16": "{SAY:missinfo}其他新闻中，你有没有感觉阳光突然不见了？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_14_INTRO_17": "{SAY:missinfo}10 点还有更多。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_15_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:missinfo}{SAY:missinfo}我收到消息说你们三人去年的某个时候遇到了流氓员工。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_15_INTRO_2": "{SAY:missinfo}我想表达他们的行为并不反映僵企的价值观和目标。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_15_INTRO_3": "{EXCITED:winnie}企业话题已经够多了！我们把你逼到绝境了，信息小姐！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_15_INTRO_4": "{EXCITED:crazydave}是的，我已经安装了防病毒软件！你现在不能攻击我们了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_15_INTRO_5": "{SAY:missinfo}哦，亲爱的。在这里，我要为您提供我们全新系列产品的折扣作为道歉！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_15_INTRO_6": "{SAY:missinfo}您是否曾经想要一台势不可挡的杀人机器来满足您所有的邪恶需求？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_15_INTRO_7": "{SAY:crazydave}什么？不！我们不是邪恶的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_15_INTRO_8": "{SAY:missinfo}也许我可以通过现场演示让您感兴趣！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_15_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，大量威胁传入。 Z-Mech 逼近。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_15_INTRO_10": "{SAY:missinfo}这一次，是货真价实的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_15_INTRO_11": "{TIRED:crazydave}哦不，又不是他了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_15_INTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}我还检测到了更多干扰。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_15_INTRO_13": "{SAY:winnie}准备好，用户戴夫。事情即将变得混乱。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_15_INTRO_14": "{SAY:missinfo}下次再见，各位！请记住——",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_01_ZCORP_15_INTRO_15": "{SAY:missinfo}投资僵企的股票！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_1_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}哇哦，朋朋！你看一下，今天是中国新年！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_1_INTRO_2": "{SAY:crazydave}他们有自己的西方世界的日历系统！正确的？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_1_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}....正确，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_1_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}抱歉。有时候，看到你记得我教过你的事情，真是令人惊讶。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_1_INTRO_5": "{SAY:crazydave}仍然不明白为什么僵尸会庆祝它。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_1_INTRO_6": "{SAY:crazydave}我们确定他们不是中国人吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_1_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}那件事无关紧要，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_1_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}这样的文化交流都是围绕净积极的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_1_INTRO_9": "{SAY:crazydave}说到净积极值——那家伙真的很有钱吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_1_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}正在扫描……",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_1_INTRO_11": "{SAY:winnie}摇钱树僵尸会定期在 3x3 区域内投掷元宝，每次投掷最多 3 个。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_1_INTRO_12": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}他们说钱不会长在树上！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_1_INTRO_13": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}显然他们没有去过禅园！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_2_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:crazydave}朋朋，我才意识到！新年到了，我有话要对你们说。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_2_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}这是什么，用户戴夫？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_2_INTRO_3": "{SAY:crazydave}我只想说这是很棒的一年！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_2_INTRO_4": "{SAY:crazydave}我很幸运有你全程陪伴！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_2_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}....",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_2_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}谢谢你，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_2_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}这似乎有点突然，但我还是很欣赏这种情绪。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_2_INTRO_8": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}我们是一个很好的团队，朋朋！毕竟，好事成双！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_2_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}确实如此。虽然这个表情似乎有些适合这个场合。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_2_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}我今天在僵尸威胁中检测到有趣的匹配，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_2_INTRO_11": "{SAY:crazydave}是这样吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_2_INTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}僵尸似乎已经创造了有益的配对来超越我们的防御。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_2_INTRO_13": "{SAY:winnie}鉴于他们通常太愚蠢而无法利用这样的优势，我怀疑有什么事情正在发生。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_2_INTRO_14": "{SAY:crazydave}嘿，谁知道呢？也许今年除夕夜星星齐齐，朋朋-",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_2_INTRO_15": "{SAY:crazydave}——僵尸们完全是出于……运气好才编队。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_4_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{TIRED:crazydave}呃..今天不知为何感觉很沉闷，朋朋。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_4_INTRO_2": "{SAY:crazydave}几乎如果有什么不好的事情即将发生。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_4_INTRO_3": "{EXCITED:winnie}相反，用户戴夫。看来今天对我们来说是一件幸运的事情。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_4_INTRO_4": "{EXCITED:crazydave}哦，真的吗？开始发红包了吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_4_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}负。但今天草坪的布局似乎对我们有利。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_4_INTRO_6": "{EXCITED:winnie}有了这个设定，僵尸就会走向死亡！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_4_INTRO_7": "{SAY:crazydave}所以...我们的工作量减少了？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_4_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}最有可能。这些陷阱瓷砖将被证明是坚不可摧的防御。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_4_INTRO_9": "{TIRED:crazydave}似乎还是有些不对劲……如果我是你，邻居，我会小心的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_6_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}检测到新威胁，用户戴夫。舞狮僵尸逼近。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_6_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}它们喷出不灭的火焰，在短距离内杀死植物。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_6_INTRO_3": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}哇，这些僵尸今年更加热衷于庆祝活动！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_6_INTRO_4": "{SAY:crazydave}但是这些家伙去年根本就不在！有什么不对劲...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_6_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}你的担忧可能有一定的道理，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_6_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}我感觉到一些可疑的模式，似乎对僵尸非常有利。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_6_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}优势布局，新威胁……",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_6_INTRO_8": "{SAY:crazydave}你几乎可以说他们非常-",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_6_INTRO_9": "{NPC_ENTER:lucky}{SAY:lucky}...非常幸运，现在看到了吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_6_INTRO_10": "{SAY:crazydave}什么-？朋朋，这是谁？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_6_INTRO_11": "{SAY:lucky}早上好小伙子们。另一个粉丝正在制作中，瞧！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_6_INTRO_12": "{SAY:lucky}您想了解更多关于我的信息，是吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_6_INTRO_13": "{SAY:crazydave}嗯，我只是-",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_6_INTRO_14": "{SAY:lucky}那就别害怕，我的好小伙子！ A，Lucky，会安排你收到一本我的自传！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_6_INTRO_15": "{SAY:crazydave}哎呀！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_6_INTRO_16": "{SAY:crazydave}朋朋，这本书是从天上掉下来的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_6_INTRO_17": "{SAY:lucky}啊，是这样吗？现在发生这样的事情对你来说真是太幸运了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_6_INTRO_18": "{TIRED:winnie}我们已经反复经历过这个事情了。幸运先生，你的动机是什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_6_INTRO_19": "{SAY:lucky}动机？哎呀，只是想对我大发雷霆，仅此而已！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_6_INTRO_20": "{SAY:lucky}啊’被我的仰慕者许诺了一顿丰盛的晚餐——但是，A相信你可能会坚持下去。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_6_INTRO_21": "{SAY:lucky}我预计在烟花开始时我会得到一顿饭。 G'wan，砍掉它，我的好家伙！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_6_INTRO_22": "{NPC_EXIT:lucky}{SAY:crazydave}什么？我不记得告诉过那个人我们要给他做晚饭！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_6_INTRO_23": "{TIRED:winnie}他指的是你的大脑，用户戴夫。他想要把你的大脑放在盘子里。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_7_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:crazydave}哇，朋朋——这个幸运儿似乎已经做到了一切！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_7_INTRO_2": "{EXCITED:crazydave}他的自传说他已经走遍了世界各地，从埃及到了西部荒野！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_7_INTRO_3": "{EXCITED:crazydave}并且他一手阻止了僵王将人们困在永恒假期的邪恶计划！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_7_INTRO_4": "{TIRED:winnie}用户戴夫，这明显是Lucky自己写的自我夸大的描述。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_7_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}大多数这些说法都被证明是错误的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_7_INTRO_6": "{SAY:crazydave}你怎么知道，朋朋？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_7_INTRO_7": "{TIRED:winnie}需要我提醒你，我们是阻止僵王邪恶节日主题计划的人。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_7_INTRO_8": "{SAY:crazydave}也许他在我们不知情的情况下又做了一次？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_7_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}尽管他在那本令人讨厌的自吹自擂的书中给出了所有的解释——",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_7_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}我仍然看不出他有什么品质能让他成为如此优秀的战略家。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_7_INTRO_11": "{SAY:winnie}他能做什么才能让僵尸比我们拥有如此巨大的战术优势？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_7_INTRO_12": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}完成了吗？他什么都不用做，朋朋！他就是这么幸运！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_7_INTRO_13": "{SAY:winnie}假设被拒绝。这里一定有什么我们没有看到的东西。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_7_INTRO_14": "{SAY:crazydave}你说得对，朋朋。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_7_INTRO_15": "{SAY:crazydave}今天有事。我感觉有人在看着我！难道是——",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_7_INTRO_16": "{SAY:winnie}是的，用户戴夫。我们似乎身处幽灵之中。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_7_INTRO_17": "{SAY:crazydave}恐怖！我听说过这个！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_7_INTRO_18": "{SAY:crazydave}中国文化将七月视为“鬼月”！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_7_INTRO_19": "{SAY:crazydave}今天是庆祝活动的第七天！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_7_INTRO_20": "{SAY:winnie}....",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_7_INTRO_21": "{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，你介意带我去你听说过的地方吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_9_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:lucky}{EXCITED:crazydave}看，朋朋！又是他！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_9_INTRO_2": "{SAY:lucky}啊，很高兴见到新的崇拜者！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_9_INTRO_3": "{SAY:crazydave}好谦虚的家伙！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_9_INTRO_4": "{TIRED:winnie}用户戴夫...不要被他浅薄的言辞和轻易的阿谀奉承所迷惑。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_9_INTRO_5": "{SAY:lucky}Ah'今天出现，让我亲爱的追随者们看到他们是国王和骑士！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_9_INTRO_6": "{SAY:lucky}就像啊’在我的新书中写到的——“如何‘亲近’成为像我这样的人！”",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_9_INTRO_7": "{SAY:lucky}通过购买它 - 你将学会成为像 A 一样的半个伟大领袖！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_9_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}是这样吗？成为一名成功的领导者是您的野心吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_9_INTRO_9": "{SAY:lucky}野心？我姑娘——已经很苍白了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_9_INTRO_10": "{SAY:lucky}不像其他某个统治者扮演蛆虫——我的臣民如此爱我！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_9_INTRO_11": "{SAY:winnie}你是在说僵王吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_9_INTRO_12": "{SAY:lucky}是？为什么，A绝不会说我们伟大领袖的坏话——",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_9_INTRO_13": "{SAY:lucky}但是在某个时刻-应该有人告诉皇帝他没有穿衣服。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_9_INTRO_14": "{NPC_EXIT:lucky}{SAY:crazydave}真是个家伙！对吧，朋朋？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_9_INTRO_15": "{SAY:winnie}确实，用户戴夫。真是个家伙啊。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_12_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:winnie}用户戴夫，我破解了图案！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_12_INTRO_2": "{SAY:crazydave}模式？什么图案，朋朋？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_12_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}在这些庆祝活动中表现出来的有利模式。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_12_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}看来这个节日带有一些神奇的属性，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_12_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}具体来说，关于数字。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_12_INTRO_6": "{SAY:crazydave}数字？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_12_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}四在中国文化中被认为是一个不好的数字。与厄运和死亡有关。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_12_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}你还记得庆祝活动第四天用户戴夫发生了什么吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_12_INTRO_9": "{SAY:crazydave}僵尸走向自己的死亡.. 等等，那真是太不幸了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_12_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}第八天对于僵尸来说是无端的幸运，有这么多的财富可供他们支配——",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_12_INTRO_11": "{SAY:winnie}-这个数字与财富和运气有关！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_12_INTRO_12": "{EXCITED:winnie}所以你看！ Lucky的“幸运”，正是源于这个节日的神奇属性！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_12_INTRO_13": "{EXCITED:winnie}这不仅仅是一些“愚蠢的运气！” 不，是数字和图案！极其可计算！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_12_INTRO_14": "{PLAYFUL:winnie}幸运先生这个评价对吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_12_INTRO_15": "{NPC_ENTER:lucky}{SAY:lucky}.....",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_12_INTRO_16": "{SAY:lucky}G'way outta，姑娘！啊，不知道你在说什么！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_12_INTRO_17": "{SAY:crazydave}所以他的运气只取决于日子？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_12_INTRO_18": "{EXCITED:winnie}事实证明是这样！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_12_INTRO_19": "{SAY:lucky}公平竞赛，姑娘！对你们来说不幸的是，今天是第十二个，两个六的总和！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_12_INTRO_20": "{SAY:lucky}6 是幸运的一天！因此——今天是最幸运的一天！颤抖、哭泣！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_12_INTRO_21": "{SAY:winnie}其实，12在中国文化中并没有什么吉利的意思。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_12_INTRO_22": "{SAY:winnie}今天，你就没有“运气”来救你了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_12_INTRO_23": "{SAY:lucky}....",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_12_INTRO_24": "{SAY:lucky}该死！曼奇假期！一年一次，我的运气就变坏了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_12_INTRO_25": "{NPC_EXIT:lucky}{SAY:crazydave}朋朋，他要走了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_12_INTRO_26": "{SAY:winnie}追他，用户戴夫！在这天重置他的运气之前！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_13_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:lucky}{EXCITED:crazydave}我们把他逼到了绝境，朋朋- 尽管如此，还是在第十三天！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_13_INTRO_2": "{SAY:crazydave}13 是最不吉利的数字吧？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_13_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}不幸的是，这个数字在中国文化中没有相同的含义。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_13_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}甚至可以说是一个幸运数字。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_13_INTRO_5": "{SAY:lucky}啊哈，形势逆转了，小伙子们！现在我们吸柴油！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_13_INTRO_6": "{SAY:lucky}我们看这里- 13、财富-增长、活力。有利于商业交易-",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_13_INTRO_7": "{SAY:lucky}啊，多么幸运——A 和我达成了关于你要经历的交易。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_13_INTRO_8": "{SAY:lucky}只要再坚持一天就好了-",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_13_INTRO_9": "{NPC_EXIT:lucky}{SAY:crazydave}他逃走了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_13_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}他跑不了多久了，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_13_INTRO_11": "{SAY:winnie}14 被认为比典型的 4 更不吉利。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_13_INTRO_12": "{SAY:crazydave}所以如果我们今天不击败他-",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_13_INTRO_13": "{EXCITED:winnie}-明天我们一定能打败他！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_14_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:lucky}{EXCITED:winnie}结束了，Lucky！投降或面对我们植物的力量！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_14_INTRO_2": "{SAY:crazydave}是啊，咀嚼者现在真的很饿了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_14_INTRO_3": "{SAY:lucky}投降？ A 应该是告诉你们这些的 wan，你们这些混蛋！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_14_INTRO_4": "{SAY:crazydave}嗯？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_14_INTRO_5": "{SAY:lucky}你们没有感觉到大地在震动吗？你们正面临着命运本身——",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_14_INTRO_6": "{SAY:lucky}来吧，财富和繁荣就在我们身上，僵尸们！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_14_INTRO_7": "{SAY:crazydave}朋朋，发生什么事了？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_14_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}扫描中......",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_14_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}新威胁传入，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_14_INTRO_10": "{SAY:lucky}财神亲自降临在我们身上！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_14_INTRO_11": "{SHOUT:crazydave}神？你是怎么做到的！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_14_INTRO_12": "{SAY:lucky}哈哈哈，小伙子们——也许答案一直很简单。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_14_INTRO_13": "{SAY:lucky}A 就是这么幸运。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_14_INTRO_14": "{NPC_EXIT:lucky}{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，鉴于此威胁的性质，我无法提供足够的情报。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_14_INTRO_15": "{SAY:crazydave}没关系朋朋！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_14_INTRO_16": "{EXCITED:crazydave}人们都说幸运眷顾勇敢的人——所以是时候考验我们的运气了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_VALENBRAINZ_1_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:crazydave}男孩，哦男孩！又到了吃巧克力的季节了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_VALENBRAINZ_1_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}除其他外，是的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_VALENBRAINZ_1_INTRO_3": "{SAY:crazydave}是的！你不就是喜欢它吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_VALENBRAINZ_1_INTRO_4": "{SAY:crazydave}这是我最喜欢的食物......除了炸玉米饼。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_VALENBRAINZ_1_INTRO_5": "{EXCITED:crazydave}巧克力夹心炸玉米饼...嗯...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_VALENBRAINZ_1_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}庆祝“爱”的概念怎么样，用户戴夫？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_VALENBRAINZ_1_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}数据表明这才是本次活动的真正目的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_VALENBRAINZ_1_INTRO_8": "{SAY:crazydave}“爱”是给傻瓜的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_VALENBRAINZ_1_INTRO_9": "{SAY:crazydave}你看不到它，你摸不到它！有什么好处呢？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_VALENBRAINZ_1_INTRO_10": "{SAY:crazydave}我就是为了那些美味的糖果，没有比这更好的了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_VALENBRAINZ_1_INTRO_11": "{SAY:crazydave}它们融化并释放糖分的方式......嗯......",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_VALENBRAINZ_1_INTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}注意不要太看重物质财富，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_VALENBRAINZ_1_INTRO_13": "{SAY:winnie}往下走可能是一条危险的路。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_VALENBRAINZ_1_INTRO_14": "{SAY:crazydave}说朋朋，我感觉我忘记了什么……",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_VALENBRAINZ_1_INTRO_15": "{SAY:crazydave}哦，大概就是我们需要对付的那些僵尸吧！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_VALENBRAINZ_1_INTRO_16": "{SAY:crazydave}他们可能想偷我的糖果！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_VALENBRAINZ_2_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:crazydave}是的！我的糖果受到保护了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_VALENBRAINZ_2_INTRO_2": "{SAY:crazydave}虽然……我还是感觉好像忘记了什么。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_VALENBRAINZ_2_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，你的直觉可能是对的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_VALENBRAINZ_2_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}季节性植物都在吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_VALENBRAINZ_2_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}请允许我重新叙述一下。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_VALENBRAINZ_2_INTRO_6": "{SAY:crazydave}朋朋，等等！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_VALENBRAINZ_2_INTRO_7": "{SAY:crazydave}热门约会不见了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_VALENBRAINZ_2_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}你是对的，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_VALENBRAINZ_2_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}这是一个奇怪的情况。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_VALENBRAINZ_2_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}正在扫描……",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_VALENBRAINZ_2_INTRO_11": "{SAY:winnie}我无法找到您所在地区的任何热门日期。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_VALENBRAINZ_2_INTRO_12": "{SAY:crazydave}太可怕了！平时他们都在啊！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_VALENBRAINZ_2_INTRO_13": "{SAY:winnie}也许他们迷路了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_VALENBRAINZ_2_INTRO_14": "{SAY:winnie}在这波僵尸浪潮之后，我们将尝试寻找他们。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_VALENBRAINZ_3_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{TIRED:crazydave}哇…已经是晚上了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_VALENBRAINZ_3_INTRO_2": "{SAY:crazydave}幸好巧克力一直让我保持活力。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_VALENBRAINZ_3_INTRO_3": "{EXCITED:crazydave}正好证明大量的糖对你来说有多好！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_VALENBRAINZ_3_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}我不确定该说法的科学有效性。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_VALENBRAINZ_3_INTRO_5": "{SAY:crazydave}我已经等不及最终拿到豪华包装了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_VALENBRAINZ_3_INTRO_6": "{SAY:crazydave}全新口味！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_VALENBRAINZ_3_INTRO_7": "{SAY:crazydave}已经卖完​​了，到处都找不到！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_VALENBRAINZ_3_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}更重要的是，我们找不到任何热门日期。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_VALENBRAINZ_3_INTRO_9": "{SAY:crazydave}是啊，奇怪……",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_VALENBRAINZ_3_INTRO_10": "{SAY:crazydave}我知道热门约会！他们不会错过这个世界假期！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_VALENBRAINZ_3_INTRO_11": "{SAY:crazydave}我不知道，朋朋。我觉得这件事有点臭。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_VALENBRAINZ_3_INTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}确实，这开始感觉像个谜。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_VALENBRAINZ_3_INTRO_13": "{SAY:crazydave}这是我们要追查到底的一个！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_VALENBRAINZ_4_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}嘿，朋朋。你有没有注意到最近出现了很多僵尸？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_VALENBRAINZ_4_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}其实我有，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_VALENBRAINZ_4_INTRO_3": "{SAY:crazydave}有些东西告诉我那是不对的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_VALENBRAINZ_4_INTRO_4": "{SAY:crazydave}你之前说过爱情那些事。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_VALENBRAINZ_4_INTRO_5": "{SAY:crazydave}他们不是要庆祝吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_VALENBRAINZ_4_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}观察力好，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_02_VALENBRAINZ_4_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}越来越多的野蛮僵尸出现，这确实看起来很奇怪。",
