  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_3_INTRO_8": "{TIRED:crazydave}传送带坏了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_3_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}我隐隐怀疑这可能是故意的，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_3_INTRO_10": "{SAY:crazydave}你是什么意思，朋朋？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_3_INTRO_11": "{SAY:winnie}有一些外力在起作用。一个非常幸运的人。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_5_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，我很遗憾地通知你，我几天前的警告被证明是真的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_5_INTRO_2": "{NPC_ENTER:lucky}{SAY:lucky}小伙子们，怎么了？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_5_INTRO_3": "{TIRED:crazydave}哦，又是这个家伙。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_5_INTRO_4": "{SAY:lucky}好多年没见过你们这些家伙了！难道你没有想念我吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_5_INTRO_5": "{SAY:crazydave}我以为今年应该是蛇年呢！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_5_INTRO_6": "{SAY:lucky}不，这就是伙计们。这意味着在远方见不到你们！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_5_INTRO_7": "{SAY:crazydave}什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_5_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}我们能抛开欺骗吗？幸运儿，你在做什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_5_INTRO_9": "{SAY:lucky}Ar，我们这些邪教现在很少见到晴天了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_5_INTRO_10": "{SAY:lucky}现在只是出去晒日光浴！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_5_INTRO_11": "{SAY:lucky}也许你介意加入？给它一鞭子！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_5_INTRO_12": "{NPC_EXIT:lucky}{SAY:crazydave}为什么，当然，如果你坚持的话-",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_5_INTRO_13": "{SAY:winnie}我必须在那里阻止你，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_5_INTRO_14": "{SAY:winnie}Lucky没有提到的是今天的阳光被污染了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_5_INTRO_15": "{SAY:crazydave}哦，对了。我应该预见到这一点。阳光通常不是紫色的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_5_INTRO_16": "{SAY:winnie}巧合的是，我们的植物受到阳光炸弹的伤害似乎比平时要多——",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_5_INTRO_17": "{SAY:winnie}-同时僵尸受到的伤害减少。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_5_INTRO_18": "{SAY:winnie}果然Lucky的运气对我们不利。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_5_INTRO_19": "{SAY:crazydave}你永远不知道这个幸运儿会带来什么！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_6_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，我的传感器报告异常的僵尸活动。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_6_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}他们好像偷了我们的铲子。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_6_INTRO_3": "{SAY:crazydave}现在是什么情况？他们为什么这么做？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_6_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}您可能知道，您邻居的草坪曾进行过多次失败的实验。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_6_INTRO_5": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}啊，来自老板！我们在纽约没见过他！他现在在做什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_6_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}僵尸们似乎正在挖掘这些“失败的实验”的遗迹。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_6_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}特别是，他们似乎对恢复特定的一个非常感兴趣。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_6_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}也就是说，僵王博士'摧毁了运气机器。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_6_INTRO_9": "{SAY:crazydave}去年的？他们为什么要恢复它？我以为机器坏了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_6_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}数据不足，无法得出结论。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_6_INTRO_11": "{SAY:winnie}假设：我们，以及推而广之，僵王博士，可能没有考虑到一个变量-",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_6_INTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}——以一只特别幸运的僵尸的形式出现。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_6_INTRO_13": "{EXCITED:crazydave}你是说僵尸正在试图重建运气机器？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_6_INTRO_14": "{EXCITED:crazydave}他们会用Lucky作为动力源？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_6_INTRO_15": "{SAY:winnie}正如之前所证实的，尚未找到确凿的证据支持这一点。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_6_INTRO_16": "{SAY:winnie}但是，我建议谨慎。保持警惕。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_6_INTRO_17": "{SAY:winnie}今天僵尸会不断移动植物以加快挖掘速度。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_6_INTRO_18": "{SAY:crazydave}注意你站的地方！他们可能会用我们的铲子在你下面挖一个洞！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_7_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:lucky}{SAY:lucky}嘿，伙计们！你知道我们这些海盗有什么共同点吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_7_INTRO_2": "{SAY:lucky}我们喜欢每晚都用睫毛！干草了，我们早上起得很早！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_7_INTRO_3": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{PLAYFUL:crazydave}但是，你会怎么处理醉酒的水手呢？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_7_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}我的扫描仪显示这些船只上没有常见的海盗僵尸。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_7_INTRO_5": "{SAY:lucky}是的，你现在拥有了一辆强大的智能汽车，伙计。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_7_INTRO_6": "{SAY:lucky}啊，说到约会，我不寒而栗——但是你看，今天是 13 号星期五！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_7_INTRO_7": "{SAY:crazydave}运气不好！等等，这对我们有好处，还是对你有好处？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_7_INTRO_8": "{SAY:lucky}Ar，别再缠着我了，小伙子。这次没有数字游戏！整个月都很幸运！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_7_INTRO_9": "{SAY:lucky}不，13号星期五意味着这艘可怕的船一年中只有一次！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_7_INTRO_10": "{SAY:crazydave}T——这是一艘幽灵船？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_7_INTRO_11": "{SAY:lucky}鬼魂、食尸鬼、僵尸！我们内心都是同样的泥沼！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_7_INTRO_12": "{SAY:lucky}小伙子们，运气如何？总是需要更多的人来帮助你！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_7_INTRO_13": "{SAY:lucky}G'wan，我的女士们，把他们的大脑放在一个脾气暴躁的盘子里给我！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_7_INTRO_14": "{NPC_EXIT:lucky}{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，我怀疑Lucky带我们来到这艘鬼船是有更邪恶的目的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_7_INTRO_15": "{TIRED:crazydave}所以他不只是想让我们被鬼吃掉？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_7_INTRO_16": "{SAY:winnie}不，我的直觉告诉我，这是一种干扰。幸运儿正在把他的人带到别处。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_7_INTRO_17": "{SAY:winnie}看来丧尸还在继续挖掘工作。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_7_INTRO_18": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}哦，有道理！他正在雇佣海盗来挖掘宝藏！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_7_INTRO_19": "{SAY:crazydave}等等，那么Lucky就是挖运气机器的人吗？不是老板？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_7_INTRO_20": "{SAY:winnie}所有证据都表明是的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_7_INTRO_21": "{SAY:crazydave}但是他为什么需要运气机器呢？他已经很幸运了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_7_INTRO_22": "{SAY:winnie}还有待观察。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_8_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:lucky}{SAY:lucky}你们知道吗，小伙子们？与我的运气作斗争不可能是一场公平的比赛。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_8_INTRO_2": "{SAY:lucky}所以这是我的礼物，你——你最伟大的士兵！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_8_INTRO_3": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_EXIT:lucky}{SAY:crazydave}他离开了我们冰西瓜s？多好啊！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_8_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}然而，问题是他把它们放在了不利的位置。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_8_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}此外，在焦油之上。不用说，它们毫无用处。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_8_INTRO_6": "{EXCITED:crazydave}别担心朋朋！你没听说过吗？尽管有这些削弱，他们仍然会融化部落！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_8_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}无论多么强大，放在tar上都起不到任何作用，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_8_INTRO_8": "{TIRED:crazydave}该死，真的吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_8_INTRO_9": "{TIRED:crazydave}这就是我一直在说的，朋朋！即便如此强大——",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_8_INTRO_10": "{SAY:crazydave}-生活又遇到了障碍！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_8_INTRO_11": "{SAY:crazydave}这些冰西瓜对自己的命运无能为力！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_8_INTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}....",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_8_INTRO_13": "{SAY:winnie}无力对抗自己的命运..？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_8_INTRO_14": "{SAY:crazydave}怎么了，朋朋？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_8_INTRO_15": "{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，我想我刚刚意识到了一些事情。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_8_INTRO_16": "{SAY:crazydave}这是什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_8_INTRO_17": "{SAY:winnie}需要进一步调查。请原谅我一下。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_9_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}展现自己，幸运！我们已经发现你的真实意图了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_9_INTRO_2": "{NPC_ENTER:lucky}{SAY:lucky}姑娘，这是什么故事？晚上可不是大喊大叫的时候！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_9_INTRO_3": "{SAY:lucky}是时候用勺子涂抹睫毛了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_9_INTRO_4": "{SAY:crazydave}我们知道您正在重建老板的幸运机器！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_9_INTRO_5": "{SAY:lucky}别再缠着我了，小伙子！为什么需要一些肮脏的装置？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_9_INTRO_6": "{SAY:lucky}啊，祝你好运！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_9_INTRO_7": "{PLAYFUL:winnie}借用一句话，你运气不好，Lucky。确实如此。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_9_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}我一开始把它搞反了-",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_9_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}你并没有重建这台机器并利用你的运气作为它的力量！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_9_INTRO_10": "{EXCITED:winnie}这台机器不需要你，你需要这台机器！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_9_INTRO_11": "{SAY:lucky}啊'-哇-",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_9_INTRO_12": "{SAY:lucky}汽车会变长吗？她自己在抱怨什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_9_INTRO_13": "{SAY:crazydave}朋朋是说你这么幸运的原因-",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_9_INTRO_14": "{EXCITED:winnie}——就是因为那台破机器！当它爆炸的时候，积累的运气就得去某个地方了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_9_INTRO_15": "{PLAYFUL:winnie}恰巧，在那次事件发生后的某个时候，突然出现了一只幸运的僵尸。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_9_INTRO_16": "{SAY:lucky}太聪明了，为自己好，你们很多。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_9_INTRO_17": "{SAY:lucky}公平竞争，小伙子们。你抓住了我。我的运气就是这个邪恶枷锁的作用。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_9_INTRO_18": "{SAY:lucky}A 还剩下点运气。啊'用它来恢复它，然后啊'再次幸运！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_9_INTRO_19": "{SAY:crazydave}你最终会耗尽运气汁——然后你将不得不再次重复使用它！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_9_INTRO_20": "{TIRED:crazydave}如果你这么依赖运气，你真的能掌控自己的命运吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_9_INTRO_21": "{SAY:lucky}Ar，别对我耍小聪明，哎呀！我不会回去当一个卑鄙的沼泽！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_9_INTRO_22": "{SAY:lucky}谁说A'得到的只是我的运气？我还有一些伎俩-",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_9_INTRO_23": "{SAY:lucky}做个骗子是有代价的，有这些花招——你们现在永远抓不到我了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_10_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:lucky}{SAY:lucky}游戏结束了，小伙子们。幸运依然站在我这一边！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_10_INTRO_2": "{TIRED:crazydave}朋朋，我们该怎么办？他成功地重建了机器，恢复了他的运气！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_10_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}别担心，用户戴夫。我们还是有能力打败他的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_10_INTRO_4": "{TIRED:crazydave}但是——",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_10_INTRO_5": "{SAY:lucky}啊，对你的评价很有信心哦，姑娘？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_10_INTRO_6": "{SAY:lucky}你们很多人都在谈论我的秘密。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_10_INTRO_7": "{SAY:lucky}所以这就是你的终结！让我们看看你的运气对我的影响如何！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_10_INTRO_8": "{NPC_EXIT:lucky}{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，我正在检测即将发生的大规模攻击。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_10_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}Lucky 对他的崇拜者发挥了他的影响力和权威，让他们追随我们。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_10_INTRO_10": "{TIRED:crazydave}呃，哦——不好！我们该怎么办？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_10_INTRO_11": "{SAY:crazydave}运气好的话，他可以向我们扔任何东西！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_10_INTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}好吧，用户戴夫，虽然他有超自然的运气，但他也受到运气的摆布。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_10_INTRO_13": "{SAY:winnie}我们还有他的运气永远无法提供的东西。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_10_INTRO_14": "{SAY:crazydave}那是什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_10_INTRO_15": "{PLAYFUL:winnie}与他不同，我们是自己命运的主人。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_10_INTRO_16": "{EXCITED:winnie}无论他的运气如何，我们都能适应！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_10_INTRO_17": "{EXCITED:crazydave}你知道吗？你说得对，朋朋！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_10_INTRO_18": "{EXCITED:crazydave}来吧，邻居，让我们向这个骗子证明，运气只能让他走这么远！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_1_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{EXCITED:crazydave}朋朋，紧急！红色警报！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_1_INTRO_2": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}这次是什么用户戴夫？红色警报可不是闹着玩的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_1_INTRO_3": "{TIRED:crazydave}好像有人……",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_1_INTRO_4": "{TIRED:crazydave}呃……我不知道还能怎么说——拉屎了……？在我们的草坪上。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_1_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}扫描中......",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_1_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}放心，用户戴夫。那不是排泄物。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_1_INTRO_7": "{SAY:crazydave}但是还有什么会是这样的呢？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_1_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}我的扫描仪检测到糖的痕迹..还有可可。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_1_INTRO_9": "{SAY:crazydave}巧克力！等等，谁会把一堆巧克力倒在我们的草坪上？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_1_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}不清楚。然而，显而易见的是，这些巧克力......",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_1_INTRO_11": "{SAY:winnie}...正在吸引爱吃甜食的僵尸来到我们的草坪上。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_1_INTRO_12": "{SAY:crazydave}嘿，如果它在我们的草坪上，它就是我们的！五分钟规则！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_2_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}今天的天气预报刚刚出来。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_2_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}预计下午多云-",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_2_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}-有机会获得巧克力。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_4_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}朋朋，这些巧克力根本停不下来！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_4_INTRO_2": "{SAY:crazydave}一般我不会抱怨，我喜欢巧克力！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_4_INTRO_3": "{SAY:crazydave}电影让从天而降的食物看起来非常美味！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_4_INTRO_4": "{TIRED:crazydave}他们没告诉你的是会有多少蚂蚁爬来爬去。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_4_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}确实令人困惑。甜食通常不会从天而降。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_4_INTRO_6": "{SAY:crazydave}我们是否惹怒了复活节兔子？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_4_INTRO_7": "{TIRED:winnie}复活节兔子是一个神话人物，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_4_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}然而，不是神话人物的是我们遇到的众多僵尸敌人。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_4_INTRO_9": "{SAY:crazydave}倒吸一口气！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_4_INTRO_10": "{SAY:crazydave}你认为这是那些疯子的计划之一吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_4_INTRO_11": "{SAY:winnie}很有可能。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_4_INTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}这就是为什么我建议你今天不要打开草坪上的任何礼物。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_4_INTRO_13": "{SAY:winnie}内容很可能都是一样的——一个吃脑的怪物。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_6_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}朋朋，我们需要找出是谁在制造这些巧克力雨！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_6_INTRO_2": "{TIRED:crazydave}与正常的降雨不同，它们让植物很不高兴！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_6_INTRO_3": "{EXCITED:winnie}Affirmative, 用户戴夫. 我已经做了自己的研究和计算。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_6_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}根据所有可用数据，我可以安全地缩小嫌疑人范围-",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_6_INTRO_5": "{SAY:crazydave}Who are those?",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_6_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}巧克力的丰富表明与巧克力盛行的另一个节日有关。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_6_INTRO_7": "{SAY:crazydave}You mean Valenbrainz? 这是否意味着——",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_6_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}贪婪可能会参与这个特定的方案，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_6_INTRO_9": "{TIRED:crazydave}I seriously hope it's not him! I can't stand the smell of those perfumes-",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_6_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}或者，看到我们痛苦的反应可能会给一些观众带来幽默。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_6_INTRO_11": "{SAY:crazydave}谁愿意对我们的痛苦反应做出反应？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_6_INTRO_12": "{SAY:crazydave}Oh, wait-",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_6_INTRO_13": "{SAY:winnie}Zombert 可能是在恶作剧，并为他的频道拍摄我们的反应。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_6_INTRO_14": "{SAY:crazydave}我从来没有同意出现在他的视频中！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_6_INTRO_15": "{SAY:crazydave}So is it Zombert, then?",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_6_INTRO_16": "{SAY:winnie}扫描中......",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_6_INTRO_17": "{SAY:winnie}太多变数，目前还无法得出固定的结论。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_6_INTRO_18": "{SAY:winnie}请等我仔细阅读相关资料来确定。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_7_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}我们现在有麻烦了，朋朋！ Those Void Orchids are endangered!",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_7_INTRO_2": "{TIRED:crazydave}谁知道在这个不可预测的时代他们会发生什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_7_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}最有可能的结果是他们被巧克力覆盖，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_7_INTRO_4": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我刚刚意识到更糟糕的事情，朋朋！ Those Void Orchids might panic!",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_7_INTRO_5": "{EXCITED:crazydave}然后他们就无法区分僵尸和巧克力了，而且——",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_7_INTRO_6": "{TIRED:crazydave}然后他们就会随意制造漩涡，吸引更多的僵尸！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_7_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}是的，那会很麻烦，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_7_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}今天的策略推荐强力防守。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_7_INTRO_9": "{SAY:crazydave}这些虚空兰竟然陷入这样的境地，真是太倒霉了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_7_INTRO_10": "{SAY:crazydave}Wait, luck! 这是否意味着——",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_7_INTRO_11": "{SAY:winnie}我们不能排除任何人，用户戴夫。 It's possible Lucky is involved.",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_7_INTRO_12": "{SAY:crazydave}So it's Lucky?",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_7_INTRO_13": "{SAY:winnie}仍然没有足够的数据来得出结论。 But I believe one more scan would suffice.",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_7_INTRO_14": "{SAY:winnie}请像我一样阻挡即将到来的僵尸大军。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_8_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:crazydave}也许——这是恶霸小队的家伙们！这是他们的另一项研究！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_8_INTRO_2": "{EXCITED:winnie}有可能。亨特里亚也可能有罪。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_8_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}她可能希望用巧克力作为诱饵。这是一种古老的狩猎方法。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_8_INTRO_4": "{SAY:crazydave}或者也许——",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_8_INTRO_5": "{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}啊哈哈哈哈哈哈！我又遇到你们这些讨厌的时间跳跃者了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_8_INTRO_6": "{SAY:zombossicon}你享受过令人愉快的恶魔计划吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_8_INTRO_7": "{SAY:zombossicon}巧克力炸弹！老僵王家庭食谱！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_8_INTRO_8": "{SAY:crazydave}....",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_8_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}....",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_8_INTRO_10": "{SAY:crazydave}哦。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_8_INTRO_11": "{SAY:winnie}看来我们没有考虑另一个可能的嫌疑人，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_8_INTRO_12": "{SAY:zombossicon}这——这是什么？你们两个怎么了？你好？我刚刚用巧克力轰炸了你！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_8_INTRO_13": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}哦，没什么，老板！我们只是没想到你会来，仅此而已。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_8_INTRO_14": "{SAY:zombossicon}没在等我吗？还有谁会用如此美味的糖果来吓唬你？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_8_INTRO_15": "{PLAYFUL:winnie}实际上我们编制了一份清单。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_8_INTRO_16": "{SAY:crazydave}只是..你来得少，所以我们以为是别人！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_8_INTRO_17": "{SAY:zombossicon}还有其他人吗？你是说我的保姆和亨特里亚将军吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_8_INTRO_18": "{SAY:zombossicon}他们只是一次性威胁！我仍然是你最大的敌人！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_8_INTRO_19": "{SAY:zombossicon}什么、你为什么要移开视线！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_8_INTRO_20": "{SAY:zombossicon}别介意这一切！看来你只是需要复习一下！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_8_INTRO_21": "{SAY:zombossicon}我们来吧！经典植物大战僵尸对决！这会让你想起我的威胁！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_9_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}今天的计划，我把我的小鬼僵尸伪装成巨人僵尸！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_9_INTRO_2": "{SAY:zombossicon}尽量保持警惕，MWA-HA-HA！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_9_INTRO_3": "{EXCITED:crazydave}看朋朋，一个基于小鬼僵尸的方案！保姆都写完了不是吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_9_INTRO_4": "{EXCITED:winnie}欺骗手段也是信息小姐作品的商标。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_9_INTRO_5": "{SAY:zombossicon}什么-什么！？那个新闻主播和这有什么关系！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_9_INTRO_6": "{SAY:zombossicon}这是我的方案！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_9_INTRO_7": "{SAY:crazydave}哦，老板。你一直都在那儿吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_9_INTRO_8": "{SAY:zombossicon}.....",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_9_INTRO_9": "{SAY:zombossicon}GRAAAH!!",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_9_INTRO_10": "{NPC_EXIT:zombossicon}{TIRED:crazydave}天哪，他的交易是什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_10_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}所以一切都归结为这一点，大卫。一场适合所有年龄段的战斗！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_10_INTRO_2": "{TIRED:crazydave}哦不，朋朋。看来老板这次是认真的了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_10_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}保持冷静，用户戴夫。我们战胜了更大的胜算。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_10_INTRO_4": "{EXCITED:winnie}即使运气本身对我们不利，我们还是胜利了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_10_INTRO_5": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}对了，朋朋！如果我们能打败Lucky，我们也能打败他！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_10_INTRO_6": "{SAY:zombossicon}太天真了！你——等等！幸运的..？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_10_INTRO_7": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}是啊，你知道的-那个戴着高帽、拄着拐杖的家伙-",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_10_INTRO_8": "{SAY:zombossicon}不，我不知道！你们三个都在做什么，和本周一些常见的恶棍混在一起？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_10_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}从数据上来说，Lucky确实是一个非常强大的敌人。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_10_INTRO_10": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}是啊，我们还和他打了两次！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_10_INTRO_11": "{SAY:zombossicon}两次-？你怎么敢——！我是你最大的敌人！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_10_INTRO_12": "{SAY:crazydave}是这样吗朋朋？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_10_INTRO_13": "{SAY:winnie}根据我更新的威胁排名，僵王博士在我们最大的对手中排名第二。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_10_INTRO_14": "{SAY:zombossicon}什么！？不可能的！我是有史以来最有威胁、最强大的僵尸！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_10_INTRO_15": "{SAY:zombossicon}在你的欺诈名单中谁能打败我？说话吧，机器！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_10_INTRO_16": "{SAY:winnie}....",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_10_INTRO_17": "{SAY:winnie}将军迷彩。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_10_INTRO_18": "{SAY:zombossicon}将军……他！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_10_INTRO_19": "{TIRED:crazydave}他非常可怕。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_10_INTRO_20": "{SAY:zombossicon}哈..哈-哈哈哈哈！他？那个想成为指挥官的人没有我就什么都不是！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_10_INTRO_21": "{SAY:zombossicon}这些愚蠢的戏剧够了！看来你们三个需要提醒一下你们最大的敌人是谁！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_10_INTRO_22": "{SAY:zombossicon}我的巧克力炸弹和小鬼僵尸finities将轻松照顾你！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_10_INTRO_23": "{SAY:zombossicon}而且我不会像你那样全力以赴！可见相比之下，你在我眼里是多么的渺小！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_10_INTRO_24": "{TIRED:winnie}如果你这么说的话。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_10_INTRO_25": "{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，我们需要准备好我们的武器库以进行报复。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_10_INTRO_26": "{SAY:zombossicon}是的，哈哈哈！就这么做吧！我什至不会观看战斗，因为我不在乎！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_10_INTRO_27": "{SAY:zombossicon}我会看向窗外的另一边——那些巨大的..飞艇，挡住了天空。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_10_INTRO_28": "{SAY:zombossicon}该死！为了这个景色我花了很多钱！谁在飞那些东西！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_10_INTRO_29": "{NPC_EXIT:zombossicon}{SAY:crazydave}嘿，朋朋？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_10_INTRO_30": "{SAY:winnie}是的，用户戴夫？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_04_SPRINGENING_10_INTRO_31": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}再次见到老板很高兴吧？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_1_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:crazydave}朋朋，邻居！当心！是老板！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_1_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}防御模式启动。部署豌豆射手s...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_1_INTRO_3": "{SAY:crazydave}你想要什么，老板？你通常不会这么早就暴露自己！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_1_INTRO_4": "{SAY:zombossicon}....",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_1_INTRO_5": "{SAY:zombossicon}让你的马冷静一下，好吗？我的意思是你没有伤害。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_1_INTRO_6": "{SAY:crazydave}嗯？老板，愚人节你迟到了一个月！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_1_INTRO_7": "{SAY:zombossicon}这不是恶作剧！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_1_INTRO_8": "{SAY:zombossicon}去年那场聚会之后，我有时间思考你的感受。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_1_INTRO_9": "{SAY:zombossicon}尽管说出来我很伤心，大卫-你是对的。我决不能执着于过去。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_1_INTRO_10": "{SAY:zombossicon}让我们洗心革面，重新开始吧。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_1_INTRO_11": "{SAY:crazydave}朋朋，这是真的吗？我们在做梦吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_1_INTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}看来不是，用户戴夫。当他说话时，我已经对僵王进行了自己的真相检测扫描。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_1_INTRO_13": "{SAY:zombossicon}看到了吗？没有诡计，也没有欺骗。今年我想要的只是一个简单的庆祝！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_1_INTRO_14": "{SAY:zombossicon}我会把僵尸送到你的草坪上，为这个大日子做准备！期待那个！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_1_INTRO_15": "{NPC_EXIT:zombossicon}{SAY:winnie}这看起来足够真实，用户戴夫，至少根据传感器来看。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_1_INTRO_16": "{SAY:crazydave}那边的僵尸是派对策划者？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_1_INTRO_17": "{SAY:winnie}正确。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_1_INTRO_18": "{TIRED:winnie}但是请注意，僵王博士似乎忘记告诉他的僵尸这是一个庆祝活动..",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_1_INTRO_19": "{TIRED:winnie}...而不是入侵计划。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_1_INTRO_20": "{SAY:crazydave}所以我们今天就只是进行平常的战斗吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_1_INTRO_21": "{SAY:winnie}看来是这样。至少要等到僵王再次出现才能纠正误会。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_1_INTRO_22": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}嘿，往好的方面看，朋朋！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_1_INTRO_23": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}至少我们大家都可以从现在开始翻开新的一页了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_1_INTRO_24": "{EXCITED:crazydave}一起狂欢吧！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_2_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:zombert}{SAY:zombert}哦哇……派对？一切都是为了我……？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_2_INTRO_2": "{SAY:zombert}聊天.... eheueheuheuehe... 你不应该！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_2_INTRO_3": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}呃哦，朋朋。是老板的侄子。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_2_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}正确，用户戴夫。似乎有人不小心告诉了他聚会的事。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_2_INTRO_5": "{SAY:zombert}Brah...我不敢相信今年 unc 居然会给我举办一个派对！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_2_INTRO_6": "{SAY:zombert}通常他会在我生日那天把我扔进一桶酸里……",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_2_INTRO_7": "{TIRED:winnie}Zombert，你似乎误以为僵王为你举办了这个派对。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_2_INTRO_8": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}他没有！今天也是你的生日吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_2_INTRO_9": "{SAY:zombert}你知道各方需要什么，聊天吗？音乐！还有跳舞！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_2_INTRO_10": "{SAY:zombert}我会告诉小队拉起brah...而且我什至会亲自聘请音乐家！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_2_INTRO_11": "{SAY:zombert}我要邀请大家了！这将是有史以来最好的生日......！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_2_INTRO_12": "{NPC_EXIT:zombert}{SAY:crazydave}朋朋，我们该怎么办？我们应该告诉老板吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_2_INTRO_13": "{SAY:winnie}我认为没有必要，用户戴夫。我们可以自己解决这个问题。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_2_INTRO_14": "{SAY:crazydave}所以我们得告诉那些 Neon Mixtape 的家伙滚蛋？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_2_INTRO_15": "{TIRED:crazydave}这并不容易，朋朋！尤其是当他们吵架的时候！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_2_INTRO_16": "{SAY:winnie}这不应该是一个问题，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_2_INTRO_17": "{PLAYFUL:winnie}以我们面对的智力水平，这些丧尸的威胁可能为零。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_3_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:antibullysquad}{SHOUT:antibullysquad}好了好了好了——！看看我们这里有什么，孩子们！一场僵王派对就等着被毁掉！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_3_INTRO_2": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}呵呵呵呵。对他来说是个坏消息！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_3_INTRO_3": "{TIRED:antibullysquad}是啊，你说的是！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_3_INTRO_4": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}是反欺凌小队！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_3_INTRO_5": "{SAY:crazydave}迷路！你没有被邀请参加这个聚会！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_3_INTRO_6": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}恰恰相反，大卫。我们收到了一封字面意义上的邀请来破坏这个聚会！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_3_INTRO_7": "{SAY:crazydave}呃，什么？他们做到了！朋朋，这是怎么发生的？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_3_INTRO_8": "{TIRED:winnie}看来佐伯特所说的“邀请所有人”是认真的，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_3_INTRO_9": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}还有什么比在大家面前羞辱僵王更好的方式来毁掉这个聚会呢？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_3_INTRO_10": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}呵呵。等他上大学的时候，我们就揭露他背后的尴尬秘密！对他来说是个坏消息！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_3_INTRO_11": "{TIRED:antibullysquad}是啊，他说的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_3_INTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}我猜这和香槟有关？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_3_INTRO_13": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}什么——！？你是怎么猜到的，你这群叮当作响的肮脏垃圾？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_3_INTRO_14": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}就在我们说话的时候，你们已经在我们的草坪上放了三打香槟了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_3_INTRO_15": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}哈哈哈哈！你是对的，大卫！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_3_INTRO_16": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}回到大学时，僵王不小心喝了一杯杂牌香槟，导致他在急诊室呆了两周！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_3_INTRO_17": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}所以我们用香槟代替了聚会上的所有茶点！提醒僵王过去的麻烦事！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_3_INTRO_18": "{TIRED:antibullysquad}是啊，他说的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_3_INTRO_19": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}现在我们要做的就是躲在桌子底下看他重演他最糗的记忆！ MWA-哈哈！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_3_INTRO_20": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}你们知道僵王不在这里，对吧？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_3_INTRO_21": "{SAY:winnie}派对要到几天后才能举行。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_3_INTRO_22": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}什么？所以他根本不在这里！？记起！记起！把香槟收回来！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_3_INTRO_23": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}呃哦，高跷老板...僵王'男人们已经来参加聚会了。坏消息。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_3_INTRO_24": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}该死的！我们不能就这样被抓住了！这次你赢了，僵王！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_3_INTRO_25": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}嗯。我们肯定会在他下一个生日时送他，Stilts 老板，恶心。恶心。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_3_INTRO_26": "{TIRED:antibullysquad}好吧，我说这是浪费时间。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_3_INTRO_27": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}....",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_3_INTRO_28": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}....",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_3_INTRO_29": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}你会说话吗！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_3_INTRO_30": "{TIRED:antibullysquad}是啊，你说的是！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_3_INTRO_31": "{NPC_EXIT:antibullysquad}{TIRED:winnie}好吧，至少这个问题自己解决了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_4_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:lucky}{SAY:lucky}哎呀，看看他的伤口！这就是僵王举办的豆子盛宴吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_4_INTRO_2": "{SAY:lucky}耶拉走吧！嗯，那个巴纳吉！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_4_INTRO_3": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{TIRED:winnie}幸运-",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_4_INTRO_4": "{SAY:lucky}我的好姑娘，在你自己变得残酷之前，请阅读小字！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_4_INTRO_5": "{EXCITED:crazydave}他也有邀请函！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_4_INTRO_6": "{TIRED:crazydave}Zombert 真的意味着“每个人”，对吧？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_4_INTRO_7": "{SAY:lucky}Tis' 根本不行- 僵王制作一个袋子！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_4_INTRO_8": "{SAY:lucky}啊，Lucky，一定要好好安排一下这里的热闹！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_4_INTRO_9": "{SAY:crazydave}你要帮我们策划聚会吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_4_INTRO_10": "{SAY:lucky}当然，我的家伙！没有幸运，任何聚会都是不完整的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_4_INTRO_11": "{SAY:lucky}为什么，回到霉草甸，没有一个胡利可以离开我！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_4_INTRO_12": "{SAY:lucky}一旦我的人重新安排这个庆祝活动，你的客人将是delira n' excira！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_4_INTRO_13": "{NPC_EXIT:lucky}{SAY:crazydave}哇，真是一个谦虚的人，这样帮助我们！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_4_INTRO_14": "{TIRED:winnie}用户戴夫，这显然又是一种自我膨胀的伎俩。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_4_INTRO_15": "{SAY:crazydave}怎么会呢？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_4_INTRO_16": "{SAY:winnie}Lucky 的手下正在将这些所谓的周年纪念日变成一场关于他的庆祝活动，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_4_INTRO_17": "{TIRED:crazydave}哦，该死！我打赌老板不会喜欢这样。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_4_INTRO_18": "{TIRED:winnie}不，他当然不会。我们最好阻止这个计划。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_5_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:missinfo}{SAY:missinfo}早上好，邻里镇！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_5_INTRO_2": "{SPECIAL1:missinfo}*观众掌声曲目播放*",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_5_INTRO_3": "{SAY:missinfo}庆典策划第五天现场报道，场地一片废墟！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_5_INTRO_4": "{SAY:missinfo}这就是僵王博士对他所有努力的僵尸的欣赏程度吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_5_INTRO_5": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}这不是真的！庆祝活动计划进行得很顺利，直到所有其他人都出现了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_5_INTRO_6": "{TIRED:winnie}记住，这是她的噱头用户戴夫，不断误导群众。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_5_INTRO_7": "{SAY:missinfo}我们的驻场领袖，Dr. Edgar George 僵王，在派对上有不好的记录！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_5_INTRO_8": "{SAY:missinfo}虽然他最近的“节庆串烧”恶作剧可能仍然让观众记忆犹新……",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_5_INTRO_9": "{SAY:missinfo}我恳请大家将注意力转向这一系列政党失败的开始！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_5_INTRO_10": "{SAY:missinfo}2009年大优惠派对！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_5_INTRO_11": "{SAY:winnie}让步派对..？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_5_INTRO_12": "{EXCITED:crazydave}哦，我记住了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_5_INTRO_13": "{EXCITED:crazydave}就是我们在屋顶上敲打老板并录制音乐录影带的时候！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_5_INTRO_14": "{SAY:winnie}我明白了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_5_INTRO_15": "{SAY:crazydave}但是等等，信息小姐你怎么知道这个？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_5_INTRO_16": "{SAY:crazydave}僵企当时还不存在！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_5_INTRO_17": "{SAY:missinfo}为什么，僵企作为一个实体可能不存在于2009年-",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_5_INTRO_18": "{SAY:missinfo}但是你的确实做到了！一个谦虚的地面新闻记者...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_5_INTRO_19": "{SAY:missinfo}...负责拍摄僵王博士自己的音乐视频，并向所有僵尸播放！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_5_INTRO_20": "{SAY:crazydave}你是录制“Zombies On Your Lawn”的人吗？我不记得了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_5_INTRO_21": "{SAY:missinfo}如果你这样做的话我会很惊讶，你花了一半的时间拍摄颠倒的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_5_INTRO_22": "{TIRED:crazydave}哦，对了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_5_INTRO_23": "{SAY:missinfo}不管怎样，我认为僵尸是时候任命一个新的领袖了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_5_INTRO_24": "{SAY:missinfo}一个足够关心他们的人，可以为他们举办一场盛大的庆祝活动！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_5_INTRO_25": "{TIRED:winnie}我想那就是你吧？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_5_INTRO_26": "{SAY:missinfo}各位，你们先在这里听到的，朋朋，时间机器，已认可我成为你们的新统治者！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_5_INTRO_27": "{SAY:crazydave}她没有-",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_5_INTRO_28": "{TIRED:winnie}节省你的精力，用户戴夫-否则她会继续扭曲我们的话以适应她的叙述。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_5_INTRO_29": "{SAY:missinfo}我代表僵企派了一些员工去给你们送花庆祝！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_5_INTRO_30": "{SAY:missinfo}与某些人不同，我们僵企非常关心聚会常客的困境！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_5_INTRO_31": "{SAY:missinfo}这都是我的，各位！直到下次！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_5_INTRO_32": "{NPC_EXIT:missinfo}{SAY:crazydave}她给我们送花了？那真是太好了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_5_INTRO_33": "{SAY:winnie}这纯粹是公关噱头，用户戴夫，她的“员工”其实都是危机演员。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_5_INTRO_34": "{SAY:winnie}她派他们进一步破坏计划，为僵王上的另一件丑闻热门作品辩护。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_5_INTRO_35": "{SAY:crazydave}哎呀！我们必须制止这种行为！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_5_INTRO_36": "{SAY:crazydave}您可以出于许多其他原因不喜欢老板！不是编出来的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_6_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:greedy}{SAY:greedy}我们又见面了，老朋友们。老贪婪者亲吻你的脸颊！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_6_INTRO_2": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}呸！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_6_INTRO_3": "{SAY:crazydave}上次见面你不是就发誓要为我们报仇吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_6_INTRO_4": "{SAY:greedy}啊，我明白是什么让你沮丧了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_6_INTRO_5": "{SAY:greedy}不用担心，朋友们。保持你的个人生活和商业生活是围绕这些部分的生活方式。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_6_INTRO_6": "{SAY:greedy}我在这里处理严格的个人事务，请参阅。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_6_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}说明你的事情，贪婪-知道“Zombert 僵王”发出的任何邀请都被认为是没有意义的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_6_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}如果这是您抵达的原因，我建议您返回。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_6_INTRO_9": "{SAY:greedy}朋友们...老贪婪不需要任何聚会邀请！ M’出场默认，期待！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_6_INTRO_10": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}你无法否认这一点。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_6_INTRO_11": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}我去的每一个华丽的聚会总是有一个有钱的胖子站在房间的中央！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_6_INTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}无论任何“期望”如何 - 如果您未列在宾客名单上，则禁止您进入。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_6_INTRO_13": "{SAY:greedy}啊'，我发现我们有一个-什么叫做-一个误会。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_6_INTRO_14": "{SAY:greedy}我不是来和‘老百姓朋友们’交往的。我的注意力在别处”。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_6_INTRO_15": "{SAY:winnie}所以你承认侵入了？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_6_INTRO_16": "{SAY:greedy}非法侵入？我才不会做这样的事呢！我现在舒服地坐在我的豪宅里。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_6_INTRO_17": "{SAY:greedy}然而，M'boys却有完全不同的想法。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_6_INTRO_18": "{SAY:crazydave}但是为什么呢？你就是收到赞伯特邀请的人！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_6_INTRO_19": "{SAY:greedy}我自己就有很多这样的聚会。老贪婪者并不关心这个问题。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_6_INTRO_20": "{SAY:greedy}那些又大又漂亮的礼物盒，这就是我现在关注的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_6_INTRO_21": "{SAY:greedy}没有什么时间比得上这份礼物了，所以庆祝这份礼物吧！背后的人们的想法是正确的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_6_INTRO_22": "{TIRED:winnie}我不确定这就是这个表达的意思。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_6_INTRO_23": "{SAY:crazydave}但那是僵尸们送给彼此的礼物！你不能拥有那个！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_6_INTRO_24": "{SAY:greedy}啊，另一个误解，我明白了——你看到这个了吗，大卫？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_6_INTRO_25": "{TIRED:crazydave}我的脚……？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_6_INTRO_26": "{SAY:greedy}城市街道，你的双脚——它们都是我的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_6_INTRO_27": "{SAY:greedy}都是我的！我所看到的一切！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_6_INTRO_28": "{SAY:greedy}现在把你那丑陋的杯子从我的礼物上移开。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_7_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:nanny}{SAY:nanny}咳嗽，咳嗽。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_7_INTRO_2": "{SAY:nanny}又是和你一起烂的一年$@#$！印象。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_7_INTRO_3": "{SAY:nanny}真是浪费了一条生命。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_7_INTRO_4": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}Zombert发出的任何邀请-",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_7_INTRO_5": "{SAY:nanny}保存它，你这个笨手笨脚的四轮车。我的邀请来自这位大人物本人。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_7_INTRO_6": "{SAY:crazydave}老板邀请了你？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_7_INTRO_7": "{SAY:nanny}我并不是自愿来到这里的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_7_INTRO_8": "{SAY:nanny}你以为我想在生日计划中照顾 3,000 个小鬼吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_7_INTRO_9": "{EXCITED:crazydave}那为什么还要出现？你就不能请病假吗？你咳嗽得像疯了一样！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_7_INTRO_10": "{SAY:nanny}僵王工作人员要求每个小鬼每年过一次生日。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_7_INTRO_11": "{SAY:nanny}我不会浪费宝贵的时间为每一个小矮子筹办生日派对！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_7_INTRO_12": "{SAY:nanny}我要用这个准备充分的场地给他们同时举办一个生日！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_7_INTRO_13": "{SAY:nanny}所以，艾伦斯、鲍勃、塞西尔斯、D 某事、Ziegel 都进去吧。这就是你们的全部名字吧？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_7_INTRO_14": "{SAY:nanny}哦，谁给@#$%！？你们这三千个魔鬼我可没记住。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_7_INTRO_15": "{TIRED:winnie}为什么我们要首当其冲？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_7_INTRO_16": "{SAY:nanny}正好适合你和大头狒狒擦肩而过！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_7_INTRO_17": "{SAY:nanny}哦，顺便说一句，希望你们两个不要介意在僵王'蛋糕上添加额外的成分。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_7_INTRO_18": "{EXCITED:crazydave}哦！它是什么？听起来很好吃！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_7_INTRO_19": "{TIRED:winnie}这不是大脑，是吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_7_INTRO_20": "{SAY:nanny}哦，天哪。当我再次发现这些小鬼偷偷把炸药放进厕所时，我就灵机一动。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_7_INTRO_21": "{SAY:nanny}这么说吧 - 僵王即将带来爆炸性惊喜！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_7_INTRO_22": "{SAY:nanny}MWA-哈哈-咳嗽-咳嗽-哈哈哈-咳嗽。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_7_INTRO_23": "{SAY:nanny}@!#$%！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_7_INTRO_24": "{NPC_EXIT:nanny}{SAY:crazydave}朋朋，我们应该担心这个吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_7_INTRO_25": "{TIRED:winnie}我们只是在仪式上切蛋糕时需要格外小心，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_8_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:captaincamo}{SAY:captaincamo}这是什么！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_8_INTRO_2": "{SAY:captaincamo}我有重要的事情要处理。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_8_INTRO_3": "{SAY:captaincamo}这最好不要浪费时间！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_8_INTRO_4": "{SAY:captaincamo}哈！？某种庆祝活动？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_8_INTRO_5": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}朋朋，我知道你说Zombert邀请了所有人——",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_8_INTRO_6": "{SAY:crazydave}可是为什么要邀请他呢？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_8_INTRO_7": "{TIRED:winnie}我仍然无法理解赞伯特头脑中的阴谋，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_8_INTRO_8": "{SAY:captaincamo}啊，我明白这是怎么回事了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_8_INTRO_9": "{SAY:captaincamo}那个可悲的节日，你庆祝离死亡又近了一年。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_8_INTRO_10": "{SAY:captaincamo}仿佛时间的流逝就足以值得庆祝。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_8_INTRO_11": "{SAY:captaincamo}如果他们活得够久，他们会看到……",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_8_INTRO_12": "{SHOUT:captaincamo}...他们都参加真是浪费时间！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_8_INTRO_13": "{SAY:winnie}卡莫将军，你只是生闷气吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_8_INTRO_14": "{SAY:captaincamo}几乎没有。如果不是发送邀请的人，我不会在一天中的这个时间发出此邀请！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_8_INTRO_15": "{SAY:captaincamo}想想看，在我手里——一封来自僵王'亲人的字面邀请。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_8_INTRO_16": "{SHOUT:captaincamo}我可以让整个家庭对他们自己可悲的庆祝活动感到惊讶并杀死他们！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_8_INTRO_17": "{SHOUT:captaincamo}特别是那个脑瘤白痴！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_8_INTRO_18": "{SAY:captaincamo}我怎么能拒绝呢？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_8_INTRO_19": "{SAY:crazydave}你要做什么，盖伊将军？我们有严格的禁止飞机政策！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_8_INTRO_20": "{SAY:captaincamo}我已经思考了七个晚上——最终彻底摆脱这个脑残的最好方法是什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_8_INTRO_21": "{SAY:captaincamo}然后我意识到，他因为我说他愚蠢的计划的坏话而驱逐了我——所以我就这样把他赶出去——！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_8_INTRO_22": "{SAY:captaincamo}用这个同族的聚会计划，终于一劳永逸地除掉他！嗬嗬嗬！残酷、诗意、正义！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_8_INTRO_23": "{SAY:crazydave}呃……那你到底做了什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_8_INTRO_24": "{SAY:captaincamo}如果我自由地谈论我的计划，我会成为什么样的战略家？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_8_INTRO_25": "{SAY:captaincamo}那种肤浅的表演技巧是僵王们的东西，而不是真正的专业人士。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_8_INTRO_26": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}哦，不过我相信你做的任何东西都比他们以前做的要好得多！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_8_INTRO_27": "{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，你在做什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_8_INTRO_28": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}嘘朋朋，陪我玩吧。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_8_INTRO_29": "{SAY:crazydave}将军先生说得很清楚了！无论你做什么，都会更好！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_8_INTRO_30": "{SAY:crazydave}你必须告诉我们！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_8_INTRO_31": "{SAY:captaincamo}我做了什么？当然更好了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_8_INTRO_32": "{SAY:captaincamo}这是他永远不会看到的事情！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_8_INTRO_33": "{SAY:captaincamo}嘿，这么说吧——蛋糕里多加一点配料就会带来爆炸物——",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_8_INTRO_34": "{SAY:winnie}恐怕你来得太晚了，卡莫将军。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_8_INTRO_35": "{SAY:winnie}保姆打败了你，让你在蛋糕里塞满了炸药。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_8_INTRO_36": "{SAY:captaincamo}什么！？那个女人抢了我的风头！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_8_INTRO_37": "{SAY:captaincamo}我不会在刺杀行动中被打败！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_8_INTRO_38": "{SAY:captaincamo}...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_8_INTRO_39": "{SAY:captaincamo}该死！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_8_INTRO_40": "{SAY:captaincamo}不管怎样，我会把这个场地的光都炸掉，直到它变成一个红色的陨石坑！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_8_INTRO_41": "{NPC_EXIT:captaincamo}{EXCITED:crazydave}哦，朋朋，看——蜡烛！吹掉它并许愿！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_8_INTRO_42": "{SAY:winnie}那不是蜡烛，用户戴夫。卡莫将军似乎错误地留下了一枚炸药。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_8_INTRO_43": "{TIRED:crazydave}该死。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_9_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:hunterria}{SAY:hunterria}Hunterria带来了期待已久的蛋糕。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_9_INTRO_2": "{SAY:hunterria}Hunterria已经连续9天帮Boss做蛋糕了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_9_INTRO_3": "{SAY:hunterria}Hunterria 用最好的草药填充它。赋予风味。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_9_INTRO_4": "{SAY:hunterria}无意冒犯临时植物盟友。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_9_INTRO_5": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}Hunterria，你需要听我们的，那个蛋糕是炸弹！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_9_INTRO_6": "{SAY:hunterria}Hunterria 听说了这个。老板称之为“表情”。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_9_INTRO_7": "{SAY:hunterria}这个蛋糕确实是炸弹！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_9_INTRO_8": "{SAY:crazydave}不，我们实际上是字面意思！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_9_INTRO_9": "{SHOUT:crazydave}有人往蛋糕里塞了炸药！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_9_INTRO_10": "{SAY:hunterria}小鬼僵尸可能。 Hunterria 警惕地看守着蛋糕。没有人通过。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_9_INTRO_11": "{SAY:crazydave}即使你睡觉的时候？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_9_INTRO_12": "{SAY:hunterria}Hunterria 睁着一只眼睛睡觉。没有人能偷偷溜过去。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_9_INTRO_13": "{SAY:winnie}那为什么我们会听到蛋糕发出嘶嘶声呢？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_9_INTRO_14": "{SAY:hunterria}可能是剩下的蛇。 Snake也帮助Hunterria做了蛋糕。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_9_INTRO_15": "{SAY:hunterria}Hunterria 会留下蛋糕给你。 Hunterria希望你和老板能享受蛋糕。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_9_INTRO_16": "{NPC_EXIT:hunterria}{SAY:crazydave}我不会碰那个蛋糕，朋朋。里面有炸弹和蛇！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_9_INTRO_17": "{SAY:winnie}这只是开始，用户戴夫。我检测到即将发生踩踏事件。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_9_INTRO_18": "{SAY:winnie}好像Hunterria用的是什么材料来做蛋糕——",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_9_INTRO_19": "{EXCITED:winnie}——它吸引了周围所有的野生动物！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_9_INTRO_20": "{SAY:winnie}我们必须做好准备，打败一波又一波来袭的小动物。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_9_INTRO_21": "{TIRED:crazydave}朋朋，这个派对，现在还有救吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_9_INTRO_22": "{TIRED:winnie}我们尽力了，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_11_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}天哪，今天是个大日子！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_11_INTRO_2": "{SAY:zombossicon}经过10天的精心策划，这一切的等待都是值得的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_11_INTRO_3": "{SAY:crazydave}呃，老板..？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_11_INTRO_4": "{SAY:zombossicon}安静，大卫！你一定不能破坏这个惊喜！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_11_INTRO_5": "{SAY:zombossicon}我要进去了！大家一定都在期待我吧——",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_11_INTRO_6": "{SAY:zombossicon}-还有他们所有的礼物和蛋糕-",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_11_INTRO_7": "{SAY:zombossicon}大家我来了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_11_INTRO_8": "{NPC_EXIT:zombossicon}{SAY:crazydave}朋朋...？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_11_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}除了做好撞击准备之外别无他法，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_12_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{TIRED:crazydave}朋朋....",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_12_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}是的，用户戴夫？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_12_INTRO_3": "{SAY:crazydave}你有收到-",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_12_INTRO_4": "{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:crazydave}啊，没关系。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_12_INTRO_5": "{SAY:zombossicon}.....",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_12_INTRO_6": "{SAY:crazydave}老板，你是——",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_12_INTRO_7": "{SAY:zombossicon}GRAHHHH！我珍贵的派对！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_12_INTRO_8": "{SAY:zombossicon}发生了什么！？我以为我告诉过你我们正在停火！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_12_INTRO_9": "{SAY:zombossicon}你为什么要一直折磨我？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_12_INTRO_10": "{SAY:crazydave}哇哦，老板！冷静下来！这些我们都没有做！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_12_INTRO_11": "{SAY:zombossicon}还有谁会有这样的动机对我进行如此琐碎的个人报复？！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_12_INTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}....",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_12_INTRO_13": "{SAY:winnie}这是修辞，对吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_12_INTRO_14": "{SAY:zombossicon}什么意思！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_12_INTRO_15": "{SAY:winnie}僵王，你多年的恶行已经创建了一份符合这一要求的人名单。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_12_INTRO_16": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}是啊，显然你的敌人比我们两个还要多老板！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_12_INTRO_17": "{SAY:zombossicon}哦，所以现在这在某种程度上是我的错？！你告诉我我毁了我自己的派对！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_12_INTRO_18": "{SAY:winnie}你太不理性了。我并不认为这直接是你的错。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_12_INTRO_19": "{SAY:winnie}虽然从经验上来说，是的。您对此负有间接责任。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_12_INTRO_20": "{SAY:zombossicon}你在胡言乱语什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_12_INTRO_21": "{SAY:crazydave}呃……",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_12_INTRO_22": "{SAY:crazydave}我想我会-",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_12_INTRO_23": "{NPC_EXIT:crazydave}{SAY:winnie}如果你从来没有和你的诽谤者发生过小争执，我怀疑这个聚会会被毁掉。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_12_INTRO_24": "{SAY:winnie}欺凌同事、忽视亲人、虐待员工、与媒体为敌-",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_12_INTRO_25": "{SAY:winnie}字面上将前盟友带回过去-",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_12_INTRO_26": "{SAY:winnie}你是为这一场景的展开做好准备的人。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_12_INTRO_27": "{SAY:zombossicon}好吧，你有没有想过我只是因为卡莫很烦人而把他击退了？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_12_INTRO_28": "{SAY:winnie}这个态度正是我所说的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_12_INTRO_29": "{SAY:winnie}你这么情绪化我没法说话。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_12_INTRO_30": "{SAY:zombossicon}够了！现在你却把破坏我的政党的责任归咎于我所谓的“诽谤者”？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_12_INTRO_31": "{SAY:zombossicon}我的僵尸忠于我！我会向你证明这一点！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_12_INTRO_32": "{SAY:zombossicon}大家！国家规定的生日派对！就位！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_12_INTRO_33": "{SAY:zombossicon}我看到了！任何一个抱怨或翻白眼的人都会被削减养老金！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_12_INTRO_34": "{SAY:zombossicon}让我们一劳永逸地解决这个问题吧。我知道对你们三个施舍是一个错误！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_12_INTRO_35": "{NPC_EXIT:zombossicon}{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SAY:crazydave}朋朋，结束了吗？他走了吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_12_INTRO_36": "{TIRED:winnie}是的，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_12_INTRO_37": "{TIRED:crazydave}呃，朋朋-我知道你的意思...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_12_INTRO_38": "{TIRED:crazydave}...但你可能不应该那样对他生气。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_12_INTRO_39": "{TIRED:winnie}我知道，用户戴夫。尽管如此，还是有必要说一下。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_12_INTRO_40": "{SAY:crazydave}那么老板就做好人了吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_12_INTRO_41": "{SAY:winnie}最有可能。我察觉到一场迫在眉睫的入侵。做好准备，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_12_INTRO_42": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}好吧，我想我们正在以老式的方式结束庆祝活动！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_05_BIRTHDAYZ_12_INTRO_43": "{EXCITED:crazydave}老式的植物大战僵尸乱斗！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_1_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}朋朋，我有没有告诉过你我小时候想成为什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_1_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}不，我不相信你有，用户戴夫。是什么导致了这一切？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_1_INTRO_3": "{EXCITED:crazydave}哦，我在春季大扫除时发现了我童年梦想的旧盒子！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_1_INTRO_4": "{SAY:crazydave}所以我只是在回忆......",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_1_INTRO_5": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}我怎么忘了我儿时的梦想是当国王？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_1_INTRO_6": "{SAY:crazydave}那是在戴夫妈妈让我坐下来进行一次艰难的谈话之前。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_1_INTRO_7": "{SAY:crazydave}她说：“小戴维，这个世界早已超越了君主制作为治理体系。”",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_1_INTRO_8": "{TIRED:crazydave}那天我的梦想破灭了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_1_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}错误。我不知道我该如何巧妙地回应这个问题。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_1_INTRO_10": "{SAY:crazydave}哦，没关系，朋朋！这老头简直是胡言乱语啊！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_1_INTRO_11": "{SAY:crazydave}你有梦想吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_1_INTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}我没有潜意识用户戴夫。我无法做梦这样的事情。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_1_INTRO_13": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}不是字面意义上的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_1_INTRO_14": "{SAY:crazydave}你是否从未有过一个目标，或者一个你藏在口袋里的愿望？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_1_INTRO_15": "{SAY:winnie}处理中......",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_1_INTRO_16": "{SAY:winnie}我想我拥有的最符合这种描述的东西就是我的作案手法。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_1_INTRO_17": "{SAY:winnie}你创造了我来帮助你穿越时空，对抗各个年龄段的僵尸。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_1_INTRO_18": "{SAY:winnie}这个答案足够吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_1_INTRO_19": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}嗯，我觉得你还不太到位，朋朋！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_1_INTRO_20": "{SAY:winnie}注意到。我会记录这个问题并在将来找到更合适的答案。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_1_INTRO_21": "{SAY:winnie}不过，说到我的作案手法——看来僵尸正在逼近。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_1_INTRO_22": "{TIRED:crazydave}呃哦！我知道那些轻微的脚步声意味着麻烦！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_2_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫。准备参与。一艘敌舰挡住了我们的路线。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_2_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}令人困惑的是，它似乎充满了小鬼。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_2_INTRO_3": "{SHOUT:crazydave}小鬼僵尸突袭！盖好舱口盖！我们需要抵御这些侏儒！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_2_INTRO_4": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}虽然我不得不说，在这么大的船上看到小家伙有点让我回想起！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_2_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}怎么会，用户戴夫？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_2_INTRO_6": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}当我们只有三个苹果那么高时，我和我的兄弟曾经在我们的后院玩海盗！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_2_INTRO_7": "{TIRED:crazydave}不过我已经有一段时间没有他的消息了。我想他可能已经变坏了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_2_INTRO_8": "{TIRED:winnie}....你有一个邪恶的兄弟？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_2_INTRO_9": "{SAY:crazydave}是的，但这不重要！嘿，你认为小鬼们也在玩海盗吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_2_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}他们的意图无关紧要，用户戴夫。他们的比赛仍然对我们构成威胁。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_2_INTRO_11": "{SAY:crazydave}那我们该怎么办呢？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_2_INTRO_12": "{EXCITED:winnie}我预测小鬼今天会试图不断地冲向我们。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_2_INTRO_13": "{EXCITED:winnie}建议：储备我们的防晒用品。这将帮助我们抵御他们。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_3_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:crazydave}他来了，朋朋！那是皮亚·平克顿警长！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_3_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}我猜他就是发出求救信号的人。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_3_INTRO_3": "{SAY:crazydave}是的！他说正午的决斗即将来临！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_3_INTRO_4": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}我现在明白他的意思了！看看远处那些小鬼！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_3_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}过去几天我们不断收到有关历史上小鬼攻击的电话。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_3_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}我感觉到一种模式。我想到的只有一个罪魁祸首。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_3_INTRO_7": "{SAY:crazydave}是谁，等等——",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_3_INTRO_8": "{NPC_ENTER:nanny}{SAY:crazydave}当然是奶奶了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_3_INTRO_9": "{SAY:nanny}这是“保姆”，你这个白痴。我不是什么老太婆。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_3_INTRO_10": "{SAY:crazydave}真的吗？但你看起来好老啊！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_3_INTRO_11": "{SAY:nanny}那@#$&是什么？你是这个意思吗？我已经30岁了，僵尸年！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_3_INTRO_12": "{SAY:crazydave}你30岁了……？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_3_INTRO_13": "{SAY:crazydave}现在我知道为什么他们说吸烟对皮肤不好了...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_3_INTRO_14": "{SAY:nanny}呃。我已经要照顾一大堆小家伙了，我没有时间照顾一个长得太大的小家伙了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_3_INTRO_15": "{SAY:winnie}我想你就是最近所有小鬼攻击的幕后黑手？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_3_INTRO_16": "{SAY:nanny}还会是谁？ @#!$，这些小矮人永远不会停止抱怨！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_3_INTRO_17": "{SAY:nanny}我需要把它们从我的头发里弄出来——否则我最终会和所有的坚果和松鼠一起进疯人院。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_3_INTRO_18": "{SAY:nanny}所以我只是让他们重演他们愚蠢的小电视节目来分散他们的注意力。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_3_INTRO_19": "{SAY:winnie}..并造成污染时间线的连锁反应。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_3_INTRO_20": "{SAY:nanny}我不明白这是我的问题。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_3_INTRO_21": "{SAY:nanny}总之，我抽烟的时候，看好小家伙们。当你在做的时候，龙骨运输其中一些。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_3_INTRO_22": "{NPC_EXIT:nanny}{SAY:crazydave}哎呀！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_3_INTRO_23": "{TIRED:crazydave}我大概不该说皮肤的事吧？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_4_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:nanny}{SAY:nanny}你终于拿起电话了！今天我要——",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_4_INTRO_2": "{SAY:nanny}啊啊啊！ @#$​​%!&! 我会抓住你的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_4_INTRO_3": "{SAY:crazydave}发生了什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_4_INTRO_4": "{SAY:nanny}他们用愚蠢的小玩具枪吸引了我的注意力！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_4_INTRO_5": "{SAY:nanny}别笑了，你们这些小恶魔！你将为此付出代价！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_4_INTRO_6": "{EXCITED:crazydave}爆能玩具枪？哦，我曾经有过其中一个！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_4_INTRO_7": "{EXCITED:crazydave}它来自那部老太空战争电影！当年风靡一时！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_4_INTRO_8": "{SAY:nanny}太空战争..？那不是巨型机器人的关节吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_4_INTRO_9": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}是啊！巨型狂暴杀手机器人杀死了很多人！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_4_INTRO_10": "{SAY:nanny}......",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_4_INTRO_11": "{SAY:nanny}嘿嘿嘿嘿！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_4_INTRO_12": "{SAY:nanny}哎呀你这个小猪屎！还记得我们做过的那些小型重演游戏吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_4_INTRO_13": "{SAY:nanny}收拾行李！我们正在做另一件事！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_4_INTRO_14": "{SAY:nanny}哦，如果不是我的幽默感，我几年前就已经崩溃了，哈哈哈哈！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_4_INTRO_15": "{NPC_EXIT:nanny}{TIRED:crazydave}呃，朋朋- 那是什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_4_INTRO_16": "{TIRED:winnie}我们即将看到技术进步的阴暗面，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_4_INTRO_17": "{SAY:crazydave}等等，那她为什么又给我们打电话？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_6_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}当当，朋朋-小鬼甚至到了恐龙时代？你确定吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_6_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}正，用户戴夫。出于什么目的，我不知道。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_6_INTRO_3": "{SAY:crazydave}也许这又是他们的小游戏之一！他们——",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_6_INTRO_4": "{SAY:crazydave}呃，等等，有人打电话了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_6_INTRO_5": "{NPC_ENTER:nanny}{SAY:nanny}好了好了！住口！我会问他们！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_6_INTRO_6": "{SAY:nanny}你们知道我在哪里可以找到“紫色恐龙”吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_6_INTRO_7": "{TIRED:crazydave}嗯，霸王龙有紫色条纹..",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_6_INTRO_8": "{SAY:nanny}这就是我一直告诉他们的！几乎是一样的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_6_INTRO_9": "{SAY:nanny}安静点，你们这些忘恩负义的小鬼！我不在乎剧中是否全是紫色！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_6_INTRO_10": "{SAY:nanny}生活很糟糕！有时恐龙不是紫色的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_6_INTRO_11": "{SAY:crazydave}他们只想实现儿时的梦想！为什么要这么酸呢？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_6_INTRO_12": "{SAY:nanny}供你参考，他们大多数都33岁了。他们只是表现得像个小孩子一样来激怒我！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_6_INTRO_13": "{SAY:nanny}僵王从不关心区分儿童和侏儒，所以他将他的小恶魔设施建造成了孤儿院。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_6_INTRO_14": "{SAY:nanny}猜猜谁是年度最佳母亲？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_6_INTRO_15": "{TIRED:winnie}你的小鬼正在扰乱时间的流动，保姆。你就不能把这个论点转移到别处吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_6_INTRO_16": "{SAY:nanny}不，我认为这是争论的完美场所。你知道淘气的小鬼会得到什么吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_6_INTRO_17": "{SAY:nanny}它们被恐龙吃掉了！我要把你们都留在这里！祝你好运，笨蛋！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_6_INTRO_18": "{NPC_EXIT:nanny}{TIRED:winnie}好吧，用户戴夫。我想我们有责任清理这个烂摊子。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_6_INTRO_19": "{TIRED:crazydave}为什么？我什至不想看到紫色恐龙！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_7_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:nanny}{SAY:nanny}哦，@#$!%，所有这些天..",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_7_INTRO_2": "{SAY:nanny}我带着这些小矮人穿过丛林的那一天，那些新奇的陷阱瓷砖没有出现！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_7_INTRO_3": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}又是奶奶！你想用陷阱除掉小鬼吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_7_INTRO_4": "{SAY:nanny}这就是计划，是的。但陷阱丢失了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_7_INTRO_5": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}嗯，它被称为失落之城。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_7_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}没错，这是一个发现失落古代文明的历史时期。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_7_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}也没有你的小鬼可以嬉戏的地方。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_7_INTRO_8": "{SAY:nanny}What would you know about it, you tin-can? 狂欢是这一天的主题。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_7_INTRO_9": "{SAY:nanny}I'm re-enacting some stupid cartoon today. 有些讲述的是一群冒险英雄的故事。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_7_INTRO_10": "{SAY:nanny}现在这些白痴把自己视为一些勇敢、寻求刺激的超级英雄。毫无意义的废话。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_7_INTRO_11": "{SAY:nanny}看到他们认为自己可以飞，但是很有趣。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_7_INTRO_12": "{SAY:nanny}噢——当他们与地面相撞时，他们愚蠢的笑容从脸上消失了……",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_7_INTRO_13": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我能体会到这一点！我小时候也曾梦想成为一名超级英雄！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_7_INTRO_14": "{SAY:winnie}我以为你的梦想是成为国王..？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_7_INTRO_15": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}你可以有多个梦想，朋朋！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_7_INTRO_16": "{SAY:winnie}我明白了。这是我在回答你的问题时要记住的另一个重要消息，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_7_INTRO_17": "{SAY:nanny}呸……梦想。这对你有很多好处。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_7_INTRO_18": "{SAY:nanny}只有小孩子和白痴才会自欺欺人地做梦！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_7_INTRO_19": "{SAY:nanny}不过我猜你和这些小鬼都符合这个要求，对吧？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_7_INTRO_20": "{TIRED:crazydave}这不太好...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_7_INTRO_21": "{SAY:nanny}咳嗽。闲聊够了。如果你要妨碍我，那么你就会有另一件事发生！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_7_INTRO_22": "{SAY:nanny}小鬼僵尸s，即。如果他们想扮演英雄，那么就必须有人扮演他们打败的恶棍，对吧？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_8_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{TIRED:crazydave}Oh, we're here again.. This place always gives me the heebie-jeebies!",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_8_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}我正在检测到另一个干扰，用户戴夫。毫无疑问，保姆就在这里。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_8_INTRO_3": "{NPC_ENTER:nanny}{EXCITED:crazydave}是的，她在那里！奶奶，你这次表演什么节目？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_8_INTRO_4": "{SAY:nanny}没有出现。这些咬脚踝的人只是想去看马戏团。所以我决定带他们来这里。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_8_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}就这样？你没有什么邪恶的计划来处理这些小鬼吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_8_INTRO_6": "{SAY:nanny}嘿，我？没有打算折磨这些小家伙吗？你一定是某种咳嗽笑话机器。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_8_INTRO_7": "{SAY:nanny}我也在这里向他们展示宝贵的人生课程。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_8_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}那个是——？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_8_INTRO_9": "{SAY:nanny}童年消逝！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_8_INTRO_10": "{SAY:nanny}几年后，他们将参加一场比这个马戏团更大的恐怖表演……成年！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_8_INTRO_11": "{SAY:nanny}Cough- where you have to get a job, pay taxes- cough- and overcome nicotine addiction.",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_8_INTRO_12": "{TIRED:winnie}最后一个似乎完全可以避免。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_8_INTRO_13": "{SAY:crazydave}我以为你说他们大多数都不是孩子？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_8_INTRO_14": "{SAY:nanny}If they insist on acting like one, then it's time to bring them back to reality.",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_8_INTRO_15": "{SAY:nanny}用力。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_8_INTRO_16": "{SAY:nanny}I heard this here carnival had one of those, magical transformation cards? 咳咳，哈哈！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_8_INTRO_17": "{SAY:nanny}They think they get a free pass cause they got disgusting, pinchable cheeks, and those big, googly eyes?",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_8_INTRO_18": "{SAY:nanny}那我要把他们变成最压抑的生物，1930年代的最低工资工人！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_8_INTRO_19": "{SAY:nanny}看看你们经历了那次痛苦的转变之后是否还笑容满面，你们这群扭曲的小子！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_8_INTRO_20": "{SAY:crazydave}你为何如此残忍？那些小鬼只是想玩得开心！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_8_INTRO_21": "{SAY:nanny}享受我的乐趣！呸! 当然，你会站在他们一边。你们是同一品种。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_8_INTRO_22": "{SAY:nanny}An overgrown child blabbering about \"dreams\" and \"having fun\". 别让我笑。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_8_INTRO_23": "{SAY:nanny}你所做的一切都是在逃避你的责任。你和这些小鬼！滚出我的视线！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_8_INTRO_24": "{NPC_EXIT:nanny}{SAY:crazydave}呃...抱歉..？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_9_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:nanny}{SAY:nanny}好吧，今天就长话短说吧，因为我无法应付这些喧嚣！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_9_INTRO_2": "{SAY:nanny}现在这些小鬼已经明白了他们会唱歌！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_9_INTRO_3": "{SAY:nanny}我不在乎你是否留下来，但我要离开这里！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_9_INTRO_4": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}好吧，又是一个烂摊子需要我们清理。{NPC_EXIT:nanny}",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_9_INTRO_5": "{SAY:crazydave}....",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_9_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，我检测到轻微的情绪困扰。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_9_INTRO_7": "{TIRED:crazydave}哦，对不起朋朋。我只是在想。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_9_INTRO_8": "{TIRED:crazydave}保姆说得对吗？我的意思是，我知道生活并不总是微笑......",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_9_INTRO_9": "{TIRED:crazydave}但我想如果我能快乐地走下去的话，事情会更好！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_9_INTRO_10": "{TIRED:crazydave}但她是对的，不是吗？我在做什么……我只是在逃避吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_9_INTRO_11": "{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，恐怕我无法回答你这个问题。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_9_INTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}我生来就没有广泛的情绪。我没有能力回答如此沉重的情感困境。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_9_INTRO_13": "{TIRED:crazydave}对了，对不起，朋朋。我不应该把这一切都倾倒在你身上。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_9_INTRO_14": "{SAY:winnie}但是，客观地说，《保姆》也是从充满情感的角度出发的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_9_INTRO_15": "{SAY:crazydave}呃，什么意思？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_9_INTRO_16": "{SAY:winnie}她可能认为自己的观点是正确的。但这并不能使它成为现实。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_9_INTRO_17": "{SAY:winnie}这是我的编程偏见言论——但我不明白为什么你会让她的话决定你的人生观。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_9_INTRO_18": "{SAY:crazydave}所以你的意思是，我这样可以吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_9_INTRO_19": "{SAY:winnie}嗯，事实上，沉迷到拒绝成长的地步是不健康的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_9_INTRO_20": "{SAY:winnie}但是仅仅拥有积极的态度和充满活力的内在童心？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_9_INTRO_21": "{PLAYFUL:winnie}我看不出这样做有什么严重错误。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_9_INTRO_22": "{SAY:crazydave}朋朋....",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_9_INTRO_23": "{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，你前几天问我我的梦想是什么。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_9_INTRO_24": "{SAY:winnie}如果我能够梦想，那就是扩大我的作案手法。我想帮助你对抗僵尸...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_9_INTRO_25": "{PLAYFUL:winnie}...并永远让您开心。感谢你为我所做的一切。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_9_INTRO_26": "{SAY:crazydave}*嗅嗅*朋朋，你确定你没有情感吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_9_INTRO_27": "{SAY:crazydave}因为那真的很感人。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_9_INTRO_28": "{PLAYFUL:winnie}也许你确实给我编程了比我最初意识到的更多情感理解。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_9_INTRO_29": "{SAY:winnie}我们走用户戴夫。与保姆不同，我客观地知道什么会让你感觉更好。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_9_INTRO_30": "{SAY:crazydave}那会是什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_9_INTRO_31": "{EXCITED:winnie}踢僵尸屁股。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_10_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:nanny}{SAY:nanny}@#$%!@! 他当然不在办公室！有一次我想反对他的要求！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_10_INTRO_2": "{SAY:nanny}这太离谱了！远远超出了我的薪水！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_10_INTRO_3": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}您指的是僵王吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_10_INTRO_4": "{SAY:nanny}还有谁！？那个自大狂最近没有出现！总是去某个地方做他的研究！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_10_INTRO_5": "{SAY:nanny}他在找东西。我不知道那是什么，但这对我来说一定意味着更多的痛苦。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_10_INTRO_6": "{SAY:crazydave}嘿，谁知道呢？也许老板正在追逐他的梦想！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_10_INTRO_7": "{SAY:crazydave}你不知道，奶奶！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_10_INTRO_8": "{SAY:nanny}呃。你还为此耿耿于怀吗？你已经40岁了，不是吗？长大！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_10_INTRO_9": "{SAY:crazydave}不！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_10_INTRO_10": "{SAY:crazydave}长大并不意味着我必须像你一样一直痛苦！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_10_INTRO_11": "{SAY:crazydave}朋朋告诉我的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_10_INTRO_12": "{SAY:nanny}您的车让您感到舒适吗？呵呵。我知道现在已经到了谷底，但目前你还远远低于这个谷底。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_10_INTRO_13": "{SAY:crazydave}她知道的比你多！你可能只会说这些话，因为你自己从来没有梦想过！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_10_INTRO_14": "{SAY:nanny}......",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_10_INTRO_15": "{SAY:nanny}呵呵，哈哈哈！我..？你以为我没有梦想吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_10_INTRO_16": "{SAY:nanny}我之所以告诉你这一切，你这个爱锅的白痴，是因为我有一个。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_10_INTRO_17": "{SAY:nanny}我这个刚大学毕业、成绩满分、前途光明的人，会想到这样吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_10_INTRO_18": "{SAY:nanny}当我接受僵王的工作时，你以为我梦想着当保姆来度过我的日子吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_10_INTRO_19": "{SAY:nanny}我有真正的梦想。我有抱负。那个人粉碎了它！他扼杀了我的梦想！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_10_INTRO_20": "{SAY:nanny}他骗我做了这份工作！ “哦，这是一个很有名望的人，它在你的简历上会很好看！”",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_10_INTRO_21": "{SAY:crazydave}哇哦...我不知道..",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_10_INTRO_22": "{SAY:winnie}保姆，如果这份工作这么紧张又没有成就感，我不明白你为什么不干脆辞职。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_10_INTRO_23": "{SAY:nanny}退出？哈哈！你真是个笑话机器。你见过僵王对他的逃兵做什么吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_10_INTRO_24": "{SAY:nanny}我不喜欢被电击回到70年前，或者被冻在冰块里！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_10_INTRO_25": "{SAY:nanny}不，我获得自由的唯一方法......就是他不在画面中。永久地。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_10_INTRO_26": "{SAY:nanny}但是已经够了！如果你有足够的精力说这些脏话，那么你显然可以打架！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_10_INTRO_27": "{SAY:nanny}让我们看看你是否能对抗这些怪胎僵王强迫我照顾孩子。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_10_INTRO_28": "{SAY:nanny}令人厌恶的光着膀子的小鬼，大头监工……还有最糟糕中的最糟糕的..",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_10_INTRO_29": "{SAY:nanny}那个可怕的、计划外的错误，多重性！哈哈哈！咬紧牙关，你们这些白痴！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_10_INTRO_30": "{NPC_EXIT:nanny}{SAY:winnie}警报，用户戴夫。一股巨大的小鬼浪潮逼近，其中包括保姆刚刚规定的威胁。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_10_INTRO_31": "{SAY:crazydave}朋朋？你还记得我告诉你你可以有多个梦想吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_10_INTRO_32": "{SAY:crazydave}我有一个新的。让我们打倒这些小鬼，阻止保姆的行动！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_10_INTRO_33": "{SAY:crazydave}你能帮我实现这个梦想吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_CHILDRENS_10_INTRO_34": "{EXCITED:winnie}当然是用户戴夫。让我们这样做吧！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_1_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:crazydave}朋朋！又到了夏天的时候了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_1_INTRO_2": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}烧烤和热狗时间到了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_1_INTRO_3": "{SAY:crazydave}你的日程安排好了吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_1_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，我必须提醒你，我没有“繁忙的日程”。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_1_INTRO_5": "{SAY:crazydave}好，我们就有时间看烟花了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_1_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}那就太好了，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_1_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}其实，虽然我没有传统的情感……",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_1_INTRO_8": "{EXCITED:winnie}观看烟花有一些让我的算法欣赏的东西。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_1_INTRO_9": "{EXCITED:crazydave}是的，那就是你吸收了夏天的精神！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_1_INTRO_10": "{SAY:crazydave}那么烟花一开始你就来吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_1_INTRO_11": "{SAY:winnie}确实，我会陪伴你和你的邻居。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_1_INTRO_12": "{EXCITED:crazydave}不错！到那时我会把东西准备好。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_1_INTRO_13": "{SAY:winnie}看来我们不是唯一做好准备的人。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_1_INTRO_14": "{SAY:winnie}僵尸正试图在我们的草坪上做一种不同类型的烧烤。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_2_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{PLAYFUL:crazydave}啊，朋朋！明白我的意思吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_2_INTRO_2": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}那次攻击根本不算什么！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_2_INTRO_3": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}连僵尸都轻松了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_2_INTRO_4": "{SAY:crazydave}我应该得到我的吊床！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_2_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}这个庆祝活动确实很独特。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_2_INTRO_6": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我打赌没有什么可以破坏我的暑假时光！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_2_INTRO_7": "{NPC_ENTER:greedy}{SAY:greedy}园丁。我终于找到你了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_2_INTRO_8": "{TIRED:crazydave}哦来吧，我才刚刚开始放松！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_2_INTRO_9": "{SAY:greedy}在你向亲爱的贪婪者付出代价之前，你不能放松。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_2_INTRO_10": "{SAY:greedy}我会让你知道违背我总是会带来后果。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_2_INTRO_11": "{SAY:greedy}看来你已经得到了我宝贝小脑袋的注视。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_2_INTRO_12": "{TIRED:winnie}贪婪，你从我们这里得不到任何东西。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_2_INTRO_13": "{SAY:crazydave}是啊！尤其是这个时候！滚！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_2_INTRO_14": "{SAY:greedy}看来我没说清楚。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_2_INTRO_15": "{SAY:greedy}你破坏了我的操作。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_2_INTRO_16": "{SAY:greedy}后果不堪设想。你欠我的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_2_INTRO_17": "{SAY:greedy}我总是收集。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_2_INTRO_18": "{SAY:winnie}去其他地方进行交易吧！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_2_INTRO_19": "{SAY:greedy}哦，但这笔交易是你还清会费的最好机会。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_2_INTRO_20": "{SAY:greedy}那所房子......你一直在保护的房子。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_2_INTRO_21": "{SAY:greedy}从来没有僵尸能够踏足其中。成为相当传奇。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_2_INTRO_22": "{SAY:greedy}里面的东西在黑市上肯定价值不菲。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_2_INTRO_23": "{EXCITED:greedy}给我这些物品！他们所有人！而且你的会费都得到很好的支付。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_2_INTRO_24": "{SAY:crazydave}永远不会！这些是我邻居的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_2_INTRO_25": "{SAY:greedy}哦，这不是请求。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_2_INTRO_26": "{SAY:greedy}要么你把它们给我...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_2_INTRO_27": "{SAY:greedy}或者我自己拿。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_2_INTRO_28": "{NPC_EXIT:greedy}{SAY:winnie}警告，用户戴夫！贪婪即将派出偷袭埋伏！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_2_INTRO_29": "{SAY:winnie}僵尸将试图绕过我们的防御并偷走邻居的财物！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_2_INTRO_30": "{SAY:crazydave}哦，我们会看看的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_3_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{EXCITED:crazydave}我们出发，朋朋！一切都清楚了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_3_INTRO_2": "{SAY:crazydave}贪婪的家伙连那房子里的一枚硬币都拿不到！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_3_INTRO_3": "{NPC_ENTER:greedy}{SAY:greedy}咩哈哈！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_3_INTRO_4": "{SAY:greedy}陷入了旧的switcharoo诡计中。经典之作。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_3_INTRO_5": "{SAY:crazydave}你在说什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_3_INTRO_6": "{PLAYFUL:greedy}哦，不用担心你的秃头。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_3_INTRO_7": "{SAY:greedy}你需要知道的是，现在我有你需要的东西。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_3_INTRO_8": "{SAY:greedy}如果你想拿回来，你就得付出高昂的代价。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_3_INTRO_9": "{SAY:crazydave}不！上次和你做交易差点就犯了错误！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_3_INTRO_10": "{SAY:crazydave}另外...你可能是在虚张声势！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_3_INTRO_11": "{EXCITED:crazydave}是啊！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_3_INTRO_12": "{SAY:greedy}你觉得我不对吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_3_INTRO_13": "{SAY:greedy}很好。我们明天看看你是否会改变你的态度。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_3_INTRO_14": "{NPC_EXIT:greedy}{SAY:crazydave}...朋朋！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_3_INTRO_15": "{SAY:crazydave}你看到了吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_3_INTRO_16": "{SAY:crazydave}她在哪儿？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_3_INTRO_17": "{TIRED:crazydave}非常适合轻松的夏天......",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_4_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:greedy}{SAY:greedy}你想看看我没有虚张声势，不是吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_4_INTRO_2": "{SAY:crazydave}是啊！你必须是！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_4_INTRO_3": "{SAY:greedy}哦，贪婪的人通常对筹码和扑克牌很得心应手，但这很明显......",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_4_INTRO_4": "{SAY:greedy}*咔嗒声*",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_4_INTRO_5": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:greedy}哈哈！看，你的老朋友贪婪给自己买了一辆新车。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_4_INTRO_6": "{SAY:greedy}告诉他们施曼尼。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_4_INTRO_7": "{TIRED:winnie}是的，这是事实。我现在是贪婪的佐姆塔拉尼的财产。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_4_INTRO_8": "{SAY:crazydave}...什么！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_4_INTRO_9": "{SAY:greedy}虽然我让你因为我的追随者试图从那所房子里偷东西而分心......",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_4_INTRO_10": "{SAY:greedy}我的一个顶尖男孩安装了一个我从我的某个联系人那里订购的小程序。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_4_INTRO_11": "{SAY:greedy}也拿到了她的钥匙。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_4_INTRO_12": "{PLAYFUL:greedy}看看，樱桃红。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_4_INTRO_13": "{TIRED:crazydave}朋朋，说不是这样的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_4_INTRO_14": "{TIRED:winnie}我现在是贪婪佐姆塔拉尼用户戴夫的合法财产。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_4_INTRO_15": "{TIRED:winnie}我必须服从他的命令。它在我的编程中。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_4_INTRO_16": "{SAY:greedy}看看当你不听老贪婪的时候事情会怎样？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_4_INTRO_17": "{PLAYFUL:greedy}我确信现在这一切都会变得很容易，是吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_4_INTRO_18": "{SAY:greedy}你把那房子里所有的奇特东西都给我怎么样？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_4_INTRO_19": "{SAY:greedy}这就是贪婪者所需要的，你会让你的小朋友回来的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_4_INTRO_20": "{SAY:greedy}不然我们两个会在一起玩得很开心的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_4_INTRO_21": "{SAY:crazydave}你真是个……",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_4_INTRO_22": "{TIRED:crazydave}麻烦的个人。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_4_INTRO_23": "{SAY:greedy}很好。随你便吧。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_4_INTRO_24": "{SAY:greedy}当你在考虑的时候，我会派出越来越多的我的孩子们来利用这个不稳定的局势。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_4_INTRO_25": "{NPC_EXIT:greedy}{NPC_EXIT:winnie}{TIRED:crazydave}欢迎。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_4_INTRO_26": "{SAY:crazydave}邻居，现在就我们两个人了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_4_INTRO_27": "{SAY:crazydave}我去准备一些植物。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_4_INTRO_28": "{SAY:crazydave}呃……让我们看看。现在是晚上。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_4_INTRO_29": "{EXCITED:crazydave}你需要一些蘑菇，邻居！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_4_INTRO_30": "{EXCITED:crazydave}让我来填补你的种子位！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_5_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SAY:crazydave}呸！这是正确的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_5_INTRO_2": "{SAY:crazydave}植物可以在夏夜期间吸收阳光！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_5_INTRO_3": "{SAY:crazydave}因为夏天的炎热和装饰的光！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_5_INTRO_4": "{SAY:crazydave}我完全忘记了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_5_INTRO_5": "{SAY:crazydave}对不起，邻居！我希望蘑菇至少有用。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_5_INTRO_6": "{NPC_ENTER:greedy}{SAY:greedy}好吧，好吧，好吧。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_5_INTRO_7": "{SAY:greedy}如果没有你的那辆货车给你建议，你看起来就像疯子一样。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_5_INTRO_8": "{SAY:greedy}我猜嘟嘟真的是你们操作的所有“大脑”。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_5_INTRO_9": "{SAY:crazydave}这不是真的！我做这件事的时间比她还长！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_5_INTRO_10": "{SAY:greedy}啊，但是如果没有呃，你仍然会犯菜鸟错误，我的朋友。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_5_INTRO_11": "{SAY:greedy}看来你能走到这一步只是因为你拥有那辆车。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_5_INTRO_12": "{SAY:greedy}那就可以一切恢复正常了……",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_5_INTRO_13": "{SAY:greedy}你知道你必须做什么。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_5_INTRO_14": "{SAY:crazydave}不与小鬼做交易！以前走过那条路！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_5_INTRO_15": "{TIRED:greedy}哇，不必把这个方面带入其中，你知道吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_5_INTRO_16": "{SAY:greedy}好吧，同时……",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_5_INTRO_17": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:greedy}我要给自己一点乐趣。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_5_INTRO_18": "{TIRED:winnie}贪婪的主人，请问你不要加快我的速度-",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_5_INTRO_19": "{SAY:greedy}退出你的陷阱，嘟嘟！你是一辆车，像它一样转动那些轮子！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_5_INTRO_20": "{NPC_EXIT:winnie}{SAY:greedy}今天我在店里收到了一个特别的惊喜...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_5_INTRO_21": "{SAY:greedy}这么说吧，香水并不是我送给下属的唯一东西。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_5_INTRO_22": "{NPC_EXIT:greedy}{SAY:crazydave}呃哦。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_5_INTRO_23": "{SAY:crazydave}我不喜欢这个声音。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_5_INTRO_24": "{SAY:crazydave}我们必须加强我们的比赛，邻居！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_5_INTRO_25": "{SAY:crazydave}朋朋大部分植物伙伴的种子都在她身上！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_5_INTRO_26": "{SAY:crazydave}但我会确保我们两个像以前一样种植！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_6_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SAY:crazydave}邻居，我们已经在一起很多年了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_6_INTRO_2": "{SAY:crazydave}即使我们无法接触到所有新的植物伙伴......",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_6_INTRO_3": "{SAY:crazydave}我们会像以前一样在没有朋朋的情况下管理自己。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_6_INTRO_4": "{SAY:crazydave}今天的僵尸将会是……",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_6_INTRO_5": "{SAY:crazydave}让我检查扫描仪-",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_6_INTRO_6": "{SAY:crazydave}哦，对了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_6_INTRO_7": "{TIRED:crazydave}很奇怪，我几乎是本能地这么做了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_6_INTRO_8": "{SAY:crazydave}没关系！让我回顾一下我早期的园艺日子......",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_6_INTRO_9": "{TIRED:crazydave}...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_6_INTRO_10": "{SAY:crazydave}...对了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_6_INTRO_11": "{SAY:crazydave}我们的防守需要的是一些经典的协同作用！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_6_INTRO_12": "{SAY:crazydave}胖子永远不会看到它的到来！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_6_INTRO_13": "{SAY:crazydave}将三线射手种植在泳池中央，双发射手种植在泳池上方和下方...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_6_INTRO_14": "{SAY:crazydave}并用火炬树桩为它们增压！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_7_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:greedy}{SAY:greedy}你好，植物种植怪胎。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_7_INTRO_2": "{SAY:greedy}您对这笔交易改变主意了吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_7_INTRO_3": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SAY:crazydave}我们会从您那里得到朋朋！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_7_INTRO_4": "{EXCITED:greedy}咩哈哈哈！你很有钱，我对此略知一二。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_7_INTRO_5": "{SAY:greedy}看来你们不知道你们在和谁打交道。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_7_INTRO_6": "{SAY:greedy}来吧，告诉他们我是谁！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_7_INTRO_7": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{TIRED:winnie}贪婪的佐姆塔拉尼：一个犯罪头目，他觉得有必要用物质财富取代天生的自信。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_7_INTRO_8": "{SAY:greedy}什么！？你在说什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_7_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}来自严厉的黑手党父亲，小贪婪觉得自己无法接替他的位置——",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_7_INTRO_10": "{SHOUT:greedy}闭嘴！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_7_INTRO_11": "{SAY:greedy}男孩……现在的姑娘们。我涅瓦说过类似的话。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_7_INTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}正在播放昨晚的录音...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_7_INTRO_13": "{SHOUT:greedy}我告诉过你关掉它！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_7_INTRO_14": "{SAY:crazydave}贪婪的家伙，你听起来好像有一些问题。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_7_INTRO_15": "{SAY:greedy}别再胡言乱语了，它们对我来说毫无价值！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_7_INTRO_16": "{SAY:winnie}从统计上看，任何东西对你来说“一文不值”的可能性很低。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_7_INTRO_17": "{SAY:winnie}...基于您重复的行为模式。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_7_INTRO_18": "{SAY:greedy}你想说什么？啊？汽车，你真正在想什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_7_INTRO_19": "{SAY:greedy}吐了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_7_INTRO_20": "{SAY:crazydave}嘿！稍微放松一点。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_7_INTRO_21": "{TIRED:winnie}楼主贪婪，我很想回到用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_7_INTRO_22": "{SAY:greedy}闭嘴，丫头！你现在是我的财产了，你没有发言权。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_7_INTRO_23": "{SAY:greedy}除非他吐出贪婪叔叔想要的东西，否则你就是我的了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_7_INTRO_24": "{SAY:greedy}无论如何，如果没有你，他肯定像小提琴一样不值钱。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_7_INTRO_25": "{NPC_EXIT:greedy}{NPC_EXIT:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}嘿！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_7_INTRO_26": "{SAY:crazydave}我……还能做到！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_7_INTRO_27": "{SAY:crazydave}当然，这些年来我可能有点依赖朋朋的帮助了……",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_7_INTRO_28": "{SAY:crazydave}但即使没有她，我仍然是园丁。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_7_INTRO_29": "{TIRED:crazydave}...对吧？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_8_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{TIRED:crazydave}邻居，绝望时刻呼唤……",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_8_INTRO_2": "{SHOUT:crazydave}CRAAAAZY措施！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_8_INTRO_3": "{SAY:crazydave}我有一把以前藏在车里的种子！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_8_INTRO_4": "{SAY:crazydave}我以前卖给你的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_8_INTRO_5": "{SAY:crazydave}虽然，你知道，我仍然专注于此。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_8_INTRO_6": "{TIRED:crazydave}咳咳……我想我自己以前也是个有点贪心的家伙。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_8_INTRO_7": "{SAY:crazydave}总之，我知道我们要怎么打败那个胖子了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_8_INTRO_8": "{SAY:crazydave}我还需要为我的计划收集所有资源。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_8_INTRO_9": "{SAY:crazydave}明天见！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_9_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SAY:crazydave}好吧...就这样。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_9_INTRO_2": "{SAY:crazydave}朋朋可以制定明智的计划...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_9_INTRO_3": "{EXCITED:crazydave}但是我正在制定疯狂的计划！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_9_INTRO_4": "{SAY:crazydave}我们需要以某种方式将朋朋从胖子的恍惚状态中释放出来。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_9_INTRO_5": "{SAY:crazydave}幸运的是，我比任何人都了解朋朋！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_9_INTRO_6": "{SAY:crazydave}我知道我们两个打算等会儿去看烟花。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_9_INTRO_7": "{SAY:crazydave}她说这个想法对她来说真的很棒！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_9_INTRO_8": "{SAY:crazydave}...也许不是那些话，但是是的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_9_INTRO_9": "{SAY:crazydave}所以我在想...我们必须让这一切发生！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_9_INTRO_10": "{SAY:crazydave}一定能让她从恍惚中醒来，我确定！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_9_INTRO_11": "{SAY:crazydave}但是那个粗鲁的贪婪家伙取消了所有的烟花。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_9_INTRO_12": "{SAY:crazydave}所以我们必须自己做！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_9_INTRO_13": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}这是我能找到的所有爆炸种子！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_9_INTRO_14": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}一次消灭尽可能多的僵尸！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_9_INTRO_15": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}我们需要让这成为一场奇观！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_10_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:greedy}{SAY:greedy}好了好了好了。如果不是顽固镇的总裁的话。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_10_INTRO_2": "{SAY:greedy}你想用什么愚蠢的伎俩来摆脱对贪婪者的亏欠？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_10_INTRO_3": "{SAY:greedy}不管是什么，没有你的车你就无法获得这些知识，所以你最好让步！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_10_INTRO_4": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:greedy}这台机器是你成为一名成功园丁的唯一原因，不是吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_10_INTRO_5": "{PLAYFUL:greedy}所以只要把东西给我，你就可以把它们全部拿回来。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_10_INTRO_6": "{SAY:greedy}想想看...你可以再次成为一个人。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_10_INTRO_7": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{EXCITED:crazydave}贪婪家伙，你太小看朋朋了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_10_INTRO_8": "{EXCITED:crazydave}还有我！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_10_INTRO_9": "{SAY:greedy}你在说什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_10_INTRO_10": "{PLAYFUL:winnie}那是一些美妙的烟花......",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_10_INTRO_11": "{EXCITED:winnie}用户...和所有者...戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_10_INTRO_12": "{SAY:greedy}胡说八道-！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_10_INTRO_13": "{SHOUT:greedy}我是你的主人！你是我的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_10_INTRO_14": "{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫和我约好了看烟花，不包括你。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_10_INTRO_15": "{SAY:winnie}那些烟花也安排好了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_10_INTRO_16": "{SAY:winnie}这样的体贴之举又重新激发了我以前的主动性。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_10_INTRO_17": "{SAY:crazydave}如果你对她好一点也许-",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_10_INTRO_18": "{SAY:greedy}她！？为什么我要对她更好一点！？她是一辆车！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_10_INTRO_19": "{SAY:greedy}我只是爱抚她，因为我拥有了她，伙计！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_10_INTRO_20": "{SAY:winnie}我不再属于你了，贪婪。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_10_INTRO_21": "{SAY:winnie}事实上，您可能有兴趣知道用户戴夫...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_10_INTRO_22": "{SAY:winnie}在贪婪的所有权下，我设法访问他的银行账户并将其吸干。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_10_INTRO_23": "{SHOUT:greedy}你什么！不！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_10_INTRO_24": "{SHOUT:greedy}你没有！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_10_INTRO_25": "{SHOUT:greedy}不！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_10_INTRO_26": "{SHOUT:greedy}你不能！这一切都注定是我的！米尼尼！！！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_10_INTRO_27": "{SHOUT:greedy}不啊啊啊啊啊啊！！！！！！我该怎么办——啊啊啊！不啊啊啊啊啊！！！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_10_INTRO_28": "{SHOUT:greedy}我一文不值！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_10_INTRO_29": "{SHOUT:greedy}我不能胡闹！不啊啊啊啊啊啊！！！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_10_INTRO_30": "{SAY:crazydave}您是如何访问它们的？他们不是像超级保护者吗？？？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_10_INTRO_31": "{SAY:winnie}确实，用户戴夫。我无法访问它们。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_10_INTRO_32": "{SAY:winnie}但是我需要听听Greedy对于我的想法的反应。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_10_INTRO_33": "{TIRED:greedy}...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_10_INTRO_34": "{TIRED:greedy}就是为了这个。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_10_INTRO_35": "{TIRED:greedy}今晚我的特别“清理”小队会来拜访你。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_10_INTRO_36": "{NPC_EXIT:greedy}{EXCITED:crazydave}啊，很高兴你回来了，朋朋！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_10_INTRO_37": "{SAY:winnie}回来真好，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_10_INTRO_38": "{SAY:winnie}你的烟花奇观确实成功地重新激活了我的基本要求。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_10_INTRO_39": "{SAY:winnie}这是一些快速的思考。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_10_INTRO_40": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}呵呵。好吧，我不能把所有的功劳都揽在自己身上。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_10_INTRO_41": "{SAY:crazydave}但更重要的是，贪婪小子呢？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_10_INTRO_42": "{SAY:winnie}扫描仪显示...贪婪已经支付了某些“老板”僵尸的费用，但总体而言这些僵尸的重要性微乎其微。然而",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_10_INTRO_43": "{SAY:winnie}仍然危险。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_10_INTRO_44": "{SAY:winnie}我们需要为他们的罢工做好准备。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_06_SUMMERNIGHTS_10_INTRO_45": "{EXCITED:crazydave}哦，又回到节奏了真好！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_1_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{PLAYFUL:crazydave}朋朋，我发现这几天僵尸越来越少了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_1_INTRO_2": "{SAY:crazydave}什么给出？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_1_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}又到了一年中的这个时间，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_1_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}学期似乎进入了新的周期。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_1_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}我认为僵尸会忙于他们的课程而无法进行全面入侵。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_1_INTRO_6": "{EXCITED:crazydave}啊，学校！过去的美好时光！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_1_INTRO_7": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}我记得午餐时偷偷溜进厕所，低声告诉人们洗手。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_1_INTRO_8": "{TIRED:winnie}我不确定这是否应该是学校的目的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_1_INTRO_9": "{TIRED:crazydave}哥们，我也很擅长！但所有的老师都会因此训斥我！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_1_INTRO_10": "{TIRED:crazydave}参见朋朋，这是当前学校教学大纲状态的问题。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_1_INTRO_11": "{SAY:crazydave}他们更注重教你如何思考...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_1_INTRO_12": "{SAY:crazydave}...但实际上并没有找到你想做什么！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_1_INTRO_13": "{SAY:crazydave}如果允许学生尽早展示他们的热情......",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_1_INTRO_14": "{EXCITED:crazydave}...老师可以帮助他们磨练它，使其成为对他们以后的生活有帮助的良好技能！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_1_INTRO_15": "{SAY:crazydave}我们的教育系统的状况多么可悲。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_1_INTRO_16": "{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，我们说的是厕所里的窃窃私语。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_1_INTRO_17": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}如果当时有一个合适的导师，也许一切都会不一样！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_1_INTRO_18": "{TIRED:winnie}我想，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_2_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:antibullysquad}{SHOUT:antibullysquad}我告诉你们孩子们这个计划不会成功！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_2_INTRO_2": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}咕。巨人僵尸s 会成为强有力的开场白，高跷老大。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_2_INTRO_3": "{TIRED:antibullysquad}不，不是你说的那样。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_2_INTRO_4": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}小鬼僵尸需要先走，你这个混蛋！这真是经典的开书啊！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_2_INTRO_5": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}但是想象一下，如果Gargs排在第一位，那机会有多大，老大。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_2_INTRO_6": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}植物来不及反应，呵呵。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_2_INTRO_7": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}这打破了我们叮当学术书籍中的所有规则！你读过材料吗！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_2_INTRO_8": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}这是怎么回事？你们为什么互相喊叫？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_2_INTRO_9": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}“发生了什么，”大卫，是我的队友正在积极破坏我！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_2_INTRO_10": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}Buh。没有破坏。高跷老板人。真实消息。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_2_INTRO_11": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}你就是不能接受不同的意见。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_2_INTRO_12": "{TIRED:antibullysquad}是啊，他说的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_2_INTRO_13": "{SAY:winnie}我们是否应该知道这一点？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_2_INTRO_14": "{SAY:crazydave}你现在不是应该派出僵尸来吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_2_INTRO_15": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}我们无法就先送哪只僵尸达成一致！太棒了，现在我们已经错过了入侵任务的最后期限！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_2_INTRO_16": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}没有人欣赏我们的勤奋！如果教授能给我们一个证明自己的机会就好了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_2_INTRO_17": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}看到我们潜力的人！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_2_INTRO_18": "{TIRED:antibullysquad}是啊，你说的是！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_2_INTRO_19": "{SAY:winnie}如果你一直杂乱无章，没有人会看到你的潜力。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_2_INTRO_20": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}那么，我们该怎么办！？完美的解决方案不会凭空出现！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_2_INTRO_21": "{NPC_ENTER:greedy}{SAY:greedy}那么，看来通讯人员终于把好的“贪婪”通过了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_2_INTRO_22": "{SAY:greedy}我一直在远处观察你们的表现，孩子们。是时候进行正式介绍了，不是吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_2_INTRO_23": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}天哪！难道是……",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_2_INTRO_24": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}一定是他，老大。贪吃，呃呃……西葫芦。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_2_INTRO_25": "{TIRED:antibullysquad}是啊，你说的是！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_2_INTRO_26": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}不，你们这些白痴！这是贪婪的佐姆……佐姆……Zooooom……",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_2_INTRO_27": "{SAY:greedy}现在，现在孩子们……事情不是这样的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_2_INTRO_28": "{SAY:greedy}我感觉你很有潜力成为我的新人......",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_2_INTRO_29": "{SAY:greedy}超级战略太阳能搜索与粉碎小队！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_2_INTRO_30": "{SAY:greedy}我需要一些新的追随者，因为我的老追随者大约一个月前就被打败了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_2_INTRO_31": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}等等，你是认真的吗，Guinni 先生？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_2_INTRO_32": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}你说的是你认为你在说的吗？我们将成为你们精英小队的一员！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_2_INTRO_33": "{SAY:greedy}是啊，我刚才就是这么说的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_2_INTRO_34": "{TIRED:antibullysquad}是啊，你刚才说的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_2_INTRO_35": "{SAY:greedy}告诉你，让我们看看你如何在经济支持下处理自己。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_2_INTRO_36": "{SAY:greedy}由于我的一次特殊接触，我得到了一些传送门生成器。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_2_INTRO_37": "{SAY:greedy}明智地使用它们。将此视为一个测试。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_2_INTRO_38": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}你们听到了吗，孩子们？终于有人认出我们了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_2_INTRO_39": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}你知道这意味着什么！邪恶的笑时间！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_2_INTRO_40": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}姆哇哈哈哈！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_2_INTRO_41": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}呵呵呵呵。好消息。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_2_INTRO_42": "{TIRED:antibullysquad}是啊，你说的是，老板！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_2_INTRO_43": "{SAY:greedy}这甚至不是真正的笑声。我想我们会努力解决这个问题。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_2_INTRO_44": "{NPC_EXIT:antibullysquad}{NPC_EXIT:greedy}{SAY:winnie}看起来不太可能的联盟已经形成了，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_2_INTRO_45": "{SAY:crazydave}我们应该担心吗，朋朋？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_2_INTRO_46": "{SAY:winnie}虽然小队可能无害，但在贪婪的财政支持下，他们最终可能会成为威胁。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_2_INTRO_47": "{SAY:winnie}我想说我们现在需要保持警惕，以防万一。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_3_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:antibullysquad}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}好消息，高跷老大。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_3_INTRO_2": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}西葫芦先生答应给我们的节日饮料刚刚到货。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_3_INTRO_3": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}你这个鸟脑子！那不是他的名字！这是……意大利宽面条先生……？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_3_INTRO_4": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}随便吧！我们可以稍后再问他！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_3_INTRO_5": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}现在，让我们集思广益如何使用这些饮料！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_3_INTRO_6": "{TIRED:antibullysquad}是啊，你说的是！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_3_INTRO_7": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}让我们派出最大最强的僵尸吧，老大。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_3_INTRO_8": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}想象一下他们会变得多么强大！对于植物来说是个坏消息！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_3_INTRO_9": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}好主意，看，现在你的想法像个恶棍！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_3_INTRO_10": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}从头开始，现在你在想！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_3_INTRO_11": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}这样吧：我们派出飞行僵尸！然后他们就可以更快地飞越一切！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_3_INTRO_12": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}是啊，对于坚果墙来说是个坏消息，呵呵。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_3_INTRO_13": "{TIRED:antibullysquad}是啊，你说的是！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_3_INTRO_14": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}就是这样，孩子们，我们终于要证明我们的天才了！哈哈哈！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_3_INTRO_15": "{NPC_EXIT:antibullysquad}{TIRED:winnie}嗯，看来干扰是完全没有必要的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_4_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:antibullysquad}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SHOUT:antibullysquad}糟糕，饮料不起作用！如何！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_4_INTRO_2": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}也许他们并不渴。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_4_INTRO_3": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}回到绘图板！今天佐马蒂尼先生还给我们发了什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_4_INTRO_4": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}他给了我们这些黑糊糊的饮料，老板。味道不好。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_4_INTRO_5": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}Grim 可以证明。他喝了整整一升。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_4_INTRO_6": "{TIRED:antibullysquad}哎哟，你-哎呀......",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_4_INTRO_7": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}什么！？这不是酒，你们这些白痴！那是黑焦油！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_4_INTRO_8": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}哦。那么我们应该停止饮用它们吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_4_INTRO_9": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}是的！林吉尼先生一定把这个发给我们是为了减缓植物的生长！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_4_INTRO_10": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}哈！这是一个想法！我们应该把所有这些焦油洒在他们草坪后面！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_4_INTRO_11": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}那是讨厌的园丁通常种植最强大植物的地方，对吧？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_4_INTRO_12": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}是的，我们在攻击过程中进行，作为伏击。对于植物来说是个坏消息！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_4_INTRO_13": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}它们会很粘。呵呵。{NPC_EXIT:winnie}",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_4_INTRO_14": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}哈哈哈！他们绝对不会看到这一幕！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_4_INTRO_15": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SAY:crazydave}你们在做什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_4_INTRO_16": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}哦，你很快就会看到的，大卫！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_4_INTRO_17": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}我们有大惊喜来了！呵呵。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_4_INTRO_18": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}白痴！别告诉他们这个！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_4_INTRO_19": "{SAY:crazydave}你的手怎么又黑又粘？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_4_INTRO_20": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}与你无关！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_4_INTRO_21": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}与其插手我们的阴谋，不如准备好你的植物，大卫？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_4_INTRO_22": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}是的。准备好植物，迎接大惊喜！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_4_INTRO_23": "{TIRED:antibullysquad}是啊，他们说的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_4_INTRO_24": "{SAY:crazydave}等等，你们要走了吗？你不去洗手吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_4_INTRO_25": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}不……",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_4_INTRO_26": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}.....因为我们是邪恶的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_4_INTRO_27": "{NPC_EXIT:antibullysquad}{PLAYFUL:crazydave}伙计，邪恶会导致更糟糕的卫生状况。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_4_INTRO_28": "{SAY:crazydave}你每天都会学到新东西！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_4_INTRO_29": "{EXCITED:winnie}总而言之，用户戴夫，小队计划将焦油倾倒在我们的草坪后面。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_4_INTRO_30": "{SAY:winnie}出于这个原因，我建议仅在这一天将我们的植物稍微靠右放置。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_4_INTRO_31": "{SAY:winnie}如果一切按计划进行，我们的工厂将不受影响。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_5_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:greedy}{SAY:greedy}你们还等什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_5_INTRO_2": "{SAY:greedy}我已经给了你足够多的东西来激发你的想象力。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_5_INTRO_3": "{NPC_ENTER:antibullysquad}{SHOUT:antibullysquad}我们一直在努力，桑蒂尼先生！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_5_INTRO_4": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}植物每一步都设法躲避我们的计划。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_5_INTRO_5": "{TIRED:antibullysquad}是啊，他们说的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_5_INTRO_6": "{SAY:greedy}好吧，也许你不应该大声说出所有这些！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_5_INTRO_7": "{SAY:greedy}你明白了吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_5_INTRO_8": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}是啊！你是老板！你是老板！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_5_INTRO_9": "{SAY:greedy}我刚才说什么了！？看看你在说什么！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_5_INTRO_10": "{SAY:greedy}尤其是通过电话，你们这些白痴！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_5_INTRO_11": "{SAY:greedy}对于你来说，我只是一个好心的恩人！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_5_INTRO_12": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}是啊，老板你真是一个好心的恩人。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_5_INTRO_13": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}您在过去的一周内没有向我们非法运送非法产品或类似的情况。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_5_INTRO_14": "{SAY:greedy}别再嚷嚷了，你这个白痴！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_5_INTRO_15": "{SAY:greedy}我不敢相信我会这么做，但至少你们是忠诚的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_5_INTRO_16": "{SAY:greedy}你准备好接受严厉的爱了吗？好的，就这样吧。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_5_INTRO_17": "{SAY:greedy}你们这些家伙很糟糕，但我们可以解决这个问题。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_5_INTRO_18": "{SAY:greedy}有我的超秘密成长配方。好好利用它。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_5_INTRO_19": "{SAY:greedy}这就是作品。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_5_INTRO_20": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_EXIT:greedy}{SHOUT:antibullysquad}好了好了！老板刚刚给了我们这些非法的成长配方，孩子们！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_5_INTRO_21": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}嘘！老板，你不应该谈论非法增长公式。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_5_INTRO_22": "{TIRED:antibullysquad}对啊，你说的非法成长公式！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_5_INTRO_23": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}是的，有人能听到你的声音。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_5_INTRO_24": "{TIRED:antibullysquad}是啊，我就是这个意思，不要说非法增长公式！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_5_INTRO_25": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}哦，对了。好吧，任何人，你认为我们如何利用这个？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_5_INTRO_26": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}后面的信息说一滴就足以让僵尸超级加速！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_5_INTRO_27": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}那么我们为什么不把一大堆这个东西注射到我们的僵尸身上呢？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_5_INTRO_28": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}好主意，高跷老大！僵尸将会变得巨大！对我们来说是好消息，对植物来说则是坏消息！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_5_INTRO_29": "{TIRED:antibullysquad}是啊，你说的。这种非法增长公式确实是个坏消息！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_5_INTRO_30": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}这个计划不可能失败！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_5_INTRO_31": "{NPC_EXIT:antibullysquad}{TIRED:crazydave}朋朋...？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_5_INTRO_32": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{TIRED:winnie}对此我什至没有任何建议。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_5_INTRO_33": "{TIRED:winnie}让我们看看情况如何。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_6_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:antibullysquad}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SHOUT:antibullysquad}这些计划都不起作用！有什么大主意！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_6_INTRO_2": "{TIRED:winnie}如果不是这么随意讨论的话……",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_6_INTRO_3": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}我们现在比以往任何时候都需要一个指导声音，老板。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_6_INTRO_4": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}也许你应该听听他说的话！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_6_INTRO_5": "{TIRED:antibullysquad}什么，他说什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_6_INTRO_6": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}等等，他说什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_6_INTRO_7": "{TIRED:antibullysquad}是啊，他说的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_6_INTRO_8": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}什么，谁说的？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_6_INTRO_9": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}你知道，他说了什么！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_6_INTRO_10": "{TIRED:antibullysquad}是啊，你说的是！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_6_INTRO_11": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}你说什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_6_INTRO_12": "{TIRED:antibullysquad}不，他说的是！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_6_INTRO_13": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}唷，朋朋，这就是不洗手的结果……",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_6_INTRO_14": "{TIRED:winnie}你为什么窃窃私语？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_6_INTRO_15": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}我是厕所窃窃私语者朋朋。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_6_INTRO_16": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}你说什么？等等，他们想分散我们的注意力！但这是行不通的！对吧，孩子们？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_6_INTRO_17": "{TIRED:antibullysquad}是啊，你说的是！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_6_INTRO_18": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}等等，你说什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_6_INTRO_19": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}我——等等，停下来！计划！当天的计划！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_6_INTRO_20": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}呃...Toucinni先生又给了我们什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_6_INTRO_21": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}我不记得他说了什么。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_6_INTRO_22": "{TIRED:antibullysquad}他说什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_6_INTRO_23": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}模具！他给了我们模具！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_6_INTRO_24": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}哦，还有滑块。呵呵。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_6_INTRO_25": "{TIRED:antibullysquad}是啊，他说的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_6_INTRO_26": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}我们要把所有的僵尸都送到有模具的车道上！所以你对此无能为力！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_6_INTRO_27": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}你不应该大声说出计划，老板。他也这么说。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_6_INTRO_28": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}什么？他说什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_6_INTRO_29": "{NPC_EXIT:antibullysquad}{TIRED:winnie}我正在切断通讯。我们不会再这样做了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_6_INTRO_30": "{SAY:crazydave}但是朋朋，他们会把所有僵尸重定向到模具通道！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_6_INTRO_31": "{TIRED:crazydave}他们说我们没有办法比他们更聪明。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_6_INTRO_32": "{TIRED:winnie}对...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_7_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:antibullysquad}{NPC_ENTER:greedy}{SAY:greedy}你们把我的钱都投入了什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_7_INTRO_2": "{SAY:greedy}我在大洞里有五万僵尸！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_7_INTRO_3": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}但是Guggachini先生，你不是很有钱吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_7_INTRO_4": "{SAY:greedy}你知道我为什么有钱吗？因为我不会乱花钱！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_7_INTRO_5": "{SAY:greedy}不像你使用我给你的资源的方式！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_7_INTRO_6": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}你是说非法增长公式吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_7_INTRO_7": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}非法成长公式，现在想想这个词还挺奇怪的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_7_INTRO_8": "{TIRED:antibullysquad}是啊，你说的。很奇特的一个词。非法增长公式。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_7_INTRO_9": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}这不是一个词，这是一个短语，你这个笨蛋！非法成长公式！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_7_INTRO_10": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}非法。生长。公式。三个字。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_7_INTRO_11": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}棘手的绕口令。老板，快说五遍。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_7_INTRO_12": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}非法生长配方、非法种植",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_7_INTRO_13": "{SAY:greedy}你们在做什么！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_7_INTRO_14": "{SAY:greedy}好吧，妈妈没有养出半途而废的人。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_7_INTRO_15": "{SAY:greedy}我一直在保存这个。这是一个万无一失的设备。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_7_INTRO_16": "{SAY:greedy}即使是像你们这样的大笨蛋也能应付得来。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_7_INTRO_17": "{SAY:greedy}销售人员向我保证它完好无损。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_7_INTRO_18": "{SAY:greedy}Sandstorm-O-Matic 3000。它可以像没有明天一样抛出沙尘暴的追随者。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_7_INTRO_19": "{SAY:greedy}充分利用这些书本知识。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_7_INTRO_20": "{SAY:greedy}并确保在他们开始种植之前偷走他们有问题的植物！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_7_INTRO_21": "{NPC_EXIT:greedy}{SHOUT:antibullysquad}好了好了！你听到那个男人的声音了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_7_INTRO_22": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}什么植物可以破坏这个，孩子们？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_7_INTRO_23": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}呃，沙尘暴是风吧？那我们就偷走那些会吹气的植物吧！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_7_INTRO_24": "{TIRED:antibullysquad}是啊，他说的！偷三叶草！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_7_INTRO_25": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}还有飓风甘蓝。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_7_INTRO_26": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}还有什么，还有什么？这个计划需要实施！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_7_INTRO_27": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}坚果墙呢，老大？如果僵尸被快速击中，它们会头朝下猛击。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_7_INTRO_28": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}你这个笨蛋！沙尘暴绕过坚果墙s！上课没认真听讲吗！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_7_INTRO_29": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}哦，对了。那我们就来偷地刺吧。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_7_INTRO_30": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}好吧，是的。我们来偷地刺吧！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_7_INTRO_31": "{TIRED:antibullysquad}是啊，你说的是！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_7_INTRO_32": "{NPC_EXIT:antibullysquad}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_7_INTRO_33": "{SAY:winnie}使用这个Fanilla，邻居。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_8_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:antibullysquad}{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}我们的计划都不起作用，老板。我们该怎么办？莱文尼先生越来越不耐烦了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_8_INTRO_2": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}我有计划了！我总是这样！但你们这些家伙却总是把他们搞砸！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_8_INTRO_3": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}我们不会“搞砸”老板。也许你只是一个糟糕的领导者。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_8_INTRO_4": "{TIRED:antibullysquad}是啊，糟糕的领导！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_8_INTRO_5": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}什么！？别跟我顶嘴！我是我们行动的大脑！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_8_INTRO_6": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}我是带你们两个上完课的人！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_8_INTRO_7": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}但我是一直背着你去上课的人，高跷老大。在我的背上。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_8_INTRO_8": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}嘎！任何！老板送我们的还有什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_8_INTRO_9": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}陷阱瓷砖。我们按照他的具体指示绑架了普兰特。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_8_INTRO_10": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}所以现在我们必须用这些瓷砖杀死那棵植物！这将是小菜一碟！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_8_INTRO_11": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}但是运气好的话，这也会以某种方式在我们脸上爆炸。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_8_INTRO_12": "{TIRED:antibullysquad}是的，在我们脸上！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_8_INTRO_13": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}我们如何确保不会发生这种情况？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_8_INTRO_14": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}看，这就是你们这些傻瓜需要我的原因！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_8_INTRO_15": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}我就是有计划的人！让我们看看，我们应该。我们应该...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_8_INTRO_16": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}啊！拧紧它！让我们把所有的火焰砖都倒在草坪的右侧吧！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_8_INTRO_17": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}看看他们如何防御！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_8_INTRO_18": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}也给他们发传单！这样我们就可以照顾割草机了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_8_INTRO_19": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}哇哦，高跷老大。你会从各个角度思考。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_8_INTRO_20": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}甚至是几何上的直角！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_8_INTRO_21": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}我就是这么说的！有计划的男人！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_8_INTRO_22": "{TIRED:antibullysquad}是的，他说的是！有计划的男人！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_8_INTRO_23": "{NPC_EXIT:antibullysquad}{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{TIRED:winnie}并非每个角度都很明显。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_8_INTRO_24": "{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，我必须转移你的注意力到轨道车上。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_8_INTRO_25": "{SAY:crazydave}哦，植物在铁轨上！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_8_INTRO_26": "{SAY:winnie}正是如此。当僵尸踩到火焰方块时，我们可以将它们相应地移离任何车道。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_8_INTRO_27": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}这感觉是应该考虑的最重要的角度。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_8_INTRO_28": "{TIRED:winnie}是的。已经成为一种模式了，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_9_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:antibullysquad}{NPC_ENTER:greedy}{SAY:greedy}好吧，伙计们，我现在有点忙。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_9_INTRO_2": "{SAY:greedy}如果你听到任何汽车准备的声音，就别管它了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_9_INTRO_3": "{SAY:greedy}我只需要一项信息。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_9_INTRO_4": "{SAY:greedy}为什么施曼尼和其他人还在踢球！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_9_INTRO_5": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}噢，嗯。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_9_INTRO_6": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}这是一项正在进行中的工作，老板。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_9_INTRO_7": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}是啊，你明白了！就在我们说话的时候，我们即将派出你们的机器人！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_9_INTRO_8": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}绝对坚不可摧的军队！他们不可能从这个地方溜出去的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_9_INTRO_9": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}连非法成长公式都不需要！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_9_INTRO_10": "{SAY:greedy}快闭嘴 DANG 公式吧！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_9_INTRO_11": "{SAY:greedy}这是你最后的机会了，笨蛋！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_9_INTRO_12": "{SAY:greedy}如果你搞砸了这个，就考虑自己是鱼食吧！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_9_INTRO_13": "{SAY:greedy}你真是太幸运了，我为你们这些笨蛋找到了一个甜蜜的地方！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_9_INTRO_14": "{SAY:greedy}要不是你提醒我自己，我才不会这么手软！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_9_INTRO_15": "{NPC_EXIT:greedy}{SHOUT:antibullysquad}关于鱼食他说了什么？他要我们照看他的宠物鱼？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_9_INTRO_16": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}老大，我们需要派机器人过来。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_9_INTRO_17": "{TIRED:antibullysquad}是啊，你说的是！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_9_INTRO_18": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}好啦好啦！我们需要最大限度地利用这些机器！把他们都扔出去！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_9_INTRO_19": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}全部？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_9_INTRO_20": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}全部！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_9_INTRO_21": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}连那个看起来像牛的？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_9_INTRO_22": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}对啊，也是！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_9_INTRO_23": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}这个还有鼻子吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_9_INTRO_24": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}好吧，不是那个。那个让我吓坏了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_9_INTRO_25": "{TIRED:antibullysquad}是的，不是那个。这让我很害怕！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_9_INTRO_26": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}这一次我们绝对不会失败！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_9_INTRO_27": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}Y'知道现在几点了吗，孩子们？又从山顶来了一次！姆瓦哈哈哈！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_9_INTRO_28": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}呵呵呵呵。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_9_INTRO_29": "{TIRED:antibullysquad}你说啥啊，老板！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_9_INTRO_30": "{NPC_EXIT:antibullysquad}{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{PLAYFUL:crazydave}好吧，至少他们现在笑得更好了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_9_INTRO_31": "{SAY:crazydave}但是我们要对这些机器人做什么呢？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_9_INTRO_32": "{SAY:winnie}E.M. 桃。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_10_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:antibullysquad}{NPC_ENTER:greedy}{SHOUT:greedy}你们这些绝对的穴居人！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_10_INTRO_2": "{SPECIAL1:greedy}*警报声*",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_10_INTRO_3": "{SHOUT:greedy}为什么我发现我的阴谋银行账户是负数！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_10_INTRO_4": "{SHOUT:greedy}为什么我会到达你在废弃大学的坐标！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_10_INTRO_5": "{SHOUT:greedy}为什么！？为什么！？为什么！？？？？？？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_10_INTRO_6": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}我们呃...听不到你说话，老板。背景中有汽车噪音。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_10_INTRO_7": "{SHOUT:greedy}感谢您喋喋不休的博览会OVA的电话-",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_10_INTRO_8": "{SHOUT:greedy}联邦调查局已经盯上我了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_10_INTRO_9": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}为什么你会被当局追捕，佐姆塔拉尼先生！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_10_INTRO_10": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}是因为非法成长公式吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_10_INTRO_11": "{SHOUT:greedy}别再谈论增长公式了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_10_INTRO_12": "{SPECIAL2:greedy}*车祸噪音*",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_10_INTRO_13": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}他还好吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_10_INTRO_14": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}他显然很好！他就是伟大的贪婪佐姆塔拉尼！你质疑他的可信度？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_10_INTRO_15": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}区区一场车祸也救不了他！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_10_INTRO_16": "{TIRED:antibullysquad}是啊，他说的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_10_INTRO_17": "{SHOUT:greedy}你的日子屈指可数了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_10_INTRO_18": "{SHOUT:greedy}抓紧时间，日子屈指可数了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_10_INTRO_19": "{NPC_EXIT:greedy}{SHOUT:antibullysquad}最后一部分是什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_10_INTRO_20": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}他告诉我们要数着日子，老板。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_10_INTRO_21": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}数数我们的日子？为了什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_10_INTRO_22": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{PLAYFUL:crazydave}嘘。你也许应该逃跑。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_10_INTRO_23": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}呼——？谁说的？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_10_INTRO_24": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}哦不。一定是厕所窃窃私语。坏消息。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_10_INTRO_25": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}厕所窃窃私语？他是真的！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_10_INTRO_26": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}发生这种情况是因为您没有从焦油上洗手。厕所窃窃私语者会吃掉不洗手的人。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_10_INTRO_27": "{TIRED:antibullysquad}是啊，你说的是！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_10_INTRO_28": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}我我我帅到不能吃！为你的生命奔跑吧，孩子们！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_10_INTRO_29": "{NPC_EXIT:antibullysquad}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}嗯，看来小队终于撤退了，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_10_INTRO_30": "{TIRED:winnie}不是因为他们应该的原因，但是..",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_10_INTRO_31": "{EXCITED:crazydave}厕所低语器再次拯救了世界！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_10_INTRO_32": "{TIRED:winnie}厕所低语者也赶走了这些刽子手加尔格斯应该处理的赏金。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_10_INTRO_33": "{SAY:winnie}我怀疑他们不会因为这个原因对他太满意。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_10_INTRO_34": "{TIRED:crazydave}哦。难道是贪婪家伙派来的那些家伙……？他们应该干掉那些小队的人吗？嗯。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_10_INTRO_35": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}你可以解决这个问题，对吧，邻居？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_08_BIGBRAINZ_10_INTRO_36": "{TIRED:winnie}这就是为什么有些天赋不应该被沉迷的原因。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_1_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:crazydave}朋朋，看！我上周种下的小家伙开始开花了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_1_INTRO_2": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}欢迎来到这个世界，小家伙们！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_1_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}这是个好消息用户戴夫，他们正好赶上丰收的月份。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_1_INTRO_4": "{SAY:crazydave}你说得对，朋朋！每年这个时候植物的生产力都要高得多！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_1_INTRO_5": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}大概在冬天到来之前把所有的事情都处理完吧！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_1_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}老园丁的故事和农场民间传说也表明了这一点，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_1_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}尽管如此，我很遗憾地通知您，僵尸活动又开始稳步上升。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_1_INTRO_8": "{TIRED:winnie}看来无论什么月份，他们总是准备给我们的植物带来麻烦。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_1_INTRO_9": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我们不能让那些没良心的丧尸破坏了我们美好的收获时光！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_1_INTRO_10": "{SAY:crazydave}邻居，我们来防治害虫吧！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_2_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，紧急传输传入。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_2_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}我必须恳求你小声点。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_2_INTRO_3": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SAY:crazydave}呃，为什么？什么是-",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_2_INTRO_4": "{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}我宣布我们的月度会议开始。将军，状况报告。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_2_INTRO_5": "{NPC_ENTER:nanny}{SAY:nanny}咳嗽。展示。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_2_INTRO_6": "{NPC_ENTER:hunterria}{SAY:hunterria}亨特利亚将军在场。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_2_INTRO_7": "{SAY:zombossicon}很好。你们可能都知道，我们已经进入了我们的卑鄙敌人所谓的一年中最有生产力的时期。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_2_INTRO_8": "{SAY:zombossicon}相比之下，这个月一直是丧尸最慢的时候，到了十月，食尸鬼之月，才恢复过来！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_2_INTRO_9": "{SAY:zombossicon}不用说，这显然也影响了我们的财务收入。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_2_INTRO_10": "{SAY:hunterria}Hunterria可以挖掘更多埋藏的宝藏来帮助赚钱。 Hunterria最近发现了未经探索的水下遗迹——",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_2_INTRO_11": "{SAY:zombossicon}不，你这个傻女人！几个埋藏的宝藏无法让我们的财务状况恢复活力！我们这里有大麻烦了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_2_INTRO_12": "{SAY:zombossicon}我们甚至没有钱承担这种类型的探险！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_2_INTRO_13": "{SAY:zombossicon}我已经把从僵企借的钱都装进油箱里了！我的兄弟 Zombillion 和他的利率......",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_2_INTRO_14": "{SAY:zombossicon}这让我别无选择！我要开始砍掉那些只霸占资源、零利益的无用部门！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_2_INTRO_15": "{SAY:nanny}你要裁员？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_2_INTRO_16": "{SAY:zombossicon}是的，你们的两个部门都在砧板上。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_2_INTRO_17": "{SAY:zombossicon}你们要向我证明你们的部门，以及你们的职位——值得保留！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_2_INTRO_18": "{SAY:zombossicon}不然我就得看你废物了。你们都知道浪费会怎样。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_2_INTRO_19": "{SAY:hunterria}它们被处理掉了。亨特里亚记得。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_2_INTRO_20": "{SAY:nanny}...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_2_INTRO_21": "{SAY:zombossicon}正是如此。你们中只有一个人可以留下来，所以向我证明你比你的同龄人更有价值。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_2_INTRO_22": "{SAY:zombossicon}就这样，你可以回到你的帖子了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_2_INTRO_23": "{NPC_EXIT:zombossicon}{SPECIAL1:nanny}哦，@%!#$！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_2_INTRO_24": "{SAY:nanny}想想我终于可以有一次平静的一个月了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_2_INTRO_25": "{SAY:nanny}我需要一支烟。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_2_INTRO_26": "{NPC_EXIT:nanny}{SAY:hunterria}狼。我们的家园岌岌可危。我们必须通过证明自己的价值来赢得老板的青睐。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_2_INTRO_27": "{SAY:hunterria}叫上你的兄弟们。狩猎开始了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_2_INTRO_28": "{TIRED:crazydave}朋朋，这是怎么回事？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_2_INTRO_29": "{TIRED:winnie} 僵王似乎错误地将我们与他的股东大会用户戴夫连接起来。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_2_INTRO_30": "{SAY:hunterria}Hunterria 听到声音。谁去那里？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_2_INTRO_31": "{SAY:crazydave}哦，糟糕，朋朋！在她发现我们之前我们就走吧！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_3_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:hunterria}{SAY:hunterria}Hunterria 终于追踪到了气味。胖子和他的铁猛犸象一直在偷听。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_3_INTRO_2": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}好吧，说句公道话，是老板娘错误地把我们加进去的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_3_INTRO_3": "{SAY:hunterria}这根本不行。这样的方法对于我们猎人来说是不光彩的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_3_INTRO_4": "{SAY:hunterria}Hunterria必须惩罚胖子的这种背叛行为。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_3_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}你要向僵王举报我们吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_3_INTRO_6": "{SAY:hunterria}Hunterria不会让boss参与其中。我们按照猎人的方式来解决这个问题。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_3_INTRO_7": "{SAY:hunterria}我们决斗。 Hunterria 给你时间准备。亨特利亚想要诚实和公平的战斗。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_3_INTRO_8": "{SAY:hunterria}如果你赢了决斗，亨特利亚就会放走胖子。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_3_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}等一下，亨特里亚。如果你坚持公平战斗的话...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_3_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}...那你为什么要把用户戴夫的霉菌菌落放在板上呢？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_3_INTRO_11": "{SAY:winnie}这对我们来说是一个明显的劣势。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_3_INTRO_12": "{SAY:crazydave}嘿，这就是为什么那些家伙不在我的模具罐里！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_3_INTRO_13": "{SAY:hunterria}这很公平。强者必须保护弱者。 Hunterria 还将在决斗期间保护动物朋友。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_3_INTRO_14": "{SAY:hunterria}证明你作为猎人的荣誉。在我们决斗时保护你的霉菌朋友。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_3_INTRO_15": "{NPC_EXIT:hunterria}{SAY:winnie}好吧，用户戴夫。我想我们必须应付这些限制。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_3_INTRO_16": "{SAY:crazydave}我说比赛开始，朋朋！邻居，让我们来证明我们的荣誉吧！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_4_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:hunterria}{SAY:hunterria}胖子和邻居公平公正地赢得了战斗。 Hunterria 认识到他们的决心。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_4_INTRO_2": "{SAY:hunterria}你们三个是尊贵的对手。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_4_INTRO_3": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}你也不是好惹的，Hunterria！你打得很好！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_4_INTRO_4": "{SAY:hunterria}Hunterria 必须的。这是她身为猎人的职责。以及将军到老板。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_4_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}非常高贵。如果就这样了，亨特里亚，那么我们就告辞了——",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_4_INTRO_6": "{NPC_ENTER:nanny}{SAY:nanny}咳嗽。这——这到底是什么？你们四个在干什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_4_INTRO_7": "{SAY:hunterria}老妇人。亨特里亚正在与胖子和他的邻居决斗。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_4_INTRO_8": "{SAY:nanny}别说我老。你刚才说什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_4_INTRO_9": "{SAY:nanny}哦，我明白这是怎么回事了！先把这三个人干掉，才能赢得老板的好感吧？你抢到我了吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_4_INTRO_10": "{SAY:hunterria}Hunterria 不会做这样的事情。亨特里亚是——",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_4_INTRO_11": "{SAY:nanny}闭上你的陷阱，你这个原始异教徒。我不会因为某些人……某些宠物而失去工作！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_4_INTRO_12": "{SAY:nanny}我不能再回到街上了。尽管我很讨厌它，但僵王'的保护是唯一让我站起来的东西！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_4_INTRO_13": "{SAY:nanny}如果他摆脱了我并且那个胖子黑手党得到了风声......",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_4_INTRO_14": "{SAY:nanny}那就是如果僵王不先处理掉我的话！我并不是在寻找 70 年前的单程旅行！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_4_INTRO_15": "{SAY:crazydave}哇哦，Bossman真的会再这么做吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_4_INTRO_16": "{SAY:nanny}好吧，我不是想找出答案！滚开，你这个尼安德特人！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_4_INTRO_17": "{SAY:nanny}如果有人要为这三个人赢得荣誉，那就是我！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_4_INTRO_18": "{NPC_EXIT:hunterria}{NPC_EXIT:nanny}{TIRED:winnie}我们应该趁有机会就离开。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_5_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:hunterria}{SAY:hunterria}Hunterria 为昨天的事情道歉。老妇人正在经历问题。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_5_INTRO_2": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{TIRED:crazydave}这是描述她的一种方式......",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_5_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}你怎么回来了，亨特里亚？我的印象是我们的事情已经解决了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_5_INTRO_4": "{SAY:hunterria}我们的决斗还没有结束。亨特里亚仍然必须向老板证明她的价值。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_5_INTRO_5": "{SAY:hunterria}就像你向胖子证明了价值一样。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_5_INTRO_6": "{SAY:hunterria}Hunterria一直在看着你们两个。你和胖子的血缘关系，就是boss对Hunterria的关系。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_5_INTRO_7": "{SAY:crazydave}真的吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_5_INTRO_8": "{SAY:hunterria}是的：就像胖子提供家和照顾猛犸象一样，这就是boss为Hunterria所做的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_5_INTRO_9": "{SAY:hunterria}Boss关心Hunterria。把她从萨凡纳带走了。亨特里亚只是通过追捕你来回报老板的慷慨。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_5_INTRO_10": "{TIRED:crazydave}哦，天啊-当你这样说时......",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_5_INTRO_11": "{SAY:winnie}我发现这是一个错误的等价。用户戴夫从来没有要求我向他证明我的价值。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_5_INTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}Hunterria，如果僵王真的在乎你的话……",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_5_INTRO_13": "{SAY:winnie}...当你不再对他有用时，他不会威胁要抛弃你。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_5_INTRO_14": "{TIRED:crazydave}朋朋！你不能只对她说这种话！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_5_INTRO_15": "{SAY:hunterria}boss就是这样。 Hunterria很了解boss。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_5_INTRO_16": "{SAY:hunterria}Hunterria 现在正在追捕你。为了证明价值。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_5_INTRO_17": "{NPC_EXIT:hunterria}{SHOUT:crazydave}哦不，朋朋！我们该怎么办？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_5_INTRO_18": "{SHOUT:crazydave}就在这些小花也正在绽放的时候！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_5_INTRO_19": "{SAY:winnie}这很可能是Hunterria劫持他们的计划的一部分，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_5_INTRO_20": "{SAY:winnie}她自己说的，她一直在看着我们。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_5_INTRO_21": "{SAY:winnie}同时，这些刺草可以保护小花不被践踏。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_5_INTRO_22": "{SAY:winnie}但是我不能永远保证他们的安全。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_5_INTRO_23": "{SAY:winnie}邻居。现在就看你了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_6_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}朋朋，你觉得今天Hunterria还会出现吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_6_INTRO_2": "{SAY:crazydave}你知道。进行另一场决斗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_6_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}计算可能性...结果：2.8%",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_6_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}她可能需要时间来恢复自己，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_6_INTRO_5": "{SAY:crazydave}唷！我们终于可以低调一段时间了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_6_INTRO_6": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}我已经很喜欢她了——她是个僵尸而且……",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_6_INTRO_7": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}但是当她不是想杀我们的时候，她却出奇的和蔼可亲！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_6_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}恐怕我对她的印象仍然是负面的，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_6_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}尽管如此，即使她不在，这并不意味着没有其他僵尸不能——",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_6_INTRO_10": "{NPC_ENTER:nanny}{TIRED:winnie}...随时攻击我们。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_6_INTRO_11": "{SAY:nanny}好吧，好吧——咳。出色地。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_6_INTRO_12": "{SAY:nanny}我看到你终于厌倦了那只老狗亨特里亚。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_6_INTRO_13": "{SAY:nanny}在她已经软化了你之后，这对我来说是一个多么完美的机会来完成任务啊！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_6_INTRO_14": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}谢什，奶奶。你真的会利用这样的朋友吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_6_INTRO_15": "{SAY:nanny}她不是我的朋友。没有任何杂种狗会忠于僵王！呸!",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_6_INTRO_16": "{SAY:nanny}你们这些弱者今天斗不过我这群臭小子！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_6_INTRO_17": "{SAY:nanny}我给他们注射了僵王'强效增强配方！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_6_INTRO_18": "{SAY:nanny}让我们看看这些小鬼如何对抗你的植物！哈哈哈！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_8_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:hunterria}{SAY:hunterria}Hunterria 为昨天没有出现而道歉。亨特里亚正在照顾沃尔夫的后代。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_8_INTRO_2": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{PLAYFUL:crazydave}不用担心！我们也忙着给庄稼浇水！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_8_INTRO_3": "{SAY:hunterria}今天，我们的对决继续进行。亨特里亚将再次尝试赢得老板的青睐。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_8_INTRO_4": "{SAY:hunterria}Hunterria 让她的小动物朋友偷你的种子。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_8_INTRO_5": "{SAY:crazydave}什么——嘿！把那些包裹还回来，你们这些粘糊糊的黄鼠狼！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_8_INTRO_6": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}别担心，用户戴夫。我设法保存了一些种子包。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_8_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}虽然还有一个问题。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_8_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}今天，飞行标本发出的刺耳声音似乎挡住了天空，限制了我们获得的阳光。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_8_INTRO_9": "{SAY:crazydave}哇，一切都在上面了！翼龙、渡渡鸟、鹈鹕！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_8_INTRO_10": "{SAY:hunterria}Hunterria 请求她的飞行朋友帮忙。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_8_INTRO_11": "{TIRED:winnie}就这样，她成功地颠覆了我们。就像猫围困小老鼠一样。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_8_INTRO_12": "{EXCITED:crazydave}不愧是猎人！干得好，亨特利亚！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_8_INTRO_13": "{SAY:winnie}你为什么要祝贺她，用户戴夫？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_8_INTRO_14": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}嘿，当有人设法智胜你时，你就必须停下来，给他们应得的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_8_INTRO_15": "{SAY:hunterria}Boss很少夸奖Hunterria，所以Hunterria很欣赏这一点。谢谢你，胖子。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_8_INTRO_16": "{SAY:crazydave}噢，你不值得！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_8_INTRO_17": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}老板应该夸奖你的辛苦！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_8_INTRO_18": "{SAY:hunterria}Hunterria不这么认为。赞美并不是成为一名有效的猎人所必需的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_8_INTRO_19": "{SAY:hunterria}Hunterria 稍后会在 Boss 餐盘上见到你。再见。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_8_INTRO_20": "{NPC_EXIT:hunterria}{SAY:crazydave}天哪，那个女孩真是个喷火者！你不这么说吗，朋朋？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_8_INTRO_21": "{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，她的一只黄鼠狼刚刚钻进了你的裤子里。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_9_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:nanny}{SPECIAL1:nanny}你这个小老鼠！为什么你必须把它弄得这么@#$%！难的！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_9_INTRO_2": "{NPC_ENTER:hunterria}{SAY:hunterria}Hunterria只是在尽她的职责。也许老妇人应该好起来。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_9_INTRO_3": "{SPECIAL1:nanny}为什么，你@%$！，当我和你在一起时——咳嗽。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_9_INTRO_4": "{SAY:nanny}经历这一切之后我真的需要好好睡一觉。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_9_INTRO_5": "{SAY:nanny}带我进入一个让我满足的梦想......而不是要被解雇！听起来是不是很桃花呢？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_9_INTRO_6": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}吵什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_9_INTRO_7": "{SAY:nanny}呃，你是怎么得到的……？你们两个一直都在连接这个私人频道吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_9_INTRO_8": "{SAY:nanny}Tch，没关系。安全漏洞是他的问题。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_9_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}目前看来紧张局势处于高度紧张状态。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_9_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}假设：僵王即将决定“处置”谁。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_9_INTRO_11": "{SAY:nanny}这不会是我，你听到了吗？我为他工作的时间比你长，他不可能解雇我！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_9_INTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}既然如此，那你为什么这么紧张呢？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_9_INTRO_13": "{SPECIAL2:nanny}因为，@@#!$它，这个%&!@是个%$!#@笨蛋！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_9_INTRO_14": "{SAY:nanny}你知道那个自大狂是多么喜欢被人抚摸！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_9_INTRO_15": "{SAY:hunterria}Hunterria 刚刚开始工作。 Hunterria 不是@#$%！向上。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_9_INTRO_16": "{SPECIAL2:nanny}你@#$%！ @$$ ^&*!@",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_9_INTRO_17": "{SAY:hunterria}Hunterria不明白。 Hunterria 不是一只母狗。或者驴。或者猫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_9_INTRO_18": "{SAY:nanny}如果他解雇你，他会对你做的最糟糕的事情是什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_9_INTRO_19": "{SPECIAL1:nanny}他会把你送回那个@#$%！萨凡纳！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_9_INTRO_20": "{SAY:hunterria}...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_9_INTRO_21": "{SAY:hunterria}Hunterria回不去了。萨凡纳，萨凡纳已经消失了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_9_INTRO_22": "{TIRED:crazydave}没了？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_9_INTRO_23": "{SAY:hunterria}这就是Boss收留Hunterria和她的动物朋友的原因。Boss救了Hunterria。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_9_INTRO_24": "{SAY:hunterria}Hunterria永远感激Boss。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_9_INTRO_25": "{SAY:nanny}哦这个，这个好丰富啊！你认为他这样做是出于善意吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_9_INTRO_26": "{SAY:nanny}他在利用你，你这个笨蛋！你在他眼里连一条狗都没有！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_9_INTRO_27": "{SAY:hunterria}老太婆……为什么老太婆就不能感谢老板为我们俩所做的一切呢？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_9_INTRO_28": "{SAY:hunterria}Hunterria 可能是石器时代的那个。但老妇人的心是石头做的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_9_INTRO_29": "{SAY:nanny}...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_9_INTRO_30": "{SAY:nanny}呵呵，是这样吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_9_INTRO_31": "{SAY:nanny}好吧，讽刺的是，我并不是那个被谎言蒙蔽双眼的人。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_9_INTRO_32": "{SAY:nanny}我知道你知道他为什么要“救”你。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_9_INTRO_33": "{SAY:nanny}可怜。关于历史上最伟大的女猎手就到此为止了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_9_INTRO_34": "{NPC_EXIT:nanny}{SAY:crazydave}Hunterria，这是怎么回事？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_9_INTRO_35": "{SAY:hunterria}没什么。老太婆只是太残忍了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_9_INTRO_36": "{SAY:hunterria}胖子今天应该担心亨特里亚的计划。猛犸象会向胖子解释。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_9_INTRO_37": "{NPC_EXIT:hunterria}{TIRED:crazydave}朋朋...？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_9_INTRO_38": "{SAY:winnie}Hunterria 夺走了我们所有的太阳生产者，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_9_INTRO_39": "{SAY:winnie}这样积累起来会很麻烦-",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_9_INTRO_40": "{TIRED:crazydave}不是那个，朋朋，那——",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_9_INTRO_41": "{TIRED:winnie}抱歉，用户戴夫。但恐怕我们没有权利卷入这样的事情。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_9_INTRO_42": "{TIRED:winnie}为了我们的缘故，让我们抵挡亨特利亚的军队吧。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_10_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:nanny}{NPC_ENTER:hunterria}{SAY:nanny}你听到了，这不会是我！不是我吧！所以你最好现在就结束吧！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_10_INTRO_2": "{SAY:hunterria}老板这么说我们才知道。老太婆需要冷静一下。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_10_INTRO_3": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}是啊，我们还不知道，别打扰她，奶奶！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_10_INTRO_4": "{SAY:nanny}又是你！？这个漏洞怎么还没修好！？你为什么要关心？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_10_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}嗯，僵王解雇他的一名将军显然对我们有利。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_10_INTRO_6": "{SAY:nanny}哦，你来支持你最喜欢的，是吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_10_INTRO_7": "{SAY:nanny}好吧，如果我要倒下，我会把你们都和我一起倒下！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_10_INTRO_8": "{SHOUT:crazydave}哇哦！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_10_INTRO_9": "{SAY:hunterria}老妇人。放下——",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_10_INTRO_10": "{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}好消息，我忠诚的将军们！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_10_INTRO_11": "{SAY:zombossicon}你们都不会被解雇！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_10_INTRO_12": "{SAY:nanny}...！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_10_INTRO_13": "{SAY:zombossicon}事实证明，我忘记削减对这个由 Zom- Zomtarani 领导的已不复存在的部门的资助..？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_10_INTRO_14": "{SAY:zombossicon}那到底是谁？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_10_INTRO_15": "{SAY:zombossicon}反正这五年来他们一直在骗我们钱，所以我就把他们砍了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_10_INTRO_16": "{SAY:zombossicon}你们都可以保住自己的工作！真是一种解脱，是吧？我不必流放或冻结你们中的任何一个！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_10_INTRO_17": "{SAY:zombossicon}喂，脸怎么了！？我以为你会因此而高兴！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_10_INTRO_18": "{SAY:crazydave}所以没有人被解雇？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_10_INTRO_19": "{SAY:zombossicon}什么！？那是大卫吗！？他是怎么接到这个超级秘密电话的！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_10_INTRO_20": "{SAY:zombossicon}那个该死的记者肯定又篡改了我们的台词！我要和Zombillion谈谈！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_10_INTRO_21": "{SAY:zombossicon}你们其中一个，照顾好他们！他一定不能知道我们的内部运作！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_10_INTRO_22": "{NPC_EXIT:zombossicon}{SAY:hunterria}老妇人，我们不会被解雇。没有必要——",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_10_INTRO_23": "{SPECIAL2:nanny}@#$%&!@ 你@#$!& 在开玩笑吗！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_10_INTRO_24": "{SPECIAL1:nanny}他让我通过@$%@！又白回来了！？再次！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_10_INTRO_25": "{SPECIAL1:nanny}我要@#$%^！我需要找个地方发泄所有的愤怒！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_10_INTRO_26": "{SAY:nanny}你！保持静止！你们三个将为 ZOMBOSS 刚刚对我所做的事情付出代价！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_10_INTRO_27": "{NPC_EXIT:nanny}{SAY:crazydave}但我们什么也没做！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_10_INTRO_28": "{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，我检测到一大群小鬼正在逼近。是谁派他们来的并不神秘。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_10_INTRO_29": "{SAY:hunterria}别担心，铁猛犸象。 Hunterria愿意与你签订临时契约。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_10_INTRO_30": "{SAY:crazydave}嗯，但是为什么呢？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_10_INTRO_31": "{SAY:hunterria}老太婆的所作所为是不光彩的。因为某人做了某事而惩罚某人。这是不公正的。这是背叛。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_10_INTRO_32": "{SAY:hunterria}而背叛是亨特里亚最讨厌的。所以 Hunterria 会帮助你。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_10_INTRO_33": "{SAY:hunterria}你已被证明是值得尊敬的对手，与老妇人不同。你应该被同样尊贵的对手击败。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_10_INTRO_34": "{SAY:winnie}我想那就是你吧？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_10_INTRO_35": "{SAY:hunterria}猛犸象再次读心。是的，老妇人打不过你，因为如果有人能打败你，那就是亨特利亚了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_10_INTRO_36": "{SAY:hunterria}Hunterria将派出恐龙增援。好好利用它们。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_10_INTRO_37": "{SAY:hunterria}Hunterria 希望你能活下来。这样我们就可以改天再决斗。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_10_INTRO_38": "{NPC_EXIT:hunterria}{SAY:crazydave}她是一只奇特的僵尸！你认为我们会知道她的交易是什么，朋朋？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_10_INTRO_39": "{SAY:winnie}好吧，为了实现这一点，我们必须首先活下来。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_09_HARVEST_10_INTRO_40": "{SAY:winnie}系好安全带，用户戴夫，邻居。我们有一片草坪需要保卫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_1_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:winnie}警报，用户戴夫。入侵者入内。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_1_INTRO_2": "{EXCITED:winnie}我检测到一大群食尸鬼和怪物在附近游荡。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_1_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}我要部署我们的武器库吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_1_INTRO_4": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SAY:crazydave}哇，冷静一下，朋朋！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_1_INTRO_5": "{SAY:crazydave}这些只是“不给糖就捣蛋”！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_1_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}查找术语：“Trick or treaters”。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_1_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}一个人，通常是孩子，穿着盛装，挨家挨户讨要糖果。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_1_INTRO_8": "{SAY:crazydave}是的，就是这样！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_1_INTRO_9": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}我想你以前从来没有真正庆祝过万圣节吧？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_1_INTRO_10": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}每年的这个时候我们通常都会在时间轴上踢僵尸屁股！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_1_INTRO_11": "{SAY:crazydave}我们从来不只是呆在家里分发糖果。这一定是你困惑的原因！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_1_INTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}我明白了。你是对的，用户戴夫。我将相应地更新我的数据库。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_1_INTRO_13": "{SAY:winnie}所以每个月的这个时候装扮成僵尸是常态。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_1_INTRO_14": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}完全正常！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_1_INTRO_15": "{SAY:winnie}这样会很麻烦。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_1_INTRO_16": "{SAY:winnie}我们如何区分僵尸和冒充僵尸的孩子？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_1_INTRO_17": "{SAY:crazydave}嗯，这可能是显而易见的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_1_INTRO_18": "{SAY:crazydave}但是你是一台智能机器，朋朋！充分利用这些扫描仪！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_1_INTRO_19": "{SAY:winnie}注意到。扫描成功。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_1_INTRO_20": "{SAY:crazydave}哇，我们说话的时候你在扫描？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_1_INTRO_21": "{SAY:winnie}僵尸，真正的不死生命体，在我们家门口被发现。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_1_INTRO_22": "{SAY:crazydave}哦，我现在看到他们了！哎呀，这可不是什么不给糖就捣蛋的事了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_1_INTRO_23": "{SAY:crazydave}邻居，我们来种植吧！别让这些僵尸得到我们的糖果！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_1_INTRO_24": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}当然还有大脑。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_2_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}我们在黑暗时代、朋朋做什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_2_INTRO_2": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}您不想再沉迷于“不给糖就捣蛋”的传统吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_2_INTRO_3": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我准备了糖果碗！你可以尝试把它们送给孩子们！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_2_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}抱歉，用户戴夫。但责任在召唤。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_2_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}尽管扩大我的知识面很诱人，但僵尸入侵并没有消退。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_2_INTRO_6": "{TIRED:crazydave}该死。我想这个更重要。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_2_INTRO_7": "{SAY:crazydave}放在我身上，朋朋，这次我们有什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_2_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}小动物。数额异常之大。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_2_INTRO_9": "{SAY:crazydave}奇怪。可能是什么原因造成的——",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_2_INTRO_10": "{NPC_ENTER:hunterria}{PLAYFUL:crazydave}但是当然！还能是谁呢？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_2_INTRO_11": "{SAY:winnie}这次的对手果然是亨特利亚将军，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_2_INTRO_12": "{SAY:hunterria}...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_2_INTRO_13": "{SAY:crazydave}呃……Hunterria，你就站在那里吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_2_INTRO_14": "{SAY:hunterria}我亨特里亚。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_2_INTRO_15": "{TIRED:crazydave}呃...是的。我们见过面。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_2_INTRO_16": "{SAY:winnie}最近也是如此。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_2_INTRO_17": "{SAY:hunterria}我Hunterria，我会派动物追捕你。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_2_INTRO_18": "{SAY:crazydave}我们知道！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_2_INTRO_19": "{SAY:hunterria}好。亨特里亚还有更多邪恶的事情要做！小心，亨特利亚会抓住你的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_2_INTRO_20": "{NPC_EXIT:hunterria}{TIRED:crazydave}这很奇怪。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_2_INTRO_21": "{SAY:winnie}我们可以稍后处理，用户戴夫。目前，这些生物需要采取行动。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_4_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}说，朋朋，直到现在我才想到。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_4_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}做了什么，用户戴夫？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_4_INTRO_3": "{SAY:crazydave}万圣节期间僵尸似乎更加活跃！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_4_INTRO_4": "{SAY:crazydave}我记得老板曾经说过这样的话。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_4_INTRO_5": "{SAY:crazydave}有什么联系吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_4_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}研究中...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_4_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}这个庆祝活动似乎起源于人们纪念分离灵魂的时刻。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_4_INTRO_8": "{SAY:crazydave}灵魂分离吧？从技术上讲，僵尸和幽灵就是这样，对吧？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_4_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}是的，尽管这个庆祝活动和僵尸活动之间的任何联系仍不清楚。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_4_INTRO_10": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}也许我们应该问其中一位来找出答案！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_4_INTRO_11": "{NPC_ENTER:hunterria}{EXCITED:crazydave}说到恶魔，那就是亨特利亚了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_4_INTRO_12": "{SAY:crazydave}Hunterria，万圣节和僵尸活动有什么联系吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_4_INTRO_13": "{SAY:hunterria}...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_4_INTRO_14": "{SAY:hunterria}没有。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_4_INTRO_15": "{SAY:crazydave}真的吗？然后-",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_4_INTRO_16": "{SAY:hunterria}僵尸工作日历从十月开始。这就是为什么僵尸在万圣节前后效率更高。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_4_INTRO_17": "{SAY:hunterria}很多僵尸办公时间是晚上。鬼魂和神秘生物也是如此。这就是为什么万圣节之夜会有更多怪物的原因。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_4_INTRO_18": "{SAY:crazydave}...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_4_INTRO_19": "{SAY:winnie}你似乎对这件事非常了解，Hunterria。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_4_INTRO_20": "{SAY:hunterria}Hunterria 是穴居女人。并不是说她傻。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_4_INTRO_21": "{SAY:hunterria}她有办公室工作。和老板一起。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_4_INTRO_22": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}我想这在僵尸社会里也算办公室工作吧。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_4_INTRO_23": "{SAY:hunterria}万圣节的意义是庆祝邪恶。像亨特利亚那样邪恶。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_4_INTRO_24": "{SAY:hunterria}这就是为什么Hunterria会聚集更多的动物！她正在策划邪恶！看看亨特里亚有多邪恶！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_4_INTRO_25": "{TIRED:crazydave}好吧……？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_4_INTRO_26": "{SAY:hunterria}Hunterria 会抓住你的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_4_INTRO_27": "{NPC_EXIT:hunterria}{TIRED:winnie}好吧，这次我不能忽视这一点。这令人费解。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_4_INTRO_28": "{TIRED:crazydave}对吧……？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_5_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}朋朋，你也有感觉吗？我觉得有人在看着我们！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_5_INTRO_2": "{SAY:crazydave}但是当我回头一看，却没有人！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_5_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}最好奇。由于某种莫名其妙的原因，僵尸们变得隐形了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_5_INTRO_4": "{SAY:crazydave}不再！这是万圣节魔法在起作用吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_5_INTRO_5": "{SAY:crazydave}有些僵尸本身就足够可怕了！为什么它们也需要隐形？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_5_INTRO_6": "{NPC_ENTER:hunterria}{EXCITED:crazydave}又是你！ Hunterria，你是这件事的幕后黑手吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_5_INTRO_7": "{SAY:crazydave}你正在使用万圣节魔法让你的小动物隐形吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_5_INTRO_8": "{SAY:hunterria}没有。隐形技术已经成为僵尸的家喻户晓的技术。不需要魔法。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_5_INTRO_9": "{SAY:crazydave}哦，那就是——等等，什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_5_INTRO_10": "{SAY:hunterria}僵尸科学家非常先进。他们也篡改个人时间旅行。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_5_INTRO_11": "{TIRED:crazydave}...假设您不知道这一切是错误的吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_5_INTRO_12": "{SAY:hunterria}因为Hunterria穴居女？你有偏见。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_5_INTRO_13": "{SAY:winnie}也许我们低估了她的专业知识。她是僵王的将军。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_5_INTRO_14": "{SAY:hunterria}车辆右侧。亨特里亚今晚会做更多的坏事。收集更多的动物。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_5_INTRO_15": "{SAY:hunterria}不要妨碍。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_5_INTRO_16": "{NPC_EXIT:hunterria}{SAY:crazydave}朋朋，这是怎么回事？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_5_INTRO_17": "{SAY:winnie}我说我们还是静观其变吧，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_6_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:winnie}警报，警报！检测到违反时间线！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_6_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}一些异常现象已经出现在我们的现代生活中。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_6_INTRO_3": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SHOUT:crazydave}又是那些变种人！僵尸！他们怎么到这里来了？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_6_INTRO_4": "{NPC_ENTER:hunterria}{SAY:hunterria}是Hunterria在做的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_6_INTRO_5": "{SAY:hunterria}Hunterria 完成了动物采集。她现在将收集僵博机器人ani。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_6_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}请问这样做的目的是什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_6_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}你似乎非常坚持告诉我们你正在集结部队。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_6_INTRO_8": "{SAY:hunterria}...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_6_INTRO_9": "{SAY:hunterria}Hunterria正在建立军队。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_6_INTRO_10": "{SAY:crazydave}是啊，但是为了什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_6_INTRO_11": "{SAY:hunterria}拿下Boss。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_6_INTRO_12": "{SAY:crazydave}H-哈？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_6_INTRO_13": "{SAY:hunterria}Hunterria 是邪恶的。但Boss更是如此。亨特利亚现在明白了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_6_INTRO_14": "{SAY:hunterria}Hunterria将使用动物和僵博机器人any来制造叛乱。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_6_INTRO_15": "{SHOUT:crazydave}叛逆？对抗僵王！？太疯狂了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_6_INTRO_16": "{SAY:crazydave}你怎么了，Hunterria？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_6_INTRO_17": "{SAY:hunterria}原因。原因到了亨特里亚。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_6_INTRO_18": "{SAY:hunterria}Boss必须被推翻。如果你站在亨特里亚的路上，她也会把你打倒。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_6_INTRO_19": "{NPC_EXIT:hunterria}{SAY:crazydave}朋朋，这是真的吗？亨特里亚为何突然叛变？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_6_INTRO_20": "{SAY:winnie}这里有些地方不太对劲。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_6_INTRO_21": "{SAY:winnie}Hunterria因对僵王的忠诚而臭名昭著。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_6_INTRO_22": "{SAY:winnie}我有一个理论。但将所有内容拼凑起来需要一些时间。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_6_INTRO_23": "{SAY:crazydave}我的心被震撼了！怎么了！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_8_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}怎么样，朋朋？你知道和 Hunterria 有什么关系吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_8_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}不完全是，用户戴夫。看来我已经走进了死胡同。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_8_INTRO_3": "{SAY:crazydave}如果老板被推翻对我们意味着什么？这样好吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_8_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}如果要暴力取出僵王，毫无疑问会引发骚乱。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_8_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}僵尸将群龙无首，许多僵尸将争夺这个位置。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_8_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}在歇斯底里中，群众更容易爆发暴力。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_8_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}很可能是针对我们这个共同的敌人。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_8_INTRO_8": "{EXCITED:crazydave}为什么亨特里亚会想要这样的东西？她从来都不是暴力型的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_8_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}不，她不是，从我们之前的遭遇来看，这是事实。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_8_INTRO_10": "{SAY:crazydave}我们应该告诉老板这件事吗？但这会对他有帮助。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_8_INTRO_11": "{SAY:crazydave}我们该怎么办，朋朋？什么-",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_8_INTRO_12": "{NPC_ENTER:hunterria}{SAY:hunterria}咳嗽。咳嗽。你#$%@！ imps 又做到了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_8_INTRO_13": "{SAY:crazydave}...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_8_INTRO_14": "{SAY:winnie}...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_8_INTRO_15": "{SAY:crazydave}...什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_8_INTRO_16": "{SAY:hunterria}什么？你目瞪口呆，你这个小丑？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_8_INTRO_17": "{SAY:crazydave}亨泰利亚！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_8_INTRO_18": "{SAY:hunterria}亨泰利亚……？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_8_INTRO_19": "{SAY:hunterria}哦！@#!$！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_8_INTRO_20": "{SAY:hunterria}这不是正确的造型！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_8_INTRO_21": "{NPC_EXIT:hunterria}{SAY:winnie}我想我现在明白了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_8_INTRO_22": "{SAY:crazydave}朋朋，这、这是怎么回事！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_8_INTRO_23": "{SAY:winnie}稍后，用户戴夫。目前。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_8_INTRO_24": "{SAY:winnie}让我们照顾一下“Hunterria”离开我们的这些小鬼吧。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_9_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}那么到底发生了什么，朋朋？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_9_INTRO_2": "{SAY:crazydave}其实一直都是保姆？不是亨特利亚吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_9_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}都不是，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_9_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}想想，谁沉迷于谎言和欺骗，总乐于欺骗群众？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_9_INTRO_5": "{SAY:crazydave}哈！？你说的是——",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_9_INTRO_6": "{NPC_ENTER:missinfo}{SAY:missinfo}早上好，邻里镇！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_9_INTRO_7": "{SPECIAL1:missinfo}*鼓掌特效*",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_9_INTRO_8": "{SHOUT:crazydave}什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_9_INTRO_9": "{SAY:missinfo}我们从海盗港湾向大家直播报道！疯狂戴夫在哪里惹事生非！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_9_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}信息小姐！这几天的袭击事件就是你干的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_9_INTRO_11": "{SAY:winnie}你一直伪装成Hunterria来滋事！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_9_INTRO_12": "{SAY:missinfo}如此诽谤！向群众传播恶作剧是刑事犯罪，你知道吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_9_INTRO_13": "{SAY:missinfo}我对此一无所知！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_9_INTRO_14": "{SPECIAL3:missinfo}*笑声曲目*",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_9_INTRO_15": "{SAY:crazydave}为什么要陷害Hunterria和The Nanny对僵王发动政变？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_9_INTRO_16": "{SAY:missinfo}什么啊啊啊啊！？我什么都没听说过！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_9_INTRO_17": "{SAY:missinfo}这几天亨特利亚将军的目击事件其实都是政变企图？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_9_INTRO_18": "{SAY:missinfo}你明白了吗，杰里米？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_9_INTRO_19": "{SAY:missinfo}突发新闻，伙计们！突发新闻！热销媒体！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_9_INTRO_20": "{SAY:winnie}别说了，用户戴夫。她用你的话来对付你！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_9_INTRO_21": "{SAY:missinfo}不，拜托！多说话吧！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_9_INTRO_22": "{SAY:missinfo}你对僵王博士和他的将军之间的这场丑闻冲突了解多少？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_9_INTRO_23": "{SAY:winnie}我们没什么可对你说的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_9_INTRO_24": "{SAY:missinfo}真令人失望！我想这又回到了我们预定的节目了，伙计们！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_9_INTRO_25": "{SAY:missinfo}这就是——疯狂戴夫！是的，就是你，疯狂的戴夫！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_9_INTRO_26": "{SAY:crazydave}M-我！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_9_INTRO_27": "{SAY:missinfo}你受到攻击了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_10_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:missinfo}{SAY:missinfo}可悲的是，这就是我们今天的全部时间了，伙计们！杰里米，滚动片尾字幕！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_10_INTRO_2": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}我们需要答案，信息小姐！我们知道您已经停播了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_10_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}为什么要发动政变并把责任归咎于亨特里亚？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_10_INTRO_4": "{SAY:missinfo}为什么，你们很执着，我亲爱的观众！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_10_INTRO_5": "{SAY:missinfo}我想，我们可以接受这个“假设”。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_10_INTRO_6": "{SAY:missinfo}如果我伪装成亨特利亚将军来“发动”“政变”，那可是天大的新闻啊！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_10_INTRO_7": "{SAY:missinfo}想象一下，僵王博士'将军们正在他眼皮子底下酝酿骚乱，而他却一无所知！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_10_INTRO_8": "{SAY:missinfo}收视率飙升！全部剧情！紧张！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_10_INTRO_9": "{SAY:crazydave}你布置场景只是为了将其作为新闻报道？为了提高收视率？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_10_INTRO_10": "{SAY:crazydave}你就不能报道真实的新闻吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_10_INTRO_11": "{SAY:missinfo}“真实”新闻？啊哈哈哈！亲爱的观众，新闻就是我认为的那样！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_10_INTRO_12": "{SAY:missinfo}人们不想被告知，他们想要被娱乐！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_10_INTRO_13": "{SAY:missinfo}想象一下，你还想看更多...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_10_INTRO_14": "{SAY:missinfo}关于僵尸经济低迷的更令人沮丧的消息，还是政治家之间的戏剧性事件？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_10_INTRO_15": "{SAY:winnie}公然欺骗自己的观众，你没有悔意吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_10_INTRO_16": "{SAY:missinfo}悔恨？这只是生意，亲爱的！这就是观众想要的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_10_INTRO_17": "{SAY:missinfo}我不明白为什么我应该为满足人民的要求而感到悔恨！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_10_INTRO_18": "{SAY:winnie}我非常怀疑。所有这些谎言必定有更大的理由。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_10_INTRO_19": "{SAY:missinfo}你很执着地认为我说谎就是事实，我明白吗？多么有趣啊！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_10_INTRO_20": "{SAY:crazydave}你不说真话就是事实！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_10_INTRO_21": "{SAY:missinfo}真理不是事实或理性的东西。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_10_INTRO_22": "{SAY:missinfo}事实就是大家都同意的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_10_INTRO_23": "{SAY:crazydave}所以你就是喜欢说谎……？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_10_INTRO_24": "{SAY:missinfo}如果说谎意味着做我的工作，那么是的！没有什么更多的了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_10_INTRO_25": "{SAY:missinfo}我这样做是出于对我的职业的纯粹热爱！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_10_INTRO_26": "{SAY:missinfo}啊，好难过啊。看来我的工会规定的休息时间快结束了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_10_INTRO_27": "{SAY:missinfo}我向你告别了，我会在我们的美食大战节目中见到你，还有一位特邀嘉宾！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_10_INTRO_28": "{SAY:missinfo}记住，你们三个......",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_10_INTRO_29": "{SAY:missinfo}没有人会相信你。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_10_INTRO_30": "{NPC_EXIT:missinfo}{SAY:winnie}好吧，谜团解开了，用户戴夫。亨特里亚并没有发动政变。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_10_INTRO_31": "{SAY:crazydave}这可能不是超级恐怖，但这是一个疯狂的万圣节！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_10_INTRO_32": "{SAY:crazydave}有人可以因为喜欢撒谎就撒谎吗？太混乱了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_10_INTRO_33": "{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，鉴于我们正在处理的对象的性质......",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_10_HALLOWEEN_10_INTRO_34": "{SAY:winnie}谁敢说她刚才的推理不是又一个谎言？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_1_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SAY:crazydave}朋朋，为什么我听到一阵骚动？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_1_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}正在扫描……",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_1_INTRO_3": "{TIRED:winnie}恐怕我有一个可怕的消息，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_1_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}一年一度的丧尸英雄大会刚刚开始。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_1_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}今年的参加人数似乎创下了历史新高。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_1_INTRO_6": "{SAY:crazydave}哦，呸！这是怎么回事？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_1_INTRO_7": "{EXCITED:winnie}你可能还记得，去年的大会是一场多事的大会——",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_1_INTRO_8": "{EXCITED:winnie}-迷彩将军登场，向世界介绍全新的僵尸英雄。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_1_INTRO_9": "{SAY:crazydave}哦，对了！那是我们第一次见到他的时候！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_1_INTRO_10": "{TIRED:crazydave}等等，这是否意味着我们今年会再次见到他？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_1_INTRO_11": "{SAY:winnie}否定，因为大会已经更新了规则和指南。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_1_INTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}新增内容包括：“所有与会者必须淋浴”",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_1_INTRO_13": "{PLAYFUL:winnie}以及“不允许出现疯狂的军事将领。”",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_1_INTRO_14": "{SAY:crazydave}他们禁止将军参加活动了？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_1_INTRO_15": "{TIRED:winnie}是的，这往往发生在你把一个事件炸成碎片之后。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_1_INTRO_16": "{SAY:winnie}但是回到不断增加的出席人数-",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_1_INTRO_17": "{SAY:winnie}卡莫将军推出的新英雄已经赢得了自己的狂热者。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_1_INTRO_18": "{SAY:crazydave}哦，原来参加的人都是新生代英雄迷啊！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_1_INTRO_19": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}我想知道OG粉丝们会如何处理？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_1_INTRO_20": "{SAY:winnie}我们只能推测，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_1_INTRO_21": "{EXCITED:winnie}重要的是我们要面对的僵尸数量增加了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_1_INTRO_22": "{EXCITED:winnie}所以保持警惕，让我们击退这些英雄崇拜者！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_2_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SAY:crazydave}哇哦，朋朋！这些人越来越不守规矩了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_2_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}是的，用户戴夫。网上的反应也反映了类似的态度。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_2_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}新老英雄粉丝的内讧浮出水面。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_2_INTRO_4": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}为什么他们还要看门利益？这可不是什么好的粉丝礼仪啊！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_2_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}我们关心的应该是僵尸之间日益混乱，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_2_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}它可能对旁观植物造成危险。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_2_INTRO_7": "{SAY:crazydave}不好！我们该呼吁谁来阻止这种疯狂行为？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_2_INTRO_8": "{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}我听到你大声而清晰，大卫！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_2_INTRO_9": "{SAY:crazydave}老板，你在这里做什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_2_INTRO_10": "{SAY:zombossicon}作为仍然从这些活动中获得版税支票的人，确保其顺利运行是我的首要任务！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_2_INTRO_11": "{SAY:winnie}是这样吗？那么你会亲自介入并调解这场冲突吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_2_INTRO_12": "{SAY:zombossicon}什么！？当然不是！我不会让自己陷入一群狂热的英雄粉丝之中！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_2_INTRO_13": "{SAY:zombossicon}不，我得到了下一个最好的东西，调解专家，你可以说-",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_2_INTRO_14": "{EXCITED:crazydave}哦，是谁？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_2_INTRO_15": "{SAY:zombossicon}专家！到帖子里举报吧！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_2_INTRO_16": "{NPC_ENTER:zombert}{TIRED:crazydave}僵尸！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_2_INTRO_17": "{TIRED:winnie}...你在开玩笑吧？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_2_INTRO_18": "{SAY:zombert}Hue Hue Hue…终于可以和HERO Bassloid见面了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_2_INTRO_19": "{SAY:zombossicon}是的，是的，当然，无论如何！只要确保阻止这些白痴互相残杀即可！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_2_INTRO_20": "{SAY:zombert}我只要阻止这些家伙打架就行了？布拉，这有多难？主要技能问题。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_2_INTRO_21": "{TIRED:winnie}这只是把你的侄子扔进一群愤怒的粉丝的借口吗僵王？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_2_INTRO_22": "{SAY:zombert}我只是想见见Bassloid，兄弟。色相色相。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_2_INTRO_23": "{SAY:zombossicon}你这么想我很生气！我绝不会希望我心爱的侄子受到伤害！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_2_INTRO_24": "{SAY:zombert}我什么时候见到她？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_2_INTRO_25": "{SAY:crazydave}你在背后交叉手指，老板。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_2_INTRO_26": "{SAY:zombossicon}无论如何！我亲爱的侄子，这件事就交给你能干的手吧！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_2_INTRO_27": "{SAY:zombossicon}记住，让他们把愤怒引向别的事情！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_2_INTRO_28": "{NPC_EXIT:zombossicon}{SAY:zombert}你可以信赖我，unc。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_2_INTRO_29": "{SAY:zombert}一旦我完成了，我会检查她是否像我在我的设置布拉旁边得到的她的真人大小的复制品。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_2_INTRO_30": "{TIRED:crazydave}呃……那么Zombert，你到底有什么计划来停止战斗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_2_INTRO_31": "{SAY:zombert}...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_2_INTRO_32": "{SAY:zombert}IDK。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_3_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:zombert}{SAY:zombert}聊天，这些家伙根本不听我说话，我该怎么办。也许这个胡子家伙知道。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_3_INTRO_2": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SAY:winnie}也许你应该找个更有能力的人，Zombert。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_3_INTRO_3": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}是啊，让他们来处理吧！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_3_INTRO_4": "{SAY:zombert}L 移动。不会看到贝斯洛德...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_3_INTRO_5": "{SAY:zombert}聊天，如果他们不听Zombert，也许他们会听Super Zombert。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_3_INTRO_6": "{SAY:crazydave}谁是超级僵尸？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_3_INTRO_7": "{SAY:zombert}Hue Hue Hue...这是我的超级英雄sona brah...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_3_INTRO_8": "{SAY:zombert}他与他的宿敌保姆特隆战斗。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_3_INTRO_9": "{SAY:zombert}你可以从我小时候制作的漫画的免费赠品中找到更多信息。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_3_INTRO_10": "{SAY:zombert}超级英雄迷只能听超级英雄的话。 W的想法。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_3_INTRO_11": "{SAY:zombert}这意味着这次大会需要一个英雄......",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_3_INTRO_12": "{TIRED:winnie}这太白痴了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_3_INTRO_13": "{EXCITED:winnie}之所以会出现这种情况，是因为英雄太多了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_3_INTRO_14": "{SAY:winnie}你的解决方案是再做一个吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_3_INTRO_15": "{SAY:zombert}Super Zombert 比所有其他人都酷，除了 Bassloid 之外。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_3_INTRO_16": "{SAY:zombert}看，呵——他可以时间旅行，而且他超级强大。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_3_INTRO_17": "{SAY:zombert}比我频道上的僵企罢工更强。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_3_INTRO_18": "{SAY:zombert}超级僵尸将拯救城市！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_3_INTRO_19": "{TIRED:crazydave}嗯，这是一座城市……",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_3_INTRO_20": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}但我不知道失落之城还能保存什么！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_3_INTRO_21": "{TIRED:winnie}这将会以可怕的方式结束。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_4_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:zombert}{SAY:zombert}群众还没有听超级Zombert聊天。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_4_INTRO_2": "{SAY:zombert}当我们执行W拯救动作时，他们会听并按铃。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_4_INTRO_3": "{SAY:zombert}我们需要做更多的英雄事迹，缩略图将是史诗般的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_4_INTRO_4": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{TIRED:winnie}我认为这在某种程度上意味着帮助他们吃掉我们的大脑？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_4_INTRO_5": "{SAY:zombert}色调色调色调...是的，布拉。我需要拯救他们。就像《Flothright》中那样拯救世界。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_4_INTRO_6": "{SAY:zombert}Fowcwavt Fortquite Flpcraft Fptgvsgr",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_4_INTRO_7": "{SAY:zombert}我无法拼写它@mods帮助",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_4_INTRO_8": "{TIRED:crazydave}超级僵尸有什么帮助吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_4_INTRO_9": "{SAY:zombert}简单，超级僵尸拥有无限的耐力，他可以独奏sups Brainz，没有区别",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_4_INTRO_10": "{SAY:zombert}看，他会在这10波挑战中向你展示他的力量！你不会看到它的到来。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_4_INTRO_11": "{SAY:zombert}请保持10分钟以上。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_4_INTRO_12": "{TIRED:winnie}我们确实会看到它的到来。你刚刚告诉我们了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_4_INTRO_13": "{SAY:zombert}哇哦，魔法师，你的can也是超级英雄吗？她能读心术！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_4_INTRO_14": "{SAY:zombert}我要用锡纸包住我的头。这会抵消读心波。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_4_INTRO_15": "{SAY:zombert}我在 TrueNews 播客上听到了这个。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_4_INTRO_16": "{NPC_EXIT:zombert}{SAY:crazydave}朋朋...？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_4_INTRO_17": "{TIRED:winnie}是的，用户戴夫？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_4_INTRO_18": "{SAY:crazydave}你真的会读心术吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_5_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:zombert}{SAY:zombert}我作为友好邻居超级僵尸的事迹还没有被看到，聊天。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_5_INTRO_2": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{TIRED:winnie}也许那是因为实际上没有做好事...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_5_INTRO_3": "{SAY:zombert}那么超级僵尸没办法，只能释放出他的超级秘密能力。色调色调色调...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_5_INTRO_4": "{SAY:zombert}隐形！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_5_INTRO_5": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{TIRED:crazydave}又不是……",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_5_INTRO_6": "{SAY:zombert}Huehueheue...现实生活中我其实也有这个能力，聊天。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_5_INTRO_7": "{SAY:crazydave}你？可以隐形吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_5_INTRO_8": "{SAY:zombert}是啊，兄弟。每当我出现在公共场合时，都没有人注意到我在那里。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_5_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_5_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}抛开压抑的创伤不谈，看来僵尸确实已经变得隐形了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_5_INTRO_11": "{SAY:zombert}这一天又得救了，多亏了超级赞伯特。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_5_INTRO_12": "{SAY:zombert}这次大会有一位英雄......",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_5_INTRO_13": "{NPC_EXIT:zombert}{SAY:crazydave}天啊。这孩子长大后会让一些心理医生变得富有！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_5_INTRO_14": "{SAY:winnie}我怀疑那个脑袋里有很多东西需要分析。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_5_INTRO_15": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}...僵尸有精神病吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_6_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:winnie}用户戴夫，我需要报告这个异常。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_6_INTRO_2": "{EXCITED:winnie}今天大会上的丧尸似乎明显缩小了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_6_INTRO_3": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{EXCITED:crazydave}啊，终于！人群散去！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_6_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}不，用户戴夫。我的意思是，从字面上看，僵尸本身已经缩小了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_6_INTRO_5": "{SAY:crazydave}哦。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_6_INTRO_6": "{SAY:crazydave}谁会这么做？我发誓，我没有把手放在那些萎缩的紫罗兰身上！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_6_INTRO_7": "{EXCITED:crazydave}喘气！一定是那些僵尸英雄之一！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_6_INTRO_8": "{SAY:crazydave}我记得其中一个曾经有收缩射线...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_6_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}还好，不是锈栓，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_6_INTRO_10": "{SAY:crazydave}然后谁——",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_6_INTRO_11": "{NPC_ENTER:zombert}{SAY:zombert}很明显你不知道，huehue...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_6_INTRO_12": "{SAY:zombert}超级僵尸的尺寸操纵能力让农民感到困惑。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_6_INTRO_13": "{SAY:zombert}真正的粉丝会知道这一点并做好准备......",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_6_INTRO_14": "{SAY:crazydave}你把这些家伙缩小了？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_6_INTRO_15": "{SAY:zombert}是啊，兄弟。呼呼呼。你生气了吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_6_INTRO_16": "{TIRED:crazydave}……把这些家伙变大不是更有帮助吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_6_INTRO_17": "{SAY:zombert}............",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_7_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:zombert}{SAY:zombert}看，聊天，现在我要使用心灵遥感的力量了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_7_INTRO_2": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SAY:crazydave}这家伙到底有多少力量？？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_7_INTRO_3": "{SAY:zombert}我还确保超级僵尸拥有不受所有伤害的护盾。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_7_INTRO_4": "{SAY:zombert}...而且他对破盾魔法免疫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_7_INTRO_5": "{SAY:crazydave}那这家伙会做什么呢？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_7_INTRO_6": "{SAY:zombert}我将移动所有这些滑块将僵尸引导到巨石陷阱。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_7_INTRO_7": "{SAY:zombert}而且它会杀死濒临灭绝的植物... 1000 IQ",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_7_INTRO_8": "{TIRED:crazydave}呃…这个布局似乎妥协了…",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_7_INTRO_9": "{SAY:zombert}呼呼呼……是的，为你对抗。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_7_INTRO_10": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}我的意思是这个布局对我们的好处比对你的好处多！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_7_INTRO_11": "{SAY:zombert}你只是看不到愿景。我现在在主机上。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_7_INTRO_12": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}也许你应该称呼它为Zombert。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_7_INTRO_13": "{SAY:winnie}显然，您的尝试不起作用。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_7_INTRO_14": "{SAY:zombert}不，兄弟！我需要看看 Bassloid！听着，我会让她兴奋起来。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_7_INTRO_15": "{SAY:crazydave}朋朋...？翻译？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_7_INTRO_16": "{TIRED:winnie}Zombert 的一半词汇不在我的任何口语数据库中，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_7_INTRO_17": "{SAY:zombert}我要像Super Zombert一样，他有一个每天都救的女朋友，Interpret小姐。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_7_INTRO_18": "{TIRED:crazydave}呃……",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_7_INTRO_19": "{TIRED:winnie}最好不要问，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_7_INTRO_20": "{SAY:zombert}我要拯救Bassloid，就像超级僵尸从The Nanny-tron 手中拯救Interpret小姐一样。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_7_INTRO_21": "{SAY:zombert}现在我要做一个很酷的翻转。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_7_INTRO_22": "{NPC_EXIT:zombert}{TIRED:winnie}用户戴夫。让我们...忘记我们听到过的任何事情。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_8_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:zombert}{SAY:zombert}好的，聊吧。这次一定会成功的",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_8_INTRO_2": "{SAY:zombert}超级僵尸将使用他的终极力量......无敌！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_8_INTRO_3": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{PLAYFUL:crazydave}这个力量至少是真实的，不是吗，朋朋？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_8_INTRO_4": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}他被杀了还能再回来，简直就是无敌了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_8_INTRO_5": "{TIRED:winnie}我不认为这就是这个词的意思。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_8_INTRO_6": "{SAY:zombert}blud 说什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_8_INTRO_7": "{SAY:zombert}亚普维尔市长在这里……",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_8_INTRO_8": "{SAY:zombert}总之，我的能力还不止这些。我还可以控制动物。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_8_INTRO_9": "{SAY:crazydave}这不是Hunterria的牛群吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_8_INTRO_10": "{SAY:zombert}是的。当我告诉她 unc 给我下的命令时，她就让我借了，呵呵……",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_8_INTRO_11": "{SAY:zombert}一般她只是叫她的狗把我赶走...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_8_INTRO_12": "{SAY:zombert}说实话，这有点蹩脚的力量……但是这些鸡翅味道棒极了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_8_INTRO_13": "{SAY:winnie}看来我们要面对的不仅仅是鸡。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_8_INTRO_14": "{EXCITED:winnie}我正在检测即将发生的恐龙踩踏事件，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_8_INTRO_15": "{SAY:zombert}什么？你破坏了结局。聊天，鱼反应这辆车。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_8_INTRO_16": "{SAY:zombert}将会有无敌的僵尸然后蜂拥而至洗牌你的植物，呵呵，呵呵",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_8_INTRO_17": "{SAY:zombert}迫不及待地想看到反应，色调色调。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_8_INTRO_18": "{SAY:zombert}W 计划。但万一失败了，我还有最后的后备计划！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_8_INTRO_19": "{SAY:zombert}就等明天吧。太棒了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_8_INTRO_20": "{SAY:zombert}您可以在社区页面找到倒计时。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_8_INTRO_21": "{NPC_EXIT:zombert}{EXCITED:crazydave}哇！这是他唯一有效的计划吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_8_INTRO_22": "{SAY:winnie}我怀疑。鉴于他的性格，即使是最简单的计划他也可能会处理不当。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_8_INTRO_23": "{EXCITED:crazydave}这意味着我们明天会再次见到他！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_8_INTRO_24": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}想知道他有什么......",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_9_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，允许在地面中继状态吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_9_INTRO_2": "{SAY:crazydave}他们停止战斗了吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_9_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}是的，但不是出于你想的原因。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_9_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}看来——",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_9_INTRO_5": "{NPC_ENTER:superzombert}{SAY:superzombert}这是一只渡渡鸟！这是仲裁者X！不，这是超级僵尸！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_9_INTRO_6": "{SAY:crazydave}...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_9_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_9_INTRO_8": "{SAY:superzombert}你觉得怎么样？这是我自己做的。这很难契合吧？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_9_INTRO_9": "{TIRED:crazydave}是……",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_9_INTRO_10": "{TIRED:crazydave}...创意...？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_9_INTRO_11": "{SAY:winnie}翻译：太糟糕了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_9_INTRO_12": "{SAY:superzombert}L 仇恨者。你只是不知道这个角色设计的高明之处。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_9_INTRO_13": "{SAY:superzombert}看，其他人都同意。他们已经停止战斗了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_9_INTRO_14": "{SAY:winnie}你是对的，Zombert。我想凡事都有第一次。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_9_INTRO_15": "{SAY:crazydave}等等，为什么他们不再战斗了？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_9_INTRO_16": "{SAY:winnie}看来英雄们的新老粉丝们已经联合起来除掉赞伯特了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_9_INTRO_17": "{SAY:superzombert}@zork 是这样吗",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_9_INTRO_18": "{SAY:winnie}请允许我读出网上的评论。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_9_INTRO_19": "{SAY:winnie}“这小子以为他是谁？”",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_9_INTRO_20": "{SAY:winnie}“他把我表弟费斯里漏进了一块巨石砖里！”",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_9_INTRO_21": "{SAY:winnie}“他把我的小恶魔孩子们缩小到了遗忘。他们消失了。”",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_9_INTRO_22": "{SAY:winnie}“我们杀了他吧！”",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_9_INTRO_23": "{TIRED:crazydave}哇。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_9_INTRO_24": "{SAY:superzombert}不，布拉。别再恨了。他们都爱我！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_9_INTRO_25": "{TIRED:winnie}Zombert，一群愤怒的暴民聚集在一起要杀你。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_9_INTRO_26": "{SAY:superzombert}噗。谁会杀死超级僵尸？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_10_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}哦，我必须感谢你们俩，上周你们为我提供了无尽的娱乐！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_10_INTRO_2": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SAY:crazydave}你是在谈论赞伯特的越轨行为吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_10_INTRO_3": "{SAY:zombossicon}我还能说什么？我已经把一切都录在磁带上了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_10_INTRO_4": "{SAY:zombossicon}哦，我可以整天看着他被那群暴徒吞掉！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_10_INTRO_5": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}我要问这一切的意义，僵王。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_10_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}你知道在这一切之后你仍然需要克隆另一个僵尸。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_10_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}那为什么呢？所有这些不必要的残忍行为有何意义？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_10_INTRO_8": "{SAY:zombossicon}什么？我不被允许娱乐吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_10_INTRO_9": "{SAY:zombossicon}我将会并且已经克隆了另一个 Zombert。该过程是自动化的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_10_INTRO_10": "{SAY:zombossicon}看着他受伤就是我最喜欢的消遣！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_10_INTRO_11": "{SAY:zombossicon}现在我什至不用履行我的诺言了！那个克隆人不会记得任何事！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_10_INTRO_12": "{NPC_ENTER:superzombert}{SAY:superzombert}右，未发货。我做到了。我现在可以见见 Bassloid 吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_10_INTRO_13": "{SAY:zombossicon}什么-！？怎么——你是怎么活下来的——！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_10_INTRO_14": "{SAY:superzombert}超级僵尸总是有他的另一把戏！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_10_INTRO_15": "{SAY:zombossicon}不，真的！如何！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_10_INTRO_16": "{SAY:superzombert}...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_10_INTRO_17": "{SAY:superzombert}IDK。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_10_INTRO_18": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}也许Zombert毕竟有一些“超级”的东西......",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_10_INTRO_19": "{SAY:winnie}好吧，现在这又带来了另一个问题。我们有两个僵尸在逃。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_10_INTRO_20": "{SAY:superzombert}超级僵尸只有一只！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_10_INTRO_21": "{SAY:superzombert}那一定是我的邪恶分身，Nega-Zombert！邪恶博士大叔诞生！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_10_INTRO_22": "{SAY:zombossicon}...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_10_INTRO_23": "{SAY:zombossicon}你这个任性的孩子！美好的！这次你赢了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_10_INTRO_24": "{SAY:superzombert}所以我可以看到Bassloid？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_10_INTRO_25": "{SAY:superzombert}Wwwwwwwwww 英雄已经保存了这个约定。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_10_INTRO_26": "{SAY:crazydave}但你什么也没做！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_10_INTRO_27": "{SAY:superzombert}我见到了Bassloid brah。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_10_INTRO_28": "{SAY:superzombert}*歌曲录制开始*",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_10_INTRO_29": "{SAY:superzombert}“Kimi wa boku ni totte no hiiroo！Totsuzen arawareta hikari koraekirezu koboreteta SOS o-”",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_10_INTRO_30": "{SAY:superzombert}“英雄！英雄！”",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_10_INTRO_31": "{SAY:zombossicon}好了，别再玩那个东西了！我的耳朵好难受啊！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_10_INTRO_32": "{SAY:superzombert}我现在就想见她！现在！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_10_INTRO_33": "{SAY:zombossicon}好吧好吧！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_10_INTRO_34": "{NPC_EXIT:superzombert}{NPC_EXIT:zombossicon}{SAY:crazydave}等等！克隆人呢！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_10_INTRO_35": "{TIRED:winnie}一如既往，我们来收拾残局。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_10_INTRO_36": "{SAY:winnie}嗯，用户戴夫。这一切还有一线希望。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_10_INTRO_37": "{SAY:crazydave}这是什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_10_INTRO_38": "{SAY:winnie}下一场 Hero-Con 我们将少一件需要担心的事情。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_HEROES_10_INTRO_39": "{TIRED:winnie}Camo将军肯定不会是明年唯一被禁止的人。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_1_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SAY:crazydave}现在几点了，朋朋？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_1_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}上午 10 点。怎么了，用户戴夫？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_1_INTRO_3": "{EXCITED:crazydave}哦，太棒了！这意味着感恩节马拉松开始了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_1_INTRO_4": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}你为什么不来和我一起坐下来朋朋？我们看会儿电视吧！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_1_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}这真的是我们时间的最佳利用吗用户戴夫？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_1_INTRO_6": "{EXCITED:crazydave}哦，来吧，朋朋！这确实是时候了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_1_INTRO_7": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}感恩节，是家人围坐在桌子旁的时候，看好电视！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_1_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}你从哪里听到这句话的？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_1_INTRO_9": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}电视！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_1_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}这看起来效率很低。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_1_INTRO_11": "{SAY:crazydave}朋朋，电视上的东西可以真正改变你的看法和观点！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_1_INTRO_12": "{TIRED:winnie}对于那些容易动摇的人来说，也许...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_1_INTRO_13": "{SAY:crazydave}这并不像你说的那么毫无意义！就像学习一样！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_1_INTRO_14": "{SAY:winnie}嗯，我想偶尔放纵一下也没什么坏处。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_1_INTRO_15": "{SAY:crazydave}太棒了！那就坐吧！你也是，邻居！快来加入我们吧！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_1_INTRO_16": "{SAY:crazydave}看电视时间到了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_1_INTRO_17": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}哦，看！这部电影是我的老最爱了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_2_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{TIRED:crazydave}你知道吗，朋朋？这部电影很无聊！让我们看看还有什么！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_2_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}好的。用户戴夫。切换频道...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_2_INTRO_3": "{NPC_ENTER:missinfo}{SAY:missinfo}早上好，邻里镇！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_2_INTRO_4": "{SPECIAL1:missinfo}*鼓掌特效*",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_2_INTRO_5": "{SAY:crazydave}嘿，我不记得这个频道在我的有线电视计划上！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_2_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}要不要再换频道用户戴夫？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_2_INTRO_7": "{SAY:crazydave}不，朋朋。来看看她怎么说吧！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_2_INTRO_8": "{SAY:missinfo}Z-Channel 希望您度过一个美好的感恩节！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_2_INTRO_9": "{SAY:missinfo}与家人围坐在餐桌旁看精彩电视的绝佳时机！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_2_INTRO_10": "{SAY:crazydave}看到了吗，朋朋？连她都同意了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_2_INTRO_11": "{SAY:missinfo}因此，我们Z-Channel今天为您准备了一个特别节目！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_2_INTRO_12": "{SAY:missinfo}对最近热议的名字的独家采访...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_2_INTRO_13": "{SAY:missinfo}被认为是被时间遗忘的人物，也是僵王博士最臭名昭著的诋毁者——！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_2_INTRO_14": "{SAY:crazydave}她在说谁？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_2_INTRO_15": "{SAY:missinfo}现代少将的典范……放弃吧，为了一个，唯一……",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_2_INTRO_16": "{SAY:missinfo}通用迷彩迷彩！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_2_INTRO_17": "{NPC_ENTER:captaincamo}{SAY:captaincamo}啊！让灯光远离我的脸！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_2_INTRO_18": "{SAY:captaincamo}对了，面试官在哪里？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_2_INTRO_19": "{SAY:missinfo}好吧，您正在看着她，尊敬的卡莫将军先生！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_2_INTRO_20": "{SAY:captaincamo}有人像你一样！？切，我想这会做...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_2_INTRO_21": "{SAY:missinfo}迷彩将军，正如之前所证实的那样，最近已成为赞比亚家喻户晓的名字！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_2_INTRO_22": "{SAY:missinfo}自从他宣布回归以来，关于他的荣誉和历史事迹的低语就成为好奇僵尸中的热门话题。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_2_INTRO_23": "{SAY:missinfo}...当然也包括我们亲爱的国内观众！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_2_INTRO_24": "{SAY:captaincamo}那么，我们开始说正事吧？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_2_INTRO_25": "{SAY:missinfo}好吧！您能向我们亲爱的国内观众介绍一下您自己吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_2_INTRO_26": "{SAY:missinfo}迷彩将军是谁？他的野心是什么？请大家解释一下！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_2_INTRO_27": "{SAY:captaincamo}我是谁？为什么，你们都有历史书。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_2_INTRO_28": "{SAY:captaincamo}我是我们族中被错误终止职业生涯的领袖！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_2_INTRO_29": "{SAY:captaincamo}我要纠正这个错误，带领我们大家走向胜利！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_2_INTRO_30": "{SAY:missinfo}好吧好吧。确实是一个强有力的开局！伙计们，我们想了解更多，不是吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_2_INTRO_31": "{SAY:missinfo}所以不要碰那个表盘！他将在中场休息后立即回答所有这些问题以及更多问题！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_2_INTRO_32": "{NPC_EXIT:missinfo}{NPC_EXIT:captaincamo}{TIRED:crazydave}噢，疯了！我想听听这到底是怎么回事！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_2_INTRO_33": "{SAY:winnie}嗯，这将是一个很长的采访，用户戴夫。也是一个相关的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_2_INTRO_34": "{EXCITED:winnie}请坐，我们要搭车了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_3_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，又开始了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_3_INTRO_2": "{TIRED:crazydave}终于！我再也受不了僵企广告歌曲了……",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_3_INTRO_3": "{NPC_ENTER:missinfo}{NPC_ENTER:captaincamo}{SAY:missinfo}好了，伙计们！我们和迷彩将军一起回到工作室！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_3_INTRO_4": "{SAY:missinfo}现在，街上有消息说卡莫将军和僵王博士发生了历史性的争吵！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_3_INTRO_5": "{SAY:missinfo}他被不光彩地开除，并被送回70年前！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_3_INTRO_6": "{SAY:missinfo}他不知怎么地回来了，而他回到公众视野的短暂时间到目前为止，是一个多事之秋！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_3_INTRO_7": "{SAY:missinfo}去年，他对流星Z进行了历史性的朝圣，为世界带来了新的英雄！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_3_INTRO_8": "{SAY:missinfo}难怪他在成功之后为自己建立了某种崇拜！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_3_INTRO_9": "{SAY:missinfo}迷彩将军，你对这一切有何反应？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_3_INTRO_10": "{SAY:captaincamo}你不支持我就是个白痴。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_3_INTRO_11": "{SAY:captaincamo}我的意思是，你看到那个疯子肿瘤大脑在做什么吗！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_3_INTRO_12": "{SAY:captaincamo}他在那个愚蠢的假期里浪费了多少资源！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_3_INTRO_13": "{SAY:captaincamo}我很惊讶竟然有羊可以对此视而不见！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_3_INTRO_14": "{SAY:captaincamo}我们的社区变成了什么！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_3_INTRO_15": "{SAY:captaincamo}他对审查制度的所作所为是可耻的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_3_INTRO_16": "{SAY:captaincamo}大佬在骗你们！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_3_INTRO_17": "{SAY:missinfo}好带电的语言！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_3_INTRO_18": "{SAY:missinfo}我必须同意 - 他的审查制度给 Z 频道带来了相当大的麻烦！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_3_INTRO_19": "{SAY:missinfo}那么我假设你会继续公开反对我们的领袖，对吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_3_INTRO_20": "{SAY:captaincamo}称那个男孩为领袖本身就是一种侮辱。我想这就是你的答案。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_3_INTRO_21": "{SAY:missinfo}但是——卡莫将军，他撒谎了什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_3_INTRO_22": "{SAY:missinfo}这和你最近的太空旅行有什么关系吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_3_INTRO_23": "{SAY:captaincamo}这真的是人们认识我的原因吗！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_3_INTRO_24": "{SAY:captaincamo}让我来教育一下无知的群众吧！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_3_INTRO_25": "{SAY:captaincamo}准备好迎接这个重磅炸弹，这是肿瘤脑多年来一直掩盖的事情......",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_3_INTRO_26": "{SAY:captaincamo}您对战争的了解都是错误的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_3_INTRO_27": "{SAY:captaincamo}他让士兵们都得了痴呆症！每个人都生活在幻想的国度里！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_3_INTRO_28": "{SAY:captaincamo}战争由我掌控！在飞空艇里！带枪！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_3_INTRO_29": "{SAY:captaincamo}我还引入了巨型飞机，让它们后面的战斗机隐形！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_3_INTRO_30": "{SAY:captaincamo}他一定在你们的脑袋里植入了某种微芯片，朋友们！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_3_INTRO_31": "{SAY:captaincamo}记住战争是我控制的！别当羊了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_3_INTRO_32": "{SAY:missinfo}噢，是这样吗，迷彩将军？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_3_INTRO_33": "{SAY:missinfo}你还向战争介绍了什么？巨型机器鸟？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_3_INTRO_34": "{SPECIAL3:missinfo}*笑轨*",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_3_INTRO_35": "{SHOUT:captaincamo}是的，你这个笨蛋！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_3_INTRO_36": "{SHOUT:captaincamo}如果您不相信我，这是时间线代码！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_3_INTRO_37": "{SHOUT:captaincamo}立即将0820-0109-4.1-25插入您的时间旅行机！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_3_INTRO_38": "{SHOUT:captaincamo}去做吧！我不是在编造事情！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_3_INTRO_39": "{SHOUT:captaincamo}现在就做！打败你的肿瘤头编程！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_3_INTRO_40": "{SAY:missinfo}好吧好吧！你们听到了，伙计们——我们在展会上鼓励你们得出自己的结论。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_3_INTRO_41": "{SAY:missinfo}随心所欲地使用这款“重磅炸弹”将军迷彩！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_3_INTRO_42": "{NPC_EXIT:missinfo}{NPC_EXIT:captaincamo}{SAY:crazydave}哦，亲爱的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_3_INTRO_43": "{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，大规模时间线突破即将到来。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_3_INTRO_44": "{EXCITED:winnie}我想我们是时候返回突击空域了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_4_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SHOUT:crazydave}神圣的汉娜！有这么多僵尸！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_4_INTRO_2": "{SAY:crazydave}发生了什么！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_4_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}嗯，用户戴夫。我想这次采访会给你一个很好的答案。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_4_INTRO_4": "{NPC_ENTER:missinfo}{NPC_ENTER:captaincamo}{SAY:captaincamo}就在那里！就像我描述的那样！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_4_INTRO_5": "{SAY:captaincamo}这就是肿瘤大脑向公众隐瞒的秘密！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_4_INTRO_6": "{SAY:missinfo}哇哦！伙计们，我们已经做到了！真实、真实的飞行战地现场直播！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_4_INTRO_7": "{SAY:captaincamo}我更喜欢称其为空域突击！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_4_INTRO_8": "{SAY:missinfo}我觉得我们的观众非常想知道他们的反应！让我们接听一些来电者吧！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_4_INTRO_9": "{SAY:missinfo}*随机来电*：哇！简直就像是一座空中之城！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_4_INTRO_10": "{SAY:missinfo}我同意，亲爱的观众 - 多么壮观的景象啊！想想都被僵王博士掩盖了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_4_INTRO_11": "{SAY:missinfo}所以，卡莫将军，如果你说的是实话，那一定意味着你所有传闻中的荣誉也一定是真的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_4_INTRO_12": "{SAY:missinfo}我们的观众都已经坐不住了！在这个飞升的高度中，你最大的成就是什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_4_INTRO_13": "{SAY:captaincamo}当然是打败我所有的敌人！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_4_INTRO_14": "{SAY:captaincamo}克服与自己的个人分歧......",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_4_INTRO_15": "{SAY:captaincamo}不像别人，一举一动都被不可预知的因素所左右！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_4_INTRO_16": "{SAY:missinfo}如果你说你指的是谁……是我们亲爱的领袖，会不会很愚蠢？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_4_INTRO_17": "{SAY:captaincamo}我还能指谁，你这个愚蠢的多拉！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_4_INTRO_18": "{SAY:captaincamo}观众请观察。这就是一个有能力的领导者所得到的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_4_INTRO_19": "{SAY:captaincamo}空中乌托邦！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_4_INTRO_20": "{SAY:captaincamo}同时僵王业余时间做什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_4_INTRO_21": "{SAY:captaincamo}他不再制定策略来击败敌人，而是在战斗中进行装扮！他把这当成一场时装秀！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_4_INTRO_22": "{SAY:captaincamo}有些花哨的衣服让我恶心！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_4_INTRO_23": "{SAY:captaincamo}我个人比较喜欢时尚的防毒面具。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_4_INTRO_24": "{SAY:missinfo}这些都是严厉的指控！你们都在家里得到这一切吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_4_INTRO_25": "{SAY:missinfo}僵王博士真的脱节了吗？我们该换人了吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_4_INTRO_26": "{SAY:missinfo}防毒面具又流行起来了吗？好吧，别碰那个表盘！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_4_INTRO_27": "{SAY:missinfo}休息后我们很快就会发现更多信息！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_4_INTRO_28": "{NPC_EXIT:missinfo}{NPC_EXIT:captaincamo}{TIRED:winnie}嗯，这肯定会激怒这些狂热的邪教。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_4_INTRO_29": "{TIRED:crazydave}我无法再经历另一件事了！一场战争就够了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_4_INTRO_30": "{TIRED:winnie}用户戴夫，我不知道如何告诉你......",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_5_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SHOUT:crazydave}不止一场战争？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_5_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}是的，用户戴夫。花园战争曾发生过两次。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_5_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}但是小声点。广播回来了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_5_INTRO_4": "{NPC_ENTER:missinfo}{NPC_ENTER:captaincamo}{SAY:missinfo}欢迎回到节目！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_5_INTRO_5": "{SAY:missinfo}看来我们的一些观察者报告说自上次广告中断以来无法到达时间坐标！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_5_INTRO_6": "{SAY:missinfo}先生卡莫，你从中得到什么信息？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_5_INTRO_7": "{SAY:captaincamo}将军，女人！学会使用标题！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_5_INTRO_8": "{SAY:captaincamo}总之，发生什么事就很清楚了！想一想吧！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_5_INTRO_9": "{SAY:captaincamo}谁有一个兄弟负责制造那些时间旅行机器！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_5_INTRO_10": "{SAY:captaincamo}僵企的首席执行官，ZOMBILL-！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_5_INTRO_11": "{SAY:missinfo}哦哦好吧！我们来谈谈别的事情吧！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_5_INTRO_12": "{SAY:missinfo}至少可以说，并不是所有对你的报道都普遍良好-",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_5_INTRO_13": "{SAY:missinfo}所以我现在问你，卡莫将军，那些传言是真的吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_5_INTRO_14": "{SAY:captaincamo}什么谣言！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_5_INTRO_15": "{SAY:missinfo}不法传闻！犯罪！特别是在空战期间进行的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_5_INTRO_16": "{SAY:captaincamo}更具体一些。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_5_INTRO_17": "{SAY:missinfo}一些指控包括非自愿使用墨西哥胡椒、使用小鬼士兵和导弹袭击芦荟。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_5_INTRO_18": "{SAY:missinfo}你能纠正这些误解吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_5_INTRO_19": "{SAY:captaincamo}哦，我会消除这些误解的，好吧！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_5_INTRO_20": "{SAY:captaincamo}我没有“导弹袭击芦荟s”，我导弹袭击了濒危芦荟s！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_5_INTRO_21": "{SAY:captaincamo}我讨厌记者弄错细节！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_5_INTRO_22": "{SAY:missinfo}我说的纠正错误不是这个意思-",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_5_INTRO_23": "{SAY:captaincamo}看，我将重现它现在实际发生的情况！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_5_INTRO_24": "{SAY:captaincamo}你最好把这个记录下来，以便在关于我的纪录片中使用！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_5_INTRO_25": "{NPC_EXIT:missinfo}{NPC_EXIT:captaincamo}{TIRED:crazydave}哦，我不喜欢这个声音。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_5_INTRO_26": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}幸好我们远离那个工作室！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_5_INTRO_27": "{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，我们的草坪什么时候种了这么多芦荟？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_6_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:captaincamo}{NPC_ENTER:missinfo}{SAY:missinfo}嗯...我说这真是一个...生动的重演！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_6_INTRO_2": "{SAY:captaincamo}是啊！ ...呃...你可以再说一遍！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_6_INTRO_3": "{SAY:captaincamo}中场休息时你给我的这杯...饮料...是什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_6_INTRO_4": "{SAY:missinfo}简直就是补神经啊，尊敬的将军！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_6_INTRO_5": "{SAY:missinfo}就像面试前吃的那些药一样！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_6_INTRO_6": "{SAY:captaincamo}什么……呃……药丸！？军人是不吃药的！他喝……征服！嗝!",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_6_INTRO_7": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{TIRED:crazydave}哦，我们错过了！我们错过了！一直都这样吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_6_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}才刚刚开始，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_6_INTRO_9": "{SAY:missinfo}我必须说，收视率从未如此好！这是我们历史上表现最好的节目！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_6_INTRO_10": "{SAY:missinfo}僵尸喜欢你散发出的自信，迷彩将军！你的严谨态度让很多人都心服口服！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_6_INTRO_11": "{SAY:captaincamo}Hic-是吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_6_INTRO_12": "{SAY:missinfo}当然是！有些人甚至提出要完全取代僵王博士的想法！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_6_INTRO_13": "{SAY:captaincamo}呵呵。我的会费……早就该应得了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_6_INTRO_14": "{SAY:missinfo}杰里米！又给男人倒了一杯！让我们举杯庆祝吧！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_6_INTRO_15": "{SAY:captaincamo}哦，既然我们……呃……还在记录那片草坪，让我……",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_6_INTRO_16": "{SAY:captaincamo}给两个我确信正在观看的精彩人物留言......",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_6_INTRO_17": "{SAY:captaincamo}疯狂铺路，丹尼......你可以把污垢塞进你的鼻孔！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_6_INTRO_18": "{SAY:captaincamo}为什么当我得到你的时候我会...我会...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_6_INTRO_19": "{SAY:captaincamo}我会擦掉你的…呃呃…肮脏的大嘴，我会…",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_6_INTRO_20": "{SAY:captaincamo}我会喝掉...你的货车的...破坏和...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_6_INTRO_21": "{SAY:missinfo}好吧将军，让我们——",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_6_INTRO_22": "{SHOUT:captaincamo}结束你们悲惨的存在吧你们这些讨厌鬼！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_6_INTRO_23": "{SHOUT:captaincamo}抓住你最近的耙子并刺穿你的-",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_6_INTRO_24": "{SAY:missinfo}AAA好吧各位，这是我们赞助商阅读的完美赛格威！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_6_INTRO_25": "{SAY:missinfo}僵企品牌时间转换器！现在每辆敞篷车都配备了这些，再也不会在裂谷路上迷路了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_6_INTRO_26": "{NPC_EXIT:missinfo}{NPC_EXIT:captaincamo}{TIRED:crazydave}好吧，我不想看广告了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_6_INTRO_27": "{SAY:winnie}应该有比光荣的时间导航系统更让你烦恼的事情，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_6_INTRO_28": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}你在说什么，朋朋？这是很棒的娱乐活动！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_6_INTRO_29": "{SAY:winnie}卡莫将军刚刚在电视直播中威胁我们。现在他所有的狂热分子都动员起来反对我们。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_6_INTRO_30": "{TIRED:crazydave}但是无论如何，这种事每天都会发生！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_6_INTRO_31": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}还有……我是Pave吗？还是丹尼？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_7_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:captaincamo}{NPC_ENTER:missinfo}{SAY:missinfo}Aaa我们广告时段回来了，伙计们！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_7_INTRO_2": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SAY:crazydave}时间太长了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_7_INTRO_3": "{SAY:crazydave}我们应该购买僵企+来摆脱广告，朋朋。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_7_INTRO_4": "{TIRED:winnie}我编程中的每一项举措都强烈反对这个想法。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_7_INTRO_5": "{SAY:missinfo}现在，卡莫将军——我们都见证了你的历史高度，以及你……充满激情的意见。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_7_INTRO_6": "{SAY:missinfo}我们现在可以探讨一下您职业生涯中的一些低谷吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_7_INTRO_7": "{SAY:captaincamo}...我已经拥有了一切，女士。嗝。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_7_INTRO_8": "{SAY:captaincamo}...我与伟人同在，翱翔天际。那我又去了哪里呢？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_7_INTRO_9": "{SAY:captaincamo}那个……呃……该死的鸟！嘎！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_7_INTRO_10": "{SAY:captaincamo}愚蠢的货车！愚蠢的人！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_7_INTRO_11": "{SAY:captaincamo}我让自己被骗了！胡说！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_7_INTRO_12": "{SAY:captaincamo}...我曾经拥有这一切...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_7_INTRO_13": "{SAY:captaincamo}...但后来我回来毁了它！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_7_INTRO_14": "{SAY:captaincamo}……白痴老头把我放逐了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_7_INTRO_15": "{SAY:captaincamo}...我沦落成什么了？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_7_INTRO_16": "{SAY:captaincamo}...必须自己制作士兵吗？可笑。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_7_INTRO_17": "{SAY:captaincamo}需要那颗愚蠢的流星的力量才能拥有任何资产......",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_7_INTRO_18": "{SAY:captaincamo}在广播中为普通民众与女性交谈......",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_7_INTRO_19": "{SAY:missinfo}哦，你这个可怜的笨蛋！杰里米，再给他倒一杯！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_7_INTRO_20": "{SAY:captaincamo}...我怀念在空域突击队当将军的日子...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_7_INTRO_21": "{SAY:captaincamo}...从此以后我就觉得自己像个悲伤的小丑...外面笑，内心哭...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_7_INTRO_22": "{SAY:missinfo}将军，您对飞行有着如此美好的回忆，不是吗？我知道如何让你高兴起来！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_7_INTRO_23": "{SAY:missinfo}那么，看屏幕！这么多漂亮的颜色...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_7_INTRO_24": "{SAY:captaincamo}...那是气球吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_7_INTRO_25": "{SAY:captaincamo}我也曾经在天上！啊！ ...嗝！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_7_INTRO_26": "{SAY:missinfo}天哪！有人给将军送一盒纸巾！杰里米！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_7_INTRO_27": "{SAY:missinfo}这样的东西别再看了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_7_INTRO_28": "{SAY:missinfo}我们会继续前草坪的广播，这样你就可以分散自己的注意力！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_7_INTRO_29": "{NPC_EXIT:missinfo}{NPC_EXIT:captaincamo}{TIRED:crazydave}Dang...我现在有点为盖伊将军感到难过。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_7_INTRO_30": "{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，他刚刚在草坪上轰炸了无辜的芦荟。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_8_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:captaincamo}{NPC_ENTER:missinfo}{SAY:captaincamo}我背叛了自己，你知道吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_8_INTRO_2": "{SAY:captaincamo}领导一场...军事政变！对抗……年轻时的自己！我打败了他！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_8_INTRO_3": "{SAY:captaincamo}而我...呃...我不应该！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_8_INTRO_4": "{SAY:captaincamo}再给我倒一杯，女人……",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_8_INTRO_5": "{SAY:captaincamo}度过了我生命中的…呃…最好的岁月…呃…",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_8_INTRO_6": "{SAY:captaincamo}哎呀……我最大的敌人就是我自己，不是吗……？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_8_INTRO_7": "{SAY:captaincamo}不……是瘤头……还是老家伙……",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_8_INTRO_8": "{SAY:captaincamo}布莱...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_8_INTRO_9": "{SAY:captaincamo}我想我要吐了...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_8_INTRO_10": "{SAY:missinfo}哦，一般。你这个悲伤、流口水的烂摊子！我知道另一种方法可以让你高兴起来！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_8_INTRO_11": "{SAY:missinfo}怎么样...我们叫朋友来吧！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_8_INTRO_12": "{SAY:captaincamo}F-朋友...？我有那些吗……？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_8_INTRO_13": "{SAY:missinfo}当然可以！还记得墓地猛攻吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_8_INTRO_14": "{SAY:captaincamo}墓地……猛攻……？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_8_INTRO_15": "{SAY:missinfo}墓地猛攻，对于那些不知道的人来说，是一支由僵王博士多年前创建的精英将军小队！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_8_INTRO_16": "{SAY:missinfo}成员当然包括卡莫将军、黑手党贪婪佐姆塔拉尼和亨特里亚将军！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_8_INTRO_17": "{SAY:captaincamo}啊……老人们……",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_8_INTRO_18": "{SAY:captaincamo}我讨厌他们的胆量。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_8_INTRO_19": "{SAY:missinfo}哦，我确定你不是那个意思。你们一定都互相喜欢吧！呃……在内心深处的某个地方。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_8_INTRO_20": "{SAY:missinfo}其实我们为什么不现在就给他们打电话呢？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_8_INTRO_21": "{SAY:missinfo}铃声，铃声！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_8_INTRO_22": "{SAY:missinfo}*随机来电者* 看来我终于可以在没有奖励的情况下出现在新闻上了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_8_INTRO_23": "{SAY:missinfo}这是一个什么样的世界，嗯？无论如何，那是什么？我现在正在洗钱。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_8_INTRO_24": "{SAY:captaincamo}你这小子想要什么！？难道你没看到我正在沉浸在悲伤之中吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_8_INTRO_25": "{SAY:missinfo}哦来吧。不要让世界打倒伟大的迷彩将军！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_8_INTRO_26": "{SAY:missinfo}你还有更多的勇气在电视上为我们倾诉，不是吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_8_INTRO_27": "{SAY:missinfo}我得走了。我正在煮披萨。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_8_INTRO_28": "{SAY:missinfo}哇，好暖心啊！哦，那是什么？我们又接到一个电话！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_8_INTRO_29": "{SAY:missinfo}*随机呼叫者* HUNTERRIA 通过可怕的魔法神器说话。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_8_INTRO_30": "{SAY:missinfo}老人有麻烦了。你知道亨特里亚遇到麻烦时会做什么吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_8_INTRO_31": "{SAY:missinfo}与狼一起狩猎。老头子，投身于一群饿狼之中吧。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_8_INTRO_32": "{SAY:missinfo}它将结束轮子。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_8_INTRO_33": "{SAY:captaincamo}...你是对的。我心里有一只狼...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_8_INTRO_34": "{SAY:captaincamo}...还有一些披萨现在听起来还不错...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_8_INTRO_35": "{NPC_EXIT:missinfo}{NPC_EXIT:captaincamo}{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SAY:crazydave}她根本就没有给那些家伙打电话……",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_8_INTRO_36": "{SAY:crazydave}她只是在模仿电话口技！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_9_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:captaincamo}{NPC_ENTER:missinfo}{SAY:captaincamo}让我告诉你关于这个人的事......",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_9_INTRO_2": "{SAY:captaincamo}REAAAL 的作品，这个......",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_9_INTRO_3": "{SAY:captaincamo}你必须小心，他总是用那些僵博机器人技术承诺来骗你，那个……",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_9_INTRO_4": "{SAY:captaincamo}我为那个家伙伸出了我的脖子......出路！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_9_INTRO_5": "{SAY:captaincamo}说了他想听的话！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_9_INTRO_6": "{SAY:captaincamo}那我到哪里去了！？它在我脸上爆炸了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_9_INTRO_7": "{SAY:captaincamo}轰隆隆！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_9_INTRO_8": "{SAY:missinfo}嗯，这真是一次有趣的 40 分钟漫步，不是吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_9_INTRO_9": "{SAY:missinfo}您对我们敬爱的领袖有很多肆无忌惮的……意见，不是吗，将军？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_9_INTRO_10": "{SAY:captaincamo}哦，是的。相当苦涩。就像这里的奇怪气味一样……",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_9_INTRO_11": "{SAY:missinfo}那么，我们把话题从他身上移开吧！别再谈论坏人了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_9_INTRO_12": "{SAY:missinfo}我们来谈谈你吧！你喜欢谈论你，不是吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_9_INTRO_13": "{SAY:captaincamo}打嗝-是的。我很棒，不是吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_9_INTRO_14": "{SAY:missinfo}那么，如果您将注意力转向屏幕，我们可以看到您最新的但肯定不是最伟大的成就！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_9_INTRO_15": "{SAY:missinfo}你来到了流星Z！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_9_INTRO_16": "{SAY:captaincamo}流星Z！？不是那个腐臭的地方……我那里有一种奇怪的……呃……痒的感觉。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_9_INTRO_17": "{SAY:captaincamo}最糟糕的是，我没能炸掉月亮！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_9_INTRO_18": "{SAY:captaincamo}我受到了辐射……东西……但是月亮！啊！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_9_INTRO_19": "{SAY:captaincamo}嗨！一切都崩溃了！嗝! 这就是我的最终策略！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_9_INTRO_20": "{SAY:captaincamo}为什么这一切都要崩溃！？打嗝。什么-什么甚至-",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_9_INTRO_21": "{SAY:captaincamo}我去睡觉了……月亮上还有他的脸！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_9_INTRO_22": "{SAY:captaincamo}我讨厌月亮...非常...对我傻笑...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_9_INTRO_23": "{SAY:captaincamo}嗨！有人……应该为此做点什么……",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_9_INTRO_24": "{SAY:missinfo}哦好吧！我们将看看能否让一些技术人员登上月球！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_9_INTRO_25": "{SPECIAL3:missinfo}*笑声曲目*",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_9_INTRO_26": "{NPC_EXIT:missinfo}{NPC_EXIT:captaincamo}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SAY:winnie}嗯。卡莫将军确实遇到了对手。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_9_INTRO_27": "{SAY:crazydave}此时此刻，这次采访会走向何方？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_9_INTRO_28": "{EXCITED:winnie}我有一些猜测，时机已经成熟，我们终于可以得到答案了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_9_INTRO_29": "{SAY:winnie}让我们继续关注吧。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_10_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:captaincamo}{NPC_ENTER:missinfo}{SAY:captaincamo}有什么，呃-还是困扰着我-！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_10_INTRO_2": "{SAY:captaincamo}你是怎么得到这份工作的！？嗝! 我无法保住我的...工作...猛攻...被埋葬...某事...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_10_INTRO_3": "{SAY:captaincamo}而你就在这里，在愚蠢的……呃……时间里说着有趣的话。你为什么……？嗝!",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_10_INTRO_4": "{SAY:missinfo}啊哈哈哈……嗯……",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_10_INTRO_5": "{SAY:missinfo}将军，这就是我和你的区别吧？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_10_INTRO_6": "{SAY:captaincamo}Wuzzat...这是什么意思？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_10_INTRO_7": "{SAY:missinfo}我知道如何伺机而动。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_10_INTRO_8": "{SAY:missinfo}有能力。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_10_INTRO_9": "{SAY:captaincamo}等一下...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_10_INTRO_10": "{SAY:captaincamo}为什么......我应该！我应该抓住你，你这个无知的女人！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_10_INTRO_11": "{SAY:captaincamo}嗨！过来，你这个笨蛋多拉！嗝! 就这样跟我说话……",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_10_INTRO_12": "{SAY:captaincamo}我…让你…你…",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_10_INTRO_13": "{SAY:captaincamo}…你…呃…过来！我会...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_10_INTRO_14": "{SAY:missinfo}安全！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_10_INTRO_15": "{NPC_EXIT:captaincamo}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SAY:crazydave}什么——！？发生了什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_10_INTRO_16": "{SAY:winnie}将军迷彩似乎已从场地中移除。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_10_INTRO_17": "{TIRED:crazydave}采访结束了？真是个废物！看，朋朋！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_10_INTRO_18": "{TIRED:crazydave}他的网上声誉正在下降！那次面试彻底失败了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_10_INTRO_19": "{SAY:winnie}相反，我认为它达到了它的初衷。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_10_INTRO_20": "{SAY:crazydave}什么意思？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_10_INTRO_21": "{SAY:winnie}我认为她从来没有打算给卡莫进行评估采访。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_10_INTRO_22": "{SAY:winnie}信息小姐，我说得对吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_10_INTRO_23": "{SAY:missinfo}...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_10_INTRO_24": "{SAY:missinfo}...还在录音吗？不？谢天谢地！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_10_INTRO_25": "{SAY:missinfo}我和你们三个终于可以心连心了！没有审查员干涉！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_10_INTRO_26": "{TIRED:crazydave}嗯？她如何通过电视与我们交谈？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_10_INTRO_27": "{EXCITED:winnie}她不再播出了，用户戴夫。她现在正在直接和我们说话，那个纵容的女人。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_10_INTRO_28": "{SAY:missinfo}啊哈哈，降低攻击性！我这样做是为了人民的福祉！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_10_INTRO_29": "{SAY:missinfo}在一个毫无魅力的老人统治下的岁月，推翻他的新候选人出现了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_10_INTRO_30": "{SAY:missinfo}...又是一个无聊的老头，观点一模一样，只是调料不同。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_10_INTRO_31": "{SAY:missinfo}我们僵尸需要前进！让同样的老人来负责我们是无法实现这一目标的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_10_INTRO_32": "{SAY:missinfo}这就是像僵王博士和迷彩将军这样的人向你隐藏的真正真相，而不是一些飞行战争空间！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_10_INTRO_33": "{SAY:crazydave}所以你从一开始就在破坏他？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_10_INTRO_34": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我知道这不仅仅是神经补品！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_10_INTRO_35": "{SAY:missinfo}这些人是过去时代的产物。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_10_INTRO_36": "{SAY:missinfo}是时候让具有更...​​...“相关”观点的人来负责了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_10_INTRO_37": "{TIRED:winnie}...这意味着什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_10_INTRO_38": "{SAY:missinfo}哎呀，一开始就把好部分都毁掉的节目有什么好处呢？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_10_INTRO_39": "{SAY:missinfo}你很快就会明白我的意思，我亲爱的朋朋，在适当的时候！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_10_INTRO_40": "{SAY:winnie}你……一个人能容纳多少个虚拟和谎言？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_10_INTRO_41": "{SAY:missinfo}为什么，我不明白为什么这很糟糕！谎言如果运用得当，可以带来好处。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_10_INTRO_42": "{SAY:missinfo}谎言滋生不满，不满扰乱秩序，秩序被推翻，真相将揭开！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_10_INTRO_43": "{SAY:missinfo}大众与我达成同样真理的时刻……正在快速逼近。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_10_INTRO_44": "{EXCITED:winnie}我想你是对的，用户戴夫。电视确实对一个人的看法有巨大的影响。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_10_INTRO_45": "{TIRED:crazydave}咕噜，我不是这个意思！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_10_INTRO_46": "{SAY:missinfo}好了，这就是我今天的全部时间了，各位！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_11_FOODFIGHT_10_INTRO_47": "{SAY:missinfo}我希望这对你来说是一个启发性的感恩节。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_1_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SAY:crazydave}朋朋，可以请教一下吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_1_INTRO_2": "{TIRED:crazydave}这件事发生在呃……我的一个朋友身上。他需要帮助。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_1_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}您寻求什么建议，用户戴夫？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_1_INTRO_4": "{SAY:crazydave}好的。所以...让我们说...假设一下。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_1_INTRO_5": "{SAY:crazydave}我的这个朋友去了一家酒吧......喝了几杯。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_1_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}的...？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_1_INTRO_7": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}通常的，你知道...机油，焦油...葡萄汁。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_1_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}对。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_1_INTRO_9": "{SAY:crazydave}...而且他不小心被僵尸缠住了...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_1_INTRO_10": "{SAY:crazydave}...还有...当然是假设的-",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_1_INTRO_11": "{SAY:crazydave}他同意邻居的院子举办一年一度的草地滚球奥运会。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_1_INTRO_12": "{TIRED:winnie}用户戴夫...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_1_INTRO_13": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}当然，所有都是假设的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_1_INTRO_14": "{SAY:winnie}这解释了目前许多体育迷正在游行到我们的草坪。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_1_INTRO_15": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}哦，哇——真的吗？哈哈……这和我的假设太相似了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_1_INTRO_16": "{TIRED:winnie}请勿作弊，用户戴夫。你比这更清楚。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_1_INTRO_17": "{SAY:winnie}你也更懂得编造一个更有说服力的谎言。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_1_INTRO_18": "{SAY:winnie}你的心根本不在这上面。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_1_INTRO_19": "{TIRED:crazydave}你是对的，朋朋。对不起。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_1_INTRO_20": "{SAY:winnie}没关系，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_1_INTRO_21": "{PLAYFUL:winnie}说实话，丧尸这次请求许可，异常有礼。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_1_INTRO_22": "{EXCITED:crazydave}好吧，如果归根结底，我仍然支持植物队！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_1_INTRO_23": "{SAY:crazydave}去植物吧！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_1_INTRO_24": "{SAY:winnie}确实是植物。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_2_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SHOUT:crazydave}朋朋，你看到了吗？那球飞进了球门柱！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_2_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}最不寻常，是的。球以这样的速度加速，在那条弧线上......",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_2_INTRO_3": "{EXCITED:winnie}进球的几率应该是0.0001%",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_2_INTRO_4": "{EXCITED:crazydave}真是太幸运了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_2_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}行程-",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_2_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，你知道这支球队的教练是谁吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_2_INTRO_7": "{TIRED:crazydave}呃，呃……我不这么认为？这是什么-",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_2_INTRO_8": "{NPC_ENTER:lucky}{SAY:lucky}小伙子们，故事是什么？我们真是太疯狂了，不是吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_2_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}我应该知道的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_2_INTRO_10": "{SAY:crazydave}幸运吗？你参加奥运会吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_2_INTRO_11": "{SAY:lucky}真是个好小伙子。啊，幸运的是，现在我已经把帽子扔到了擂台上！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_2_INTRO_12": "{TIRED:crazydave}好吧，现在看来这并不是一场公平的竞争。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_2_INTRO_13": "{SAY:winnie}确实如此。为什么还要麻烦呢，幸运儿？赢得这场胜利会给你带来什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_2_INTRO_14": "{SAY:lucky}哎哟，大奖一千万僵尸巴克！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_2_INTRO_15": "{SAY:lucky}有了那点钱，啊，我要给自己买一顶新帽子，用最好的丝绸丝线，装饰着金色！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_2_INTRO_16": "{SAY:lucky}所有需要的是赢得一些疯狂的锦标赛吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_2_INTRO_17": "{SAY:lucky}G'远离那个！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_2_INTRO_18": "{TIRED:winnie}是的，一如既往，你这样做是出于自私的原因。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_2_INTRO_19": "{SAY:lucky}Ar'，你让我变得猩红，姑娘。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_2_INTRO_20": "{SAY:crazydave}但是为什么你会为了钱而参加比赛呢？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_2_INTRO_21": "{SAY:crazydave}你的运气难道不能让你变现金吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_2_INTRO_22": "{SAY:lucky}Ar，比你看起来更锐利吧？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_2_INTRO_23": "{SAY:lucky}加油，伙计们！这并不总是与钱有关。想象一下这个——",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_2_INTRO_24": "{SAY:lucky}这次比赛的获胜者将受到公众的关注！每个人都喜欢胜利者，不是吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_2_INTRO_25": "{SAY:lucky}有了这么多的关注，我又迈出了一步，从那个肮脏的工具僵王的冰冷手中赢得了僵尸的心。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_2_INTRO_26": "{SAY:lucky}为什么，啊，你们也有前排座位看我获胜！多么体贴呀！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_2_INTRO_27": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}这并不是说我们有选择......它发生在我邻居的院子里！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_2_INTRO_28": "{SAY:lucky}加油，小伙子们！胜利与我一样美好！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_2_INTRO_29": "{NPC_EXIT:lucky}{SAY:winnie}好吧，Lucky横扫对手，至少这会很快结束。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_3_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{EXCITED:crazydave}我以前从未见过这个比赛！为什么有这么多食物？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_3_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}好像是一场吃东西比赛，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_3_INTRO_3": "{EXCITED:crazydave}那个女孩要吃火腿了！看着她走！那一定是Lucky的团队吧？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_3_INTRO_4": "{NPC_ENTER:lucky}{SAY:lucky}珍妮·麦克！这是什么故事？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_3_INTRO_5": "{SAY:lucky}那个彩琳傻傻地吃自己！照这样下去我队就要输了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_3_INTRO_6": "{SAY:crazydave}等等，那不是你的团队？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_3_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}真好奇。有人能超越 Lucky 的运气吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_3_INTRO_8": "{SAY:lucky}胜过我吗？这个镇上见过的最热情的家伙？离开那个花园！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_3_INTRO_9": "{SAY:lucky}我想看看谁认为他们可以做到这一点！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_3_INTRO_10": "{NPC_ENTER:hunterria}{SAY:lucky}这个笨蛋是谁？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_3_INTRO_11": "{SAY:crazydave}亨特里亚？你也来参赛？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_3_INTRO_12": "{SAY:hunterria}Hunterria 参加比赛赢取奖金。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_3_INTRO_13": "{SAY:winnie}我从来没有把你当成需要钱的人，Hunterria。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_3_INTRO_14": "{SAY:hunterria}Hunterria 用奖金为渡渡鸟和恐龙建造保护区。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_3_INTRO_15": "{SAY:hunterria}Hunterria 将战胜灭绝。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_3_INTRO_16": "{SAY:lucky}废话！谁会为那些肮脏的小动物花那么多钱呢？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_3_INTRO_17": "{SAY:lucky}你不妨把钱扔进千斤顶！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_3_INTRO_18": "{SAY:hunterria}你一定是魔法师。你一直在从亨特里亚的树林里采摘三叶草。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_3_INTRO_19": "{TIRED:crazydave}魔法师？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_3_INTRO_20": "{SAY:hunterria}让事情发生的魔法师，因为他是由魔法组成的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_3_INTRO_21": "{SAY:hunterria}Boss对魔法师的警惕已经有一段时间了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_3_INTRO_22": "{SAY:lucky}Ar，看来我的运气和颜值甚至已经达到了那些……落后于时代了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_3_INTRO_23": "{SAY:lucky}甚至僵王现在也意识到我了，是吗？弥天大谎！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_3_INTRO_24": "{SAY:lucky}好吧，现在别介意了。如果你认为你打败了我，小姑娘，那你就滚出你的树吧！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_3_INTRO_25": "{SAY:hunterria}Hunterria 没有带来任何树。但她会打败你。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_3_INTRO_26": "{SAY:hunterria}魔法师打不过亨特利亚。亨特里亚已做好准备。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_3_INTRO_27": "{SAY:lucky}接下来比赛吧，姑娘！你们很快就看到了，别跟我打架！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_3_INTRO_28": "{NPC_EXIT:lucky}{NPC_EXIT:hunterria}{SAY:winnie}嗯，这突然变得更有趣了......",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_3_INTRO_29": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}确实如此！比如说，朋朋，你想打赌谁赢吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_3_INTRO_30": "{SAY:winnie}打赌？我不觉得赌博是教导植物的好习惯，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_3_INTRO_31": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}在任何这样的比赛中体育博彩都是很自然的，朋朋！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_3_INTRO_32": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我的钱都花在幸运上了！你怎么能打败他的运气呢？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_3_INTRO_33": "{SAY:winnie}凭借纯粹的智慧和决心，Hunterria 拥有很多。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_3_INTRO_34": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}所以你赌她了？呵呵，那我们就看看谁说得对吧！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_4_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{EXCITED:crazydave}噢，哇——他们居然并列第一！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_4_INTRO_2": "{EXCITED:winnie}据我计算，亨特利亚并不是一个容易对付的对手。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_4_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}即使有不可预知的“运气”变数。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_4_INTRO_4": "{NPC_ENTER:lucky}{SAY:lucky}犯规！那辆小马车是作弊的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_4_INTRO_5": "{SAY:crazydave}马车……？你是说亨特里亚？她怎么可能出轨呢？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_4_INTRO_6": "{SAY:lucky}啊不知道——但她现在一定是了！不然她怎么能逃避我的好运呢？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_4_INTRO_7": "{PLAYFUL:winnie}通过努力工作和纯粹的技巧。你明显缺乏的东西。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_4_INTRO_8": "{SAY:lucky}胡说八道！艰苦的工作对于笨蛋来说是不够幸运的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_4_INTRO_9": "{SAY:lucky}你一定很幸运才能取得成功，就是这样！大家都知道！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_4_INTRO_10": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}嘘……你最好不要输，伙计！我打赌你赢的几率很大！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_4_INTRO_11": "{SAY:lucky}啊‘赢了’！篮球很容易选！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_4_INTRO_12": "{SAY:lucky}让我们澄清事实——没有人打败过Lucky！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_5_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SAY:crazydave}今天的比赛是什么，朋朋？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_5_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}看起来是一场电子竞技比赛。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_5_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}看来今年终于被批准为合法活动了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_5_INTRO_4": "{NPC_ENTER:lucky}{SAY:lucky}是的，幸运的是，小伙子们，不是吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_5_INTRO_5": "{SAY:lucky}无论我内心的愿望是什么——我的运气会让它实现！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_5_INTRO_6": "{SAY:lucky}那些无聊的 eejit 不可能知道任何关于计算机的事情！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_5_INTRO_7": "{SAY:lucky}现在，我们将吸柴油！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_5_INTRO_8": "{NPC_ENTER:hunterria}{SAY:hunterria}Hunterria 了解计算机。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_5_INTRO_9": "{SAY:lucky}呸！你好！你们不了解杰克的技术！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_5_INTRO_10": "{SAY:hunterria}没有。亨特里亚知道。 Hunterria 一直在看着 Boss 的幼体玩“compyooter 游戏”。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_5_INTRO_11": "{SAY:hunterria}他玩游戏时自言自语。毫无疑问，这是魔法咒语。魅力。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_5_INTRO_12": "{SAY:hunterria}Hunterria将背诵他的咒语来拉开这场比赛的序幕。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_5_INTRO_13": "{SAY:hunterria}“大家最近怎么样。Zombert Gaming 来了。今天我们将在 fllvefcrtf 中打败菜鸟。”",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_5_INTRO_14": "{TIRED:crazydave}什么……？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_5_INTRO_15": "{SAY:lucky}Ar，这个哥布达说话太蠢了！现在完全是胡言乱语！现在这就是皮屑了，就是这样！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_5_INTRO_16": "{TIRED:crazydave}什么……？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_5_INTRO_17": "{SAY:lucky}看吧，小伙子们！一定会把金牌带回家！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_6_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{EXCITED:crazydave}棒球时间！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_6_INTRO_2": "{SAY:crazydave}邻居，我有跟你说过这件事吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_6_INTRO_3": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}我曾经是棒球冠军！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_6_INTRO_4": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{TIRED:winnie}如果您通过“用球棒击败对手的数量”来跟踪分数，...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_6_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}...那就是真的了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_6_INTRO_6": "{NPC_ENTER:hunterria}{SAY:hunterria}这是一项关于投掷的运动。亨特里亚已经训练她的部队适应任务。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_6_INTRO_7": "{SAY:hunterria}Hunterria 肯定会赢钱。小伙伴们再也不用担心流星雨了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_6_INTRO_8": "{TIRED:crazydave}呃...现在我觉得对赌这样的事业有点不好！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_6_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，Hunterria 心目中的“小朋友”是一只五十英尺长的剑龙。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_6_INTRO_10": "{SAY:hunterria}Hunterria 称他为史蒂夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_6_INTRO_11": "{SAY:hunterria}不过胖子不用担心。这不是个人的。每个人都做小赌注。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_6_INTRO_12": "{SAY:hunterria}连Boss也时不时下注。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_6_INTRO_13": "{SAY:crazydave}真的是现在吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_6_INTRO_14": "{SAY:hunterria}是的。老板还在我们身边的时候就和贪婪的男孩子打赌。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_6_INTRO_15": "{SAY:hunterria}他们打赌Boss的幼体是否会注意到他一直在使用酸作为洗发水。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_6_INTRO_16": "{SAY:hunterria}Boss损失了300万僵尸币。刚孵化的幼体失去了毛发。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_6_INTRO_17": "{TIRED:winnie}真是一个奇怪的、难以辨认的家庭。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_6_INTRO_18": "{SAY:hunterria}魔法师在跑向你的房子时不会击败亨特利亚。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_6_INTRO_19": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}你的意思是打出全垒打？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_6_INTRO_20": "{SAY:hunterria}是的。那。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_7_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:lucky}{NPC_ENTER:hunterria}{SAY:lucky}不公平竞赛！你在作弊，你这个小工具！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_7_INTRO_2": "{SAY:hunterria}Hunterria 不会作弊。这是不光彩的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_7_INTRO_3": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{EXCITED:crazydave}哇哦，把不符合运动员精神的行为淡化一点吧，伙计！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_7_INTRO_4": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}这场比赛应该是为了在一天结束时享受乐趣！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_7_INTRO_5": "{SAY:hunterria}是的。魔法师需要冷静一下。到目前为止他已经取得了胜利。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_7_INTRO_6": "{SAY:hunterria}这是一个真正的、可敬的对手的标志。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_7_INTRO_7": "{SAY:lucky}你们为什么要对我好？我们在竞争！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_7_INTRO_8": "{SAY:lucky}哦，啊，知道你的电话号码了！你对我很好，因为你想要得到总和！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_7_INTRO_9": "{SAY:hunterria}亨泰利亚不明白。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_7_INTRO_10": "{SAY:lucky}每个人在需要帮忙的时候总是会向Lucky示好！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_7_INTRO_11": "{SAY:lucky}甜言蜜语……他们认为他们可以用我的运气来获得他们的利益！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_7_INTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}或者...这可能看起来是一个疯狂的想法...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_7_INTRO_13": "{SAY:winnie}也许她这样做是因为她是一个正派的人。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_7_INTRO_14": "{SAY:lucky}胡言乱语！没有这样的事！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_7_INTRO_15": "{SAY:hunterria}如果魔法师认为亨特里亚有其他动机，那就是他的问题了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_7_INTRO_16": "{SAY:hunterria}狮子不关心小狗的意见。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_7_INTRO_17": "{SAY:lucky}这是什么意思？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_7_INTRO_18": "{EXCITED:crazydave}她的意思是，哇-朋朋小心！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_7_INTRO_19": "{SAY:crazydave}那些鸡在后面要疯了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_7_INTRO_20": "{SAY:hunterria}那些是Hunterria的。 Hunterria 必须照顾他们。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_7_INTRO_21": "{SAY:hunterria}抱歉打断了，魔术师。 Hunterria确实喜欢和你说话。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_7_INTRO_22": "{SAY:hunterria}也许Boss的警惕是错误的。你是一个有趣的对手。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_7_INTRO_23": "{NPC_EXIT:hunterria}{SAY:lucky}什么——？呸! 阿谀奉承不会让你从我这里得到任何好处，姑娘！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_7_INTRO_24": "{SAY:lucky}你很快就会看到，啊，现在就用我的运气横扫这里的比赛吧！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_7_INTRO_25": "{NPC_EXIT:lucky}{PLAYFUL:crazydave}哇！事情正在升温！然而，",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_7_INTRO_26": "{SAY:winnie}仅来自一侧。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_7_INTRO_27": "{SAY:crazydave}不过我还是要说，我没想到你会这么支持Hunterria！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_7_INTRO_28": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}我以为你不喜欢她！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_7_INTRO_29": "{SAY:winnie}好吧，面对Lucky这样狡猾的干员，谁都会好看一些。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_7_INTRO_30": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}你不会只是因为赌她才这么做吧？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_7_INTRO_31": "{SAY:winnie}*主题模块变更已启用。*让我们回到游戏，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_8_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{EXCITED:crazydave}哇哦，我猜他不是在唬人！他的分数非常高！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_8_INTRO_2": "{SAY:crazydave}Lucky大概就这样赢了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_8_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}嗯……我怀疑出了什么问题。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_8_INTRO_4": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}哦，来吧，朋朋！不要成为一个痛苦的失败者！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_8_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}没有。我正在检测合法的犯规行为痕迹。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_8_INTRO_6": "{SAY:crazydave}嗯？你是什​​么意思？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_8_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}查阅我的扫描仪后，我发现了一个令人担忧的问题。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_8_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}Lucky 和 ​​Hunterria 都没有使用他们所谓的注册公牛。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_8_INTRO_9": "{SAY:crazydave}但这怎么可能！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_8_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}好像……互换了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_8_INTRO_11": "{TIRED:crazydave}等一下。昨天那群鸡疯了……",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_8_INTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}这是一种干扰。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_8_INTRO_13": "{SAY:winnie}Lucky 获胜是因为他使用的是 Hunterria 的公牛。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_8_INTRO_14": "{SAY:crazydave}所以他作弊了！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_8_INTRO_15": "{NPC_ENTER:lucky}{SAY:lucky}终于到了，不是吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_8_INTRO_16": "{SAY:lucky}确实如此。现在被指控有罪。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_8_INTRO_17": "{SAY:winnie}现在收回你的话吧，Lucky？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_8_INTRO_18": "{SAY:crazydave}是啊，你很反对她出轨！但被骗的人却是你！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_8_INTRO_19": "{SAY:lucky}啊’没有说任何关于再次作弊的事情。只要它不针对我，我就可以接受！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_8_INTRO_20": "{EXCITED:winnie}你真可怜。我们将向主办方报告此事！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_8_INTRO_21": "{SAY:lucky}哈哈！祝你好运，姑娘，你想啊，还没有想到吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_8_INTRO_22": "{TIRED:crazydave}哦不，你做了什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_8_INTRO_23": "{SAY:lucky}请他们出去喝几品脱，饮料，如果你们愿意的话-当他们在丝带里时-",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_8_INTRO_24": "{SAY:lucky}在桌子底下滑了20。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_8_INTRO_25": "{SHOUT:crazydave}不！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_8_INTRO_26": "{SAY:lucky}哦，但是是的！现在，我们保证赢得这场比赛！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_8_INTRO_27": "{SAY:lucky}只是提供良好的措施，啊'确保让今天的比赛对她来说更加困难！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_8_INTRO_28": "{SAY:lucky}cailin不可能夺取那面旗帜！哈哈哈！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_8_INTRO_29": "{SAY:lucky}喝吧，伙计们。为了我的胜利！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_9_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:hunterria}{NPC_ENTER:lucky}{SAY:lucky}对了，看那个，小姑娘！现在，A 处于领先地位！而且数量可观！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_9_INTRO_2": "{SAY:lucky}你们现在不可能赢了，是吗？那是气体。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_9_INTRO_3": "{SAY:hunterria}魔术师说得对。亨特里亚输了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_9_INTRO_4": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{EXCITED:winnie}Hunterria，Lucky作弊了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_9_INTRO_5": "{EXCITED:crazydave}是啊！他偷了你的牛！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_9_INTRO_6": "{SAY:lucky}呸！公鸡和公牛的故事！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_9_INTRO_7": "{SAY:hunterria}没有。尊敬的猎人知道接受失败。亨特里亚被公平地击败。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_9_INTRO_8": "{SAY:hunterria}魔术师获胜是因为他技术更高。 Hunterria 需要尊重这一点。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_9_INTRO_9": "{SAY:lucky}确实如此。确实，姑娘！很荣幸能在我身边。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_9_INTRO_10": "{SAY:lucky}但我现在不再是胜利者，如果你愿意的话，你可以得到前排座位......参加我的胜利派对！哈哈！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_9_INTRO_11": "{SAY:hunterria}恭喜你，魔法师。但亨特里亚不会出席。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_9_INTRO_12": "{SAY:hunterria}Hunterria 需要拯救动物朋友，但如果没有那个庇护所，希望就很低。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_9_INTRO_13": "{SAY:hunterria}Hunterria最好现在就开始。她需要腾出大部分时间。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_9_INTRO_14": "{NPC_EXIT:hunterria}{SAY:lucky}...呃...当然。那你就继续做吧，姑娘。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_9_INTRO_15": "{TIRED:crazydave}做这一切值得关注吗，魔法师？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_9_INTRO_16": "{SAY:lucky}啊，你们在抱怨什么？你也能从中受益，不是吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_9_INTRO_17": "{SAY:lucky}你会赢那辆车的赌注！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_9_INTRO_18": "{SAY:lucky}这就是一天结束时最重要的，不是吗？赢了？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_9_INTRO_19": "{SAY:winnie}竞争不仅仅是获胜。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_9_INTRO_20": "{TIRED:winnie}但只有有原则的人才知道。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_9_INTRO_21": "{SAY:lucky}...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_9_INTRO_22": "{SAY:lucky}呸！谁在乎你们怎么想？啊，赢了，现在！就是这样啊！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_9_INTRO_23": "{SAY:lucky}无论我内心渴望什么，我的运气都会实现！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_9_INTRO_24": "{NPC_EXIT:lucky}{TIRED:crazydave}现在Hunterria还有获胜的希望吗朋朋？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_9_INTRO_25": "{TIRED:winnie}无，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_9_INTRO_26": "{TIRED:crazydave}还有一天可以追上吧……？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_9_INTRO_27": "{SAY:winnie}成绩差距这么大？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_9_INTRO_28": "{TIRED:winnie}只要奇迹发生。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_10_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SAY:crazydave}朋朋，我的眼睛欺骗了我吗？真的是这样的结果吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_10_INTRO_2": "{EXCITED:winnie}看来是这样，用户戴夫。 Lucky的团队最终失败了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_10_INTRO_3": "{EXCITED:crazydave}亨特里亚获胜！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_10_INTRO_4": "{SAY:crazydave}但是如何呢？只有奇迹才能一夜扭转比分！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_10_INTRO_5": "{PLAYFUL:winnie}那……还是运气好。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_10_INTRO_6": "{SAY:crazydave}等等...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_10_INTRO_7": "{NPC_ENTER:lucky}{NPC_ENTER:hunterria}{SAY:hunterria}亨特里亚获胜。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_10_INTRO_8": "{SAY:hunterria}Hunterria 现在可以为朋友建造庇护所了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_10_INTRO_9": "{SAY:lucky}不！不！一定是有什么误会！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_10_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}你被打败了，Lucky。公平公正。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_10_INTRO_11": "{SAY:hunterria}Hunterria一定要感谢你们两位的支持。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_10_INTRO_12": "{SAY:hunterria}当然还有魔术师，迎接挑战。亨特里亚不会忘记这一点。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_10_INTRO_13": "{SAY:lucky}你……呃……",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_10_INTRO_14": "{SAY:lucky}啊'不应该……啊啊！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_10_INTRO_15": "{SAY:lucky}荒谬！垃圾！梦呓！胡说！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_10_INTRO_16": "{NPC_EXIT:lucky}{SAY:hunterria}Hunterria也需要离开。她必须告诉一群人好消息。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_10_INTRO_17": "{SAY:hunterria}她会告诉牛群庆祝！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_10_INTRO_18": "{NPC_EXIT:hunterria}{SAY:winnie}扫描中...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_10_INTRO_19": "{SAY:winnie}我们可能需要做好准备。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_10_INTRO_20": "{SAY:winnie}Hunterria 的庆祝活动可能会不知不觉地蔓延到我们的草坪上。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_10_INTRO_21": "{EXCITED:crazydave}这一定是我唯一一次庆幸自己输了赌注！正如他们所说，",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_10_INTRO_22": "{PLAYFUL:winnie}作弊者永远不会繁荣，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_10_INTRO_23": "{SAY:crazydave}对了，也就是说——",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_10_INTRO_24": "{SAY:crazydave}谁押注这最后会有“良好的道德教训”？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_SPORTZBALL_10_INTRO_25": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}是你吗，邻居？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_1_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，你今天比平时起得早了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_1_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}你这么早就表现出这么活泼的样子有道理吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_1_INTRO_3": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}今天早上这么热闹有什么理由吗？为什么，还能是什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_1_INTRO_4": "{EXCITED:crazydave}一年中最美好的时光，朋朋！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_1_INTRO_5": "{EXCITED:crazydave}植物叮叮当当，每个人都在呼唤你加油！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_1_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}是。距离盛宴节只剩一周左右了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_1_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}我想这确实符合你振奋的心情。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_1_INTRO_8": "{EXCITED:crazydave}没有什么可以阻碍这种节日气氛！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_1_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}连僵尸都没有？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_1_INTRO_10": "{SAY:crazydave}僵尸...嗯？他们在那里多久了？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_1_INTRO_11": "{SAY:crazydave}我们不能让煽动者用他们的不良情绪破坏气氛！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_1_INTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}那么是时候铲掉车道了，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_2_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{TIRED:crazydave}等等，为什么那些丧尸都行动迟缓，毫无生气？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_2_INTRO_2": "{TIRED:crazydave}……忽略第二部分。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_2_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，我有一些令人担忧的消息。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_2_INTRO_4": "{SAY:crazydave}什么？每年的这个时候？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_2_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}不幸的是，看起来确实如此。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_2_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}我收到了一封电子邮件，最终进入了我的“垃圾邮件”文件夹，但它看起来很重要。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_2_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}似乎是由“mailbox.thats.mine@zmail.com”发送的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_2_INTRO_8": "{SAY:crazydave}他的邮箱？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_2_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}就是他。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_2_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}zmail 内容如下：",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_2_INTRO_11": "{SAY:winnie}“僵尸、植物、人类和其他一切，你好！”",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_2_INTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}“我，贪婪的佐姆塔拉尼，越狱了！”",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_2_INTRO_13": "{SAY:winnie}“这个假期，我想要你的礼物！”",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_2_INTRO_14": "{SAY:winnie}“我制造了一台能抽干你所有节日精神的机器！”",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_2_INTRO_15": "{SAY:winnie}“没错，如果你还想再次感受到任何盛宴节的快乐……”",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_2_INTRO_16": "{SAY:winnie}“……就把你的盛宴节礼物交给WW35-FF01-Z0833！”",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_2_INTRO_17": "{TIRED:crazydave}他把每个人的盛宴节快乐都抽干了！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_2_INTRO_18": "{SAY:winnie}看起来是这样。Greedy好像制造了一台可以做到这一点的机器。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_2_INTRO_19": "{TIRED:crazydave}是啊，说实话，我现在有点沮丧。我真的什么都感觉不到。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_2_INTRO_20": "{TIRED:crazydave}也许盛宴节真的没什么特别的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_2_INTRO_21": "{TIRED:winnie}它的效果比我预想的更直接。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_2_INTRO_22": "{TIRED:crazydave}朋朋，我现在不想冒险。只是感觉下雪了，仅此而已。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_2_INTRO_23": "{SAY:winnie}看来我因为是机械造物而没有受到影响。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_2_INTRO_24": "{EXCITED:winnie}我们会找回你对盛宴节的感受，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_2_INTRO_25": "{SAY:winnie}我可以追踪这些坐标，我们明天就去那里。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_3_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}我们在这里做什么，朋朋？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_3_INTRO_2": "{TIRED:crazydave}今天不想出去，工作太多了...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_3_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}我们是来调查Greedy的Zmail的，用户戴夫，你还记得吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_3_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}我们需要让您的盛宴节重新振作起来。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_3_INTRO_5": "{TIRED:crazydave}但是朋朋，外面很冷！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_3_INTRO_6": "{EXCITED:winnie}坚持住，用户戴夫。我们应该就在贪婪所确定的位置附近。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_3_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}我们只需清除前面的这些障碍即可。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_4_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}我们已到达所需地点用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_4_INTRO_2": "{TIRED:crazydave}我想没关系。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_4_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}看来计划已经奏效了，这里有很多礼物。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_4_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}当然，贪婪本人也不会太远。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_4_INTRO_5": "{NPC_ENTER:greedy}{SAY:greedy}好吧好吧。圣诞老人要进城了，是吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_4_INTRO_6": "{SAY:greedy}你是来送我礼物的吗，嘟嘟？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_4_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}不，我们实际上是来带你回监狱的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_4_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}你到底是怎么逃出来的？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_4_INTRO_9": "{SAY:greedy}哦那个？没什么。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_4_INTRO_10": "{SAY:greedy}在我被扔进hoosegow之前我吃了一些炸药棒，这样我就可以在进去后把它们扔出去。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_4_INTRO_11": "{SAY:greedy}典狱长从未看到它到来。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_4_INTRO_12": "{EXCITED:winnie}你要回馈给人们盛宴节快乐！难道你没有看到你对假期的影响吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_4_INTRO_13": "{SAY:greedy}没有机会，嘟嘟。这台机器给了我的礼物多得你数不过来。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_4_INTRO_14": "{EXCITED:winnie}但是你不能这样对人！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_4_INTRO_15": "{SAY:greedy}哦，但我可以。你会看到结果。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_4_INTRO_16": "{SAY:greedy}滴答，嘟嘟！如果你不想剩下的日子，你最好把这些礼物递给我，否则你会过着沮丧的生活！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_4_INTRO_17": "{NPC_EXIT:greedy}{SAY:winnie}如果有什么可以帮助的话就不会。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_4_INTRO_18": "{SAY:winnie}我无法确定他的设备的位置，它不在他身边。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_4_INTRO_19": "{SAY:winnie}我认为需要采取一些严厉措施。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_4_INTRO_20": "{SAY:winnie}一旦我们成功拿下他藏匿的礼物，我就可以确定他的精确位置。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_4_INTRO_21": "{EXCITED:winnie}不要情绪低落，用户戴夫，邻居。我们很快就会找到他。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_5_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:greedy}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:greedy}哇！？我在哪里？发生了什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_5_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}你现在是一名非自愿乘客，贪婪。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_5_INTRO_3": "{SAY:greedy}你做了什么？我在哪里？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_5_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}由于我的传感器无法确定您设备的位置，因此我必须从您那里获取该信息。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_5_INTRO_5": "{SAY:greedy}你要做什么，把我逼死吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_5_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}你显然需要接受教训。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_5_INTRO_7": "{SAY:greedy}现在，从我控制你开始，你就没有再生气吧？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_5_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}也许吧。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_5_INTRO_9": "{EXCITED:winnie}那么现在，我就带你回到我们第一次见面的场景，反思你对用户戴夫的伤害。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_5_INTRO_10": "{EXCITED:winnie}而且我也与你们以前的一些受害者取得了联系。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_5_INTRO_11": "{SAY:greedy}呸，骗人的！你们在说什么？宣讲一切高高在上。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_5_INTRO_12": "{NPC_ENTER:antibullysquad}{SHOUT:antibullysquad}哇啊！我们又见面了，托特林尼先生！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_5_INTRO_13": "{SAY:greedy}什么！？我以为我的孩子们做了肉末哦！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_5_INTRO_14": "{SAY:greedy}你们是鬼吗？这是一个令人难以忘怀的事情吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_5_INTRO_15": "{SAY:greedy}嗯，我什么鬼都不怕！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_5_INTRO_16": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}幽灵……？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_5_INTRO_17": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}呸，高跷老大他在说什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_5_INTRO_18": "{TIRED:antibullysquad}是啊，他在说什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_5_INTRO_19": "{EXCITED:winnie}鬼魂，是的！这些是盛宴节过去、现在和未来的幽灵！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_5_INTRO_20": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}嗯？哦，是的，她说了什么！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_5_INTRO_21": "{TIRED:antibullysquad}是啊，她什么——",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_5_INTRO_22": "{SAY:winnie}这些鬼魂来向你展示你的错误，贪婪。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_5_INTRO_23": "{SAY:winnie}不是吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_5_INTRO_24": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}嗯？哦，当然。我是盛宴节过去的幽灵！噢噢噢！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_5_INTRO_25": "{SAY:greedy}你一定是在跟我开玩笑吧。这些白痴到底想对我做什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_5_INTRO_26": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}也许答案会在过去找到！噢噢噢！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_5_INTRO_27": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}你真是个好鬼，老大。可怕的消息。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_5_INTRO_28": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}接受汽车作业可以给我们鬼研究课额外的学分。呵呵。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_5_INTRO_29": "{TIRED:antibullysquad}是啊，他说的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_5_INTRO_30": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}让我们回到你的过去吧！就像，呃... 10 个月前！这一切都是从哪里开始的……",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_6_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:greedy}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:antibullysquad}{SAY:winnie}你现在知道你给用户戴夫造成了多大的痛苦了吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_6_INTRO_2": "{SAY:greedy}啊，是的，我记得。美好时光。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_6_INTRO_3": "{TIRED:antibullysquad}是啊，他说的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_6_INTRO_4": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}什么！？不，你这个白痴！这不是他应该学到的教训！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_6_INTRO_5": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}Buh。那么教训是什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_6_INTRO_6": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}教训是……！它是...！呃……",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_6_INTRO_7": "{EXCITED:winnie}教训是要消除自私，不像过去你如何点燃和胁迫用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_6_INTRO_8": "{SAY:greedy}呸！这只是生意，他带来了感情和爱，这不是我的错。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_6_INTRO_9": "{TIRED:antibullysquad}是啊，他说的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_6_INTRO_10": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}哥们，别再同意他的观点了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_6_INTRO_11": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}很明显你还没有吸取教训塔蒂尼先生！看来我们需要闪回另一个过去了！噢噢噢！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_6_INTRO_12": "{SAY:greedy}太好了，现在怎么办？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_6_INTRO_13": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}还记得那次你对我们大喊大叫吗？噢噢，格里达利尼先生真糟糕！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_6_INTRO_14": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}都是因为非法成长公式的一次失误。尽管我们听取了您的其他指示。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_6_INTRO_15": "{TIRED:antibullysquad}是啊，这不公平！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_6_INTRO_16": "{SAY:greedy}即使再往下六英尺，你们这些男孩仍然设法激怒我。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_6_INTRO_17": "{SAY:winnie}基于你的冷漠，你甚至对自己的盟友也施行残酷，贪婪。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_6_INTRO_18": "{EXCITED:winnie}现在，你不假思索地通过你的机器传播了这种冷漠！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_6_INTRO_19": "{SAY:greedy}细节，你这个笨车。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_6_INTRO_20": "{SAY:greedy}也许其他人都应该先想想他们对老贪婪做了什么。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_6_INTRO_21": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}呸，他们对你做了什么，贪婪先生？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_6_INTRO_22": "{SAY:greedy}叹息。当我还很小的时候小鬼僵尸，我并没有什么名气。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_6_INTRO_23": "{SAY:greedy}只是爱父母和我想要的一切。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_6_INTRO_24": "{SAY:greedy}到了盛宴节时间，突然间所有其他小鬼也都得到了他们想要的一切。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_6_INTRO_25": "{SAY:greedy}这不公平！把你想要的一切都交给你是我唯一拥有的东西！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_6_INTRO_26": "{SAY:greedy}那种满足只属于我。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_6_INTRO_27": "{TIRED:antibullysquad}...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_6_INTRO_28": "{TIRED:antibullysquad}...什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_7_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:greedy}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:antibullysquad}{SAY:winnie}现在...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_7_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}康复的第二部分......",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_7_INTRO_3": "{SAY:greedy}我需要康复什么？五天前我已经去过那个狗窝了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_7_INTRO_4": "{EXCITED:winnie}现在是时候让你看看你的行为对现在造成的影响了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_7_INTRO_5": "{SAY:greedy}礼物？如果我这样做的话，请不要介意！这就是我从一开始就在这里的目的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_7_INTRO_6": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}不，老板。你不明白。你需要谦虚。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_7_INTRO_7": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}我们都希望你成为更好的反派。所有好恶人都懂得谦虚。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_7_INTRO_8": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}我是盛宴节现在的幽灵。我给你看现在的礼物。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_7_INTRO_9": "{SAY:greedy}我从名字就知道了，有趣的是。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_7_INTRO_10": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}看看这些悲伤的僵尸。他们没有节日气氛。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_7_INTRO_11": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}他们中的一些人甚至不穿适合这个场合的衣服。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_7_INTRO_12": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}有些人根本没穿衣服！别人需要学习谦卑！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_7_INTRO_13": "{PLAYFUL:winnie}你现在明白了吗，贪婪？您的行为对他人造成了更坏的影响。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_7_INTRO_14": "{SAY:greedy}呸，保存这个悲伤的故事吧，嘟嘟！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_7_INTRO_15": "{SAY:greedy}我的机器会不断吸走他们的精神，直到他们给我我想要的东西！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_7_INTRO_16": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}这不是——啊！？他制造了一台可以削弱人们精神的机器！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_7_INTRO_17": "{TIRED:winnie}事后看来，我可能应该早点向你提到这一点。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_7_INTRO_18": "{SAY:greedy}想想看，我一直想知道为什么你们这些男孩没有受到机器的影响......",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_7_INTRO_19": "{SAY:greedy}我猜它对没有鬼魂不起作用。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_7_INTRO_20": "{TIRED:winnie}（或者也许你没有校准它来影响他们，因为你认为他们已经死了。）",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_7_INTRO_21": "{SAY:greedy}嗯，我们都在这里学到了宝贵的一课。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_7_INTRO_22": "{SAY:greedy}永远向你的走狗通报你所有的邪恶计划。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_7_INTRO_23": "{NPC_EXIT:greedy}{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}确实如此。我现在可以回家了吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_7_INTRO_24": "{TIRED:antibullysquad}是啊，他说的！我猜……？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_7_INTRO_25": "{SAY:winnie}那不是——",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_7_INTRO_26": "{TIRED:winnie}这需要一段时间。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_8_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:greedy}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:antibullysquad}{SAY:greedy}说真的，我可以去吗？我对这台机器不感兴趣！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_8_INTRO_2": "{SAY:greedy}你无法摆脱我！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_8_INTRO_3": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}我们还不能回家。仍然需要向盛宴节 Present 的 Ghost 学习。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_8_INTRO_4": "{TIRED:antibullysquad}是啊，他说的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_8_INTRO_5": "{SAY:greedy}Tch。你们小伙子们还搞过什么其他的事情吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_8_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}好吧贪婪，你考虑过大家情绪低落对经济的影响吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_8_INTRO_7": "{SAY:greedy}现在怎么办？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_8_INTRO_8": "{EXCITED:winnie}如您所知，假期是主要消费的时间。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_8_INTRO_9": "{EXCITED:winnie}僵尸和植物一样会装饰自己并赠送礼物给别人。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_8_INTRO_10": "{EXCITED:winnie}破坏了节日气氛，整体收入就会下降，所有副业的利润也会下降。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_8_INTRO_11": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}是的，格林尼尼先生。为了钱，你必须让人们精神抖擞。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_8_INTRO_12": "{SAY:greedy}反正我所有的副业都被砍掉了！僵王发现了我的小小副业。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_8_INTRO_13": "{PLAYFUL:winnie}但是想想那些钱就留在人们的口袋里......",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_8_INTRO_14": "{PLAYFUL:winnie}这一切都可能是你的......",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_8_INTRO_15": "{SAY:greedy}Y'知道还有什么可能是我的吗？所有这些礼物！巴哈哈哈哈！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_8_INTRO_16": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}但是我们现在买不到盛宴节礼物。没有礼物。钱留在口袋里。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_8_INTRO_17": "{SAY:greedy}所以呢？让它留在那里！这样抢劫你就更容易了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_8_INTRO_18": "{SAY:greedy}要么抢你的钱，要么抢你的礼物！对我来说双赢！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_8_INTRO_19": "{NPC_EXIT:greedy}{SAY:winnie}我正在扫描草坪……似乎有大量的盗贼僵尸正在逼近。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_8_INTRO_20": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}会说话的货车，这有点糟糕……",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_8_INTRO_21": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}是的，您打电话告诉我们邀请我们与 Tarteloini 先生一起度过愉快的盛宴节！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_8_INTRO_22": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}这不好玩！香槟和巧克力喷泉以及富人聚会上的所有东西在哪里！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_8_INTRO_23": "{TIRED:antibullysquad}是啊，他说的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_8_INTRO_24": "{TIRED:winnie}你们三个保持安静，各司其职。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_8_INTRO_25": "{SAY:winnie}接下来我们将走向未来。我已经知道我要去那里做什么了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_9_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:greedy}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:antibullysquad}{SAY:greedy}好吧，这就是未来……我们现在处于什么状态？盛宴节未来的幽灵？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_9_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}你们三个已经起来了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_9_INTRO_3": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}嗯，我已经尽了过去的鬼魂的职责了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_9_INTRO_4": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}我已经是现在的幽灵了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_9_INTRO_5": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}这很糟糕，高跷老板。谁会成为未来的gho",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_9_INTRO_6": "{TIRED:antibullysquad}贪婪的佐姆塔拉尼。你犯了罪。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_9_INTRO_7": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}什么-！？你可以-",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_9_INTRO_8": "{EXCITED:winnie}安静！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_9_INTRO_9": "{TIRED:antibullysquad}正是由于你们的自私行为，盛宴节现在被永久地污染、改变、亵渎。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_9_INTRO_10": "{TIRED:antibullysquad}你注定了这个假期的未来将是沮丧和痛苦的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_9_INTRO_11": "{TIRED:antibullysquad}你自己看看吧，你冤枉了人民。现在的人们漫无目的地走在街上。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_9_INTRO_12": "{TIRED:antibullysquad}他们所有的幸福都被你转瞬即逝的欲望驱动的自私冲动毫无意义地夺走了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_9_INTRO_13": "{TIRED:antibullysquad}当不可避免的审判向你召唤时......你将如何在法庭上为自己辩护？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_9_INTRO_14": "{SAY:greedy}和我的律师，呃！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_9_INTRO_15": "{NPC_EXIT:greedy}{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}当当。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_9_INTRO_16": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}他想都没想。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_10_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:greedy}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:antibullysquad}{SHOUT:antibullysquad}老兄，那是什么，你能再做一次吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_10_INTRO_2": "{TIRED:antibullysquad}...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_10_INTRO_3": "{TIRED:antibullysquad}是啊，你说的是！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_10_INTRO_4": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}咕。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_10_INTRO_5": "{SAY:greedy}我现在应该吸取教训了吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_10_INTRO_6": "{SAY:greedy}我只是有点无聊，真的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_10_INTRO_7": "{PLAYFUL:winnie}我非常高兴地通知您，您未来的现金余额恰好为 0 Zombucks。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_10_INTRO_8": "{EXCITED:winnie}都是因为你的自私行为。这让你感觉如何？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_10_INTRO_9": "{SAY:greedy}这不是像……2323吗？那时谁在乎呢。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_10_INTRO_10": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}老大，我们该怎么办？这不起作用。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_10_INTRO_11": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}我们会，呃...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_10_INTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}坚持计划就好。向他展示你准备的东西。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_10_INTRO_13": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}呃，但是塔拉尼先生，看看那个营养不良的小恶魔！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_10_INTRO_14": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}他很伤心没有精神，所以他不吃东西！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_10_INTRO_15": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}这不让你伤心吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_10_INTRO_16": "{SAY:greedy}我不知道。我想这看起来有点有趣。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_10_INTRO_17": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}...哦。好的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_10_INTRO_18": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}你能在这些文件上签名吗，这样我们就可以报告我们未能成为使你作为一个人进步的鬼魂？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_10_INTRO_19": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}再见额外学分。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_10_INTRO_20": "{SAY:greedy}当然，无论如何。我们现在可以回家了吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_10_INTRO_21": "{SAY:greedy}我应该留在罐子里。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_10_INTRO_22": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}嗯，这取决于汽车！你带我们回去吗，嘟嘟？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_10_INTRO_23": "{TIRED:winnie}好的。但我们必须首先经历这些营养不良的小恶魔的悲惨表现。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_10_INTRO_24": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}也是花了一整晚才把他们全部收集起来！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_11_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:antibullysquad}{NPC_ENTER:greedy}{SAY:greedy}啊，我们回来了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_11_INTRO_2": "{SAY:greedy}现在，我不是很高兴拥有所有盛宴节为自己加油吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_11_INTRO_3": "{EXCITED:winnie}贪婪，你真的感到盛宴节欢呼吗？一切之后？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_11_INTRO_4": "{SAY:greedy}当然可以，而且感觉太棒了，嘟嘟！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_11_INTRO_5": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}呵呵，原来我们成功了？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_11_INTRO_6": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}我们已经交文件了，老板。我们不能再获得额外的学分了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_11_INTRO_7": "{TIRED:antibullysquad}见鬼，他说了什么！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_11_INTRO_8": "{EXCITED:winnie}这是一个突破！难道你没有看到你从每个人身上夺走了什么吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_11_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}是不是让人心碎？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_11_INTRO_10": "{SAY:greedy}是的，你帮助我认识到了我的错误，嘟嘟。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_11_INTRO_11": "{SAY:greedy}我不该给他们喝烈酒...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_11_INTRO_12": "{SAY:greedy}...今年！我几年前就应该拿它！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_11_INTRO_13": "{SAY:winnie}什么！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_11_INTRO_14": "{SAY:greedy}Y'知道吗，那些小鬼现在想起来真的让我很开心！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_11_INTRO_15": "{SAY:greedy}多么悲伤的麻袋！哈！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_11_INTRO_16": "{SAY:greedy}没有什么比拥有别人没有的感觉更好的了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_11_INTRO_17": "{SAY:greedy}我感觉站在世界之巅！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_11_INTRO_18": "{TIRED:winnie}...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_11_INTRO_19": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{TIRED:crazydave}朋朋，是盛宴节吗？我不知道。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_11_INTRO_20": "{TIRED:winnie}看来我的任务失败了，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_11_INTRO_21": "{TIRED:winnie}贪婪仍然拥有所有节日精神。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_11_INTRO_22": "{SAY:greedy}这不是我唯一拥有的东西！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_11_INTRO_23": "{SAY:greedy}我也想拥有你的大脑！抓住他们！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_11_INTRO_24": "{NPC_EXIT:greedy}{SAY:winnie}距离盛宴节还有一天，我们还是没能保存。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_11_INTRO_25": "{TIRED:crazydave}这是错误的，朋朋。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_11_INTRO_26": "{TIRED:crazydave}这不是盛宴节 eve 应该有的感觉！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_11_INTRO_27": "{TIRED:crazydave}应该不会觉得惨吧！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_11_INTRO_28": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}如果有什么安慰的话，我们的盛宴节前夜总是很痛苦。所以对我们来说没有什么太大改变。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_11_INTRO_29": "{TIRED:antibullysquad}是啊，他说的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_11_INTRO_30": "{TIRED:winnie}你们三个根本不受影响。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_11_INTRO_31": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}哦，对了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_12_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:antibullysquad}{NPC_ENTER:greedy}{SAY:greedy}哈哈哈哈！哦，一轮抛光后我感觉就像闪亮的镍！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_12_INTRO_2": "{SAY:greedy}这就是盛宴节精神的感觉！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_12_INTRO_3": "{SAY:greedy}我只是用我的机器拿这个来敲诈你们！现在我明白为什么这种感觉如此令人上瘾了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_12_INTRO_4": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}我们也可以吃一些吗...？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_12_INTRO_5": "{SAY:greedy}不！你所有的感受都是我的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_12_INTRO_6": "{SAY:greedy}你一直都知道，这就是全部！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_12_INTRO_7": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}Buh。我们只能看着，流泪。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_12_INTRO_8": "{TIRED:antibullysquad}是啊，你说的是……",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_12_INTRO_9": "{TIRED:crazydave}是啊，他……",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_12_INTRO_10": "{SAY:crazydave}不，等等。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_12_INTRO_11": "{SAY:crazydave}不！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_12_INTRO_12": "{SAY:greedy}嗯？现在这是什么情况？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_12_INTRO_13": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我为什么要在盛宴节伤心？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_12_INTRO_14": "{EXCITED:crazydave}就因为某些黑手党拥有一台愚蠢的机器？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_12_INTRO_15": "{EXCITED:crazydave}这是欢乐的季节！不是吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_12_INTRO_16": "{TIRED:antibullysquad}...是的。是啊，你说的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_12_INTRO_17": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}你说得对！为什么我们应该只听别人告诉我们的话？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_12_INTRO_18": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}呃...因为我们是学生。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_12_INTRO_19": "{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，你正在经历我认为你正在经历的事情吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_12_INTRO_20": "{EXCITED:crazydave}是的，我想我是！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_12_INTRO_21": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我会感到快乐，不管是不是愚蠢的机器！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_12_INTRO_22": "{SAY:greedy}什么！？如何！？我全都偷了！这一切都应该是我的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_12_INTRO_23": "{EXCITED:winnie}扫描中……看来其他人也正在找回他们的盛宴节灵魂。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_12_INTRO_24": "{EXCITED:winnie}他们要走上街头...即使没有礼物也要庆祝！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_12_INTRO_25": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}他们中的一些人肯定也会以这种速度回去拿礼物！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_12_INTRO_26": "{SAY:winnie}看来被偷走的盛宴节精神还不是全部。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_12_INTRO_27": "{SAY:winnie}True 盛宴节精神存在于我们每个人的内心。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_12_INTRO_28": "{SAY:winnie}而且它永远无法真正被夺走。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_12_INTRO_29": "{SAY:greedy}不！我一定是最快乐的一个！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_12_INTRO_30": "{SAY:greedy}终于体会到这种感觉了，不能这么快就被夺走！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_12_INTRO_31": "{SAY:winnie}没有人会把它从你手中夺走贪婪，其他人只是在经历-",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_12_INTRO_32": "{SAY:greedy}你要把我占为己有！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_12_INTRO_33": "{SAY:greedy}不！我不能落后！我只是需要更多的欢呼！我要成为最开朗的那个！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_12_INTRO_34": "{SAY:greedy}啊哈！这就是装有所有积累的灵晶的小瓶！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_12_INTRO_35": "{TIRED:crazydave}贪婪的家伙，我认为你不应该喝那个。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_12_INTRO_36": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}先生格里纳尼，那不是——",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_12_INTRO_37": "{SAY:greedy}啊！太晚了！我现在是节日之王！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_12_INTRO_38": "{SAY:greedy}哈哈哈哈哈哈！我感觉到了！我感觉我的心在成长！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_12_INTRO_39": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}先生宗比利尼。这不是节日精神。你喝错了瓶子。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_12_INTRO_40": "{SAY:greedy}什么！？你在说什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_12_INTRO_41": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}你喝了非法成长配方。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_12_INTRO_42": "{SAY:greedy}哦。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_12_INTRO_43": "{SAY:greedy}所以-不会停止-肿胀-",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_12_INTRO_44": "{SAY:greedy}我的心...！呼叫-呼叫医务人员-",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_12_INTRO_45": "{NPC_EXIT:greedy}{PLAYFUL:winnie}我猜他的心脏确实变大了三倍。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_12_INTRO_46": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}别介意那个贪婪的怪杰，朋朋！看，草坪上有礼物！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_12_INTRO_47": "{EXCITED:crazydave}就在盛宴节早上！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_12_INTRO_48": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}这是盛宴节奇迹！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_12_INTRO_49": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}鬼也来庆祝盛宴节！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_12_INTRO_50": "{TIRED:antibullysquad}是啊，你们都说的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_12_INTRO_51": "{PLAYFUL:winnie}好吧，既然我们的联盟结束了，我们是不是应该重新成为敌人呢？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_12_INTRO_52": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}哦，对了。我想说的是：“我恨你们园丁！明年见！”",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2025_12_FEASTIVUS_12_INTRO_53": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}哦，你！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_1_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SAY:crazydave}嘿，邻居！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_1_INTRO_2": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}这一年过得怎么样啊？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_1_INTRO_3": "{TIRED:crazydave}有了所有这些假期和季节性计划，僵尸就会陷入......",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_1_INTRO_4": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}这不是很有趣吗？通常，人们都会乞求放假！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_1_INTRO_5": "{SAY:crazydave}然而假期是我们最忙碌的时间。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_1_INTRO_6": "{SAY:crazydave}好消息！这个月没有假期！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_1_INTRO_7": "{SAY:crazydave}那些僵尸大概工作太忙，没时间打扰我们吧！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_1_INTRO_8": "{SAY:crazydave}所以暂时没有方案！那不是很好吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_1_INTRO_9": "{SAY:crazydave}让我们打开一杯冷的，然后——",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_1_INTRO_10": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}紧急消息，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_1_INTRO_11": "{TIRED:crazydave}我说得太早了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_1_INTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}僵尸正准时来恐吓我们的草坪。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_1_INTRO_13": "{TIRED:crazydave}哦，天哪...是谁送的！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_1_INTRO_14": "{SAY:winnie}僵企再次发出对我们的入侵，附上他们的正式声明：",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_1_INTRO_15": "{SAY:winnie}“我们僵企是来偿还你欠我们的债的。”",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_1_INTRO_16": "{SAY:winnie}“已指派专人执行此任务，遇到请遵照执行。”",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_1_INTRO_17": "{SAY:winnie}“敬上，僵企媒体分部负责人，信息小姐。”",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_1_INTRO_18": "{SAY:crazydave}这次就立刻跳过去吧？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_1_INTRO_19": "{EXCITED:crazydave}好吧，我要起草一份措辞强硬的投诉书！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_1_INTRO_20": "{SAY:crazydave}他们还欠我们一些迟来的放松时间！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_2_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:crazydave}我已经受够了这种入侵！我要跟经理说话！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_2_INTRO_2": "{SAY:crazydave}给大佬打电话！呃……姑娘。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_2_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}注意到，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_2_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}正在呼叫...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_2_INTRO_5": "{NPC_ENTER:missinfo}{SAY:missinfo}早上好邻里维尔！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_2_INTRO_6": "{SPECIAL1:missinfo}*鼓掌特效*",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_2_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}是的，我们知道这笔交易。我们可以跳过手续吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_2_INTRO_8": "{SAY:crazydave}我们希望结束这次入侵！我写过一个...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_2_INTRO_9": "{SAY:missinfo}...措辞强硬的投诉？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_2_INTRO_10": "{TIRED:crazydave}...措辞强硬-嗯？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_2_INTRO_11": "{SAY:missinfo}亲爱的观众们，想摆脱这个恐怕没那么容易吧！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_2_INTRO_12": "{SAY:missinfo}你看，我已经为你们四个准备了特别的方案！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_2_INTRO_13": "{SAY:crazydave}但是为什么呢？不能-",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_2_INTRO_14": "{SAY:crazydave}等等，四个？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_2_INTRO_15": "{NPC_ENTER:zombert}{SAY:zombert}嘿兄弟们",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_2_INTRO_16": "{SAY:zombert}你能给我wifi密码吗",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_2_INTRO_17": "{SAY:missinfo}如您所见，我忠实的观众，今天我们迎来了一位惊喜嘉宾！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_2_INTRO_18": "{SAY:missinfo}我被我们的首席执行官Zombillion先生亲自委托，来辅导僵企未来的继承人！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_2_INTRO_19": "{SAY:crazydave}哈！？佐伯特是僵企的继承者！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_2_INTRO_20": "{SHOUT:crazydave}太疯狂了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_2_INTRO_21": "{SAY:missinfo}但是当然！佐姆比利恩先生终有一天会从他的职位上退休。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_2_INTRO_22": "{SAY:missinfo}这就是你进来的地方，Zombert！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_2_INTRO_23": "{SAY:missinfo}你是保护你父亲留给你的遗产的工具！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_2_INTRO_24": "{SAY:zombert}无论你说什么，大佬。你能给我 wi-fi 密码吗",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_2_INTRO_25": "{SAY:missinfo}现在，赞伯特。这对于未来的僵企 CEO 来说可不是什么礼仪！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_2_INTRO_26": "{SAY:missinfo}当有人对你说话时，你会倾听，并使用适当的语言来-",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_2_INTRO_27": "{SAY:zombert}Nvm shawty 我发现它是 1 到 8",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_2_INTRO_28": "{SAY:zombert}听听这首歌曲。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_2_INTRO_29": "{SAY:missinfo}嘿，把音乐关小点！这是一个工作场所！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_2_INTRO_30": "{NPC_EXIT:zombert}{SAY:missinfo}你要去哪里！？嘿！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_2_INTRO_31": "{SAY:missinfo}哈哈...我们似乎遇到了技术难题！请大家站稳脚跟！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_2_INTRO_32": "{NPC_EXIT:missinfo}{TIRED:crazydave}哇...赞伯特？拥有僵企？我无法想象。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_2_INTRO_33": "{TIRED:winnie}最灾难性的结果。我们希望它永远不会成为现实。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_3_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}这次入侵越来越残酷！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_3_INTRO_2": "{TIRED:crazydave}朋朋，我们有什么办法可以阻止信息小姐吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_3_INTRO_3": "{TIRED:winnie}你问得太多了，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_3_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}与我们的其他对手不同，信息小姐是一个独特的案例。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_3_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}她并非从原始的个人力量中汲取力量-",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_3_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}——不像迷彩将军这样的人。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_3_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}她的优势在于她对法人实体僵企的巨大影响力。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_3_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}所以从某种意义上来说，她是不可触碰的。如果你愿意的话，你是无敌的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_3_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}想要永久摆脱她，就必须承担僵企本身，这是一项相当艰巨的任务。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_3_INTRO_10": "{EXCITED:crazydave}好吧...那我们为什么不这样做呢？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_3_INTRO_11": "{TIRED:winnie}我们一直在努力，但这是一个艰难的过程。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_3_INTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}短期来看，这是一个很难实现的目标。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_3_INTRO_13": "{SAY:crazydave}我们当然可以以某种方式推翻它！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_3_INTRO_14": "{SAY:winnie}你指望我们如何推翻僵企帝国？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_3_INTRO_15": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave} 好吧，他们不会无缘无故地叫我疯狂戴夫！我有一个主意！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_3_INTRO_16": "{SAY:crazydave}她自己说的！ Zombert是确保僵企未来的工具！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_3_INTRO_17": "{SAY:crazydave}所以如果我们破坏Zombert的辅导课程......",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_3_INTRO_18": "{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫...这实际上非常巧妙。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_3_INTRO_19": "{SAY:winnie}Zombert 可能是设置僵企并让他们摆脱我们的工具。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_3_INTRO_20": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}是的，所以下次他们出现时，我们就-",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_3_INTRO_21": "{NPC_ENTER:missinfo}{NPC_ENTER:zombert}{SAY:missinfo}我们回来了，伙计们！现在让我们从上次中断的地方继续这次入侵吧！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_3_INTRO_22": "{SAY:missinfo}以此为契机，执行我告诉你的事情，Zombert！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_3_INTRO_23": "{SAY:missinfo}为什么不告诉我们亲爱的受害者我们今天为他们准备了什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_3_INTRO_24": "{SAY:zombert}当坏人告诉我做某事时：o7",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_3_INTRO_25": "{SAY:zombert}好的兄弟。呃……我们有一台挖掘机，一个巨大的全明星僵尸——",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_3_INTRO_26": "{SAY:missinfo}W-什么？不！赞伯特，那不是——！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_3_INTRO_27": "{SAY:missinfo}要成为一名成功的企业家，您需要知道要保留或告知哪些信息！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_3_INTRO_28": "{SAY:missinfo}更微妙一点，扭曲你的话！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_3_INTRO_29": "{SAY:zombert}歪曲我的话？好吧布拉",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_3_INTRO_30": "{SAY:zombert}获得全明星我们巨型挖掘机呃......僵尸a",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_3_INTRO_31": "{SAY:missinfo}什么？你在干什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_3_INTRO_32": "{SAY:zombert}扭曲我的话。我做对了吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_3_INTRO_33": "{SAY:missinfo}我的意思是撒谎，Zombert！你必须-",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_3_INTRO_34": "{SAY:missinfo}Y-你知道吗，让我们暂时搁置本课。让我们进入下一个吧！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_3_INTRO_35": "{NPC_EXIT:zombert}{NPC_EXIT:missinfo}{SAY:winnie}我们甚至可能什么都不用做。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_3_INTRO_36": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}哦哦哦！我是对的！这将会非常有趣！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_3_INTRO_37": "{SAY:winnie}确实，用户戴夫。操纵和利用他人是信息小姐的强项。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_3_INTRO_38": "{EXCITED:winnie}让她尝尝自己的药吧。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_4_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:crazydave}我都准备好了，朋朋！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_4_INTRO_2": "{EXCITED:winnie}太棒了，用户戴夫。记住我们排练过的内容。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_4_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}Miss Information 计划上线……大约……现在。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_4_INTRO_4": "{NPC_ENTER:missinfo}{NPC_ENTER:zombert}{SAY:missinfo}我们又回到了入侵的一天，伙计们！植物的防御正在崩溃！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_4_INTRO_5": "{SAY:missinfo}我和你一起悬念！多么惊心动魄啊！今天会是胜利的日子吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_4_INTRO_6": "{SAY:missinfo}僵企能否实现僵王博士过去16年一直未能成功的尝试？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_4_INTRO_7": "{SAY:missinfo}当然，如果没有我们的恩人的帮助，这一切都是不可能实现的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_4_INTRO_8": "{SAY:missinfo}Zombert，您愿意荣幸地向我们的观众介绍我们可爱的赞助商吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_4_INTRO_9": "{SAY:zombert}呃，这个腰痛药膏？虽然它们的味道并不好，但嘿嘿嘿嘿。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_4_INTRO_10": "{SAY:missinfo}哈哈！那是因为你不应该吃它，佐伯特！现在如果你愿意的话。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_4_INTRO_11": "{SAY:missinfo}棒。到。这。脚本。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_4_INTRO_12": "{SAY:zombert}你说我们要卖W产品来赚钱。但这些都是L产品。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_4_INTRO_13": "{SAY:zombert}没有人买这个G。我只是保持真实。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_4_INTRO_14": "{SAY:crazydave}没错！我不在乎一些背部药膏！实在是太无聊了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_4_INTRO_15": "{SAY:missinfo}嘿！我们可能会在活着的观众面前拍摄，但这并不意味着他们可以插话！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_4_INTRO_16": "{SAY:winnie}同意，用户戴夫。我觉得这个产品不是特别有用。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_4_INTRO_17": "{SAY:crazydave}是啊，你为什么不推荐一些真正有用的东西呢，Zombert？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_4_INTRO_18": "{SAY:missinfo}现在，在那里！你不能只是干扰广播——",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_4_INTRO_19": "{SAY:zombert}你们想要真正好的东西吗？然后买这些能量饮料吧。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_4_INTRO_20": "{SAY:zombert}太好了。当饮料出来时……滋滋作响！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_4_INTRO_21": "{SAY:zombert}我最喜欢的口味是酸橙。爸爸说他们在里面放了会上瘾的酸，让人们继续购买。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_4_INTRO_22": "{SAY:zombert}我们开始运动聊天吧。输入#ILOVEACIDINMYDRINKS rn。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_4_INTRO_23": "{SAY:missinfo}什么！？他们不应该知道它有——我——我是说——！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_4_INTRO_24": "{SAY:missinfo}这些僵企牌饮料含有很多成分，没有一个是酸的！哈哈！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_4_INTRO_25": "{SAY:missinfo}杰里米，剪镜头，剪——",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_4_INTRO_26": "{NPC_EXIT:zombert}{NPC_EXIT:missinfo}{EXCITED:crazydave}成功了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_4_INTRO_27": "{SAY:winnie}他落下了钩线和坠子。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_4_INTRO_28": "{SAY:winnie}现在我们要做的就是处理好信息小姐发来的僵尸。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_4_INTRO_29": "{TIRED:crazydave}是啊！所有这些僵尸...还有饮料...嗯。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_4_INTRO_30": "{SAY:winnie}什么是用户戴夫？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_4_INTRO_31": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}呃...你知道吗？大概只是我的想象吧！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_4_INTRO_32": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我们继续计划吧！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_5_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}有更新吗朋朋？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_5_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}僵企现在因在饮料中添加酸而面临诉讼。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_5_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}再这样下去，僵企将会陷入财务危机。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_5_INTRO_4": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}就连我也没想到Zombert会失败得这么严重！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_5_INTRO_5": "{SAY:crazydave}那么下一步是什么，朋朋？还要等下一个广播吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_5_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}今天没有安排，用户戴夫。我们可以利用这段停机时间来恢复...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_5_INTRO_7": "{NPC_ENTER:zombert}{SAY:zombert}我无聊，闲聊。布鲁啊啊啊啊啊啊。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_5_INTRO_8": "{TIRED:winnie}...或者他们可能会突然打电话，我猜。",
