  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_8_INTRO_20": "{SAY:missinfo}喂，你这是……不！别在我的工作室里乱跑！你会把摄像头关掉-",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_8_INTRO_21": "{NPC_EXIT:superzombert}{NPC_EXIT:missinfo}{SAY:winnie}我预计Zombert会给他们带来经济上的损失，但不会到这种程度。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_8_INTRO_22": "{SAY:crazydave}僵企破产了！？我简直不敢相信！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_8_INTRO_23": "{EXCITED:crazydave}这是个好消息！对吧，朋朋？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_8_INTRO_24": "{SAY:winnie}是的，我想是的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_8_INTRO_25": "{SAY:winnie}你还想让我报告我对僵尸布局的发现吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_8_INTRO_26": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}啊，那可以等了！今天我们一起庆祝一下吧！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_8_INTRO_27": "{SAY:winnie}好吧，与这个突破性的消息相比，这确实显得陈词滥调。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_8_INTRO_28": "{SAY:winnie}寄希望于Zombert的愚蠢行为对于僵企的衰落来说是一项值得的投资。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_9_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:winnie}用户戴夫。事情紧急。请回复。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_9_INTRO_2": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SAY:crazydave}什么？你为什么这么挑剔，朋朋？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_9_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}我们错了。僵企的身价一夜暴涨。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_9_INTRO_4": "{SHOUT:crazydave}什么？太疯狂了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_9_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}考虑到昨天他们确定破产的消息，我忘了提这件事......",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_9_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}但是这些反复出现的僵尸布局，僵企的突然下跌和随后的崛起......",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_9_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}感觉不像……但他们一定是相连的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_9_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}我们需要记住我们实际上面对的是谁。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_9_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}欺骗和欺骗是她的作案手法。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_9_INTRO_10": "{TIRED:crazydave}所以这背后是信息小姐吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_9_INTRO_11": "{EXCITED:winnie}她一定是。我感觉这太容易了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_9_INTRO_12": "{SAY:crazydave}但这对我们朋朋意味着什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_9_INTRO_13": "{SAY:winnie}她给我们的眼睛蒙上了一层面纱。我们需要面对她。但在那之前——",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_9_INTRO_14": "{NPC_ENTER:superzombert}{SAY:superzombert}现在，观看，聊天！超级僵尸要拯救僵企！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_9_INTRO_15": "{SAY:superzombert}今天，我要惩罚那些破坏僵尸经济的坏人。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_9_INTRO_16": "{EXCITED:crazydave}什么！？你就是摧毁僵尸经济的人！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_9_INTRO_17": "{SAY:superzombert}努呃。我是拯救僵尸经济的英雄！爸爸的新闻女记者也这么说。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_9_INTRO_18": "{SAY:superzombert}你们才是这里的恶棍！超级僵尸消灭了恶棍并得到了女孩！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_9_INTRO_19": "{TIRED:winnie}如果世界像你说的那么简单就好了，Zombert。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_9_INTRO_20": "{SAY:superzombert}我不是白痴！你真是个白痴，指望我会失败僵企，或者其他什么。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_9_INTRO_21": "{SAY:winnie}什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_9_INTRO_22": "{NPC_EXIT:superzombert}{SAY:winnie}他不应该知道这一点，具体到确切的措辞。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_9_INTRO_23": "{EXCITED:crazydave}信息小姐肯定告诉他了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_9_INTRO_24": "{SAY:winnie}但她怎么知道？在这一点上毫无疑问。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_9_INTRO_25": "{SAY:winnie}她是这一切的幕后黑手。我们需要面对她。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_9_INTRO_26": "{SAY:crazydave}是的。但首先，我们需要照顾超级僵尸！呼男孩！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_9_INTRO_27": "{SAY:winnie}明天我会录制对峙。不留任何错误的余地。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_9_INTRO_28": "{EXCITED:crazydave}是的，数字足迹！她不可能从这个地方溜出去的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_10_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:missinfo}{SAY:missinfo}I-",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_10_INTRO_2": "{EXCITED:crazydave}承认吧，女士！我们知道这一切都是你做的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_10_INTRO_3": "{EXCITED:winnie}没有其他合理的解释。所以保留戏剧。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_10_INTRO_4": "{SAY:missinfo}哦...？噗——啊哈哈哈哈！那么，所有的牌都摆在桌面上了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_10_INTRO_5": "{SAY:missinfo}你真以为你能拆掉僵企吗？和赞伯特一起？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_10_INTRO_6": "{SAY:crazydave}你……你怎么知道那是我们的计划？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_10_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}反复出现的僵尸图案！这一切都来自我们之前的战斗……",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_10_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}有人复制它......这意味着他们一定一直在看着我们。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_10_INTRO_9": "{SAY:missinfo}复制？我更愿意称其为您节目最热门歌曲的“重播”，哈哈！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_10_INTRO_10": "{EXCITED:winnie} 所以一切都连接好了！但我们第一次见面后我就消灭了你所有的虫子！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_10_INTRO_11": "{SAY:missinfo}啧啧。那你就严重低估了僵企的侦查能力了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_10_INTRO_12": "{TIRED:crazydave}等等。这意味着你故意让Zombert破产僵企！为什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_10_INTRO_13": "{SAY:missinfo}我已经多次向Zombillion先生表示Zombillion是一个无可救药的接班人。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_10_INTRO_14": "{SAY:missinfo}把他带来这里只会破坏我们辛辛苦苦建立的一切......",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_10_INTRO_15": "{SAY:missinfo}既然 Zombert 为我证明了我的观点，为什么我必须干涉呢？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_10_INTRO_16": "{SAY:winnie}你一直在利用我们...让我们使用Zombert...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_10_INTRO_17": "{SAY:winnie}这一切都是为了让你能因解决他的烂摊子而获得功劳？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_10_INTRO_18": "{TIRED:winnie}最终，我们就是工具。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_10_INTRO_19": "{EXCITED:crazydave}你完成了，女士！朋朋将所有这些都录在磁带上！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_10_INTRO_20": "{SAY:crazydave}你的老板不会高兴听到你破坏他的儿子！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_10_INTRO_21": "{SAY:missinfo}是这样吗？但如果我一直在看的话，我难道不会期待这一点吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_10_INTRO_22": "{SAY:winnie}*错误*",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_10_INTRO_23": "{EXCITED:winnie}我、不可能……我的录音已损坏！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_10_INTRO_24": "{SAY:missinfo}哈哈哈！哦……希望你们三个都明白了~你们是斗不过我的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_10_INTRO_25": "{SAY:missinfo}如果你曾经想过你可以，那是因为我让你了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_10_INTRO_26": "{SAY:missinfo}现在不要得意地飞近太阳，以为你可以推翻僵企。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_10_INTRO_27": "{SAY:missinfo}在你不知不觉中我们公司已经侵入你生活的方方面面了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_10_INTRO_28": "{SAY:missinfo}我在这里幕后操纵。一旦赞伯特和赞比利恩消失了，我就会——",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_10_INTRO_29": "{NPC_ENTER:zombert}{SAY:zombert}聊聊吧。我现在就对她说。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_10_INTRO_30": "{SAY:zombert}嘿女孩，你在建筑吗？因为你正在建造。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_10_INTRO_31": "{SAY:crazydave}什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_10_INTRO_32": "{SAY:missinfo}僵尸！？你怎么-？你什么时候在那儿的？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_10_INTRO_33": "{SAY:zombert}我想一直都是。你吵得那么厉害，我根本没注意。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_10_INTRO_34": "{SAY:missinfo}你在……直播？整个事情...？ T-至...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_10_INTRO_35": "{SAY:zombert}致大家。你说过你会让我在直播中为你加油，还记得吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_10_INTRO_36": "{SAY:missinfo}E、大家都看到了吗……？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_10_INTRO_37": "{SAY:zombert}是的，聊天中的每个人。向观看的 2 只山羊致敬。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_10_INTRO_38": "{SAY:missinfo}T——两个人……两个……不，没什么。两个人没什么。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_10_INTRO_39": "{SAY:missinfo}哈...哈哈哈哈...哈哈哈哈！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_10_INTRO_40": "{SAY:missinfo}佐伯特。我想你是时候回家了。我会打电话给你父亲来接你。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_10_INTRO_41": "{SAY:zombert}但是评价一下我的rizz-",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_10_INTRO_42": "{SAY:missinfo}走。家。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_10_INTRO_43": "{NPC_EXIT:zombert}{PLAYFUL:winnie}看来其他人需要停止靠近太阳飞行了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_10_INTRO_44": "{SAY:missinfo}杰里米。找到他的那个频道。删除那个片段。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_10_INTRO_45": "{NPC_EXIT:missinfo}{TIRED:crazydave}嗯……我想我们确实让她尝到了Zombert的苦处？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_10_INTRO_46": "{TIRED:crazydave}任务完成了……？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_10_INTRO_47": "{SAY:winnie}不幸的是，我们无法获取这次遭遇的证据。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_01_ZCORP_10_INTRO_48": "{SAY:winnie}但我们至少现在知道了。就连她也不是真正无敌的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_1_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SAY:winnie}好吧，我们又来了，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_1_INTRO_2": "{PLAYFUL:winnie}你指定的“吃巧克力的季节”的时间。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_1_INTRO_3": "{SAY:crazydave}呃，实际上。向日葵医护人员说我需要减少巧克力的摄入量。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_1_INTRO_4": "{TIRED:crazydave}我可以容忍他们告诉我减少机油饮食，但是这个！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_1_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}他们有一点，用户戴夫。过多的巧克力对身体没有好处。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_1_INTRO_6": "{EXCITED:crazydave}他们也是这么说的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_1_INTRO_7": "{SAY:crazydave}“拥有良好的身体形象是保持自爱的理想选择”",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_1_INTRO_8": "{SAY:crazydave}“——这反过来又会带来更好的心理健康。”",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_1_INTRO_9": "{TIRED:crazydave}吃巧克力的时候我还不能爱自己吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_1_INTRO_10": "{TIRED:winnie}嗯，我想这可以讨论。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_1_INTRO_11": "{SAY:crazydave}我需要用一些东西来发泄我的沮丧！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_1_INTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}嗯，一群饥饿的僵尸似乎很容易达到这样的目的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_1_INTRO_13": "{TIRED:crazydave}哦，所以僵尸可以爱大脑，但我不能爱巧克力？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_2_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}我们收到邮件了，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_2_INTRO_2": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{EXCITED:crazydave}一定是一封情书！它有一个小心脏作为密封！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_2_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}不要抱太大希望，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_2_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}扫描返回僵尸相邻起源的几率为 100%。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_2_INTRO_5": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}这不是一个破坏交易的事情！先读一下！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_2_INTRO_6": "{TIRED:winnie}那么，如果你坚持的话。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_2_INTRO_7": "{EXCITED:winnie}“大家好，小伙子们，姑娘们，啊，幸运儿，带着请求写下了这些信！”",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_2_INTRO_8": "{SAY:crazydave}你为什么要带口音？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_2_INTRO_9": "{TIRED:winnie}这封信是带有重音的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_2_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}“希望大家收看明天的 Valenbrainz 电视特别节目。请留意——”",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_2_INTRO_11": "{SAY:winnie}“-真心的！”",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_2_INTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}“我终于得到了我的运气无法保证的一件事——”",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_2_INTRO_13": "{SAY:winnie}“-好极了！”",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_2_INTRO_14": "{TIRED:crazydave}粗人？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_2_INTRO_15": "{NPC_ENTER:lucky}{SAY:lucky}亲爱的，我的好小伙子！一个女人！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_2_INTRO_16": "{SAY:lucky}啊'看到你收到我的信了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_2_INTRO_17": "{SAY:crazydave}你想让我们看着你得到一个女孩吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_2_INTRO_18": "{SAY:lucky}啊'当然！你看，我正在参加 Valenbrainz 的“约会秀”，目前正在进行中！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_2_INTRO_19": "{SAY:lucky}当然，运气好的话就一定能赢。但我正在起草这些信-",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_2_INTRO_20": "{SAY:lucky}——更加保证我的胜利！啊哈！有这样的命运，我可以夸耀，真是太幸运了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_2_INTRO_21": "{SAY:winnie}你就是来找我们吹牛的？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_2_INTRO_22": "{SAY:lucky}我的运气会满足我内心的愿望！这次没有出事！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_2_INTRO_23": "{SAY:lucky}这就是我想向你们证明的，好小伙子！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_2_INTRO_24": "{SAY:lucky}对了！下次见面的话，奖杯就是我了，哈哈！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_2_INTRO_25": "{NPC_EXIT:lucky}{SAY:crazydave}所以这封信是Lucky寄来的？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_2_INTRO_26": "{TIRED:crazydave}好吧，这就是破坏者。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_3_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{TIRED:winnie}我们真的在看这个“相亲节目”用户戴夫吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_3_INTRO_2": "{TIRED:winnie}如果我自己说的话，那就是浪费时间。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_3_INTRO_3": "{SAY:crazydave}我还是得别再想巧克力了！什么都会做！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_3_INTRO_4": "{NPC_ENTER:missinfo}{SAY:missinfo}欢迎回到“爱超越面纱（来世）”！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_3_INTRO_5": "{SPECIAL1:missinfo}*鼓掌特效*",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_3_INTRO_6": "{SAY:crazydave}她是主持人！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_3_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}这应该不足为奇。她主导了 90% 的僵尸电视节目。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_3_INTRO_8": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}我猜？当她没有对我们图谋不轨时，看到她真是奇怪……",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_3_INTRO_9": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}就像在杂货店见到你的老师一样！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_3_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}我怀疑在我们上次见面后她会做出如此厚颜无耻的事情，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_3_INTRO_11": "{SAY:winnie}目前看来，她只是暂时搁置自己的计划，只是尽自己作为一名电视主持人的职责。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_3_INTRO_12": "{SAY:missinfo}跟我一起回来吧，你们的东道主，还有这次小比赛的终极奖品！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_3_INTRO_13": "{SAY:missinfo}谁能迷倒这纯洁的少女心？啊，好诱人啊！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_3_INTRO_14": "{SAY:missinfo}好吧，我们即将找到答案！让我们来统计一下上一轮的票数吧！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_3_INTRO_15": "{SAY:missinfo}首先，我们的住校甜心们！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_3_INTRO_16": "{NPC_ENTER:antibullysquad}{SHOUT:antibullysquad}我们赢了吗！？我们得到了广泛的吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_3_INTRO_17": "{TIRED:antibullysquad}是啊，我们得到了广泛吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_3_INTRO_18": "{SAY:missinfo}你们三个一起——哎呀！一场精彩的比赛获得2票！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_3_INTRO_19": "{SPECIAL3:missinfo}*笑声曲目*",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_3_INTRO_20": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}什么！？但这意味着你们中的一个人甚至没有投票给我们！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_3_INTRO_21": "{SAY:missinfo}对不起，你们三个被取消资格了！进入滑道吧！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_3_INTRO_22": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}降落伞？老板，这是什么意思？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_3_INTRO_23": "{TIRED:antibullysquad}是的，这意味着什么-",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_3_INTRO_24": "{SPECIAL2:antibullysquad}啊啊啊啊啊啊！！！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_3_INTRO_25": "{NPC_EXIT:antibullysquad}{SAY:crazydave}哇，他们刚刚掉进了深渊。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_3_INTRO_26": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}我现在明白为什么人们会迷上这个节目了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_3_INTRO_27": "{SAY:missinfo}...aaaa又取消资格了！这只剩下...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_3_INTRO_28": "{SAY:missinfo}哦...他。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_3_INTRO_29": "{NPC_ENTER:lucky}{SAY:lucky}啊，美丽的姑娘，信息女士，我们现在在一起一定是缘分！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_3_INTRO_30": "{SAY:lucky}或者应该说，运气好。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_3_INTRO_31": "{SPECIAL3:missinfo}*笑声曲目*",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_3_INTRO_32": "{SAY:missinfo}啊哈哈哈哈，对了！当然！应该预见到这一点，对吧，伙计们？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_3_INTRO_33": "{SAY:lucky}经过这么多封未回复的信，我们终于团结了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_3_INTRO_34": "{SAY:lucky}也许你应该认为自己很幸运，姑娘。像我一样获得恩惠！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_3_INTRO_35": "{SAY:missinfo}...对。我应该，不是吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_3_INTRO_36": "{SAY:missinfo}嗯。明天，我们进入下一个环节，第一次约会。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_3_INTRO_37": "{SAY:missinfo}这就是，呵呵，本次比赛的规则！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_3_INTRO_38": "{SAY:missinfo}我们两个合适吗-",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_3_INTRO_39": "{SAY:lucky}我们一定会的！啊'可以看到，它将分享爱所暗示的一切-",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_3_INTRO_40": "{SAY:lucky}我们会是完美的一对，就像我的大腿一样！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_3_INTRO_41": "{SAY:missinfo}...多么有趣的比较！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_3_INTRO_42": "{SAY:missinfo}明天，伙计们，看看这是否是真的......",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_3_INTRO_43": "{SAY:missinfo}今天就这样！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_3_INTRO_44": "{NPC_EXIT:lucky}{NPC_EXIT:missinfo}{TIRED:winnie}真是一个有辱人格的前提。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_4_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{TIRED:winnie}用户戴夫，你为什么还在看这个？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_4_INTRO_2": "{SAY:crazydave}巧克力摄入量低让我情绪低落！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_4_INTRO_3": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我想看别人被扔进降落伞！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_4_INTRO_4": "{NPC_ENTER:lucky}{NPC_ENTER:missinfo}{SAY:missinfo}我们回来了，伙计们，我们正在进入下一个部分，第一次约会！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_4_INTRO_5": "{SAY:lucky}是的，你知道，A'自己就有无数这样的人。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_4_INTRO_6": "{SAY:lucky}但是现在没有一个可以持续下去。你知道，像我这样的种马笨手笨脚的，真是太遗憾了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_4_INTRO_7": "{SAY:missinfo}幸运先生，这次约会对你来说有何不同？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_4_INTRO_8": "{SAY:lucky}为什么，我是爱情新手，但我知道它是什么样子。啊，看电视。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_4_INTRO_9": "{SAY:lucky}A' 必须说你是一个火热、凶猛的女人，姑娘。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_4_INTRO_10": "{SAY:lucky}在这样的经济环境下，一个职业女性的地位如此之高？最令人佩服的是！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_4_INTRO_11": "{SAY:missinfo}哈哈！你也这么认为吗，幸运先生？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_4_INTRO_12": "{SAY:missinfo}我必须说，你是一个非常有趣的人......",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_4_INTRO_13": "{SAY:lucky}当然，你知道，我自己也是一个平等的机会主义者！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_4_INTRO_14": "{SAY:lucky}像你们一样坚强地爱我！ A说，是时候打破玻璃天花板了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_4_INTRO_15": "{SAY:missinfo}幸运先生，你真是一个正念啊！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_4_INTRO_16": "{SAY:lucky}啊哈，当然！现在，我总是为比我低等的人辩护！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_4_INTRO_17": "{TIRED:winnie}真的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_4_INTRO_18": "{SAY:missinfo}你就是知道该说什么，幸运先生，不是吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_4_INTRO_19": "{SAY:missinfo}我们只需看看你的话是否可以翻译成其他形式-",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_4_INTRO_20": "{SAY:missinfo}-下一步比赛的爱语！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_4_INTRO_21": "{NPC_EXIT:lucky}{NPC_EXIT:missinfo}{PLAYFUL:crazydave}啊，他们一定会说法语！爱的语言！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_4_INTRO_22": "{TIRED:winnie}这不是爱情语言的意思，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_5_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SAY:winnie}热爱语言。定义：",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_5_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}伴侣在浪漫的环境中表达和体验爱情的方式。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_5_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}分为五个不同的——",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_5_INTRO_4": "{TIRED:crazydave}好的，朋朋。你可以停在那里。越来越无聊了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_5_INTRO_5": "{EXCITED:crazydave}此外，节目又回来了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_5_INTRO_6": "{NPC_ENTER:lucky}{NPC_ENTER:missinfo}{SAY:lucky}Melassie，我想要这个。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_5_INTRO_7": "{SAY:missinfo}啊，礼物！多周到啊！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_5_INTRO_8": "{SAY:lucky}接收礼物就是你的爱语，是吗？弥天大谎！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_5_INTRO_9": "{SAY:missinfo}哦，你看一下吗！这是……嗯……",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_5_INTRO_10": "{SAY:lucky}我的限量、独家自传。签名，并附有我的靴子照片！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_5_INTRO_11": "{SAY:lucky}姑娘，珍惜吧！许多凯林斯“会奋力争取”以得到它。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_5_INTRO_12": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}哦，就是第一次见到他时掉在我头上的那本书！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_5_INTRO_13": "{SAY:missinfo}我还给你买了东西！请收下吧！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_5_INTRO_14": "{SAY:lucky}啊，你不应该有！是呃……",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_5_INTRO_15": "{SAY:lucky}短裙？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_5_INTRO_16": "{SAY:missinfo}确实如此！最适合您的苏格兰传统！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_5_INTRO_17": "{SAY:lucky}斯科特-！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_5_INTRO_18": "{SAY:missinfo}啊，我还没表达过我有多喜欢你的苏格兰口音呢！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_5_INTRO_19": "{SAY:lucky}你让我筋疲力尽，我的好姑娘！我是爱尔兰血统！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_5_INTRO_20": "{SAY:missinfo}真的吗？你像“A”一样发音“I”的方式更让人想起苏格兰方言！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_5_INTRO_21": "{SAY:missinfo}更不用说你说“cailin-”的方式了，它的发音是“caw-leen”，你知道吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_5_INTRO_22": "{SAY:missinfo}但是，当然，你已经知道了，不是吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_5_INTRO_23": "{SAY:lucky}啊'-我是说，我知道！是的当然！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_5_INTRO_24": "{SAY:missinfo}因为如果你不...但你为什么要假装口音，对吧？哈哈！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_5_INTRO_25": "{SAY:lucky}哈哈哈！你是个毒气女人，姑娘。我不需要伪造任何东西！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_5_INTRO_26": "{SAY:missinfo}当然不是，幸运先生。你知道，因为不诚实对我来说是一个主要的危险信号，真的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_5_INTRO_27": "{SAY:winnie}...对。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_5_INTRO_28": "{NPC_EXIT:lucky}{NPC_EXIT:missinfo}{TIRED:crazydave}...口音是假的？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_5_INTRO_29": "{SAY:winnie}鉴于他的形象是建立在廉价谎言之上的，我不会感到惊讶。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_5_INTRO_30": "{TIRED:crazydave}所以……他只是为了好玩才这样说话？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_6_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{PLAYFUL:crazydave}哥们，这个相亲节目其实还挺受欢迎的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_6_INTRO_2": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我什至听到了一些向日葵的八卦！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_6_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}是的，人们真的很高兴。到底是什么原因，我无法理解。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_6_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}我不计算这两者之间的任何化学反应。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_6_INTRO_5": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}嗯，我猜他们的外表确实都有一定的……魅力。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_6_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}肤浅。虽然我认为这是有道理的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_6_INTRO_7": "{EXCITED:crazydave}说到，嘘！又开始了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_6_INTRO_8": "{NPC_ENTER:lucky}{NPC_ENTER:missinfo}{SAY:lucky}哎呀，小姑娘，今天你给我们准备了什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_6_INTRO_9": "{SAY:lucky}更多......我希望观众会感到兴奋？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_6_INTRO_10": "{SAY:lucky}A'还能怎样证明我们是有缘分呢？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_6_INTRO_11": "{SAY:missinfo}我们先来了解一下吧幸运先生！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_6_INTRO_12": "{SAY:missinfo}毕竟，我们的观众爱你！因为，我确信有非常充分的理由。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_6_INTRO_13": "{SAY:missinfo}我们为什么不给他们一些话题呢？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_6_INTRO_14": "{SAY:lucky}啊，人民之声。我怎么能拒绝崇拜者的召唤呢？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_6_INTRO_15": "{SAY:missinfo}那我就开始吧！幸运先生，您有机械倾向吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_6_INTRO_16": "{SAY:lucky}我？啊，我不会欺骗你们，你们都这么想我！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_6_INTRO_17": "{SAY:lucky}哈哈。为什么问这个问题，姑娘？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_6_INTRO_18": "{SAY:missinfo}没有理由，真的。也许还有一个问题！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_6_INTRO_19": "{SAY:missinfo}你能给我们解释一下吗……你的这个神秘之处。你超自然的运气！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_6_INTRO_20": "{SAY:missinfo}你到底是怎么得到的？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_6_INTRO_21": "{SAY:winnie}这些问题...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_6_INTRO_22": "{SAY:lucky}Ar，我现在不知道你在说什么。它一直伴随着我，真的！那里没有令人兴奋的故事！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_6_INTRO_23": "{SAY:missinfo}像你这样的超自然幸运僵尸会一直是媒体宠儿-",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_6_INTRO_24": "{SAY:missinfo}-你就是！然而，你似乎只是有一天凭空出现的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_6_INTRO_25": "{SAY:missinfo}很有趣，不是吗？但也许这个神秘是你的神秘的一部分。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_6_INTRO_26": "{SAY:missinfo}不想破坏现在的乐趣，不是吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_6_INTRO_27": "{SAY:lucky}你...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_6_INTRO_28": "{SAY:missinfo}哦，广告时间到了！说得好，幸运先生！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_6_INTRO_29": "{SAY:missinfo}感觉我们更加了解了，呵呵！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_6_INTRO_30": "{NPC_EXIT:lucky}{NPC_EXIT:missinfo}{TIRED:crazydave}她说话的方式......",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_6_INTRO_31": "{TIRED:crazydave}是运气机器的事吗？她怎么知道的？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_6_INTRO_32": "{EXCITED:winnie}她的情报不容嘲笑。把它挂在Lucky面前……",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_6_INTRO_33": "{SAY:winnie}她有什么打算？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_7_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:missinfo}{SAY:missinfo}晚上好，邻家小镇！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_7_INTRO_2": "{SPECIAL1:missinfo}*鼓掌特效*",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_7_INTRO_3": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{EXCITED:crazydave}你！你在这里做什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_7_INTRO_4": "{SAY:crazydave}你不应该去约会吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_7_INTRO_5": "{SAY:missinfo}哦，所以你一直在看？哈哈！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_7_INTRO_6": "{SAY:missinfo}说到底我还是个记者，你知道吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_7_INTRO_7": "{SAY:missinfo}我不只是热门相亲节目中的漂亮面孔！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_7_INTRO_8": "{SAY:missinfo}即使有些人坚持不然。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_7_INTRO_9": "{SHOUT:crazydave}神圣的汉娜！那是很多僵尸！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_7_INTRO_10": "{SAY:missinfo}嗯，晚间新闻需要燃料来启动！这不是什么个人的事！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_7_INTRO_11": "{SAY:winnie}不知何故我对此表示怀疑。创造新闻就是这一切吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_7_INTRO_12": "{SAY:missinfo}嗯？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_7_INTRO_13": "{SAY:winnie}这对于一个小规模的故事来说有点过分了。你正在利用这次攻击作为一个出口。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_7_INTRO_14": "{SAY:winnie}你显然对最近和Lucky的搭配不满意吧？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_7_INTRO_15": "{SAY:missinfo}哦，朋朋！如此直率和直接！你知道，我喜欢某人——",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_7_INTRO_16": "{SAY:missinfo}为什么，如果情况不同的话，我现在会神魂颠倒！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_7_INTRO_17": "{SAY:crazydave}嗯....",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_7_INTRO_18": "{TIRED:winnie}请少拍马屁。直接告诉我们吧。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_7_INTRO_19": "{SAY:missinfo}这是演艺圈，亲爱的朋朋！没有任何空间来纠缠、矛盾的情绪！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_7_INTRO_20": "{SAY:missinfo}放心，我很擅长让自己摆脱这种不稳定的困境。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_7_INTRO_21": "{SAY:missinfo}我已经做过无数次了，所以不用担心你的漂亮脑袋！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_7_INTRO_22": "{SAY:missinfo}哎呀！快到新闻时间了！让你的植物就位。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_8_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{EXCITED:crazydave}朋朋，换频道！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_8_INTRO_2": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}向日葵们想看相亲节目！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_8_INTRO_3": "{TIRED:winnie}真的吗？向日葵s...？而不是你呢？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_8_INTRO_4": "{NPC_ENTER:missinfo}{NPC_ENTER:lucky}{SAY:missinfo}...我们回来了，伙计们！我们的表演已经接近巅峰了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_8_INTRO_5": "{SAY:missinfo}我们多认识一下怎么样，Lucky先生？还有几个问题——",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_8_INTRO_6": "{SAY:lucky}其实，姑娘。问所有问题不公平，对吧？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_8_INTRO_7": "{SAY:lucky}哈哈，我的意思是，我不应该更好地了解你吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_8_INTRO_8": "{SAY:missinfo}哦，当然！你想问什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_8_INTRO_9": "{SAY:lucky}Ar，上次你提到了起源……这次演出之前你在做什么，现在？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_8_INTRO_10": "{SAY:missinfo}嗯，在我加入僵企之前，我是一些当地报纸的撰稿人！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_8_INTRO_11": "{SAY:lucky}我明白了……你知道，我想其中之一就是《Daily Brainz》，不是吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_8_INTRO_12": "{SAY:lucky}在因为和主编的绯闻而被下架之前我曾经看过它！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_8_INTRO_13": "{SAY:missinfo}不幸的是，是的。所以我只好跳槽了，哈哈！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_8_INTRO_14": "{SAY:lucky}是的。致《赞比亚邮报》。也因另一起丑闻而关闭。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_8_INTRO_15": "{SAY:lucky}想想看，所有这些出版物都因老板的丑闻而关闭！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_8_INTRO_16": "{SAY:lucky}啊，但我很高兴你现在从未受到过个人的负面影响。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_8_INTRO_17": "{SAY:lucky}我什至听到了相反的说法——你们设法在这些工作上攀登阶梯......",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_8_INTRO_18": "{SAY:lucky}...不久之后他们就崩溃了。至少你设法充分利用它，是吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_8_INTRO_19": "{SAY:missinfo}....哇。呃。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_8_INTRO_20": "{SAY:missinfo}先生幸运的是，你消息灵通，哈哈！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_8_INTRO_21": "{SAY:lucky}啊，就说运气吧。耳朵要放在正确的地方。哈哈哈！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_8_INTRO_22": "{NPC_EXIT:lucky}{NPC_EXIT:missinfo}{TIRED:crazydave}朋朋，是不是感觉呃……更紧张了？比平时？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_8_INTRO_23": "{EXCITED:winnie}我猜测信息小姐正试图像她做迷彩的方式一样抹黑Lucky。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_8_INTRO_24": "{SAY:crazydave}哦，原来她就是这么做的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_8_INTRO_25": "{EXCITED:winnie}是的，但与迷彩不同的是，Lucky 也知道如何欺骗。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_8_INTRO_26": "{EXCITED:winnie}他正在反击，用她自己的策略来对付她。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_8_INTRO_27": "{EXCITED:winnie}提起她麻烦的过去……现在这变得有趣了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_9_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:missinfo}{NPC_ENTER:lucky}{SAY:lucky}现在姑娘，我们继续上次的话题吧？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_9_INTRO_2": "{SAY:missinfo}哦，真的吗？当然可以，我可以——",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_9_INTRO_3": "{SAY:lucky}问你一个问题。你们有什么目标或愿望吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_9_INTRO_4": "{SAY:missinfo}我？好吧，我想在僵企继续我的职业生涯，越久越好！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_9_INTRO_5": "{SAY:lucky}我明白了。令人钦佩。最令人佩服的是。你辛苦了才来到这里，不是吗，姑娘？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_9_INTRO_6": "{SAY:lucky}从头开始建立诚实的职业生涯。这是一个可怕的想法......",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_9_INTRO_7": "{SAY:lucky}想象一下，如果它只是因为一次侥幸、一个错误的词而被推翻......",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_9_INTRO_8": "{SAY:lucky}...一个不明智的敌人。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_9_INTRO_9": "{SAY:lucky}啊，但这只有在你的工作基础一开始就脆弱的情况下才会发生。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_9_INTRO_10": "{SAY:lucky}也许，如果它是建立在谎言......或丑闻之上......",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_9_INTRO_11": "{SAY:missinfo}...我们要去哪里？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_9_INTRO_12": "{SAY:lucky}哦，我在自言自语，真的！别介意我。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_9_INTRO_13": "{SAY:lucky}啊，但是这不会让你筋疲力尽吧？自己就这么傻干活吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_9_INTRO_14": "{SAY:lucky}你已经拥有了这一切，有时我想知道你为什么还要去！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_9_INTRO_15": "{SAY:missinfo}为什么？当然是因为我热爱我的工作！还应该有其他原因吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_9_INTRO_16": "{SAY:lucky}凭你的长相，为什么还要工作？你可以成为特洛伊的海伦娜！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_9_INTRO_17": "{SAY:lucky}如果我是你，我就会找个人安定下来。过有意义的人生！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_9_INTRO_18": "{SAY:missinfo}哈哈哈！噢，要是事情像你说的那么简单就好了，幸运先生。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_9_INTRO_19": "{SAY:lucky}哦，但现在可以了！也许是和一个被幸运召唤为宠物的人在一起！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_9_INTRO_20": "{SAY:lucky}让男人提供！我就是这么说的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_9_INTRO_21": "{SAY:lucky}哦，还有一点小费，姑娘。我们男人不喜欢多嘴！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_9_INTRO_22": "{SAY:lucky}八卦的女孩子很无聊，你知道吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_9_INTRO_23": "{SAY:lucky}但是我们对一位孤僻的女士溺爱、迷恋和阿谀奉承。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_9_INTRO_24": "{SAY:missinfo}我...明白了。我会牢记这颗智慧之珠！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_9_INTRO_25": "{SAY:lucky}送给你自己的好姑娘，你最好这样做。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_9_INTRO_26": "{NPC_EXIT:lucky}{NPC_EXIT:missinfo}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{TIRED:crazydave}这有点让人不舒服......",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_9_INTRO_27": "{TIRED:crazydave}朋朋，我们要帮她吗……？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_9_INTRO_28": "{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，需要我提醒你的是，信息小姐并不完全是盟友。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_9_INTRO_29": "{EXCITED:crazydave}所以我们应该让这种情况发生！？我不能只是坐视这一切！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_9_INTRO_30": "{TIRED:winnie}嗯，不……不，我不是那个意思。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_9_INTRO_31": "{SAY:winnie}就她应得的后果而言，这看起来并不令人愉快。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_9_INTRO_32": "{SAY:winnie}但是即使你想帮忙，我们也无能为力，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_9_INTRO_33": "{EXCITED:crazydave}等等，不！我们可以做点什么！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_9_INTRO_34": "{EXCITED:crazydave}邻居，我需要你的帮助！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_10_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SAY:crazydave}演出什么时候开始，朋朋？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_10_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}大约十分钟。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_10_INTRO_3": "{NPC_ENTER:missinfo}{EXCITED:crazydave}什么-？你为什么在这里？难道你不应该为你的表演做准备吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_10_INTRO_4": "{SAY:missinfo}我只是需要一个人...哈哈...我是说...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_10_INTRO_5": "{SAY:missinfo}啊哈哈哈！我只是在为自己做准备！这一点也不罕见！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_10_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}你抹黑Lucky的计划并没有按照你的预期进行，是吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_10_INTRO_7": "{SAY:missinfo}W、什么！？不！一切都已就位！我只是需要找到他的其他谎言-",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_10_INTRO_8": "{SAY:missinfo}那我就用它来揭发他，让观众投票把他淘汰！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_10_INTRO_9": "{SAY:missinfo}当观众更多地听到他有多糟糕时......",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_10_INTRO_10": "{NPC_ENTER:lucky}{SAY:lucky}...他们不会相信。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_10_INTRO_11": "{EXCITED:crazydave}幸运！你一直在偷听吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_10_INTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}...你为什么这么肯定，Lucky？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_10_INTRO_13": "{SAY:lucky}因为在充满谎言的世界里这是唯一的真理！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_10_INTRO_14": "{SAY:lucky}人们...他们不想被告知。他们想要被娱乐！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_10_INTRO_15": "{SAY:lucky}她已经利用了很长一段时间了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_10_INTRO_16": "{SAY:lucky}但是人们可以通过多种方式来娱乐......",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_10_INTRO_17": "{SAY:lucky}就像两个非常迷人的人在一起一样！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_10_INTRO_18": "{SAY:lucky}Gwan，让他们看看到底得分是多少！他们只会更加相信我。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_10_INTRO_19": "{SAY:lucky}因为迷人、耀眼的幸运王子就是他们想听到的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_10_INTRO_20": "{SAY:lucky}收视率也这么说……他们喜欢看我们在一起，不是吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_10_INTRO_21": "{SAY:lucky}我们有缘！运气也这么认为！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_10_INTRO_22": "{EXCITED:crazydave}你不能做出那样的决定！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_10_INTRO_23": "{SAY:lucky}我不知道，但那些高管知道！这个结果就像 Do Re 一样确定无疑！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_10_INTRO_24": "{SAY:lucky}如果她在电视直播中拒绝我，为什么，收视率肯定会直线下降。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_10_INTRO_25": "{SAY:lucky}她的上级会不高兴的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_10_INTRO_26": "{SAY:missinfo}他们并没有规定我能做什么或不能做什么，幸运先生。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_10_INTRO_27": "{SAY:lucky}当然！就像你的老板和你的旧工作一样，你在放弃之前寻找的工作。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_10_INTRO_28": "{SAY:lucky}但是僵企并不是什么容易被遗忘的本地生意。僵企是力量，而不是被丢弃。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_10_INTRO_29": "{SAY:lucky}当然，这并不是说你没有尝试过在僵企这里破坏你的老板......",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_10_INTRO_30": "{SAY:missinfo}W-你在说什么！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_10_INTRO_31": "{SAY:lucky}Ar，不久前，我运气好，看到了一个当地无名小卒的直播——",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_10_INTRO_32": "{SAY:lucky}客串主演，某位女士不明智地泄露了她推翻老板的秘密计划......",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_10_INTRO_33": "{SAY:missinfo}我...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_10_INTRO_34": "{SAY:lucky}我不是唯一一个衣柜里有骷髅的人，小姑娘。我们都把自己建立在谎言之上。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_10_INTRO_35": "{SAY:lucky}你和我并没有那么不同，你知道吗？那么你为什么要拒​​绝我呢？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_10_INTRO_36": "{SAY:lucky}只有我和你最配。谁挑战你。谁会为你做任何事。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_10_INTRO_37": "{SAY:lucky}拒绝也可能意味着...关于你的不幸谣言正在流传...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_10_INTRO_38": "{SAY:lucky}我们不想这样，对吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_10_INTRO_39": "{NPC_EXIT:lucky}{TIRED:crazydave}天哪...真是一把！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_10_INTRO_40": "{SAY:missinfo}不，他是对的。人们坚持他们所知道的东西。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_10_INTRO_41": "{SAY:missinfo}我不能说任何不符合他们想听的话。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_10_INTRO_42": "{EXCITED:winnie}他们想要什么？即使现在，你脑子里想的是什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_10_INTRO_43": "{SAY:missinfo}你在说什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_10_INTRO_44": "{SAY:winnie}连你自己都不相信的事情会是真的吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_10_INTRO_45": "{EXCITED:winnie}一生中就一次，对自己诚实。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_10_INTRO_46": "{SAY:missinfo}I-",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_10_INTRO_47": "{SAY:missinfo}...不，我不能。我为自己的事业付出了太多的努力。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_10_INTRO_48": "{SAY:missinfo}演出必须继续。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_11_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SAY:crazydave}今天他们正在统计选票，不是吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_11_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}是的。它会展示观众对节目比赛的看法，这是前提。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_11_INTRO_3": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}那我希望这能成功！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_11_INTRO_4": "{TIRED:winnie}用户戴夫，你在说什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_11_INTRO_5": "{NPC_ENTER:lucky}{NPC_ENTER:missinfo}{SAY:missinfo}这是你们一直在等待的时刻，伙计们！让我们来听听大家都怎么说吧！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_11_INTRO_6": "{SAY:lucky}啊，但是在那之前——ma cherie，我可以说几句诚实的话吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_11_INTRO_7": "{SAY:missinfo}呃……对，当然。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_11_INTRO_8": "{SAY:lucky}你们是最美丽的少女，是我见过的最耀眼的三叶草！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_11_INTRO_9": "{SAY:lucky}这周我们在一起度过的时光……啊，这是我最近最开心的一段时间了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_11_INTRO_10": "{SAY:lucky}那么它会是什么，是“是”还是“哦，是”？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_11_INTRO_11": "{SAY:missinfo}啊哈哈哈，我们为什么不……先宣读一下观众的投票呢？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_11_INTRO_12": "{SAY:lucky}我怀疑这只是一种肯定！他们都——",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_11_INTRO_13": "{SAY:missinfo}…不想我们在一起。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_11_INTRO_14": "{SAY:lucky}什么！？你们在抱怨什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_11_INTRO_15": "{SAY:missinfo}写在这篇论文里，Lucky先生，70%的人对“我们是对手吗？”投了“不”票。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_11_INTRO_16": "{EXCITED:crazydave}成功了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_11_INTRO_17": "{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，你做了什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_11_INTRO_18": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}选民欺诈！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_11_INTRO_19": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}我和邻居操纵观众投票说不！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_11_INTRO_20": "{SAY:lucky}W、什么！？但怎么可能！我运气好-！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_11_INTRO_21": "{SAY:missinfo}观众是这么想的，Lucky。群众已经发话了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_11_INTRO_22": "{SAY:missinfo}当我们这样做时，为什么我不告诉你我的想法呢？我自己的几句“诚实的话”！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_11_INTRO_23": "{SAY:missinfo}你就是一个自私自利、沙文主义的骗子！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_11_INTRO_24": "{SAY:missinfo}爱有很多种形式。没有一个是你能理解的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_11_INTRO_25": "{SAY:missinfo}但最令你困惑的是——对辛勤工作和有成就感的劳动的诚实热爱！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_11_INTRO_26": "{SAY:missinfo}想知道你多次第一次约会却从未坚持的原因吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_11_INTRO_27": "{SAY:missinfo}这是因为运气只能让你走这么远。感情是需要努力来维持的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_11_INTRO_28": "{SAY:missinfo}*清嗓子*",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_11_INTRO_29": "{SAY:missinfo}但是，当然，我这样说是不专业的。那我就不说了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_11_INTRO_30": "{SAY:lucky}*吞咽* L-看看你们做了什么！收视率直线下降！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_11_INTRO_31": "{SAY:missinfo}我有不止一个五星级节目在播出！谁在乎一个人是否倒下？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_11_INTRO_32": "{SAY:lucky}B-但是-我能给你什么呢-！？我运气好，还有--",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_11_INTRO_33": "{SAY:lucky}你、你是个邪恶的女巫！当你的老板听到我必须说的话时——！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_11_INTRO_34": "{SAY:missinfo}被拒绝的失败者的胡言乱语？哦，幸运的是，你忘记了观众喜欢看的其他东西！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_11_INTRO_35": "{SAY:missinfo}脚跟转！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_11_INTRO_36": "{SAY:missinfo}对于那些被拒绝的人，我们该怎么办？大声说！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_11_INTRO_37": "{SAY:missinfo}没错！降落伞！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_11_INTRO_38": "{NPC_ENTER:antibullysquad}{SHOUT:antibullysquad}他们打开了降落伞！我们自由了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_11_INTRO_39": "{SAY:missinfo}下落时不要撞到你漂亮的脸蛋，现在！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_11_INTRO_40": "{SAY:lucky}嘿，别再胡闹了——啊啊啊啊啊！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_11_INTRO_41": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}有东西刚刚降落在这里 - 不，等等，不要再关闭它！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_11_INTRO_42": "{NPC_EXIT:antibullysquad}{NPC_EXIT:lucky}{SAY:missinfo}哈哈哈哈哈哈！谁知道说实话会那么令人兴奋……？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_11_INTRO_43": "{SAY:missinfo}邪恶的女巫……从那以后就没人这么叫过我——",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_11_INTRO_44": "{SAY:missinfo}——无论如何！这就是本季《面纱之外的爱》（来世）！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_11_INTRO_45": "{SAY:missinfo}Jeremy，告诉他们我再也不会做这样的节目了，永远！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_11_INTRO_46": "{NPC_EXIT:missinfo}{SAY:winnie}你做到了，用户戴夫，邻居。我没有想到利用投票作为一种策略。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_11_INTRO_47": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}满嘴谎言、欺骗，还有什么不诚实的手段？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_11_INTRO_48": "{SAY:winnie}不得不说，我内心的一部分仍然对帮助信息小姐持怀疑态度。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_11_INTRO_49": "{SAY:crazydave}哦来吧，朋朋！我们总不能让Lucky为所欲为吧？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_11_INTRO_50": "{TIRED:winnie}不，当然不是。真是一个难题。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_11_INTRO_51": "{SAY:winnie}我想只有时间才能告诉我们这会对未来产生什么影响。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_VALENBRAINZ_11_INTRO_52": "{SAY:winnie}对于所有参与者。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_1_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{PLAYFUL:crazydave}...就在那时她打开了传送门并把我送回了这里！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_1_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}我明白了。这就是你前段时间突然失踪的原因。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_1_INTRO_3": "{EXCITED:crazydave}是的，老实说这仍然是一件疯狂的事情。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_1_INTRO_4": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}...尤其是因为你不在场！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_1_INTRO_5": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}我们一起战斗了这么久，没有你在身边有点奇怪！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_1_INTRO_6": "{PLAYFUL:winnie}确实如此。我也很感谢你的陪伴，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_1_INTRO_7": "{EXCITED:crazydave}这就是为什么我很高兴我们能一起回到这里过新年！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_1_INTRO_8": "{SAY:crazydave}这不就是今天结束时庆祝的意义吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_1_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}人们对这个庆祝活动有不同的含义，但我想这就是其中之一，是的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_1_INTRO_10": "{SAY:crazydave}那么，还有什么意义呢？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_1_INTRO_11": "{EXCITED:winnie}这个农历新年被称为“马年”。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_1_INTRO_12": "{EXCITED:winnie}马代表了中国文化中的许多价值观——即忠诚和友谊。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_1_INTRO_13": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}嗯，这很适合我们的讨论，不是吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_1_INTRO_14": "{SAY:crazydave}但是你知道，朋朋，我实际上有点害怕踏入门户。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_1_INTRO_15": "{SAY:crazydave}我在想，如果像那些故事一样呢？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_1_INTRO_16": "{SAY:crazydave}你回来的时候，一切都变了，除了你自己？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_1_INTRO_17": "{SAY:crazydave}如果我回到你身边时你变了怎么办？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_1_INTRO_18": "{SAY:winnie}你的想象力太丰富了，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_1_INTRO_19": "{SAY:winnie}关键词：想象力。这显然是马所代表的另一个价值。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_1_INTRO_20": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}但是想象一下这是一个可怕的场景，不是吗？恐怕比丧尸还要可怕！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_1_INTRO_21": "{SAY:winnie}好吧，这些新聚集的新年僵尸不敢苟同。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_2_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SAY:winnie}昨天的那些袭击让我想起了某种特殊的烟花。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_2_INTRO_2": "{TIRED:crazydave}爆米花？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_2_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}爆炸物。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_2_INTRO_4": "{TIRED:crazydave}哦，别告诉我...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_2_INTRO_5": "{NPC_ENTER:captaincamo}{SAY:captaincamo}所以你们园丁们想出来了。它会为你做脂肪负荷。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_2_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}卡莫将军，你还打算再发动一次季节性袭击吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_2_INTRO_7": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}加油，骆驼。月球动物园年的炸药？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_2_INTRO_8": "{SAY:crazydave}我本来可以想到的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_2_INTRO_9": "{EXCITED:captaincamo}废话够了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_2_INTRO_10": "{EXCITED:captaincamo}我不是为了你！不管你信不信，世界不是围着你转的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_2_INTRO_11": "{SAY:captaincamo}但是，你对我有用。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_2_INTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}请允许我提醒你，我们上次的交锋最终以你的彻底失败告终。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_2_INTRO_13": "{TIRED:captaincamo}这就是我想让你这么想的，白痴。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_2_INTRO_14": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}你的名声不是彻底被炸毁了吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_2_INTRO_15": "{TIRED:captaincamo}那个恶魔女人……她陷害了我。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_2_INTRO_16": "{SAY:captaincamo}不过没关系。我不需要白痴群众的认可。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_2_INTRO_17": "{PLAYFUL:captaincamo}我还有更多朋友要打电话。这次的月球动物园年聚会将是团圆的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_2_INTRO_18": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}你有朋友吗？哇，我没想到会这样。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_2_INTRO_19": "{SAY:captaincamo}你当然没有，你这个白痴。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_2_INTRO_20": "{SAY:winnie}计算中……他指的是墓地冲击计划的成员。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_2_INTRO_21": "{SAY:captaincamo}这样就可以进行基本推导了，干得好。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_2_INTRO_22": "{EXCITED:captaincamo}我要举办一个聚会，我们大家重聚，把你的植物变成堆肥！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_2_INTRO_23": "{PLAYFUL:captaincamo}之后……我会招募他们，最终推翻这一切的幕后黑手。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_2_INTRO_24": "{SAY:captaincamo}现在……先吃开胃菜。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_2_INTRO_25": "{SAY:captaincamo}为了拯救自己，你必须烧掉你所珍视的东西。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_2_INTRO_26": "{NPC_EXIT:captaincamo}{TIRED:winnie}我们必须保持警惕，这可能会很糟糕。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_2_INTRO_27": "{SAY:winnie}如果卡莫将军给老朋友打电话，我们最终可能会面临从未见过的威胁。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_2_INTRO_28": "{SAY:crazydave}我还是不敢相信他有朋友。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_3_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:captaincamo}{TIRED:captaincamo}哈！？大家都在哪里！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_3_INTRO_2": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SAY:crazydave}您是房东！你应该知道这一点。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_3_INTRO_3": "{SAY:captaincamo}你有闭嘴吗！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_3_INTRO_4": "{SAY:captaincamo}他们现在应该已经到了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_3_INTRO_5": "{TIRED:captaincamo}我很惊讶黑手党至少没有出现，我答应了钱。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_3_INTRO_6": "{TIRED:crazydave}是啊...我想知道他发生了什么，哈哈...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_3_INTRO_7": "{PLAYFUL:winnie}看来你需要更好的朋友。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_3_INTRO_8": "{SAY:captaincamo}我需要更聪明的朋友。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_3_INTRO_9": "{SAY:captaincamo}不是只听他们所说的一切的傻瓜。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_3_INTRO_10": "{SAY:captaincamo}等等，好像有人来​​了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_3_INTRO_11": "{NPC_ENTER:hunterria}{SAY:hunterria}Hunterria收到了聚会邀请。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_3_INTRO_12": "{EXCITED:captaincamo}好吧，这不是眼睛酸痛的景象吗？哈！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_3_INTRO_13": "{EXCITED:captaincamo}我会让你知道，这里是Hunterria！她是众所周知的杀人机器！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_3_INTRO_14": "{TIRED:crazydave}是啊，我们呃呃……以前见过她。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_3_INTRO_15": "{SAY:hunterria}胖子，你看到队长了吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_3_INTRO_16": "{TIRED:winnie}队长？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_3_INTRO_17": "{SAY:hunterria}带着奇怪面具的那个。他发送邀请。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_3_INTRO_18": "{PLAYFUL:captaincamo}我不再是队长了，我现在是迷彩将军了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_3_INTRO_19": "{SAY:hunterria}那你就不是迷彩队长了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_3_INTRO_20": "{SAY:hunterria}再见。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_3_INTRO_21": "{NPC_EXIT:hunterria}{EXCITED:captaincamo}等等，你要去哪里！？回来！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_3_INTRO_22": "{NPC_ENTER:hunterria}{SAY:hunterria}老头你是谁？你对队长做了什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_3_INTRO_23": "{TIRED:captaincamo}呃...听着，我知道你有点慢，但是赶上吧，女人。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_3_INTRO_24": "{SAY:captaincamo}我是迷彩队长！嗯，曾经是。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_3_INTRO_25": "{SAY:hunterria}什么。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_3_INTRO_26": "{SAY:hunterria}你看起来一点也不像迷彩。又老又皱。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_3_INTRO_27": "{SAY:hunterria}你这么老了。你的包在哪里？你的家人在哪里？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_3_INTRO_28": "{TIRED:captaincamo}我有很多东西要告诉你...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_3_INTRO_29": "{NPC_EXIT:hunterria}{NPC_EXIT:captaincamo}{PLAYFUL:crazydave}嗯，这是一次意外的重逢。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_3_INTRO_30": "{SAY:winnie}值得庆幸的是，Hunterria是一个熟悉的对手。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_3_INTRO_31": "{SAY:winnie}让我们继续关注这次“重聚”，以防新面孔决定突然出现。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_4_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:hunterria}{NPC_ENTER:captaincamo}{PLAYFUL:captaincamo}...所以，我现在老了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_4_INTRO_2": "{SAY:hunterria}你对自己做了什么？你需要更好地照顾身体。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_4_INTRO_3": "{SAY:hunterria}老了很多。猎人应该优雅地老去。青春洋溢，如骏马坚定。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_4_INTRO_4": "{TIRED:captaincamo}我会忽略这个轻微的。在我们开始做正事之前，我们需要建立更多的东西。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_4_INTRO_5": "{SAY:captaincamo}你知道墓地猛攻的其他成员在哪里吗？我期待着更大的数字。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_4_INTRO_6": "{SAY:hunterria}Hunterria 不知道他们所有人的命运。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_4_INTRO_7": "{TIRED:captaincamo}等等，那么我们来回忆一下它们。那个惨败的家伙……老拉斯蒂，那个粘糊糊的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_4_INTRO_8": "{SAY:hunterria}你老了之后发生了很多事情，卡莫。训练停止了。他们离开了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_4_INTRO_9": "{TIRED:captaincamo}是这样吗？嗯，至少这样很好。那就不能被那个白痴束缚了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_4_INTRO_10": "{SAY:hunterria}...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_4_INTRO_11": "{PLAYFUL:captaincamo}Rusty 没有他会过得更好。他可以制作自己的装置！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_4_INTRO_12": "{SAY:captaincamo}遗憾的是，他可能在被解雇后不得不成为自由职业者！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_4_INTRO_13": "{SAY:captaincamo}如果我有资源的话，我会亲自委托他制作一些装置。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_4_INTRO_14": "{SAY:hunterria}他做出了奇怪的事情。他周围总是有很多空气。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_4_INTRO_15": "{SAY:captaincamo}我不知道他是否找到了一个可以做东西的恩人。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_4_INTRO_16": "{SAY:captaincamo}我知道他为那个糟糕的表演者制作了东西......那个被标记为“朋克”的人。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_4_INTRO_17": "{SAY:hunterria}他发出非常可怕的声音。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_4_INTRO_18": "{PLAYFUL:captaincamo}是啊，我当然不会想念那个家伙。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_4_INTRO_19": "{SAY:hunterria}Hunterria 错过了一些训练中的人。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_4_INTRO_20": "{SAY:hunterria}那个史莱姆人是个好猎人。好策略。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_4_INTRO_21": "{SAY:hunterria}非常不寻常，但他很有趣。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_4_INTRO_22": "{EXCITED:captaincamo}说起来，你还记得几十年前我给你讲过策略吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_4_INTRO_23": "{SAY:hunterria}八年前。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_4_INTRO_24": "{SAY:captaincamo}对。我看你听了我的建议。用强兵来保护弱兵。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_4_INTRO_25": "{SAY:hunterria}是的。好策略。非常感谢您的建议。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_4_INTRO_26": "{SAY:captaincamo}我知道我想你。但我还期待着至少还有一个……",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_4_INTRO_27": "{TIRED:captaincamo}黑手党...我对他的记忆已经模糊了...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_4_INTRO_28": "{TIRED:captaincamo}我记得一些关于披萨的事？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_4_INTRO_29": "{SAY:captaincamo}等等，不是还有一个小鬼吗？小鬼僵尸我们？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_4_INTRO_30": "{SAY:hunterria}迷彩。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_4_INTRO_31": "{SAY:captaincamo}什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_4_INTRO_32": "{SAY:hunterria}我们不谈论小鬼僵尸我们。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_4_INTRO_33": "{NPC_EXIT:hunterria}{NPC_EXIT:captaincamo}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SAY:crazydave}呃…朋朋？我认为追赶让他们忘记了我们。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_4_INTRO_34": "{SAY:winnie}是的，好吧。以至于他们忘记了指挥他们的军队来对付我们。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_4_INTRO_35": "{EXCITED:crazydave}真的吗！？呜呼！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_4_INTRO_36": "{TIRED:winnie}这只能说明他们的进攻不协调。预计今天会出现混乱，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_4_INTRO_37": "{EXCITED:crazydave}真的吗！？号泣！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_5_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SHOUT:crazydave}这就是不协调的攻击！？那太无情了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_5_INTRO_2": "{TIRED:winnie}我们需要休养。我不确定我们的防御是否可以-",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_5_INTRO_3": "{NPC_ENTER:hunterria}{NPC_ENTER:captaincamo}{EXCITED:captaincamo}现在回忆够了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_5_INTRO_4": "{EXCITED:captaincamo}我们有宏伟的计划。摧毁植物和园丁！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_5_INTRO_5": "{SAY:hunterria}Hunterria 准备好了。所有动物朋友也都准备好了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_5_INTRO_6": "{EXCITED:captaincamo}完美，准备好！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_5_INTRO_7": "{EXCITED:winnie}等等！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_5_INTRO_8": "{SAY:captaincamo}什么！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_5_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，我还没有计算成功下一步要做什么。请搁置。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_5_INTRO_10": "{TIRED:crazydave}Uuuuh...今天天气很好，不是吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_5_INTRO_11": "{TIRED:captaincamo}呃。浪费我的时间。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_5_INTRO_12": "{SAY:hunterria}这对于狩猎来说是平庸的一天，Hunterria 对主题持中立态度。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_5_INTRO_13": "{SAY:captaincamo}你不会再骗我了！没有停滞！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_5_INTRO_14": "{EXCITED:winnie}...计算响应！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_5_INTRO_15": "{SAY:winnie}Hunterria，你介意告诉卡莫将军你现在受雇于谁吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_5_INTRO_16": "{EXCITED:captaincamo}我是雇用她的人！这是计划的一部分！事实上...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_5_INTRO_17": "{SAY:hunterria}Hunterria 为-工作",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_5_INTRO_18": "{EXCITED:captaincamo}我建议永久联盟！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_5_INTRO_19": "{SAY:hunterria}Hunterria已经有永久联盟。僵王是Hunterria的领袖。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_5_INTRO_20": "{SAY:captaincamo}什么！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_5_INTRO_21": "{TIRED:captaincamo}真的吗……？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_5_INTRO_22": "{SAY:hunterria}Boss从萨凡纳拯救了Hunterria。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_5_INTRO_23": "{TIRED:captaincamo}你还和脑瘤勾结吗！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_5_INTRO_24": "{SAY:hunterria}肿瘤……大脑……？不识字。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_5_INTRO_25": "{SAY:captaincamo}呃...我简直不敢相信。你什么时候想告诉我这个！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_5_INTRO_26": "{SAY:hunterria}迷彩不要问。亨特里亚会告诉的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_5_INTRO_27": "{TIRED:crazydave}Hunterria，你知道的-老板真的会反对这一切！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_5_INTRO_28": "{TIRED:captaincamo}...好吧。我们可以稍后再担心。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_5_INTRO_29": "{SAY:captaincamo}就像一些愚蠢的雇佣保证忠诚！我们仍在向你们发起全面的正面攻击。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_5_INTRO_30": "{PLAYFUL:captaincamo}等我完了，僵王反正就死了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_5_INTRO_31": "{SAY:hunterria}...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_5_INTRO_32": "{NPC_EXIT:hunterria}{NPC_EXIT:captaincamo}{SAY:winnie}分歧的种子已经种下，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_5_INTRO_33": "{SAY:winnie}希望能有所成就。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_6_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:captaincamo}{NPC_ENTER:hunterria}{SAY:captaincamo}你真的还想为那个小丑工作吗？在我告诉你他对我做了什么之后！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_6_INTRO_2": "{SAY:hunterria}Hunterria说实话。并没有真正在听。 Hunterria只知道你变老了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_6_INTRO_3": "{SHOUT:captaincamo}他毁了我的生活！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_6_INTRO_4": "{SAY:hunterria}Boss 还不错。老板为动物提供庇护所。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_6_INTRO_5": "{EXCITED:captaincamo}他无法制定策略来拯救自己的皮肤！他所做的就是把一个又一个的机器人扔下去......",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_6_INTRO_6": "{TIRED:captaincamo}等等。呃...让我做一下呼吸练习。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_6_INTRO_7": "{TIRED:captaincamo}呼……呼……",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_6_INTRO_8": "{SAY:hunterria}你有问题了，卡莫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_6_INTRO_9": "{SAY:captaincamo}是啊，我们不是吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_6_INTRO_10": "{SAY:captaincamo}...告诉你什么。我可以成为比他更好的动物保护者。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_6_INTRO_11": "{SAY:captaincamo}我会证明这一点。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_6_INTRO_12": "{SAY:captaincamo}我可能没有广阔的庇护所，但真正重要的是战斗统计。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_6_INTRO_13": "{PLAYFUL:captaincamo}你的动物朋友中有多少因为他的鲁莽部署而战死？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_6_INTRO_14": "{SAY:hunterria}...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_6_INTRO_15": "{SAY:hunterria}Hunterria愿意倾听。但仅此而已。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_6_INTRO_16": "{SAY:captaincamo}好的。让我向您展示一个有能力的战术家如何利用这些生物！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_6_INTRO_17": "{NPC_EXIT:hunterria}{NPC_EXIT:captaincamo}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{EXCITED:crazydave}我们应该做点什么，朋朋！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_6_INTRO_18": "{SAY:crazydave}这两个人配合攻击不是我日常能应付的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_6_INTRO_19": "{EXCITED:winnie}我们会克服这个，用户戴夫。就像我们战胜了之前的磨难一样。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_6_INTRO_20": "{SAY:winnie}关于僵王博士的分歧可能对我们有利。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_6_INTRO_21": "{SAY:winnie}让我们继续火上浇油。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_6_INTRO_22": "{TIRED:crazydave}想想有点奇怪，但是我们是在破坏他们的友谊吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_6_INTRO_23": "{SAY:winnie}他们仍然对我们构成威胁，用户戴夫。远离这样的想法。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_6_INTRO_24": "{SAY:winnie}而且，这种友谊无论如何也不会长久。我们只是加快其终止速度。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_6_INTRO_25": "{TIRED:crazydave}我猜...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_7_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:hunterria}{SAY:hunterria}现在证明自己值得。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_7_INTRO_2": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SHOUT:crazydave}哦，不是这个地方了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_7_INTRO_3": "{TIRED:winnie}为什么我们一次又一次被迫被带到这里？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_7_INTRO_4": "{TIRED:crazydave}还没有那么酷！我没有看到任何漂浮的建筑物！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_7_INTRO_5": "{SAY:hunterria}迷彩向 Hunterria 展示如何到达这里。说这是他做的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_7_INTRO_6": "{SAY:hunterria}证明他比Boss强多少。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_7_INTRO_7": "{SAY:crazydave}他是否必须向他遇到的每个人敲响这些钥匙？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_7_INTRO_8": "{EXCITED:winnie}亨特里亚，听着。你不能听他的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_7_INTRO_9": "{SAY:hunterria}为什么我们在天空？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_7_INTRO_10": "{EXCITED:crazydave}Hunterria，卡莫是个很糟糕的人。他已经不是你曾经认识的那个人了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_7_INTRO_11": "{PLAYFUL:winnie}嗯，阅读表明他自年轻以来道德方面没有太大改变。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_7_INTRO_12": "{SAY:hunterria}胖子和猛犸象不会迷惑Hunterria。卡莫说这是他为你设下的陷阱。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_7_INTRO_13": "{SAY:hunterria}防止你逃跑。一次完美的狩猎。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_7_INTRO_14": "{SAY:winnie}你认真考虑穿越僵王博士吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_7_INTRO_15": "{SAY:hunterria}老大？不，亨特里亚忠诚。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_7_INTRO_16": "{SAY:winnie}那么这是关于什么呢？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_7_INTRO_17": "{SAY:hunterria}...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_7_INTRO_18": "{SAY:hunterria}Hunterria不知道。亨特利亚一脸困惑。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_7_INTRO_19": "{SAY:hunterria}迷彩熟练猎人，但不喜欢Boss。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_7_INTRO_20": "{SAY:hunterria}Hunterria不知道她为什么在这里。或者在那儿。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_7_INTRO_21": "{SAY:winnie}嗯，也许——",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_7_INTRO_22": "{SAY:hunterria}Hunterria不再说话了。想看狩猎。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_7_INTRO_23": "{SAY:hunterria}卡莫告诉他已经为他的包裹准备了订单。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_7_INTRO_24": "{NPC_EXIT:hunterria}{EXCITED:winnie}警告！大量飞机来袭！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_8_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:captaincamo}{NPC_ENTER:hunterria}{EXCITED:captaincamo}那里！你有没有看到！？我做到了这一切，而且我还可以做得更多。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_8_INTRO_2": "{EXCITED:captaincamo}想想看！当你能和我一起繁荣时，为什么还要被那个肿瘤大脑束缚呢？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_8_INTRO_3": "{EXCITED:captaincamo}你和我，我们是骄傲、狂野、自由的马，不需要锁链！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_8_INTRO_4": "{PLAYFUL:captaincamo}驰骋潇洒，蹄下温顺！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_8_INTRO_5": "{SAY:captaincamo}你会在我身边茁壮成长，不像僵王。我已经向你展示了所有的证据。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_8_INTRO_6": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SAY:winnie}请允许我声明一下，用于构建该领域的蓝图......",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_8_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}...从僵王博士被盗。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_8_INTRO_8": "{SAY:hunterria}Hunterria 不知道该怎么想了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_8_INTRO_9": "{SAY:hunterria}滚出亨特里亚头！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_8_INTRO_10": "{SAY:captaincamo}别听他们的，听我的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_8_INTRO_11": "{SAY:captaincamo}既然你可以成为我的战士，为什么要成为僵王的走狗呢？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_8_INTRO_12": "{SAY:crazydave}天哪...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_8_INTRO_13": "{SAY:hunterria}Hunterria 不是“走狗”。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_8_INTRO_14": "{SAY:hunterria}Hunterria是第一大Boss将军。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_8_INTRO_15": "{SAY:captaincamo}...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_8_INTRO_16": "{SAY:captaincamo}........",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_8_INTRO_17": "{SAY:captaincamo}................",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_8_INTRO_18": "{TIRED:crazydave}...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_8_INTRO_19": "{TIRED:winnie}...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_8_INTRO_20": "{TIRED:captaincamo}...哦。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_8_INTRO_21": "{TIRED:captaincamo}S-再说一遍？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_8_INTRO_22": "{TIRED:captaincamo}数……一名将军？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_8_INTRO_23": "{SAY:hunterria}是的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_8_INTRO_24": "{SAY:captaincamo}...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_8_INTRO_25": "{SHOUT:captaincamo}第一将军！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_8_INTRO_26": "{PLAYFUL:captaincamo}哈！当然。当然！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_8_INTRO_27": "{SHOUT:captaincamo}他将他最尊敬的将军的头衔授予了一个穴居女人！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_8_INTRO_28": "{EXCITED:captaincamo}典型！看不到良策的人，任命为将军走走停停！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_8_INTRO_29": "{SHOUT:captaincamo}哈哈哈！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_8_INTRO_30": "{TIRED:captaincamo}但是当涉及到懂得策略的人时...当涉及到我时...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_8_INTRO_31": "{SHOUT:captaincamo}他让我腐烂！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_8_INTRO_32": "{SAY:hunterria}卡莫把亨特利亚称为一扇门吗？ Hunterria不是门。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_8_INTRO_33": "{EXCITED:captaincamo}哦，你什么都看不见，你这个瞎眼女人！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_8_INTRO_34": "{SAY:captaincamo}你真的认为你配得上这个称号吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_8_INTRO_35": "{SAY:hunterria}Hunterria 狩猎绝对值得！卡莫收回侮辱！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_8_INTRO_36": "{EXCITED:captaincamo}我看到的唯一侮辱就是我应得的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_8_INTRO_37": "{EXCITED:captaincamo}他在利用你！给你头衔，让你受束缚！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_8_INTRO_38": "{SAY:hunterria}迷彩说亨特里亚不如迷彩？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_8_INTRO_39": "{EXCITED:captaincamo}我告诉你这一点是为了你的最大利益：是的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_8_INTRO_40": "{SAY:hunterria}...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_8_INTRO_41": "{SHOUT:captaincamo}我是真正的将军！一个在战争中得到证明的人！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_8_INTRO_42": "{SAY:hunterria}Boss给了Hunterria正式的总头衔。谁赋予迷彩一般称号？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_8_INTRO_43": "{SAY:captaincamo}我！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_8_INTRO_44": "{SAY:hunterria}这个标题没有任何意义。如果给自己就不是赚来的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_8_INTRO_45": "{SAY:captaincamo}你是在说我是假货吗！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_8_INTRO_46": "{SAY:hunterria}Hunterria 正在称呼你为队长。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_8_INTRO_47": "{EXCITED:captaincamo}你……真的对生命一无所知。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_8_INTRO_48": "{SAY:captaincamo}你怎么了？你曾经是一个骄傲的猎人！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_8_INTRO_49": "{SAY:hunterria}Hunterria 有同样的问题。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_8_INTRO_50": "{SAY:captaincamo}...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_8_INTRO_51": "{SAY:captaincamo}你还有希望。拒绝他！加入我吧！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_8_INTRO_52": "{NPC_EXIT:hunterria}{NPC_EXIT:captaincamo}{TIRED:crazydave}嗯...做到了，朋朋。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_8_INTRO_53": "{SAY:winnie}就让他们去拼吧。正如我所表达的，这个结果是预先确定的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_8_INTRO_54": "{TIRED:crazydave}我们在这里做的事情正确吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_8_INTRO_55": "{SAY:winnie}再次，尽量不要从这样的角度思考这个问题，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_9_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:captaincamo}{NPC_ENTER:hunterria}{SAY:hunterria}老板很慷慨。他寻找猎人和动物园。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_9_INTRO_2": "{EXCITED:captaincamo}他正在做最低限度的事情。谁不会给自己的士兵提供住房！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_9_INTRO_3": "{SAY:hunterria}但是Boss是墓地猛攻包遇到的原因。如果不是他，我们就不会见面。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_9_INTRO_4": "{EXCITED:captaincamo}发生了！他不是故意的！他所做的一切都是为了自己！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_9_INTRO_5": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{PLAYFUL:winnie}很像这里的其他人。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_9_INTRO_6": "{SAY:captaincamo}什么！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_9_INTRO_7": "{SAY:crazydave}丧尸英雄聚集，因为老板想要为自己建立一支英雄队伍。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_9_INTRO_8": "{SAY:crazydave}当这不起作用时，他启动了墓地计划。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_9_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}迷彩将军，你自己组建了一支英雄队，不是吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_9_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}而刚才，你试图为自己组建另一个墓地突击计划。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_9_INTRO_11": "{SAY:captaincamo}你在说什么！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_9_INTRO_12": "{SAY:hunterria}看到了吗，迷彩？ Hunterria认为你和老板会相处得很好。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_9_INTRO_13": "{SHOUT:captaincamo}...你怎么敢！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_9_INTRO_14": "{EXCITED:captaincamo}我和他！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_9_INTRO_15": "{SAY:hunterria}你们俩非常相似。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_9_INTRO_16": "{SAY:captaincamo}你把我比作那个白痴！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_9_INTRO_17": "{SAY:captaincamo}在我向你展示的一切之后！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_9_INTRO_18": "{SAY:hunterria}Hunterria 认为这是最大的成就。可以和boss比较。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_9_INTRO_19": "{SAY:hunterria}Hunterria认为，不，Hunterria知道你们两个会相处得很好。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_9_INTRO_20": "{SAY:captaincamo}别侮辱我的智商，穴居女！他会当场杀了我！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_9_INTRO_21": "{SAY:captaincamo}每个僵尸都是为了自己！这就是他最后教给我的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_9_INTRO_22": "{NPC_EXIT:hunterria}{NPC_EXIT:captaincamo}{SAY:winnie}干得好，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_9_INTRO_23": "{TIRED:crazydave}我只是希望一切快点结束。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_10_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:captaincamo}{NPC_ENTER:hunterria}{SAY:captaincamo}我应该坚持我的理念。肿瘤脑也证明了这一点。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_10_INTRO_2": "{PLAYFUL:captaincamo}盟友！？朋友们！？以此超越坟墓！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_10_INTRO_3": "{SAY:captaincamo}我为什么不如你！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_10_INTRO_4": "{SAY:captaincamo}我对我的策略、我的服装、我的整体形象都非常讲究！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_10_INTRO_5": "{EXCITED:captaincamo}所以会有人想要我当他们的指挥官！一个领导者！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_10_INTRO_6": "{TIRED:captaincamo}但是你...你只是一些生活在山洞里的尼安德特垃圾！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_10_INTRO_7": "{EXCITED:captaincamo}那怎么样！？像你这样的人怎么会有我没有的头衔！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_10_INTRO_8": "{EXCITED:captaincamo}这么不值钱的智力怎么可能比我更特别！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_10_INTRO_9": "{EXCITED:captaincamo}那个男人毁了我的一生，他让我受苦！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_10_INTRO_10": "{TIRED:captaincamo}我会报仇的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_10_INTRO_11": "{SAY:hunterria}Hunterria 将你视为盟友是错误的。你无非是对老大的威胁。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_10_INTRO_12": "{SAY:hunterria}Hunterria 现在明白了。你只是想打猎，因为你着迷。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_10_INTRO_13": "{SAY:hunterria}Hunterria 不能允许这样的事情发生。亨特里亚不会允许背叛。可耻的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_10_INTRO_14": "{SAY:hunterria}Hunterria 会阻止你这样做。无论如何。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_10_INTRO_15": "{SAY:captaincamo}我错了你。你不是一匹骄傲而自由的马。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_10_INTRO_16": "{SAY:captaincamo}你完全是另外一个人。一只宠物。意志薄弱到足以被驯服和拴住的狗。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_10_INTRO_17": "{SAY:hunterria}...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_10_INTRO_18": "{SAY:hunterria}大家都这么说Hunterria。老妇人称亨特里亚为狗。你称亨特里亚狗为狗。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_10_INTRO_19": "{SAY:hunterria}每个人都认为他们比Hunterria聪明，言语豪言壮语，居高临下。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_10_INTRO_20": "{SAY:hunterria}Hunterria 觉得说话的时间已经结束了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_10_INTRO_21": "{SAY:hunterria}像我们这样的猎人、战士，我们让我们的刀片说话。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_10_INTRO_22": "{TIRED:captaincamo}我要对你完全诚实：我恨你。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_10_INTRO_23": "{SAY:captaincamo}你对一切的处理方式，你愚蠢的动物，所有这些都激怒了我。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_10_INTRO_24": "{EXCITED:captaincamo}我拒绝输给你！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_10_INTRO_25": "{NPC_EXIT:hunterria}{NPC_EXIT:captaincamo}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{EXCITED:winnie}警告！地平线上大量的生物和士兵集中！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_10_INTRO_26": "{EXCITED:crazydave}他们把我们的草坪当作战场了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_10_INTRO_27": "{SAY:crazydave}我告诉过你这是一个坏主意！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_10_INTRO_28": "{SAY:crazydave}他们一起工作已经够糟糕了，还互相打架？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_10_INTRO_29": "{TIRED:winnie}这两个选择都不好，但无论如何都必须做出选择。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_10_INTRO_30": "{SAY:winnie}他们两个显然不会永远相处下去。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_10_INTRO_31": "{SAY:winnie}时间改变一切，包括人。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_10_INTRO_32": "{EXCITED:crazydave}是啊，但现在他们正在毁坏草坪！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_10_INTRO_33": "{SAY:winnie}我的观点已经表达了，用户戴夫。我不知道你还想让我说什么。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_10_INTRO_34": "{TIRED:crazydave}嗯，我也不知道。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_10_INTRO_35": "{SAY:crazydave}...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_10_INTRO_36": "{TIRED:crazydave}我们忘记这件事吧，好吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_02_LUNARZOOYEAR_10_INTRO_37": "{TIRED:winnie}也许这是最好的。我们有很多事情要做。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_1_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SAY:crazydave}警告，邻居！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_1_INTRO_2": "{SAY:crazydave}你知道，我刚刚把盐瓶打翻了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_1_INTRO_3": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}戴夫妈妈曾经说过，这是运气不好的征兆！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_1_INTRO_4": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{TIRED:winnie}用户戴夫，你怎么还相信这种迷信？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_1_INTRO_5": "{SAY:crazydave}朋朋，你怎么还不相信迷信呢？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_1_INTRO_6": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}尤其是在面对一个几乎体现了它的人之后！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_1_INTRO_7": "{TIRED:winnie}正是因为这个原因，他的存在让我感到厌烦。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_1_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}命运这个概念本身就已经不合逻辑了……",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_1_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}但要玩弄它、操纵它，那就更让人感觉亵渎了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_1_INTRO_10": "{TIRED:crazydave}我知道，对吧？一切都是那么令人困惑！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_1_INTRO_11": "{TIRED:winnie}我想我只能接受它。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_1_INTRO_12": "{EXCITED:crazydave}看！僵尸！我就知道！我就知道我运气不好！我们的草坪上有僵尸！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_1_INTRO_13": "{TIRED:winnie}用户戴夫，无论运气好坏，僵尸都会发生。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_1_INTRO_14": "{TIRED:crazydave}既然聊到了他，不知道Lucky会不会出现呢……",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_1_INTRO_15": "{SAY:winnie}考虑到这个赛季，我想他最终出现才有意义。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_1_INTRO_16": "{SAY:winnie}让我们祈祷吧，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_2_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}基于我记录的模式和扫描......",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_2_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}我们本周的对手应该马上就会出现。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_2_INTRO_3": "{EXCITED:crazydave}让我今天来做扫描吧，朋朋！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_2_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}您想要进行今天的扫描吗，用户戴夫？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_2_INTRO_5": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}当然！和我值得信赖的大鼻子！运气有一定的气味，你知道吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_2_INTRO_6": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}在这种情况下......令人晕眩的香水和三叶草奶昔！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_2_INTRO_7": "{SAY:crazydave}*闻一闻* 嗯，我确实闻到了酒味，但它更像是一种廉价的酒味。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_2_INTRO_8": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}你通常在兄弟会聚会上看到的那种。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_2_INTRO_9": "{NPC_ENTER:antibullysquad}{SHOUT:antibullysquad}嗯...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_2_INTRO_10": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}...嗯...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_2_INTRO_11": "{TIRED:antibullysquad}...说得好！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_2_INTRO_12": "{EXCITED:crazydave}是你们！你怎么到这里来了！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_2_INTRO_13": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}啊！你看，大卫，我们三个人最近都处于一个非常黑暗的地方。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_2_INTRO_14": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}黑暗，更黑暗，还是更黑暗。坏消息。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_2_INTRO_15": "{TIRED:antibullysquad}对，降落伞！很黑！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_2_INTRO_16": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}我们在那个狭窄的监狱里数着日子，直到……",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_2_INTRO_17": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}...好消息出现了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_2_INTRO_18": "{TIRED:antibullysquad}是啊！好消息！一个巫师！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_2_INTRO_19": "{SAY:crazydave}巫师？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_2_INTRO_20": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}是的，一位贤者巫师从天而降！他明智地驶来，拯救我们的后路！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_2_INTRO_21": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}他摔倒后不久，电视台的工作人员才想起我们还在降落伞里。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_2_INTRO_22": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}所以他们带我们出去，然后带我们和巫师去了一家五星级餐厅作为补偿！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_2_INTRO_23": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}运气真好！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_2_INTRO_24": "{TIRED:winnie}……当然。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_2_INTRO_25": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}嗯……那也不能解释你们在这里做什么。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_2_INTRO_26": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}我们对巫师先生心怀感激。我们说我们是学生，问他我们该如何回报他。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_2_INTRO_27": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}他对我们非常喜欢，巫师！他说他喜欢我们这种类型的人！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_2_INTRO_28": "{PLAYFUL:winnie}愚蠢？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_2_INTRO_29": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}听话！他说他找到了一份只有我们学生才能为他做的工作！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_2_INTRO_30": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}他告诉我们-",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_2_INTRO_31": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}啊啊啊啊！记住格雷格，巫师说过这是一个秘密任务！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_2_INTRO_32": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}别挡我们的路，讨厌的园丁！免得你激起巫师的愤怒！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_2_INTRO_33": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}我们走吧，孩子们！哦，我们要去听巫师的话了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_2_INTRO_34": "{NPC_EXIT:antibullysquad}{TIRED:winnie}...好吧。我想幸运儿确实回到了我们身边。通过反欺凌小队。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_2_INTRO_35": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}把脏活儿外包给自己的走狗，自己也不动手？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_2_INTRO_36": "{TIRED:winnie}听起来像Lucky，好吧。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_3_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:antibullysquad}{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}老大……在哪儿？我们多年来一直在寻找这个地方。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_3_INTRO_2": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}肯定就在这附近！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_3_INTRO_3": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}我的意思是，这是他们发明发明的地方，不是吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_3_INTRO_4": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}老板，我们在找什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_3_INTRO_5": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}机械部件！银色而闪亮的东西！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_3_INTRO_6": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}是那个组件吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_3_INTRO_7": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}不，你这个笨蛋！那是一辆飞驰的汽车，径直向我们驶来。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_3_INTRO_8": "{TIRED:antibullysquad}是啊，什么-什么！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_3_INTRO_9": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}老大，趴下！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_3_INTRO_10": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}抱歉，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_3_INTRO_11": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{TIRED:crazydave}我从来没有经历过那么严重的时间乱流！我们一直在碰撞！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_3_INTRO_12": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}啊啊啊！看看你做了什么！你把霉菌洒得到处都是！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_3_INTRO_13": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}哎呀。我猜他们是从后备箱上掉下来的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_3_INTRO_14": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}老大，现在这个模具里要怎么找零件呢？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_3_INTRO_15": "{SAY:crazydave}您正在寻找组件？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_3_INTRO_16": "{SAY:winnie}这就是我检测到的时间异常的来源。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_3_INTRO_17": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}Y——你这个白痴！不要在敌人面前谈论组件！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_3_INTRO_18": "{SAY:winnie}请问这个“组件”的用途是什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_3_INTRO_19": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}别介意！嘎！现在我们要仔细研究所有这些模具！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_3_INTRO_20": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}继续寻找！格雷格，派一些僵尸来拖延这三个人！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_3_INTRO_21": "{NPC_EXIT:antibullysquad}{EXCITED:winnie}他们正在尝试建造某种机器，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_3_INTRO_22": "{EXCITED:crazydave}这就是他们给Lucky的计划！建造一台机器...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_3_INTRO_23": "{SAY:winnie}Lucky 只会对一台机器感兴趣。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_3_INTRO_24": "{SAY:crazydave}运气机器？他为什么还想要另一个？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_3_INTRO_25": "{SAY:winnie}嗯，这还有待观察。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_3_INTRO_26": "{EXCITED:winnie}不管怎样，我认为我们最好在他们到达那个点之前阻止他们。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_3_INTRO_27": "{SAY:crazydave}我们也要找回我所有的模具！快点！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_3_INTRO_28": "{TIRED:crazydave}他们都这样分散真是太倒霉了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_4_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{PLAYFUL:crazydave}我们回到了未来！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_4_INTRO_2": "{NPC_ENTER:antibullysquad}{SHOUT:antibullysquad}这里！该组件一定在这里，对吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_4_INTRO_3": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}一切都必须在这一点上被发明！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_4_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}我恳求你停止开发这个幸运机器。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_4_INTRO_5": "{TIRED:winnie}你真的不知道自己会陷入什么境地。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_4_INTRO_6": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}什么！？你怎么知道我们正在建造它！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_4_INTRO_7": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}我们确实看到了在您身后建造的机器。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_4_INTRO_8": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}你不知道！那可能是另一台不相关的机器！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_4_INTRO_9": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}老大，我们找到了可以装幸运机的组件。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_4_INTRO_10": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}好吧，好吧！你抓住了我们！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_4_INTRO_11": "{SAY:crazydave}你们知道Lucky已经有其中之一了，对吧？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_4_INTRO_12": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}巫师说一个还不够！快干了！或者什么...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_4_INTRO_13": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}老大，我真的觉得我们不应该告诉他们这些。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_4_INTRO_14": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}闭嘴！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_4_INTRO_15": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}当我们完成这个任务时，他会赐予我们他的巫师智慧，实现我们心中的愿望！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_4_INTRO_16": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}再也不会有人称我们为失败者了！我们会有头脑在僵王回来！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_4_INTRO_17": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}以及得到所有女士的心。呵呵。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_4_INTRO_18": "{TIRED:antibullysquad}以及建立世界统治的勇气。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_4_INTRO_19": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}是的-等等。你刚才说什么——",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_4_INTRO_20": "{TIRED:winnie}我想你们不知道Lucky是一个什么样的人。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_4_INTRO_21": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}他可能只是想利用你们！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_4_INTRO_22": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}巫师永远不会！他帮助我们逃离了降落伞！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_4_INTRO_23": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}他甚至给了我们所有这些逆向工程蓝图来建造机器！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_4_INTRO_24": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}话虽如此……并没有说这台机器的温度会这么高——",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_4_INTRO_25": "{TIRED:crazydave}呃...是的。真的是突然好热啊……",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_4_INTRO_26": "{SAY:winnie}不是来自机器。阳光中充满了有毒的辐射。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_4_INTRO_27": "{SAY:crazydave}未来全球变暖会发生吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_4_INTRO_28": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}全球变暖！？我们不能让这东西过热！我们得把它移到别的地方！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_4_INTRO_29": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}严峻，将目的地设定在没有阳光照射的地方！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_4_INTRO_30": "{TIRED:antibullysquad}是啊，老大你说什么就是了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_4_INTRO_31": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}等等，不是现在，不是现在！我们还没有让我们的僵尸散去——",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_4_INTRO_32": "{NPC_EXIT:antibullysquad}{EXCITED:crazydave}我们要……追他们，朋朋！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_4_INTRO_33": "{TIRED:crazydave}啊，太热了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_4_INTRO_34": "{SAY:winnie}这个地方不适合长时间居住。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_4_INTRO_35": "{SAY:winnie}我们尽快清除僵尸，继续追击吧。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_5_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{PLAYFUL:crazydave}他们说要去一个没有阳光的地方是认真的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_5_INTRO_2": "{EXCITED:winnie}看，用户戴夫。那里有小队。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_5_INTRO_3": "{NPC_ENTER:antibullysquad}{SHOUT:antibullysquad}那里！只要用一堆这样的药水填满它就可以了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_5_INTRO_4": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}运气是一种魔法吧？当然，这可以作为燃料！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_5_INTRO_5": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}完成了，老板。机器坦克现在装满了魔法药水。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_5_INTRO_6": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}完美！打开它！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_5_INTRO_7": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}已开启。动力十足。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_5_INTRO_8": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}哈哈哈哈！我能感觉到自己已经被幸运所眷顾了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_5_INTRO_9": "{SAY:crazydave}*嗅一嗅* 好吧，这闻起来不像运气。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_5_INTRO_10": "{TIRED:antibullysquad}是啊！实在是太难闻了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_5_INTRO_11": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}呸！你怎么知道幸运的味道是什么？也许它确实闻起来像农场——",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_5_INTRO_12": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}不，等一下！闻起来像……羊？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_5_INTRO_13": "{SPECIAL1:antibullysquad}啊！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_5_INTRO_14": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}为什么一群羊落在我们身上？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_5_INTRO_15": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}Baaaaaa-d 新闻。绵羊风暴。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_5_INTRO_16": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}羊风暴！？这不是真正的瘦——",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_5_INTRO_17": "{SPECIAL1:antibullysquad}是的，他什么-AUUUGH！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_5_INTRO_18": "{EXCITED:crazydave}幸运机的副作用之一是召唤大量的羊吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_5_INTRO_19": "{SAY:winnie}当我们面对僵王博士'迭代时，我不记得关于羊的任何事情。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_5_INTRO_20": "{SAY:winnie}我记得的是- *bzzt*",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_5_INTRO_21": "{TIRED:winnie}抱歉，用户戴夫。我的系统遇到了故障。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_5_INTRO_22": "{SAY:crazydave}是啊，我正想说！我认为绵羊被意外发射时——",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_5_INTRO_23": "{EXCITED:crazydave}BLUGH！哎呀！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_5_INTRO_24": "{TIRED:crazydave}一只苍蝇刚进我嘴里！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_5_INTRO_25": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}这是怎么回事！？？？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_5_INTRO_26": "{SAY:winnie}运气的极性似乎……*bzzt*颠倒了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_5_INTRO_27": "{SAY:crazydave}你们没有造运气机器！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_5_INTRO_28": "{SHOUT:crazydave}你制造了一台不走运的机器！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_5_INTRO_29": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}什么？决不！你在撒谎！你不会让我们把它关掉的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_5_INTRO_30": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}B-但无论如何都要检查一下，格雷格。我们校准得正确，对吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_5_INTRO_31": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}我们不能，老板。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_5_INTRO_32": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}“你不能！”是什么意思？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_5_INTRO_33": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}我们不能。因为羊刚刚把机器撞下了山。看。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_5_INTRO_34": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}W、什么！？为什么我们甚至给那个东西轮子！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_5_INTRO_35": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}进入了我们来自的时间之门。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_5_INTRO_36": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}A——之后！如果那台机器出了什么事，巫师就会杀了我们！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_5_INTRO_37": "{NPC_EXIT:antibullysquad}{TIRED:crazydave}好吧，如果我见过它，那就太不幸了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_5_INTRO_38": "{TIRED:crazydave}布鲁！这些苍蝇一直飞进我嘴里！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_6_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:antibullysquad}{SHOUT:antibullysquad}那里！终于抓到了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_6_INTRO_2": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}现在我们只要把它带回去，修好，然后就可以交给巫师了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_6_INTRO_3": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}好了，你们还在等什么？把那个东西举起来！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_6_INTRO_4": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}我正在尝试移动。但不能。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_6_INTRO_5": "{TIRED:antibullysquad}是啊！不能动！脚粘了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_6_INTRO_6": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}你在说什么？等等，我也动不了了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_6_INTRO_7": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}老大。我们跑到了一滩焦油上。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_6_INTRO_8": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}嘎啊！我们全神贯注地追逐它，却没有意识到！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_6_INTRO_9": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}我们要怎么离开这里？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_6_INTRO_10": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}不用担心，老大。严峻的安装按钮可以立即传送机器。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_6_INTRO_11": "{TIRED:antibullysquad}是啊，他说的！现在机器很容易移动！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_6_INTRO_12": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}如果它可以自我传送，那我们为什么还要费心给它轮子呢！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_6_INTRO_13": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}随便吧！只需按下按钮即可！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_6_INTRO_14": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}好的。我正在点击按钮。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_6_INTRO_15": "{SPECIAL3:antibullysquad}...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_6_INTRO_16": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}机器去哪儿了？？？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_6_INTRO_17": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}传送了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_6_INTRO_18": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}猜测这是一个“传送机”按钮。不是“传送我们”按钮。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_6_INTRO_19": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}所以现在它消失了，我们仍然被困住了！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_6_INTRO_20": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}诅咒这台机器！它一直在咒骂我们厄运！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_6_INTRO_21": "{NPC_EXIT:antibullysquad}{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}为什么我们还在关注他们？这不再是我们的问题了，不是吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_6_INTRO_22": "{EXCITED:crazydave}其实我觉得我们应该远离，那东西很邪恶！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_6_INTRO_23": "{TIRED:crazydave}它让我把我的霉菌群落的所有 100 个成员从地上捡起来！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_6_INTRO_24": "{TIRED:winnie}恐怕还是我们的问题用户戴夫。想一想。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_6_INTRO_25": "{SAY:winnie}一台机器，在有能力的人手下，可以让某人做任何事都失败......",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_6_INTRO_26": "{TIRED:crazydave}...哦，当你这样说时...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_6_INTRO_27": "{PLAYFUL:winnie}值得庆幸的是，反欺凌小队并不是我所说的“能手”。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_6_INTRO_28": "{SAY:winnie}他们的“巫师”，另一方面......",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_6_INTRO_29": "{TIRED:crazydave}咕噜……一想到Lucky会得到那个东西……",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_6_INTRO_30": "{SAY:winnie}我们必须在那台机器到达他之前拦截它。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_7_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}看来这就是那台机器传送到的地方了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_7_INTRO_2": "{EXCITED:crazydave}哦，哇！这是80年代最传奇的音乐会的前一天！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_7_INTRO_3": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我最喜欢的乐队是头条新闻，领唱的钢琴技巧是出了名的！！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_7_INTRO_4": "{EXCITED:crazydave}看，他们现在正在把钢琴搬上舞台呢！这是一个历史性的时刻！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_7_INTRO_5": "{SAY:crazydave}不得不说，这样移动似乎很危险……",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_7_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}我已经确定了机器的位置。球队就靠它了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_7_INTRO_7": "{NPC_ENTER:antibullysquad}{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}我们明白了，老板。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_7_INTRO_8": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}这次你哪儿也去不了，你这个滑溜的机器！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_7_INTRO_9": "{TIRED:antibullysquad}是啊，他说的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_7_INTRO_10": "{SAY:crazydave}远离机器！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_7_INTRO_11": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}什么-为什么还关注我们-！？我们永远不会给你这台机器！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_7_INTRO_12": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}哦，不。我只是说说而已！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_7_INTRO_13": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}看来离那东西越近就越不走运。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_7_INTRO_14": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}他说对了，老板。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_7_INTRO_15": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}咕噜，好吧！让我们……离机器三步远！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_7_INTRO_16": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}然后我们就可以用棍子什么的推动它来移动它了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_7_INTRO_17": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}是啊，这真是天才之举，哈哈哈！现在我们可以免受厄运了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_7_INTRO_18": "{SAY:winnie}我不太确定。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_7_INTRO_19": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}噗，你在说什么啊？这里没有愚蠢的绵羊或焦油！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_7_INTRO_20": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}好宽敞啊！从字面上看，我们这里不会发生任何不好的事情！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_7_INTRO_21": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}厄运又不是会……从天而降！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_7_INTRO_22": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_7_INTRO_23": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}...老大，你听到我们头顶上传来叮叮当当的声音了吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_7_INTRO_24": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}啥-",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_7_INTRO_25": "{SPECIAL1:antibullysquad}*哇！*",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_7_INTRO_26": "{NPC_EXIT:antibullysquad}{PLAYFUL:crazydave}我告诉过你把钢琴挂在绳子上是很危险的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_7_INTRO_27": "{SAY:winnie}那次碰撞的冲击力再次将机器推开，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_7_INTRO_28": "{SAY:winnie}它正在向一个开放的时间门户滚动。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_7_INTRO_29": "{TIRED:crazydave}哎呀，对于一台倒霉的机器来说，这机器已经很幸运了吧？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_8_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:antibullysquad}{SHOUT:antibullysquad}留在...原地！你这个愚蠢的机器！我和你已经受够了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_8_INTRO_2": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}这是怎么了？固定了吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_8_INTRO_3": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}咕。我不知道。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_8_INTRO_4": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}啊啊！我们不能给巫师这样的机器！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_8_INTRO_5": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}那我们就无法报答他了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_8_INTRO_6": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}Buh。他也无法将他的巫师智慧传授给我们。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_8_INTRO_7": "{TIRED:antibullysquad}是的，他现在正在给我们打电话！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_8_INTRO_8": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}是的，他是……",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_8_INTRO_9": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}...等等，什么！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_8_INTRO_10": "{NPC_ENTER:lucky}{SAY:lucky}早上好小伙子们！我的机器进展如何？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_8_INTRO_11": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}噢，是……",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_8_INTRO_12": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}老大，机器着火了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_8_INTRO_13": "{SAY:lucky}那是什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_8_INTRO_14": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}没什么，巫师先生！一切都像小鬼的头脑一样顺利！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_8_INTRO_15": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}老大，格瑞姆着火了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_8_INTRO_16": "{TIRED:antibullysquad}是啊，他什么-AAAAAAAAHHHH!!!!!!!!!",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_8_INTRO_17": "{SAY:lucky}Delira n' excira！干得好，小伙子们！法师很高兴。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_8_INTRO_18": "{SAY:lucky}当然，你会因此得到奖励！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_8_INTRO_19": "{SAY:lucky}我将赐予我巫师智慧。你们不再只是一些无名小卒！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_8_INTRO_20": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}哦，谢谢你，巫师先生！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_8_INTRO_21": "{SAY:lucky}我现在就期待明天机器在我身上。那么再见，小伙子们！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_8_INTRO_22": "{NPC_EXIT:lucky}{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:crazydave}放弃吧，伙计！你不可能抢救这台机器！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_8_INTRO_23": "{SAY:winnie}足够谈判了。我们的时间不多了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_8_INTRO_24": "{EXCITED:winnie}用户戴夫，抢机！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_8_INTRO_25": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}不！逃离！格雷格，打他！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_8_INTRO_26": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}好的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_8_INTRO_27": "{SPECIAL2:antibullysquad}哎呀！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_8_INTRO_28": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}不是他，你这个白痴！他！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_8_INTRO_29": "{TIRED:crazydave}给……呃……给我！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_8_INTRO_30": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}不...从来没有！这是巫师的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_8_INTRO_31": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}老大，看你抢机的地方。你要按下传送按钮-",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_8_INTRO_32": "{SPECIAL3:antibullysquad}啊！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_8_INTRO_33": "{SAY:crazydave}什么——不见了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_8_INTRO_34": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}靠，又传送了！为什么我们还要安装这个功能！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_8_INTRO_35": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}你问的是坏消息，园丁。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_8_INTRO_36": "{TIRED:antibullysquad}是啊，他说的！揍他！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_8_INTRO_37": "{EXCITED:winnie}撤退，用户戴夫。我们没有时间为小事争吵。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_8_INTRO_38": "{SAY:winnie}我们需要在Lucky找到那台机器之前找到它！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_9_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:lucky}{SAY:lucky}啊！这台机器神奇地出现在我家门口？我会说，多么幸运啊！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_9_INTRO_2": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:antibullysquad}{TIRED:crazydave}哦，不...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_9_INTRO_3": "{SAY:lucky}啊，你们小伙子们做到了，我印象深刻！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_9_INTRO_4": "{SAY:lucky}谁知道相信我在洞里遇到的一些陌生人会有回报！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_9_INTRO_5": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}啊，呃……完全、完全！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_9_INTRO_6": "{SAY:lucky}运气加倍，我终于可以拥有我想要的一切了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_9_INTRO_7": "{SAY:lucky}连她也……哈哈哈哈！我终于可以拥有她了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_9_INTRO_8": "{SAY:crazydave}你还挂念着她吗？这太令人毛骨悚然了，伙计。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_9_INTRO_9": "{SAY:lucky}别再烦了！命运注定我们有缘！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_9_INTRO_10": "{SAY:lucky}有缘的人就是注定的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_9_INTRO_11": "{SAY:lucky}不管怎样，让我们​​启动这个装置吧？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_9_INTRO_12": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}等等，不！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_9_INTRO_13": "{SAY:lucky}什么？吉吉是什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_9_INTRO_14": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}我的意思是...比如，我们不应该做一些热身吗？在那之前……？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_9_INTRO_15": "{EXCITED:winnie}小队不敢告诉他真相，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_9_INTRO_16": "{EXCITED:winnie}Lucky 已经拥有机器了...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_9_INTRO_17": "{EXCITED:winnie}我们现在唯一的希望就是事与愿违！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_9_INTRO_18": "{EXCITED:crazydave}是啊，这对Lucky来说会很不走运吧？然后机器就会实现它！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_9_INTRO_19": "{SAY:crazydave}继续按下按钮，伙计！打开它！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_9_INTRO_20": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}不，不要这样做！我-我是说-",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_9_INTRO_21": "{SAY:lucky}什么？你们都没有道理！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_9_INTRO_22": "{SAY:winnie}您必须将其打开。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_9_INTRO_23": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}不要听车。她是邪恶的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_9_INTRO_24": "{SAY:crazydave}不，听车子的声音！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_9_INTRO_25": "{TIRED:antibullysquad}是啊，他说的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_9_INTRO_26": "{SAY:lucky}谁说的？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_9_INTRO_27": "{TIRED:antibullysquad}他什么…呃…",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_9_INTRO_28": "{SAY:lucky}够了！如果你们都告诉我做不同的事情，我就听天由命了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_9_INTRO_29": "{SAY:lucky}我来抛硬币！开始吧！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_9_INTRO_30": "{SAY:lucky}哎呀，扔得太高了。呃……它是不是滑进了机器的缝隙里？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_9_INTRO_31": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}为什么机器现在嗡嗡作响，剧烈晃动？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_9_INTRO_32": "{EXCITED:winnie}那枚硬币肯定击中了内部组件！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_9_INTRO_33": "{SAY:lucky}意思是……？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_9_INTRO_34": "{SHOUT:crazydave}它要爆炸了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_9_INTRO_35": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}先生法师，下来吧！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_10_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:lucky}{NPC_ENTER:antibullysquad}{SAY:lucky}Ya' bleedin eejit！你们给我造了一台 JINX 机器！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_10_INTRO_2": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}我发誓，这不是故意的，巫师先生先生！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_10_INTRO_3": "{SAY:lucky}我差点就拥有了这一切！啊啊！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_10_INTRO_4": "{EXCITED:crazydave}等等，那台机器就像老板的幸运机器一样爆炸了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_10_INTRO_5": "{TIRED:crazydave}但是当它发生时，那东西里的所有运气都转移到了幸运中，对吧？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_10_INTRO_6": "{TIRED:crazydave}也就是说……Lucky吸收了刚才爆炸的厄运？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_10_INTRO_7": "{SAY:lucky}W、什么！？不！我运气好！你对我做了什么！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_10_INTRO_8": "{SAY:lucky}没有我的运气，我什么都不是！这不可能发生！不，不，不……！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_10_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}正在扫描……",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_10_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}不幸的是，反欺凌小队保护了他免受爆炸，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_10_INTRO_11": "{SAY:crazydave}所以他们吸收了所有的厄运？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_10_INTRO_12": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}唷，我想这意味着我们扯平了，嗯，巫师先生？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_10_INTRO_13": "{SAY:lucky}哈！？你在笑什么？你没听到她说的话吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_10_INTRO_14": "{SAY:lucky}你现在运气不好了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_10_INTRO_15": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}呃……我是说，我们一开始就已经很不幸了。有什么会改变吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_10_INTRO_16": "{TIRED:antibullysquad}是啊，他说的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_10_INTRO_17": "{SAY:lucky}什么？但现在你将永远成为运气不佳的笨蛋失败者！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_10_INTRO_18": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}Y'知道吗？看看保持运气是多么疯狂，我想我宁愿做一个失败者！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_10_INTRO_19": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}世界需要我们这样被命运打倒的人！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_10_INTRO_20": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}因为当人们看到我们时...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_10_INTRO_21": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}...他们不想成为我们。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_10_INTRO_22": "{TIRED:antibullysquad}是啊！这让他们感觉很棒！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_10_INTRO_23": "{SAY:lucky}你们称我为像你们一样的失败者？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_10_INTRO_24": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}我的意思是，你刚才确实输了，不是吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_10_INTRO_25": "{PLAYFUL:winnie}物以类聚。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_10_INTRO_26": "{SHOUT:antibullysquad}嘿，也许我们现在可以成为您的学徒了，巫师先生！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_10_INTRO_27": "{PLAYFUL:antibullysquad}最幸运的僵尸和最不幸的僵尸。呵呵。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_10_INTRO_28": "{TIRED:antibullysquad}是啊，就像……命运把我们绑在一起了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_10_INTRO_29": "{PLAYFUL:winnie}...一位聪明的巫师曾经说过...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_10_INTRO_30": "{PLAYFUL:winnie}“有缘分的人就是天生一对。”",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_10_INTRO_31": "{SAY:lucky}...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_10_INTRO_32": "{SAY:lucky}这是我自己做的不是吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_10_INTRO_33": "{SAY:lucky}啊，胡说八道！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_10_INTRO_34": "{NPC_EXIT:lucky}{NPC_EXIT:antibullysquad}{PLAYFUL:winnie}希望他们之间的缘分天长地久。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_10_INTRO_35": "{TIRED:crazydave}呃，为什么？你通常不会希望这些家伙有任何好处！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_10_INTRO_36": "{SAY:winnie}我还是没有。如果幸运儿留在这三个人身边，他们就会把他变成和他们一样。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_10_INTRO_37": "{PLAYFUL:winnie}愚蠢且无害。我想这对我们所有人来说都会更容易。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_LUCKOTHEZOMBIE_10_INTRO_38": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}呵呵。我想这是看待它的一种方式！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_1_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{EXCITED:crazydave}朋朋，我找不到电视遥控器了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_1_INTRO_2": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}扫描电视遥控器...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_1_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}不幸的是，我找不到你的电视遥控器，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_1_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}您居住地周围垃圾过多。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_1_INTRO_5": "{TIRED:crazydave}我一直想把这个地方清理干净......",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_1_INTRO_6": "{TIRED:crazydave}我应该做春季大扫除。但是哇，我真的不想这样做吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_1_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}也许是时候放弃你的懒惰方式并拥抱清洁文化了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_1_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}它可以防止所有垃圾堆积起来。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_1_INTRO_9": "{EXCITED:crazydave}但是朋朋，我疯了戴夫。不干净戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_1_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}当我们前进时，我们一直在改变自己。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_1_INTRO_11": "{SAY:winnie}是死亡与重生的无尽循环。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_1_INTRO_12": "{EXCITED:crazydave}就像僵尸一样！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_1_INTRO_13": "{SAY:winnie}这个假期，春暖花开。以鸡蛋为代表的变革和新生命的时代。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_1_INTRO_14": "{SHOUT:crazydave}就像那些落在我们房子上的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_2_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}我找到了我的电视遥控器，它在沙发垫子里。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_2_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}你的住处清理了吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_2_INTRO_3": "{SAY:crazydave}没有。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_2_INTRO_4": "{SAY:crazydave}我想知道当我按下这个按钮时会发生什么。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_2_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}*呜呜...*",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_2_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}(拦截未知无线电信号...)",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_2_INTRO_7": "{NPC_ENTER:captaincamo}{SAY:captaincamo}你好“僵王”。我发送此消息是为了立即通知您。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_2_INTRO_8": "{SAY:crazydave}噢，那一定是“邪将”按钮了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_2_INTRO_9": "{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}这是谁？这是恶作剧电话吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_2_INTRO_10": "{EXCITED:captaincamo}这是一个极其重要的呼吁。是我，你最大的对手，迷彩将军！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_2_INTRO_11": "{SAY:zombossicon}谁？抱歉，你已经删掉了。你在隧道里吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_2_INTRO_12": "{TIRED:captaincamo}呸！没关系！这是一条需求留言！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_2_INTRO_13": "{SAY:zombossicon}我不会支付我的工人更多工资！天啊！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_2_INTRO_14": "{SAY:zombossicon}我以为我已经联系工会了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_2_INTRO_15": "{SAY:captaincamo}关乎你的血脉！你的继承人！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_2_INTRO_16": "{SAY:zombossicon}看，现在我知道这是一个恶作剧电话。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_2_INTRO_17": "{PLAYFUL:captaincamo}我绑架了你心爱的侄子……他被称为“僵尸”。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_2_INTRO_18": "{SAY:captaincamo}来吧，对你亲爱的叔叔说句话。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_2_INTRO_19": "{NPC_ENTER:zombert}{SAY:zombert}嗨，未开封。你给我带来了新的 zorkrite 皮肤吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_2_INTRO_20": "{SAY:zombossicon}等等，你是认真的吗！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_2_INTRO_21": "{EXCITED:captaincamo}哈哈哈！当然！我用枪指着他把他绑在椅子上！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_2_INTRO_22": "{SAY:captaincamo}现在，除非你完全按照我说的去做，否则我会——",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_2_INTRO_23": "{SAY:zombossicon}巴哈哈哈哈哈哈哈！你是认真的！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_2_INTRO_24": "{TIRED:captaincamo}是的...因为我已经...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_2_INTRO_25": "{SAY:zombossicon}嘿，需求先生，请给 Zombert 一个很好的聚会场所。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_2_INTRO_26": "{SHOUT:captaincamo}我不是虚张声势！他有生命危险！我会-",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_2_INTRO_27": "{SAY:zombossicon}看，我的节目还有两分钟就开始了，我得做好准备了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_2_INTRO_28": "{SAY:zombossicon}你为什么不和Zombert一起度过一些美好时光呢？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_2_INTRO_29": "{SAY:captaincamo}你就一点也不关心他发生什么事吗！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_2_INTRO_30": "{SAY:zombossicon}...不。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_2_INTRO_31": "{SAY:zombossicon}Zobox，结束通话并屏蔽此号码！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_2_INTRO_32": "{NPC_EXIT:zombossicon}{SAY:captaincamo}...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_2_INTRO_33": "{TIRED:captaincamo}那么好吧。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_2_INTRO_34": "{TIRED:captaincamo}我该怎么对付这个白痴呢？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_2_INTRO_35": "{NPC_EXIT:captaincamo}{NPC_EXIT:zombert}{SAY:crazydave}我想我不喜欢这个遥控器。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_3_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，我想我们可能刚刚目睹了一场绑架勒索事件。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_3_INTRO_2": "{SAY:crazydave}是的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_3_INTRO_3": "{NPC_ENTER:captaincamo}{SHOUT:captaincamo}你！你是侵入我谈话的信号！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_3_INTRO_4": "{SAY:crazydave}嗨。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_3_INTRO_5": "{SHOUT:captaincamo}为什么我应该——啊！啊!",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_3_INTRO_6": "{TIRED:captaincamo}...我的背...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_3_INTRO_7": "{NPC_ENTER:zombert}{SAY:zombert}哇哦。你这么老了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_3_INTRO_8": "{SAY:zombert}你在这里做什么，伙计？回到你的家人身边吧。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_3_INTRO_9": "{SHOUT:captaincamo}闭嘴，你这个白痴！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_3_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}这次你希望实现什么好事呢，卡莫？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_3_INTRO_11": "{SHOUT:captaincamo}我不知道！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_3_INTRO_12": "{SAY:zombert}其发音为“IDK”",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_3_INTRO_13": "{SAY:zombert}布鲁德摸到了包",
