  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_9_INTRO_24": "{SAY:captaincamo}也许我必须在情感层面上联系你？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_9_INTRO_25": "{SAY:captaincamo}我相信你已经有足够的生活经验了，值得一些东西！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_9_INTRO_26": "{SAY:captaincamo}你知道吗...当我在你这个年纪的时候，我在历史行军中击败了敌方士兵。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_9_INTRO_27": "{SAY:zombert}在 Zombox 或 Gravestation 上？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_9_INTRO_28": "{SAY:captaincamo}...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_9_INTRO_29": "{SHOUT:captaincamo}就到愚蠢的草坪上出去吧！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_9_INTRO_30": "{NPC_EXIT:captaincamo}{NPC_EXIT:zombert}{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫-",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_9_INTRO_31": "{TIRED:crazydave}是的，我知道。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_10_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:captaincamo}{SHOUT:captaincamo}啊哈哈哈哈哈哈！他来了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_10_INTRO_2": "{SHOUT:captaincamo}死了！一定！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_10_INTRO_3": "{TIRED:captaincamo}哦，但是，让我猜猜......",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_10_INTRO_4": "{TIRED:captaincamo}他会——",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_10_INTRO_5": "{NPC_ENTER:zombert}{SAY:zombert}什么是“流行”聊天？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_10_INTRO_6": "{SHOUT:captaincamo}啊啊啊啊啊！！！！！！！！！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_10_INTRO_7": "{SHOUT:captaincamo}我要疯了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_10_INTRO_8": "{SHOUT:captaincamo}他又活了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_10_INTRO_9": "{EXCITED:captaincamo}死了，然后活着，然后不死，然后死了，然后死了，然后活着……",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_10_INTRO_10": "{EXCITED:captaincamo}死了，活了，死了，活了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_10_INTRO_11": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}迷彩将军，我真的必须说——",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_10_INTRO_12": "{EXCITED:captaincamo}哈哈！有什么好说的！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_10_INTRO_13": "{EXCITED:captaincamo}什么？你要告诉我他接下来可以繁殖吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_10_INTRO_14": "{NPC_ENTER:superzombert}{SAY:superzombert}嗨聊天。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_10_INTRO_15": "{TIRED:captaincamo}...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_10_INTRO_16": "{TIRED:captaincamo}不…这…这一步太过分了…",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_10_INTRO_17": "{TIRED:captaincamo}我拒绝……不。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_10_INTRO_18": "{TIRED:captaincamo}我只是……一个-疯狂的插曲。就是这样。",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_10_INTRO_19": "{SAY:zombert}哥们，你脸上的是什么？我可以摸一下吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_10_INTRO_20": "{SHOUT:captaincamo}你这个怪物离我远点！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_10_INTRO_21": "{SHOUT:captaincamo}你是谁！？",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_10_INTRO_22": "{SHOUT:captaincamo}啊！我知道！我得到它...！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_10_INTRO_23": "{SAY:captaincamo}你...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_10_INTRO_24": "{SAY:captaincamo}你一定是僵王'秘密项目！就是这样！他的完美战士！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_10_INTRO_25": "{SAY:captaincamo}他的怪物创造！哈哈哈！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_10_INTRO_26": "{SHOUT:captaincamo}这一定是他一直以来的计划！拒绝赎金！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_10_INTRO_27": "{SHOUT:captaincamo}TO-让我发疯！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_10_INTRO_28": "{SHOUT:captaincamo}离我远点，你们这些大自然的怪物！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_10_INTRO_29": "{SHOUT:captaincamo}像瘟疫一样死在战场上！",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_10_INTRO_30": "{NPC_EXIT:captaincamo}{SAY:zombert}哈哈战场",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_10_INTRO_31": "{SAY:superzombert}聊那家伙可能被煮熟了",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_10_INTRO_32": "{SAY:zombert}嘿，我们攻击那边的房子吧",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_10_INTRO_33": "{SAY:superzombert}当然",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_10_INTRO_34": "{NPC_EXIT:superzombert}{NPC_EXIT:zombert}{SAY:crazydave}...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_10_INTRO_35": "{SAY:winnie}...",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_10_INTRO_36": "{TIRED:crazydave}让我们-",
  "NARRATIVE_LTE_2026_03_SPRINGENING_10_INTRO_37": "{SAY:winnie}是。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_TORCHWOOD_RFL_01_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，我检测到大量的时间干预痕迹。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_TORCHWOOD_RFL_01_INTRO_2": "{SAY:crazydave}时间现在怎么样？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_TORCHWOOD_RFL_01_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}我们历史上的不幸，让一些熟悉的面孔穿越时空散去。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_TORCHWOOD_RFL_01_INTRO_4": "{EXCITED:winnie}其中一个受害者就是值得信赖的火炬树桩！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_TORCHWOOD_RFL_01_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}我的扫描仪检测到他低沉的求救信号。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_TORCHWOOD_RFL_01_INTRO_6": "{TIRED:crazydave}这个我不知道朋朋...",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_TORCHWOOD_RFL_01_INTRO_7": "{TIRED:crazydave}我欠那家伙20块钱...",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_TORCHWOOD_RFL_02_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:winnie}用户戴夫，看来火炬树桩又有新花样了！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_TORCHWOOD_RFL_02_INTRO_2": "{EXCITED:winnie}火炬树桩现在可以多次点亮豌豆，造成巨大伤害！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_TORCHWOOD_RFL_02_INTRO_3": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}好吧，我不知道他会因为那个赌注而生气！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_TORCHWOOD_RFL_02_INTRO_4": "{EXCITED:winnie}尝试连续种植多个火炬树桩！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_TORCHWOOD_RFL_08_OUTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}我们已成功营救火炬树桩、用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_TORCHWOOD_RFL_08_OUTRO_2": "{EXCITED:winnie}他将为我们的收藏带来强大的补充！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_TORCHWOOD_RFL_08_OUTRO_3": "{TIRED:crazydave}好吧，我猜我会缺20块钱......",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_PARODY_01_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:winnie}用户戴夫，我正在检测僵王博士的另一个邪恶计划的迹象！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_PARODY_01_INTRO_2": "{TIRED:crazydave}呃，这次是什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_PARODY_01_INTRO_3": "{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}计划！？我只是给自己提供一个创意的出口！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_PARODY_01_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}为什么这个创意出口会引起我的警报呢？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_PARODY_01_INTRO_5": "{SAY:zombossicon}我需要你的草坪作为布景！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_PARODY_01_INTRO_6": "{SAY:zombossicon}我正在释放我内心的艺术家！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_PARODY_01_INTRO_7": "{SAY:zombossicon}实现我的愿景！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_PARODY_01_INTRO_8": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}如果你的愿景是拥有一个巨大的头，那么你已经做到了！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_PARODY_01_INTRO_9": "{SAY:zombossicon}安静！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_PARODY_01_INTRO_10": "{SAY:zombossicon}我的头就是我的太阳穴，没有人可以侮辱它！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_PARODY_01_INTRO_11": "{SAY:zombossicon}总之我想当电影导演！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_PARODY_01_INTRO_12": "{SAY:zombossicon}但是，想出原创故事很难！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_PARODY_01_INTRO_13": "{SAY:zombossicon}所以，我将从好莱坞汲取灵感：",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_PARODY_01_INTRO_14": "{SAY:zombossicon}翻拍现有电影并声称它们是我自己的作品！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_PARODY_01_INTRO_15": "{SAY:zombossicon}姆哇哈哈哈！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_PARODY_01_INTRO_16": "{NPC_EXIT:zombossicon}{EXCITED:crazydave}朋朋，我们必须阻止他！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_PARODY_01_INTRO_17": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我讨厌翻拍！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_PARODY_05_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}这次拍摄，我需要你们都站稳！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_PARODY_05_INTRO_2": "{SAY:zombossicon}让我的员工彻底反超领域！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_PARODY_05_INTRO_3": "{SAY:zombossicon}他们的化妆和视觉特效将完成剩下的工作！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_PARODY_05_INTRO_4": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SAY:crazydave}不可能！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_PARODY_05_INTRO_5": "{SAY:crazydave}但是，出于好奇......",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_PARODY_05_INTRO_6": "{SAY:crazydave}这部电影是关于什么的？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_PARODY_05_INTRO_7": "{SAY:zombossicon}哦，这将是一场伟大的比赛！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_PARODY_05_INTRO_8": "{SAY:zombossicon}我的僵尸扮演可怕的外星人，而你们都扮演...",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_PARODY_05_INTRO_9": "{SAY:zombossicon}...好吧，你以前无聊的自己。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_PARODY_05_INTRO_10": "{SAY:zombossicon}他们要入侵了！看上去很震惊，很害怕！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_PARODY_05_INTRO_11": "{SAY:zombossicon}别把这件事搞砸了，就像你一直在做其余的事情一样！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_PARODY_06_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}嘎！你会成为糟糕的同事！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_PARODY_06_INTRO_2": "{SAY:zombossicon}这是您的第一次警告！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_PARODY_06_INTRO_3": "{SAY:zombossicon}发挥你的作用！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_PARODY_06_INTRO_4": "{SAY:zombossicon}让巨人僵尸看起来强大而可怕！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_PARODY_06_INTRO_5": "{SAY:zombossicon}我们不能让我们的主要对手在他的介绍场景中被击败！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_PARODY_06_INTRO_6": "{SAY:zombossicon}灯光、相机...",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_PARODY_06_INTRO_7": "{SAY:zombossicon}行动！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_PARODY_09_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}这是你最后的警告！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_PARODY_09_INTRO_2": "{SAY:zombossicon}别再毁了我的作品！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_PARODY_09_INTRO_3": "{SAY:zombossicon}这一次，我将把来自未来的可怕机器人刺客送到你家门口！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_PARODY_09_INTRO_4": "{SAY:zombossicon}为了戏剧效果，你需要牺牲你的大脑！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_PARODY_09_INTRO_5": "{SAY:zombossicon}这就是演艺圈的规矩！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_PARODY_09_INTRO_6": "{SAY:zombossicon}祝你好运！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_PARODY_10_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}因为你们的不配合，我所有的电影都被测试观众轰炸了！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_PARODY_10_INTRO_2": "{SAY:zombossicon}小鬼想要更多暴力！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_PARODY_10_INTRO_3": "{SAY:zombossicon}所以，我要重新创作一个古老的经典。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_PARODY_10_INTRO_4": "{SAY:zombossicon}我要当主角了！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_PARODY_10_INTRO_5": "{SAY:zombossicon}不管你如何合作，我的电影生涯都会有一个激动人心的结局！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_PARODY_10_OUTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}你不再重拍了，老板！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_PARODY_10_OUTRO_2": "{EXCITED:winnie}你们的盗版电影终于要进便宜货了，僵王！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_PARODY_10_OUTRO_3": "{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}咕咕咕……",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_PARODY_10_OUTRO_4": "{SAY:zombossicon}我会回来的！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_PARODY_10_OUTRO_5": "{SAY:zombossicon}我是世界之王！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_PARODY_10_OUTRO_6": "{SAY:zombossicon}下次，你需要一个更大的睡莲叶！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_ENDANGERED_01_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，我已经在这附近的某个地方找到了第一批捕获的植物。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_ENDANGERED_01_INTRO_2": "{SAY:crazydave}会不会是那边那些豌豆射手？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_ENDANGERED_01_INTRO_3": "{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}天哪！你们两个尼安德特人什么时候到这里的？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_ENDANGERED_01_INTRO_4": "{SAY:zombossicon}你还不应该来这里！我的实验还远远没有正确设置！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_ENDANGERED_01_INTRO_5": "{SAY:zombossicon}没关系！现在让我们看看您有多喜欢您的豌豆射手！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_ENDANGERED_01_INTRO_6": "{NPC_EXIT:zombossicon}{EXCITED:crazydave}我们做到了朋朋！让我们来一场胜利派对吧！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_ENDANGERED_01_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}庆祝活动可以等待。这些豌豆射手即将打破大量僵尸的冰冻状态。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_ENDANGERED_02_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}那么，你还喜欢你的珍贵植物吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_ENDANGERED_02_INTRO_2": "{SAY:zombossicon}即使他们的行为让你处于直接劣势！？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_ENDANGERED_02_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}我注意到你在搞事情，僵王。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_ENDANGERED_02_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}我们不是在玩你扭曲的游戏！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_ENDANGERED_02_INTRO_5": "{SAY:zombossicon}哦，我向你保证，这不是游戏。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_ENDANGERED_02_INTRO_6": "{SAY:zombossicon}我只是想验证你的假设！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_ENDANGERED_02_INTRO_7": "{SAY:zombossicon}你喜欢这些生物只是因为它们能够帮助你，还是出于你内心的善良？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_ENDANGERED_02_INTRO_8": "{SAY:zombossicon}选择权在你！时间在流逝！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_ENDANGERED_02_INTRO_9": "{NPC_EXIT:zombossicon}{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，和上次一样，这些归巢蓟又被置于了另一个不利的境地。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_ENDANGERED_02_INTRO_10": "{TIRED:winnie}尤其是现在今晚有一群当地的小丑在场。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_ENDANGERED_02_INTRO_11": "{SAY:winnie}保证他们的安全，我们很快就能度过难关！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_ENDANGERED_02_INTRO_12": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}那些小丑不会在我的手表上玩弄任何东西！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_ENDANGERED_05_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{TIRED:winnie}更多的铃声，你知道这意味着什么......",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_ENDANGERED_05_INTRO_2": "{EXCITED:crazydave}免费冰淇淋！？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_ENDANGERED_05_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}小丑，用户戴夫。他们又回来伤害我们捕获的植物。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_ENDANGERED_05_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}似乎僵王试图让我们都不喜欢使用植物作为盟友的前景。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_ENDANGERED_05_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}他将他们放入这些不幸的场景中以证明虐待狂的观点。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_ENDANGERED_05_INTRO_6": "{TIRED:winnie}但我们不能让这些捏造的情况改变我们的决心或证明他是对的。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_ENDANGERED_05_INTRO_7": "{EXCITED:crazydave}所以你说的是......",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_ENDANGERED_05_INTRO_8": "{SHOUT:crazydave}他说我们是骗子！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_ENDANGERED_05_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}正是如此。他这样做正在危及无辜的植物。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_ENDANGERED_06_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}我内心深处知道你们都是伪君子！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_ENDANGERED_06_INTRO_2": "{SAY:zombossicon}让我们看看你自己的盟友互相破坏是否能成功！哇哈哈！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_ENDANGERED_06_INTRO_3": "{NPC_EXIT:zombossicon}{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SHOUT:crazydave}老板！！！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_ENDANGERED_06_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}我检测到高度愤怒，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_ENDANGERED_06_OUTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}太棒了，现在我们只剩下两批植物需要保存了。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_ENDANGERED_06_OUTRO_2": "{TIRED:crazydave}老板会看到的！我们没有说谎！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_ENDANGERED_08_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}我找到了最后一组捕获的植物。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_ENDANGERED_08_INTRO_2": "{EXCITED:crazydave}让我们拯救他们并向他展示什么是什么！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_ENDANGERED_08_INTRO_3": "{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}你这时间旅行的傻瓜没那么快！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_ENDANGERED_08_INTRO_4": "{SAY:zombossicon}我看到我精心设计的陷阱未能阻碍你的决心，但这不会！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_ENDANGERED_08_INTRO_5": "{SAY:zombossicon}你们两个还没有准备好，我应该说...严峻的情况...",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_ENDANGERED_08_INTRO_6": "{TIRED:crazydave}...我不明白。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_ENDANGERED_08_OUTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}诅咒！你真的很关心这些可怕的事情！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_ENDANGERED_08_OUTRO_2": "{SAY:zombossicon}我想我应该这么期待！我会回来的，你们这些白痴！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_ENDANGERED_08_OUTRO_3": "{NPC_EXIT:zombossicon}{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}我们已经保存了辣椒投手和墓碑玫瑰。让聚会开始吧。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_ENDANGERED_08_OUTRO_4": "{EXCITED:crazydave}OOH，现在我明白了！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_SHADOWLURKERS_01_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}吉普车，朋朋！有人把灯灭了！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_SHADOWLURKERS_01_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，我们以前经历过这个。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_SHADOWLURKERS_01_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}没有人关灯。我们只是在经历夜晚。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_SHADOWLURKERS_01_INTRO_4": "{SAY:crazydave}哦...好吧，我们为什么要晚上来这里呢？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_SHADOWLURKERS_01_INTRO_5": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我们得去教训那个老板先生，他不会用炸玉米饼来耍花招！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_SHADOWLURKERS_01_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}我发现了一个阴郁的盟友，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_SHADOWLURKERS_01_INTRO_7": "{SHOUT:crazydave}幽暗蘑菇？！？！我一直在等待这一刻！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_SHADOWLURKERS_01_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}...没有。忧郁藤，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_SHADOWLURKERS_01_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}忧郁藤可以在其周围的3x3区域内进行攻击。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_SHADOWLURKERS_01_INTRO_10": "{EXCITED:winnie}这个暗影潜伏者还能够为其方块上的其他暗影植物提供动力。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_SHADOWLURKERS_01_INTRO_11": "{SAY:crazydave}看起来很方便！不过，我想知道我的老朋友忧郁蘑菇在做什么。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_SHADOWLURKERS_01_INTRO_12": "{EXCITED:crazydave}这藤蔓小子倒是有灵气，只是有点太阴森了！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_SHADOWLURKERS_02_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，看来一些替代的僵尸威胁正在从阴影中出现。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_SHADOWLURKERS_02_INTRO_2": "{EXCITED:crazydave}哦不！不是迷雾潜伏者！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_SHADOWLURKERS_02_INTRO_3": "{EXCITED:crazydave}那些家伙带走了我们心爱的朋友 GLOOM-SHROOM！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_SHADOWLURKERS_02_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，我相信你错了。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_SHADOWLURKERS_02_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}这些僵尸只占领了忧郁藤，没有占领幽暗蘑菇。根据我的数据，",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_SHADOWLURKERS_02_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}Gloom-shroom 目前正在享受退休生活。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_SHADOWLURKERS_02_INTRO_7": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}哦。这是正确的。忘了我们是在寻找藤蔓人。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_SHADOWLURKERS_02_INTRO_8": "{SAY:crazydave}不管怎样，雾潜者是怎么回事？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_SHADOWLURKERS_02_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}这些新僵尸是我们之前遇到过的其他僵尸的替代版本。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_SHADOWLURKERS_02_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}黑暗探险家似乎是中世纪时期的探险家僵尸。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_SHADOWLURKERS_02_INTRO_11": "{SAY:crazydave}这没有任何意义。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_SHADOWLURKERS_02_INTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}你是对的，用户戴夫。我需要找到更多关于它们的数据。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_SHADOWLURKERS_02_INTRO_13": "{SAY:winnie}另一个新威胁是火药桶滚轮。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_SHADOWLURKERS_02_INTRO_14": "{SAY:winnie}这些替代桶滚轮正在推动装有炸药的桶。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_SHADOWLURKERS_02_INTRO_15": "{TIRED:crazydave}我觉得这可能存在安全风险。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_SHADOWLURKERS_02_INTRO_16": "{SAY:winnie}确实是用户戴夫。为了我们的植物，而不是推动它们的僵尸。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_SHADOWLURKERS_02_INTRO_17": "{SAY:winnie}我们必须保持警惕。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_SHADOWLURKERS_04_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}草坪上那些怪异的新瓷砖是怎么回事？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_SHADOWLURKERS_04_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}数据显示这些是Boosting Tiles，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_SHADOWLURKERS_04_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}踩在它们身上的僵尸可以获得韧性、速度或无敌提升。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_SHADOWLURKERS_04_INTRO_4": "{EXCITED:crazydave}无敌？！这些奇怪的僵尸家伙根本不会公平竞争！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_SHADOWLURKERS_07_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:crazydave}外面很冷，朋朋！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_SHADOWLURKERS_07_INTRO_2": "{EXCITED:crazydave}这一定是我们正在接近忧郁藤的征兆！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_SHADOWLURKERS_07_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，这是老园丁的神话。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_SHADOWLURKERS_07_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}忧郁藤无法影响当前天气。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_SHADOWLURKERS_07_INTRO_5": "{SAY:crazydave}哦。那为什么这么冷呢？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_SHADOWLURKERS_07_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}当地天气似乎预示着会突然有风寒。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_SHADOWLURKERS_07_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}我们应该带暖气以确保安全。这将是一个寒冷的夜晚。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_SHADOWLURKERS_08_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}就是这个，用户戴夫。我们几乎已经拯救了忧郁藤。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_SHADOWLURKERS_08_INTRO_2": "{EXCITED:crazydave}终于！这是一段漫长的旅程！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_SHADOWLURKERS_08_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}我们还有最后一个挑战需要克服。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_SHADOWLURKERS_08_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}能量块在我们这边，但是，僵尸有加速块。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_SHADOWLURKERS_08_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}大规模攻击即将来临。我们必须做好准备。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_SHADOWLURKERS_08_INTRO_6": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我们有这个，朋朋！忧郁藤，我们来了！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_SHADOWLURKERS_08_OUTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:crazydave}我们做到了，朋朋！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_SHADOWLURKERS_08_OUTRO_2": "{EXCITED:winnie}我们已成功获得忧郁藤！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_SHADOWLURKERS_08_OUTRO_3": "{TIRED:crazydave}我会想念夜晚的，朋朋。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_SHADOWLURKERS_08_OUTRO_4": "{EXCITED:crazydave}与我们所有的新朋友一起重温这个夜晚真是太有趣了！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_SHADOWLURKERS_08_OUTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}确实有，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_SHADOWLURKERS_08_OUTRO_6": "{SAY:crazydave}嘿，邻居，我们应该找个时间清理一下你的旧游泳池。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_SHADOWLURKERS_08_OUTRO_7": "{EXCITED:crazydave}一旦我们拿回我的炸玉米饼，我们就应该庆祝一下！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_SHADOWLURKERS_08_OUTRO_8": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我们可以邀请所有植物朋友还有忧郁藤！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_SHADOWLURKERS_08_OUTRO_9": "{TIRED:crazydave}不过，不是僵尸。那些家伙真糟糕。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_SHADOWLURKERS_08_OUTRO_10": "{PLAYFUL:winnie}也许我可以安排一次清理行动，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_SHADOWLURKERS_08_OUTRO_11": "{EXCITED:crazydave}那就太好了，朋朋！希望在我拿回我的炸玉米饼之前可以完成......",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_SHADOWLURKERS_08_OUTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}我会看看我能做什么。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_POOLPARTY_01_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}哇哦，朋朋！我们回来做什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_POOLPARTY_01_INTRO_2": "{SAY:crazydave}我知道几周前我们讨论过清理邻居的游泳池......",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_POOLPARTY_01_INTRO_3": "{SHOUT:crazydave}但我需要先充分利用我的炸玉米饼！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_POOLPARTY_01_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}炸玉米饼可以等，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_POOLPARTY_01_INTRO_5": "{SAY:crazydave}噢。我刚想吃第二口！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_POOLPARTY_01_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}我的扫描仪也一直在后院检测到异常时间粒子。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_POOLPARTY_01_INTRO_7": "{SAY:crazydave}至少我还能在泳池里畅游。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_POOLPARTY_01_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}包括僵尸。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_POOLPARTY_01_INTRO_9": "{SAY:crazydave}噢。不公平！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_POOLPARTY_01_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}先别闲了，这里说不定很快就会有植物需要拯救。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_POOLPARTY_01_INTRO_11": "{SAY:winnie}如果我的内存驱动器正确，池将限制种植能力。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_POOLPARTY_01_INTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}因此，放置睡莲叶对于抵御穿过它的入侵者非常重要。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_POOLPARTY_01_INTRO_13": "{SAY:winnie}也请留意盾牌僵尸的替代紧凑版本。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_POOLPARTY_01_INTRO_14": "{SAY:crazydave}嗯？我还以为是清洁工呢！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_POOLPARTY_02_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，我的系统已经产生了有价值的结果。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_POOLPARTY_02_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}首先也是最重要的：我们确实有一种新植物需要回收。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_POOLPARTY_02_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}Lotus Pod 是一个有趣的样本，能够根据放置的位置切换能力。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_POOLPARTY_02_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}在陆地上，它向僵尸发射重型鱼雷。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_POOLPARTY_02_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}在水上时，它会发射快速鱼雷，快速穿过水池。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_POOLPARTY_02_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}命中后对区域内的多个目标造成伤害。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_POOLPARTY_02_INTRO_7": "{SAY:crazydave}谈论流动性！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_POOLPARTY_02_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}另一个话题，僵尸们有一些新发现的策略。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_POOLPARTY_02_INTRO_9": "{SAY:crazydave}是的，呃，我想他们又找到了上次来这里时的鸭管供应。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_POOLPARTY_02_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}小心他们的充气玩具，因为这使他们在泳池中的航行速度比在陆地上更快。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_POOLPARTY_02_INTRO_11": "{SAY:winnie}看来我的扫描也注意到有些人已经淹没在水下。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_POOLPARTY_02_INTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}做好突然袭击的准备。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_POOLPARTY_02_INTRO_13": "{SAY:crazydave}糟糕。我猜一旦我们完成了，我的泳池清洁工作就会被取消。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_POOLPARTY_05_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SAY:crazydave}嘿邻居！我很快就过来告诉你一些疯狂的事情！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_POOLPARTY_05_INTRO_2": "{SAY:crazydave}我们不能这样！只有我可以疯狂！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_POOLPARTY_05_INTRO_3": "{SAY:crazydave}而且朋朋现在也不在这里。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_POOLPARTY_05_INTRO_4": "{SAY:crazydave}她说她会忙于分析其他地方的东西。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_POOLPARTY_05_INTRO_5": "{SAY:crazydave}不知道为什么，但她在离开前确实告诉了我一些令人兴奋的事情。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_POOLPARTY_05_INTRO_6": "{SAY:crazydave}僵尸使用某种古怪的majig来让自己变得更小！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_POOLPARTY_05_INTRO_7": "{SAY:crazydave}他们怎么能这么做？！我当然希望我能！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_POOLPARTY_05_INTRO_8": "{SAY:crazydave}当我还小的时候，我打赌我吃玉米饼的速度可以快两倍！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_POOLPARTY_05_INTRO_9": "{SAY:crazydave}只是我可能会被squirbo一击打昏。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_POOLPARTY_05_INTRO_10": "{SAY:crazydave}除非我能完全避免被击中！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_POOLPARTY_05_INTRO_11": "{SAY:crazydave}等等，呃哦...不过我会小心的。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_POOLPARTY_05_INTRO_12": "{SAY:crazydave}这里的僵尸也许可以用豌豆做到这一点。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_POOLPARTY_05_INTRO_13": "{SAY:crazydave}嗯，祝你好运！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_POOLPARTY_08_OUTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}我们已成功保护 Lotus Pod。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_POOLPARTY_08_OUTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}这将证明是一个非常重要的前进盟友。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_POOLPARTY_08_OUTRO_3": "{SAY:crazydave}现在我们可以回去清理泳池了！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_POOLPARTY_08_OUTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}暂停，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_POOLPARTY_08_OUTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}我们还有重要的事情要去处理。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_POOLPARTY_08_OUTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}恐怕僵王正在酝酿新的剧情。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_POOLPARTY_08_OUTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}数据目前效率低下，但可能并不令人愉快。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_POOLPARTY_08_OUTRO_8": "{SAY:crazydave}噢。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_POOLPARTY_08_OUTRO_9": "{SAY:crazydave}好吧，我改天再去处理。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_POOLPARTY_08_OUTRO_10": "{SAY:crazydave}希望不是在晚上，我讨厌晚上清理游泳池！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_1_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}好吧朋朋，是这个地方吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_1_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}是的，我们已经到达Meteor Z了。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_1_INTRO_3": "{SAY:crazydave}等等，这不是赋予僵尸超能力的地方吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_1_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}根据L.E.A.F团队的记录，一些年前坠落到这里的丧尸获得了超能力。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_1_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}这一切都归功于陨石独特的辐射。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_1_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}不过，大部分都在那次事件中被吸收了。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_1_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}这个地点从此就享有神秘的名声。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_1_INTRO_8": "{SAY:crazydave}我们之前看到的僵尸火箭呢？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_1_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}这似乎就是它的目的地了。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_1_INTRO_10": "{SAY:crazydave}他们比我们先一步吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_1_INTRO_11": "{SAY:winnie}他们先到了。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_1_INTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}正在扫描……",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_1_INTRO_13": "{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，准备好以下信息。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_1_INTRO_14": "{SAY:winnie}火箭中的所有僵尸似乎都来自“Hero-Con”事件。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_1_INTRO_15": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我已经准备好我们的服装植物了！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_1_INTRO_16": "{EXCITED:crazydave}幸好我们带了他们去旅行！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_2_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}哇哦，这些英雄家伙比我记得的要多得多。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_2_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}确实太多了。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_2_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}这很可能是迷彩将军所为。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_2_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}上次我们打英雄主题的军队，就是他干的。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_2_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}从逻辑上可以得出结论，这是另一种方案。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_2_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}所以，我会提供与上次击败他相同的手段。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_2_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}植物食物块一旦种植在其上就会触发植物的植物食物效果。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_2_INTRO_8": "{EXCITED:crazydave}是啊！我们也有超能力！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_3_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:captaincamo}{SAY:captaincamo}哦，你能看一下吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_3_INTRO_2": "{SAY:captaincamo}你提前了。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_3_INTRO_3": "{SAY:captaincamo}我现在有点忙，但我会看看是否可以安排你。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_3_INTRO_4": "{SAY:captaincamo}Brainiacs，3 号阵型。有访客。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_3_INTRO_5": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}将军！你在这里做什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_3_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}我知道这是你的又一个阴谋。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_3_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}你想赋予你的新“军队”超能力吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_3_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}你知道Meteor Z的辐射已经被吸收了吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_3_INTRO_9": "{EXCITED:captaincamo}滚出我的视线！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_3_INTRO_10": "{NPC_EXIT:captaincamo}{PLAYFUL:crazydave}Ooooh，有人有点不安。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_3_INTRO_11": "{SAY:winnie}迷彩现在似乎不适合交谈。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_3_INTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，我发现大量修复小鬼涌入。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_3_INTRO_13": "{SAY:winnie}或者...“Brainiacs”，他们的超级英雄身份。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_3_INTRO_14": "{SAY:crazydave}呃，他们带着那些丑陋的东西是什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_5_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，我检测到存在奇怪的僵尸诡计。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_5_INTRO_2": "{SAY:crazydave}僵尸技巧...现在这是我有一段时间没有听说过的东西了。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_5_INTRO_3": "{NPC_ENTER:captaincamo}{PLAYFUL:captaincamo}哦，我一直为你保存这个。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_5_INTRO_4": "{SAY:captaincamo}我已经彻底研究了如何利用这些英雄技巧来为我带来优势。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_5_INTRO_5": "{SAY:captaincamo}谁知道书呆子实际上可以做一些有用的事情。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_5_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}你在图什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_5_INTRO_7": "{EXCITED:captaincamo}你的死！尤其是你！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_5_INTRO_8": "{SAY:captaincamo}哦，如果我能握住我的手-",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_5_INTRO_9": "{SHOUT:captaincamo}咳咳咳喘息声",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_5_INTRO_10": "{TIRED:captaincamo}一定要保持冷静，这对心脏不好。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_5_INTRO_11": "{SAY:captaincamo}但这一切都是后来的事。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_5_INTRO_12": "{SAY:captaincamo}首先...",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_5_INTRO_13": "{EXCITED:captaincamo}自从你把我从我自己的时代驱逐出去之后-!!!!!",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_5_INTRO_14": "{SAY:captaincamo}我需要创建一支属于我自己的军队。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_5_INTRO_15": "{SAY:crazydave}用那些英雄？他们完全就是一群懦夫！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_5_INTRO_16": "{TIRED:captaincamo}...别提醒我。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_5_INTRO_17": "{SAY:winnie}如果你打算用这颗流星的辐射来给它们供电，那你就太晚了。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_5_INTRO_18": "{SAY:captaincamo}或者你会这么想。这东西里还有足够的能量来增强一支军队。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_5_INTRO_19": "{SAY:captaincamo}你只需要知道在哪里挖就可以了，哈哈哈！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_5_INTRO_20": "{SAY:winnie}等等……这是真的吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_5_INTRO_21": "{SAY:captaincamo}我可能在撒谎，想知道吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_5_INTRO_22": "{SAY:captaincamo}此外，我来这里还有更多个人原因。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_5_INTRO_23": "{SAY:captaincamo}现在准备好！一些不好的天然卫星即将升起！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_7_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:captaincamo}{SAY:captaincamo}你可能有兴趣知道我实际上挖掘了这个地方的历史。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_7_INTRO_2": "{SAY:captaincamo}僵王在组建我们的主动小队之前，已经有不少英雄了吧？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_7_INTRO_3": "{SAY:captaincamo}很明显这个白痴与他们中的大多数失去了联系。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_7_INTRO_4": "{SAY:captaincamo}这是典型的他放弃有用的资产......",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_7_INTRO_5": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}根据最近的记录，僵博机器人 Hero-Tron 5000 创造的僵尸英雄大部分已经退役。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_7_INTRO_6": "{SAY:crazydave}是的，它们曾经很痛苦，但是呃......",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_7_INTRO_7": "{SAY:crazydave}我听说很多人都把老板留在了后面，只是为了排长队签名。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_7_INTRO_8": "{SAY:captaincamo}典型。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_7_INTRO_9": "{SAY:captaincamo}我认为一次适当的意外正是创造一个真正的新“英雄”所需要的。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_7_INTRO_10": "{SAY:captaincamo}而这恰好是其中之一的发源地。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_7_INTRO_11": "{SAY:captaincamo}所以今天，我要送来与巨型巨猿相似的人......",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_7_INTRO_12": "{SAY:captaincamo}还自己制造事故！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_7_INTRO_13": "{SAY:captaincamo}通过重现这些场景，我将拥有一个属于自己的超能力士兵！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_7_INTRO_14": "{SAY:captaincamo}一个将与其他人处于同一联盟的人！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_7_INTRO_15": "{SAY:captaincamo}所以，做好你的事吧，园丁们。模仿进化，消灭没有潜力的“巨兽”！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_8_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:captaincamo}{SAY:winnie}看来进化让你失败了，卡莫。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_8_INTRO_2": "{SAY:captaincamo}都不够强？嘘。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_8_INTRO_3": "{SAY:captaincamo}反正没关系。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_8_INTRO_4": "{EXCITED:captaincamo}如果我没有超级战士...我会复仇！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_8_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}什么复仇？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_8_INTRO_6": "{SAY:captaincamo}你抬头仰望过晴朗的夜空吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_8_INTRO_7": "{SAY:captaincamo}睡不着？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_8_INTRO_8": "{SAY:captaincamo}然后...你看...那个。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_8_INTRO_9": "{SAY:crazydave}看到什么了吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_8_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，我正在检测到强大的激光。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_8_INTRO_11": "{EXCITED:winnie}它一直处于隐形状态......它在迷彩的火箭上！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_8_INTRO_12": "{SAY:captaincamo}没错。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_8_INTRO_13": "{PLAYFUL:captaincamo}现在你明白了......",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_8_INTRO_14": "{SAY:winnie}它指向月亮！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_8_INTRO_15": "{SAY:winnie}卡莫将军正试图炸毁月球！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_8_INTRO_16": "{PLAYFUL:captaincamo}宾果游戏。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_8_INTRO_17": "{SAY:crazydave}什么！？他为什么要这么做？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_8_INTRO_18": "{SAY:crazydave}上面有一只可爱的兔子！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_8_INTRO_19": "{SAY:winnie}卡莫将军，炸毁月球对于你这样的人来说没有任何好处。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_8_INTRO_20": "{SAY:winnie}你为什么要这么做？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_8_INTRO_21": "{EXCITED:captaincamo}哦相信我垃圾堆，我完全知道我在做什么。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_8_INTRO_22": "{SAY:captaincamo}这将证明我对所有僵尸的力量，但最重要的是-",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_8_INTRO_23": "{SHOUT:captaincamo}摆脱那个白痴的愚蠢丑陋的杯子！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_8_INTRO_24": "{SHOUT:captaincamo}你们怎么能每晚都带着那张无知的脸盯着你们睡觉！？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_8_INTRO_25": "{SAY:winnie}Bzzt...",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_8_INTRO_26": "{TIRED:crazydave}哦。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_8_INTRO_27": "{TIRED:crazydave}噢，甜甜的玉米卷。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_8_INTRO_28": "{SAY:winnie}所以这就是这个？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_8_INTRO_29": "{SAY:winnie}僵王博士把他的脸雕刻成月亮？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_8_INTRO_30": "{SAY:captaincamo}我不会让那座愚蠢的纪念碑留在夜空中！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_8_INTRO_31": "{EXCITED:captaincamo}他的自我很快就会崩溃！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_8_INTRO_32": "{NPC_EXIT:captaincamo}{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，我正在检测激光炮充电。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_8_INTRO_33": "{SAY:winnie}三天后就可以正常使用了！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_8_INTRO_34": "{TIRED:crazydave}哦兄弟。现在看来，这实在是太卑鄙了。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_9_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:captaincamo}{PLAYFUL:captaincamo}哈！你们这些白痴专注于激光而忘记了辐射！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_9_INTRO_2": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:winnie}这不是诈唬吗！？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_9_INTRO_3": "{SAY:captaincamo}你这个白痴机器。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_9_INTRO_4": "{SAY:captaincamo}感谢你们俩的愚蠢，我得到了我来这里的一切。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_9_INTRO_5": "{SAY:captaincamo}我的一些部队已经浸泡在辐射的好处中！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_9_INTRO_6": "{SAY:captaincamo}我的激光炮即将抹去国王脸上的笑容！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_9_INTRO_7": "{EXCITED:captaincamo}愚者之王！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_9_INTRO_8": "{NPC_EXIT:captaincamo}{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，我正在检测属性增强的僵尸。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_9_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}迷彩确实没有说谎。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_9_INTRO_10": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SAY:crazydave}呃，什么？抱歉，我吃掉了地上所有的时髦奶酪。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_10_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:winnie}迷彩，今天我们要对你们的火箭发起全面正面攻击！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_10_INTRO_2": "{EXCITED:crazydave}是啊！我们不能让你毁掉月亮！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_10_INTRO_3": "{NPC_ENTER:captaincamo}{SAY:captaincamo}哦，形势真是逆转了。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_10_INTRO_4": "{SAY:captaincamo}我的部队已经吸收了这块石头上剩下的所有辐射。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_10_INTRO_5": "{SAY:captaincamo}而你的植物现在成了在打扮的角色。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_10_INTRO_6": "{SAY:captaincamo}那么你打算怎么打败我呢？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_10_INTRO_7": "{SAY:crazydave}你显然从没看过漫画书。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_10_INTRO_8": "{EXCITED:crazydave}坏人像你们总是会输！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_10_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}此外，我们的武器库里有你能要求的所有英雄植物。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_10_INTRO_10": "{SHOUT:captaincamo}什么！？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_10_INTRO_11": "{SAY:winnie}你不是唯一一个有伎俩的人。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_10_INTRO_12": "{EXCITED:crazydave}没错！这就是英雄对恶棍所做的事！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_10_INTRO_13": "{SAY:captaincamo}所以它充满了战争，是吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_10_INTRO_14": "{SAY:captaincamo}不知道你们这些白痴有没有意识到……",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_10_INTRO_15": "{SHOUT:captaincamo}我专攻战争！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_10_INTRO_16": "{SHOUT:captaincamo}开始吧！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_10_INTRO_17": "{SHOUT:captaincamo}咳咳咳喘息声",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_10_INTRO_18": "{TIRED:captaincamo}唔。得减轻喊叫了。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_10_INTRO_19": "{SAY:captaincamo}来吧。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_10_OUTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:captaincamo}{TIRED:captaincamo}呼... 吸...",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_10_OUTRO_2": "{TIRED:captaincamo}你们这些卑鄙的园丁……",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_10_OUTRO_3": "{TIRED:captaincamo}你让我恶心。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_10_OUTRO_4": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}厌倦了整天指挥其他僵尸？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_10_OUTRO_5": "{SAY:captaincamo}你闭嘴。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_10_OUTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}你的激光炮已被成功摧毁，卡莫。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_10_OUTRO_7": "{EXCITED:crazydave}是啊！拿那个！盖伊将军教授！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_10_OUTRO_8": "{TIRED:captaincamo}我不是教授，你这个白痴。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_10_OUTRO_9": "{SAY:crazydave}这就是你的反派名字！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_10_OUTRO_10": "{SAY:captaincamo}呃啊...",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_10_OUTRO_11": "{SHOUT:captaincamo}部队们！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_10_OUTRO_12": "{SAY:captaincamo}战术撤退！现在！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_10_OUTRO_13": "{SAY:captaincamo}上船。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_10_OUTRO_14": "{SAY:captaincamo}呵...",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_10_OUTRO_15": "{SAY:captaincamo}毕竟我的计划之一还是完成了。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_10_OUTRO_16": "{SAY:captaincamo}我的大部分部队都从辐射中获得了能量。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_10_OUTRO_17": "{SAY:captaincamo}把这块岩石吸干了。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_10_OUTRO_18": "{SAY:captaincamo}虽然你阻止了我的复仇，但我赢了。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_10_OUTRO_19": "{SAY:captaincamo}这不适合你。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_10_OUTRO_20": "{SAY:captaincamo}部队！准备起飞！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_10_OUTRO_21": "{NPC_EXIT:captaincamo}{EXCITED:crazydave}对于刚吃过灰尘的人来说真是大话！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_10_OUTRO_22": "{SAY:winnie}恐怕他是对的，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_10_OUTRO_23": "{SAY:winnie}我们未能阻止他增强部队实力的阴谋。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_10_OUTRO_24": "{SAY:winnie}这将来可能会很麻烦。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_10_OUTRO_25": "{SAY:crazydave}加油朋朋！看看它好的一面！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_10_OUTRO_26": "{SAY:crazydave}我们把它粘到了坏人身上！没有人受伤！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_10_OUTRO_27": "{SAY:crazydave}你知道我叫它什么吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_METEORZ_10_OUTRO_28": "{SAY:crazydave}一次美好的英雄冒险！",
  "NARRATIVE_PREMIUM_QUEST_BEACH_1_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，为什么又回到了巨浪海滩？",
  "NARRATIVE_PREMIUM_QUEST_BEACH_1_INTRO_2": "{SAY:crazydave}你没听说过吗，朋朋？他们开了一家新的礼品店！",
  "NARRATIVE_PREMIUM_QUEST_BEACH_1_INTRO_3": "{SAY:crazydave}我什至还给自己买了这个甜点，是那里独一无二的纪念品！",
  "NARRATIVE_PREMIUM_QUEST_BEACH_1_INTRO_4": "{SAY:crazydave}这意味着让我非常幸运！",
  "NARRATIVE_PREMIUM_QUEST_BEACH_1_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}正在扫描……",
  "NARRATIVE_PREMIUM_QUEST_BEACH_1_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，看来僵尸卖给了你一块普通的石头。",
  "NARRATIVE_PREMIUM_QUEST_BEACH_1_INTRO_7": "{SAY:crazydave}糟糕...",
  "NARRATIVE_PREMIUM_QUEST_BEACH_1_INTRO_8": "{SAY:crazydave}我想我会扔掉它......",
  "NARRATIVE_PREMIUM_QUEST_BEACH_1_INTRO_9": "{NPC_EXIT:crazydave}{SAY:winnie}扫描显示用户戴夫不是这家店唯一的顾客。",
  "NARRATIVE_PREMIUM_QUEST_BEACH_1_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}店里除了卖便宜的纪念品外，还卖这个时期的僵尸充气玩具。",
  "NARRATIVE_PREMIUM_QUEST_BEACH_1_INTRO_11": "{SAY:winnie}穿着这些鸭管的僵尸将在水中增加机动性。保持警惕。",
  "NARRATIVE_PREMIUM_QUEST_BEACH_2_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SAY:crazydave}嘿邻居，看看吧！",
  "NARRATIVE_PREMIUM_QUEST_BEACH_2_INTRO_2": "{SAY:crazydave}这个酸液柠檬家伙可以对这些僵尸的坚固装甲造成真正的伤害！",
  "NARRATIVE_PREMIUM_QUEST_BEACH_2_INTRO_3": "{SAY:crazydave}不仅如此，他还可以扔出他的那片来将他们推回去！很酷吧？",
  "NARRATIVE_PREMIUM_QUEST_BEACH_2_INTRO_4": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:winnie}分析得很好用户戴夫，我印象深刻！",
  "NARRATIVE_PREMIUM_QUEST_BEACH_2_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}你是怎么这么快就查到这些信息的？",
  "NARRATIVE_PREMIUM_QUEST_BEACH_2_INTRO_6": "{SAY:crazydave}嗯你看朋朋，昨天我扔那块石头的时候，我听到有人痛苦地叫喊！",
  "NARRATIVE_PREMIUM_QUEST_BEACH_2_INTRO_7": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}原来我不小心在这里撞到了这家伙！",
  "NARRATIVE_PREMIUM_QUEST_BEACH_2_INTRO_8": "{SAY:crazydave}可怜的东西，这可能就是它看起来痛苦尖叫的原因。",
  "NARRATIVE_PREMIUM_QUEST_BEACH_2_INTRO_9": "{SAY:crazydave}这确实让他释放了一些酸，这就是我注意到他所做的事情的方式。",
  "NARRATIVE_PREMIUM_QUEST_BEACH_2_INTRO_10": "{SAY:crazydave}但是在那里！你看，朋朋？这块石头很幸运！它给我们带来了一个新的盟友！",
  "NARRATIVE_PREMIUM_QUEST_BEACH_2_INTRO_11": "{SAY:crazydave}我们要用它去寻找一些宝藏，然后送给他作为歉意！",
  "NARRATIVE_PREMIUM_QUEST_BEACH_2_INTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}感谢你对新朋友用户戴夫的关心，但你的寻宝活动还得等一等。",
  "NARRATIVE_PREMIUM_QUEST_BEACH_2_INTRO_13": "{SAY:winnie}僵尸已经意识到我们的存在。",
  "NARRATIVE_PREMIUM_QUEST_BEACH_2_INTRO_14": "{SAY:winnie}我们可以利用他和他的朋友来防守。",
  "NARRATIVE_PREMIUM_QUEST_BEACH_3_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}有宝藏吧朋朋？",
  "NARRATIVE_PREMIUM_QUEST_BEACH_3_INTRO_2": "{SAY:crazydave}到目前为止我们发现的只是这些派对动物留下的一堆垃圾！",
  "NARRATIVE_PREMIUM_QUEST_BEACH_3_INTRO_3": "{SAY:crazydave}这样下去，酸液柠檬不会原谅我的！",
  "NARRATIVE_PREMIUM_QUEST_BEACH_3_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}正在扫描……",
  "NARRATIVE_PREMIUM_QUEST_BEACH_3_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}这些僵尸废物将被潮汐移动经过我们的工厂，直到到达海岸线。",
  "NARRATIVE_PREMIUM_QUEST_BEACH_3_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}它是无害的，但我们的植物在漂浮时会被它们分散注意力。",
  "NARRATIVE_PREMIUM_QUEST_BEACH_3_INTRO_7": "{SAY:crazydave}说，也许我们的小伙伴会帮我们打扫卫生！",
  "NARRATIVE_PREMIUM_QUEST_BEACH_3_INTRO_8": "{SAY:crazydave}...",
  "NARRATIVE_PREMIUM_QUEST_BEACH_3_INTRO_9": "{SAY:crazydave}嘿邻居，你不觉得这个看起来有点眼熟吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_PREMIUM_QUEST_BEACH_5_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}大奖！看看我和我的幸运石发现了什么朋朋！",
  "NARRATIVE_PREMIUM_QUEST_BEACH_5_INTRO_2": "{SAY:crazydave}蛤蜊，也很大！",
  "NARRATIVE_PREMIUM_QUEST_BEACH_5_INTRO_3": "{SAY:crazydave}有了从他们那里得到的珍珠，我们就能买到完美的道歉礼物了！",
  "NARRATIVE_PREMIUM_QUEST_BEACH_5_INTRO_4": "{SAY:crazydave}你想要的剧透我都给你买！",
  "NARRATIVE_PREMIUM_QUEST_BEACH_5_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}虽然我很欣赏用户戴夫的情绪，但这些“蛤蜊”似乎是伪装的僵尸。",
  "NARRATIVE_PREMIUM_QUEST_BEACH_5_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}他们全力以赴，遇到植物时会采取防御姿势。",
  "NARRATIVE_PREMIUM_QUEST_BEACH_5_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}然而，一旦他们的硬壳被破坏，他们就会像往常一样继续步行。",
  "NARRATIVE_PREMIUM_QUEST_BEACH_5_INTRO_8": "{TIRED:crazydave}我也正要抓起我的木槌！",
  "NARRATIVE_PREMIUM_QUEST_BEACH_7_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}我的分析表明存在另一种类型的贝壳僵尸。",
  "NARRATIVE_PREMIUM_QUEST_BEACH_7_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}与重量级对手不同，它们会猛烈地攻击附近的植物而不是保护自己。",
  "NARRATIVE_PREMIUM_QUEST_BEACH_7_INTRO_3": "{SAY:crazydave}小心你的手指！那里有僵尸，他会咬人！",
  "NARRATIVE_PREMIUM_QUEST_BEACH_7_INTRO_4": "{SAY:crazydave}最糟糕的是，还没有珍珠！",
  "NARRATIVE_PREMIUM_QUEST_BEACH_9_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，在你的寻宝之旅中，我有了一个发现。",
  "NARRATIVE_PREMIUM_QUEST_BEACH_9_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}看来我们并不是唯一回到巨浪海滩的人。",
  "NARRATIVE_PREMIUM_QUEST_BEACH_9_INTRO_3": "{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}你的假设是正确的，机器！",
  "NARRATIVE_PREMIUM_QUEST_BEACH_9_INTRO_4": "{SAY:crazydave}僵王！你在这里做什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_PREMIUM_QUEST_BEACH_9_INTRO_5": "{SAY:zombossicon}哈哈！你不想知道吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_PREMIUM_QUEST_BEACH_9_INTRO_6": "{SAY:zombossicon}你猜怎么着！？我不会告诉你的！",
  "NARRATIVE_PREMIUM_QUEST_BEACH_9_INTRO_7": "{SAY:zombossicon}邪恶的天才可以隐藏一些秘密！",
  "NARRATIVE_PREMIUM_QUEST_BEACH_9_INTRO_8": "{SAY:zombossicon}知道它是为一个伟大的、完全邪恶的、邪恶的计划服务的！完全！",
  "NARRATIVE_PREMIUM_QUEST_BEACH_9_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}海滩垃圾增多的原因是你吗僵王？",
  "NARRATIVE_PREMIUM_QUEST_BEACH_9_INTRO_10": "{SAY:zombossicon}你真的认为我是世界上所有坏事的根源吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_PREMIUM_QUEST_BEACH_9_INTRO_11": "{SAY:zombossicon}虽然我希望如此，但这个废物的出现与我无关！",
  "NARRATIVE_PREMIUM_QUEST_BEACH_9_INTRO_12": "{SAY:zombossicon}最近这里举办了一场声势浩大的聚会，带来了极大的污染！",
  "NARRATIVE_PREMIUM_QUEST_BEACH_9_INTRO_13": "{SAY:zombossicon}现在我不得不处理这个巨大的混乱，抱怨，抱怨。",
  "NARRATIVE_PREMIUM_QUEST_BEACH_9_INTRO_14": "{SAY:crazydave}那是什么，老板？",
  "NARRATIVE_PREMIUM_QUEST_BEACH_9_INTRO_15": "{SAY:zombossicon}没什么！我这次的计划与你们无关！",
  "NARRATIVE_PREMIUM_QUEST_BEACH_9_INTRO_16": "{SAY:zombossicon}留在原地，因为我没有任何特殊原因地仔细阅读这片废物海洋！",
  "NARRATIVE_PREMIUM_QUEST_BEACH_9_INTRO_17": "{NPC_EXIT:zombossicon}{SAY:winnie}僵王博士似乎一如既往地有自己的议程。",
  "NARRATIVE_PREMIUM_QUEST_BEACH_9_INTRO_18": "{SAY:winnie}这很可能与海滩上乱扔垃圾有关。",
  "NARRATIVE_PREMIUM_QUEST_BEACH_9_INTRO_19": "{SAY:crazydave}你是说他在这些垃圾中自己寻宝吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_PREMIUM_QUEST_BEACH_9_INTRO_20": "{SAY:crazydave}喘气！不能让他先拿到宝藏！幸运石，指引我们！",
  "NARRATIVE_PREMIUM_QUEST_BEACH_12_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}该死！我别无选择！",
  "NARRATIVE_PREMIUM_QUEST_BEACH_12_INTRO_2": "{SAY:zombossicon}我妈妈把我的手绑在这儿了，所以我只能向你们这些穿越者坦白。",
  "NARRATIVE_PREMIUM_QUEST_BEACH_12_INTRO_3": "{SAY:zombossicon}你不会碰巧看到过- *低语*？",
  "NARRATIVE_PREMIUM_QUEST_BEACH_12_INTRO_4": "{SAY:crazydave}大声说话老板，我们听不到你的声音！",
  "NARRATIVE_PREMIUM_QUEST_BEACH_12_INTRO_5": "{SAY:zombossicon}一块石头！我正在寻找我侄子的被毁的“宠物”岩石！",
  "NARRATIVE_PREMIUM_QUEST_BEACH_12_INTRO_6": "{SAY:zombossicon}诅咒他和他的愚蠢党！他不仅偷走了我的时间科技来旅行到这里-",
  "NARRATIVE_PREMIUM_QUEST_BEACH_12_INTRO_7": "{SAY:zombossicon}他几乎逍遥法外，因为我的女族长老大不准我碰他一根手指头！",
  "NARRATIVE_PREMIUM_QUEST_BEACH_12_INTRO_8": "{SAY:zombossicon}不仅如此——现在我还要处理他更多的愚蠢混乱——",
  "NARRATIVE_PREMIUM_QUEST_BEACH_12_INTRO_9": "{SAY:zombossicon}我该如何为他丢失宠物石头负责？ “哦，这是你的时间机器，乔吉——”",
  "NARRATIVE_PREMIUM_QUEST_BEACH_12_INTRO_10": "{SAY:zombossicon}闭嘴，老太婆！错的就是你！",
  "NARRATIVE_PREMIUM_QUEST_BEACH_12_INTRO_11": "{SAY:zombossicon}我已经告诉过你我正在用实验性时间机器模型替换冰箱！",
  "NARRATIVE_PREMIUM_QUEST_BEACH_12_INTRO_12": "{SAY:zombossicon}这怎么是我的错！？她应该是阻止他愚蠢地自我放逐的人！",
  "NARRATIVE_PREMIUM_QUEST_BEACH_12_INTRO_13": "{SAY:zombossicon}哦，我多么渴望能和这个有问题的孩子报仇啊——有一天……",
  "NARRATIVE_PREMIUM_QUEST_BEACH_12_INTRO_14": "{SAY:zombossicon}我永远被我的家族纽带所诅咒！",
  "NARRATIVE_PREMIUM_QUEST_BEACH_12_INTRO_15": "{SAY:zombossicon}呸！我这样做只是为了防止下一场食物大战晚餐变得又一场艰难！",
  "NARRATIVE_PREMIUM_QUEST_BEACH_12_INTRO_16": "{SAY:zombossicon}否则我永远不会听到它的结局......",
  "NARRATIVE_PREMIUM_QUEST_BEACH_12_INTRO_17": "{EXCITED:winnie}一块石头，你说？用户戴夫，可以吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_PREMIUM_QUEST_BEACH_12_INTRO_18": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}你是说这个吗？这是我的幸运石！",
  "NARRATIVE_PREMIUM_QUEST_BEACH_12_INTRO_19": "{SAY:zombossicon}...",
  "NARRATIVE_PREMIUM_QUEST_BEACH_12_INTRO_20": "{SAY:zombossicon}就是这样！你怎么——",
  "NARRATIVE_PREMIUM_QUEST_BEACH_12_INTRO_21": "{SAY:zombossicon}好吧，没关系！当我取回它时，留在原地！",
  "NARRATIVE_PREMIUM_QUEST_BEACH_12_INTRO_22": "{SAY:zombossicon}无论如何，有人会养一块石头作为宠物吗？我侄子的愚蠢无边无际！",
  "NARRATIVE_PREMIUM_QUEST_BEACH_12_INTRO_23": "{SAY:zombossicon}至少我有一个明智的理由来养一个宠物金鱼缸！",
  "NARRATIVE_PREMIUM_QUEST_BEACH_12_INTRO_24": "{SAY:zombossicon}呸！",
  "NARRATIVE_PREMIUM_QUEST_BEACH_12_OUTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}你可能打败了我，但我得到了我来这里的目的！",
  "NARRATIVE_PREMIUM_QUEST_BEACH_12_OUTRO_2": "{SAY:zombossicon}诅咒你，机器，诅咒你，大卫，诅咒你，你这个愚蠢的摇滚伴侣！",
  "NARRATIVE_PREMIUM_QUEST_BEACH_12_OUTRO_3": "{SAY:zombossicon}诅咒你，你是一个亲戚的对不起借口，破坏了僵王'的遗产，游手好闲的兄弟的树懒后代--",
  "NARRATIVE_PREMIUM_QUEST_BEACH_12_OUTRO_4": "{NPC_EXIT:zombossicon}{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}拿走也没关系朋朋...",
  "NARRATIVE_PREMIUM_QUEST_BEACH_12_OUTRO_5": "{SAY:crazydave}我们不需要一些花哨的魔法石来寻找宝藏......",
  "NARRATIVE_PREMIUM_QUEST_BEACH_12_OUTRO_6": "{SAY:crazydave}因为我们真正找到的是最好的宝藏！",
  "NARRATIVE_PREMIUM_QUEST_BEACH_12_OUTRO_7": "{SAY:crazydave}我们一路上结识的新朋友！",
  "NARRATIVE_PREMIUM_QUEST_BEACH_12_OUTRO_8": "{TIRED:winnie}用户戴夫，我不认为这是你应该从这一切中学到的教训。",
  "NARRATIVE_PREMIUM_QUEST_BEACH_12_OUTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}我也不认为这里有任何值得学习的教训。",
  "NARRATIVE_PREMIUM_QUEST_BEACH_12_OUTRO_10": "{TIRED:winnie}我们回家吧，别再提这件事了。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_1_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}朋朋，发生了什么？我们为什么停下来？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_1_INTRO_2": "{TIRED:winnie}抱歉，用户戴夫，我突然没力气了。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_1_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}看来我们目前陷入困境。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_1_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}而且我无法确定我们当前的位置。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_1_INTRO_5": "{SAY:crazydave}该死，我以为这是回家最快的路线了。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_1_INTRO_6": "{TIRED:crazydave}我知道我们应该在西部荒野左转...",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_1_INTRO_7": "{SAY:crazydave}上次向旅行日志问路。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_1_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}看来这条高速公路还在建设中。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_1_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}这是一个新现象，跨时空运输似乎变得更加普遍。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_1_INTRO_10": "{EXCITED:crazydave}哦，我看到一些僵企 doohickeys 正在出售！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_1_INTRO_11": "{SAY:crazydave}显然他们正在尝试“将时间旅行商业化”或类似的东西。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_1_INTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}也许这就是我们说话时僵尸在这条高速公路上工作的原因。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_1_INTRO_13": "{SAY:crazydave}请问他们有没有多余的jerry可以用吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_1_INTRO_14": "{SAY:winnie}我建议不要这样做，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_1_INTRO_15": "{SAY:winnie}充电时要保持谨慎。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_1_INTRO_16": "{SAY:winnie}毕竟他们是僵尸。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_2_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{TIRED:winnie}用户戴夫，我很遗憾地通知你，但我们似乎并不是唯一被困在这条次元高速公路上的人。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_2_INTRO_2": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我看得出来！以前我们开车时我见过传送门来来去去……",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_2_INTRO_3": "{EXCITED:crazydave}...但这是第一次如此亲密和私人！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_2_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}看起来还没有结束，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_2_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}我们的出现似乎吸引了这片“无人区”的其他居民。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_2_INTRO_6": "{SAY:crazydave}宇宙风滚草？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_2_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}这样的话事情就简单多了。我指的是搭便车的人，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_2_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}被困在时间线裂缝中的僵尸。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_2_INTRO_9": "{SAY:crazydave}哦，原来如此！我通常只是开车经过它们，就像传送门一样！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_2_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}这次情况没有给我们提供这样的奢侈，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_2_INTRO_11": "{SAY:winnie}我怀疑这些僵尸会试图搭我们的便车离开这个地方。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_2_INTRO_12": "{SAY:crazydave}我不会免费搭僵尸的！尤其是那些拿着铲子来势汹汹的！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_2_INTRO_13": "{SAY:crazydave}等等，我认为这不是处理铲子的正确方法。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_2_INTRO_14": "{SAY:winnie}确实，用户戴夫。这些丧尸因为某种原因被遗弃在这里。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_2_INTRO_15": "{SAY:winnie}但统一因素似乎是他们与同龄人相比的异常行为。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_2_INTRO_16": "{SAY:winnie}所以保持警惕。我们可能会发现一些熟悉的面孔的行为方式与我们习惯的完全不同。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_3_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}好吧朋朋，我要对你说实话了。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_3_INTRO_2": "{TIRED:crazydave}这个地方有点让我害怕。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_3_INTRO_3": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我的意思是，他们把铲子举过头顶！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_3_INTRO_4": "{EXCITED:crazydave}你不应该这么做！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_3_INTRO_5": "{TIRED:winnie}这种跨维度的怪异似乎是一个持续的主题。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_3_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}我感觉到地平线上有更多奇怪的僵尸。在这种情况下，",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_3_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}字面上的意思。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_3_INTRO_8": "{SAY:crazydave}我们现在会遇到什么样的怪人呢？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_3_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}看起来他们更有可能遇到我们，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_3_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}我感觉到前方交通拥堵。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_3_INTRO_11": "{SAY:winnie}这是由于对跨次元高速公路的恐惧而引起的。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_3_INTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}松散的一群未驯服的翻滚黄鼠狼。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_3_INTRO_13": "{SAY:winnie}他们跟随时间之风在裂缝中漫游。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_3_INTRO_14": "{SAY:winnie}一般建议是立即寻求庇护。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_3_INTRO_15": "{TIRED:crazydave}朋朋，我害怕。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_4_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，我有东西要在扫描仪上给你看......",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_4_INTRO_2": "{SAY:crazydave}这次会是什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_4_INTRO_3": "{EXCITED:crazydave}哦！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_4_INTRO_4": "{EXCITED:crazydave}所以这就是这些去的地方！我已经很久没见过这些家伙了！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_4_INTRO_5": "{EXCITED:winnie}你以前遇到过这些奇特的僵尸吗，用户戴夫？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_4_INTRO_6": "{SAY:crazydave}没错朋朋！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_4_INTRO_7": "{SAY:crazydave}邻居，还记得他们装扮成植物试图闯入你家吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_4_INTRO_8": "{SAY:crazydave}那时候植物连路都走不了！他们没有欺骗任何人！美好时光。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_4_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，我的传感器确实确定这些奇怪的僵尸有一些共同的DNA成分",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_4_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}...还有我们在旅途中遇到的植物。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_4_INTRO_11": "{SAY:crazydave}恶心！你是说它们不是假装成植物？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_4_INTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}根据你的描述和他们的突然消失......",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_4_INTRO_13": "{SAY:winnie}僵王博士很可能认为这些僵尸植物杂交体是失败的实验。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_4_INTRO_14": "{SAY:winnie}...并把它们扔到这里来彻底埋葬该项目。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_4_INTRO_15": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}邻居，给这些怪人带路吧！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_4_INTRO_16": "{TIRED:crazydave}我需要一分钟，我想我要生病了......",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_6_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SAY:crazydave}这次不需要扫描仪了，朋朋。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_6_INTRO_2": "{SAY:crazydave}我一直在训练我的眼睛。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_6_INTRO_3": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}如果我足够努力......我可以成为双筒望远镜。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_6_INTRO_4": "{SAY:crazydave}哦什么-",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_6_INTRO_5": "{EXCITED:crazydave}那是什么！？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_6_INTRO_6": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}嗯，这是一种奇特的滚筒压路机。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_6_INTRO_7": "{EXCITED:crazydave}不，不是他！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_6_INTRO_8": "{EXCITED:crazydave}长着一张娃娃脸的巨人僵尸到底是什么？！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_6_INTRO_9": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我以前见过小鬼僵尸gantuars，但这更糟糕！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_6_INTRO_10": "{SAY:crazydave}你偶然找到燃料了吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_6_INTRO_11": "{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，我不需要燃料。请记住，我是一辆电动汽车。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_6_INTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}只要等我充值就够了。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_6_INTRO_13": "{SAY:crazydave}但是朋朋，我们已经别无选择了。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_6_INTRO_14": "{SAY:crazydave}朋朋...你需要成为燃料。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_6_INTRO_15": "{SAY:winnie}就别看脸了，用户戴夫。遮住你的眼睛。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_7_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{PLAYFUL:crazydave}早上好，嘶-*咳嗽*。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_7_INTRO_2": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}*咳嗽*，*咳嗽*，*咳嗽*。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_7_INTRO_3": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{PLAYFUL:crazydave}朋朋，我是不是又带着一包特辣薯条睡着了*咳嗽*？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_7_INTRO_4": "{TIRED:crazydave}因为，*咳嗽*我感觉不太舒服。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_7_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}负，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_7_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}虽然今天我在空气中检测到了很大比例的薯片粉尘。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_7_INTRO_7": "{SAY:crazydave}然后，我*咳嗽*忘了清理前座的包。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_7_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}我相信你不是原因。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_7_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}我的扫描仪检测到僵尸和薯片之间存在非常不稳定的混合物。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_7_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}好像植物僵尸融合实验的一些遗留物已经进化成了新的物种……",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_7_INTRO_11": "{TIRED:winnie}...现在使用不同时代的植物。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_7_INTRO_12": "{TIRED:crazydave}哦。他们现在进化了。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_7_INTRO_13": "{TIRED:crazydave}太棒了。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_9_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{TIRED:crazydave}这些怪人到底是从哪里来的？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_9_INTRO_2": "{TIRED:crazydave}为什么次元高速公路上有这么多？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_9_INTRO_3": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}我在充电时做了一些研究，我想我可能有一个合理的理论。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_9_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}僵尸和我们自己可以旅行到具有定义入口点的所有可访问时间时代。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_9_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}所有前往它们的僵尸都必须能够通过这些入口点。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_9_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}直到最近，这还需要得到僵王博士或其他来自不同时代的强大僵尸的批准。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_9_INTRO_7": "{SAY:crazydave}所以，你是说……没人想让他们进来？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_9_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}基本上是的。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_9_INTRO_9": "{EXCITED:crazydave}好吧，我明白为什么了！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_9_INTRO_10": "{SAY:crazydave}至少有任何放缓的迹象吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_9_INTRO_11": "{SAY:winnie}区域邻近扫描，用户戴夫。结果仍然显示逐渐增加。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_9_INTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}更具体地说，更多的搭便车的人正涌向我们的方向。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_9_INTRO_13": "{SAY:crazydave}哇，你能想象成为一个没有人愿意进入某个时期的僵尸吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_9_INTRO_14": "{SAY:crazydave}我有点拿到娃娃脸的情况下......",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_9_INTRO_15": "{SAY:crazydave}...但我也见过一些僵尸，它们只是有令人讨厌的噱头。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_9_INTRO_16": "{SAY:crazydave}想象一下，你是如此烦人，甚至连你的同龄人都不让你进来。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_10_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，我正在检测到另一个僵尸威胁正在逼近。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_10_INTRO_2": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SAY:crazydave}再来一个？伙计，这里有这么多僵尸，我感觉有点糟糕。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_10_INTRO_3": "{SAY:crazydave}老板在这里抛弃了很多人，很多人都迷失了......",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_10_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}那么你就不会喜欢听The Sniffer了。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_10_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}小鬼僵尸拥有大鼻子，宁愿闻我们的植物也不愿吃它们。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_10_INTRO_6": "{SAY:crazydave}被困在所有僵尸放克必须的地方-",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_10_INTRO_7": "{SAY:crazydave}等等！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_10_INTRO_8": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我认得这家伙！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_10_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}你知道吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_10_INTRO_10": "{EXCITED:crazydave}是啊！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_10_INTRO_11": "{EXCITED:crazydave}他在这个非常奇怪的梦中，我在吃完辣酱后做了一段时间。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_10_INTRO_12": "{TIRED:crazydave}我不太记得了，只是觉得太疯狂了。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_10_INTRO_13": "{SAY:crazydave}也就是说我一定能看到未来！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_10_INTRO_14": "{SAY:crazydave}我应该找个时间尝试在squirbo比赛中下注！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_10_INTRO_15": "{SAY:winnie}一步一步，用户戴夫。我的电量已经达到 62.5%，所以我们还得再坚持一段时间。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_10_INTRO_16": "{EXCITED:crazydave}是啊，我不想让这家伙进来……",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_10_INTRO_17": "{EXCITED:crazydave}...嗅嗅我珍贵的《Leapfrog Quarterly》收藏！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_10_INTRO_18": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}它仍然完好无损！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_11_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{TIRED:crazydave}朋朋...",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_11_INTRO_2": "{TIRED:crazydave}朋朋你需要充电...",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_11_INTRO_3": "{TIRED:crazydave}我看到了一些东西...",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_11_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}我正在努力，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_11_INTRO_5": "{SAY:crazydave}我想我开始产生幻觉了。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_11_INTRO_6": "{TIRED:crazydave}我什至开始看到头上戴着猕猴桃兽的僵尸......",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_11_INTRO_7": "{TIRED:crazydave}还有加特林豌豆...",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_11_INTRO_8": "{TIRED:winnie}用户戴夫，我不知道该怎么说...",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_14_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{TIRED:winnie}部落逼近。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_15_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{EXCITED:crazydave}嘿，小家伙们！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_15_INTRO_2": "{SAY:crazydave}你们都困在这里做什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_15_INTRO_3": "{EXCITED:crazydave}跳上我们的房车，我们送你回家！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_15_INTRO_4": "{SAY:crazydave}...等等！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_15_INTRO_5": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我不是说你！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_15_INTRO_6": "{SHOUT:crazydave}远离！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_15_INTRO_7": "{SHOUT:crazydave}我有除草剂！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_16_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:winnie}用户戴夫，充值完成93.75%。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_16_INTRO_2": "{EXCITED:winnie}今天应该可以出发了。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_16_INTRO_3": "{EXCITED:crazydave}太棒了！但话虽如此...",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_16_INTRO_4": "{SAY:crazydave}我们还得想办法离开这里。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_16_INTRO_5": "{SAY:crazydave}此时我已经有点忘记我们从哪里来了。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_16_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}正在扫描……",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_16_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}我检测到一张熟悉的面孔。难以置信...\n 在我们所有的对手中，",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_16_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}Zombert 可能是我们规划安全路线的关键。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_16_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}等等...",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_16_INTRO_10": "{EXCITED:winnie}我正在检测……两个僵尸？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_16_INTRO_11": "{SAY:winnie}不……五。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_16_INTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}这个数字只会不断增加。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_16_INTRO_13": "{SAY:crazydave}这不对。你能再运行一次吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_16_INTRO_14": "{SAY:winnie}看来，这不是一个错误。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_16_INTRO_15": "{SAY:winnie}这些僵尸显示出老鼠的平均智力水平。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_16_INTRO_16": "{SAY:crazydave}所以它们和原版一模一样？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_16_INTRO_17": "{SAY:winnie}我的意思是字面意义上的。他们几乎没有意识。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_16_INTRO_18": "{SAY:winnie}我相信这些都是被丢弃的克隆。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_16_INTRO_19": "{SAY:crazydave}没想到老板对他的侄子这么大方。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_16_INTRO_20": "{SAY:crazydave}等等，我现在才意识到。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_16_INTRO_21": "{EXCITED:crazydave}僵尸军队？！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_16_INTRO_22": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我们完蛋了！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_16_INTRO_23": "{SAY:winnie}振作起来，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_16_INTRO_24": "{SAY:winnie}这远不是一场斗智斗勇。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_16_INTRO_25": "{SAY:winnie}然而，这将是一场战斗。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_16_OUTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:winnie}我的系统再次全面运行！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_16_OUTRO_2": "{EXCITED:crazydave}哦，谢天谢地！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_16_OUTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}我们走哪条路线，用户戴夫？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_16_OUTRO_4": "{SAY:crazydave}我已经有计划了！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_16_OUTRO_5": "{SAY:crazydave}其中一个僵尸丢下了我的一张旧皮纳塔派对邀请函。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_16_OUTRO_6": "{SAY:crazydave}我们就跟着那群人走吧。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_16_OUTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}请提醒我，用户戴夫，你是怎么做到的...",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_16_OUTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}...时空丢失所有广告？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_RIFT_16_OUTRO_9": "{SAY:crazydave}已经十多年了，我不太记得了。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_PICKLEDPEPPER_1_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}朋朋，我们回来做什么？这是某人的生日吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_PICKLEDPEPPER_1_INTRO_2": "{TIRED:crazydave}糟糕。甚至无法为这个场合烤蛋糕......",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_PICKLEDPEPPER_1_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}负，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_PICKLEDPEPPER_1_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}我的扫描检测到需要跨时间救援的植物。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_PICKLEDPEPPER_1_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}看来剩下的节日疯狂已经体现了墨西哥胡椒的新变种。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_PICKLEDPEPPER_1_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}Pickled Pepper 的行为与它的前身非常相似。它会燃烧一个区域周围的僵尸。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_PICKLEDPEPPER_1_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}但是，它燃烧的是垂直柱而不是车道。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_PICKLEDPEPPER_1_INTRO_8": "{SAY:crazydave}腌制...胡椒？这个名字听起来很耳熟。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_PICKLEDPEPPER_1_INTRO_9": "{EXCITED:crazydave}太微弱了，我记不清了。无论如何，让我们把这株植物救活吧！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_PICKLEDPEPPER_3_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}Brr……那家伙怎么又跑回来了？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_PICKLEDPEPPER_3_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}泡椒是一种奇怪的植物，曾经被遗忘并消失在时间的长河中。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_PICKLEDPEPPER_3_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}很像我们之前拯救过的植物。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_PICKLEDPEPPER_3_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}所以我们需要跨越时空的大弯路才能捡起散落各处的包裹。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_PICKLEDPEPPER_3_INTRO_5": "{SAY:crazydave}可怜的东西……谁能让他们就这样到处漂泊呢？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_PICKLEDPEPPER_3_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}幸运的是，它对于草坪上的冰块非常有用。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_PICKLEDPEPPER_4_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:crazydave}又是这个地方？除了这里什么都可以！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_PICKLEDPEPPER_4_INTRO_2": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我不想和那些怪人混在一起！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_PICKLEDPEPPER_4_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，保持冷静。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_PICKLEDPEPPER_4_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}与我们之前的遭遇不同，我们可以随意退出。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_PICKLEDPEPPER_4_INTRO_5": "{TIRED:winnie}还有，请不要再对着虚空尖叫。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_PICKLEDPEPPER_4_INTRO_6": "{TIRED:winnie}如前所述，不会发生回声。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_PICKLEDPEPPER_4_INTRO_7": "{SAY:crazydave}哇。这是我来这里唯一的乐趣！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_PICKLEDPEPPER_8_OUTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}我们成功救出了泡椒。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_PICKLEDPEPPER_8_OUTRO_2": "{SAY:crazydave}现在我已经近距离看到它了...我仍然不能完全把手指放在上面。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_PICKLEDPEPPER_8_OUTRO_3": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}但是嘿，幸好你不再迷失在时间里了！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_PICKLEDPEPPER_8_OUTRO_4": "{EXCITED:crazydave}希望您喜欢我们的公司！其他植物很乐意闲逛！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_EIGHTIES_1_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}我的声纳在霓虹旋音游发现了一些很有价值的东西。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_EIGHTIES_1_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}我建议在继续扫描时保持更长的时间。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_EIGHTIES_1_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}与此同时，我还发现了新的僵尸威胁。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_EIGHTIES_1_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}贝斯手僵尸目前正在巡回演出，无论当前正在演奏什么即兴演奏。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_EIGHTIES_1_INTRO_5": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{EXCITED:crazydave}希望你带了护耳器，邻居！他们的扬声器可不是开玩笑的！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_EIGHTIES_1_INTRO_6": "{SAY:crazydave}幸运的是，我得到了紧急芝士泡芙！我想分享，但我已经全力以赴了！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_EIGHTIES_1_OUTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，我的声纳扫描结果已经返回。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_EIGHTIES_1_OUTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}看来僵尸在这个时期正在移动大量的宝石。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_EIGHTIES_1_OUTRO_3": "{SAY:crazydave}他们一定是在用它们做点什么，朋朋！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_EIGHTIES_1_OUTRO_4": "{SAY:crazydave}他们想用它来购买什么东西一定不好！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_EIGHTIES_1_OUTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}如果我们动作快的话，也许能够拦截他们。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_EIGHTIES_1_OUTRO_6": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我们还在等什么？让我们一起摇滚吧！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_EIGHTIES_5_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SHOUT:crazydave}这些派对动物焦躁不安！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_EIGHTIES_5_INTRO_2": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}别担心，用户戴夫。我已经为今天的攻击做好了充分的防御准备。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_EIGHTIES_5_INTRO_3": "{SAY:crazydave}好电话，朋朋！这应该让他们忙碌一段时间！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_EIGHTIES_5_INTRO_4": "{SAY:crazydave}...",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_EIGHTIES_5_INTRO_5": "{SAY:crazydave}*嗅一嗅*",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_EIGHTIES_5_INTRO_6": "{SAY:crazydave}说，邻居，你闻到了吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_EIGHTIES_5_OUTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:crazydave}好火啊！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_EIGHTIES_5_OUTRO_2": "{SAY:crazydave}让我想起了Disco Zombie录的那一则汽水广告。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_EIGHTIES_5_OUTRO_3": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}他就像一根会走路的火柴！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_EIGHTIES_5_OUTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}我们很幸运有密集胡萝卜的帮助来恢复我们的防御。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_EIGHTIES_5_OUTRO_5": "{SAY:crazydave}说，朋朋，你觉得它们也能帮助恢复头发吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_EIGHTIES_5_OUTRO_6": "{SAY:crazydave}找朋友。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_EIGHTIES_5_OUTRO_7": "{TIRED:winnie}现在还不是时候，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_EIGHTIES_10_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}我的雷达检测到我们要找的宝石就在附近。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_EIGHTIES_10_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}不幸的是，丧尸想要对他们做什么的计划已经完成了。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_EIGHTIES_10_INTRO_3": "{SAY:crazydave}该死的！他们一定也听到了我们的风声！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_EIGHTIES_10_INTRO_4": "{SAY:crazydave}大道堆叠！我们就这样找不到他们了！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_EIGHTIES_10_INTRO_5": "{SAY:crazydave}邻居，如果你今天能分散他们的注意力的话……",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_EIGHTIES_10_INTRO_6": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我和朋朋可以尝试确定宝石的位置！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_EIGHTIES_10_INTRO_7": "{SAY:crazydave}祝你好运！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_EIGHTIES_10_OUTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:crazydave}干得好，邻居！你震撼了他们的世界！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_EIGHTIES_10_OUTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}确实如此。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_EIGHTIES_10_OUTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}Me 和用户戴夫已经找到了宝石，以及它们的用途。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_EIGHTIES_10_OUTRO_4": "{SAY:crazydave}你相信吗？他们是用它们来买今晚音乐会的门票的！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_EIGHTIES_10_OUTRO_5": "{SAY:crazydave}这一定是一场真正的大秀吧朋朋？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_EIGHTIES_10_OUTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}据我计算，购买的门票数量为：",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_EIGHTIES_10_OUTRO_7": "{TIRED:winnie}...售出了多达七张半的票。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_QUEST_EIGHTIES_10_OUTRO_8": "{TIRED:crazydave}哦。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_01_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:crazydave}太恶心了！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_01_INTRO_2": "{TIRED:winnie}*重启系统*",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_01_INTRO_3": "{TIRED:winnie}*重新上线*",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_01_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，我停电期间发生了什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_01_INTRO_5": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我们像往常一样进行时间旅行！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_01_INTRO_6": "{EXCITED:crazydave}然后突然... 砰！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_01_INTRO_7": "{EXCITED:crazydave}一切都变得疯狂，我们坠毁在这里！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_01_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}好吧，至少我们到达了我们想要的位置。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_01_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}这里有一株植物急需救援。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_01_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}让我对迫降造成的损坏进行诊断。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_01_INTRO_11": "{TIRED:winnie}*时间旅行系统离线*",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_01_INTRO_12": "{TIRED:winnie}（发动机状态：损坏）",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_01_INTRO_13": "{TIRED:winnie}用户戴夫，我的时间旅行系统坏了。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_01_INTRO_14": "{TIRED:winnie}在可预见的未来我们将被困在这里。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_01_INTRO_15": "{TIRED:crazydave}我已经冻伤了！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_01_INTRO_16": "{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，我们回到了上次访问几十年后的冰河时代。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_01_INTRO_17": "{SAY:winnie}气候呈指数级恶化。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_01_INTRO_18": "{SAY:winnie}滑块瓷砖将因此在白天改变方向。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_01_INTRO_19": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我应该带我的夹克！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_02_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，我必须通知你新的观察结果。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_02_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}观察#1：我的发动机需要一段时间才能自行修复，因为某些部件被冰冻住了。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_02_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}观察#2：需要救援的工厂就在附近。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_02_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}观察#3：这里的僵尸是僵王上次访问时留下的僵尸的后代。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_02_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}观察#4：这些僵尸已被僵王抛弃并自生自灭。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_02_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}它们为适应这些更恶劣的环境而进化的程度令人印象深刻。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_02_INTRO_7": "{SAY:crazydave}当当，僵王就把它们全部留下了？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_02_INTRO_8": "{TIRED:crazydave}我几乎为他们感到有点遗憾......",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_02_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}他们到头来仍然是僵尸，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_02_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}他们非常饥饿，我们必须保持警惕。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_03_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，我终于找到了需要救援的工厂了。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_03_INTRO_2": "{SAY:crazydave}哦？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_03_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}火草会迅速点燃僵尸，包括飞行的僵尸。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_03_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}他火热的身体也为附近的植物提供了充足的热量。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_03_INTRO_5": "{EXCITED:crazydave}终于！我们是时候寻求帮助了！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_03_INTRO_6": "{EXCITED:crazydave}一旦我们拯救了这种植物，我们就能立即融化冰块！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_05_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SAY:winnie}我的发动机正在以稳定的速度进行维修，但是，电机维修才刚刚开始。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_05_INTRO_2": "{EXCITED:crazydave}朋朋，我看到远处有东西！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_05_INTRO_3": "{EXCITED:crazydave}整个雪地都很难辨认！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_05_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}我的传感器也检测到了它。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_05_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}我们有新的僵尸来了。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_05_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}或者更确切地说......更进化的僵尸。与普通的 ⟦T1⟧ 相比，",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_05_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}正在扫描……",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_05_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}炮弹猎人似乎要先进得多。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_05_INTRO_9": "{TIRED:crazydave}我有种不好的预感。我的第七感开始发挥作用。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_05_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}他们的雪球威力巨大。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_05_INTRO_11": "{SAY:winnie}他们的俱乐部也是如此。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_05_INTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}我们需要确保他们不会用他们的武器库刺穿我们的防御。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_07_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}我的引擎已修复 25%。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_07_INTRO_2": "{EXCITED:crazydave}太好了，我等不及要离开这里了！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_07_INTRO_3": "{TIRED:crazydave}此时我几乎感觉自己出现了幻觉……",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_07_INTRO_4": "{TIRED:crazydave}我看到的只是雪、冰、雪和更多的冰......",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_07_INTRO_5": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我什至见过一些僵尸被活活烧死！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_07_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}正在扫描……",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_07_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}那些不是幻觉，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_07_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}那些是烧焦的僵尸。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_07_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}他们的体温略高于零，使他们对寒冷免疫。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_07_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}此外，他们的皮肤由于被烧伤而完全防火。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_07_INTRO_11": "{EXCITED:crazydave}燃烧自己可以免疫火和冰！？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_07_INTRO_12": "{TIRED:crazydave}也许我应该找个时间尝试一下......",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_07_INTRO_13": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}他们称之为什么...替代医学？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_07_INTRO_14": "{TIRED:winnie}...",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_09_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}朋朋，我在想。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_09_INTRO_2": "{EXCITED:crazydave}如果僵王抛弃了这些丧尸，他们就都散了，没有目的！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_09_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}这可能不完全正确。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_09_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}逻辑告诉我们，必须有一个足够强大的丧尸才能成为他们的领袖。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_09_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}如果我们继续捍卫自己，我们最终会引起他们的注意。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_09_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}我的引擎已经修复了50%，所以我们有机会在这之前逃离这里。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_09_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}说到，我的扫描仪正在检测新的传入威胁......",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_09_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}这些僵尸可能已经进化成了一个全新的等级体系。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_09_INTRO_9": "{SAY:crazydave}层次结构？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_09_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}所有部落都有其成员：首领、酋长...",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_09_INTRO_11": "{SAY:winnie}看来我们已经引起了首领们的注意了。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_09_INTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}这段时间，酋长尤其致命。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_09_INTRO_13": "{SAY:winnie}他们对寒冷呼吸的掌握导致整条车道上的战士都被冻住了。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_09_INTRO_14": "{SAY:winnie}我们必须提供比以往更多的供暖。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_09_INTRO_15": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}嘿，一点点臭气永远不会杀死任何人。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_09_INTRO_16": "{SAY:crazydave}此外，我认为这些僵尸与老板分开也很巧妙。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_09_INTRO_17": "{SAY:crazydave}也许新的领导者对他们来说真的可以发挥作用。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_09_INTRO_18": "{EXCITED:winnie}这是一个有趣的想法，并且考虑到证据，可能性很大。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_09_INTRO_19": "{SAY:winnie}没有现有数据可以匹配这种场景。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_09_INTRO_20": "{SAY:winnie}也许我们还没有迫降，无缘无故地留下来观察这些事件。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_12_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}我注意到地平线上的僵尸比平时多了很多。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_12_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}我们似乎已经引起了领导的注意。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_12_INTRO_3": "{TIRED:winnie}这很糟糕。我的引擎还远没有准备好。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_12_INTRO_4": "{SAY:crazydave}我们要对抗他们的领袖？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_12_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}扫描仪显示：长者冰雹。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_12_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}他的人民的英雄，大脑的获得者。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_12_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}雪崩战士和部落之王。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_12_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}危险级别：高。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_12_INTRO_9": "{SAY:crazydave}这是我们第一次对抗不是由老板领导的僵尸部落，对吧？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_12_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}仅仅因为他们不是由僵王领导并不意味着他们的危险性较低。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_12_INTRO_11": "{TIRED:winnie}如果有的话，那就是它们更难以预测。我已经记录了僵王的所有模式。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_12_INTRO_12": "{TIRED:winnie}我们要盲进这里。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_12_INTRO_13": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}所以这里是领导者领导者，是吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_12_INTRO_14": "{EXCITED:crazydave}让他向后进化吧！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_13_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:winnie}用户戴夫，我有很多好消息！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_13_INTRO_2": "{EXCITED:winnie}首先，我的引擎已经修复了75%！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_13_INTRO_3": "{EXCITED:winnie}其次，风雹长老和他的亲信已经撤退了！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_13_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}冰雹长老的状态仍未知。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_13_INTRO_5": "{SAY:crazydave}奇怪了，我发誓我看到一些僵尸还在逼近？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_13_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}我会快速扫描一下。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_13_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}*扫描中*",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_13_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}你似乎是正确的，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_13_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}这是最不寻常的。他们的领袖被击败了。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_13_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}他们应该都撤退了，别管我们了。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_13_INTRO_11": "{SAY:crazydave}你以为他们就那么饿吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_13_INTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}就算是，他们也会听从领导的命令。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_13_INTRO_13": "{SAY:winnie}更奇怪...有一种全新类型的进化僵尸。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_13_INTRO_14": "{EXCITED:crazydave}又来了！？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_13_INTRO_15": "{SAY:winnie}黄鼠狼女王会召唤更加耐用的永冻黄鼠狼。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_13_INTRO_16": "{SAY:winnie}一旦她的日志被打破，她就会发出约德尔声以寻求黄鼠狼的进一步支持。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_13_INTRO_17": "{EXCITED:crazydave}现在这显然没有任何意义！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_13_INTRO_18": "{EXCITED:crazydave}如果我认识僵尸（我确实认识），他们就会在这一点上停下来！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_13_INTRO_19": "{SAY:crazydave}也许也举办一个舞会，但派遣新部队？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_13_INTRO_20": "{EXCITED:crazydave}这真是太奇怪了！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_13_INTRO_21": "{SAY:winnie}确实如此。它违背了所有以前遇到的模式。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_13_INTRO_22": "{SAY:winnie}我会进行分析，同时防御这些丧尸。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_13_INTRO_23": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我们应该使用火草，他非常渴望点燃僵尸黄鼠狼！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_14_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:winnie}用户戴夫，前所未有的事情发生了！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_14_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}我们似乎收到了丧尸部落的石碑信。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_14_INTRO_3": "{SAY:crazydave}哦。嗯，这很正常，我们已经收到了很多这样的信息。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_14_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}不像这个。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_14_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}它是用一种结构非常糟糕的原始语言编写的，但我相信我可以翻译它。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_14_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}*嘟嘟*",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_14_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}“我冰雹长老！我命令写并递送这封信！”",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_14_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}“我死得很夸张！”",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_14_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}“昨天的攻击不是我们发起的。我发现你不再是猎物了。”",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_14_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}“我为攻击行为道歉。”",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_14_INTRO_11": "{SAY:winnie}“当我发现你是谁时，我尊重你。”",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_14_INTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}“我们部落有问题！”",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_14_INTRO_13": "{SAY:winnie}“我们的坏领导回来了。分裂发生了。”",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_14_INTRO_14": "{SAY:winnie}“我支持我的人民。我们不允许大脑僵尸重新夺回领导权。”",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_14_INTRO_15": "{SAY:winnie}“部落里的懦夫加入了他的阵营，我们其他人躲了起来。”",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_14_INTRO_16": "{SAY:winnie}“他们继续对你发起攻击。”",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_14_INTRO_17": "{SAY:winnie}“帮部落我问问。我们不想再为坏领袖服务了。”",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_14_INTRO_18": "{TIRED:winnie}*信尾*",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_14_INTRO_19": "{SAY:crazydave}哇哦。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_14_INTRO_20": "{EXCITED:winnie}这是前所未有的。一个僵尸组织向我们寻求援助。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_14_INTRO_21": "{SAY:crazydave}来自那些被老板抛弃的家伙？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_14_INTRO_22": "{SAY:winnie}确实如此。这是最不寻常的。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_14_INTRO_23": "{SAY:winnie}而且，僵王好像又回来了。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_14_INTRO_24": "{SAY:winnie}仍在攻击我们的丧尸来自部落，但在僵王回来后他们就倒戈了。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_14_INTRO_25": "{EXCITED:crazydave}这对我来说也太疯狂了！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_14_INTRO_26": "{SAY:winnie}看来僵王还没有注意到我们在这里。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_14_INTRO_27": "{SAY:winnie}我会计算下一个行动计划。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_15_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，我的引擎已经完全修复了。我们现在该走了。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_15_INTRO_2": "{SAY:crazydave}其实朋朋，我想我想多呆一会儿。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_15_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}你做出这种不合逻辑的行为的理由是什么，用户戴夫？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_15_INTRO_4": "{EXCITED:crazydave}你听到了老家伙，朋朋！这些僵尸需要我们的帮助！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_15_INTRO_5": "{EXCITED:crazydave}老板想再次成为他们的领袖，但他们已经有了新的领袖了！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_15_INTRO_6": "{EXCITED:crazydave}那个领导居然想和我们做朋友！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_15_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}我认为这并不能完全反映情况。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_15_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}我的传感器显示这些僵尸有 66% 的机会背叛我们。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_15_INTRO_9": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我们必须相信他们朋朋！老盖甚至说他“尊重我们”。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_15_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}如果您希望我们留下来提供帮助，我们会的。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_16_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}朋朋！？大卫！？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_16_INTRO_2": "{SAY:zombossicon}这是什么阴谋！？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_16_INTRO_3": "{SAY:zombossicon}我回到冰河世纪，发现我的僵尸在新的领导下！？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_16_INTRO_4": "{SAY:zombossicon}他们中的一半人因为某些崇拜者而不再尊重我！？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_16_INTRO_5": "{SAY:zombossicon}受到“一个奇怪的人和他的红色金属猛犸象”的存在的启发！？？？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_16_INTRO_6": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:crazydave}老板，这些僵尸已经继续前进了！我的意思是，你抛弃了他们！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_16_INTRO_7": "{SAY:zombossicon}哦，真的吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_16_INTRO_8": "{SAY:zombossicon}...",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_16_INTRO_9": "{SAY:zombossicon}嗯，我想我有。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_16_INTRO_10": "{SAY:zombossicon}像我这样忙碌的坏人有太多的事情要担心，以至于记不住这样的小事。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_16_INTRO_11": "{SAY:winnie}你必须承认僵王，你应该预见到这一点。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_16_INTRO_12": "{SAY:zombossicon}我够了！你在这里做什么！？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_16_INTRO_13": "{SAY:zombossicon}你为什么要和这些穴居人合谋！？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_16_INTRO_14": "{EXCITED:crazydave}因为他们现在有了自己的部落了！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_16_INTRO_15": "{SAY:zombossicon}他们的抵抗是徒劳的。你应该离开这里，让我好好清理一下！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_16_INTRO_16": "{SAY:zombossicon}我是他们唯一的领袖！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_16_INTRO_17": "{SAY:winnie}这与我的扫描相矛盾。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_16_INTRO_18": "{SAY:winnie}僵王...你有没有训练这些僵尸模仿冰雹长老？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_16_INTRO_19": "{SAY:zombossicon}嗯？什么！？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_16_INTRO_20": "{SAY:zombossicon}好吧，我可能已经下令任命我自己的一些僵尸作为为我工作的新副领导。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_16_INTRO_21": "{SAY:winnie}你正在复制原作，连衣服都复制了。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_16_INTRO_22": "{SAY:zombossicon}如果你要的是战争，你就得到了。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_16_INTRO_23": "{SAY:crazydave}我们不是已经战争多年了吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_16_INTRO_24": "{SAY:zombossicon}呸！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_19_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，我们又收到了冰雹长老的石信。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_19_INTRO_2": "{SAY:crazydave}那么，它说了什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_19_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}“我喜欢你为部落而战。”",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_19_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}“部落很尊重你。”",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_19_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}“我们反击大脑僵尸。”",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_19_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}“明天进攻。”",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_19_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}“我和你一起上战场！”",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_19_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}“我们打败了大脑僵尸！我们解放了部落！”",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_19_INTRO_9": "{TIRED:winnie}*信尾*",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_19_INTRO_10": "{SAY:crazydave}听起来我们是在黎明时进攻。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_19_INTRO_11": "{SAY:winnie}僵王必须准备好。他决心夺回部落首领的头衔。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_19_INTRO_12": "{SAY:crazydave}为什么老板还关心？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_19_INTRO_13": "{EXCITED:crazydave}他身边已经有一卡车的僵尸了！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_19_INTRO_14": "{SAY:winnie}僵王是一只骄傲的僵尸，他不会放过这样的反抗。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_19_INTRO_15": "{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，我收回之前的怀疑。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_19_INTRO_16": "{SAY:winnie}这个联盟对我们来说非常有用。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_19_INTRO_17": "{SAY:winnie}如果我们成功击败了僵王，我们就能打破与这些僵尸之间的僵局。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_19_INTRO_18": "{TIRED:crazydave}哇，僵尸作为盟友。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_19_INTRO_19": "{SAY:winnie}我们正在真正经历历史上的革命性时刻。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_19_INTRO_20": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我从没想过我会看到这一天。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_20_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}哈哈！你真指望冰雹长老能打败我吗！？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_20_INTRO_2": "{SAY:zombossicon}领导者的那个可悲的借口？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_20_INTRO_3": "{SAY:zombossicon}我才是真正的领袖！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_20_INTRO_4": "{SAY:zombossicon}连自己都无法避免被冻住！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_20_INTRO_5": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{EXCITED:crazydave}老板，这必须停止了！你必须离开这个部落！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_20_INTRO_6": "{SAY:zombossicon}你什么时候开始关心僵尸了！？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_20_INTRO_7": "{SAY:zombossicon}你所做的就是与我们战斗！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_20_INTRO_8": "{EXCITED:crazydave}这些僵尸甚至不想再吃我们的大脑了！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_20_INTRO_9": "{SAY:zombossicon}荒谬！这是对所有丧尸的侮辱！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_20_INTRO_10": "{SAY:zombossicon}我要夺回这个时代僵尸统治者应有的地位。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_20_INTRO_11": "{SAY:zombossicon}我会打败所有的对手！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_20_INTRO_12": "{SAY:zombossicon}不管你挡不挡我的路！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_20_OUTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}为什么……",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_20_OUTRO_2": "{SAY:zombossicon}你为什么要帮助他们和我分开！？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_20_OUTRO_3": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{PLAYFUL:winnie}拥有僵尸盟友就像呼吸新鲜空气，你不同意吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_20_OUTRO_4": "{SAY:zombossicon}我宁愿吐口水在你的挡风玻璃上。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_20_OUTRO_5": "{SAY:zombossicon}至少我用爆炸干掉了冰雹长老。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_20_OUTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}状态报告：尽管已化为灰烬，冰雹长老仍然活得很好。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_20_OUTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}报告说他实在太强大了，不会因此而死。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_20_OUTRO_8": "{SAY:zombossicon}...",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_20_OUTRO_9": "{SAY:zombossicon}好的！他们可以拥有自己的小部落！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_20_OUTRO_10": "{SAY:zombossicon}我不在乎！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_20_OUTRO_11": "{SAY:zombossicon}我还有更大的鱼要煎！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_20_OUTRO_12": "{SAY:zombossicon}更大的鱼！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_20_OUTRO_13": "{SAY:zombossicon}再见...很快。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_ICEAGE_20_OUTRO_14": "{NPC_EXIT:zombossicon}{PLAYFUL:winnie}冰雹长老问候！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_1_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}朋朋...我们在哪里？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_1_INTRO_2": "{SAY:crazydave}这是某种……天空之城吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_1_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}不，用户戴夫。我们目前处于未知空域。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_1_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}看起来我们好像遭到了袭击。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_1_INTRO_5": "{EXCITED:crazydave}这到底是什么地方！？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_1_INTRO_6": "{SAY:crazydave}我不记得历史书上有飞行堡垒。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_1_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}我无法识别我们当前的位置或时间段。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_1_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}请给我时间适应新环境。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_1_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}我不知道这就是我们跟随求救信号而最终到达的地方。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_1_INTRO_10": "{SAY:crazydave}幸好我们降落在这所房子上，它有一门大炮和一个盾牌！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_1_INTRO_11": "{SAY:crazydave}我们也可以好好利用萝卜仪这样的飞友！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_1_INTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}不幸的是，僵尸配备了自己的武器。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_1_INTRO_13": "{SAY:winnie}虽然他们不能吃掉我们的大脑，但他们可以击沉这艘船。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_1_INTRO_14": "{SAY:winnie}我已经让我们的邻居远程访问飞艇的大炮。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_1_INTRO_15": "{SAY:winnie}如果出现问题，他们可以在“POWER-UPS”中免费找到它。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_1_INTRO_16": "{SAY:winnie}大炮使用后需要时间充电。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_1_INTRO_17": "{SAY:winnie}也许抵御这次攻击能让我们了解当前的情况。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_2_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{EXCITED:crazydave}看那边邻居，云！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_2_INTRO_2": "{SAY:crazydave}云的一个好处是植物喜欢坐在上面。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_2_INTRO_3": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}这通常是不可能的。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_2_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}然而，这些云显示出具有足够高的密度，这是可能的。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_2_INTRO_5": "{SAY:crazydave}嘿朋朋，那些朝我们走来的家伙是谁？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_2_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}警报，僵尸战士逼近！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_2_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}僵尸战斗机的飞行器上有口径。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_2_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}他们会不断地向我们的工厂开枪并击落我们的船。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_2_INTRO_9": "{EXCITED:crazydave}什么！？枪？这是什么类型的僵尸！？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_2_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}我们捡到了Aceparagus真是太好了！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_2_INTRO_11": "{SAY:winnie}Aceparagus 在自己的车道或相邻车道上射击僵尸。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_2_INTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}几次射击后，它必须冷却并重新加载。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_3_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}天上的僵尸，大枪，飞屋……",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_3_INTRO_2": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我们去哪里朋朋？这是什么地方？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_3_INTRO_3": "{SAY:crazydave}那求救信号是谁发出的？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_3_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}那个，我还不确定。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_3_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}但是，我已经分析完了这个位置。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_3_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}我们正处于一个曾经被通俗地称为“历史进行曲”的时代。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_3_INTRO_7": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我没有看到任何游行发生！真是个骗局！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_3_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}尽管日期一致，但地点本身与我的记录有很大不同。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_3_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}原本，“历史进行曲”是20世纪的战时时期。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_3_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}里面的冲突是用先进的武器进行的，但不是这样的。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_3_INTRO_11": "{SAY:winnie}不在天空中，当然也不会使用这种技术。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_3_INTRO_12": "{SAY:crazydave}怎么变成这样了？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_3_INTRO_13": "{SAY:winnie}历史已被更改。这是毫无疑问的。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_3_INTRO_14": "{SAY:crazydave}哦，听起来很糟糕。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_3_INTRO_15": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}这也是老板的计划吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_3_INTRO_16": "{SAY:winnie}这是来自僵王博士的方案的可能性很高。我们必须保持警惕。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_4_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{TIRED:crazydave}这些飞机小鬼僵尸正在击败我们朋朋...",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_4_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}我们的新同胞 Puffapple 正好解决了我们的问题。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_4_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}他的弹性特性使他能够使自己膨胀以偏转他们的子弹。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_4_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}他的防御力也很高，所以他可以像其他墙一样使用。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_4_INTRO_5": "{EXCITED:crazydave}这样可以给我们一些在云上呼吸的空间！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_5_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{PLAYFUL:crazydave}那是一艘大船，里面有什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_5_INTRO_2": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}扫描中......",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_5_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}小鬼僵尸，还有很多。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_5_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}我无法在船上收集任何东西，该模型不在我的数据库中。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_5_INTRO_5": "{SAY:crazydave}凡是涉及小鬼的事情都不好，大家要警惕。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_6_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{TIRED:crazydave}朋朋，我又需要你的帮助了。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_6_INTRO_2": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}看来新的飞机模型正在运行。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_6_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}正在扫描……",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_6_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}F-82 双战斗机模型已定位。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_6_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}F-82双体战斗机占据2排空间，除非双方都被摧毁，否则不会下降。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_6_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}摧毁一侧而不摧毁另一侧将使其吸收射弹。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_6_INTRO_7": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}哇哦，你的分析算法真的升级了朋朋。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_6_INTRO_8": "{PLAYFUL:winnie}在这样的时刻，他们确实需要好好掸掉灰尘。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_7_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{TIRED:crazydave}这个地方真是无情啊……",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_7_INTRO_2": "{SAY:crazydave}无论我们如何击败僵尸，他们都不会倒下！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_7_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}新检索到的 Saucer Squash 可以缓解这个问题。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_7_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}碟形南瓜具有击晕僵尸和捕获虚弱僵尸的能力。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_7_INTRO_5": "{SAY:crazydave}我们需要所有能得到的帮助。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_8_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}新威胁到来，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_8_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}携带激光枪的僵尸正在逼近。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_8_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}我的扫描能够确定它们能量背后的逻辑。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_8_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}仔细听，这是至关重要的信息。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_8_INTRO_5": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SAY:winnie}这些僵尸会发射带有正能量和负能量的等离子球。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_8_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}蓝色为正极，红色为负极。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_8_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}两个负连接将使我们的植物瘫痪。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_8_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}正负连接会使我们的植物变冷。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_8_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}两个正向连接会慢慢摧毁非防御植物。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_8_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}你明白吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_8_INTRO_11": "{SAY:crazydave}我应该诚实还是顺从？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_8_INTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}诚实，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_8_INTRO_13": "{SAY:crazydave}没有。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_11_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，我收集了一些重要的信息。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_11_INTRO_2": "{TIRED:crazydave}希望比上次好。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_11_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}我可以确认僵王不负责改变这个世界。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_11_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}我知道我认出了科学家僵尸使用的枪型号。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_11_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}过去几天我对它们进行了分析，结果是结论性的。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_11_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}这些模型是僵王博士几年前尝试制造的原型枪的 1:1 复制品。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_11_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}除了他发誓不再使用它，因为它炸毁了他的实验室。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_11_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}他对此类武器的研究早已被放弃，副本也被销毁。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_11_INTRO_9": "{TIRED:crazydave}那么这件事的幕后黑手是谁呢？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_11_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}只有一种方法可以找到答案。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_11_INTRO_11": "{SAY:winnie}丧尸主要从东方协同进攻。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_11_INTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}我们必须乘船并追踪源头。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_11_INTRO_13": "{TIRED:crazydave}我们就不能休息一下吗？他们一直在攻击我们。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_11_INTRO_14": "{TIRED:winnie}如果我们留在这里他们恐怕不会停下来。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_11_INTRO_15": "{SAY:winnie}再不前进就一定会被打倒。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_12_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:crazydave}朋朋，我不知道还能坚持多久！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_12_INTRO_2": "{EXCITED:crazydave}这个战争世界与我以前见过的任何东西都不一样！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_12_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}雪上加霜的是，我发现僵尸即将袭击。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_12_INTRO_4": "{EXCITED:crazydave}哎呀！我们准备好了吗！？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_12_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}我目前无法检索该数据。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_12_INTRO_6": "{SAY:crazydave}我不明白。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_12_INTRO_7": "{SAY:crazydave}我们的目的是进入这里，营救发出求救信号的人-",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_12_INTRO_8": "{EXCITED:crazydave}滚出去！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_12_INTRO_9": "{EXCITED:crazydave}这个神秘人在哪里！？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_12_INTRO_10": "{TIRED:winnie}用户戴夫，我们必须专注于即将到来的战斗。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_12_INTRO_11": "{SAY:winnie}我的扫描表明-",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_12_INTRO_12": "{NPC_ENTER:captaincamo}{PLAYFUL:captaincamo}哦，我怎么知道会发生这种事。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_12_INTRO_13": "{EXCITED:winnie}是你！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_12_INTRO_14": "{EXCITED:crazydave}将军！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_12_INTRO_15": "{EXCITED:captaincamo}哈哈哈！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_12_INTRO_16": "{SAY:captaincamo}我在我正值巅峰的时候发出求救信号来困住你们这些混蛋！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_12_INTRO_17": "{EXCITED:captaincamo}你们这些普通的园丁还没有面对过真正的战争！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_12_INTRO_18": "{SAY:captaincamo}这里的一切都让您大饱眼福！我干的！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_12_INTRO_19": "{EXCITED:captaincamo}我给这个地方进行了世纪改造！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_12_INTRO_20": "{SAY:winnie}迷彩将军，你的威胁很好——",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_12_INTRO_21": "{SAY:winnie}但是“当我正值巅峰时”是什么意思？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_12_INTRO_22": "{SAY:winnie}你给这个时代带来了改变吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_12_INTRO_23": "{SAY:captaincamo}哦，我很高兴你问。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_12_INTRO_24": "{SAY:captaincamo}看，这段时间承载着我最美好的回忆。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_12_INTRO_25": "{SAY:captaincamo}我年轻时曾经指挥过这一切。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_12_INTRO_26": "{SAY:captaincamo}在我需要戴这个面具之前...",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_12_INTRO_27": "{SAY:captaincamo}历史上有一段短暂的时期，我处于世界之巅。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_12_INTRO_28": "{SAY:captaincamo}并且有资源来对付像你这样的白痴。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_12_INTRO_29": "{SAY:captaincamo}让我们看看...",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_12_INTRO_30": "{SAY:captaincamo}年轻时的我已经决定全面正面进攻了。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_12_INTRO_31": "{SAY:captaincamo}我想“如果你想做某事，就自己做”确实适用。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_12_INTRO_32": "{SAY:captaincamo}我就让他干活，在一旁看着。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_12_INTRO_33": "{SAY:captaincamo}一定要让这成为一场精彩的表演。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_12_INTRO_34": "{NPC_EXIT:captaincamo}{EXCITED:crazydave}什么！？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_12_INTRO_35": "{EXCITED:crazydave}这毫无意义！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_12_INTRO_36": "{SAY:winnie}实际上，它非常准确地把事情放在上下文中。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_12_INTRO_37": "{SAY:winnie}我们所知道的将军迷彩将我们引入了这个时期。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_12_INTRO_38": "{SAY:winnie}让过去的自己可以在资源丰富的时候“照顾我们”。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_12_INTRO_39": "{EXCITED:crazydave}你是说这家伙在和自己合作！？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_12_INTRO_40": "{SAY:winnie}我怀疑，它会导致太多的时间不稳定。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_12_INTRO_41": "{SAY:winnie}年轻时的自己可能甚至不知道他在这里，观看战斗。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_12_INTRO_42": "{SAY:winnie}这确实引起了一件事的质疑。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_12_INTRO_43": "{SAY:winnie}这场战争是如何从记录的变成这场空战的？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_12_INTRO_44": "{SAY:winnie}如果这是卡莫将军职业生涯的巅峰，那么是什么结束了它呢？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_12_INTRO_45": "{SAY:crazydave}我想我需要练习我的战斗口号。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_12_INTRO_46": "{SHOUT:crazydave}这个。是。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_12_INTRO_47": "{SHOUT:crazydave}疯狂！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_13_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:crazydave}那个将军疯了！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_13_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}他对我们做了一个肮脏的把戏。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_13_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}看来我无法让我们脱离这个时间段。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_13_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}他一定是采取了穿越时空的对策。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_13_INTRO_5": "{SAY:crazydave}那么，我们该怎么办？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_13_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}暂时以生存为主。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_13_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}年轻的迷彩仍然拥有大量武器。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_13_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}让他的恐怖统治变得更加令人费解。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_13_INTRO_9": "{TIRED:winnie}还有……一场典型的战争是如何变成……这个的。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_13_INTRO_10": "{NPC_ENTER:captaincamo}{SAY:captaincamo}我想我会告诉你，看看你还活着。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_13_INTRO_11": "{SAY:captaincamo}你是对的，这曾经只是典型的坦克和地雷。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_13_INTRO_12": "{SAY:captaincamo}...直到我回来。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_13_INTRO_13": "{SAY:crazydave}你是说你什么时候回来困住我们的？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_13_INTRO_14": "{EXCITED:captaincamo}什么！？不，你这个白痴！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_13_INTRO_15": "{SAY:captaincamo}僵王和我有着相当广泛的历史。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_13_INTRO_16": "{SAY:captaincamo}他认识到我的才华并将我带到他的时代。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_13_INTRO_17": "{SAY:captaincamo}在无法理解我的心理优越性后，他把我送回了这里......",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_13_INTRO_18": "{SAY:captaincamo}但是他忘记了一件小事。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_13_INTRO_19": "{SAY:captaincamo}我拥有过目不忘的能力！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_13_INTRO_20": "{SAY:captaincamo}我记住了他所有奇特的未来技术的原理图！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_13_INTRO_21": "{SAY:captaincamo}并把它带到了天空。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_13_INTRO_22": "{SAY:winnie}但这并没有持续下去，不是吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_13_INTRO_23": "{TIRED:captaincamo}Rggh。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_13_INTRO_24": "{TIRED:captaincamo}由于不可预见的情况，我被推翻了……",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_13_INTRO_25": "{SAY:captaincamo}但在我体验到战斗的荣耀之前。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_13_INTRO_26": "{SAY:crazydave}从那时起你就讨厌老板？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_13_INTRO_27": "{EXCITED:captaincamo}别把他扯进来！这是我的时间！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_13_INTRO_28": "{SAY:captaincamo}哦，看哪，我要对你发动我的招牌伏击了。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_13_INTRO_29": "{SAY:captaincamo}很快你就会发现我以前穿的不仅仅是一种时尚选择。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_13_INTRO_30": "{NPC_EXIT:captaincamo}{SAY:crazydave}这是什么意思？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_13_INTRO_31": "{SAY:winnie}几乎不加掩饰的威胁。我们必须做好准备。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_14_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:captaincamo}{EXCITED:captaincamo}现在对气体有抵抗力，是吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_14_INTRO_2": "{SAY:captaincamo}哼。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_14_INTRO_3": "{SAY:captaincamo}看来我要派出我最强的士兵之一了。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_14_INTRO_4": "{SAY:captaincamo}让我们看看你真正准备得如何。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_14_INTRO_5": "{SAY:captaincamo}你可以对抗毒气，但你能对付导弹吗！？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_14_INTRO_6": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_EXIT:captaincamo}{EXCITED:crazydave}M-导弹！？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_14_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}尽量不要让他的恐吓影响到你，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_14_INTRO_8": "{EXCITED:crazydave}他要派他的士兵把我们的房子炸成碎片！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_14_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}我们有了自己的新士兵。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_14_INTRO_10": "{PLAYFUL:winnie}或者说，植物的“模型”，原来如此。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_14_INTRO_11": "{SAY:winnie}P-15 Peagle Pod 攻击自己车道上的僵尸以及相邻车道上的僵尸。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_14_INTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}豌豆飞行员瞄准 3 个独立的僵尸并继续造成伤害。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_14_INTRO_13": "{SAY:winnie}他们肯定会暂时减轻我们的负担。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_15_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，这可能会减轻你的担忧。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_15_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}我们还有另一个盟友，Nispaereo。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_15_INTRO_3": "{SAY:crazydave}哇哦，我们真的和植物伙伴们相处得很融洽。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_15_INTRO_4": "{SAY:crazydave}但是我还是很害怕...",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_15_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}Nispaereo 可以在龙卷风中捕获周围的僵尸。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_15_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}到目前为止，我们正在有效地对抗年轻卡莫的部队。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_15_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}我们不能放弃。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_16_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:captaincamo}{EXCITED:captaincamo}这是万万不能接受的！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_16_INTRO_2": "{EXCITED:captaincamo}你现在应该已经炸肉和电路了！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_16_INTRO_3": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:winnie}我们正在慢慢削弱你的部队，迷彩！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_16_INTRO_4": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}或者我应该说，迷彩少年！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_16_INTRO_5": "{SAY:crazydave}因为他是年轻的你...",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_16_INTRO_6": "{SAY:crazydave}就像......尿布。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_16_INTRO_7": "{SHOUT:captaincamo}紧急！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_16_INTRO_8": "{EXCITED:captaincamo}现在连自己都靠不住了！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_16_INTRO_9": "{SAY:captaincamo}我想战术经验的缺乏才是阻碍这个计划的真正原因！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_16_INTRO_10": "{SAY:captaincamo}是时候让一些经验丰富的人上场了！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_16_INTRO_11": "{SAY:captaincamo}我必须亲自指挥这场战斗！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_16_INTRO_12": "{EXCITED:captaincamo}你不会摧毁我军队的威力！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_16_INTRO_13": "{NPC_EXIT:captaincamo}{SAY:crazydave}哇哦，他听起来很生气。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_16_INTRO_14": "{SAY:crazydave}他想做什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_16_INTRO_15": "{SAY:winnie}他似乎要试图摆脱过去的自己并取而代之。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_16_INTRO_16": "{SAY:winnie}这对我们来说只会意味着坏事。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_16_INTRO_17": "{SAY:winnie}我会尝试制定一个计划。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_17_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:captaincamo}{TIRED:captaincamo}呼……呼……",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_17_INTRO_2": "{SAY:captaincamo}从来没有想过试图篡夺自己会这么累。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_17_INTRO_3": "{TIRED:captaincamo}呃……我的身体已经不像以前了。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_17_INTRO_4": "{EXCITED:captaincamo}但这就是你们这些白痴的厄运！因为我做到了！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_17_INTRO_5": "{EXCITED:captaincamo}我现在掌控一切了！而且你已经无处可藏了！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_17_INTRO_6": "{EXCITED:captaincamo}第一件事：仲裁位面！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_17_INTRO_7": "{NPC_EXIT:captaincamo}{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}正如我担心的那样。我们的卡莫将军本人现在正在管理军队。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_17_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}我从没想过他会走那么远。干涉自己的过去是危险的。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_17_INTRO_9": "{EXCITED:crazydave}那我们该怎么办！？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_17_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}他已经采取严厉措施试图消灭我们。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_17_INTRO_11": "{SAY:winnie}我正在检测多个仲裁飞机中队。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_17_INTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}仲裁飞机将所有僵尸隐藏在自己身后。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_17_INTRO_13": "{SAY:winnie}使其他僵尸基本上无敌于伤害。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_17_INTRO_14": "{SAY:crazydave}如果他无敌，我为什么能看到他？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_17_INTRO_15": "{SAY:winnie}其隐身能力范围共5条。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_17_INTRO_16": "{SAY:winnie}我们必须做好准备。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_18_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}由于您最近的困扰，我已经采取了初步措施，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_18_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}今天的防御我已经做好了。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_18_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}我们的事业有一位新的招聘人员，你可能有情报。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_18_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}加特林豌豆以超快的速度烹制豌豆。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_18_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}准备好后，你可以点击加特林豌豆，它会发射一颗大豌豆，造成更多伤害。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_18_INTRO_6": "{EXCITED:crazydave}哦，哇！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_18_INTRO_7": "{EXCITED:crazydave}很高兴看到熟悉的面孔！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_18_INTRO_8": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}还有谢谢朋朋，这个辩护确实让我安心了。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_18_INTRO_9": "{NPC_ENTER:captaincamo}{SAY:captaincamo}战争第 #1 课。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_18_INTRO_10": "{SAY:captaincamo}永远不要安心。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_18_INTRO_11": "{PLAYFUL:captaincamo}你的防守很好。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_18_INTRO_12": "{EXCITED:captaincamo}要是往上面扔凝固汽油弹就太可惜了！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_18_INTRO_13": "{NPC_EXIT:captaincamo}{SHOUT:crazydave}不！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_19_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:captaincamo}{SAY:captaincamo}哦，我真的应该谢谢你！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_19_INTRO_2": "{SAY:captaincamo}我在这里度过了我的人生时光！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_19_INTRO_3": "{EXCITED:captaincamo}我早就应该这么做了！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_19_INTRO_4": "{SAY:captaincamo}回来并控制军队简直就是电动！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_19_INTRO_5": "{SAY:captaincamo}想到这一切都在很久以前就被无情地从我身边夺走了......",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_19_INTRO_6": "{SAY:captaincamo}我不得不躲藏了70年......",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_19_INTRO_7": "{SAY:captaincamo}都是因为某个不知从哪里冒出来的老家伙推翻了我！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_19_INTRO_8": "{SAY:captaincamo}...",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_19_INTRO_9": "{SAY:captaincamo}...哦。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_19_INTRO_10": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}我知道你会愿意屈服于一些低点......",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_19_INTRO_11": "{SAY:winnie}但是，乱搞自己的过去比我想象的还要低。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_19_INTRO_12": "{SAY:captaincamo}呃，我确信还有一些深度需要探索。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_19_INTRO_13": "{EXCITED:captaincamo}至少现在我得到了我一直应得的！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_19_INTRO_14": "{SAY:captaincamo}想想...如果我能把这一切带回到现在...",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_19_INTRO_15": "{SAY:captaincamo}我可以出现在那个白痴僵王家门口……",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_19_INTRO_16": "{EXCITED:captaincamo}用大炮指着他丑陋的杯子！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_19_INTRO_17": "{EXCITED:captaincamo}哈哈哈哈！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_19_INTRO_18": "{SAY:captaincamo}但是首先...我会完成我在这里开始的事情。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_19_INTRO_19": "{EXCITED:captaincamo}死吧！事不宜迟！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_20_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，我想我现在已经很好地理解了迷彩是如何让我们被困在这里的。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_20_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}我正在检测比我们的海拔更高的卫星。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_20_INTRO_3": "{EXCITED:winnie}他一定是为了阻止我们通过时间扭曲离开这里而设置的！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_20_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}而且它们遥不可及......而且似乎可以防弹。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_20_INTRO_5": "{EXCITED:crazydave}什么！？你的意思是我们永远无法摆脱这场战争！？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_20_INTRO_6": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我不知道我还能承受多少，朋朋！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_20_INTRO_7": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我习惯了花园战争，但不习惯这样的真枪实弹！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_20_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，我理解这给你带来的压力。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_20_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}多年来你已经习惯了与僵王战斗。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_20_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}但是我必须告诉你，即使我们现在确实设法离开了......",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_20_INTRO_11": "{SAY:winnie}目前，卡莫将军对世界构成了巨大的威胁。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_20_INTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}如果他能够实施将这支军队带到现在的计划，也许比僵王更大的威胁。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_20_INTRO_13": "{SAY:winnie}我们必须找到一种方法既能阻止他，又能释放我们自己。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_20_INTRO_14": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我在这里失去了理智！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_20_INTRO_15": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我不能在战争中灭亡！我太年轻了！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_20_INTRO_16": "{SAY:winnie}只要有信心，用户戴夫。",
