  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_20_INTRO_18": "{SAY:winnie}我会继续努力制定计划。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_22_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:winnie}用户戴夫，我可能发现了迷彩策略中潜在的弱点。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_22_INTRO_2": "{SAY:crazydave}哦。什、是什么？",
