  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_22_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}我可能可以侵入它们。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_22_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}但是他们现在的保护太大了。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_22_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}如果我尝试，卡莫将军会注意到并轻松阻止我。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_22_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}我只有一次机会。",
