  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_22_INTRO_10": "{SAY:crazydave}没希望了！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_22_INTRO_11": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我不是用那么坚固的橡木做的！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_22_INTRO_12": "{TIRED:crazydave}我希望智慧树在这里......",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_22_INTRO_13": "{EXCITED:crazydave}它会知道该怎么做！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_22_INTRO_14": "{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，我检测到高度的情绪不安。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_22_INTRO_15": "{SAY:winnie}压力又是问题吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_22_INTRO_16": "{SAY:crazydave}看朋朋，我觉得我失去了节奏！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_22_INTRO_17": "{SAY:crazydave}打僵尸这么多年，我以为我已经下定决心了！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_22_INTRO_18": "{SAY:crazydave}突然间，剧本全部倒退了！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_22_INTRO_19": "{SAY:crazydave}就像我的马桶座圈一样。",
