  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_23_INTRO_12": "{SAY:captaincamo}现在我明白为什么你们有牢不可破的声誉了！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_23_INTRO_13": "{SAY:captaincamo}但我相信任何东西都可以被打破。",
