  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_23_INTRO_18": "{SAY:winnie}他仍然主要依靠他的军队。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_23_INTRO_19": "{TIRED:crazydave}哦，好...",
