  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_24_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:captaincamo}{TIRED:captaincamo}我不敢相信你们三个竟然让我走到了这一步！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_24_INTRO_2": "{SAY:captaincamo}你会后悔的！",
