  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_24_INTRO_11": "{SHOUT:captaincamo}天空没有角落！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_24_INTRO_12": "{SHOUT:captaincamo}咳咳咳喘息声",
