  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_24_INTRO_14": "{SAY:captaincamo}但你显然以前从未听说过“B 计划”。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_24_INTRO_15": "{SAY:captaincamo}我欺骗了你的扫描仪，我有一些大东西在商店里。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_24_INTRO_16": "{SAY:captaincamo}你没有机会拿下的东西。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_24_INTRO_17": "{SAY:captaincamo}不，我不会出现。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_24_INTRO_18": "{SAY:captaincamo}不像某些脑瘤，我还没有傻到把自己放进巨大的金属棺材里！",
