  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_24_INTRO_25": "{PLAYFUL:captaincamo}请选择后者。我会让你死得开心...",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_24_INTRO_26": "{NPC_EXIT:captaincamo}{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，为明天做好准备。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_24_INTRO_27": "{SAY:winnie}如果真如我所计算的那样，这将是分散他注意力的最佳时机。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_24_INTRO_28": "{SAY:crazydave}好吧...",
