  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_25_INTRO_20": "{NPC_EXIT:captaincamoboss}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:winnie}这太完美了，用户戴夫！继续努力吧！",
