  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_25_OUTRO_24": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我已经准备好再次面对任何僵尸了！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_25_OUTRO_25": "{SAY:crazydave}那个将军不能让老大头低下！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_25_OUTRO_26": "{SAY:crazydave}所以...现在怎么办？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_25_OUTRO_27": "{SAY:winnie}我们应该离开这个地方。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_25_OUTRO_28": "{SAY:winnie}没有迷彩在身边，他们就没有真正的领导力。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_25_OUTRO_29": "{SAY:winnie}如果没有这个，冲突就会逐渐平息。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_25_OUTRO_30": "{SAY:winnie}他们可能也不会知道如何维护他带来的技术。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_25_OUTRO_31": "{SAY:winnie}事情会继续自然发展，历史不会受到影响。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_25_OUTRO_32": "{SAY:crazydave}那我们回家吧！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_SKYCITY_25_OUTRO_33": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}汉堡包我来啦！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_1_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SAY:crazydave}那是一轮月亮吗？还有彩虹？！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_1_INTRO_2": "{SAY:crazydave}邻居，我们在哪儿？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_1_INTRO_3": "{SAY:crazydave}朋朋又在哪儿？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_1_INTRO_4": "{SAY:crazydave}我只记得一些闪光……",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_1_INTRO_5": "{SAY:crazydave}看起来我们没时间提问，这里也有僵尸！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_1_INTRO_6": "{SAY:crazydave}还有桌子？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_1_INTRO_7": "{SAY:crazydave}幸好这里还有多余的阳光！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_2_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SAY:crazydave}好吧，我伸手到心灵深处，拉出我们在这里的记忆。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_2_INTRO_2": "{SAY:crazydave}最后我记得我只是在小睡，一些奇怪的门户打开了......",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_2_INTRO_3": "{EXCITED:crazydave}...然后就在这里醒来了！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_2_INTRO_4": "{NPC_ENTER:tenkyuchimata}{SAY:tenkyuchimata}你们还有一个吗？究竟有多少人？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_2_INTRO_5": "{SAY:crazydave}哇哦！你是谁？你为什么看起来那样？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_2_INTRO_6": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}我来自与你习惯的不同的宇宙。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_2_INTRO_7": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}在你们两个适应之前，很多事情可能看起来很奇怪。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_2_INTRO_8": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}我的名字是Chimata Tenkyuu，我经营这个市场。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_2_INTRO_9": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}这不是我第一次见到你们。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_2_INTRO_10": "{SAY:crazydave}什么？这是否又是一种时空维度的情况……",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_2_INTRO_11": "{SAY:crazydave}等等，市场！？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_2_INTRO_12": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}这里是月虹市场，一个只在月虹下开放的市场。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_2_INTRO_13": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}然而，这次出了大问题。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_2_INTRO_14": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}看起来既不是妖怪也不是人类的奇怪生物。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_2_INTRO_15": "{SAY:crazydave}奇怪的生物？哦，那些只是僵尸，我几乎每天都在和他们战斗！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_2_INTRO_16": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}你的另一个自我也告诉了我很多。他们一直在制造混乱！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_2_INTRO_17": "{SAY:crazydave}好吧，如果这就是你找到我的原因，那么你找到了合适的人选！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_2_INTRO_18": "{EXCITED:crazydave}僵尸不是我对付不了的！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_2_INTRO_19": "{SAY:crazydave}等等，那些僵尸为什么有翅膀？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_2_INTRO_20": "{AWKWARD:tenkyuchimata}我不确定。不过从你的反应来看，它们通常是没有翅膀的？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_2_INTRO_21": "{SAY:crazydave}他们骑着奇怪的虫子，但……不是真的。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_2_INTRO_22": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}嗯，这里总是发生奇怪的事情。事实上，这对我来说非常好。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_2_INTRO_23": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}不管怎样，这些僵尸都长出了类似于仙女的翅膀。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_2_INTRO_24": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}它们在这个世界上飞舞，数量众多。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_2_INTRO_25": "{SAY:crazydave}哦，我一直想见到仙女。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_3_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{EXCITED:crazydave}Chimata！我在这个市场发现了一种新植物！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_3_INTRO_2": "{NPC_ENTER:tenkyuchimata}{SAY:tenkyuchimata}海棠？这些象征着友谊和纽带，但也可能意味着不幸。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_3_INTRO_3": "{SAY:crazydave}那么...它有什么作用？这通常是朋朋来填补我的空缺。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_3_INTRO_4": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}据我所知，它可以操纵冰和火......",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_3_INTRO_5": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}...直接攻击僵尸的心脏。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_3_INTRO_6": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}当然是比喻意义上的。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_3_INTRO_7": "{SAY:crazydave}直入心底？那一定很痛吧",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_3_INTRO_8": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}冰会导致心碎，妨碍他们移动的能力。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_3_INTRO_9": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}火会引起相思，削弱元气。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_3_INTRO_10": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}心碎又相思，彻底心碎。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_3_INTRO_11": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}这使它们更容易受到您植物的...弹幕的影响？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_3_INTRO_12": "{SAY:crazydave}段玛库是谁？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_4_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:tenkyuchimata}{SAY:crazydave}所以根据你告诉我的...",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_4_INTRO_2": "{SAY:crazydave}我和其他疯狂戴夫一起来到了另一个世界？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_4_INTRO_3": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}是的。现在你来了，我需要你的帮助来拯救市场。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_4_INTRO_4": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}与你的邻居和其他戴夫一起。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_4_INTRO_5": "{ANGRY:tenkyuchimata}你的一个“僵尸”能够到达这里，并且他一直在制造混乱。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_4_INTRO_6": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}对市场和我自己的信心因此而减弱。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_4_INTRO_7": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}我不能让我积聚的信念再次消失……",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_4_INTRO_8": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}所以我需要你、你的邻居和其他戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_4_INTRO_9": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}不用担心，等这件事解决之后我会扶你们回家的。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_4_INTRO_10": "{AWKWARD:tenkyuchimata}我想可能是一位圣人把你拖到了这里......",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_4_INTRO_11": "{TIRED:crazydave}嗯，这有点粗鲁。我只是在吊床上放松。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_4_INTRO_12": "{SAY:crazydave}但是，如果你没有做好准备，僵尸就会很危险，这是肯定的。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_4_INTRO_13": "{SAY:crazydave}...",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_4_INTRO_14": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}...",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_4_INTRO_15": "{AWKWARD:tenkyuchimata}你……要做什么吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_4_INTRO_16": "{SAY:crazydave}我不知道。你带我来这里的。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_4_INTRO_17": "{SAY:crazydave}这就是你的混乱，不是吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_4_INTRO_18": "{SAY:crazydave}通常我需要某种......动机来清理混乱。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_4_INTRO_19": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}天哪，我饿了！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_4_INTRO_20": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}这个世界上的各种美食我都可以给你，有你想要的吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_4_INTRO_21": "{SAY:crazydave}...",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_4_INTRO_22": "{ANGRY:tenkyuchimata}嗯？我在这里有点绝望！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_4_INTRO_23": "{SAY:crazydave}我在想！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_4_INTRO_24": "{SAY:crazydave}...",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_4_INTRO_25": "{SAY:crazydave}三明治。不过是一副很酷的样子。就像广告中那样。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_4_INTRO_26": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}我讨厌现代市场和他们的广告......",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_4_INTRO_27": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}好，等这一切完成后，我给你做最特别的三明治。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_4_INTRO_28": "{AWKWARD:tenkyuchimata}人类可以这么简单……",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_4_INTRO_29": "{SAY:crazydave}我可以帮忙吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_4_INTRO_30": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}就像你最了解的那样继续对抗这些僵尸。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_4_INTRO_31": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}因为这件事，我的信心下降了，所以我自己做不了多少事情。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_4_INTRO_32": "{EXCITED:crazydave}没有时间失去希望！疯狂戴夫开始工作了！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_4_INTRO_33": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}不，我是说对自己的信心。作为女神，我需要对力量的信仰，也需要对生命的信仰。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_4_INTRO_34": "{SAY:crazydave}Ooooooh，这一定就是你看起来像这样的原因！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_4_INTRO_35": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}当然，我得打扮得适合女神的角色。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_4_INTRO_36": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}不管怎样，这个世界上有很多神，和我一样需要信仰。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_4_INTRO_37": "{SAY:crazydave}现在等一下，我看到拿着掸子的僵尸！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_4_INTRO_38": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}那些是扫帚。他们肯定想把你的植物扫走。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_4_INTRO_39": "{SAY:crazydave}没时间闲聊！僵尸大战时间到了！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_5_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:tenkyuchimata}{SAY:tenkyuchimata}戴夫，发生了可怕的事情！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_5_INTRO_2": "{SAY:crazydave}我注意到，我们的大部分植物都消失了！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_5_INTRO_3": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}幸运的是我市场上的那些还在，但是......",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_5_INTRO_4": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}所有属于你的都彻底失去了所有权。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_5_INTRO_5": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}只有我有权力放弃所有权，这意味着别人已经使用了我的卡...",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_5_INTRO_6": "{SAY:crazydave}所有权？现在请稍等...",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_5_INTRO_7": "{NPC_ENTER:greedy}{SAY:greedy}好了好了好了。如果这不是我自己的胖子园丁的话。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_5_INTRO_8": "{SAY:crazydave}看看谁在说话！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_5_INTRO_9": "{SAY:greedy}我有一种预感，那个奇怪的姑娘迟早会把你带到这里的。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_5_INTRO_10": "{SAY:greedy}但是你来得太晚了，明白吗？我已经拿到货了。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_5_INTRO_11": "{ANGRY:tenkyuchimata}你！你一定是这起事件的幕后黑手。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_5_INTRO_12": "{SAY:greedy}这么说吧……我的一项副业确实得到了回报。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_5_INTRO_13": "{SAY:greedy}所有这些“跨维度”的东西通常不在我的脑海和视线之外，但是哦，这个市场！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_5_INTRO_14": "{SAY:greedy}为什么，当我发现这件事时，我像个吃糖的婴儿一样咯咯地笑！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_5_INTRO_15": "{SAY:greedy}我的消息来源告诉我，它的核心是所有权本身。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_5_INTRO_16": "{SAY:greedy}而且真的，它很容易被利用。我告诉你，我偶然发现了正确的维度。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_5_INTRO_17": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}这样使用我的力量，跨越神是很危险的……",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_5_INTRO_18": "{SAY:greedy}哦，拜托。你不全是这样的如果你是，你就不需要那些“戴夫”来为你而战。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_5_INTRO_19": "{SAY:greedy}看来你注定不会成为某种“所有权之神”或其他什么。不，这里的其他人似乎更适合这个头衔......",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_5_INTRO_20": "{NPC_EXIT:greedy}{SAY:crazydave}...",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_5_INTRO_21": "{NPC_ENTER:greedy}{SAY:greedy}别人就是我，就是这个意思。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_5_INTRO_22": "{SAY:greedy}澄清一下。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_5_INTRO_23": "{NPC_EXIT:greedy}{ANGRY:tenkyuchimata}那小子的神经……",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_5_INTRO_24": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我认识那家伙，他被宠坏了！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_5_INTRO_25": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}我也能看到这么多。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_5_INTRO_26": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}我想惩罚他的行为，但我太弱了。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_5_INTRO_27": "{SAY:crazydave}我们现在就用我们所拥有的来对抗这些僵尸吧。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_5_INTRO_28": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}我也会帮助你恢复植物的所有权。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_6_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:tenkyuchimata}{SAY:tenkyuchimata}昨晚的一株植物似乎希望成为你邻居的所有权。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_6_INTRO_2": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}这个芝士草莓可以吊起芝士来降低僵尸的攻击力。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_6_INTRO_3": "{SAY:crazydave}嗯...",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_6_INTRO_4": "{SAY:crazydave}选择。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_7_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SAY:crazydave}这些带有彩虹的盒子是什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_7_INTRO_2": "{NPC_ENTER:tenkyuchimata}{SAY:tenkyuchimata}这些盒子……里面装着能力卡！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_7_INTRO_3": "{SAY:crazydave}能力卡？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_7_INTRO_4": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}我的一个旧事件的残余......",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_7_INTRO_5": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}他们模仿其他人的力量，但只是一小部分。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_7_INTRO_6": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}他们可能会帮助我们，或者让事情变得更加困难。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_7_INTRO_7": "{NPC_ENTER:greedy}{SAY:greedy}哦，他们会让事情变得更加困难，好吧。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_7_INTRO_8": "{SAY:greedy}多亏了你们，我开始获得越来越多的所有权权力。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_7_INTRO_9": "{SAY:greedy}这包括你的那些卡片！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_7_INTRO_10": "{SAY:greedy}我不得不说，真是一个景象。手艺不错。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_7_INTRO_11": "{SAY:greedy}它们会让你闭嘴！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_7_INTRO_12": "{SAY:greedy}你和你带来的其他“戴夫”来惹恼我！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_7_INTRO_13": "{SAY:greedy}我已经激活了其中一些，嘟嘟。他们做得很好。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_7_INTRO_14": "{ANGRY:tenkyuchimata}能力卡本来就不是这么用的！一旦我把手伸到你身上...",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_7_INTRO_15": "{SAY:greedy}你不会的。那双手也不再属于你了。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_7_INTRO_16": "{SAY:greedy}这个市场给你所有的力量，对“所有权”的信念等等。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_7_INTRO_17": "{SAY:greedy}至少我的专业人士是这么告诉我的。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_7_INTRO_18": "{SAY:greedy}但是如果所有的信仰都归我所有，我将拥有一切！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_7_INTRO_19": "{SAY:greedy}城市街道，双脚...",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_7_INTRO_20": "{SAY:greedy}“所有僵尸的领袖”的地位……",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_7_INTRO_21": "{SAY:greedy}这一切都绝对是我的！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_8_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:tenkyuchimata}{SAY:tenkyuchimata}那么这个贪婪者到底是谁呢？他只是另一个想破坏我的市场的强盗吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_8_INTRO_2": "{SAY:crazydave}他是一个痴迷于想要为自己拥有一切的黑帮僵尸。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_8_INTRO_3": "{SAY:crazydave}最近我遇到了很多像他这样的古怪角色。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_8_INTRO_4": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}他想拥有市场上的一切......",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_8_INTRO_5": "{AWKWARD:tenkyuchimata}他难道没有了解到所有权不是那么容易传递的吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_8_INTRO_6": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}他试图打破所有权的自然秩序……",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_8_INTRO_7": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}……而我还没有能力阻止它。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_8_INTRO_8": "{SAY:crazydave}如果他赢了，听起来他也获得了僵尸领袖的位置！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_8_INTRO_9": "{EXCITED:crazydave}这会给家里带来严重的麻烦！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_8_INTRO_10": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}还有其他维度……他将从这里获得普遍访问权。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_8_INTRO_11": "{SAY:crazydave}他不会停止，直到他拥有一切。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_8_INTRO_12": "{EXCITED:crazydave}有一次还偷走了大家的盛宴节精神！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_8_INTRO_13": "{SAY:crazydave}而且只是因为他想成为最开朗的！你能想象吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_8_INTRO_14": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}如果他有这样的欲望想要拥有一切的话……",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_8_INTRO_15": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}他无疑会在异次元发动丧尸袭击，尽可能地占有。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_8_INTRO_16": "{SAY:crazydave}而且我还有一些私人的东西要对付他！他偷过我的车一次！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_8_INTRO_17": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我的车是我最好的朋友！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_8_INTRO_18": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}那辆“车”一定是你的珍贵财产。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_8_INTRO_19": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}除此之外，我们还有一个新的威胁。她们看起来都是公主。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_8_INTRO_20": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}他们可以用风扇掩盖其他僵尸。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_8_INTRO_21": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}类似于Kappa使用光学迷彩的方式。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_8_INTRO_22": "{SAY:crazydave}版税与隐形有什么关系？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_8_INTRO_23": "{SAY:crazydave}现在想想，我觉得我这辈子都没见过公主。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_9_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:tenkyuchimata}{SAY:tenkyuchimata}看来我们收到了守谷巫女的供奉",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_9_INTRO_2": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}...以这些伞菌的形式。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_9_INTRO_3": "{SAY:crazydave}这个地方吓坏了我。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_9_INTRO_4": "{ANGRY:tenkyuchimata}这个“地方”很重要我会让你知道的！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_9_INTRO_5": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}无论如何...这些都会产生一些很棒的捐款！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_9_INTRO_6": "{NPC_ENTER:greedy}{SAY:greedy}我听到的那个可怕的词是什么？捐款！？呸!",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_9_INTRO_7": "{SAY:greedy}在我的新世界里不会说出这样的亵渎的话！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_9_INTRO_8": "{SAY:greedy}任何和所有的捐款都应该真正捐给你！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_9_INTRO_9": "{SAY:greedy}包括这个！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_9_INTRO_10": "{ANGRY:tenkyuchimata}哼！你甚至会偷窃神的供品。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_9_INTRO_11": "{ANGRY:tenkyuchimata}你知道这会给你带来什么样的业力吗？！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_9_INTRO_12": "{SAY:greedy}业力？你指的是那些愚蠢网站上的东西吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_9_INTRO_13": "{SAY:greedy}我需要这笔捐款，谢谢。这就是我们在业内所说的“公开邀请”。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_9_INTRO_14": "{SAY:greedy}我不会让它掉落，因为几个......戴夫！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_9_INTRO_15": "{SAY:greedy}我现在就活得很开心！我有仆人、女仆、奴才……",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_9_INTRO_16": "{SAY:greedy}我拥有它们全部！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_9_INTRO_17": "{SAY:greedy}女仆，仆人，都是我的！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_9_INTRO_18": "{SAY:greedy}现在连贵族都愿意跟我闲聊、寒暄了。表明我真正拥有的比任何人都多。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_9_INTRO_19": "{SAY:greedy}我现在没有机会放弃这种生活，而且它只会变得更好。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_9_INTRO_20": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}好吧贪婪，我给你一次听的机会。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_9_INTRO_21": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}你想拥有一切...但是当你拥有一切之后，还能拥有什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_9_INTRO_22": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}你将拥有所有财产。但随后你会寻求更多。你会想要这一切。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_9_INTRO_23": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}你将追逐所有权的最高点，寻求再一次填补你内心的空洞。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_9_INTRO_24": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}直到什么都没有了。拥有一切就等于一无所有。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_9_INTRO_25": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}贪婪寻求永恒。寻求深刻、深刻、永恒。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_9_INTRO_26": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}永远不会满足。你永远不会满足。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_9_INTRO_27": "{SAY:greedy}哦，我们会看看......",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_9_INTRO_28": "{SAY:greedy}一旦你宝贵的市场就是我的了。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_9_INTRO_29": "{SAY:greedy}一旦这一切都属于我了。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_9_INTRO_30": "{SAY:greedy}我所看到的一切。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_9_INTRO_31": "{SAY:greedy}北、南、东、西。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_9_INTRO_32": "{SAY:greedy}这将是我的，我的，我的，我的，我的！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_9_INTRO_33": "{NPC_EXIT:greedy}{AWKWARD:tenkyuchimata}我为什么还要麻烦呢？他们都是一样的...",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_10_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:greedy}{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:tenkyuchimata}{SAY:greedy}我觉得你们都没有明白重点！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_10_INTRO_2": "{SAY:greedy}我真的要拼出来吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_10_INTRO_3": "{ANGRY:tenkyuchimata}别浪费我的时间了，继续吧！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_10_INTRO_4": "{SAY:greedy}无论如何也不指望你能理解。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_10_INTRO_5": "{SAY:greedy}你看，自从我的行动被大佬本人不认可后，贪婪的日子就过得很艰难了。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_10_INTRO_6": "{SAY:greedy}躲藏、密谋、被园丁殴打！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_10_INTRO_7": "{SAY:greedy}当我拿到这些的时候你就给我带来了三个！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_10_INTRO_8": "{SAY:greedy}您如何看待这种情况？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_10_INTRO_9": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}我已经选择了想要打败你的英雄，这个甚至以前也这样做过。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_10_INTRO_10": "{SAY:greedy}对。告诉你什么。我不是一个不讲道理的人。我们来做个交易吧。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_10_INTRO_11": "{SAY:greedy}我还给你...比方说...你10%的力量。并且您将免受即将到来的攻击。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_10_INTRO_12": "{SAY:greedy}作为回报，你告诉我这个地方所有我尚未揭开的秘密。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_10_INTRO_13": "{SAY:Greey}呵呵。我们达成协议了吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_10_INTRO_14": "{ANGRY:tenkyuchimata}我永远不会和你这样的人做交易！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_10_INTRO_15": "{SAY:greedy}好的。我试着对你保持文明。是时候让我的孩子们真正向你们展示他们可以利用所有这些资源做什么了。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_10_INTRO_16": "{NPC_EXIT:greedy}{SAY:tenkyuchimata}他到底在计划什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_10_INTRO_17": "{EXCITED:crazydave}这是他的又一巨大攻击。没有什么是我们两个解决不了的！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_11_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:greedy}{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:tenkyuchimata}{SAY:greedy}哎呀，你们这些家伙和税务员一样烦人。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_11_INTRO_2": "{SAY:greedy}我想这也是没办法的事。在你之后我得派更多的孩子过来。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_11_INTRO_3": "{SAY:greedy}接下来是……这个花瓶般的家伙。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_11_INTRO_4": "{SAY:greedy}我不知道他在做什么，但玩得开心！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_11_INTRO_5": "{NPC_EXIT:greedy}{SAY:crazydave}他现在在做什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_11_INTRO_6": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}他说的可能是那些类似于尸界仙的丧尸。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_11_INTRO_7": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}这些僵尸用花瓶来复活自己。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_11_INTRO_8": "{SAY:crazydave}看来我们得打破一些花瓶了，邻居！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_11_INTRO_9": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}就像过去的美好时光一样！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_12_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:tenkyuchimata}{SAY:tenkyuchimata}又一植物寻求加入你！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_12_INTRO_2": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}艾里斯可以召唤小鸟来攻击并阻挡沿其车道而来的僵尸。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_12_INTRO_3": "{SAY:crazydave}鸟儿一次为我们工作！？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_12_INTRO_4": "{SAY:crazydave}这真是异次元啊！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_13_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:greedy}{SAY:greedy}现在，老实告诉我吧。您是否曾经想过...晋升到更高的职位？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_13_INTRO_2": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:tenkyuchimata}{AWKWARD:tenkyuchimata}...什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_13_INTRO_3": "{SAY:greedy}我不是在跟你说话！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_13_INTRO_4": "{SAY:crazydave}什么更高的等级？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_13_INTRO_5": "{SAY:greedy}上面只是一个跑腿的。一直在和我们那个领导吵架！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_13_INTRO_6": "{SAY:greedy}真是浪费生命。你可以像我一样在社会上层取得巨大的成就。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_13_INTRO_7": "{SAY:crazydave}更高等级？像锥体和桶一样？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_13_INTRO_8": "{SAY:greedy}这……不完全是我的想法。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_13_INTRO_9": "{SAY:greedy}但是，你知道我会用它做什么。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_13_INTRO_10": "{SAY:greedy}也许你需要的是见见皇帝。正如您所描述的那样，将他人提升到更高级别的人。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_13_INTRO_11": "{NPC_EXIT:greedy}{SAY:tenkyuchimata}我真的厌倦了这个强盗。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_13_INTRO_12": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}随着这件事的持续，我越来越虚弱。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_13_INTRO_13": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}如果我消失了，人类会变成什么样子……",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_14_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:greedy}{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:tenkyuchimata}{SAY:greedy}Ooooh，猜猜老贪婪刚刚发现了什么。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_14_INTRO_2": "{SAY:crazydave}？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_14_INTRO_3": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}小偷，这是什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_14_INTRO_4": "{SAY:greedy}我知道他肮脏的小秘密......",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_14_INTRO_5": "{SAY:greedy}你的信心不在于这个小小的冒险，是大卫吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_14_INTRO_6": "{SAY:crazydave}你在说什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_14_INTRO_7": "{SAY:greedy}你这样做不是出于内心的善良，是吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_14_INTRO_8": "{SAY:greedy}Ol'贪婪得到了一些情报。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_14_INTRO_9": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}什么也没发生？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_14_INTRO_10": "{SAY:greedy}无需伪装。我都听到了。你利用了这个女孩，这样你就可以从整个磨难中得到一个三明治。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_14_INTRO_11": "{SAY:crazydave}什么？这只是一个三明治。让所有的烦恼都变得值得。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_14_INTRO_12": "{SAY:greedy}啊，这就是我喜欢你的地方。你知道如何打牌。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_14_INTRO_13": "{SAY:greedy}你看到了一个机会，可以得到你想要的东西，你抓住了它！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_14_INTRO_14": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}嘿！我同意送给他作为奖励！真的，这是我至少能做的。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_14_INTRO_15": "{SAY:greedy}呵呵...总是很高兴看到有人被玩。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_14_INTRO_16": "{SAY:greedy}你有潜力，大卫。你有潜力...",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_14_INTRO_17": "{NPC_EXIT:greedy}{SAY:crazydave}老实说，我不知道那是什么。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_14_INTRO_18": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}他在玩心理游戏……",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_14_INTRO_19": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}哼。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_15_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:greedy}{SAY:greedy}问候。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_15_INTRO_2": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:tenkyuchimata}{ANGRY:tenkyuchimata}我不知道昨天的谈话是关于什么的，但不要试图拉任何东西！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_15_INTRO_3": "{SAY:greedy}我！？可怜的小老我？拉东西吗？管他呢。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_15_INTRO_4": "{SAY:greedy}我只是指出戴夫有一点商人的气质。仅此而已。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_15_INTRO_5": "{SAY:crazydave}看，胖子！我不知怎么就被拉到这里来了！我不知道我在哪里！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_15_INTRO_6": "{SAY:crazydave}我不想被困在这里...我想吃点东西！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_15_INTRO_7": "{SAY:greedy}嗯嗯。没必要跟我故弄玄虚。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_15_INTRO_8": "{SAY:greedy}看看呃。她很绝望。为了你的帮助，我愿意放弃一切。其他大卫也是如此。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_15_INTRO_9": "{SAY:greedy}区别在于：您看到了如何将其货币化。没关系。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_15_INTRO_10": "{SAY:greedy}贪一点并不可耻。这就是你在生活中走得更远……以及失去生命的方式。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_15_INTRO_11": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}...这就是现在外界的问题。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_15_INTRO_12": "{SAY:greedy}就像你说的，为什么这是你的责任？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_15_INTRO_13": "{SAY:greedy}这次我没有对你做什么。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_15_INTRO_14": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}我们知道如果你成功会发生什么......",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_15_INTRO_15": "{SAY:greedy}这就是他们所有人都在这里的原因吗？含糊的威胁？你的说服应该起到一些作用。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_15_INTRO_16": "{SAY:greedy}我现在就去享受一些奢华。毕竟我拥有它。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_15_INTRO_17": "{NPC_EXIT:greedy}{SAY:tenkyuchimata}戴夫……我的力量越来越弱了。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_15_INTRO_18": "{SAY:crazydave}看，我想这只是天气什么的。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_15_INTRO_19": "{TIRED:crazydave}我会……四处看看。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_16_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:tenkyuchimata}{SAY:tenkyuchimata}戴夫！戴夫！你在哪里！？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_16_INTRO_2": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}我找不到他。幸运的是，我有一些储存的阳光。实际上有很多。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_16_INTRO_3": "{NPC_ENTER:greedy}{SAY:greedy}噢噢……嗯嗯。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_16_INTRO_4": "{SAY:greedy}你最近囤货太多了。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_16_INTRO_5": "{SAY:greedy}贪婪是不好的，不是吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_16_INTRO_6": "{ANGRY:tenkyuchimata}哦，一旦我接触到你......",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_16_INTRO_7": "{SAY:greedy}什么？我以为你喜欢负责任的所有权。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_16_INTRO_8": "{SAY:greedy}这里，让我强制执行。用卡啊！你一毛钱都花不了！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_16_INTRO_9": "{NPC_EXIT:greedy}{SAY:tenkyuchimata}他正在使用圣山供品。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_16_INTRO_10": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}看来他打算用它来为自己争取一些阳光",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_16_INTRO_11": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}...这会限制你可以使用的数量。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_16_INTRO_12": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}小心你的阳光，戴夫的邻居。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_17_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:tenkyuchimata}{SAY:tenkyuchimata}哦，戴夫！你在那里！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_17_INTRO_2": "{SAY:crazydave}Chimata，我决定早点把这块草坪弄好！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_17_INTRO_3": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}太棒了！但你之前为什么不这样做呢？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_17_INTRO_4": "{SAY:crazydave}嗯...我不知道。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_17_INTRO_5": "{NPC_ENTER:greedy}{SAY:greedy}我来告诉你为什么！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_17_INTRO_6": "{SAY:greedy}他不想在这里！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_17_INTRO_7": "{SAY:greedy}他不想帮助你，嘟嘟！你绑架了他！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_17_INTRO_8": "{SAY:greedy}你现在还不明白吗！？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_17_INTRO_9": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}我...需要帮助...为了人类。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_17_INTRO_10": "{SAY:greedy}对……对。来吧，现在不要开始对我哭泣。现在的女孩子...",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_17_INTRO_11": "{SAY:greedy}你知道大卫，没有你的车在身边，没有人可以告诉你该怎么做。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_17_INTRO_12": "{SAY:greedy}你可以在这里自由地做任何你想做的事情。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_17_INTRO_13": "{SAY:greedy}听这姑娘说话吗？请！她甚至不是我们附近的人！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_17_INTRO_14": "{SAY:greedy}这个市场你不用死守，反正也不是你的。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_17_INTRO_15": "{SAY:greedy}其实我可以让它成为你的。你能得到的不仅仅是一个三明治……",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_17_INTRO_16": "{SAY:greedy}我可以让很多东西成为你的。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_17_INTRO_17": "{SAY:crazydave}但是……不！你已经尝试过和我做一次交易了！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_17_INTRO_18": "{SAY:greedy}是啊，那辆蠢车挡住了路！你不必在这里听她的！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_17_INTRO_19": "{SAY:greedy}早先看到你的小特技了……一旦摆脱束缚，你就是你自己的人了。我查过你的历史...",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_17_INTRO_20": "{SAY:greedy}进行交易。从你的车里卖东西。呵呵。市场是您的理想地点，不是吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_17_INTRO_21": "{SAY:crazydave}如果我和你做任何交易，你就会回来偷走一切！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_17_INTRO_22": "{SAY:greedy}哦不。我这里有比我需要的更多的东西。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_17_INTRO_23": "{SAY:greedy}加上其他尺寸...",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_17_INTRO_24": "{SAY:greedy}我向你保证，我会给你一个你无法拒绝的条件。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_17_INTRO_25": "{SAY:crazydave}没办法！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_17_INTRO_26": "{SAY:greedy}告诉我，你走遍了所有的世界才给自己买了一份炸玉米饼......一个你甚至从来没有吃过的。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_17_INTRO_27": "{SAY:greedy}只是一些低于标准的替代品僵王，让你有事可做。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_17_INTRO_28": "{SAY:greedy}现在，这有多不满意？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_17_INTRO_29": "{SAY:greedy}...我可以给你买你一直想要的玉米卷。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_17_INTRO_30": "{SAY:crazydave}你的意思是...",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_17_INTRO_31": "{SAY:greedy}还有一笔交易。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_17_INTRO_32": "{TIRED:crazydave}...",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_17_INTRO_33": "{ANGRY:tenkyuchimata}Dave，别被他的黑心产品说服了！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_17_INTRO_34": "{SAY:greedy}市场上很公平。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_17_INTRO_35": "{SAY:greedy}至于你……我正在用一张卡片来驾驭地下太阳的能力！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_17_INTRO_36": "{SAY:greedy}再见！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_17_INTRO_37": "{NPC_EXIT:greedy}{NPC_EXIT:crazydave}{SAY:tenkyuchimata}你们两个小心点……",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_18_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:tenkyuchimata}{SAY:tenkyuchimata}嗨。戴夫的邻居。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_18_INTRO_2": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}对我的信心正在恶化...找不到戴夫...",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_18_INTRO_3": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}他真的这么贪心，为了一个玉米卷追遍了世界吗……？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_18_INTRO_4": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}嗯，我想每个人都有自己的愿望...不会那么糟糕吧？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_18_INTRO_5": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}我希望通过这些色彩缤纷的植物的力量...",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_18_INTRO_6": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}我可以提醒每个人我是谁，并重新获得一些信仰。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_18_INTRO_7": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}包括戴夫对自己的信心。我知道那是什么感觉...",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_18_INTRO_8": "{NPC_ENTER:greedy}{SAY:greedy}Awww...现在这些不是很虚伪吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_18_INTRO_9": "{SAY:greedy}现在有人想要我的信仰！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_18_INTRO_10": "{ANGRY:tenkyuchimata}你只是不知道什么时候停止，是吗？你真卑鄙。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_18_INTRO_11": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}而且你还是个大男孩。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_18_INTRO_12": "{SAY:greedy}现在，我还以为你是在骂人呢，哦——所有权女神！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_18_INTRO_13": "{SAY:greedy}那些植物现在是我的了！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_18_INTRO_14": "{SAY:greedy}你猜怎么着！大卫实际上正在考虑我的提议！哈哈！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_18_INTRO_15": "{SAY:greedy}你真是个坏商人。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_18_INTRO_16": "{NPC_EXIT:greedy}{SAY:tenkyuchimata}还有信心。我能感觉到。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_19_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:greedy}{SAY:greedy}已达成协议。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_19_INTRO_2": "{SAY:greedy}一份炸玉米饼的市场。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_19_INTRO_3": "{SAY:greedy}确实是贸易的顶峰。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_19_INTRO_4": "{NPC_ENTER:tenkyuchimata}{SAY:tenkyuchimata}戴夫，你不会吧！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_19_INTRO_5": "{SAY:greedy}哦，他亲自联系我了！他真的很想要那个炸玉米饼。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_19_INTRO_6": "{TIRED:crazydave}对不起……我追这个追了很久。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_19_INTRO_7": "{SAY:crazydave}而且有贪婪家伙的卡片力量，他可以让它再次变成现实。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_19_INTRO_8": "{SAY:greedy}没错！而你要完蛋了！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_19_INTRO_9": "{SAY:greedy}我现在解放我的卡片…现在！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_19_INTRO_10": "{AWKWARD:tenkyuchimata}...",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_19_INTRO_11": "{SAY:greedy}...",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_19_INTRO_12": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}哈...我就知道他不会那么糟糕。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_19_INTRO_13": "{SAY:greedy}什么！？我的卡在哪里！？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_19_INTRO_14": "{SAY:crazydave}你是说我从你那里偷来的卡牌？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_19_INTRO_15": "{SAY:greedy}什么！？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_19_INTRO_16": "{SAY:crazydave}我跟你不一样！那个炸玉米饼可能是一个未实现的愿望，但我已经继续前进了！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_19_INTRO_17": "{SAY:crazydave}我现在和朋朋一起旅行！我不再需要什么“奖励”了！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_19_INTRO_18": "{EXCITED:crazydave}这段旅程才是真正的意义！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_19_INTRO_19": "{TIRED:crazydave}我忘记了。对不起，奇玛塔。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_19_INTRO_20": "{SAY:crazydave}我不应该向你要任何东西。这不是我与僵尸战斗的原因。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_19_INTRO_21": "{EXCITED:crazydave}你需要保护自己免受僵尸侵害，疯狂戴夫就是你的最佳选择！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_19_INTRO_22": "{EXCITED:crazydave}随时随地！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_19_INTRO_23": "{SAY:greedy}Y-y-yyy-y-你个白痴！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_19_INTRO_24": "{SAY:greedy}你这个胖白痴！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_19_INTRO_25": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}我知道你能做到，戴夫。我可以告诉你你仍然有信心。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_19_INTRO_26": "{SAY:greedy}哈哈哈！那么好吧！我就用人行道把你夷为平地！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_19_INTRO_27": "{SAY:greedy}你可能拿走了我的核心藏品，但我还有备份！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_19_INTRO_28": "{SAY:greedy}还有一张你不知道我身上有的卡片！我的王牌在洞里！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_19_INTRO_29": "{SAY:greedy}看哪！市场崩盘！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_19_INTRO_30": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}那张卡？我什至不知道它还存在！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_19_INTRO_31": "{SAY:crazydave}这是什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_19_INTRO_32": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}是在Kappa的帮助下制作的，与另一起事件有关。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_19_INTRO_33": "{SAY:greedy}如果我不能拥有任何财富，那么没有人可以！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_19_INTRO_34": "{SAY:greedy}那个热闹的市场现在在哪里！？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_19_INTRO_35": "{NPC_EXIT:greedy}{SAY:tenkyuchimata}好消息是，昨晚的植物展示让我重新找回了一些信心。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_19_INTRO_36": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}如果我们能活过今晚和明天，我应该能为这一切做点什么！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_19_INTRO_37": "{SAY:crazydave}我们的工厂成本似乎都很靠不住，但我相信我们可以应付！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_20_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:greedy}{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:tenkyuchimata}{SAY:greedy}The Market Crash didn't get you!?",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_20_INTRO_2": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}You're gonna have to do more than use my own cards against us.",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_20_INTRO_3": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我们抓到你了，贪婪的家伙！ Me and the other Daves!",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_20_INTRO_4": "{SAY:greedy}Seems like I oughta take some drastic measures.",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_20_INTRO_5": "{SAY:greedy}你不会带我出去的！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_20_INTRO_6": "{SAY:greedy}Why, when I had lotsa money I made some wise investments.",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_20_INTRO_7": "{AWKWARD:tenkyuchimata}你现在在忙什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_20_INTRO_8": "{SAY:greedy}What's a rich fella like me without some body guards??",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_20_INTRO_9": "{SAY:greedy}每个戴夫一个！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_20_INTRO_10": "{SAY:greedy}装备保护和摧毁！ My Klepto-matons!",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_20_INTRO_11": "{SAY:greedy}抓住他们，孩子们！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_20_OUTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:greedy}{SAY:greedy}哦天哪...那个呃呃。这肯定没有按照我的预期进行。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_20_OUTRO_2": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:tenkyuchimata}{SAY:tenkyuchimata}你就完成了。但对我来说，这只是一个开始。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_20_OUTRO_3": "{SAY:crazydave}哦，看那个，三明治！但我说了我不想要！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_20_OUTRO_4": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}成交就是成交。你已经证明了自己，疯狂的戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_20_OUTRO_5": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}你值得拥有这个三明治。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_20_OUTRO_6": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}我什至亲自装饰它以反映你来自的维度！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_20_OUTRO_7": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}这个特殊时刻的提醒！ As stressful as it was.",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_20_OUTRO_8": "{EXCITED:crazydave}好吃！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_20_OUTRO_9": "{SAY:greedy}现在... 咕噜... 我知道你知道关于我占领市场的事情只是一个大笑话。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_20_OUTRO_10": "{SAY:greedy}呵呵。 A simple jest of mine. All in good fun.",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_20_OUTRO_11": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}贪婪...哦贪婪。你要留在这里。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_20_OUTRO_12": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}当我完成对你的惩罚时......",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_20_OUTRO_13": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}这个世界的居民会相信你是慷慨之神！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_20_OUTRO_14": "{SAY:greedy}...",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_20_OUTRO_15": "{SAY:greedy}MAMA!",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_20_OUTRO_16": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}我跟你说的穿越神是什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_20_OUTRO_17": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}咳咳……戴夫，邻居们，你们可以走了！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_20_OUTRO_18": "{SAY:tenkyuchimata}The gaps back to your dimensions are opening now. 感谢您的帮助！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_20_OUTRO_19": "{SAY:crazydave}谢谢你的三明治！再见！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_MARKET_20_OUTRO_20": "{NPC_EXIT:crazydave}{SAY:greedy}不！ DON'T LEAVE ME HERE!",
  "NARRATIVE_DANGER_ROOM_INTRO_HOLLOWS_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SAY:crazydave}嗨邻居！欢迎来到绝对零高原！",
  "NARRATIVE_DANGER_ROOM_INTRO_HOLLOWS_2": "{SAY:crazydave}零不正常且无聊……它们是绝对的！",
  "NARRATIVE_DANGER_ROOM_INTRO_SKYCITY_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SAY:crazydave}嗨邻居！欢迎来到死亡地带！",
  "NARRATIVE_DANGER_ROOM_INTRO_SKYCITY_2": "{SAY:crazydave}就像普通扇区一样，但是收不到任何信号！",
  "NARRATIVE_DANGER_ROOM_INTRO_TRAVELLOG_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SAY:crazydave}嗨邻居！欢迎来到危险自然小径！",
  "NARRATIVE_DANGER_ROOM_INTRO_TRAVELLOG_2": "{SAY:crazydave}就像混合干果一样，什么都有一点！",
  "NARRATIVE_DANGER_ROOM_INTRO_TRAVELLOG_3": "{SAY:crazydave}只不过这一次，混合干果反而想吃掉你！",
  "NARRATIVE_DANGER_ROOM_INTRO_TRAVELLOG_MARKET_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SAY:crazydave}嗨邻居！欢迎来到离线贸易中心！",
  "NARRATIVE_DANGER_ROOM_INTRO_TRAVELLOG_MARKET_2": "{SAY:crazydave}负责任地消费，不要被那些饥饿的顾客践踏！",
  "NARRATIVE_DANGER_ROOM_INTRO_FAIRYTALE_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SAY:crazydave}嗨邻居！欢迎来到永无休止的故事！",
  "NARRATIVE_DANGER_ROOM_INTRO_FAIRYTALE_2": "{SAY:crazydave}你会迷失在这些页面中！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_1_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}嗯？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_1_INTRO_2": "{SAY:crazydave}什么-？这是什么地方？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_1_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}扫描记录...",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_1_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}错误。该位置与我的数据库中记录的任何位置都不匹配。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_1_INTRO_5": "{TIRED:crazydave}邻居，我们怎么到这里了……？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_1_INTRO_6": "{SAY:crazydave}我记得的最后一件事是你打开一本书......然后我们突然就在这里。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_1_INTRO_7": "{EXCITED:winnie}打开那本书，我们所有人似乎都被传送到了这个地方。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_1_INTRO_8": "{EXCITED:winnie}我建议我们暂时保留这本书，这样我就可以扫描它的属性。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_1_INTRO_9": "{SAY:crazydave}我很困惑！这是怎么回事！？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_1_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}我还遗憾地通知你，我们在这里并不孤单。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_1_INTRO_11": "{EXCITED:crazydave}等等，我闻到了！这里有僵尸！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_1_INTRO_12": "{SAY:crazydave}草坪上的那些东西是什么？扑克牌？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_1_INTRO_13": "{EXCITED:winnie}我在这些卡片中检测到奇怪的魔法属性。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_1_INTRO_14": "{SAY:winnie}它们是否对我们有利，我们只能推测。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_1_INTRO_15": "{SAY:winnie}现在让我们集中精力建设我们的防御。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_1_INTRO_16": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}还好我还储备了一些植物种子！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_2_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SHOUT:crazydave}不！呃呃！这些卡对我们来说绝对没有好处！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_2_INTRO_2": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:winnie}也许这还不是全部，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_2_INTRO_3": "{EXCITED:winnie}您可能已经注意到，今天草坪上出现了另一个神奇的物体。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_2_INTRO_4": "{SAY:crazydave}哇，这些是什么？魔镜？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_2_INTRO_5": "{SAY:crazydave}他们的周围长着小藤蔓......",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_2_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}看起来是这样。当地的树叶已经覆盖了这些镜子。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_2_INTRO_7": "{PLAYFUL:winnie}也就是说，它们对我们来说绝对是有利的。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_2_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}它们含有魔法能量，可以反射魔法卡弹。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_2_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}我们可以利用这一点将卡片射弹反射回僵尸。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_2_INTRO_10": "{EXCITED:crazydave}神奇的护盾！就在你身边，僵尸们！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_3_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{PLAYFUL:crazydave}我得说，即使这应该是不稳定的，但我很开心！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_3_INTRO_2": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}这个地方让我想起了戴夫妈妈在睡前讲的故事！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_3_INTRO_3": "{EXCITED:crazydave}在魔法森林中探险的骑士，战胜邪恶的僵尸大军！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_3_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}看来这片森林里不只有丧尸。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_3_INTRO_5": "{EXCITED:winnie}我们已经熟悉了Hatter-shroom。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_3_INTRO_6": "{EXCITED:winnie}它通过发射帽子来攻击僵尸，然后帽子会弹到其他障碍物上。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_3_INTRO_7": "{SAY:crazydave}他从哪里来？和我们一样吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_3_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}我不能确定。我仍在对这本“魔法书”的本质进行扫描。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_3_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}还有什么你能回忆起来的吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_3_INTRO_10": "{SAY:crazydave}嗯...不。并不真地。我只记得是僵尸把它掉下来的。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_3_INTRO_11": "{TIRED:crazydave}我想……这是一个小鬼……？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_3_INTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}小鬼掉落了这本书？有趣的。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_3_INTRO_13": "{SAY:crazydave}呸！这个无聊的话题先搁置吧！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_3_INTRO_14": "{EXCITED:crazydave}这小家伙一定是迫不及待想冲上擂台了吧！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_3_INTRO_15": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}你可以成为大骑士的扈从！让我们勇往直前吧！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_4_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:winnie}我预测某种类型的薄雾很快就会笼罩这片区域。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_4_INTRO_2": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}就像……某种魔法雾？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_4_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}它似乎以不同的方式影响植物和僵尸。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_4_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}被雾气笼罩时，僵尸会获得增益。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_4_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}与此同时，我们的植物将陷入沉睡。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_4_INTRO_6": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}嘿，工作时不能睡觉！蘑菇甚至不再这样做了！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_4_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}我也在这片雾气中感觉到了另一个额外的存在。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_4_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}看起来是一个相当强大的僵尸。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_4_INTRO_9": "{EXCITED:crazydave}那我们一定找到他们的首领了！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_4_INTRO_10": "{EXCITED:crazydave}不用担心，朋朋！伟大的骑士戴夫来拯救世界！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_4_INTRO_11": "{EXCITED:crazydave}当他们出现时，就是我们英勇击倒他们的时候了！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_4_INTRO_12": "{TIRED:winnie}如果可以的话，让我们避免打架。我们的首要任务是逃跑。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_4_INTRO_13": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}嘿，来吧！享受一点乐趣，好吗，朋朋？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_5_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:crazydave}我看到新的挑战者即将出现！骑兵来了！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_5_INTRO_2": "{TIRED:winnie}是的，敌方骑士……骑着独角兽。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_5_INTRO_3": "{TIRED:winnie}这慢慢变得越来越可笑了。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_5_INTRO_4": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}愚蠢的骑士！你知道只有心地纯洁的人才能骑独角兽！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_5_INTRO_5": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}看吧，那只独角兽一有机会就会把他甩掉！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_5_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}也许现在是利用我们的新盟友的好时机。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_5_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}春天公主的吊球会弹到她前面的瓷砖上，甚至在相邻的车道上也是如此。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_5_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}这些弹簧将留在瓷砖上，在失效前将僵尸击退。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_5_INTRO_9": "{EXCITED:crazydave}大骑士团又添新成员！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_5_INTRO_10": "{TIRED:winnie}这支骑兵难道是他们的首领派来增援的？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_6_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，我正在检测一套带有钻石套装的新牌。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_6_INTRO_2": "{TIRED:crazydave}上次那支骑兵有钻石标记……",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_6_INTRO_3": "{EXCITED:winnie}正确。卡牌只能由具有相同花色的僵尸激活。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_6_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}特殊僵尸属于不同的、独特的套装。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_6_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}不同的卡牌也有不同的效果。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_6_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}这也适用于它们的反射效果。所以请记住这一切。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_6_INTRO_7": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}天啊，有太多东西需要记录！卡片、镜子、雾……",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_6_INTRO_8": "{SAY:crazydave}嗯……不知道为什么，这里的雾看起来更像是烟雾！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_6_INTRO_9": "{TIRED:crazydave}那个……还有镜子……它给了我一个特定的形象……",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_6_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}我看到你最终成功建立了连接，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_6_INTRO_11": "{SAY:winnie}我正想宣布这些丧尸的神秘首领不是别人，正是——",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_6_INTRO_12": "{NPC_ENTER:nanny}{SAY:crazydave}奶奶！我应该早点意识到的！就是她把我们困在这里的！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_6_INTRO_13": "{SAY:nanny}...",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_6_INTRO_14": "{SPECIAL1:nanny}什么@#$%！？你怎么在这里！？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_6_INTRO_15": "{SAY:crazydave}嗯？你不是派了一个小恶魔来给我们那本邪恶的魔法书吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_6_INTRO_16": "{SAY:nanny}魔法书？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_6_INTRO_17": "{SPECIAL1:nanny}@#$%！课程。当然，这是一本神奇的书！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_6_INTRO_18": "{SAY:nanny}我应该知道僵王不会告诉我只保护一些随机书籍。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_6_INTRO_19": "{TIRED:nanny}在僵王把它们交给我之后，一定是小鬼从我的书房里偷走了其中一张。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_6_INTRO_20": "{TIRED:winnie}还有一本书吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_6_INTRO_21": "{TIRED:crazydave}所以你不是故意陷害我们的？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_6_INTRO_22": "{TIRED:nanny}我只记得打开那本愚蠢的书，然后在这儿醒来！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_6_INTRO_23": "{SAY:winnie}所以你和我们有同样的困境。然后，我提议休战。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_6_INTRO_24": "{SAY:winnie}让我们抛开分歧，共同寻找走出这片森林的出口。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_6_INTRO_25": "{SAY:nanny}...",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_6_INTRO_26": "{SAY:nanny}不。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_6_INTRO_27": "{PLAYFUL:nanny}想想其实我不介意这里...",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_6_INTRO_28": "{SAY:nanny}很安静。无论如何，比我必须照顾的小鬼孤儿院安静。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_6_INTRO_29": "{PLAYFUL:nanny}天知道，我早该离开僵王和他的小鬼了，不是吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_6_INTRO_30": "{SAY:winnie}我们不知道这片森林的性质。我们越早离开越好。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_6_INTRO_31": "{TIRED:nanny}你怎么知道？只不过是普通的植物和僵尸而已！谁在乎呢？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_6_INTRO_32": "{SHOUT:nanny}放开我！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_6_INTRO_33": "{NPC_EXIT:nanny}{TIRED:winnie}但是——",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_6_INTRO_34": "{SAY:crazydave}呃，她会回来的。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_6_INTRO_35": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}现在就让我们玩得开心吧！看，我们所有的植物也都玩得很开心！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_7_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}我的传感器在空气中发现了一丝恶作剧的痕迹。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_7_INTRO_2": "{SAY:crazydave}真的吗？是什么原因造成的？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_7_INTRO_3": "{NPC_ENTER:nanny}{SPECIAL1:nanny}小鬼僵尸s！ @#$​​%^！小鬼僵尸s！这就是造成这种情况的原因...胡特尼尼！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_7_INTRO_4": "{SAY:nanny}我终于开始放松了，想象着自己远离小矮子......",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_7_INTRO_5": "{EXCITED:nanny}这……东西！它显现出来了！它是什么？它是一只猫吗？小鬼？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_7_INTRO_6": "{SAY:nanny}当我想仔细观察时，它消失了！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_7_INTRO_7": "{TIRED:crazydave}消失了？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_7_INTRO_8": "{EXCITED:nanny}哦，它还在那里，我能听到它咯咯地笑！它不知何故变得隐形了！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_7_INTRO_9": "{SPECIAL1:nanny}突然，小@#$%^又出现了，把我的头按到了树上！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_7_INTRO_10": "{SAY:nanny}即使是在这啦啦地……我也无法控制这些小家伙！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_7_INTRO_11": "{TIRED:nanny}我希望他们能听我一次！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_7_INTRO_12": "{NPC_EXIT:nanny}{TIRED:winnie}所以我们面对的是一个可以随意出现和消失的小鬼……",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_7_INTRO_13": "{SAY:crazydave}哦不！我们的植物能看到它吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_7_INTRO_14": "{EXCITED:winnie}也许我们的新伙伴 Ent 可以提供帮助。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_7_INTRO_15": "{SAY:winnie}他是一堵墙，可以攻击前方一定范围内的僵尸。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_7_INTRO_16": "{SAY:winnie}当他没有被僵尸攻击时，他也会定期治愈自己。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_7_INTRO_17": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}靠，这家伙果然有射程啊！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_8_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{TIRED:winnie}我尽了最大的努力，还是没能破解这本魔法书。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_8_INTRO_2": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}也许你应该更加关注眼前的事情，朋朋！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_8_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，解开这个谜团是我们回家的钥匙——",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_8_INTRO_4": "{TIRED:crazydave}不，我的意思是字面意思！看看你的前面！那些东西是什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_8_INTRO_5": "{TIRED:winnie}哦。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_8_INTRO_6": "{TIRED:winnie}抱歉。我太专注于这本书了，以至于没有注意到这些……",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_8_INTRO_7": "{TIRED:winnie}...大锅？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_8_INTRO_8": "{SAY:crazydave}这里好像有某种药剂！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_8_INTRO_9": "{EXCITED:crazydave}嘿，邻居！你为什么不尝试在这些药剂中加入植物性食物呢？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_8_INTRO_10": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}谁知道呢？也许会有好事发生！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_9_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}所以，回顾一下，保姆已经拿到了一系列魔法书籍。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_9_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}我们已经亲手拿到了其中一本书，这是由一个手脚不好的小鬼提供的。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_9_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}之后，你打开书，我们就到了这里。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_9_INTRO_4": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}然后奶奶出现了！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_9_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}负。扫描显示保姆在我们之前到达这里。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_9_INTRO_6": "{TIRED:crazydave}等等，所以她先掉进书里了？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_9_INTRO_7": "{SAY:crazydave}掉进书里……是这样的吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_9_INTRO_8": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我们是在一本魔法书中吗？我们生活在童话里吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_9_INTRO_9": "{TIRED:winnie}不知何故，我觉得还有更多的事情。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_9_INTRO_10": "{NPC_ENTER:nanny}{PLAYFUL:nanny}所以。你说童话？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_9_INTRO_11": "{PLAYFUL:nanny}告诉你，这个地方确实让我想起了妈妈以前给我讲的睡前故事。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_9_INTRO_12": "{SAY:nanny}愚蠢的小故事，每个人都一直很开心。总的。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_9_INTRO_13": "{PLAYFUL:nanny}好像生活可以如此简单。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_9_INTRO_14": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}但是如果生活就这样简单不是很有趣吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_9_INTRO_15": "{SAY:nanny}有趣...？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_9_INTRO_16": "{PLAYFUL:nanny}呵呵。我想对于像你这样的白痴来说，享受乐趣就是生活的全部吧？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_9_INTRO_17": "{SAY:nanny}可怜。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_9_INTRO_18": "{NPC_EXIT:nanny}{SAY:crazydave}天啊，真是个派对大佬！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_9_INTRO_19": "{TIRED:winnie}还是没明白。这一切意味着什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_10_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SHOUT:crazydave}那是穿着铠甲的巨人僵尸吗！？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_10_INTRO_2": "{EXCITED:winnie}这个庞然大物似乎也带着贵族的小鬼。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_10_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}被击败时，他会掉落他的女王小鬼，女王小鬼将会逃离草坪。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_10_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}她需要尽快被击败，否则她会召唤骑兵参战。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_10_INTRO_5": "{EXCITED:crazydave}这太疯狂了！我从来没有遇到过穿着盔甲的巨人！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_10_INTRO_6": "{NPC_ENTER:nanny}{EXCITED:nanny}哈哈哈...哈哈。你说疯了吗？我完全同意。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_10_INTRO_7": "{EXCITED:winnie}这背后是你吗？你是怎么做到的？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_10_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}前几天你连小鬼都控制不了。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_10_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}现在你正在控制一支庞大的军队？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_10_INTRO_10": "{PLAYFUL:nanny}呵呵，谁知道呢？我只是觉得这些白痴能听我一次就好了。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_10_INTRO_11": "{PLAYFUL:nanny}就像那样，他们突然这样做了。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_10_INTRO_12": "{EXCITED:nanny}就像我想在这个地方发生的一切都发生了。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_10_INTRO_13": "{EXCITED:nanny}他们中的一些人甚至开始称我为他们的女王！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_10_INTRO_14": "{PLAYFUL:nanny}现在，你为什么不给你的女王一些娱乐呢？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_10_INTRO_15": "{EXCITED:nanny}压扁这三个和它们的小植物！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_10_INTRO_16": "{NPC_EXIT:nanny}{EXCITED:crazydave}哦不，你不！没有人能打败大骑士戴夫和他的剧团！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_10_INTRO_17": "{EXCITED:crazydave}加油，邻居！让我们聚集我们自己的军队吧！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_10_INTRO_18": "{NPC_EXIT:crazydave}{SAY:winnie}“我想在这个地方发生的一切……都发生了……？”",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_11_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:winnie}我想我有一个理论，用户戴夫。你愿意听吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_11_INTRO_2": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}还等不及朋朋吗？我和植物们即将开始另一项任务！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_11_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，请。这是一个非常紧迫的问题。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_11_INTRO_4": "{TIRED:crazydave}好吧，好吧。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_11_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}这个地方的一切似乎都与保姆有关。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_11_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}当她第一次想象出一个小恶魔时，一个小恶魔神奇地出现了。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_11_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}她希望小鬼们听她的话，他们突然称她为女王。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_11_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}还记得当我们谈论童话故事时她对这个地方说了什么吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_11_INTRO_9": "{TIRED:crazydave}这很蠢吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_11_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}这让她想起了她母亲的童话故事。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_11_INTRO_11": "{SAY:winnie}我相信这个地方是基于她心灵的阴谋而创造出来的。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_11_INTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}从她先堕落开始，这本书就在回应她的想法，创造出了这个境界。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_11_INTRO_13": "{TIRED:crazydave}她梦想着一个童话世界，书上实现了吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_11_INTRO_14": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}像她这样残忍的人为什么要活在童话里？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_11_INTRO_15": "{NPC_ENTER:nanny}{PLAYFUL:nanny}那么，是这样的吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_11_INTRO_16": "{EXCITED:nanny}这个世界是我心灵的阴谋塑造的......哈哈！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_11_INTRO_17": "{PLAYFUL:nanny}多么荒谬！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_11_INTRO_18": "{SAY:crazydave}看，她同意我的观点！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_11_INTRO_19": "{SHOUT:nanny}我同意你的车，你这个白痴。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_11_INTRO_20": "{TIRED:crazydave}哈！？那么你真的希望有一个这样的世界吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_11_INTRO_21": "{TIRED:nanny}嗯，也许我去过。这段时间...",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_11_INTRO_22": "{EXCITED:nanny}生活在一个没有滋扰的世界，那是梦想成真！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_11_INTRO_23": "{SAY:nanny}一个人们听我说话的世界......",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_11_INTRO_24": "{SAY:nanny}一个没有讨厌的哭泣小鬼的世界......没有令人讨厌的......卑鄙的老板！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_11_INTRO_25": "{EXCITED:nanny}这一定就是生活在Easy Street的感觉吧……哈哈。咳嗽。哈哈！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_11_INTRO_26": "{NPC_EXIT:nanny}{EXCITED:crazydave}她疯了！那是我发出的！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_11_INTRO_27": "{SAY:winnie}她的狂热还不止于此。她又发起了一次袭击。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_11_INTRO_28": "{SAY:crazydave}好吧，看来我们必须暂停这个任务了，朋友们！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_11_INTRO_29": "{EXCITED:crazydave}不用担心！大骑士戴夫来阻止女王的疯狂！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_12_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}又一波僵尸大潮来了，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_12_INTRO_2": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}她说这些家伙像女王一样听她说话，是认真的吧？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_12_INTRO_3": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}不过我不介意！伟大骑士需要杀死更多坏人！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_12_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}我还检测到有强大的对手正在接近我们的位置。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_12_INTRO_5": "{EXCITED:crazydave}奶奶亲自来挑战我们吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_12_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}我察觉到的这种强烈的气场并不是她身上散发出来的。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_12_INTRO_7": "{TIRED:winnie}好像是……小鬼……？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_12_INTRO_8": "{SAY:crazydave}小鬼？小鬼能有多强？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_12_INTRO_9": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}这将是一条草地步道！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_12_INTRO_10": "{NPC_ENTER:nanny}{SHOUT:nanny}不！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_12_INTRO_11": "{SHOUT:nanny}无论你做什么，都不要伤害那个小恶魔！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_12_INTRO_12": "{TIRED:crazydave}嗯？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_12_INTRO_13": "{TIRED:crazydave}你从什么时候开始关心小鬼了？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_12_INTRO_14": "{TIRED:nanny}这个小鬼……她不一样。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_12_INTRO_15": "{SHOUT:nanny}不...不！我不会让你伤害她的！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_12_INTRO_16": "{NPC_EXIT:nanny}{TIRED:crazydave}好吧……？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_12_INTRO_17": "{SAY:winnie}让我们暂时忽略这种令人困惑的行为。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_12_INTRO_18": "{SAY:winnie}这个“小鬼”需要我们立即关注。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_12_OUTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:nannyboss}{SHOUT:nannyboss}不...不...不不不！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_12_OUTRO_2": "{TIRED:nannyboss}那些白痴居然让你失望了……？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_12_OUTRO_3": "{TIRED:nannyboss}我不会让你就这样结束。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_12_OUTRO_4": "{TIRED:nannyboss}我不会...",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_12_OUTRO_5": "{SAY:nannyboss}我不会让这个梦想就这样结束。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_13_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{TIRED:crazydave}Brrr！那是一只令人毛骨悚然的小恶魔！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_13_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}其实，它可能根本就不是小鬼。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_13_INTRO_3": "{EXCITED:winnie}我的扫描仪无法识别它。这是一个魔法存在。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_13_INTRO_4": "{EXCITED:winnie}这个神秘领域的空气中盛行着同样的魔法。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_13_INTRO_5": "{SAY:crazydave}但是……为什么它看起来像小鬼？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_13_INTRO_6": "{NPC_ENTER:queennanny}{EXCITED:queennanny}你……看看你做了什么！在我告诉你不要伤害她之后！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_13_INTRO_7": "{TIRED:crazydave}...啊？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_13_INTRO_8": "{SPECIAL1:queennanny}你像@#$%一样笨吗！小鬼，无法理解基本指令！？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_13_INTRO_9": "{TIRED:winnie}我觉得我们必须解决房间里的大象问题。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_13_INTRO_10": "{SAY:crazydave}起床是怎么回事？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_13_INTRO_11": "{SAY:queennanny}那个“小鬼”……她是书之力的化身。这就是她告诉我的。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_13_INTRO_12": "{SAY:queennanny}表达某人真实愿望的力量。彰显的力量...",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_13_INTRO_13": "{SAY:queennanny}“……影子……真实的自己。”",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_13_INTRO_14": "{EXCITED:queennanny}要强大，要被尊重！这是一个最美妙的梦！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_13_INTRO_15": "{EXCITED:queennanny}但是你却继续前进，差点毁了她！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_13_INTRO_16": "{SAY:queennanny}我不会有这样的梦想结局！我把她的存在束缚在了我的身体里……",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_13_INTRO_17": "{EXCITED:queennanny}现在，我保证这是一个我们谁都不会醒来的梦！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_13_INTRO_18": "{TIRED:crazydave}你的意思是，我们被困在这里了？！永远！？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_13_INTRO_19": "{EXCITED:queennanny}为了你的忏悔，我判处你和你的植物永远沉睡！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_13_INTRO_20": "{SAY:queennanny}我的镜后宫廷会处理这件事！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_13_INTRO_21": "{NPC_EXIT:queennanny}{TIRED:crazydave}镜子女王...？他们要对我们做什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_13_INTRO_22": "{SAY:winnie}我们以前遇到过他们。在我们与小恶魔的战斗中他们就在场。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_13_INTRO_23": "{EXCITED:winnie}他们能够轻松控制和禁用我们的镜子。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_13_INTRO_24": "{SAY:winnie}它们还携带有毒食物，能够使植物陷入沉睡。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_13_INTRO_25": "{SAY:crazydave}T-这实在是太糟糕了！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_14_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{TIRED:crazydave}那么，我们要做什么，朋朋？我们要怎样——",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_14_INTRO_2": "{TIRED:winnie}用户戴夫，请冷静一下。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_14_INTRO_3": "{SAY:crazydave}但她说我们永远被困在这里！我们要怎样——",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_14_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}我们会想办法离开这个地方的，用户戴夫。放心。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_14_INTRO_5": "{TIRED:crazydave}当你告诉我们逃跑时我应该听你的。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_14_INTRO_6": "{TIRED:crazydave}但我只是出去偷懒……现在她把我们困在这儿了！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_14_INTRO_7": "{TIRED:winnie}嗯，这是一个……令人分心的地方，我不能完全责怪你。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_14_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}不过，既然你已经冷静下来了，我必须通知你有新的到来。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_14_INTRO_9": "{EXCITED:winnie}僵尸面前有一头大灰狼。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_14_INTRO_10": "{EXCITED:winnie}他随身携带着三座建筑物，每座建筑物都承载着一只被困的小猪。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_14_INTRO_11": "{SAY:crazydave}说，朋朋，这就是我不明白的。保姆讨厌小鬼，不是吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_14_INTRO_12": "{TIRED:crazydave}为什么她梦想的理想世界里会堆满它们？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_14_INTRO_13": "{SAY:winnie}想想这本书的力量就像一面镜子，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_14_INTRO_14": "{SAY:winnie}这个地方体现了保姆扭曲的世界观。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_14_INTRO_15": "{TIRED:crazydave}这如何解释这些小鬼？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_14_INTRO_16": "{SAY:winnie}嗯，小鬼是无忧无虑的灵魂。他们无忧无虑地过着自己的日子。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_14_INTRO_17": "{SAY:winnie}我想，这就是保姆内心深处最渴望的吧。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_14_INTRO_18": "{SAY:winnie}这就是为什么这个地方充满了小鬼。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_14_INTRO_19": "{SAY:winnie}因此，她的欲望以小恶魔的形式显现。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_14_INTRO_20": "{TIRED:crazydave}哦……所以这也是她那么讨厌小鬼的原因吧？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_14_INTRO_21": "{PLAYFUL:winnie}她很羡慕。而且很苦。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_15_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，我们已经获得了另一座工厂。这是——",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_15_INTRO_2": "{EXCITED:crazydave}是咖啡豆！我认识这个人！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_15_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}那么我想你已经知道他唤醒植物的特性了。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_15_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}我必须补充一下，但是，他现在也可以加速周围区域的植物。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_15_INTRO_5": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}我以为他退役了！他是怎么到这里来的？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_15_INTRO_6": "{TIRED:winnie}他当然没有和我们一起进来...",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_15_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}但是，既然他是你的植物老朋友，他不可能起源于这里。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_15_INTRO_8": "{TIRED:winnie}想一想，我们目前发现的植物是不是起源于这里……？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_15_INTRO_9": "{NPC_ENTER:queennanny}{EXCITED:queennanny}这是什么！？能把人从梦中叫醒的植物！？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_15_INTRO_10": "{EXCITED:queennanny}我的王国不会有这样的亵渎行为！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_15_INTRO_11": "{SAY:crazydave}如果你不想让我们出现在你的梦里，就让我们出去吧！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_15_INTRO_12": "{EXCITED:queennanny}还有你呼叫援军从外面摧毁我的梦想吗！？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_15_INTRO_13": "{PLAYFUL:queennanny}继续梦想！哈哈哈！哦，你看到我在那里做了什么吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_15_INTRO_14": "{PLAYFUL:queennanny}我太搞笑了。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_15_INTRO_15": "{EXCITED:winnie}你的偏执和狂热已经蒙蔽了你的理性。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_15_INTRO_16": "{EXCITED:winnie}这个梦境只不过是幻象而已。这里没有什么是现实。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_15_INTRO_17": "{EXCITED:crazydave}是的，我们将继续抵抗你，直到我们离开这里！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_15_INTRO_18": "{SAY:queennanny}抵抗我？现实？切！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_15_INTRO_19": "{PLAYFUL:queennanny}我们会看到这一点。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_16_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:queennanny}{SHOUT:queennanny}你对我梦想的持续抵制已经玷污了我的梦想！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_16_INTRO_2": "{TIRED:queennanny}太多了，我已经开始回忆在“现实”世界中等待着我的绝对痛苦......",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_16_INTRO_3": "{TIRED:queennanny}僵王，还有他让我经历的所有痛苦……",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_16_INTRO_4": "{SPECIAL1:queennanny}那些@#$%^，他的那些令人讨厌的小恶魔……",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_16_INTRO_5": "{SAY:queennanny}.....",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_16_INTRO_6": "{EXCITED:queennanny}...还有她。那个不怀好意、背后捅刀子的邪恶女巫！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_16_INTRO_7": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{TIRED:crazydave}邪恶的女巫……？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_16_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}正在扫描……",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_16_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}今天我们确实遇到了女巫。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_16_INTRO_10": "{EXCITED:winnie}她能够将我们的植物变成青蛙，然后青蛙会逐渐向前跳跃。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_16_INTRO_11": "{TIRED:queennanny}哼……这些令人作呕的想法……一定是这些魔女诞生了。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_16_INTRO_12": "{SAY:queennanny}没关系！在我的指挥下，他们将第一次成为别人的麻烦！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_17_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:queennanny}{PLAYFUL:queennanny}想到我神圣母亲的摇篮曲会变成现实......",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_17_INTRO_2": "{EXCITED:queennanny}噢，亲爱的妈妈。我听从了你的甜蜜建议！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_17_INTRO_3": "{EXCITED:queennanny}现在，我在Easy Street过着快乐的生活！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_17_INTRO_4": "{PLAYFUL:queennanny}妈妈，你能听到我说话吗？我知道你是...",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_17_INTRO_5": "{PLAYFUL:queennanny}...在那儿。倾听。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_17_INTRO_6": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{TIRED:crazydave}下降？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_17_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}再说一次，这个地方只不过是那本魔法书造成的幻象。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_17_INTRO_8": "{SAY:queennanny}Tsk。为什么你这么坚决地抵制这个！？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_17_INTRO_9": "{EXCITED:crazydave}因为我们被困在这里了！违背我们的意愿！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_17_INTRO_10": "{EXCITED:queennanny}被困？这就是救赎！你应该感谢我！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_17_INTRO_11": "{SAY:crazydave}这拯救怎么样！？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_17_INTRO_12": "{EXCITED:queennanny}这是一个没有问题的世界，每个问题都能有简单的解决！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_17_INTRO_13": "{SAY:queennanny}这就是童话故事的本质。任何结果都会有一个圆满的结局。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_17_INTRO_14": "{SAY:queennanny}此外，在内心深处，我知道你会喜欢这样的东西。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_17_INTRO_15": "{SAY:crazydave}我？决不...！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_17_INTRO_16": "{EXCITED:queennanny}别想撒谎！你以为我没注意到吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_17_INTRO_17": "{PLAYFUL:queennanny}你带着愚蠢的植物在草地上跑来跑去！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_17_INTRO_18": "{EXCITED:queennanny}无忧无虑地嬉戏于世间，扮演想象中的“大骑士！”",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_17_INTRO_19": "{EXCITED:crazydave}那是在我意识到我永远无法回到现实之前！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_17_INTRO_20": "{PLAYFUL:queennanny}啊。但如果这就是你的现实，那么你就不会有这样的担忧，不是吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_17_INTRO_21": "{SAY:queennanny}你就在这个简单、快乐的地方度过余下的日子吧！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_17_INTRO_22": "{PLAYFUL:queennanny}承认吧。这听起来不是很诱人吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_17_INTRO_23": "{TIRED:crazydave}W-嗯，我-",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_17_INTRO_24": "{SAY:queennanny}还在抵抗吗？也许你终于名副其实了……",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_17_INTRO_25": "{EXCITED:queennanny}疯狂！疯狂的！受骗了！到了否认救赎的地步！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_17_INTRO_26": "{NPC_EXIT:queennanny}{SAY:winnie}别听她的，用户戴夫，邻居。这只不过是胡言乱语而已。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_18_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}我找到了另一个新盟友，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_18_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}雾霾蘑菇用孢子云攻击僵尸。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_18_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}这些云会偷走僵尸增益等魔法。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_18_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}她还可以治疗有限范围内的植物减益效果，包括动物变形。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_18_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}窃取的魔法越多，攻击力就越强。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_18_INTRO_6": "{TIRED:crazydave}Huh. 你在哪里找到她的，朋朋？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_18_INTRO_7": "{TIRED:winnie}你知道，用户戴夫。我们最初以为这些植物都起源于这里。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_18_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}但是随着Coffee Bean的出现，我们知道事实并非如此。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_18_INTRO_9": "{TIRED:crazydave}也就是说他们是从外面来的？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_18_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}这是猜测，但是……保姆将自己与这本书的魔法核心融合在一起……",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_18_INTRO_11": "{TIRED:winnie}……或许加强了这个领域的吸引力。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_18_INTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}即使没有书，现实中的事物也开始被拉进这个梦里。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_18_INTRO_13": "{SAY:crazydave}那么...这是什么意思...？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_18_INTRO_14": "{TIRED:winnie}现实与梦想之间的界限越来越模糊。如果这种情况继续下去……",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_18_INTRO_15": "{TIRED:winnie}不会有任何区别。这两个世界将会融合。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_18_INTRO_16": "{TIRED:crazydave}我...不知道对此有何感受。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_18_INTRO_17": "{SAY:winnie}这将是灾难性的。想象一下它将消除的混乱。 We can't let it happen.",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_18_INTRO_18": "{SAY:winnie}明天，我会进一步搜寻可能的逃生路线。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_18_INTRO_19": "{SAY:winnie}您和邻居必须同时坚守堡垒。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_19_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{PLAYFUL:crazydave}嘿邻居。今天就只有我们两个人了。 And the plants.",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_19_INTRO_2": "{SAY:crazydave}我想知道我们是否能离开这里。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_19_INTRO_3": "{TIRED:crazydave}...但是也许...即使我们不这样做，也不会那么糟糕？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_19_INTRO_4": "{NPC_ENTER:queennanny}{PLAYFUL:queennanny}所以。其实你已经考虑过我要说的话了...",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_19_INTRO_5": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我只是把它当作最坏的情况来考虑！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_19_INTRO_6": "{SPECIAL1:queennanny}那好，我很高兴那辆 @#$% 车今天不在。这对我方便多了。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_19_INTRO_7": "{EXCITED:crazydave}不要那样谈论朋朋！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_19_INTRO_8": "{TIRED:queennanny}哦，拜托。“朋朋”只是一台机器。“它”不像你我一样。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_19_INTRO_9": "{SAY:queennanny}它没有欲望。它不需要。它没有梦想。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_19_INTRO_10": "{EXCITED:queennanny}它不理解我们这样的人的困境！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_19_INTRO_11": "{SAY:crazydave}人们喜欢我们吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_19_INTRO_12": "{SAY:queennanny}我们的愿望难道不是一样的吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_19_INTRO_13": "{EXCITED:queennanny}像孩子一样自由奔放，不受世界残酷的束缚！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_19_INTRO_14": "{TIRED:queennanny}世界是残酷的。它需要，需要，需要。你知道这一点。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_19_INTRO_15": "{SAY:queennanny}以前，你靠在车后座卖垃圾来度日！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_19_INTRO_16": "{PLAYFUL:queennanny}小时候睡前读童话故事不是更好吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_19_INTRO_17": "{SAY:crazydave}...",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_19_INTRO_18": "{SAY:queennanny}但是世界慢慢地但肯定地夺走了你的纯真。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_19_INTRO_19": "{SAY:queennanny}你没有听到这片森林的召唤吗？不要抗拒它！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_19_INTRO_20": "{EXCITED:crazydave}你……你生气了！你想闯入我的脑海！朋朋警告我了！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_19_INTRO_21": "{SAY:queennanny}哦...即使没有我的帮助你也已经到了那里，“疯狂”戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_19_INTRO_22": "{EXCITED:queennanny}大多数人都生气了！你，尤其是...",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_19_INTRO_23": "{SAY:crazydave}我没有生气！我是——",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_19_INTRO_24": "{SAY:queennanny}我不是在跟你说话！我正在和你的小邻居说话。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_19_INTRO_25": "{SAY:crazydave}嗯？他们？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_19_INTRO_26": "{SAY:queennanny}你为什么要继续跟随大卫进行这些愚蠢的旅程？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_19_INTRO_27": "{SAY:queennanny}保护世界？世界为你做了什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_19_INTRO_28": "{PLAYFUL:queennanny}呵呵。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_19_INTRO_29": "{PLAYFUL:queennanny}我们都知道这不是真的，不是吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_19_INTRO_30": "{PLAYFUL:queennanny}这些植物大战僵尸都是废话。这对你来说只是一场游戏，不是吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_19_INTRO_31": "{SAY:queennanny}一款可以扮演“英雄”、“伟大骑士”的游戏。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_19_INTRO_32": "{SAY:queennanny}逃离世界的残酷！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_19_INTRO_33": "{EXCITED:queennanny}承认吧，你和我们其他人一样生气！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_19_INTRO_34": "{SAY:queennanny}如果你不是，而世界对你很好，你除了这里还会在其他地方吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_19_INTRO_35": "{EXCITED:crazydave}别再像了解我们一样跟我们说话了！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_19_INTRO_36": "{SAY:queennanny}你自己也说过，“如果生活就这样简单，那不是很有趣吗？”",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_19_INTRO_37": "{SAY:queennanny}这是事实。继续拒绝它，你会发现等待你的只有痛苦。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_20_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:queennanny}{EXCITED:queennanny}每个人都梦想着幸福的生活！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_20_INTRO_2": "{SAY:queennanny}如果你加入我，我可以让你的梦想成真！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_20_INTRO_3": "{TIRED:crazydave}有梦想吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_20_INTRO_4": "{SAY:queennanny}停止抵抗。又变回小孩了！只要你驶离悬崖——",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_20_INTRO_5": "{SAY:queennanny}-你可以沿着黑麦田幸福地奔跑度过余生。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_20_INTRO_6": "{TIRED:crazydave}我...",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_20_INTRO_7": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}...这是怎么回事？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_20_INTRO_8": "{EXCITED:queennanny}别理会这台机器！拥抱你的愿望，加入我吧！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_20_INTRO_9": "{EXCITED:winnie}什么！？用户戴夫，你不能认真考虑这个！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_20_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}我们必须回到现实！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_20_INTRO_11": "{EXCITED:queennanny}生活在幸福的童话里会让你摆脱痛苦！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_20_INTRO_12": "{SAY:queennanny}我们不再需要现实了！最好让它被童话般的梦想吞没......",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_20_INTRO_13": "{EXCITED:queennanny}跟我一起，让这个梦想扩展！免除许多人的痛苦！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_20_INTRO_14": "{EXCITED:queennanny}大家幸福的选择权就在你的手中！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_20_INTRO_15": "{SAY:winnie}任何人都不应有权决定他人的幸福-",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_20_INTRO_16": "{SPECIAL1:queennanny}闭嘴，闭嘴@#$%，你这个永不停息的机器！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_20_INTRO_17": "{SHOUT:queennanny}这件事你没有发言权！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_20_INTRO_18": "{EXCITED:crazydave}别这样跟她说话！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_20_INTRO_19": "{SAY:queennanny}“她？” 我已经告诉过你了！这台机器...",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_20_INTRO_20": "{TIRED:crazydave}...是的。如果只是幻想和谎言，那真的是幸福吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_20_INTRO_21": "{SAY:queennanny}何必在意那些琐碎的细节！？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_20_INTRO_22": "{SAY:queennanny}你不想快乐吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_20_INTRO_23": "{SAY:crazydave}...",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_20_INTRO_24": "{TIRED:crazydave}过去我可能会更快乐，但是……",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_20_INTRO_25": "{TIRED:crazydave}对抗僵尸...与我的植物，与我的邻居...",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_20_INTRO_26": "{TIRED:crazydave}...与朋朋。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_20_INTRO_27": "{SAY:crazydave}这就是我现在选择快乐的方式。而那个选择...",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_20_INTRO_28": "{TIRED:crazydave}...如果我让这个梦想继续下去，这就是我从每个人身上夺走的东西！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_20_INTRO_29": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我不加入你们！我们所有人都会逃离这个梦想！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_20_INTRO_30": "{SPECIAL2:queennanny}你……你这个白痴狒狒！你@#$%^!,!@#$%^!",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_20_INTRO_31": "{SHOUT:queennanny}你为什么听不懂！？那里的生活真是艰难！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_20_INTRO_32": "{EXCITED:queennanny}现实中没有幸福在等着你！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_20_INTRO_33": "{SAY:queennanny}就这样吧！如果你不肯沉迷于美梦的怀抱......",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_20_INTRO_34": "{SHOUT:queennanny}...那么你将畏缩在无情的噩梦之下！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_20_INTRO_35": "{SHOUT:queennanny}用你的头！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_21_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:queennanny}{SHOUT:queennanny}为什么，为什么，为什么！？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_21_INTRO_2": "{SHOUT:queennanny}其他人从此过上幸福的生活！那么为什么呢？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_21_INTRO_3": "{SHOUT:queennanny}你为什么不能...为什么你不让我幸福？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_21_INTRO_4": "{SAY:crazydave}我们从来没有说过我们希望你不开心！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_21_INTRO_5": "{TIRED:crazydave}但我们不能永远做一个读童话故事的孩子。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_21_INTRO_6": "{TIRED:crazydave}我们终究要长大。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_21_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}你必须审视现在和未来。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_21_INTRO_8": "{TIRED:queennanny}...展望未来...？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_21_INTRO_9": "{SHOUT:queennanny}...我没有未来！ ZOMBOSS 把它从我身边夺走了！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_21_INTRO_10": "{TIRED:queennanny}这就是他……这就是世界所做的一切。它需要，它需要，它需要——",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_21_INTRO_11": "{SHOUT:queennanny}诅咒他！诅咒他那可悲的小鬼，没完没了地折磨我……",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_21_INTRO_12": "{SHOUT:queennanny}诅咒你！诅咒你的露营车！诅咒你的同谋邻居！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_21_INTRO_13": "{SAY:queennanny}诅咒这些恶心的植物！还有……还有……",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_21_INTRO_14": "{TIRED:queennanny}诅咒她这个邪恶的女巫！她把我抛在了身后！她……",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_21_INTRO_15": "{TIRED:crazydave}保姆...",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_21_INTRO_16": "{SAY:queennanny}展望未来...哈哈。哈哈。哈哈哈！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_21_INTRO_17": "{EXCITED:queennanny}就这样吧。这个梦想将是未来！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_21_INTRO_18": "{EXCITED:queennanny}我会用这些童话来推翻我们腐烂的世界，我们痛苦的现实......",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_21_INTRO_19": "{EXCITED:queennanny}……所有曾经冤枉过我的人我都会消灭掉！从你开始！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_21_INTRO_20": "{SAY:queennanny}是的...事情应该是这样的。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_21_INTRO_21": "{TIRED:crazydave}请不要这样做...",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_21_INTRO_22": "{SHOUT:queennanny}世界即将改变！你的存在……不属于那里！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_21_INTRO_23": "{SAY:queennanny}我以为我可以离开你......但你就像一场瘟疫。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_21_INTRO_24": "{SHOUT:queennanny}我必须除掉你们所有人！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_22_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}我必须警告你们俩。这个梦想一天天变得越来越不稳定。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_22_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}毫无疑问是因为保姆精神状态每况愈下。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_22_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}很快这个梦想就会变成现实。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_22_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}一旦发生，我不知道是否可以逆转。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_22_INTRO_5": "{SAY:crazydave}昨天你没找到出口吗？我们就被困在这里了吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_22_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}不一定。我相信我们还有一种方法可以离开这个地方。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_22_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}记住，保姆想在这个地方发生的任何事情都会发生。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_22_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}所以，要结束这个梦，唯一的办法就是保姆自己祈求。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_22_INTRO_9": "{TIRED:crazydave}但是如何呢？那天你看见她了！她是……",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_22_INTRO_10": "{SAY:crazydave}...",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_22_INTRO_11": "{TIRED:crazydave}...看，朋朋。我知道她是敌人...",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_22_INTRO_12": "{TIRED:crazydave}但我就是忍不住为她感到难过。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_22_INTRO_13": "{TIRED:winnie}...",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_22_INTRO_14": "{TIRED:winnie}保姆……她是对的。我是一台机器。只被编程来消灭僵尸。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_22_INTRO_15": "{TIRED:winnie}我不知道什么是梦想，什么是希望。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_22_INTRO_16": "{SAY:crazydave}什么？朋朋，你在说什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_22_INTRO_17": "{TIRED:winnie}我从来没有对任何人着迷过这个领域。我只把它看作一个笼子。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_22_INTRO_18": "{PLAYFUL:winnie}但是...我想我愿意。我想知道快乐的“感觉”如何。为了让你开心。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_22_INTRO_19": "{SAY:winnie}这样你就永远不会像她一样。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_22_INTRO_20": "{SAY:crazydave}朋朋...",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_22_INTRO_21": "{PLAYFUL:winnie}但这就是我的意思。如果像我这样的机器能够改变她的“心”的话……",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_22_INTRO_22": "{PLAYFUL:winnie}...谁说我们也不能改变保姆的？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_22_INTRO_23": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}朋朋...对我来说你永远不仅仅是一台机器！你是我的同伴！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_22_INTRO_24": "{EXCITED:crazydave}还有你，邻居，还有我们所有的植物。我们是一个团队！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_22_INTRO_25": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我们能做到！我们可以拯救世界！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_22_INTRO_26": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}...希望我们也能改变她的心。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_22_OUTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:queennannyboss}{PLAYFUL:queennannyboss}是的，最美妙的梦……",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_22_OUTRO_2": "{SAY:queennannyboss}我已经安排你亲自去看了。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_22_OUTRO_3": "{PLAYFUL:queennannyboss}我还给你准备了惊喜。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_22_OUTRO_4": "{PLAYFUL:queennannyboss}会好吗？哦，别担心，先生。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_22_OUTRO_5": "{PLAYFUL:queennannyboss}真是要死了。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_23_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}这是真的吗……？或者这只是一个生病的老头脑的虚构？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_23_INTRO_2": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:crazydave}老板...！？你怎么在这里？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_23_INTRO_3": "{SAY:zombossicon}啊，你们两个也在这里，所以她说得对。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_23_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}是保姆带你来的吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_23_INTRO_5": "{SAY:zombossicon}她做到了。她告诉我她有一些东西想给我看。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_23_INTRO_6": "{SAY:zombossicon}我以为这只是她的另一句平凡的胡言乱语......",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_23_INTRO_7": "{SAY:zombossicon}但她告诉我她也用我给她的那些书创造了一个境界！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_23_INTRO_8": "{TIRED:crazydave}你是怎么拿到这些书的？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_23_INTRO_9": "{SAY:zombossicon}你以为我不和你战斗的时候只是在闲逛吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_23_INTRO_10": "{SAY:zombossicon}不，我一直在寻找更多。 L.O.A.M 零件！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_23_INTRO_11": "{SAY:zombossicon}当我拿到那些书的时候，我感觉到它们蕴含着神奇的力量！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_23_INTRO_12": "{SAY:zombossicon}但它们不是 L.O.A.M 零件。我没用它。这就是我丢弃它们的原因。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_23_INTRO_13": "{SAY:zombossicon}竟然还能做出如此壮举！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_23_INTRO_14": "{SAY:zombossicon}也许我不应该以貌取人……",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_23_INTRO_15": "{SAY:zombossicon}总之，客套话够多了！保姆还有东西想给我看……",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_23_INTRO_16": "{NPC_EXIT:zombossicon}{TIRED:crazydave}保姆为什么要带他来这里！？除非...",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_23_INTRO_17": "{NPC_ENTER:queennanny}{EXCITED:queennanny}当我说要消灭那些冤枉我的人时...我是认真的！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_23_INTRO_18": "{SAY:winnie}你把他带到这里来就是为了消灭他吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_23_INTRO_19": "{EXCITED:queennanny}那个白痴太骄傲太无知，根本没想过我会背叛他！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_23_INTRO_20": "{SAY:queennanny}我只需用谎言和空洞的承诺来引诱他......",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_23_INTRO_21": "{EXCITED:queennanny}就像他以前对我做的那样！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_23_INTRO_22": "{TIRED:crazydave}你和他有什么打算？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_23_INTRO_23": "{PLAYFUL:queennanny}哦，别担心。你们三个有前排座位。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_23_INTRO_24": "{EXCITED:queennanny}哈哈哈哈！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_23_OUTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{NPC_ENTER:queennannyboss}{SAY:zombossicon}你做的吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_23_OUTRO_2": "{SAY:queennannyboss}是的先生，我可以在这里创造任何我想要的东西。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_23_OUTRO_3": "{SAY:zombossicon}显然除了一套好衣服。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_23_OUTRO_4": "{SAY:zombossicon}你这样做的目的是什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_23_OUTRO_5": "{EXCITED:queennannyboss}善意的举动，先生。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_23_OUTRO_6": "{SAY:queennannyboss}你给了我很多，我想我会报答你。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_23_OUTRO_7": "{SAY:zombossicon}呵呵。我想这是真的。没有我，你就什么都不是，不是吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_23_OUTRO_8": "{SAY:queennannyboss}...",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_23_OUTRO_9": "{SAY:queennannyboss}的。当然……先生。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_23_OUTRO_10": "{SAY:zombossicon}我要带这头猛兽去试驾一下！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_23_OUTRO_11": "{SAY:zombossicon}我的判断从来没有失败过。我知道从我雇用你的那天起我就看到了你的真实身份。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_23_OUTRO_12": "{SAY:zombossicon}我可以依靠的人。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_24_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{TIRED:crazydave}朋朋，我想这个世界终于来了！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_24_INTRO_2": "{TIRED:crazydave}我刚刚看到有一个巨大的东西从我们上空飞过......",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_24_INTRO_3": "{SHOUT:crazydave}...而且它有三个头！？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_24_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}这一定是保姆用来引诱僵王来这里的诱饵。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_24_INTRO_5": "{NPC_ENTER:queennannyboss}{PLAYFUL:queennannyboss}哦……他和他的傻小鬼真是太轻松了！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_24_INTRO_6": "{PLAYFUL:queennannyboss}敲响一些钥匙...给他们一个新玩具，他们会做你想做的任何事情！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_24_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}还有时间停止你的计划。我认为你不明白其后果。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_24_INTRO_8": "{EXCITED:queennannyboss}后果？我正在为世界做一件好事，即使这对我没有任何帮助！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_24_INTRO_9": "{SAY:queennannyboss}我正在创造完美的世界。一个没有痛苦也没有磨难的童话。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_24_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}...根据你对世界应该是什么样子的自私看法而塑造。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_24_INTRO_11": "{SHOUT:queennannyboss}闭嘴，闭嘴！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_24_INTRO_12": "{SHOUT:queennannyboss}僵王用他虚假的魅力和承诺夺走了我的未来！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_24_INTRO_13": "{EXCITED:queennannyboss}他是在这个故事的结尾需要被篡夺的邪恶巫师！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_24_INTRO_14": "{SAY:queennannyboss}哈...哈哈哈哈！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_24_INTRO_15": "{SHOUT:queennannyboss}所以……我要夺走他的生命！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_24_INTRO_16": "{TIRED:crazydave}朋朋是的。这甚至不再是创造一个完美的世界，不是吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_24_INTRO_17": "{SAY:queennannyboss}棋子无法与女王交谈。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_24_INTRO_18": "{SAY:queennannyboss}这是巫师……和我之间的事情。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_24_INTRO_19": "{EXCITED:queennannyboss}发挥你的作用，互相杀死。为我铺平通往Easy Street的道路！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_24_INTRO_20": "{SAY:queennannyboss}应该是这样的，是的。我能感觉到它在我的掌握之中。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_24_INTRO_21": "{SAY:queennannyboss}我的新世界...将会是...",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_24_INTRO_22": "{PLAYFUL:queennannyboss}天堂...",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_24_INTRO_23": "{NPC_EXIT:queennannyboss}{SAY:winnie}我感觉今晚将是一场我们从未见过的无情攻击。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_24_INTRO_24": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我们会赢的，朋朋！我们必须！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_24_INTRO_25": "{PLAYFUL:winnie}谢谢你，用户戴夫。还是...",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_24_INTRO_26": "{EXCITED:winnie}保姆正在使出浑身解数。所以我们也不要退缩。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_25_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}问候，大卫，微不足道的植物和各种盟友。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_25_INTRO_2": "{SAY:zombossicon}我是这片童话土地的巫师，来这里夺取我的王座！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_25_INTRO_3": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:crazydave}老板，你需要听我们的。这是一个陷阱！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_25_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}保姆设置的陷阱，要杀死我们所有人。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_25_INTRO_5": "{SAY:zombossicon}杀我？她永远不会！她是我最忠诚的将军！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_25_INTRO_6": "{SAY:zombossicon}你知道当小鬼师的将军有多辛苦吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_25_INTRO_7": "{SAY:zombossicon}她的付出表明了她对我的忠诚！她永远不会背叛我！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_25_INTRO_8": "{TIRED:crazydave}...老板，你真的对她一无所知吧？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_25_INTRO_9": "{SAY:zombossicon}够了！保姆对我很忠诚！而她为我创作的这个僵博机器人就是证明！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_25_INTRO_10": "{SAY:zombossicon}它的护盾非常耐攻击！今晚，你将尝到它的愤怒！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_25_INTRO_11": "{NPC_EXIT:zombossicon}{TIRED:crazydave}他不听...",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_25_INTRO_12": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我们又要面对另一个僵博机器人！？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_25_INTRO_13": "{SAY:crazydave}还有老板说它的护盾也很耐用！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_25_INTRO_14": "{TIRED:crazydave}我们要怎么把它拿下来？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_25_INTRO_15": "{SAY:winnie}耐普通攻击。但也许，保姆的魔力并非如此。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_25_INTRO_16": "{SAY:winnie}记住，这整场战斗都是僵王的陷阱。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_25_INTRO_17": "{SAY:crazydave}所以我们应该将那些皇后牌反射回他的盾牌上？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_25_INTRO_18": "{EXCITED:crazydave}那么我们需要对镜子采取战术！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_25_OUTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}嘎啊！怎么会这样！？你告诉我这个僵博机器人是坚不可摧的！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_25_OUTRO_2": "{SAY:zombossicon}我扣你的工资！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_25_OUTRO_3": "{NPC_EXIT:zombossicon}{NPC_ENTER:crazydaveftf25}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:crazydaveftf25}他要走了！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_25_OUTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}没有他的僵博机器人，他对我们没有任何威胁。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_25_OUTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}而且，他目前还不是我们的主要对象。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_25_OUTRO_6": "{NPC_ENTER:queennannyboss}{SPECIAL2:queennannyboss}不！ @#$​​%！ @#$​​%！ @$%%！你们为什么不互相残杀！？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_25_OUTRO_7": "{TIRED:queennannyboss}我的梦想！ M-我的天堂！我的...",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_25_OUTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}结束了，保姆，你知道的。你的决心已经动摇了。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_25_OUTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}我能感觉到这个境界的魔力也在相应减弱。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_25_OUTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}很快这个梦想和你的力量就会消失，我们会在现实中醒来。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_25_OUTRO_11": "{TIRED:crazydaveftf25}看，这不一定是你故事的结局。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_25_OUTRO_12": "{SAY:queennannyboss}.....",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_25_OUTRO_13": "{SAY:queennannyboss}我不需要你的怜悯。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_25_OUTRO_14": "{SAY:queennannyboss}咳嗽。除此之外...",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_25_OUTRO_15": "{PLAYFUL:queennannyboss}哈哈-咳-哈哈哈...你以为这就结束了？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_25_OUTRO_16": "{PLAYFUL:queennannyboss}你很快就会后悔当时没有杀掉他的决定。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_25_OUTRO_17": "{SAY:queennannyboss}你觉得……我的这个梦很糟糕……？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_25_OUTRO_18": "{SAY:winnie}你在说什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_25_OUTRO_19": "{SAY:queennannyboss}他的梦想......这比这本书所能想象的任何事情都要可怕。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_25_OUTRO_20": "{SAY:queennannyboss}他一直在找东西。这就是他得到这些书的原因。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_25_OUTRO_21": "{SAY:queennannyboss}他不会告诉任何人他在寻找什么……甚至我们，他的将军们也不会。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_25_OUTRO_22": "{TIRED:queennannyboss}但是一旦他找到了他们...你会后悔这一天的余生。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_25_OUTRO_23": "{SPECIAL1:queennannyboss}我现在不能再少了@#$%。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_25_OUTRO_24": "{TIRED:queennannyboss}我差一点就终于找到幸福了……但它又被夺走了……",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_25_OUTRO_25": "{TIRED:queennannyboss}现在...我只想睡觉，忘记发生过的一切。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_25_OUTRO_26": "{NPC_EXIT:queennannyboss}{TIRED:crazydaveftf25}但我们只是想帮忙-",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_25_OUTRO_27": "{SAY:winnie}为了你帮助某人，某人需要得到帮助，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_25_OUTRO_28": "{SAY:winnie}不然就没用了。",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_25_OUTRO_29": "{TIRED:crazydaveftf25}我……呃……",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_25_OUTRO_30": "{SAY:crazydaveftf25}啊！我就是不明白这个！这感觉不像是一个幸福的结局！",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_25_OUTRO_31": "{PLAYFUL:winnie}嗯，这是知道我们已经逃离梦想的一种方式，不是吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_EPIC_REALM_FAIRYTALE_25_OUTRO_32": "{SAY:winnie}现实中几乎没有一个简单、幸福的日子，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_FAIRYTALE_TREASURE_1": "{NPC_ENTER:narrator}{SAY:narrator}英雄之旅的结束。",
  "NARRATIVE_FAIRYTALE_TREASURE_2": "{SAY:narrator}旁边是一张旧的、破旧的 Z-Tech 员工身份证。",
  "NARRATIVE_FAIRYTALE_TREASURE_3": "{SAY:narrator}在褪色的照片中你几乎看不到女人的微笑。",
  "NARRATIVE_FAIRYTALE_TREASURE_4": "{SAY:narrator}...",
  "NARRATIVE_FAIRYTALE_TREASURE_5": "{SAY:narrator}...",
  "NARRATIVE_FAIRYTALE_TREASURE_6": "{SAY:narrator}她看起来很高兴。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_1_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}哇哦，这里是发明空气的地方吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_1_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}不，用户戴夫。您所看到的只是由所述蒸汽驱动的机器中产生的蒸汽。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_1_INTRO_3": "{SAY:crazydave}天哪，他们在这里放了什么气味？",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_1_INTRO_4": "{SAY:crazydave}闻起来像烧煤的味道。 ...你知道我和煤炭可以追溯到很久以前。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_1_INTRO_5": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}高中的时候我就讨厌他！",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_1_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}我们似乎正处于十九世纪的工业革命之中。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_1_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}看来僵尸在这里正在努力工作。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_1_INTRO_8": "{SAY:crazydave}地上的那些洞是做什么用的？",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_1_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}在工业革命期间，像这样的沙井被用来方便地进入工作环境的不同部分。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_1_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}僵尸可以利用它们来发挥自己的优势。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_1_INTRO_11": "{SAY:winnie}我们可以在坚果墙等沙井顶部放置防护植物。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_1_INTRO_12": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}洞里有僵尸！",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_2_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}哇哦，那些落后的僵尸比我想象的还要糟糕。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_2_INTRO_2": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}他们背着我吃了我的墨西哥卷饼！",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_2_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}幸运的是，香蒲似乎要隆重回归这里了。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_2_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}香蒲可以向她附近、后面或前面的僵尸发射尖刺射弹！",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_2_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}由于是猫科动物，她的视野范围比动感甜菜等植物要大很多。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_2_INTRO_6": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}哇，他们这里有猫吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_3_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{TIRED:crazydave}我闻到茶味了。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_3_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}这并非巧合。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_3_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}有茶的地方就有绅士僵尸。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_3_INTRO_4": "{TIRED:crazydave}我讨厌茶。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_3_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}绅士僵尸使用雨伞盘旋在大多数植物和障碍物上，例如地刺或熔岩砖。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_3_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}他们对产太阳品种的植物也有相当大的胃口......",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_3_INTRO_7": "{TIRED:crazydave}谁发明了茶？他们有多无聊？",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_5_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{PLAYFUL:crazydave}看起来很有趣的植物。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_5_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}法尼拉，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_5_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}其强烈的风能击晕僵尸。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_5_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}僵尸离它越远，眩晕的时间就越长。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_5_INTRO_5": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}我也曾经对着人吹气把他打晕。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_5_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}Fanilla 无疑会挫败绅士僵尸的任何空中企图。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_5_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}刮风的天气很难打伞。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_5_INTRO_8": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我已经喜欢这种植物了。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_6_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{TIRED:crazydave}哇，那是什么味道？",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_6_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}似乎新的僵尸即将出现。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_6_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}桶状僵尸以桶为装甲，一旦被摧毁，它们就会试图冲向我们的大脑。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_6_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}他们令人难以置信的口臭也让他们能够更有效地突破防守。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_6_INTRO_5": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}我想我可能有薄荷糖。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_6_INTRO_6": "{SAY:crazydave}不，等等，薄荷也是植物......",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_10_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}似乎有人在我们的草坪上留下了蓝图。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_10_INTRO_2": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}蓝图？他们还发明了蓝色……",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_10_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}这些似乎包含僵王可以用来策划他的复仇的重要信息......",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_10_INTRO_4": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}僵尸信息！？不幸的是，我不知道如何阅读。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_10_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}好消息。这些文件的放置方式使得其文字是倒着的。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_10_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}僵尸太笨了，无法破译这样的文字。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_10_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}但是我们必须保持警惕，防止僵尸从另一边读取它。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_11_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}我有好消息和坏消息。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_11_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}你更喜欢先听哪个，用户戴夫？",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_11_INTRO_3": "{SAY:crazydave}其中“b”最多的那个。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_11_INTRO_4": "{TIRED:winnie}这是坏消息。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_11_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}又有一只僵尸从工厂抵达。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_11_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}煤矿工人僵尸可以使用他们的推车碾碎任何植物。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_11_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}被击败后，他们会溢出相邻车道上的所有煤炭。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_11_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}建议尽快消除燃煤，因为它会对我们的工厂造成损害。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_11_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}煤炭里似乎也有一些顽皮的居民。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_11_INTRO_10": "{SHOUT:crazydave}煤！不是他！",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_11_INTRO_11": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}比如说，如果我们攻击的是移动小车的僵尸而不是小车本身呢？",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_11_INTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}我担心推车的僵尸可能穿着防护装甲。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_11_INTRO_13": "{SAY:winnie}幸运的是，这是另一个消息。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_11_INTRO_14": "{SAY:winnie}我发现了一种新植物，炼金百合。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_11_INTRO_15": "{SAY:winnie}它发射高抛射弹，有机会绕过装甲！",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_11_INTRO_16": "{EXCITED:crazydave}是的！我们很快就能消灭那些煤炭恶魔！",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_14_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}朋朋！我要承认。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_14_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}是的，用户戴夫？",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_14_INTRO_3": "{SAY:crazydave}这个空中时代已经征服了我！",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_14_INTRO_4": "{SAY:crazydave}当我们背着铲子和袋装植物食物时......",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_14_INTRO_5": "{TIRED:crazydave}...我不小心被坑洼绊倒了。现在都在下水道里了。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_14_INTRO_6": "{SAY:crazydave}我不下去了，又黑又吓人！",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_14_INTRO_7": "{SAY:crazydave}上次我偷看的时候看到了几百个小鬼！",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_14_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}我可以确认下水道每天大约有 5000 个小鬼出没。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_14_INTRO_9": "{TIRED:winnie}很好，这次僵尸袭击后我会把它们找回来。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_14_INTRO_10": "{TIRED:winnie}我们将不得不适应这种不便。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_16_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}晚上好，旅行者们。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_16_INTRO_2": "{SAY:zombossicon}来跟我走吧？",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_16_INTRO_3": "{SAY:zombossicon}你对我所做的一切，我一定会让你还清你的债的！",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_16_INTRO_4": "{SAY:zombossicon}工业革命是一个关键的转折点。我的重建时间到了！补偿！",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_16_INTRO_5": "{SAY:zombossicon}一旦我这样做了，你烦人的大脑就会机械化！",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_16_INTRO_6": "{SAY:zombossicon}但是我的复仇可以更快完成……",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_16_INTRO_7": "{SAY:zombossicon}那么适合这份工作的人呢？工头巨人僵尸。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_16_INTRO_8": "{SAY:zombossicon}他会立即修复你！我会一边喝着美味的茶一边观看。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_16_INTRO_9": "{SAY:zombossicon}现在，这些邪恶的独白让我疲惫不堪！",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_16_INTRO_10": "{SAY:zombossicon}美好的一天！",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_16_INTRO_11": "{NPC_EXIT:zombossicon}{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{EXCITED:crazydave}不！我们的大脑无法机械化！",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_16_INTRO_12": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我还没准备好成为机器人！",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_16_OUTRO_LAUNCH_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}我们成功击败了工头巨人僵尸们！",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_16_OUTRO_LAUNCH_2": "{SAY:crazydave}这就是他们如此享受茶的结果！",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_16_OUTRO_LAUNCH_3": "{SAY:crazydave}我们又得到了一件闪亮的旅行小玩意！",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_16_OUTRO_LAUNCH_4": "{SAY:winnie}这个键看起来是时间上的向前跳跃。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_16_OUTRO_LAUNCH_5": "{SAY:winnie}分析表明这把钥匙通向……马戏团？",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_16_OUTRO_LAUNCH_6": "{SAY:winnie}我到达后需要进行更多分析。这是最令人困惑的。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_16_OUTRO_LAUNCH_7": "{SAY:crazydave}哎呀，至少我不用再和茶爱好者打交道了！",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_17_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}是我一个人这样，还是这里很热？",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_17_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}正确。周围的气温确实在快速升高。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_17_INTRO_3": "{SAY:crazydave}而且味道也很难闻！ ",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_17_INTRO_4": "{SAY:crazydave}有人烧旧轮胎吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_17_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}不正确。这种气味的来源是煤的气味。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_17_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}熔炉僵尸是最有可能的罪魁祸首。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_17_INTRO_7": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}哦。嗯，烧煤是我可以支持的。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_17_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}你可能不会落后于其他方面，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_17_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}失败后，熔炉会在 3x3 区域内爆炸。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_17_INTRO_10": "{TIRED:crazydave}没关系...",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_17_INTRO_11": "{SAY:crazydave}不过，把炉子绑在背上一定很麻烦。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_17_INTRO_12": "{EXCITED:winnie}它提供了优点和缺点。例如，",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_17_INTRO_13": "{EXCITED:winnie}火焰效果会造成更多伤害。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_17_INTRO_14": "{TIRED:winnie}另一方面，冰效果不会那么有效。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_17_INTRO_15": "{EXCITED:crazydave}让我们过热，过热，过热！",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_18_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}电力茶向附近的僵尸发射电能。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_18_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}食用后会释放出一阵放电。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_18_INTRO_3": "{EXCITED:winnie}还拥有让绅士僵尸无法抗拒的独特属性。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_19_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}听说过“为花生而工作”吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_19_INTRO_2": "{EXCITED:crazydave}因为这正是这些僵尸正在做的事情！",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_19_INTRO_3": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}我说，让他们拥有吧！",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_19_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}花生结合了豌豆射手和坚果墙的属性。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_19_INTRO_5": "{EXCITED:winnie}放在沙井上非常有效。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_19_INTRO_6": "{EXCITED:crazydave}说到花生，我听说有新的僵尸，甚至不需要支付任何费用！",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_19_INTRO_7": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}连花生都不是！",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_19_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}扫描工作场所时发现奇怪的发条僵尸仿制品。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_19_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}奇怪的自动复制品，不需要报酬或食物。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_19_INTRO_10": "{TIRED:crazydave}哦不，不是机器人......",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_19_INTRO_11": "{EXCITED:crazydave}他们从哪里来！？",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_19_INTRO_12": "{EXCITED:crazydave}谁创造了这些！？",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_19_INTRO_13": "{SAY:winnie}我想我们会找到答案的。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_21_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:crazydave}我有一个完美的主意！",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_21_INTRO_2": "{PLAYFUL:winnie}用户戴夫，你的想法是什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_21_INTRO_3": "{SAY:crazydave}我们可以在这里列出一些员工...",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_21_INTRO_4": "{TIRED:crazydave}...找到他们的文件...",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_21_INTRO_5": "{EXCITED:crazydave}...并提出一些阴暗的东西来解雇他们！",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_21_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}这个策略不会起作用，因为我正在检测一个新的薪水过低的敌人......",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_21_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}发明家僵尸将使用她的空气动力机器绕过防御。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_21_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}她的机器非常坚固，这意味着它会承受很多打击。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_21_INTRO_9": "{EXCITED:winnie}然而，有一个相当大的设计缺陷。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_21_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}它使用金属部件将自身固定在一起。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_21_INTRO_11": "{EXCITED:crazydave}不用拼出来朋朋！",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_23_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}为什么只有僵尸才能使用齿轮和齿轮！",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_23_INTRO_2": "{SAY:crazydave}为什么植物不能使用这么美味的东西！？",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_23_INTRO_3": "{EXCITED:winnie}准备满意，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_23_INTRO_4": "{EXCITED:winnie}我们自己狡猾的 Maypop 机械师使用它们来攻击僵尸。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_23_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}她可以同时发射一大一小两个齿轮。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_23_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}小齿轮从僵尸身上反弹最多五次。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_23_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}大齿轮向后发射，但最终反转方向，最终向前行驶。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_23_INTRO_8": "{EXCITED:winnie}它造成大量伤害。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_23_INTRO_9": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}最后，一些美味的齿轮。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_24_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，我的计算已经有了结果。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_24_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}僵王持续出现在这个位置是不合逻辑的。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_24_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}僵王具有自私行为和基于目标的行动模式。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_24_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}如果他的目标是逃离我们，雇用新的工厂工人是不合理的。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_24_INTRO_5": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}呃，老大真是个奇怪的家伙。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_24_INTRO_6": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}也许他喜欢烧煤的味道。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_24_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}我们必须保持警惕。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_25_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}莲花根向附近的僵尸发射水泡。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_25_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}水泡分散到远处。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_25_INTRO_3": "{EXCITED:winnie}为了获得最大伤害，僵尸需要非常接近。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_25_INTRO_4": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}让我想起了我用来恐吓孩子的油漆霰弹枪。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_26_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}留意维修小鬼，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_26_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}他们被雇用来修理任何机械工具或自动电子设备。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_26_INTRO_3": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}哦，所以他们拿出他们的小工具并做他们的小工作？",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_26_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}负。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_26_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}为了降低成本，他们只设有维修站。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_26_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}失败后，该站将被丢弃。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_26_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}然后它会在 3x3 区域中不断修复。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_26_INTRO_8": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}可以修复我的失眠吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_29_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，我的扫描仪发现了一些值得注意的东西。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_29_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}位于院子下方的隧道连接的不仅仅是沙井。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_29_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}它们跨越数英里。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_29_INTRO_4": "{TIRED:crazydave}好吧，我为什么要关心？",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_29_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}因为僵王里面的丧尸越来越多。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_29_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}他们不只是从沙井里出来，他们正在探索。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_29_INTRO_7": "{EXCITED:crazydave}他们会在那里找到什么？这是下水道！",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_29_INTRO_8": "{TIRED:crazydave}除非他们正在寻找我无意中掉进去的那个季度......",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_32_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}大家好！",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_32_INTRO_2": "{SAY:zombossicon}您是否喜欢露营车朋朋的存在？",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_32_INTRO_3": "{SAY:zombossicon}天啊，我当然希望如此！",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_32_INTRO_4": "{SAY:zombossicon}因为如果你这样做，你就支持了劳动汗水带来的机械发明。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_32_INTRO_5": "{SAY:zombossicon}反过来，你应该停下来考虑：",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_32_INTRO_6": "{SAY:zombossicon}哪些是我来之前开发的？",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_32_INTRO_7": "{SAY:zombossicon}如果是的话，有多先进？",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_32_INTRO_8": "{SAY:zombossicon}你必须停下来承认，我的努力往往利大于弊！",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_32_INTRO_9": "{SAY:zombossicon}让你的头脑工作起来，疯狂的白痴！",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_32_INTRO_10": "{NPC_EXIT:zombossicon}{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}难道朋朋，僵王真的引发了工业革命吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_32_INTRO_11": "{SAY:winnie}数据太矛盾，无法考虑，僵王撒谎的倾向也是如此。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_32_INTRO_12": "{EXCITED:winnie}让我们做一些被证明有效的事情：驱逐僵王！",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_32_OUTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}我说，这是缝合了！然而，",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_32_OUTRO_2": "{SAY:zombossicon}你们都该登上痛苦列车了！",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_32_OUTRO_3": "{PLAYFUL:winnie}火车已经到达beatdown站了！",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_32_OUTRO_4": "{SAY:zombossicon}你的胜利微不足道。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_32_OUTRO_5": "{SAY:zombossicon}我得到了我想要的。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_32_OUTRO_6": "{SAY:zombossicon}干杯，你们这些蠢货！",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_32_OUTRO_7": "{NPC_EXIT:zombossicon}{SAY:crazydave}知道他来的目的了吗？ ",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_32_OUTRO_8": "{SAY:crazydave}你认为这意味着什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_32_OUTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}没有足够的数据作为回复依据。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_32_OUTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}有一件事是确定的。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_32_OUTRO_11": "{SAY:winnie}正在玩一些阴谋。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_ZOMBIENOTE_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydaveicon}{SAY:crazydaveicon}朋朋，看。这是一份工作备忘录。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_ZOMBIENOTE_2": "{NPC_ENTER:winnieicon}{SAY:winnieicon}交叉分析表明该备忘录确实源自僵尸。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_ZOMBIENOTE_3": "{SAY:winnieicon}明天对工厂来说似乎是个大日子。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_ZOMBIENOTE_4": "{EXCITED:crazydaveicon}他们在招人吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_ZOMBIENOTE_5": "{SAY:crazydaveicon}也许我可以申请。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_OUTRO_DANGER_ROOM_KEY_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}我们有午餐盒！",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_OUTRO_DANGER_ROOM_KEY_2": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}哪个好，我饿了。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_OUTRO_DANGER_ROOM_KEY_3": "{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，这表明还有工作要做。",
  "NARRATIVE_STEAM_OUTRO_DANGER_ROOM_KEY_4": "{TIRED:winnie}...以及与之相伴的不成比例的短暂午休时间。",
  "NARRATIVE_DANGER_ROOM_INTRO_STEAM_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SAY:crazydave}欢迎来到人才流失工厂！",
  "NARRATIVE_DANGER_ROOM_INTRO_STEAM_2": "{SAY:crazydave}为无尽的死胡同做好准备！",
  "NARRATIVE_DANGER_ROOM_INTRO_STEAM_3": "{SAY:crazydave}字面意思！",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_1_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}哇朋朋...我们在哪里？",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_1_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}正在检索数据...",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_1_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}我们似乎偶然发现了一个20世纪初的游乐场。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_1_INTRO_4": "{TIRED:crazydave}看起来不太吸引人。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_1_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}我们已经进入了一个金融不稳定的时代。也许这就是原因。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_1_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}无论如何，僵王博士'信号会在此停止。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_1_INTRO_7": "{SAY:crazydave}老板？在这样的地方？",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_1_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}我只能追踪他最后记录的位置。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_1_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}他在这里呆了一段时间，但我们现在可能独自在这里。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_1_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}这暂时可能是有益的，因为他可能会回来。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_1_INTRO_11": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}所以...游戏计划是什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_1_INTRO_12": "{EXCITED:winnie}我建议我们留在这里并尝试揭开僵王访问背后的原因。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_1_INTRO_13": "{SAY:winnie}很可能他有特定的理由来这个时间点。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_1_INTRO_14": "{SAY:crazydave}他该不会是选了这个狂欢活动的时间吧？",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_1_INTRO_15": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}看起来比丧尸还亡灵！",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_1_INTRO_16": "{SAY:winnie}也许它仍然以自己奇怪的方式活跃着。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_1_INTRO_17": "{SAY:winnie}事实上，我正在我们的草坪上检测各种神奇的物体。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_1_INTRO_18": "{SAY:winnie}好像有一些卡牌需要种植在上面才能发动。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_1_INTRO_19": "{SAY:crazydave}但是我们可以用什么来种植它们......",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_1_INTRO_20": "{EXCITED:crazydave}发现东西了！一张带有薯片的海报！",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_1_INTRO_21": "{SAY:winnie}很好的发现，用户戴夫。薯片可能会帮助我们的事业。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_1_INTRO_22": "{SAY:crazydave}嗯嗯……薯片。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_1_INTRO_23": "{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，请不要吃我们的弹药。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_1_INTRO_24": "{SAY:winnie}这些芯片的低成本在夜间非常有用。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_1_INTRO_25": "{SAY:winnie}而且它们拥有脆脆的属性，可以帮助对僵尸造成伤害。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_2_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{TIRED:crazydave}这个地方给我一种不好的感觉...",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_2_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}看来我们已经有客串了。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_2_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}Carnie Twin 小鬼僵尸在失败后将分裂成两个单独的小鬼。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_2_INTRO_4": "{EXCITED:crazydave}太可怕了！我见过细菌这样做！",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_2_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}这可能会被证明是不利的，尤其是在存在危险牌的情况下。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_2_INTRO_6": "{TIRED:crazydave}我还是不明白那些卡牌的窍门！",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_2_INTRO_7": "{TIRED:crazydave}它们看起来像是我未来读到的东西！",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_2_INTRO_8": "{TIRED:crazydave}郑重声明，老太太完全错了！",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_2_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}就像你的经验所暗示的那样，用户戴夫...",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_2_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}...并非所有魔法卡都具有同等的用处。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_2_INTRO_11": "{SAY:winnie}扫描表明存在可以将弱僵尸变成强僵尸的卡牌。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_2_INTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}所以就像大多数嘉年华游戏一样，我们应该小心选择。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_2_INTRO_13": "{SAY:winnie}他们的位置似乎也在每晚开始时重新洗牌。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_2_INTRO_14": "{EXCITED:crazydave}哎哟我以前最擅长玩嘉年华游戏了！",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_2_INTRO_15": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我曾经同时骗过5个孩子！",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_2_INTRO_16": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}诀窍是趁他们不注意的时候把右边的牌藏到桌子底下！",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_3_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:crazydave}那是什么！？",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_3_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}你指的是什么，用户戴夫？",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_3_INTRO_3": "{SAY:crazydave}那个令人毛骨悚然的盒子！",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_3_INTRO_4": "{SAY:crazydave}不知从哪里冒出来的那个！",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_3_INTRO_5": "{SAY:crazydave}它有一个可以自行转动的杠杆！",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_3_INTRO_6": "{SAY:crazydave}想起来，这让我想起了我们以前在雾中找到的一个人。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_3_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}听起来你在描述一个杰克盒子，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_3_INTRO_8": "{SAY:crazydave}对了，其中之一！",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_3_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}杰克盒子以带来令人讨厌的惊喜而闻名。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_3_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}鉴于僵尸起源，它们可能包含以下内容：",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_3_INTRO_11": "{SAY:winnie}各种僵尸零食或危险的机械僵尸玩具。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_3_INTRO_12": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我们应该在它们爆出来之前把它们从草坪上赶走！",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_3_INTRO_13": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}而且还因为它们非常丑陋！",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_3_INTRO_14": "{SAY:winnie}还有另一个令人讨厌的惊喜。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_3_INTRO_15": "{SAY:winnie}高跷僵尸正在逼近。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_3_INTRO_16": "{SAY:winnie}他们能够凭借踩高跷的技能绕过我们的防御。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_3_INTRO_17": "{PLAYFUL:winnie}也许我们可以用卡片来挫败他们的企图。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_4_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{TIRED:crazydave}哦朋朋，我饿了，想吃点东西。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_4_INTRO_2": "{SAY:crazydave}嘉年华不是应该有这些吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_4_INTRO_3": "{SAY:crazydave}我只见过那些杰克盒里的东西喷出一些糖果......",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_4_INTRO_4": "{SAY:crazydave}但这看起来像是恶心的僵尸食物！",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_4_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}你的分析是正确的，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_4_INTRO_6": "{EXCITED:winnie}幸运的是，我很高兴地向大家报告，我们现在有了一种新的美味植物。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_4_INTRO_7": "{EXCITED:winnie}焦糖爆米花会使用她的焦糖弹丸减慢僵尸的速度。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_4_INTRO_8": "{EXCITED:winnie}这对于对抗该区域的快速僵尸非常有用。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_4_INTRO_9": "{SAY:crazydave}必须。不是。吃。焦糖。爆米花。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_4_INTRO_10": "{SAY:crazydave}Uuuh 我要去四处寻找糖果- uuuh，我的意思是...线索...现在。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_4_INTRO_11": "{SAY:crazydave}嗯……糖果……",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_5_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:winnie}用户戴夫，我在这方面找到了一些线索。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_5_INTRO_2": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}我也是！让我告诉你，它们味道不好！",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_5_INTRO_3": "{TIRED:winnie}你没有吃杰克盒子里的糖果，用户戴夫。你？",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_5_INTRO_4": "{SAY:crazydave}呜呜呜呜……",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_5_INTRO_5": "{SAY:crazydave}......没有。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_5_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}总之，游乐场周围的海报似乎不是真的。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_5_INTRO_7": "{SAY:crazydave}哇哦。这是一种哲学，朋朋。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_5_INTRO_8": "{TIRED:winnie}我的意思是，它们不是官方制造的。也没有生产出来。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_5_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}找不到任何制造商的踪迹。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_5_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}它们是定制的。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_5_INTRO_11": "{SAY:crazydave}你以为我们是在和美术人员打交道吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_5_INTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}显然有人做了这些。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_5_INTRO_13": "{SAY:winnie}他们似乎并没有真正很好地宣传嘉年华。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_5_INTRO_14": "{SAY:winnie}僵尸们为什么要制造这些……",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_5_INTRO_15": "{SAY:crazydave}也许这就是老板的阴谋！",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_5_INTRO_16": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}释放内心的艺术家！",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_5_INTRO_17": "{TIRED:winnie}...计算严重怀疑这一点。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_5_INTRO_18": "{SAY:winnie}如果发现其他情况我会稍后报告。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_6_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:crazydave}朋朋，终于找到食物了！",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_6_INTRO_2": "{TIRED:winnie}不，用户戴夫，不要……",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_6_INTRO_3": "{SAY:crazydave}嗯嗯……最后，一些好糖。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_6_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，你从哪里得到棉花糖的？",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_6_INTRO_5": "{SAY:crazydave}哦，来自那边的僵尸。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_6_INTRO_6": "{SAY:crazydave}那个粉色小伙子太诱人了。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_6_INTRO_7": "{SAY:crazydave}其实那个糖太好吃了……",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_6_INTRO_8": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我想我会及时回去再吃一次！",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_6_INTRO_9": "{TIRED:winnie}...",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_6_INTRO_10": "{SAY:crazydave}哦，没关系。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_6_INTRO_11": "{SAY:crazydave}有点回味。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_6_INTRO_12": "{SAY:crazydave}回味无穷哦！",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_6_INTRO_13": "{TIRED:crazydave}布鲁！",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_6_INTRO_14": "{TIRED:winnie}用户戴夫，让我们停止欺骗吧。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_6_INTRO_15": "{SAY:winnie}你拿走棉花糖的僵尸是不可信任的。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_6_INTRO_16": "{SAY:winnie}我发现一对兄弟。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_6_INTRO_17": "{SAY:winnie}他们的糖果有抛光属性。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_6_INTRO_18": "{SAY:winnie}我们应该阻止他们把它喂给僵尸。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_7_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}我又收集到了一条线索。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_7_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}这一带的丧尸经常发出疯狂的笑声。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_7_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}这是我们迄今为止在任何僵尸中都没有见过的现象。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_7_INTRO_4": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}嘿，嘉年华真是个有趣的地方！",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_7_INTRO_5": "{SAY:crazydave}即使里面装满了假糖果和令人毛骨悚然的玩具机器人！",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_7_INTRO_6": "{EXCITED:winnie}这其实也是一个很好的线索，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_7_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}这些玩具本身并没有那么特别。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_7_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}它是廉价塑料，内置扬声器。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_7_INTRO_9": "{TIRED:crazydave}他们中的一些人仍然给我带来惊慌！",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_7_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}它们显然是为了唤起某种情感反应而设计的。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_7_INTRO_11": "{TIRED:crazydave}我还是不喜欢看那个杰克箱的东西。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_7_INTRO_12": "{TIRED:crazydave}它的眼睛看起来太有活力了。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_7_INTRO_13": "{TIRED:crazydave}太活了……",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_7_INTRO_14": "{SAY:winnie}它们似乎具有僵王'商标架构。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_7_INTRO_15": "{SAY:winnie}僵王到底在规划什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_9_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}嘉年华表演者以玩命的特技而闻名。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_9_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}我们有这样的表演者即将进攻。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_9_INTRO_3": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}看看他们是不是不死族！",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_9_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}空中飞人僵尸总是成对或三人摇摆。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_9_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}在极少数情况下，即使是在四边形中。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_9_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}演出结束后，他们将继续前行。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_9_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}我们可以用他们的数字来对付他们。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_9_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}用塔罗牌的魔粉将他们全部击中可能会产生利润。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_9_INTRO_9": "{EXCITED:crazydave}现在你就像一个真正的马戏团领队一样思考！",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_10_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}点击爆气球花放置爆炸气球。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_10_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}她的气球最多可以叠3次。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_10_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}堆叠气球比单独使用气球造成的伤害更大。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_10_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}每堆叠一个气球，就会增加更多的伤害。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_10_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}气球不会爆炸，除非僵尸与之碰撞。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_10_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}爆气球花允许您放置任意数量的气球。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_11_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{PLAYFUL:crazydave}朋朋，你还有发现更多线索吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_11_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}我确实注意到了一些奇怪的事情。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_11_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}嘉年华周围似乎有空汽油瓶。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_11_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}但是，这里没有车辆会使用它。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_11_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}所有游乐设施似乎都坏了。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_11_INTRO_6": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}小丑车呢？",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_11_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}如果这里有小丑车，我们早就知道了。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_11_INTRO_8": "{SAY:crazydave}你再说一遍！",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_11_INTRO_9": "{SAY:crazydave}那些涂漆的怪人不断发出卡通声音！",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_11_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}我不喜欢建议这个，但是......",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_11_INTRO_11": "{SAY:winnie}...我能得出的唯一结论是...",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_11_INTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}...僵尸正在喝汽油。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_11_INTRO_13": "{SAY:crazydave}啊。坏主意。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_11_INTRO_14": "{SAY:crazydave}新手错误。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_11_INTRO_15": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}闻一闻就会觉得味道很相似。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_11_INTRO_16": "{SAY:winnie}看来我们有一个火系僵尸要启动。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_11_INTRO_17": "{SAY:winnie}喷火僵尸会从远处发射火焰。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_11_INTRO_18": "{SAY:winnie}如果距离足够近，他们可以一次点燃多株植物。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_11_INTRO_19": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}也许我应该寻找棉花糖。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_13_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，我在这里又找到了关于僵尸的线索。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_13_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}我警告你，我录制的镜头可能会令人不安。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_13_INTRO_3": "{SAY:crazydave}没关系朋朋，你可以给我看看！",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_13_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}影片放映开始。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_13_INTRO_5": "{SAY:crazydave}...",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_13_INTRO_6": "{TIRED:crazydave}噢...",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_13_INTRO_7": "{TIRED:crazydave}哦，这不对……",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_13_INTRO_8": "{TIRED:winnie}恐怕就是这样，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_13_INTRO_9": "{SAY:crazydave}那家伙吃了一整只毛绒熊？",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_13_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}这里的僵尸有些不对劲。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_13_INTRO_11": "{SAY:winnie}整个地方有些不对劲。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_13_INTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}僵王正在利用它来实现一些邪恶的目的。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_13_INTRO_13": "{SAY:winnie}一有机会我们就会和他对峙。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_16_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}欢迎大家！欢迎！",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_16_INTRO_2": "{SAY:zombossicon}我们这里有一群忠实的观众！",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_16_INTRO_3": "{SAY:zombossicon}15晚狂欢节，不能少！",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_16_INTRO_4": "{SAY:zombossicon}这样的忠诚度保证前排座位！",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_16_INTRO_5": "{SAY:zombossicon}为世纪表演做好准备！",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_16_INTRO_6": "{SAY:zombossicon}大力士巨人僵尸！节目明星！",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_16_INTRO_7": "{SAY:zombossicon}一个僵尸可以承载五个人的重量！",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_16_INTRO_8": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}我们想要答案，僵王博士。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_16_INTRO_9": "{SAY:zombossicon}真的吗？在我讲话中间！？",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_16_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}我们已经识破了你的诡计。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_16_INTRO_11": "{EXCITED:crazydave}是啊！你已经把这个地方变成了一个令人毛骨悚然的恐怖地带！",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_16_INTRO_12": "{SAY:zombossicon}显然这还不够......",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_16_INTRO_13": "{SAY:zombossicon}好的！我就吐出来吧！",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_16_INTRO_14": "{SAY:zombossicon}我这里有重要的工作要做！",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_16_INTRO_15": "{SAY:zombossicon}我尽量保持低调！",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_16_INTRO_16": "{SAY:zombossicon}用我有限的资源把这个地方变成了没有人愿意参观的地方！",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_16_INTRO_17": "{SAY:zombossicon}住15晚就少了！",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_16_INTRO_18": "{EXCITED:winnie}我们知道！这就是为什么僵尸的行为如此奇怪！",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_16_INTRO_19": "{SAY:winnie}你命令他们表现得疯狂，让我们不快！",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_16_INTRO_20": "{SAY:zombossicon}什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_16_INTRO_21": "{SAY:zombossicon}不，他们只是……有点像那样。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_16_INTRO_22": "{SAY:zombossicon}我认为在这个地方工作让他们很困扰。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_16_INTRO_23": "{SAY:zombossicon}不过无论如何，回到正题吧！",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_16_INTRO_24": "{SAY:zombossicon}面对强者巨人僵尸的力量！",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_16_INTRO_25": "{SAY:zombossicon}看看这个节目是否是您的最后一次！",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_16_OUTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}哇哦。罐子里的另一把钥匙。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_16_OUTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}我发现这个需要一个特殊的开罐器。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_16_OUTRO_3": "{TIRED:crazydave}坚果。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_16_OUTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}重要的是：我们发现了僵王'来到这里的原因。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_16_OUTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}我们现在肯定可以推断出他的计划。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_16_OUTRO_6": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我们会留下来直到我们这样做！",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_16_OUTRO_7": "{TIRED:crazydave}虽然我不是这个地方最疯狂的一个。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_17_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}那么朋朋，你认为老板在这里到底是做什么的？",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_17_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}我还没有任何结论，但僵王博士'的行为似乎很奇怪。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_17_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}他表示希望我们不要介入，并一心致力于开展重要业务。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_17_INTRO_4": "{SAY:crazydave}他来这里能有什么事？小丑生意？",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_17_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}除非我们在这个肮脏的狂欢节中继续寻找，否则我们找不到答案。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_17_INTRO_6": "{SAY:crazydave}哦，看朋朋！我想我可以看到一张友好的脸！",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_17_INTRO_7": "{SAY:crazydave}又一个人类！但他们都摇摇欲坠...",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_17_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}这似乎是你的倒影，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_17_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}在一个有趣屋的镜子里，丝毫不差。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_17_INTRO_10": "{SAY:crazydave}哦，是的，那个僵尸拿着它！而且不止一个！",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_17_INTRO_11": "{SAY:winnie}我检测到来自那些镜子的高强度魔法排斥，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_17_INTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}一旦与塔罗牌的魔法互动，事情就会变得不可预测。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_17_INTRO_13": "{SAY:crazydave}天哪！",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_18_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}我简直不敢相信。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_18_INTRO_2": "{SAY:crazydave}他们在宣传一种由糖果制成的植物！",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_18_INTRO_3": "{SHOUT:crazydave}糖果！",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_18_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}这种“糖果”植物叫做甜豆，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_18_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}它的投射物在撞击时会碎成更小的碎片。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_18_INTRO_6": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}豌豆本身不是已经很甜了吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_19_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}哇朋朋，看，一只小动物！",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_19_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}我们可能正在观察一只马戏团的动物，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_19_INTRO_3": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}那是我大学时代别人称呼我的名字。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_19_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}正在扫描……",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_19_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}我们正在观察一种宽叶凤尾竹。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_19_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}“虎草”植物。它会从藏身处出来攻击僵尸。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_19_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}它应该在我扫描仪探测到的即将到来的威胁中派上用场。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_19_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}看起来有一些大炮已就绪，可以发射小鬼。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_19_INTRO_9": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}别忘了击中靶心！",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_22_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}朋朋，我终于在这附近找到了一些可以吃的糖果！",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_22_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}我可以看看吗，用户戴夫？",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_22_INTRO_3": "{SAY:crazydave}嗯？它在哪里？它就在我的口袋里。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_22_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}我看到你的糖果不见了，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_22_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}这是一个肮脏的魔术的结果。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_22_INTRO_6": "{SAY:crazydave}魔术！？",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_22_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}确实如此。魔术师僵尸似乎也加入了节目。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_22_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}就像你的糖果一样，它们可以让我们的植物消失。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_22_INTRO_9": "{SAY:crazydave}必须有一种秘密技术才能做到这一点。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_22_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}其实有。他们利用白鸽的手段来窃取我们的植物。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_22_INTRO_11": "{SAY:winnie}除此之外，他们还可以将僵尸传送到草坪周围。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_22_INTRO_12": "{SAY:crazydave}那么，我们可以用那些卡牌效果来对付他们吧？",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_22_INTRO_13": "{SAY:winnie}恐怕不是。扫描仪显示出高水平的反魔法能力。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_22_INTRO_14": "{TIRED:crazydave}Abra-kabummer。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_23_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，我从昨天就注意到你的不满了。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_23_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}我已经找到了一个新工厂：魔术菇。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_23_INTRO_3": "{EXCITED:crazydave}拥有自己的魔术师真是太好了。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_23_INTRO_4": "{SAY:crazydave}现在魔法大赛我们并没有输！",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_23_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}魔术菇向僵尸射击具有伤害性的卡片。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_23_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}偶尔，他会射出对我们有利的魔法塔罗弹。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_23_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}一旦出现金卡，就代表他已经准备好发射魔法弹了。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_23_INTRO_8": "{SAY:crazydave}我看你已经种了一整列了，朋朋！",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_23_INTRO_9": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}好吧，让我们还给他们一些魔法吧！",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_24_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:crazydave}朋朋！朋朋！",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_24_INTRO_2": "{SAY:crazydave}你听到了吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_24_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}是的，用户戴夫。似乎有炸药被引爆了。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_24_INTRO_4": "{SAY:crazydave}它炸毁了我秘密的墨西哥卷饼藏品！",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_24_INTRO_5": "{SAY:crazydave}为什么有人可能想要这样做？",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_24_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}我不确定。看起来不像僵王博士’风格。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_24_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}而且，我注意到有一条消息发送给我们，也不是他的笔迹。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_24_INTRO_8": "{SAY:crazydave}消息？",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_24_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}上面写着：“你为何如此认真地对待你的种植技术？”",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_24_INTRO_10": "{SAY:crazydave}因为它们是我们的植物？？",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_24_INTRO_11": "{SAY:winnie}看来某人的幽默感特别恶劣。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_24_INTRO_12": "{SAY:crazydave}扫一扫，朋朋！我需要找出是谁炸毁了我的墨西哥卷饼！",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_24_INTRO_13": "{SAY:winnie}这张纸条是由一个被称为“恶作剧者”的僵尸送来的。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_24_INTRO_14": "{SAY:winnie}他对你的墨西哥卷饼的轰炸在僵尸语言中被称为“恶作剧者恶作剧”。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_24_INTRO_15": "{SAY:crazydave}哦，如果他认为炸毁植物很有趣，那他就参与其中！",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_24_INTRO_16": "{SAY:crazydave}我将通过放置西瓜投手和高坚果来向他展示我的种植能力！",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_24_INTRO_17": "{SAY:crazydave}看他多喜欢！",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_26_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}朋朋，你有没有发现，僵尸们好像在，呃呃……在寻找什么东西？",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_26_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}确实有，用户戴夫。这个马戏团不仅仅被用作“T1”计划的幌子。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_26_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}看来还是延续了蒸汽时代的模式。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_26_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}僵尸来这里不仅仅是为了阻止我们，他们也在探索。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_26_INTRO_5": "{SAY:crazydave}你知道我认为他们需要什么吗？他们需要降级！",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_26_INTRO_6": "{SAY:crazydave}它们应该不那么……奇怪。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_26_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}伟大的西葫芦可以帮助我们实现这个目标。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_26_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}他可以发射魔法弹丸，将僵尸变成最基本的变种。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_26_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}要发射魔法弹丸，只需在大西葫芦不睡觉时点击他即可。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_26_INTRO_10": "{SAY:crazydave}现在你看到他们...现在你...",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_26_INTRO_11": "{SAY:crazydave}...仍然可以看到他们，但他们太蹩脚了！",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_27_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}朋朋，你知道为什么马戏团这么……奇怪吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_27_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}似乎已经被废弃了，直到僵王博士接管了它。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_27_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}或许是因为僵王博士接管了......",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_27_INTRO_4": "{SAY:crazydave}是啊，我看到到处都是坏掉的装备！",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_27_INTRO_5": "{SAY:crazydave}我是说，看看那个坏掉的音乐娃娃！",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_27_INTRO_6": "{SAY:crazydave}显然已经有一段时间没有碰过了。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_27_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}你说的音乐娃娃好像年久失修了……\n 然而，",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_27_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}扫描显示，它有一些非常不寻常的地方......",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_27_INTRO_9": "{EXCITED:crazydave}那东西刚刚动了吗！？",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_27_INTRO_10": "{SAY:crazydave}我想我刚刚在它的眼睛里看到了一些东西！",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_27_INTRO_11": "{SAY:crazydave}朋朋，我们需要做点什么！",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_27_INTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}我们应该谨慎。音乐娃娃僵尸似乎正在逼近。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_27_INTRO_13": "{SAY:winnie}我无法确定他们如何移动。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_27_INTRO_14": "{SAY:winnie}预计可能会出现令人讨厌的意外。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_28_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}朋朋，我不得不说...我们已经在这里有一段时间了。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_28_INTRO_2": "{SAY:crazydave}为什么我们还是无法弄清楚老板在这里做什么！？",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_28_INTRO_3": "{SAY:crazydave}没有任何意义，看起来老板不喜欢在这里。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_28_INTRO_4": "{SAY:crazydave}我也没有。这个马戏团真是把我搞乱了！",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_28_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}嗯，僵王博士确实提到这是他的意图。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_28_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}这只意味着他有重要的事情瞒着我们。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_28_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}从目前的线索来看，我怀疑他对这个马戏团的超越是有预谋的。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_28_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}僵王博士最近似乎更专注于避开我们而不是面对我们。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_28_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}保守秘密而不是挑战我们。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_28_INTRO_10": "{SAY:crazydave}这通常不像他。有股味道，而且不是棉花糖。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_28_INTRO_11": "{SAY:winnie}没错。僵王在追寻某物，而它就在这里。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_28_INTRO_12": "{SAY:crazydave}所以整个地方都是这样因为老板想要一个小玩意？",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_28_INTRO_13": "{SAY:winnie}他是这件荒唐事的主谋。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_28_INTRO_14": "{SAY:winnie}一旦我们弄清楚了他的计划，我们就会知道如何阻止它。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_28_OUTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}嗯？这是什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_28_OUTRO_2": "{SAY:crazydave}注释？",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_28_OUTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}负，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_28_OUTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}这是我们一直在等待的线索。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_28_OUTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}这些是僵王’蓝图。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_28_OUTRO_6": "{SAY:crazydave}肯定是给了那个僵尸了！",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_28_OUTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}而上面写的东西是最有趣的。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_28_OUTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}看看这个...",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_29_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}你知道那东西在哪里吗朋朋？",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_29_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}我的扫描还没有发现任何异常情况，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_29_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}如果我们想在僵王博士之前找到它，我们就必须继续搜索。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_29_INTRO_4": "{SAY:crazydave}它会在哪里？",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_29_INTRO_5": "{SAY:crazydave}我们应该快点，僵尸每晚都变得更加古怪。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_29_INTRO_6": "{SAY:crazydave}还有老板一定也和我们做着同样的事情吧。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_29_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}只要保持专注，我们就会找到真相并找到那个物体。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_31_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}为什么，你是个执着的人，不是吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_31_INTRO_2": "{SAY:zombossicon}我的狂欢你享受了吗？它有很多景点和奇迹......",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_31_INTRO_3": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}游戏结束了，僵王。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_31_INTRO_4": "{SAY:crazydave}是啊，我们已经受够了你们的玩具和劣质糖果！",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_31_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}我们已适应您的方案。我们现在知道这个游戏的规则了。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_31_INTRO_6": "{SAY:zombossicon}规则？规则！？",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_31_INTRO_7": "{SAY:zombossicon}哦，但这是一个没有你的“规则”的游戏！",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_31_INTRO_8": "{SAY:zombossicon}你在我的地盘上，我可以控制会发生什么！",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_31_INTRO_9": "{SAY:zombossicon}所以我要确保今晚，你所有的“规则”都消失了！",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_31_INTRO_10": "{SAY:zombossicon}也许你有一副叠好的牌，但牌总是可以对我有利的洗牌......",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_31_INTRO_11": "{NPC_EXIT:zombossicon}{SAY:winnie}警告，用户戴夫。我今天注意到草坪上的牌有一种不寻常的行为。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_31_INTRO_12": "{SAY:crazydave}这是什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_31_INTRO_13": "{SAY:winnie}似乎僵王以某种方式控制了他们。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_31_INTRO_14": "{SAY:winnie}他会在晚上洗牌以试图阻碍我们。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_31_INTRO_15": "{SAY:crazydave}你不能欺骗骗子！我会让他见识一下真正的发牌人能做什么！",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_31_OUTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}朋朋，是吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_31_OUTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}我们做到了！我们找到了愤怒的玩具箱！",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_31_OUTRO_3": "{SAY:crazydave}哇哦，那东西近距离看更怪异。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_31_OUTRO_4": "{SAY:crazydave}那么，这就是老板一直在寻找的东西吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_31_OUTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}毫无疑问。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_31_OUTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}他的一只僵尸似乎正在将发现的神器交给他。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_31_OUTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}但是我们拦截了它。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_31_OUTRO_8": "{SAY:crazydave}知道了老板，他现在就不会退缩了。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_31_OUTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}我们已经准备好面对他可能对我们施加的任何愤怒。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_32_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}什么！？你是怎么拿到手的！？",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_32_INTRO_2": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}愤怒的玩具箱，你是说？",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_32_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}我们知道您的所有计划。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_32_INTRO_4": "{SAY:crazydave}下次你要去寻找复活节彩蛋时，请邀请我们！",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_32_INTRO_5": "{SAY:zombossicon}爱管闲事的时间旅行者...",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_32_INTRO_6": "{SAY:zombossicon}这么说，你看穿了我的幻觉？",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_32_INTRO_7": "{SAY:zombossicon}我的误导？试图摆脱你！？",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_32_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}你的雾里看花并没有阻止我们了解真相，僵王博士。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_32_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}我们怀疑你从一开始就想利用这个马戏团来隐藏你的计划。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_32_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}我们上次见面时你说的一些话让我印象深刻。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_32_INTRO_11": "{SAY:winnie}“我得到了我想要的。”",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_32_INTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}但最后的线索是什么让一切都就位了。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_32_INTRO_13": "{SAY:winnie}你的蓝图揭示了你真正追求的东西。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_32_INTRO_14": "{SAY:crazydave}我们不会让你自己得到那些东西！",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_32_INTRO_15": "{SAY:zombossicon}哈！傻瓜们……无论如何都已经太晚了。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_32_INTRO_16": "{SAY:zombossicon}我知道你会一如既往地让我感到痛苦。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_32_INTRO_17": "{SAY:zombossicon}我研究了这个奇怪地方的魔力，并成功地控制了它，对我有利。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_32_INTRO_18": "{SAY:zombossicon}我已经让自己对所有攻击几乎无敌了！你的植物几乎会让我的僵博机器人发痒。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_32_INTRO_19": "{SAY:zombossicon}所以你这次肯定要倒下了。我会得到那个玩具箱！",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_32_INTRO_20": "{NPC_EXIT:zombossicon}{SAY:winnie}扫描……确实如此，他的新僵博机器人几乎不受钝器攻击。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_32_INTRO_21": "{SAY:winnie}我们需要一种新的魔法来造成任何有意义的伤害......",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_32_OUTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}你是怎么做到的！？那是作弊！",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_32_OUTRO_2": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}什么，老板，你没看到发生了什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_32_OUTRO_3": "{SAY:zombossicon}你的牌堆对你有利！",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_32_OUTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}在这些战斗中我们总是有自己的王牌，僵王。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_32_OUTRO_5": "{SAY:zombossicon}啊啊啊！你不会先发制人，时间旅行者！",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_32_OUTRO_6": "{SAY:zombossicon}如果这是您想要的比赛，这就是您会得到的比赛！",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_32_OUTRO_7": "{SAY:zombossicon}你必须打败不止一个马戏团才能打败我！",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_32_OUTRO_8": "{NPC_EXIT:zombossicon}{SAY:winnie}我们已经做到了，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_32_OUTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}我们揭露了僵王博士'的计划并获得了愤怒玩具箱。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_32_OUTRO_10": "{SAY:crazydave}但是如果我们想阻止他建造那个东西……",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_32_OUTRO_11": "{SAY:crazydave}...我们必须先收集其他小玩意！",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_32_OUTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}那就离开这个乱七八糟的地方吧。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_32_OUTRO_13": "{SAY:winnie}有了愤怒玩具箱，我们肯定比僵王博士领先了一步。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_32_OUTRO_14": "{SAY:crazydave}现在谁笑到了最后？",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_ZOMBIENOTE_1": "{NPC_ENTER:winnieicon}{SAY:winnieicon}这张海报是为明天晚上的强人表演做广告。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_ZOMBIENOTE_2": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydaveicon}{SAY:crazydaveicon}希望爆米花人也在。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_OUTRO_DANGER_ROOM_KEY_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}这个小窍门让我想起了我们以前打僵尸的东西！",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_OUTRO_DANGER_ROOM_KEY_2": "{SAY:winnie}“打击”某物的方法不只一种，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_CARNIVAL_OUTRO_DANGER_ROOM_KEY_3": "{SAY:winnie}这样的话，或许就是证明自己实力的一种方式。",
  "NARRATIVE_DANGER_ROOM_INTRO_CARNIVAL_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SAY:crazydave}嗨邻居！欢迎来到力量考验！",
  "NARRATIVE_DANGER_ROOM_INTRO_CARNIVAL_2": "{SAY:crazydave}站起来！看看你能多用力踢草！",
  "NARRATIVE_LOAM_BLUEPRINTS_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydaveicon}{SAY:crazydaveicon}L.O.A.M？",
  "NARRATIVE_LOAM_BLUEPRINTS_2": "{NPC_ENTER:winnieicon}{SPECIAL1:winnieicon}传说中的万能神秘法器。",
  "NARRATIVE_LOAM_BLUEPRINTS_3": "{SAY:winnieicon}执行深入的 Gügle 搜索...",
  "NARRATIVE_LOAM_BLUEPRINTS_4": "{SAY:winnieicon}L.O.A.M 似乎是一个关于古代神秘武器的都市传说。起源不明。",
  "NARRATIVE_LOAM_BLUEPRINTS_5": "{SAY:crazydaveicon}听起来很疯狂！它的目的是什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_LOAM_BLUEPRINTS_6": "{SAY:winnieicon}据说是“能够取得胜利的沃土”。",
  "NARRATIVE_LOAM_BLUEPRINTS_7": "{SAY:winnieicon}根据传说，它的一部分已经分散在时间本身中。",
  "NARRATIVE_LOAM_BLUEPRINTS_8": "{SAY:winnieicon}伪装成日常用品，以免落入坏人之手。",
  "NARRATIVE_LOAM_BLUEPRINTS_9": "{SAY:crazydaveicon}这是什么？ “电源铅管”已被划掉。",
  "NARRATIVE_LOAM_BLUEPRINTS_10": "{SAY:winnieicon}那一定是僵王博士在蒸汽时代得到的L.O.A.M部分。",
  "NARRATIVE_LOAM_BLUEPRINTS_11": "{SAY:winnieicon}你知道这意味着什么吗，用户戴夫？",
  "NARRATIVE_LOAM_BLUEPRINTS_12": "{SAY:crazydaveicon}不再有华夫饼的炸玉米饼了吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LOAM_BLUEPRINTS_13": "{SAY:winnieicon}相反。如果僵王博士拿到了这种技术，我无法想象后果。",
  "NARRATIVE_LOAM_BLUEPRINTS_14": "{SAY:winnieicon}蓝图已被撕毁，但清单上的下一个是“愤怒玩具箱”。",
  "NARRATIVE_LOAM_BLUEPRINTS_15": "{EXCITED:winnieicon}那一定是 L.O.A.M. 这段时间的一部分！",
  "NARRATIVE_LOAM_BLUEPRINTS_16": "{EXCITED:crazydaveicon}我们必须先找到那个东西！",
  "NARRATIVE_EGYPT_26_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}哇哦，我们又去埃及做什么了？",
  "NARRATIVE_EGYPT_26_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，我的记忆可能有问题，但我们刚刚在这里击败了僵王博士。",
  "NARRATIVE_EGYPT_26_INTRO_3": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}哦，对了，我拿出了你的一些存储卡来代替玉米片。",
  "NARRATIVE_EGYPT_26_INTRO_4": "{SHOUT:crazydave}我们回到了现在，到处都是奇怪的传送门！",
  "NARRATIVE_EGYPT_26_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}对了，我已经备份到内存了。你是对的，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_EGYPT_26_INTRO_6": "{SAY:crazydave}邻居，如果你不明白我在说什么，我们肯定陷入了时间循环！",
  "NARRATIVE_EGYPT_26_INTRO_7": "{SHOUT:crazydave}我们来自fuuuuuuutuuuuure！",
  "NARRATIVE_EGYPT_26_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}是的。如果您还没有经历过现代世界的狂热，建议您在继续之前先体验一下。",
  "NARRATIVE_EGYPT_26_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}如果没有多功能植物，僵王博士带来的新恐怖时代将很难克服。",
  "NARRATIVE_EGYPT_26_INTRO_10": "{SAY:crazydave}疯狂！时间线很古怪！希望当你不再是过去的时候我们再次见面！",
  "NARRATIVE_EGYPT_29_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}害怕那些可恶的法老们！木乃伊化的巨人僵尸是领主。他们将统治你我！",
  "NARRATIVE_EGYPT_29_INTRO_2": "{SAY:crazydave}朋朋，你胡说什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_EGYPT_29_INTRO_3": "{TIRED:winnie}btzz...",
  "NARRATIVE_EGYPT_29_INTRO_4": "{TIRED:winnie}肯定是有什么不可预测的东西接管了我的硬件。",
  "NARRATIVE_EGYPT_29_INTRO_5": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}这是埃及古老的诅咒之一吗？我在电视上听说过一次。",
  "NARRATIVE_EGYPT_29_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}更有可能是僵王试图干扰我的信号。",
  "NARRATIVE_EGYPT_29_INTRO_7": "{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}问候。我希望你不介意我听。",
  "NARRATIVE_EGYPT_29_INTRO_8": "{SAY:crazydave}老板！",
  "NARRATIVE_EGYPT_29_INTRO_9": "{SAY:zombossicon}大卫你好！好久不见。",
  "NARRATIVE_EGYPT_29_INTRO_10": "{SAY:zombossicon}哦，我为你准备了一些大东西！",
  "NARRATIVE_EGYPT_29_INTRO_11": "{SAY:zombossicon}例如-",
  "NARRATIVE_EGYPT_29_INTRO_12": "{TIRED:winnie}btzz...服从埃及霸主，用户戴夫。他们会吃掉你的大脑。他们很快就会到达。",
  "NARRATIVE_EGYPT_29_INTRO_13": "{SAY:zombossicon}你的珍贵车辆在我手中！啊哈哈哈哈！",
  "NARRATIVE_EGYPT_30_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}您的割草机已被带到祭祀仪式场所。为了伟大的拉的仁慈而付出的代价是值得的。",
  "NARRATIVE_EGYPT_30_INTRO_2": "{SHOUT:crazydave}朋朋，你对割草机做了什么！？",
  "NARRATIVE_EGYPT_30_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}安静大卫！你的存在只是为了服务神圣的法老。",
  "NARRATIVE_EGYPT_30_INTRO_4": "{SHOUT:crazydave}我知道我说过我看了一些关于埃及的电视，但你已经把它提升到了一个新的水平！",
  "NARRATIVE_EGYPT_35_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}你好，大卫。",
  "NARRATIVE_EGYPT_35_INTRO_2": "{SAY:zombossicon}这就是你臣服于我的部分，我立刻就赢了！",
  "NARRATIVE_EGYPT_35_INTRO_3": "{EXCITED:crazydave}你想让我和我的邻居投降？",
  "NARRATIVE_EGYPT_35_INTRO_4": "{SAY:zombossicon}正是如此！我的计划太大了，不能被你们这样的人挫败！",
  "NARRATIVE_EGYPT_35_INTRO_5": "{SAY:zombossicon}以防万一遭到报复，我已经准备好了我的ZOMBOT SPHINX-INATOR 2.0！",
  "NARRATIVE_EGYPT_35_INTRO_6": "{TIRED:crazydave}哦，又是bug了。",
  "NARRATIVE_EGYPT_35_INTRO_7": "{SAY:zombossicon}呸！这不是“虫子的事”——这就是你的厄运！",
  "NARRATIVE_EGYPT_35_INTRO_8": "{SAY:zombossicon}如果你想让你的车辆同伴摆脱她对埃及的痴迷......",
  "NARRATIVE_EGYPT_35_INTRO_9": "{SAY:zombossicon}...你必须承受它的愤怒！",
  "NARRATIVE_EGYPT_35_INTRO_10": "{SAY:zombossicon}你的选择！要么屈服，要么被毁灭！",
  "NARRATIVE_EGYPT_35_OUTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}不可能！埃及计划落空！",
  "NARRATIVE_EGYPT_35_OUTRO_2": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}正在重新校准……僵王，你试图控制我最终是徒劳的。",
  "NARRATIVE_EGYPT_35_OUTRO_3": "{SAY:zombossicon}幸灾乐祸，虽然你可能......但我有意外情况。",
  "NARRATIVE_EGYPT_35_OUTRO_4": "{SAY:zombossicon}神秘埃及只是我的目的地之一！如果我不能在这里消灭你，我一定会在其他地方消灭你！",
  "NARRATIVE_EGYPT_35_OUTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}由于这些意外事件很可能是为我们设置的陷阱，所以我建议不要采取行动。",
  "NARRATIVE_EGYPT_35_OUTRO_6": "{SAY:zombossicon}我想我捕获的植物可以为你说话！啊哈哈哈哈！",
  "NARRATIVE_EGYPT_35_OUTRO_7": "{NPC_EXIT:zombossicon}{SAY:winnie}捕获植物！？用户戴夫，我们必须检查之前报道过的其他世界！",
  "NARRATIVE_EGYPT_35_OUTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}就算是陷阱，也不能让僵王得逞！",
  "NARRATIVE_EGYPT_35_OUTRO_9": "{SAY:crazydave}我已经吃了我的炸玉米饼，所以我进来了。",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_26_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{PLAYFUL:crazydave}嘿伙计！",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_26_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，我的记忆可能有问题，但我看到的船上有一艘船的模糊图像。",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_26_INTRO_3": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}哦，对了，我把你的内存卡拿出来当鱼食了。",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_26_INTRO_4": "{SHOUT:crazydave}我们回到了现在，到处都是奇怪的传送门！",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_26_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}对了，我已经备份到内存了。你是对的，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_26_INTRO_6": "{SAY:crazydave}邻居，如果你不明白我在说什么，我们肯定陷入了时间循环！",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_26_INTRO_7": "{SHOUT:crazydave}我们来自fuuuuuuutuuuuure！",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_26_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}是的。如果您还没有经历过现代世界的狂热，建议您在继续之前先体验一下。",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_26_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}如果没有多功能植物，这些虚张声势的恐怖新时代将很难克服。",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_26_INTRO_10": "{SAY:crazydave}等等。",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_26_INTRO_11": "{SAY:winnie}是吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_26_INTRO_12": "{SAY:crazydave}盗版不是违法吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_29_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}我们的割草机去哪儿了！？",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_29_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}他们有-",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_29_INTRO_3": "{SAY:crazydave}哦，没关系。它们可能是从某个粗略的地方下载的。",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_29_INTRO_4": "{SAY:crazydave}您知道盗版是违法的吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_29_INTRO_5": "{TIRED:winnie}...嗡嗡响...",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_29_INTRO_6": "{TIRED:winnie}很可能僵王正在退回到以前的时代去研究什么……",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_29_INTRO_7": "{TIRED:winnie}也许他在寻找规律？",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_29_INTRO_8": "{SAY:crazydave}哇。僵王也是海贼吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_29_INTRO_9": "{TIRED:winnie}...嗡嗡响...",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_29_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}大量海盗僵尸传入。计划必须执行，而且要快！",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_29_INTRO_11": "{EXCITED:crazydave}哦，我来给那些海盗看看！",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_29_INTRO_12": "{SAY:crazydave}等等，没关系。",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_29_INTRO_13": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我刚刚发现你可以通过这种方式获得免费电影。",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_29_INTRO_14": "{SAY:winnie}植物准备好了！",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_30_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{TIRED:crazydave}我晕船了。",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_30_INTRO_2": "{TIRED:winnie}用户戴夫，我在日志中发现了 364 次电影下载尝试。",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_30_INTRO_3": "{SAY:crazydave}是的。",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_30_INTRO_4": "{TIRED:winnie}未来400多年互联网不会被发明，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_30_INTRO_5": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}哇，排了好长的队。还好我早有准备。",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_35_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}嘿，伙计！",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_35_INTRO_2": "{SAY:crazydave}密友？你一定是疯了！我们不是朋友！",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_35_INTRO_3": "{SAY:zombossicon}哦，我知道我们是对手。",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_35_INTRO_4": "{SAY:zombossicon}我的意思是鱼食，大卫。",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_35_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}僵王，你为什么要抓走那些无辜的植物，把它们放回这些时代呢？",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_35_INTRO_6": "{SAY:zombossicon}哦，你不想知道吗，执着的旅行家？",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_35_INTRO_7": "{SAY:zombossicon}不用担心...一切都会在适当的时候变得有意义。",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_35_INTRO_8": "{SAY:zombossicon}然而，我必须完成最后一项任务。",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_35_INTRO_9": "{SAY:zombossicon}用你的大脑喂鱼！",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_35_OUTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}好吧，让我颤抖吧！你又以某种方式坚持了！",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_35_OUTRO_2": "{SAY:zombossicon}我还有捕获的植物哦哦等你在其他时代来拯救。",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_35_OUTRO_3": "{SAY:zombossicon}不要懈怠！我的新僵尸会等着我。",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_35_OUTRO_4": "{NPC_EXIT:zombossicon}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{EXCITED:winnie}用户戴夫，我们必须拯救那些植物！",
  "NARRATIVE_PIRATE_35_OUTRO_5": "{SAY:crazydave}当然！不过，遗憾的是我不得不放弃我的电影。",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_26_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}朋朋，这里怎么又这么干又热呢？",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_26_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}恐怕我无法提供该信息，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_26_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}我的记忆可能有问题，但我们才刚到这里不久，之后气候就没有变化。",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_26_INTRO_4": "{SAY:crazydave}我拿出了一些你的存储卡用于我的辣椒炖菜。",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_26_INTRO_5": "{SHOUT:crazydave}我们回到了现在，到处都是奇怪的传送门！",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_26_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}对了，我已经备份到内存了。",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_26_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}你是对的，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_26_INTRO_8": "{EXCITED:crazydave}邻居，如果你不明白我在说什么，我们肯定陷入了时间循环！",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_26_INTRO_9": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}我们来自fuuuuuuutuuuuure！",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_26_INTRO_10": "{TIRED:crazydave}但不是太空类型的未来，即使我们已经去过那里。",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_26_INTRO_11": "{TIRED:crazydave}外星人和牛仔在同一个对话中会很可怕。",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_26_INTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}是的。如果您还没有经历过现代世界的狂热，建议您在继续之前先体验一下。",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_26_INTRO_13": "{SAY:winnie}如果没有多功能植物，这些新的枪战日子将很难克服。",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_26_INTRO_14": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}疯狂！",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_26_INTRO_15": "{TIRED:crazydave}不是枪战部分，事实上炖菜甚至没有那么好吃。",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_28_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}警告：已识别出多种牛的声音。",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_28_INTRO_2": "{SAY:crazydave}有什么问题吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_28_INTRO_3": "{SAY:crazydave}我们已经和多头打交道有一段时间了。",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_28_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}这个量的公牛可不一般。",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_28_INTRO_5": "{TIRED:winnie}我担心他们可能会开始踩踏。",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_28_INTRO_6": "{TIRED:crazydave}我一直都知道会是这样的结局。",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_29_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}嘿朋朋，你注意到周围这些死灌木球状的东西了吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_29_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}你指的是风滚草，用户戴夫吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_29_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}风滚草是一种植物，对于对抗在你的防御内行进的僵尸非常有用。",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_29_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}它们也可用于对抗生命值较低的僵尸。",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_29_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}一旦种植，它就会开始沿着车道翻滚。它也可以种植在其他植物的顶部。",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_29_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}它的作用就像一个保龄球灯泡 - 然而，它有机会击晕僵尸，将其击退，甚至繁殖。",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_29_INTRO_7": "{SAY:crazydave}哇。",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_29_INTRO_8": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}枯死的灌木丛有很多用途。",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_29_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}它们现在肯定有用。看来一大群丧尸即将袭来。",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_30_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}我们的割草机去哪儿了！？",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_30_INTRO_2": "{TIRED:winnie}他们都被一群精神错乱的僵尸鸡激活了。",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_30_INTRO_3": "{TIRED:crazydave}...",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_30_INTRO_4": "{TIRED:crazydave}拿出我们的闪电芦苇！",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_31_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}这是什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_31_INTRO_2": "{SAY:crazydave}同一条轨道上的两辆小车？",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_31_INTRO_3": "{SAY:crazydave}这并不疯狂——这是不可能的！",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_31_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}我们可以利用这个。",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_31_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}在轨道上表现出色的植物是Ultomato。",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_31_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}他可以定期发射致命的激光，并且很像豌豆荚，可以升级。",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_31_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}但是，用得越多，他就会变得越贵。",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_31_INTRO_8": "{SAY:crazydave}呃，我讨厌那样的植物。",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_31_INTRO_9": "{SAY:crazydave}他们认为自己很热门，所以他们可以随心所欲地改变成本。",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_31_INTRO_10": "{EXCITED:crazydave}他们夺走了我所有的阳光，我告诉你！",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_31_INTRO_11": "{SAY:winnie}幸运的是，Ultomato越强，他的光束破坏力就越大。",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_31_INTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}不过，他对植物性食物过敏。",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_31_INTRO_13": "{SAY:winnie}喂他会让他爆炸并死亡。",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_31_INTRO_14": "{SAY:crazydave}那么对我来说更多。",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_32_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}Y'知道，我想知道这些小鬼怎么这么擅长骑公牛。",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_32_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}他们很可能是被骑术能力更高的丧尸教导的。",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_32_INTRO_3": "{TIRED:crazydave}嗯，镇上有关于牛仔竞技传奇的传言。",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_32_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}牛仔竞技传奇僵尸骑着一头公牛，它可以冲进植物并伤害它们。",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_32_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}建议尽快使用更多一次性手段阻止他。",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_35_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}问候。",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_35_INTRO_2": "{SAY:zombossicon}我希望你喜欢新的和改进的公牛模型。我已经完成了相当大的一半工作了！",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_35_INTRO_3": "{TIRED:crazydave}不，我实际上没有。",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_35_INTRO_4": "{TIRED:crazydave}现在想来他们真是个大麻烦。",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_35_INTRO_5": "{SAY:zombossicon}...",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_35_INTRO_6": "{SAY:zombossicon}是的...这就是我的意思。",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_35_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}僵王，你的讽刺言论并不能阻止我们禁止你进入这个时间段。",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_35_INTRO_8": "{SAY:zombossicon}不过也许正午的决斗会……",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_35_OUTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}我想我确实要离开这个小镇了。",
  "NARRATIVE_COWBOY_35_OUTRO_2": "{SAY:zombossicon}享受你的胜利；我还有更多的伎俩等着你。",
  "NARRATIVE_FUTURE_26_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}回到未来？你知道我讨厌这里，我对机器人有一种非理性的恐惧！",
  "NARRATIVE_FUTURE_26_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，我的记忆可能有问题，但我们只是在未来击败了僵王博士。",
  "NARRATIVE_FUTURE_26_INTRO_3": "{SAY:crazydave}呃，他们只是发出嘟嘟的声音，就像没有明天一样！",
  "NARRATIVE_FUTURE_26_INTRO_4": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}总之，是的，我拿出了你的一些存储卡，因为它们看起来很吓人。",
  "NARRATIVE_FUTURE_26_INTRO_5": "{SHOUT:crazydave}我们回到了现在，到处都是奇怪的传送门！",
  "NARRATIVE_FUTURE_26_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}对了，我已经备份到内存了。你是对的，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_FUTURE_26_INTRO_7": "{SAY:crazydave}邻居，如果你不明白我在说什么，我们肯定陷入了时间循环！",
  "NARRATIVE_FUTURE_26_INTRO_8": "{SHOUT:crazydave}我们来自fuuuuuuutuuuuure！",
  "NARRATIVE_FUTURE_26_INTRO_9": "{TIRED:crazydave}嗯...甚至futuuurer fuuutuuuuure！",
  "NARRATIVE_FUTURE_26_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}是的。如果您还没有经历过现代世界的狂热，建议您在继续之前先体验一下。",
  "NARRATIVE_FUTURE_26_INTRO_11": "{SAY:winnie}如果没有多功能植物，这些新的技术恐怖时代将很难克服。",
  "NARRATIVE_FUTURE_26_INTRO_12": "{SAY:crazydave}疯狂！",
  "NARRATIVE_FUTURE_29_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}嘿，我们之前不是已经把这些嘟嘟声和嘘声都扔掉了吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_FUTURE_29_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}未来可能会有原始巨人僵尸、用户戴夫的维修站。",
  "NARRATIVE_FUTURE_29_INTRO_3": "{SHOUT:crazydave}不！不是机器人！",
  "NARRATIVE_FUTURE_29_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}驾驶的小恶魔说机器人具有很强的报复性。",
  "NARRATIVE_FUTURE_29_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}我建议极度谨慎。",
  "NARRATIVE_FUTURE_29_INTRO_6": "{TIRED:crazydave}*吞咽*",
  "NARRATIVE_FUTURE_30_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}嘿，我们的自动割草机™怎么了？",
  "NARRATIVE_FUTURE_30_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}我担心他们的保修期已过，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_FUTURE_30_INTRO_3": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}我知道我买它们的那个人很粗略！",
  "NARRATIVE_FUTURE_30_INTRO_4": "{TIRED:winnie}我坚持认为从小鬼僵尸s买东西从来都不是一个聪明的主意。",
  "NARRATIVE_FUTURE_30_INTRO_5": "{SHOUT:crazydave}你等着吧。我的评论要火了！",
  "NARRATIVE_FUTURE_35_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}晚上好，旅行者们。",
  "NARRATIVE_FUTURE_35_INTRO_2": "{SAY:zombossicon}或者，已经是明天了吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_FUTURE_35_INTRO_3": "{SAY:zombossicon}在这些未来的情况下你可能永远不会知道。",
  "NARRATIVE_FUTURE_35_INTRO_4": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}你想要什么，聪明人？",
  "NARRATIVE_FUTURE_35_INTRO_5": "{SAY:zombossicon}我想要的已经送到了。",
  "NARRATIVE_FUTURE_35_INTRO_6": "{SAY:zombossicon}在你尝试拯救被捕获的植物时......",
  "NARRATIVE_FUTURE_35_INTRO_7": "{SAY:zombossicon}...你给了我关于我的时间干预效果的精确结果。",
  "NARRATIVE_FUTURE_35_INTRO_8": "{SAY:zombossicon}回归并赋予我过去的僵尸新能力只是我研究的第一步。",
  "NARRATIVE_FUTURE_35_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}我无法计算这些选拔赛的分数，僵王博士。",
  "NARRATIVE_FUTURE_35_INTRO_10": "{SAY:zombossicon}考虑它们.... Beta 测试！",
  "NARRATIVE_FUTURE_35_INTRO_11": "{SAY:zombossicon}是的...比悖论计划更混乱的事情正在酝酿中...",
  "NARRATIVE_FUTURE_35_INTRO_12": "{SAY:zombossicon}你的大脑就是我的！今天……还是明天？",
  "NARRATIVE_FUTURE_35_OUTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}诅咒！也许你赢得了这场战斗，但这场战争是我的胜利！",
  "NARRATIVE_FUTURE_35_OUTRO_2": "{SAY:zombossicon}好未来，坏未来，有什么区别？",
  "NARRATIVE_FUTURE_35_OUTRO_3": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{PLAYFUL:crazydave}美好的未来没有嘟嘟嘟的机器人！",
  "NARRATIVE_FUTURE_35_OUTRO_4": "{SAY:zombossicon}呃...直到我们下一次相遇...时间旅行者。",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_21_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}好诡异，我们怎么又来了？",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_21_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，我的记忆可能有问题，但我们在这个时间段内刚刚击败了僵王博士。",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_21_INTRO_3": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}哦，对了，我把你的一些内存卡拿出来当做菜了。",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_21_INTRO_4": "{SHOUT:crazydave}我们回到了现在，到处都是奇怪的传送门！",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_21_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}对了，我已经备份到内存了。你是对的，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_21_INTRO_6": "{SAY:crazydave}邻居，如果你不明白我在说什么，我们肯定陷入了时间循环！",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_21_INTRO_7": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}我们来自fuuuuuuutuuuuure！",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_21_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}是的。如果您还没有经历过现代世界的狂热，建议您在继续之前先体验一下。",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_21_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}如果没有多功能植物，这些新的巫术之夜将很难克服。",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_21_INTRO_10": "{SAY:crazydave}疯狂！",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_22_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}朋朋，你闻到了吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_22_INTRO_2": "{TIRED:winnie}我无法感知气味。",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_22_INTRO_3": "{EXCITED:crazydave}是啊，我也闻到了。我闻到了偷太阳的味道！",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_22_INTRO_4": "{EXCITED:crazydave}太阳盗窃在 9 个不同的州都是严重犯罪！",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_22_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}我从来没有听说过这个信息。",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_22_INTRO_6": "{EXCITED:winnie}哪些州认为此活动构成犯罪？",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_22_INTRO_7": "{SAY:crazydave}俄亥俄州。",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_22_INTRO_8": "{SAY:crazydave}这就是我所知道的全部。",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_22_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}事实上，我的扫描仪正在拾取一些东西。",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_22_INTRO_10": "{EXCITED:winnie}是的，这就解释了。",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_22_INTRO_11": "{SAY:winnie}强盗僵尸正在潜行。",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_22_INTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}强盗僵尸的包里装着偷来的阳光。",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_22_INTRO_13": "{SAY:winnie}如果独自一人，它们会偷偷溜出草坪。",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_22_INTRO_14": "{EXCITED:winnie}但是，如果被击败，他们的包会掉落75太阳。",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_22_INTRO_15": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我就知道！",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_22_INTRO_16": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我知道我的太阳感应没有失败！",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_22_INTRO_17": "{SAY:winnie}我不确定这是否是我想索取更多数据的信息。",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_24_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}我们的割草机怎么了！？",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_24_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}我的镜头显示两个鬼鬼祟祟的僵尸强盗在晚上早些时候偷走了它们。",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_24_INTRO_3": "{SAY:crazydave}哦，是的，这到底是怎么回事？",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_24_INTRO_4": "{SAY:crazydave}已经好几天没有白天了！",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_24_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}民间传说僵尸只在晚上出现。",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_24_INTRO_6": "{EXCITED:crazydave}夜晚唯一的好处就是可以把人从雾里吓跑！",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_24_INTRO_7": "{SAY:crazydave}但是这里连雾都没有！",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_25_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}朋朋，那群拿着锤子的蒙面丧尸在这里做什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_25_INTRO_2": "{SAY:crazydave}他们靠近了吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_25_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，我很遗憾地通知您，Edgar George 僵王博士已经为您写了一份执行令。",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_25_INTRO_4": "{SAY:crazydave}听起来不太好。",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_25_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}来自僵尸王国各地的刽子手已经到来。",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_25_INTRO_6": "{SAY:crazydave}好吧，至少我们有我们的草坪-",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_25_INTRO_7": "{TIRED:crazydave}哦，对了，我忘了。",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_26_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，这里似乎又多了一个新僵尸。",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_26_INTRO_2": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}叫我戴夫爵士！因为我先生是最多人拥有的先生！",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_26_INTRO_3": "{TIRED:winnie}戴夫爵士，这个僵尸似乎是一个黑暗巫师。",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_26_INTRO_4": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}朋朋，你错了！",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_26_INTRO_5": "{EXCITED:crazydave}参与逆向语法！",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_26_INTRO_6": "{TIRED:winnie}他将成为一个可怕的敌人。",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_26_INTRO_7": "{TIRED:winnie}龙小鬼，召唤他会的。",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_26_INTRO_8": "{EXCITED:crazydave}龙别吓倒我！",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_26_INTRO_9": "{EXCITED:crazydave}加油朋朋！",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_26_INTRO_10": "{EXCITED:crazydave}踏上冒险之旅！我们一定要救出女巫榛！",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_26_INTRO_11": "{TIRED:winnie}正常设置，我可以切换回，戴夫爵士吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_26_INTRO_12": "{TIRED:crazydave}没有。",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_27_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:crazydave}女巫榛，她来了！",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_27_INTRO_2": "{TIRED:winnie}将僵尸变成小喷菇、女巫榛都可以。",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_27_INTRO_3": "{TIRED:winnie}清除顽固的僵尸，她很有用。",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_27_INTRO_4": "{TIRED:winnie}在大群僵尸中，她的效率较低。",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_27_INTRO_5": "{SAY:crazydave}好吧朋朋没关系。",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_27_INTRO_6": "{TIRED:crazydave}我……你说的话一句也听不懂。",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_27_INTRO_7": "{TIRED:winnie}正常设置，我可以切换回，戴夫爵士吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_27_INTRO_8": "{SAY:crazydave}是啊，这越来越无聊了。",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_27_INTRO_9": "{TIRED:winnie}请不要再这样做了，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_30_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}Holla，餐饮表兄弟。",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_30_INTRO_2": "{SAY:zombossicon}或者我应该说，僵博机器人类的不法分子。",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_30_INTRO_3": "{SAY:zombossicon}你的灵魂因你破坏了我珍贵的发明而悲惨！",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_30_INTRO_4": "{SAY:zombossicon}你们这群脾气暴躁的家伙，你们的清算已经到来了！",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_30_INTRO_5": "{SAY:zombossicon}告别植物节制的日子。",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_30_INTRO_6": "{SAY:zombossicon}F'r，如果不是我自己的改良龙成功消灭了你，我一定会取得胜利！",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_30_INTRO_7": "{NPC_EXIT:zombossicon}{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SAY:crazydave}什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_30_OUTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}嘎！完美的龙确实失败了！",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_30_OUTRO_2": "{SAY:zombossicon}这一次，我其实并没有真正把自己的愿望投入到这次尝试中！",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_30_OUTRO_3": "{SAY:zombossicon}不担心，我自己的伟大研究仍在顺利进行，所以你的行为不会产生任何后果。",
  "NARRATIVE_DARK_30_OUTRO_4": "{SAY:zombossicon}再见！",
  "NARRATIVE_BEACH_33_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{TIRED:crazydave}回到这个地方我有一种不好的预感。",
  "NARRATIVE_BEACH_33_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}恐怕我不记得这个位置了，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_BEACH_33_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}我的记忆可能有问题，但有一些记忆包含章鱼的图像。",
  "NARRATIVE_BEACH_33_INTRO_4": "{SAY:crazydave}我拿出了一些你的存储卡并用它们来清洁保龄球灯泡。",
  "NARRATIVE_BEACH_33_INTRO_5": "{SHOUT:crazydave}我们回到了现在，到处都是奇怪的传送门！",
  "NARRATIVE_BEACH_33_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}对了，我已经备份到内存了。",
  "NARRATIVE_BEACH_33_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}你是对的，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_BEACH_33_INTRO_8": "{EXCITED:crazydave}邻居，如果你不明白我在说什么，我们肯定陷入了时间循环！",
  "NARRATIVE_BEACH_33_INTRO_9": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}我们来自fuuuuuuutuuuuure！",
  "NARRATIVE_BEACH_33_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}是的。如果您还没有经历过现代世界的狂热，建议您在继续之前先体验一下。",
  "NARRATIVE_BEACH_33_INTRO_11": "{SAY:winnie}如果没有多功能植物，这些疯狂的泼水新时代将很难克服。",
  "NARRATIVE_BEACH_33_INTRO_12": "{EXCITED:crazydave}疯狂！",
  "NARRATIVE_BEACH_37_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}我们的割草机去哪儿了？",
  "NARRATIVE_BEACH_37_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}游泳。",
  "NARRATIVE_BEACH_37_INTRO_3": "{TIRED:crazydave}我明白了。",
  "NARRATIVE_BEACH_37_INTRO_4": "{SAY:crazydave}那么，我们该怎么办？",
  "NARRATIVE_BEACH_37_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}扫描显示地平线上有深海巨人和一群其他僵尸。",
  "NARRATIVE_BEACH_37_INTRO_6": "{SAY:crazydave}那些又大又奇怪的螃蟹僵尸？",
  "NARRATIVE_BEACH_37_INTRO_7": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}那些是一些真正善于观察的海洋生物，让我告诉你。",
  "NARRATIVE_BEACH_37_INTRO_8": "{SAY:crazydave}那天，我去钓鱼的时候...",
  "NARRATIVE_BEACH_37_INTRO_9": "{EXCITED:winnie}用户戴夫，我确信你的钓鱼故事很有趣，但是——",
  "NARRATIVE_BEACH_37_INTRO_10": "{EXCITED:crazydave}...然后他们跳了起来，我也跳了起来，然后...",
  "NARRATIVE_BEACH_37_INTRO_11": "{SAY:winnie}这个没有用。",
  "NARRATIVE_BEACH_37_INTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}僵尸已经开始逼近了。我们需要把植物放下来。",
  "NARRATIVE_BEACH_37_INTRO_13": "{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫同时可以继续说话。",
  "NARRATIVE_BEACH_37_OUTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}...这就是我捕获有史以来最大的鱼的方法。",
  "NARRATIVE_BEACH_37_OUTRO_2": "{EXCITED:winnie}僵尸群已成功解决。",
  "NARRATIVE_BEACH_37_OUTRO_3": "{TIRED:crazydave}什么僵尸群？",
  "NARRATIVE_BEACH_38_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}我们迎来了新的僵尸。",
  "NARRATIVE_BEACH_38_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}潜水僵尸比潜水僵尸浸入水中更深。",
  "NARRATIVE_BEACH_38_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}此外，缠结海带将无法阻止他们。",
  "NARRATIVE_BEACH_38_INTRO_4": "{SAY:crazydave}哦，我知道这些。",
  "NARRATIVE_BEACH_38_INTRO_5": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}我的一个朋友讨厌他们。他总是看到他们在他的住处周围潜水。",
  "NARRATIVE_BEACH_38_INTRO_6": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}非常生气的章鱼哥。他因毁坏一些昂贵的建筑而受到追捕。",
  "NARRATIVE_BEACH_38_INTRO_7": "{SAY:crazydave}不过我明白他了。",
  "NARRATIVE_BEACH_38_INTRO_8": "{TIRED:winnie}不存在您所描述的生物，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_BEACH_38_INTRO_9": "{EXCITED:crazydave}这就是他想让你这么想！",
  "NARRATIVE_BEACH_39_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，我们即将拯救另一种植物：归巢蓟。",
  "NARRATIVE_BEACH_39_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}而其他植物的射弹会被章鱼等障碍物阻挡......",
  "NARRATIVE_BEACH_39_INTRO_3": "{EXCITED:winnie}...归巢蓟直接瞄准僵尸！",
  "NARRATIVE_BEACH_39_INTRO_4": "{EXCITED:crazydave}整齐！但这意味着它的目标不是章鱼……",
  "NARRATIVE_BEACH_39_INTRO_5": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}好吧，至少我的水生朋友会喜欢这种植物。",
  "NARRATIVE_BEACH_39_INTRO_6": "{TIRED:winnie}没有因为寿司而愤怒的章鱼横行城市，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_BEACH_39_INTRO_7": "{SAY:crazydave}呃，你只是还没遇见他而已。",
  "NARRATIVE_BEACH_39_INTRO_8": "{SAY:crazydave}除了所有沸腾的愤怒之外，还是个可爱的家伙。",
  "NARRATIVE_BEACH_42_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}这太荒谬了！",
  "NARRATIVE_BEACH_42_INTRO_2": "{SAY:zombossicon}你五步前就注定要被淘汰了！",
  "NARRATIVE_BEACH_42_INTRO_3": "{SAY:zombossicon}虽然我最宏伟的计划正在实施，但你并没有被排除在外！",
  "NARRATIVE_BEACH_42_INTRO_4": "{SAY:zombossicon}你再把这些植物从我手里抢走，我还怎么继续拿它们当实验老鼠呢！",
  "NARRATIVE_BEACH_42_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}所以这就是你对他们所做的事情？",
  "NARRATIVE_BEACH_42_INTRO_6": "{SAY:zombossicon}嗯，是的，除了用它们作为诱饵......",
  "NARRATIVE_BEACH_42_INTRO_7": "{SAY:zombossicon}我想做一个基于鱼的威胁，但我在海盗时代没有好材料了。",
  "NARRATIVE_BEACH_42_INTRO_8": "{SAY:zombossicon}遗憾的是我无法让戏剧性的小提琴出现并为这个场合演奏。",
  "NARRATIVE_BEACH_42_INTRO_9": "{SAY:zombossicon}不管怎样，我现在就让你成为一个水坟！",
  "NARRATIVE_BEACH_42_OUTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}哦，这就尴尬了。",
  "NARRATIVE_BEACH_42_OUTRO_2": "{SAY:zombossicon}我所有发明的完美转世不能让我一直失望！",
  "NARRATIVE_BEACH_42_OUTRO_3": "{SAY:zombossicon}我真的需要假期！",
  "NARRATIVE_BEACH_42_OUTRO_4": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}好吧，你在海边。",
  "NARRATIVE_BEACH_42_OUTRO_5": "{SAY:zombossicon}当我和你说完的时候你就会在海底了！",
  "NARRATIVE_BEACH_42_OUTRO_6": "{SAY:zombossicon}我会好好休息的，好吧！而且你不会成为其中的一部分！",
  "NARRATIVE_BEACH_42_OUTRO_7": "{EXCITED:crazydave}哦，在海底！我喜欢那首歌！",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_31_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:crazydave}要么我的皮肤开始像以前一样让我发痒，要么就是冻僵了！",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_31_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}当前天气预报不可用，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_31_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}我的记忆力大概是有问题，但还是隐约记得那首名曲……",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_31_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}...“噗！黄鼠狼走了”。",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_31_INTRO_5": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}我把你的一些内存卡拿出来用来御寒。",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_31_INTRO_6": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我们回到了现在，到处都是奇怪的传送门！",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_31_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}对了，我已经备份到内存了。",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_31_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}你是对的，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_31_INTRO_9": "{EXCITED:crazydave}邻居，如果你不明白我在说什么，我们肯定陷入了时间循环！",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_31_INTRO_10": "{SHOUT:crazydave}我们来自fuuuuuuutuuuuure！",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_31_INTRO_11": "{SAY:winnie}是的。如果您还没有经历过现代世界的狂热，建议您在继续之前先体验一下。",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_31_INTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}这些新...",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_31_INTRO_13": "{TIRED:winnie}我分不清现在是不是白天。",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_31_INTRO_14": "{TIRED:winnie}我的筹码结冰了。",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_31_INTRO_15": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}哇，那真的....酷。",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_31_INTRO_16": "{TIRED:winnie}如果我有情感能力对这个笑话发出呻吟，我会的。",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_35_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:crazydave}朋朋，我的外套呢？我冻坏了！",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_35_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，除了白衬衫和牛仔裤之外，你身体上无法穿任何衣服。",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_35_INTRO_3": "{TIRED:crazydave}哦，是的。我忘了。",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_35_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}天气好像变得很可怕了。",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_35_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}暴风雪即将来临。",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_35_INTRO_6": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}我们还有一些濒临灭绝的植物正在放松！",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_35_INTRO_7": "{EXCITED:winnie}这是一个有趣的琐事事实，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_35_INTRO_8": "{TIRED:winnie}根据[已编辑]发表的一篇论文，冰双关语很糟糕。",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_35_INTRO_9": "{EXCITED:crazydave}废话朋朋，现在没时间说话了！",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_35_INTRO_10": "{EXCITED:crazydave}僵尸逼近了！",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_36_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:winnie}用户戴夫，我的时间异常图表正在飙升！",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_36_INTRO_2": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}现在什么时间？",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_36_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}存在某种超越这个时代的技术。",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_36_INTRO_4": "{EXCITED:crazydave}冰淇淋？",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_36_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}如果这是真的，我们将享受美味的冰基甜食。",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_36_INTRO_6": "{TIRED:winnie}然而，事实并非如此。",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_36_INTRO_7": "{SAY:crazydave}人还是可以做梦的。",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_36_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}机器人渡渡鸟似乎已经入侵。",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_36_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}他们的突然到来几乎可以肯定是僵王'马基雅维利式的侵入性努力的结果。",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_36_INTRO_10": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我简直不敢相信。",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_36_INTRO_11": "{TIRED:crazydave}机器人。",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_36_INTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}毫无疑问，与普通品种相比，它们会更加坚固。",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_36_INTRO_13": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我记得我们过去曾有过一些与机器人打交道的事情。",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_36_INTRO_14": "{TIRED:crazydave}Uuuuh...未来，过去。",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_37_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:crazydave}海狸不见了！",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_37_INTRO_2": "{TIRED:winnie}这确实是悲伤的一天。",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_37_INTRO_3": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}我希望他们的不幸经历继续像以前一样古怪！",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_37_INTRO_4": "{EXCITED:winnie}这种希望是现实的，因为摄像机镜头显示他们正在进行与坚果有关的愚蠢行为。",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_37_INTRO_5": "{PLAYFUL:winnie}他们宣布即将参加冰上游戏相关活动。",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_37_INTRO_6": "{EXCITED:crazydave}那么，没有他们，我们拿什么来保卫自己呢！？",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_37_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}还有老的可靠的火焰豌豆、用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_37_INTRO_8": "{EXCITED:winnie}她的火焰将使寒风失效！",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_40_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}问候，旅行者。",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_40_INTRO_2": "{SAY:zombossicon}我注意到疯狂戴夫的疯狂胡言乱语可能一直是史前史的副产品！",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_40_INTRO_3": "{TIRED:winnie}以什么方式？",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_40_INTRO_4": "{SAY:zombossicon}我所有的洞穴僵尸都用含糊不清、语无伦次的方言说话。",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_40_INTRO_5": "{SAY:zombossicon}Dave 的胡言乱语符合他们的愚蠢程度！",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_40_INTRO_6": "{SAY:zombossicon}如果你值得信赖的朋友一直都是穴居人怎么办？",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_40_INTRO_7": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我，穴居人！？",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_40_INTRO_8": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我连山洞都没有！",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_40_INTRO_9": "{SAY:zombossicon}这只是一个理论。一个有证据支持的！",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_40_INTRO_10": "{SAY:zombossicon}现在，我将向您展示僵王在没有受到该死的猛犸象毛皮过敏的阻碍时可以做什么！",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_40_INTRO_11": "{SAY:zombossicon}我做了迄今为止最邪恶的事！",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_40_INTRO_12": "{SAY:zombossicon}使用合成替代品！",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_40_INTRO_13": "{SAY:zombossicon}姆哇哈哈哈！",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_40_OUTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}也许你的邻居并不像我的理论所暗示的那么愚蠢！",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_40_OUTRO_2": "{SAY:zombossicon}这次没必要留下来闲聊了。",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_40_OUTRO_3": "{SAY:zombossicon}我有地方可去，合成替代品可供利用！",
  "NARRATIVE_ICEAGE_40_OUTRO_4": "{SAY:zombossicon}下次再见，旅行者们！",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_33_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{TIRED:crazydave}我有一种直觉，我们可能会迷路。",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_33_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}我的记忆表明并非如此。",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_33_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}我们刚刚找到了离开这些丛林的出口。",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_33_INTRO_4": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}我拿出了你的一些存储卡作为地图来找到回去的路。",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_33_INTRO_5": "{SHOUT:crazydave}我们回到了现在，到处都是奇怪的传送门！",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_33_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}对了，我已经备份到内存了。你是对的，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_33_INTRO_7": "{SAY:crazydave}邻居，如果你不明白我在说什么，我们肯定陷入了时间循环！",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_33_INTRO_8": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}我们来自fuuuuuuutuuuuure！",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_33_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}是的。如果您还没有经历过现代世界的狂热，建议您在继续之前先体验一下。",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_33_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}这些新的日子...",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_33_INTRO_11": "{TIRED:winnie}看来已经不是白天了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_33_INTRO_12": "{TIRED:crazydave}太好了，一开始我找不到路，现在黑暗中连脚趾都看不见了！",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_34_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}要么是我的眼睛欺骗了我，就像周二通常做的那样，要么我看到了一张熟悉的面孔。",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_34_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}这次你的眼睛没有欺骗你，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_34_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}看来我们的老熟人回来了。或者说他已经离开了？",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_34_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}探险家僵尸。",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_34_INTRO_5": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}这太疯狂了，甚至超出了我的理解水平。",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_34_INTRO_6": "{PLAYFUL:winnie}也许在神秘埃及中发现的他原来的对应者可能是不同时间点的他！",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_34_INTRO_7": "{TIRED:crazydave}没有。停止。太可怕了。",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_34_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}不管怎样，僵尸带来了光源，可以在黑暗中看到东西。",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_34_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}平常的冰冷应该可以解决问题。",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_37_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:crazydave}朋朋，小心！",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_37_INTRO_2": "{SAY:crazydave}这附近可能有一些寺庙陷阱！",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_37_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}是的，用户戴夫。通常情况下，我的工作就是告诉你——",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_37_INTRO_4": "{EXCITED:crazydave}嘘，你会把他们吵醒的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_37_INTRO_5": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}一个好的猎人永远不会唤醒他们的猎物。这是我在自家后院学到的。",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_37_INTRO_6": "{EXCITED:winnie}还有更重要的讯息我必须——",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_37_INTRO_7": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我是圣物猎人！僵尸对我毫无抵抗力！",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_37_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}总结：大攻击，可怕的大僵尸，很多——",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_37_INTRO_9": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}我有一整套神庙陷阱！",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_37_INTRO_10": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}不相信我？",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_37_INTRO_11": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}你等着我给自己拿一些瓷砖。",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_37_INTRO_12": "{TIRED:winnie}我担心你的理智，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_37_INTRO_13": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}疯狂戴夫给你，遗物狩猎传奇！",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_38_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:crazydave}我一定有什么东西经过了……寺庙陷阱偷走了我们的割草机！",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_38_INTRO_2": "{TIRED:winnie}其实，很可能是僵王派出的一群遗迹猎人丧尸。",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_38_INTRO_3": "{SAY:crazydave}现在割草机也丢了！它们是遗迹！",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_38_INTRO_4": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}我想知道这个地方还丢失了什么。就像我的袜子一样。",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_38_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}我们即将迎来新的僵尸。",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_38_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}洋红色骷髅僵尸。",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_38_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}我的研究表明洋红色头骨的行为与绿松石头骨有很大不同。",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_38_INTRO_8": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}我以前有洋红色的袜子。但我已经失去了他们！",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_38_INTRO_9": "{EXCITED:crazydave}显然颜色和诅咒有共同点。",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_38_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}尽管你的话缺乏任何连贯的逻辑，但你是对的用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_38_INTRO_11": "{SAY:winnie}洋红色头骨拥有召唤远古诅咒的能力。",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_38_INTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}可以加速草坪上所有僵尸的速度。",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_38_INTRO_13": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}也许那个头骨就是我的袜子。",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_38_INTRO_14": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}进化是一件强大的事情。",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_38_INTRO_15": "{SAY:winnie}我们需要降低这些被诅咒的僵尸的速度！",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_38_INTRO_16": "{EXCITED:winnie}Stallia 可能会有所帮助。",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_42_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}这就是计划中从来不占你坚持的部分！",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_42_INTRO_2": "{SAY:zombossicon}我已经找到了结果，但是你找到走出这片丛林的出路了吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_42_INTRO_3": "{SAY:zombossicon}我恐怕不会让这种事发生。",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_42_INTRO_4": "{SAY:zombossicon}虽然计划的这一步以及接下来的计划是计划和平进行的......",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_42_INTRO_5": "{SAY:zombossicon}...升级我的旧僵博机器人模型是我可以即时完成的事情！",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_42_INTRO_6": "{SAY:zombossicon}无论如何，你都无法阻止我的季节统治！",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_42_INTRO_7": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{SAY:crazydave}这到底是什么意思？",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_42_INTRO_8": "{SAY:zombossicon}对于一个永远迷失在树林里的人来说什么都不是！",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_42_INTRO_9": "{SAY:zombossicon}哇哈哈哈哈！",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_42_OUTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}这不可能！！",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_42_OUTRO_2": "{SAY:zombossicon}不管你不断取得胜利，我的研究并没有被记录下来！",
  "NARRATIVE_LOSTCITY_42_OUTRO_3": "{SAY:zombossicon}下次见面，我一定会对付你的...",
  "NARRATIVE_EIGHTIES_33_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}哦耶！我们又来参加聚会了！",
  "NARRATIVE_EIGHTIES_33_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，我记得僵王'主观上糟糕的音乐会刚刚在这里举行。",
  "NARRATIVE_EIGHTIES_33_INTRO_3": "{EXCITED:crazydave}哦，我把你的存储卡拿出来了，因为说明书上说我需要向它们吹气。",
  "NARRATIVE_EIGHTIES_33_INTRO_4": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}我想他们后来以某种方式在某个地方的拱廊里结束了。",
  "NARRATIVE_EIGHTIES_33_INTRO_5": "{SHOUT:crazydave}总之，我们回到了现在，到处都是奇怪的传送门！",
  "NARRATIVE_EIGHTIES_33_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}对了，我已经备份到内存了。你是对的，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_EIGHTIES_33_INTRO_7": "{SAY:crazydave}邻居，如果你不明白我在说什么，我们肯定陷入了时间循环！",
  "NARRATIVE_EIGHTIES_33_INTRO_8": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}我们从fuuuuuuutuuuuure回来了！",
  "NARRATIVE_EIGHTIES_33_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}是的。如果您还没有经历过现代世界的狂热，建议您在继续之前先体验一下。",
  "NARRATIVE_EIGHTIES_33_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}如果没有多功能植物，这些音乐废话的新时代将很难克服。",
  "NARRATIVE_EIGHTIES_36_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}为什么我们的割草机不见了？",
  "NARRATIVE_EIGHTIES_36_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}永远不要低估凌晨 3 点朋克僵尸的力量，因为凌晨 3 点有太多的脑汁需要喝。",
  "NARRATIVE_EIGHTIES_36_INTRO_3": "{TIRED:winnie}割草机是在距离这里三个街区的水池中发现的。",
  "NARRATIVE_EIGHTIES_36_INTRO_4": "{TIRED:crazydave}我以为我疯了。",
  "NARRATIVE_EIGHTIES_37_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，扫描显示我们后门有大量吵闹的派对常客。",
  "NARRATIVE_EIGHTIES_37_INTRO_2": "{SAY:crazydave}哦耶！我绝对能听到他们的声音！",
  "NARRATIVE_EIGHTIES_37_INTRO_3": "{SAY:crazydave}他们说的是……",
  "NARRATIVE_EIGHTIES_37_INTRO_4": "{SAY:crazydave}嗯ba ba be。",
  "NARRATIVE_EIGHTIES_37_INTRO_5": "{SAY:crazydave}Ee哒哒哒哒。",
  "NARRATIVE_EIGHTIES_37_INTRO_6": "{SAY:crazydave}我听到一些巨人在尖叫，“放我出去！”",
  "NARRATIVE_EIGHTIES_37_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，有趣的是看你假装听懂僵尸说话......",
  "NARRATIVE_EIGHTIES_37_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}我们正承受着僵尸袭击的压力！",
  "NARRATIVE_EIGHTIES_37_INTRO_9": "{TIRED:winnie}如果我们不采取行动，到了晚上，他们就会把你的大脑踢在地板上。",
  "NARRATIVE_EIGHTIES_37_INTRO_10": "{SAY:crazydave}假装？",
  "NARRATIVE_EIGHTIES_39_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，我发现这个看似永无止境的聚会迟到了。",
  "NARRATIVE_EIGHTIES_39_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}Goth 朋克僵尸用多汁的民谣歌曲的曲调踢植物，这使他与 Boombox Zombies 成为危险的组合。",
  "NARRATIVE_EIGHTIES_39_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}我建议我们在他们开始通过共同热爱民谣来表达自己的感受之前照顾好他们。",
  "NARRATIVE_EIGHTIES_39_INTRO_4": "{SAY:crazydave}这个僵尸又悲伤又闷闷不乐！",
  "NARRATIVE_EIGHTIES_39_INTRO_5": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}你知道这家伙需要什么吗？这真是太疯狂了！",
  "NARRATIVE_EIGHTIES_39_INTRO_6": "{SAY:crazydave}...这叫爱情。",
  "NARRATIVE_EIGHTIES_39_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，作为一个僵尸，我向你保证，感情并不是这里唯一的死亡方面。",
  "NARRATIVE_EIGHTIES_42_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}空气中最恶臭",
  "NARRATIVE_EIGHTIES_42_INTRO_2": "{SAY:zombossicon}八万年的恐惧！",
  "NARRATIVE_EIGHTIES_42_INTRO_3": "{SAY:zombossicon}每个坟墓里的灰熊食尸鬼正在逼近，以封印你的厄运！",
  "NARRATIVE_EIGHTIES_42_INTRO_4": "{SAY:zombossicon}虽然你努力活下去，但你的身体开始颤抖..",
  "NARRATIVE_EIGHTIES_42_INTRO_5": "{SAY:zombossicon}凡人无法抗拒",
  "NARRATIVE_EIGHTIES_42_INTRO_6": "{SAY:zombossicon}我希望你已经为今晚做好准备",
  "NARRATIVE_EIGHTIES_42_INTRO_7": "{SAY:zombossicon}因为这将是一个惊悚片，惊悚之夜！",
  "NARRATIVE_EIGHTIES_42_OUTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}我已经告诉过你我要聪明地玩，现在我们还没开始就结束了。",
  "NARRATIVE_EIGHTIES_42_OUTRO_2": "{SAY:zombossicon}但是请相信我，我才刚刚开始！",
  "NARRATIVE_EIGHTIES_42_OUTRO_3": "{SAY:zombossicon}我已经到极限了，你的不断干涉我已经碰壁了！",
  "NARRATIVE_EIGHTIES_42_OUTRO_4": "{SAY:zombossicon}为了一个摆脱你的机会，我愿意冒一切风险！",
  "NARRATIVE_EIGHTIES_42_OUTRO_5": "{SAY:zombossicon}我要带你出去，直到电线。",
  "NARRATIVE_EIGHTIES_42_OUTRO_6": "{NPC_EXIT:zombossicon}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{TIRED:winnie}用户戴夫，我相信僵王在他蹩脚的歌声之下可能给我们带来了潜在的威胁。",
  "NARRATIVE_EIGHTIES_42_OUTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}我建议从现在开始要小心。否则我们就会成为最后一个被埋葬的人。",
  "NARRATIVE_EIGHTIES_42_OUTRO_8": "{EXCITED:crazydave}哦看朋朋，我的歌刚刚上来了！当我开始唱这首歌时，伙计们曾经很喜欢它！",
  "NARRATIVE_EIGHTIES_42_OUTRO_9": "{SHOUT:crazydave}它被称为“GrarrBRAINSarblarbl”。",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_33_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{PLAYFUL:crazydave}让我眼花缭乱！这些恐龙仍然在活动！",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_33_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}我们的临时休假并没有改变这种情况。",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_33_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}然而，情况似乎已经改变了，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_33_INTRO_4": "{SAY:crazydave}是的，周围都是粘糊糊的东西。",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_33_INTRO_5": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}让我想起了我的客厅。",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_33_INTRO_6": "{TIRED:winnie}我记不清细节了...",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_33_INTRO_7": "{TIRED:winnie}你又没有动过我的存储卡吧用户戴夫？",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_33_INTRO_8": "{SAY:crazydave}呜呜呜……",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_33_INTRO_9": "{SAY:crazydave}什么存储卡？",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_33_INTRO_10": "{SAY:crazydave}如果你指的是那些保存记忆的绿色矩形东西......",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_33_INTRO_11": "{SAY:crazydave}...那我，呃，不知道你在说什么。",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_33_INTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}确实很好奇。",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_33_INTRO_13": "{SAY:winnie}无论如何，如果你的邻居没有经历过现代世界的狂热，我们就脱离了正确的时间循环。",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_33_INTRO_14": "{EXCITED:crazydave}是的邻居，你应该这样做！",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_33_INTRO_15": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}我们来自未来！",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_33_INTRO_16": "{EXCITED:crazydave}剧透警告：恐龙将转世为袋鼠！",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_33_INTRO_17": "{TIRED:crazydave}我认为...",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_33_INTRO_18": "{SAY:winnie}记忆功能。已访问数据库。",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_33_INTRO_19": "{SAY:winnie}我们草坪上的黑色粘液是焦油，一种非常粘稠的物质。",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_33_INTRO_20": "{SAY:winnie}我估计僵尸在里面会慢很多。不幸的是，",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_33_INTRO_21": "{TIRED:winnie}我们的植物也会变得粘稠。足以阻止他们的攻击。",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_33_INTRO_22": "{SAY:crazydave}有传言说坚果不介意被粘。",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_33_INTRO_23": "{TIRED:crazydave}我不知道该怎么想。",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_35_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}有一些紧急信息我必须提醒你，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_35_INTRO_2": "{EXCITED:winnie}我们已经到达了僵王在这段时间内困住的第一座植物。",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_35_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}它有奇怪的“timey wimey”，我相信是科学术语，周围的东西。",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_35_INTRO_4": "{EXCITED:crazydave}及时雨植物！？",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_35_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}它似乎被僵王'最新实验所共享的辐射包围。",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_35_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}无论它是什么，它都与僵王所存储的内容相关。",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_35_INTRO_7": "{EXCITED:crazydave}加油朋朋！撒豆子！",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_35_INTRO_8": "{TIRED:winnie}正在扫描……",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_35_INTRO_9": "{EXCITED:winnie}这种植物似乎很热门！通常是一种节日植物。",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_35_INTRO_10": "{TIRED:crazydave}嗯嗯...",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_35_INTRO_11": "{SAY:crazydave}它在这里做什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_35_INTRO_12": "{PLAYFUL:winnie}我们可以假设僵王已经没有植物来引诱我们了。",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_35_INTRO_13": "{EXCITED:winnie}无论如何，Hot Date必须得救！",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_35_INTRO_14": "{SAY:winnie}有着独特的吸引人的特性，但不可否认的是韧性较低......",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_35_INTRO_15": "{EXCITED:winnie}...他将成为僵尸的绝佳诱饵！",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_35_INTRO_16": "{SAY:winnie}数据表明 tar 很大程度上否定了他的吸引力能力。",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_35_INTRO_17": "{SAY:winnie}幸运的是：他的香料会摧毁任何消化他的僵尸。",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_35_INTRO_18": "{SAY:winnie}此外，他会散布一条火线，一旦被摧毁，就会对装甲以下的僵尸造成伤害。",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_35_INTRO_19": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}非常多才多艺，这个。",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_35_INTRO_20": "{SAY:winnie}最好用他来引诱僵尸离开有恐龙的车道并直接进入焦油。",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_35_INTRO_21": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}没有什么比一些好的推和粘更好的了！",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_36_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}警告：侏罗纪时期对于组织来说并不是一个安全的环境。",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_36_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}不同物种的频繁迁徙，所过之处都造成了严重破坏。",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_36_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}扫描仪显示此类迁移正在进行中。",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_36_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}建议谨慎。",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_37_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}嘿朋朋，你有没有注意到僵尸最近有什么可疑的活动？",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_37_INTRO_2": "{PLAYFUL:winnie}僵尸通常以狡猾着称，但这个时期似乎缺乏这种智慧。",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_37_INTRO_3": "{EXCITED:crazydave}皮革似乎在这里很流行！",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_37_INTRO_4": "{TIRED:crazydave}有些可疑……",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_37_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}我之前的假设是错误的。",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_37_INTRO_6": "{EXCITED:winnie}用户戴夫，我们这里有冒名顶替者。",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_37_INTRO_7": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我就知道了！我什至不能在不小心背后的情况下洗焦油浴！",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_37_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}似乎有僵尸尝试使用原始工具制作伪装。",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_37_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}有点像恐龙的。",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_37_INTRO_10": "{TIRED:winnie}不幸的是，这可能足以让恐龙将它们与自己的恐龙混淆。",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_37_INTRO_11": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}如果我把自己伪装成僵尸怎么办？",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_37_INTRO_12": "{SAY:crazydave}他们会把我一个人留在焦油桶里吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_40_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}你知道，我通常不会这么早就向你们这些爱管闲事的人透露自己。",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_40_INTRO_2": "{SAY:zombossicon}不过，我必须强调，你们徒劳地阻碍我的实验对我来说已经不再是无足轻重了！",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_40_INTRO_3": "{SAY:zombossicon}除非我能继续努力，平静地扭转时间，否则我将得不到应有的回报！",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_40_INTRO_4": "{EXCITED:winnie}这些大脑是你永远无法拥有的物品，僵王!",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_40_INTRO_5": "{SAY:zombossicon}哦，拜托！你的大脑一直都是次要问题！",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_40_INTRO_6": "{SAY:zombossicon}我准备的东西才更合我的口味！",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_40_INTRO_7": "{SAY:zombossicon}而被捕获的植物是我会自己保留的！",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_40_INTRO_8": "{SAY:zombossicon}注意这个警告，不要碰它们，也不要打扰我！",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_40_INTRO_9": "{SAY:zombossicon}否则你的骨头就会在这片酸沼泽的坑里腐烂！",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_41_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SHOUT:crazydave}便士！我们的割草机！",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_41_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}他们似乎已经消失了。",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_41_INTRO_3": "{SHOUT:crazydave}我珍贵的石头割草机！",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_41_INTRO_4": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我花了20分钟来做这些！",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_41_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}明白了。这是僵王'做的。",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_41_INTRO_6": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}哇，他真的不希望我们继续攻击他的僵尸。",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_41_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}确实，他还确保送来了新的丧尸。",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_41_INTRO_8": "{TIRED:winnie}要么就是这样，要么他们刚到这里而僵王与此无关。",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_41_INTRO_9": "{SAY:crazydave}他们和之前的人一样可疑吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_41_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}我们即将推出运石僵尸。",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_41_INTRO_11": "{SAY:winnie}警告：不应该让他们靠近我们的防御，因为他们会在任何被击败的地方扔下石头。",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_41_INTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}他们被击败的距离越远，他们的岩石造成的麻烦就越少。",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_41_INTRO_13": "{EXCITED:crazydave}哦，我看到他们了！",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_41_INTRO_14": "{EXCITED:crazydave}他们有小恐龙！",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_41_INTRO_15": "{EXCITED:winnie}最好奇。没有数据表明存在这样的配对。",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_41_INTRO_16": "{SAY:winnie}我想知道这是怎么发生的。",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_43_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{TIRED:winnie}我在这里遗憾地通知大家：小鬼正在进化。",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_43_INTRO_2": "{TIRED:crazydave}我知道有一天会发生这种情况。",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_43_INTRO_3": "{TIRED:crazydave}没想到这么快。",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_43_INTRO_4": "{TIRED:winnie}他们学会了如何搬运东西。",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_43_INTRO_5": "{TIRED:winnie}确实是一个可怕的概念。",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_43_INTRO_6": "{EXCITED:crazydave}首先他们进入鸡蛋，现在他们携带鸡蛋！？",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_43_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}这是一种我称之为“小鬼僵尸革命”的现象，我们正处于它的边缘。",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_43_INTRO_8": "{PLAYFUL:winnie}计算的imp密度：96.875%",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_43_INTRO_9": "{SAY:crazydave}很多吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_43_INTRO_10": "{SAY:crazydave}我不知道我有一段时间没学地理了。",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_44_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:winnie}我们已经到达了这个时间段内最后捕获的植物的下落！",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_44_INTRO_2": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我们把他们赶出去吧！",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_44_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}其实，她或许能够极大地阻碍僵王的行动。",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_44_INTRO_4": "{EXCITED:winnie}魔术番红花可以随意将僵尸传送回草坪的起点！",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_44_INTRO_5": "{EXCITED:winnie}这将是一个很好的方法来教那些恶霸如何回到起跑线。",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_44_INTRO_6": "{TIRED:winnie}...考虑到他们不够聪明，无法识别基本物理和所有内容。",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_45_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}我们又迎来了一位访客。",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_45_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}侏罗纪凿岩者使用岩石将我们的植物压垮。",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_45_INTRO_3": "{SAY:crazydave}这些家伙从哪里来？",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_45_INTRO_4": "{SAY:crazydave}对岩石的奇怪执着是怎么回事？",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_45_INTRO_5": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我以为这种类型很久以前就死了！",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_48_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}你必须无视我的警告，不是吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_48_INTRO_2": "{SAY:zombossicon}我不能让你在这个关键时刻打乱我的计划。",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_48_INTRO_3": "{SAY:zombossicon}我给了你选择，你却无视！",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_48_INTRO_4": "{SAY:zombossicon}那么，现在就在这里照顾你吧？",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_48_OUTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}这没有任何意义！",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_48_OUTRO_2": "{SAY:zombossicon}来吧，尝试干扰我研究的最后一步！",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_48_OUTRO_3": "{SAY:zombossicon}跟我回到现代世界 - 我敢说！",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_48_OUTRO_4": "{SAY:zombossicon}尝试拯救最后一批那些绝望的可怜实验室老鼠！",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_48_OUTRO_5": "{SAY:zombossicon}我向你保证，你们这些蠢货现在想要阻止我将会很痛苦！",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_48_OUTRO_6": "{NPC_EXIT:zombossicon}{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:crazydave}老板说不阻止他只会让我更想阻止他！",
  "NARRATIVE_DINO_48_OUTRO_7": "{EXCITED:winnie}同意。让我们抓住他吧，用户戴夫！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_35_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，为什么我们还留在现代世界？",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_35_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}我们刚刚击败了僵王！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_35_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}三次，不能少。",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_35_INTRO_4": "{TIRED:crazydave}哦，对了。你的记忆...",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_35_INTRO_5": "{TIRED:winnie}我的记忆？",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_35_INTRO_6": "{TIRED:winnie}你是不是弄乱了我的存储卡，用户戴夫？",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_35_INTRO_7": "{SAY:crazydave}是的，抱歉。",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_35_INTRO_8": "{SAY:crazydave}确实出于各种原因。",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_35_INTRO_9": "{SAY:crazydave}给你。",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_35_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}我明白了。",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_35_INTRO_11": "{EXCITED:winnie}这真是太不寻常了！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_35_INTRO_12": "{EXCITED:winnie}我们经历了很多冒险！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_35_INTRO_13": "{EXCITED:winnie}穿越各个世界，阻止僵王完成他的研究……",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_35_INTRO_14": "{EXCITED:winnie}并拯救被捕获的植物！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_35_INTRO_15": "{EXCITED:crazydave}看起来我们的邻居可能没有明白要点。",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_35_INTRO_16": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}您好！跟你说话！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_35_INTRO_17": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}这种事已经发生很多次了，对不起朋朋和我。",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_35_INTRO_18": "{SAY:crazydave}如果你不知道我们在说什么......",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_35_INTRO_19": "{EXCITED:crazydave}...那我们一定听起来像我们已经疯了！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_35_INTRO_20": "{SAY:winnie}由于僵王的行为，时间线有点混乱。",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_35_INTRO_21": "{PLAYFUL:winnie}我们的会议不按顺序进行。",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_35_INTRO_22": "{EXCITED:winnie}你应该回到以前的世界，和我们一起拯救植物！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_35_INTRO_23": "{SAY:winnie}保留时间线。",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_35_INTRO_24": "{SAY:winnie}也就是说，如果您还没有经历过的话。",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_35_INTRO_25": "{TIRED:winnie}抱歉，有点难说。",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_35_INTRO_26": "{EXCITED:winnie}如果有的话，欢迎回来！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_35_INTRO_27": "{EXCITED:winnie}这是阻止僵王'宏伟计划的最后一步。",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_35_INTRO_28": "{SAY:winnie}但是首先，我必须问你一件事，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_35_INTRO_29": "{TIRED:winnie}这样的内存事件发生过多少次了？",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_35_INTRO_30": "{EXCITED:crazydave}很多次！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_35_INTRO_31": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}我想我只是对那些绿色的东西有诀窍！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_35_INTRO_32": "{SAY:winnie}好吧，由于被编程为你的私人助理，一切都可以原谅。",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_35_INTRO_33": "{SAY:winnie}现在，处理手头的事情。",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_35_INTRO_34": "{SAY:winnie}看来悖论计划的残余仍然存在于这个时代。",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_35_INTRO_35": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}Ooooo，就好像我们从未离开过一样。",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_35_INTRO_36": "{SAY:winnie}不完全是 - 效果不太稳定。",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_35_INTRO_37": "{SAY:winnie}很快，它们就会变得太不可靠而无法维持僵王。",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_35_INTRO_38": "{SAY:winnie}很明显：他正在利用悖论计划剩下的东西来保护自己。",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_35_INTRO_39": "{EXCITED:winnie}我们去结束他的阴谋吧！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_35_INTRO_40": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我们走吧，老大！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_37_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:winnie}用户戴夫、僵王做了非常邪恶的事情！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_37_INTRO_2": "{EXCITED:crazydave}他又做了一个炸玉米饼！？",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_37_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}我不明白这有什么邪恶的。",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_37_INTRO_4": "{SAY:crazydave}是的，我不知道这个词是什么意思。",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_37_INTRO_5": "{EXCITED:winnie}他蒸发了我们的割草机！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_37_INTRO_6": "{SAY:crazydave}哦。是的，会发生这种情况。",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_37_INTRO_7": "{SAY:crazydave}我已经习惯了。",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_37_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}很明显，僵王正在想尽一切办法来阻止我们。",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_37_INTRO_9": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我不需要割草机！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_37_INTRO_10": "{EXCITED:crazydave}在割草机发明之前我就在那里了！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_37_INTRO_11": "{EXCITED:crazydave}耶哈！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_42_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}现代性让你害怕吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_42_INTRO_2": "{SAY:zombossicon}所有辉煌的新发明和复杂的城市生活？",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_42_INTRO_3": "{SAY:zombossicon}考虑到你过去花了多少时间，人们会这么认为！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_42_INTRO_4": "{SAY:zombossicon}也许就一次，你应该放下我们的历史，让我完成我的热血事业！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_42_INTRO_5": "{SAY:zombossicon}着眼未来，而不是过去。并且忽略现在！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_42_INTRO_6": "{SAY:zombossicon}为什么，你们三个没有义务追求我。道德或其他方面。",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_42_INTRO_7": "{SAY:zombossicon}这一次，后果不涉及你的大脑！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_42_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}这是……你的消息中存在的恐惧吗，僵王？",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_42_INTRO_9": "{SAY:zombossicon}恐惧！？不！我不怕你！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_42_INTRO_10": "{EXCITED:crazydave}你是害怕我们破坏你的计划是吧！？",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_42_INTRO_11": "{SAY:zombossicon}安静！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_42_INTRO_12": "{SAY:zombossicon}确实没有理由紧张！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_42_INTRO_13": "{SAY:winnie}僵王，你已经断断续续地与我们战斗了几个月，没有休息过。",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_42_INTRO_14": "{SAY:winnie}你的僵尸一定累了。",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_42_INTRO_15": "{SAY:zombossicon}我也累了！但我已经走得太远了，无法结束它！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_42_INTRO_16": "{SAY:zombossicon}嗯...我想还有其他方法可以结束它...",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_42_INTRO_17": "{SAY:zombossicon}你的大脑将再次参与其中。",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_42_INTRO_18": "{SAY:zombossicon}我拿走悖论计划的残余物怎么样……",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_42_INTRO_19": "{SAY:zombossicon}...并放大它们？",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_42_INTRO_20": "{SAY:zombossicon}是的...是的。这应该会让你保持足够长的时间。",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_42_INTRO_21": "{SAY:zombossicon}享受你花园里的门户风暴！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_42_INTRO_22": "{SAY:zombossicon}别来找我乞讨！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_42_INTRO_23": "{SAY:zombossicon}哇哈哈哈哈哈哈！！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_48_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，我不知道发生了什么，但是......",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_48_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}……这些时间异常似乎暂时影响了丧尸们。",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_48_INTRO_3": "{SAY:crazydave}嗯？如何？",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_48_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}今天进入的每一位都会被晒到。",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_48_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}我实在无法解释这个现象。",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_48_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}看起来悖论项目正在自我折叠。",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_49_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}无礼的时间旅行者！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_49_INTRO_2": "{SAY:zombossicon}你就要毁掉一切了！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_49_INTRO_3": "{SAY:zombossicon}我想要的只是一些平静和安静，但你就在那里！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_49_INTRO_4": "{SAY:zombossicon}我教你以后不要再干扰我的假期计划了！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_49_INTRO_5": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}假期计划？",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_49_INTRO_6": "{SAY:zombossicon}不关你的事！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_49_INTRO_7": "{SAY:zombossicon}我很困惑为什么你觉得有必要进一步推进这一点！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_49_INTRO_8": "{SAY:zombossicon}自从你收到那个炸玉米饼以来我就没有打扰你了！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_49_INTRO_9": "{TIRED:winnie}你绑架了无辜的植物，危害了无数的时间周期，并多次试图毁灭我们。",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_49_INTRO_10": "{SAY:zombossicon}我还能怎么度过周四下午呢？",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_49_INTRO_11": "{SAY:zombossicon}听我说，你不会阻止我一直在准备的！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_49_INTRO_12": "{SAY:zombossicon}我会尽量拉长时间线！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_49_INTRO_13": "{SAY:zombossicon}享受面对所有你在以前的时代恐吓过的僵尸吧，傻瓜！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_49_OUTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}可恶！我忠实的世俗追随者军团再次击败了！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_49_OUTRO_2": "{SAY:zombossicon}就算你活下来，我也有一个应急预案！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_49_OUTRO_3": "{SAY:zombossicon}再拖延一天就足以消灭你的瘟疫了！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_49_OUTRO_4": "{NPC_EXIT:zombossicon}{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}警告，用户戴夫，我检测到大量时间粒子正在传输。",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_49_OUTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}看来僵王可能并不完全知道自己在做什么。",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_49_OUTRO_6": "{EXCITED:crazydave}是的！我会用我的厄运植物阻止他！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_49_OUTRO_7": "{TIRED:crazydave}...绽放。开花的植物。",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_50_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}事先从未考虑过诸如此类的严厉措施。",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_50_INTRO_2": "{SAY:zombossicon}但是，需要适应，我也要适应！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_50_INTRO_3": "{SAY:zombossicon}永恒假期流程已经开始！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_50_INTRO_4": "{SAY:zombossicon}我不会让你搞砸的！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_50_INTRO_5": "{SAY:zombossicon}向您可能认识的老僵尸打个招呼。",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_50_INTRO_6": "{SAY:zombossicon}我从不扔掉旧的坏掉的机器。",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_50_INTRO_7": "{SAY:zombossicon}组合不同的部分是一种乐趣！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_50_INTRO_8": "{SAY:zombossicon}我什至还遇到了很久没用过的武器。",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_50_INTRO_9": "{SAY:zombossicon}现在，我要做的就是确保你们这些白痴有事可做！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_50_INTRO_10": "{SAY:zombossicon}我有足够的时间扭曲能量来埋葬你微不足道的尝试！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_50_INTRO_11": "{SAY:zombossicon}我一次又一次地警告你不要干涉。",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_50_INTRO_12": "{SAY:zombossicon}现在我不再警告了。",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_50_INTRO_13": "{SAY:zombossicon}在你惹我之前先看看两边！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_50_OUTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:crazydave}轰轰轰！！！你超过了老板先生！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_50_OUTRO_2": "{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}骄傲消化理性，大卫。",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_50_OUTRO_3": "{SAY:zombossicon}我的交通仪器增强车出故障了也没关系！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_50_OUTRO_4": "{SAY:zombossicon}你要是仔细听我的话你就已经明白我的真实意图了！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_50_OUTRO_5": "{SAY:zombossicon}我已经拖延了你足够长的时间，让一切都能实现！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_50_OUTRO_6": "{EXCITED:winnie}僵王，请听我的建议！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_50_OUTRO_7": "{EXCITED:winnie}时间粒子水平失控！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_50_OUTRO_8": "{EXCITED:winnie}停止你正在做的一切！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_50_OUTRO_9": "{EXCITED:winnie}它可能会危及现实本身的结构！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_50_OUTRO_10": "{SAY:zombossicon}安静，机器！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_50_OUTRO_11": "{SAY:zombossicon}我很清楚我在做什么！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_50_OUTRO_12": "{SAY:zombossicon}你永远不会把这个从我身边夺走！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_50_OUTRO_13": "{SAY:zombossicon}从来没有！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_50_OUTRO_14": "{NPC_EXIT:zombossicon}{SAY:crazydave}朋朋，他在做什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_50_OUTRO_15": "{SAY:winnie}他正准备扭曲。",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_50_OUTRO_16": "{SAY:winnie}他的变形有点可疑，但是……",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_50_OUTRO_17": "{TIRED:winnie}他要穿越到第二天？",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_50_OUTRO_18": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}哦，我可以等那么久。",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_50_OUTRO_19": "{EXCITED:winnie}无论他计划如何，我们都必须阻止他！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_50_OUTRO_20": "{SAY:winnie}如果我们不这样做，一切都会变得-.-... *btzzz...",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_50_OUTRO_21": "{SAY:winnie}“疯狂”。",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_50_OUTRO_22": "{SAY:winnie}我找不到更合适的科学词汇来描述后果。",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_50_OUTRO_23": "{EXCITED:crazydave}疯子？就像，疯狂！？",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_50_OUTRO_24": "{SHOUT:crazydave}只有我才能疯狂！",
  "NARRATIVE_MODERN_50_OUTRO_25": "{EXCITED:crazydave}老大，你逃不了的！",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_1_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:crazydave}哇，已经是盛宴节了吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_1_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}这是非常难以置信的。",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_1_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}被称为“盛宴节”的年度活动预计还要过 152 天才会到来。",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_1_INTRO_4": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}我没有抱怨。",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_1_INTRO_5": "{TIRED:crazydave}嗯。也许... ",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_1_INTRO_6": "{EXCITED:crazydave}时间自行向前跳跃！",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_1_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}有趣的观察，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_1_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}时间似乎在某种程度上被打乱了。",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_1_INTRO_9": "{TIRED:winnie}然而，也许它还没有“自己”移动。",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_1_INTRO_10": "{EXCITED:crazydave}没关系！看朋朋，礼物！",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_1_INTRO_11": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我喜欢礼物！",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_1_INTRO_12": "{EXCITED:winnie}你很容易满足，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_1_INTRO_13": "{SAY:winnie}然而，我的阅读发现这些不是普通的礼物。 ",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_1_INTRO_14": "{SAY:winnie}它们可能包含我们可以用来对抗僵尸的强大资产。",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_1_INTRO_15": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我就是喜欢盛宴节！",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_2_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:crazydave}什么！？现在是僵尸的幸运时间！？",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_2_INTRO_2": "{EXCITED:winnie}用户戴夫，我正在运行一些计算，时间偏移的最可能原因是-",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_2_INTRO_3": "{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}哦，你已经明白了，不是吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_2_INTRO_4": "{TIRED:winnie}僵王。",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_2_INTRO_5": "{SAY:zombossicon}瘟疫裁员渗透者！",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_2_INTRO_6": "{SAY:zombossicon}你阻止我最终计划的企图真的失败了！",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_2_INTRO_7": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}这就是老大你的最终计划吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_2_INTRO_8": "{SAY:zombossicon}是的！这就是我一直想要的！最好的假期！",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_2_INTRO_9": "{SAY:zombossicon}我正在使用我完全开发的时间操纵技术，以便始终使它成为一个假期！",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_2_INTRO_10": "{SAY:zombossicon}...相信我，我已经达到了其中一些。",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_2_INTRO_11": "{SAY:winnie}你已经成功制造出一个始终相对于自身扭曲的装置！？",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_2_INTRO_12": "{SAY:zombossicon}是的！看，这是一个长期充满热情的项目。",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_2_INTRO_13": "{SAY:zombossicon}如果你没有不断干预的话会更容易！",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_2_INTRO_14": "{SAY:zombossicon}这一切都是从我不得不终止悖论项目开始的……",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_2_INTRO_15": "{SAY:zombossicon}戴夫在这里需要一份炸玉米饼来摆脱我的困扰并让我清理东西！",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_2_INTRO_16": "{SAY:zombossicon}但是在清理过程中，我意识到了有趣的结果。",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_2_INTRO_17": "{SAY:crazydave}那个炸玉米饼真的很好吃！",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_2_INTRO_18": "{SAY:zombossicon}我不在乎！我意识到时间确实可以在比我以前尝试过的更大的范围内被操纵！",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_2_INTRO_19": "{SAY:zombossicon}后来进行了很多实验......我得到了自己的时间操纵车辆！",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_2_INTRO_20": "{SAY:zombossicon}现在我再也不会让一天变得单调或沉闷了！",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_2_INTRO_21": "{SAY:zombossicon}如果你试图阻止我，我的僵尸将利用他们的节日精神大力冲破你的防御！",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_2_INTRO_22": "{SAY:zombossicon}僵尸爱好者所拥有的节日气氛！",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_2_INTRO_23": "{SAY:zombossicon}你以为他们一边高兴一边关心晕眩之类的事！？哈！",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_2_INTRO_24": "{SAY:zombossicon}所以我建议你永远不要再打扰我！",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_3_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}朋朋，我不得不承认这有点怪异。",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_3_INTRO_2": "{EXCITED:winnie}用户戴夫，我已经计算过数字，所有这些都指向灾难。",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_3_INTRO_3": "{EXCITED:winnie}我们必须警惕僵王...但是由于僵尸对眩晕等效果更具抵抗力，我们需要一种新方法！",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_3_INTRO_4": "{SAY:crazydave}也许会有新的节日植物加入我们？",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_3_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}打得好，用户戴夫。我们必须联系树汁苗。",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_3_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}树汁苗可以通过制造粘性汁液方块来减缓僵尸群的速度！",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_3_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}这应该可以对付大多数快乐的僵尸。",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_3_INTRO_8": "{SAY:crazydave}如果以前的家伙都不在乎惊艳，那我想知道这些不在乎什么……",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_3_INTRO_9": "{SAY:crazydave}我猜我们会找到答案的！",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_4_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:zombossicon}这是什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_4_INTRO_2": "{SAY:zombossicon}你想要什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_4_INTRO_3": "{SAY:zombossicon}我一个小时内收到了20条来自你的消息，不体贴的车辆！",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_4_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}僵王，你这个技术很不稳定！！",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_4_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}我预计一个月左右时间线就会崩溃！",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_4_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}此后，现实结构的损伤可能无法修复！",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_4_INTRO_7": "{SAY:zombossicon}哦，现实这个，现实那个！你所知道的就是抱怨！",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_4_INTRO_8": "{SAY:zombossicon}我完美回归，解决你所有的烦恼！",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_4_INTRO_9": "{SAY:zombossicon}我不在乎！",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_4_INTRO_10": "{SAY:zombossicon}也许你们自己应该多一些节日气氛，别让我一个人去度假！",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_5_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{PLAYFUL:crazydave}嘿，这是一年中最诡异的月份！",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_5_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}越来越多的前世遇到的僵尸被邀请参加季节性派对。",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_5_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}我们必须与自己的一些季节性盟友一起反击。",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_5_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}幽灵辣椒可以帮助我们吓跑僵尸。",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_5_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}就像真正的鬼魂一样，她漂浮在空中，吓到任何靠近的人。",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_5_INTRO_6": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}我见过一次真正的鬼。",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_5_INTRO_7": "{TIRED:crazydave}没人相信我。",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_5_INTRO_8": "{SAY:crazydave}但是僵尸？是的，每个人都在尖叫！",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_6_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}我想你已经下定决心了。",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_6_INTRO_2": "{SAY:zombossicon}可惜你太盲目了，看不到我的发明带来的原始潜力！",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_6_INTRO_3": "{SAY:zombossicon}你本可以留下我去安静地度过我的假期！不过看来缠着我才是最重要的！",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_6_INTRO_4": "{SAY:zombossicon}你不知道，我也已经计划好了这个结果！",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_6_INTRO_5": "{SAY:zombossicon}我开发了可以让我的部队疯狂的配方！",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_6_INTRO_6": "{SAY:zombossicon}既然是欢乐的季节，我就把注入了它们的僵尸作为礼物送给你！",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_6_INTRO_7": "{SAY:crazydave}Uuuuuuh...好吧，但是...我们在哪里？",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_6_INTRO_8": "{SAY:zombossicon}欢迎来到一年一度的英雄大会！",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_6_INTRO_9": "{SAY:zombossicon}...我确实说过我正在接触其中的一些。",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_6_INTRO_10": "{SAY:zombossicon}呸！在你进一步质疑我的选择之前，你会被伟大的英雄小鬼僵尸finity压垮！",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_6_INTRO_11": "{NPC_EXIT:zombossicon}{SAY:crazydave}小鬼僵尸有限性？",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_6_INTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，我正在检测到一个巨大的、由助推公式驱动的小鬼。",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_6_INTRO_13": "{SAY:winnie}僵王一定以某种方式创造了能够增强僵尸力量的化合物。",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_6_INTRO_14": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我讨厌化学品！",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_6_INTRO_15": "{SAY:winnie}这些大概是前世研究僵王的时候开发出来的。",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_6_INTRO_16": "{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，我们必须仔细考虑下一步的行动。",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_6_INTRO_17": "{SAY:winnie}僵王本质上赋予了小鬼超能力。",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_6_INTRO_18": "{SAY:winnie}从名字来看，可能是倍增品种。",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_6_INTRO_19": "{SHOUT:crazydave}小鬼僵尸可能！ IMP 可能！",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_6_INTRO_20": "{SAY:winnie}由于他的身材和重要性，他很可能会出现在最后一波。",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_6_INTRO_21": "{SAY:winnie}这一天天变得越来越古怪。",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_6_INTRO_22": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}一个可以产生其他小鬼的小鬼？哇哦，多么蹩脚的超能力啊。",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_7_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}好吧，让我们按照你的方式玩吧。",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_7_INTRO_2": "{SAY:zombossicon}小鬼僵尸有限性只是一个警告！",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_7_INTRO_3": "{SAY:zombossicon}一个你没听！",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_7_INTRO_4": "{TIRED:winnie}僵王，我们可以谈谈这个吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_7_INTRO_5": "{SAY:zombossicon}说够了！",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_7_INTRO_6": "{SAY:zombossicon}我为此付出了太长时间和努力，以至于它被像你们这样肮脏的植物使用者破坏了！",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_7_INTRO_7": "{SAY:zombossicon}你以为阴谋不累人吗？这个假期我赚到了！",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_7_INTRO_8": "{TIRED:winnie}赚与不赚，现实岌岌可危！",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_7_INTRO_9": "{SAY:zombossicon}巴拉巴拉巴拉！安静，机器！",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_7_INTRO_10": "{SAY:zombossicon}为了确保您不妨碍我，我正在进入应急计划的第二阶段！",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_7_INTRO_11": "{SAY:zombossicon}假期里大家都想喝一杯！",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_7_INTRO_12": "{SAY:zombossicon}我丰富多样的增强配方是放入其中的完美小成分！",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_7_INTRO_13": "{SAY:zombossicon}为了确保我部队的健康，也为了确保你们的灭亡，我向僵企伸出了援手！",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_7_INTRO_14": "{SAY:zombossicon}真正最有能力的丧尸经营公司！诚然，这并没有说太多。",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_7_INTRO_15": "{SAY:zombossicon}但是在他们的帮助下，我能够批量生产适合任何场合的狡猾饮料！",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_7_INTRO_16": "{NPC_EXIT:zombossicon}{SAY:winnie}嗯，这是……意想不到的。",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_7_INTRO_17": "{SAY:winnie}有了僵企的输送系统，我预计这些饮料将快速输送到我们的草坪上。",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_7_INTRO_18": "{EXCITED:crazydave}太疯狂了！",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_7_INTRO_19": "{SAY:winnie}盛宴节饮料好像是僵企品牌的蛋酒。",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_7_INTRO_20": "{SAY:winnie}扫描中... 饮酒的副作用包括：轻微健康提升、口臭。",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_7_INTRO_21": "{SAY:crazydave}也许我们应该翻阅老黄历，看看僵企的其他饮料有什么用！",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_8_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}天气分析：酷热难耐。",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_8_INTRO_2": "{SAY:crazydave}像烤面包机上的鸡蛋一样热。",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_8_INTRO_3": "{SAY:crazydave}不知道僵企有什么适合夏天的清凉饮料呢？",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_8_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}我无法检索到足够的数据来判断......",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_8_INTRO_5": "{TIRED:winnie}我们需要检查替代来源才能找到答案。",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_8_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}由于年鉴落在家里了，所以我需要检查一下这款饮料的标签。",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_8_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}标签上写着饮用“巨浪海滩之味”的副作用包括...",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_8_INTRO_8": "{TIRED:winnie}舌头有轻微刺激，可能会恶心……",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_8_INTRO_9": "{EXCITED:winnie}哦，我们开始了：......温和的速度增加。",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_8_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}增加量可以是：轻微、轻微或大量。这个在中间。",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_8_INTRO_11": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}我不在乎！我只是想喝点饮料来消解这炎热的天气！",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_8_INTRO_12": "{TIRED:winnie}用户戴夫，喝僵企品牌的饮料对于非僵尸实体来说是致命的。",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_8_INTRO_13": "{TIRED:crazydave}嗯，我确信某个抽屉里还有一些燃料。",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_8_INTRO_14": "{TIRED:crazydave}话说回来，怎么是晚上呢？",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_8_INTRO_15": "{SAY:winnie}不用担心。天气足够温暖，太阳还在落下。",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_9_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}请允许我阅读Springening饮料的标签。",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_9_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}「僵企蛋香巧克力饮料」的副作用包括...",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_9_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}《巧克力热》，零星跳跃……",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_9_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}最后：...轻微的速度增加和轻微的生命值增加。",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_9_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}这饮料似乎是一种“超级”饮料，具有两种增强能力。",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_9_INTRO_6": "{EXCITED:crazydave}等等，草坪上来了一个新家伙！",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_9_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}你是对的，用户戴夫。",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_9_INTRO_8": "{SAY:winnie}蒲公英可以帮助我们对付强化僵尸。",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_9_INTRO_9": "{SAY:winnie}他可以在他的车道和相邻车道上发射爆炸种子。",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_9_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}一些风可以帮助加快这一过程，但需要付出代价。",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_9_INTRO_11": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}三叶草s，让我们来吧！",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_10_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，我从 Food Fight 的一顿饭中闻到了一种奇怪的开胃香气。",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_10_INTRO_2": "{EXCITED:crazydave}这会是炸玉米饼吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_10_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}Taco 小鬼存在，但不是我观察的主题。",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_10_INTRO_4": "{TIRED:crazydave}塔可印象...",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_10_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}奶奶的Zoup。这就是香气的来源。",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_10_INTRO_6": "{SAY:winnie}我检测到其中含有“饥饿”配方的痕迹。",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_10_INTRO_7": "{SAY:winnie}所有吃掉Zoup的僵尸都会变得更加饥饿，其速度会比轻微增加的速度稍快一些。",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_10_INTRO_8": "{TIRED:winnie}用户戴夫，你在关注吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_10_INTRO_9": "{TIRED:crazydave}嗯...塔可印象...",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_10_INTRO_10": "{SAY:winnie}满足你的好奇心：Taco imps因其辣味而耐冷。",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_10_INTRO_11": "{EXCITED:winnie}或许我们应该以食物对抗食物？",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_10_INTRO_12": "{SAY:winnie}黄油分配玉米投手已武装就绪。",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_10_INTRO_13": "{SAY:winnie}希望他们的黄油滑稽动作能起作用。虽然，我还是有疑问……",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_11_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:crazydave}哦不，这让我想起了我的大学时光！",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_11_INTRO_2": "{SAY:winnie}这似乎是一年中教育机构开始上课的时间。",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_11_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}等等，我正在读取一些数据......",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_11_INTRO_4": "{TIRED:winnie}出了问题。",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_11_INTRO_5": "{SAY:winnie}所有僵尸似乎都有......",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_11_INTRO_6": "{TIRED:winnie}大头？",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_11_INTRO_7": "{SAY:crazydave}多大？",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_11_INTRO_8": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}比如，我们是在谈论“Johnny's 的 XL 号炸玉米饼”大还是“衬衫上的污渍”大？",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_11_INTRO_9": "{TIRED:winnie}比应有的大。",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_11_INTRO_10": "{SAY:crazydave}啊，我想起来了。",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_11_INTRO_11": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}大学时我的头也曾变大一倍。",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_11_INTRO_12": "{SAY:crazydave}美好时光。",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_11_INTRO_13": "{SAY:winnie}用户戴夫，这似乎是一所小学。",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_11_INTRO_14": "{SAY:winnie}他们的头部尺寸可能会成为一个问题。",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_11_INTRO_15": "{SAY:winnie}物体的密度越高，移动起来就越困难。",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_11_INTRO_16": "{SAY:crazydave}哦，是的，我记得在那堂课上学过这一点。",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_11_INTRO_17": "{TIRED:crazydave}我讨厌地理。",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_11_INTRO_18": "{SAY:winnie}这次的饮料似乎也能增加健康。",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_11_INTRO_19": "{SAY:winnie}比我们之前见过的都要多。",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_11_INTRO_20": "{TIRED:crazydave}关于学校我不记得的一件事是它改善了我的健康。",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_12_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}呸！你还在吗？！",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_12_INTRO_2": "{SAY:zombossicon}你和时间操纵而不是一项运动是怎么回事！？",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_12_INTRO_3": "{SAY:zombossicon}说到...我看到你的邻居跳过了时间线。",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_12_INTRO_4": "{SAY:zombossicon}与我所有的强化僵博机器人战斗是他们的未来……",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_12_INTRO_5": "{SAY:zombossicon}对我来说很好——这只意味着我可以早点切断它们！",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_12_INTRO_6": "{SAY:zombossicon}鉴于时间是相对的，我来提醒你现在是什么！",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_12_INTRO_7": "{SAY:zombossicon}一份礼物。因为现在始终是现在。",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_12_INTRO_8": "{NPC_EXIT:zombossicon}{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:winnie}不管这个礼物是什么，我都不想知道。",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_12_INTRO_9": "{SAY:crazydave}我希望这是美味又喜庆的东西！",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_12_INTRO_10": "{SAY:crazydave}像蛋糕一样的东西！",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_12_INTRO_11": "{SAY:winnie}希望这个礼物里没有僵尸……",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_13_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}我试着友善地给你一个蛋糕！但你依然执着！",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_13_INTRO_2": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:crazydave}你的假期不会发生！",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_13_INTRO_3": "{SAY:zombossicon}呸！！！",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_13_INTRO_4": "{SAY:zombossicon}好大卫，让我们玩你的游戏吧！",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_13_INTRO_5": "{SAY:zombossicon}手套脱了！我只是要把来自各地假期的僵尸混在一起！",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_13_INTRO_6": "{SAY:zombossicon}看看你喜欢这样吗，换换口味？！",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_13_INTRO_7": "{SAY:zombossicon}是啊是啊。安静，我们好吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_13_INTRO_8": "{SAY:zombossicon}老叔叔僵王不玩了！",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_13_INTRO_9": "{SAY:zombossicon}我会得到应有的休假，而你会在你家门口得到一支节日军队！",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_13_INTRO_10": "{SAY:zombossicon}准备好迎接节庆串烧！",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_13_INTRO_11": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}“节庆串烧”？这是你能想出的最好的名字吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_13_INTRO_12": "{SAY:zombossicon}安静！我制定了计划，所以我给出了名字！",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_13_INTRO_13": "{SAY:zombossicon}全息图关闭！",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_13_INTRO_14": "{SAY:zombossicon}...我说全息图关闭！",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_13_INTRO_15": "{SAY:zombossicon}呃，我发誓这通常不会发生。",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_13_INTRO_16": "{SAY:zombossicon}你通常...听不到那部分...",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_13_INTRO_17": "{SAY:zombossicon}...现在随时...",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_13_INTRO_18": "{SAY:zombossicon}那么，假期你有什么计划吗？",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_13_INTRO_19": "{SAY:zombossicon}我个人-",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_18_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}在盛宴节的第一天，僵王给了我：",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_18_INTRO_2": "{SAY:zombossicon}一小鬼僵尸无穷！",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_18_INTRO_3": "{SAY:zombossicon}在盛宴节的第二天，僵王给了我：",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_18_INTRO_4": "{SAY:zombossicon}零小鬼僵尸finities，还有一个#caketank！",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_18_INTRO_5": "{SAY:zombossicon}在盛宴节的第三天，僵王给了我：",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_18_INTRO_6": "{SAY:zombossicon}一个嬉皮舞巨人僵尸，两个驯鹿巨人僵尸，三个痴情巨人僵尸...",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_18_INTRO_7": "{SAY:zombossicon}四个烧烤之王巨人僵尸s，五个Slamrock巨人僵尸s...",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_18_INTRO_8": "{SAY:zombossicon}...还有一天的生命！",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_18_OUTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{EXCITED:winnie}颂歌就这样结束吧！",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_18_OUTRO_2": "{EXCITED:crazydave}再多的假期也无法让我们的大脑离开我们的大脑！",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_18_OUTRO_3": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我们得到了一件闪亮的旅行用品！",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_18_OUTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}这个键看起来是时间上的向前跳跃。",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_18_OUTRO_5": "{TIRED:winnie}那里没有假期；它所通向的地方除了劳动之外什么也没有。",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_19_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{NPC_ENTER:zombossicon}{SAY:zombossicon}你有没有注意到公司假期过得怎么样了！？",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_19_INTRO_2": "{SAY:zombossicon}这不是巧合！",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_19_INTRO_3": "{SAY:zombossicon}一直都是我！",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_19_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}一直以来？",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_19_INTRO_5": "{SAY:zombossicon}好吧，自从我不得不对你们采取行动！",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_19_INTRO_6": "{SAY:zombossicon}我已经正式将我所有的节日饮料配送和生产流程外包给僵企！",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_19_INTRO_7": "{SAY:zombossicon}到现在为止，我还没有必要以更直白的方式让他们参与进来！",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_19_INTRO_8": "{SAY:zombossicon}但是你的不体贴的恼怒需要更多的“动手”方法。",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_19_INTRO_9": "{SAY:zombossicon}僵企整个部门一定会处理好这个问题！",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_19_INTRO_10": "{SAY:zombossicon}哦，还有，大家来的时候也买点他们的节日限定商品吧。",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_19_INTRO_11": "{SAY:zombossicon}刺激Zomconomy！",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_20_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}僵企无法让我花掉我的戴夫币！",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_20_INTRO_2": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我不需要心形巧克力！",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_20_INTRO_3": "{SAY:winnie}也许某种植物可以帮助我们。",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_20_INTRO_4": "{EXCITED:winnie}心花怒放可以直接击中僵尸，让他们心碎！",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_20_INTRO_5": "{EXCITED:winnie}随着时间的推移，她的射弹会软化它们！",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_20_INTRO_6": "{SAY:crazydave}记住，Valenbrainz 并不是要花钱买心形的小饰品。",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_20_INTRO_7": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}这是为了让尽可能多的人心碎！",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_20_INTRO_8": "{PLAYFUL:crazydave}僵尸之心。如果他们还有的话...",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_22_INTRO_1": "{NPC_ENTER:crazydave}{NPC_ENTER:winnie}{SAY:crazydave}朋朋，到处都有僵尸想卖给我奇怪的东西！",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_22_INTRO_2": "{SAY:crazydave}有人甚至试图卖给我一个小鬼！",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_22_INTRO_3": "{EXCITED:crazydave}我会用小鬼做什么？",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_22_INTRO_4": "{SAY:winnie}我们必须抵制他们的恶毒抢钱手段。",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_22_INTRO_5": "{TIRED:winnie}我差点就卖掉了一张经过僵企绘画滤镜的豌豆射手数字图像。",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_22_INTRO_6": "{TIRED:crazydave}可怕的东西。",
  "NARRATIVE_HOLIDAY_22_INTRO_7": "{SAY:crazydave}我想我花了一些金币，但幸运的是......",
